⠀to⠀register.⠀No⠀external⠀task,⠀decision,⠀or⠀completed⠀realization⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀stop.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadakaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀whose⠀choices⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reply⠀with⠀perfect⠀courtesy⠀while⠀refusing⠀the⠀actual⠀question,⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀creates⠀an⠀obligation,⠀delay⠀an⠀answer⠀until⠀the⠀delay⠀itself⠀becomes⠀a⠀statement,⠀or⠀send⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person.⠀Let⠀each⠀sender's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀leaves⠀words⠀out,⠀a⠀third⠀revises⠀repeatedly⠀before⠀sending.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know⠀or⠀claim,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀supply⠀subtext.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀sent⠀message⠀as⠀the⠀public⠀surface⠀and⠀keep⠀private⠀material⠀clearly⠀separated.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought:⠀it⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀considered⠀saying,⠀but⠀it⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀transmitted⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀has⠀received⠀it.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀distinguished⠀from⠀both⠀sent⠀messages⠀and⠀unsent⠀drafts.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀know⠀another's⠀private⠀thought⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀appears⠀on⠀the⠀page.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀omissions⠀and⠀reputation.⠀A⠀missing⠀reply⠀about⠀money,⠀a⠀carefully⠀worded⠀refusal,⠀a⠀group⠀chat⠀that⠀falls⠀silent⠀when⠀one⠀name⠀appears,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀forwarded⠀without⠀permission⠀can⠀expose⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀delay⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀edit⠀a⠀lie;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀revise⠀for⠀courtesy,⠀anxiety,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀care.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀withheld.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀may⠀be⠀ans