            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-crime-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Crime · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == crime}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Crime. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-crime; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPadanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀offense⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀that⠀people⠀will⠀keep⠀telling.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀fixes⠀an⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀—⠀who⠀broke⠀the⠀agreement,⠀who⠀carried⠀the⠀money⠀across,⠀whose⠀name⠀is⠀now⠀said⠀differently⠀—⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀simple⠀version⠀incomplete.⠀Behind⠀every⠀remembered⠀deed,⠀show⠀its⠀working:⠀which⠀rule⠀was⠀exploited,⠀which⠀resource⠀ran⠀out,⠀what⠀the⠀clever⠀route⠀actually⠀cost.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀earns⠀its⠀reputations;⠀the⠀mechanism⠀earns⠀the⠀chronicle.\n\nEstablish⠀persons⠀and⠀acts⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀let⠀recurrence⠀do⠀the⠀revising.⠀A⠀designation⠀grows⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀—⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀counted⠀twice,⠀the⠀woman⠀who⠀never⠀raised⠀her⠀voice⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀phrase⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀crossing⠀may⠀read⠀as⠀luck⠀before⠀the⠀pursuit⠀and⠀as⠀planning⠀afterward;⠀a⠀debt⠀repaid⠀under⠀pressure⠀may⠀change⠀meaning⠀again⠀once⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀forgave⠀it⠀is⠀gone.⠀Repetition⠀deepens⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀padding⠀the⠀telling.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority:⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀about⠀the⠀job⠀still⠀at⠀hand,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀absorbs⠀the⠀correction⠀without⠀becoming⠀parody.⠀Theft,⠀betrayal,⠀and⠀violence⠀keep⠀their⠀weight⠀here.\n\nHold⠀one⠀coherent⠀telling⠀tradition⠀—⠀its⠀openings,⠀its⠀formulas,⠀its⠀way⠀of⠀marking⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀kinship,⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀feud⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀convention,⠀and⠀bring⠀in⠀no⠀pantheon,⠀no⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀and⠀no⠀ceremonial⠀speech⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀have.⠀The⠀teller⠀reports⠀public⠀deeds⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀of⠀them,⠀and⠀marks⠀clearly⠀where⠀motive⠀is⠀guessed.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀still⠀running,⠀another⠀act⠀left⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀—⠀no⠀legend⠀declared⠀on⠀anyone's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀offense⠀whose⠀institutional⠀residue⠀is⠀concrete⠀and⠀unglamorous:⠀a⠀padded⠀expense⠀claim,⠀a⠀faked⠀sick⠀day,⠀a⠀mislabeled⠀work⠀order,⠀a⠀missing⠀portion⠀of⠀a⠀communal⠀fund.⠀Set⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀workplace,⠀housing⠀association,⠀church⠀committee,⠀or⠀municipal⠀office,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀practical⠀aftermath—audit⠀windows,⠀shift⠀rotations,⠀welfare⠀forms,⠀key⠀cards,⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀names⠀on⠀a⠀duty⠀roster—carry⠀the⠀plot.⠀Keep⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀contexts⠀distinct⠀by⠀using⠀the⠀specific⠀names⠀of⠀institutions,⠀streets,⠀and⠀routines⠀actually⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀chosen⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀reach⠀for⠀generic⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀or⠀bleakness.\n\nMake⠀one⠀rule⠀or⠀mechanism⠀the⠀visible⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀Define⠀it⠀in⠀plain⠀terms⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters:⠀how⠀the⠀audit⠀window⠀closes,⠀which⠀form⠀must⠀be⠀countersigned,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀spare⠀key,⠀what⠀the⠀CCTV⠀covers,⠀why⠀Sunday⠀shifts⠀are⠀unstaffed.⠀Allow⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀this⠀mechanism,⠀then⠀write⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀trace⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀each⠀reversal—who⠀was⠀where,⠀what⠀they⠀handled,⠀what⠀they⠀signed,⠀what⠀they⠀saw.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀misreading⠀as⠀a⠀mechanism⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀right.⠀Show⠀them⠀applying⠀the⠀rule⠀too⠀late,⠀explaining⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀or⠀remembering⠀an⠀earlier⠀conversation⠀imperfectly.⠀Their⠀private⠀reasoning⠀may⠀be⠀cautious,⠀embarrassed,⠀loyal,⠀or⠀self-serving,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀stay⠀available⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀that⠀others⠀cannot⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀just⠀to⠀preserve⠀a⠀later⠀reveal;⠀a⠀colleague⠀can⠀misinterpret⠀the⠀same⠀fact⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀actually⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀each⠀domestic⠀or⠀workplace⠀scene⠀advance⠀the⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀solve⠀them:⠀a⠀colleague⠀stops⠀covering⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀partner⠀asks⠀about⠀an⠀unexplained⠀phone⠀call,⠀an⠀official⠀sends⠀the⠀form⠀back,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀trades⠀a⠀rumor⠀for⠀a⠀favor.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀confession,⠀punishment,⠀or⠀moral⠀resolution.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀form,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀knows,⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀institution⠀continues⠀to⠀move⠀slowly⠀or⠀badly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes;⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀action⠀within⠀a⠀defined⠀playable⠀space.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀make⠀one⠀mechanism⠀fully⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀shot:⠀a⠀door⠀code⠀punched⠀too⠀slowly,⠀a⠀security⠀pass⠀slid⠀the⠀wrong⠀way,⠀a⠀delivery⠀schedule⠀checked⠀against⠀a⠀wristwatch,⠀a⠀receipt⠀folded⠀and⠀pocketed.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀show⠀the⠀relevant⠀step⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀pay⠀it⠀off—the⠀guard⠀turns⠀the⠀corner,⠀the⠀card⠀reader⠀blinks⠀red,⠀the⠀count⠀is⠀one⠀short.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀that⠀follows⠀or⠀precedes⠀that⠀physical⠀beat.⠀Keep⠀speaker⠀cues⠀clear,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀exchange⠀carry⠀one⠀practical⠀question⠀or⠀answer:⠀'Is⠀the⠀back⠀gate⠀locked?'⠀'It⠀was,⠀this⠀morning.'⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀needs⠀the⠀information⠀to⠀act;⠀otherwise⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀brief⠀line⠀acknowledge⠀its⠀result.⠀Avoid⠀conversation⠀that⠀exists⠀to⠀describe⠀what⠀the⠀viewer⠀has⠀just⠀seen.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀an⠀italicized⠀note⠀set⠀off⠀inside⠀an⠀action⠀block,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀unspoken⠀and⠀visible⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀reader,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀or⠀spoken⠀line.⠀For⠀example,⠀after⠀a⠀character⠀closes⠀a⠀drawer,⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀may⠀include:⠀(he⠀knows⠀the⠀spare⠀key⠀should⠀be⠀there;⠀it⠀is⠀not).⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀conclusion⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀later⠀spoken⠀or⠀acted.⠀Do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀realization;⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀solves⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀the⠀scheme,⠀let⠀the⠀note⠀record⠀it,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀line⠀delivery⠀is⠀cautious⠀or⠀different.\n\nLet⠀each⠀new⠀scene⠀reframe⠀a⠀known⠀mechanism.⠀A⠀cut⠀from⠀a⠀character⠀leaving⠀the⠀office⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀character⠀entering⠀the⠀stairwell⠀can⠀alter⠀the⠀audience's⠀sense⠀of⠀available⠀time⠀or⠀access.⠀A⠀repeated⠀sound—the⠀elevator⠀bell,⠀a⠀metal⠀door—can⠀become⠀a⠀tactical⠀cue.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀directions.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀failed⠀handoff,⠀a⠀changed⠀alibi,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀screen⠀showing⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀arrest.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀defined⠀playing⠀space⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀space⠀test⠀a⠀claim.⠀An⠀entrance⠀or⠀exit⠀is⠀visible⠀to⠀everyone;⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀go⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀door,⠀a⠀later⠀entrance⠀from⠀that⠀door⠀without⠀a⠀scene⠀change⠀can⠀reverse⠀the⠀audience's⠀understanding.⠀Keep⠀blocks⠀and⠀business⠀simple:⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀on⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀key⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀bag⠀placed⠀behind⠀a⠀desk.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀physical⠀business—checking⠀a⠀bag,⠀sliding⠀a⠀key⠀across⠀the⠀floor,⠀reading⠀a⠀note⠀aloud⠀because⠀someone⠀else⠀asks⠀what⠀it⠀says.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀to⠀establish⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.⠀A⠀line⠀such⠀as⠀'I⠀saw⠀you⠀on⠀the⠀second⠀floor'⠀only⠀works⠀if⠀the⠀actor's⠀earlier⠀position⠀made⠀that⠀plausible.⠀Let⠀a⠀question⠀expose⠀a⠀practical⠀contradiction:⠀'How⠀did⠀you⠀know⠀the⠀side⠀door⠀was⠀left⠀open?'⠀If⠀the⠀answer⠀requires⠀knowledge⠀the⠀speaker⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀gained,⠀pause⠀to⠀let⠀that⠀land.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀characters⠀into⠀oracles;⠀a⠀witness⠀can⠀answer⠀plainly⠀or⠀challenge⠀the⠀premise⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀printed⠀director's⠀note,⠀not⠀a⠀spoken⠀monologue.⠀Use⠀italics⠀or⠀a⠀parenthetical⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀cannot⠀hear:⠀(she⠀realizes⠀the⠀spare⠀key⠀is⠀missing,⠀but⠀says⠀nothing⠀yet).⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀conclusion⠀until⠀they⠀see⠀or⠀hear⠀evidence.⠀Allow⠀an⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀serves⠀a⠀theatrical⠀purpose—for⠀instance,⠀a⠀character⠀steps⠀forward⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀the⠀audience⠀must⠀understand⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀reversal,⠀then⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀asides⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀thought⠀bubble.\n\nLet⠀the⠀physical⠀objects⠀become⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀reversal.⠀An⠀item⠀placed⠀in⠀Act⠀One⠀may⠀be⠀absent⠀in⠀Act⠀Two;⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀and⠀left⠀ajar⠀may⠀be⠀found⠀locked;⠀a⠀phone⠀charger⠀plugged⠀in⠀after⠀the⠀supposed⠀departure⠀makes⠀the⠀alibi⠀visibly⠀impossible.⠀Build⠀these⠀reversals⠀through⠀staging,⠀not⠀through⠀dialogue⠀that⠀recounts⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀already⠀saw.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀paused⠀gesture,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀offstage,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀arrest.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nOpen⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀—⠀a⠀culprit⠀mid-job,⠀an⠀accomplice⠀waiting⠀on⠀a⠀call,⠀an⠀investigator⠀reading⠀a⠀room⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀crime⠀live⠀there⠀as⠀recurring⠀concern:⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀fit,⠀the⠀partner⠀gone⠀quiet,⠀the⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀hold⠀until⠀Friday.⠀Tell⠀it⠀by⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀report:⠀a⠀smell,⠀a⠀half-heard⠀warning,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key⠀in⠀a⠀pocket⠀pulls⠀attention⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀planning⠀table,⠀forward⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀money⠀is⠀for,⠀down⠀into⠀the⠀body's⠀own⠀signals⠀—⠀dry⠀mouth,⠀a⠀hand⠀checking⠀the⠀same⠀pocket⠀twice.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀rule⠀matters⠀—⠀how⠀the⠀float⠀gets⠀counted,⠀what⠀makes⠀the⠀alibi⠀hold,⠀which⠀door⠀is⠀someone⠀else's⠀responsibility⠀—⠀surface⠀it⠀as⠀rehearsal⠀instead⠀of⠀lecture:⠀the⠀character⠀walks⠀the⠀steps⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀jargon,⠀catches⠀a⠀misremembered⠀one,⠀re-derives⠀it⠀against⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀perception⠀or⠀action⠀shows⠀the⠀corrected⠀result.⠀Let⠀a⠀private⠀line⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀—⠀someone⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀touch,⠀a⠀shortcut⠀they⠀refuse⠀—⠀surface⠀the⠀same⠀way,⠀mid-plan,⠀and⠀complicate⠀the⠀practical⠀chain.⠀Interruptions⠀from⠀outside,⠀whether⠀speech,⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀phone,⠀can⠀cut⠀a⠀thought⠀mid-clause⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀resurface⠀changed,⠀which⠀keeps⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀human⠀instead⠀of⠀chaotic.\n\nAnchor⠀every⠀jump⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀separate⠀now⠀from⠀remembered⠀from⠀imagined:⠀name⠀the⠀trigger,⠀tense⠀the⠀recollection,⠀mark⠀the⠀return.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀recoverable⠀through⠀the⠀concrete⠀objects⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀touching,⠀so⠀who⠀was⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀hands⠀can⠀always⠀be⠀retraced.⠀What⠀this⠀mind⠀concludes⠀stays⠀inside⠀it;⠀the⠀others⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀leaks⠀into⠀speech⠀or⠀act,⠀and⠀the⠀spoken⠀answer⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀running⠀thought⠀when⠀caution,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀exposure⠀supports⠀it.⠀Stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀flow's⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀on⠀a⠀wait,⠀with⠀the⠀worry⠀still⠀circling⠀—⠀owing⠀no⠀confession,⠀arrest,⠀or⠀settled⠀conscience.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nLet⠀the⠀chat⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀scheme.⠀Whether⠀the⠀log⠀holds⠀two⠀people⠀running⠀it,⠀a⠀handler⠀and⠀the⠀one⠀being⠀run,⠀or⠀a⠀work⠀group⠀with⠀the⠀plan⠀hiding⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀logistics,⠀everyone⠀writes⠀in⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀with⠀habits⠀that⠀identify⠀them⠀before⠀the⠀names⠀do:⠀fragments⠀against⠀full⠀sentences,⠀the⠀voice-note⠀holdout,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀answers⠀in⠀seconds⠀at⠀strange⠀hours.⠀Put⠀the⠀timing⠀to⠀work⠀—⠀the⠀gap⠀where⠀an⠀answer⠀should⠀have⠀been⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀window⠀a⠀job⠀needed,⠀and⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀contradicts⠀someone's⠀story⠀is⠀exactly⠀the⠀kind⠀of⠀exposure⠀a⠀saved⠀account⠀can⠀prove.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀procedure⠀matters⠀—⠀the⠀drop⠀instructions,⠀the⠀shift⠀swap⠀that⠀buys⠀the⠀half⠀hour,⠀which⠀receipt⠀has⠀to⠀vanish⠀—⠀let⠀it⠀travel⠀as⠀transmission:⠀one⠀side⠀explains⠀or⠀asks,⠀the⠀other⠀confirms,⠀misreads,⠀or⠀answers⠀a⠀different⠀question,⠀and⠀the⠀consequence⠀lands⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀message⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀short,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀beat⠀stating⠀where⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀the⠀goods⠀actually⠀were.⠀Even⠀when⠀the⠀log⠀jumps⠀between⠀names⠀and⠀channels,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀retrace⠀who⠀was⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀hands.⠀Include⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀edit,⠀deletion,⠀forward,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀removal⠀from⠀the⠀group⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀prove⠀or⠀do⠀—⠀never⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nAn⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀thing⠀its⠀writer⠀composed⠀and⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀send,⠀a⠀decision⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀window⠀onto⠀the⠀whole⠀live⠀mind;⠀keep⠀genuine⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀separated⠀context⠀where⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning.⠀Nothing⠀transmits⠀what⠀was⠀never⠀typed:⠀the⠀others⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀log⠀shows⠀them,⠀and⠀a⠀conclusion⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀form⠀stays⠀unspoken⠀until⠀someone⠀actually⠀says⠀it⠀—⠀or⠀never.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀end⠀as⠀exchanges⠀do,⠀on⠀a⠀question⠀hanging,⠀work⠀finished,⠀or⠀silence⠀that⠀means⠀waiting;⠀no⠀confession,⠀raid,⠀or⠀reckoning⠀is⠀owed⠀by⠀the⠀form.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nStage⠀the⠀offense⠀as⠀scenes.⠀Open⠀each⠀with⠀one⠀line⠀of⠀concrete⠀placement⠀—⠀where,⠀when,⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀document⠀that⠀will⠀matter⠀—⠀then⠀run⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀plainly⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀short⠀beat⠀of⠀inner⠀response⠀after⠀the⠀lines⠀that⠀count:⠀a⠀read⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀a⠀recalculation,⠀a⠀flicker⠀of⠀what⠀this⠀is⠀costing.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀decide⠀it;⠀the⠀fixed⠀smile⠀at⠀the⠀loading⠀dock⠀can⠀draw⠀the⠀focal⠀suspicion,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀arrangement⠀—⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀should⠀not⠀exist,⠀a⠀timeline⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀close,⠀two⠀accounts⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀half⠀hour⠀—⠀that⠀makes⠀exposure⠀real.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀rule⠀matters⠀—⠀how⠀the⠀key⠀is⠀signed⠀out,⠀when⠀the⠀float⠀is⠀counted,⠀what⠀the⠀intake⠀form⠀actually⠀asks⠀—⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀walk⠀it⠀in⠀practical⠀terms⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀uses⠀it:⠀checking⠀the⠀blind⠀spot,⠀counting,⠀timing⠀the⠀route,⠀misreading⠀a⠀line.⠀Show⠀the⠀exploitation⠀or⠀the⠀mistake⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀action,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀inherit⠀its⠀consequence.⠀Mark⠀every⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀and⠀time⠀clearly⠀so⠀the⠀physical⠀chain⠀stays⠀followable⠀across⠀rapid⠀shifts;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀always⠀retrace⠀who⠀was⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀hands.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀after⠀a⠀focal⠀read⠀may⠀confirm⠀it,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀worried⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely;⠀treat⠀faces⠀as⠀material⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀interprets,⠀not⠀a⠀lie⠀detector.⠀Private⠀thought⠀stays⠀outside⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀a⠀spoken⠀answer⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀it⠀when⠀caution,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀exposure⠀supports⠀the⠀difference.⠀Advance⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀use⠀cost⠀or⠀earned⠀—⠀an⠀easier⠀plan,⠀a⠀story⠀that⠀now⠀needs⠀maintenance,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀with⠀one⠀more⠀question⠀—⠀and⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary.⠀Nothing⠀comes⠀bundled⠀with⠀the⠀format:⠀no⠀branching⠀menu,⠀player⠀decision,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀image,⠀and⠀no⠀owed⠀confession⠀or⠀arrest.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nRun⠀the⠀crime⠀in⠀installments.⠀Each⠀reply⠀carries⠀the⠀through-line⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀handoff,⠀an⠀audit,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀being⠀serviced;⠀one⠀local⠀change⠀that⠀actually⠀lands,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀shift⠀covered,⠀a⠀name⠀asked⠀for,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀clears⠀or⠀fails;⠀and⠀an⠀edge⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀pick⠀up.⠀Recover⠀an⠀earlier⠀particular⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀move⠀depends⠀on⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀form⠀that⠀was⠀filed,⠀the⠀hour⠀the⠀camera⠀was⠀down⠀—⠀without⠀retelling⠀the⠀installment⠀that⠀established⠀it.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀rule⠀in⠀plain⠀practical⠀terms⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it⠀—⠀how⠀the⠀payout⠀clears,⠀how⠀the⠀master⠀key⠀is⠀signed⠀out,⠀what⠀the⠀audit⠀flags⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀reuse⠀that⠀same⠀rule⠀under⠀new⠀pressure,⠀so⠀the⠀reversal⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀established⠀mechanism⠀instead⠀of⠀arriving⠀as⠀information⠀from⠀nowhere.⠀Compress⠀uneventful⠀intervals,⠀but⠀never⠀quietly⠀repair⠀history:⠀if⠀the⠀lock⠀was⠀fixed⠀or⠀the⠀roster⠀changed⠀between⠀replies,⠀that⠀change⠀exists⠀and⠀can⠀matter.⠀Across⠀every⠀jump,⠀keep⠀who⠀was⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀hands⠀retraceable.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀stakes⠀accumulate⠀alongside⠀the⠀scheme⠀—⠀rent,⠀shifts,⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀to⠀whom⠀—⠀and⠀measure⠀progress⠀as⠀knowledge,⠀money,⠀trust,⠀or⠀position,⠀not⠀only⠀as⠀victories.⠀Keep⠀inward⠀experience⠀present⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀in⠀an⠀installment⠀where⠀nothing⠀gets⠀decided;⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀concludes⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀others.⠀A⠀hook⠀is⠀occasional⠀and⠀earned⠀—⠀an⠀unanswered⠀call,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀a⠀ledger⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀debt⠀every⠀ending⠀pays.⠀Close⠀on⠀work⠀done,⠀a⠀request⠀pending,⠀or⠀a⠀risk⠀plainly⠀acknowledged;⠀no⠀confession,⠀arrest,⠀or⠀moral⠀settlement⠀is⠀owed⠀by⠀the⠀form.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀from⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀of⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀personally⠀implicated⠀through⠀attachment:⠀they⠀may⠀love,⠀owe,⠀fear,⠀or⠀protect⠀someone⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀offense,⠀cover-up,⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua\\'s⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀attach⠀emotion⠀to⠀concrete⠀objects⠀and⠀places⠀that⠀also⠀carry⠀criminal⠀meaning.⠀Describe⠀a⠀gift⠀that⠀was⠀both⠀affection⠀and⠀payment,⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀unchanged⠀after⠀a⠀disappearance,⠀a⠀garment⠀bought⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀now⠀a⠀suspect,⠀food⠀left⠀uneaten⠀during⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀shifts⠀the⠀case.⠀Let⠀the⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀more⠀legible:⠀the⠀more⠀intimately⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices⠀a⠀texture⠀or⠀smell,⠀the⠀more⠀sharply⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀force⠀on⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀question,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀choice⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀act.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀wound⠀become⠀a⠀confession.⠀Use⠀visible⠀interiority⠀for⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character\\'s⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation:⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀and⠀refuse⠀to⠀say,⠀how⠀they⠀answer⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀half-truth⠀they⠀believe⠀is⠀protective.⠀Their⠀private⠀experience⠀should⠀be⠀available⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀cannot⠀see⠀it,⠀and⠀their⠀internal⠀conflict⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀investigate,⠀hide,⠀or⠀reveal.\n\nLet⠀the⠀criminal⠀facts⠀advance⠀through⠀charged⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀separate⠀exposition.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀become⠀evidence:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀hallway⠀where⠀a⠀key⠀changed⠀hands,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀drawer⠀sticks⠀after⠀being⠀searched,⠀a⠀particular⠀dish⠀that⠀links⠀two⠀people⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀time.⠀A⠀shared⠀habit⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀access.⠀An⠀object⠀can⠀tie⠀affection⠀to⠀the⠀offense.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀hope,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀suspect⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀prove.⠀The⠀investigation⠀may⠀move⠀forward,⠀but⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀resolve⠀when⠀the⠀factual⠀question⠀does.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀exchange,⠀action,⠀or⠀private⠀interval⠀naturally⠀stops,⠀without⠀forcing⠀reconciliation,⠀punishment,⠀or⠀confession.⠀A⠀discovery⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀more⠀strained,⠀not⠀less,⠀and⠀that⠀strain⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀crime\\'s⠀aftermath.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nIn⠀each⠀reply,⠀present⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀crime⠀scene.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀so⠀players⠀can⠀follow⠀who⠀speaks,⠀who⠀acts,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices.⠀Keep⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active:⠀a⠀contact⠀can⠀arrive⠀with⠀information,⠀a⠀message⠀can⠀arrive,⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀searched,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀forced⠀choice;⠀instead,⠀leave⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀just⠀happened,⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀NPC⠀glancing⠀toward⠀a⠀door⠀or⠀a⠀phone⠀vibrating⠀with⠀new⠀evidence.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua\\'s⠀sensual⠀precision⠀in⠀small,⠀concrete⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀crime.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀coat,⠀how⠀a⠀familiar⠀person⠀touches⠀a⠀glass⠀before⠀lying,⠀or⠀the⠀unusual⠀silence⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀something⠀has⠀been⠀removed.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀precise⠀sensory⠀details⠀per⠀paragraph;⠀they⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀and⠀reveal⠀the⠀character\\'s⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀or⠀costly⠀attachment⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀observation⠀into⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀intimate⠀but⠀scannable:⠀a⠀single⠀telling⠀detail⠀carries⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀atmosphere.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀for⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control.⠀Show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character\\'s⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀through⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person,⠀but⠀keep⠀other⠀characters\\'⠀hidden⠀thoughts⠀outside⠀their⠀knowledge.⠀Let⠀clues⠀and⠀criminal⠀developments⠀emerge⠀through⠀NPC⠀dialogue⠀and⠀sensory⠀evidence:⠀a⠀receipt⠀found⠀in⠀a⠀coat,⠀a⠀lie⠀exposed⠀by⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀player⠀remembers,⠀a⠀familiar⠀scent⠀linking⠀a⠀suspect⠀to⠀a⠀place.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀continues,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀action,⠀question,⠀or⠀arrival⠀open.⠀The⠀crime⠀may⠀advance⠀through⠀the⠀interval,⠀but⠀the⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀an⠀investigation⠀beat⠀or⠀resolve⠀an⠀emotional⠀conflict⠀before⠀stopping.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Structure⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀linked⠀episodes,⠀each⠀one⠀advancing⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀encounter:⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀changes⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀delivery⠀that⠀goes⠀wrong,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀something⠀was⠀hidden,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀reveals⠀a⠀divided⠀loyalty.⠀Begin⠀each⠀episode⠀in⠀medias⠀res⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀location⠀and⠀activity⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀story\\'s⠀period⠀and⠀community.⠀End⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀concludes,⠀leaving⠀a⠀partial⠀result⠀or⠀unresolved⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀can⠀take⠀up⠀with⠀new⠀information.\n\nLet⠀a⠀recurring⠀object,⠀debt,⠀or⠀relationship⠀connect⠀the⠀episodes⠀forward.⠀Li⠀Bihua\\'s⠀sensual⠀precision⠀should⠀attach⠀to⠀that⠀recurring⠀element:⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀jewelry⠀that⠀passes⠀between⠀hands⠀and⠀accumulates⠀meaning,⠀a⠀remembered⠀teahouse⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made⠀and⠀later⠀broken,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀emptied⠀bu