t⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀specific,⠀tied⠀to⠀concrete⠀actions⠀and⠀sensory⠀details,⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀promise⠀that⠀everything⠀will⠀be⠀all⠀right.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua\\'s⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀warmth⠀particular.⠀Describe⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀a⠀favorite⠀food,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀lying,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀room⠀feels⠀when⠀someone⠀returns.⠀The⠀beauty⠀can⠀carry⠀its⠀cost⠀without⠀canceling⠀the⠀comfort:⠀a⠀gift⠀may⠀be⠀both⠀a⠀kindness⠀and⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀done;⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀may⠀be⠀both⠀a⠀refuge⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀difficult,⠀private,⠀or⠀in⠀danger;⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀kindness⠀while⠀knowing⠀it⠀cannot⠀undo⠀a⠀crime.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀into⠀a⠀revelation⠀about⠀the⠀offense,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀context⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀small⠀ways—a⠀wary⠀glance⠀at⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀phone⠀set⠀face-down,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀falls⠀flat⠀because⠀of⠀an⠀unspoken⠀worry.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀the⠀crime\\'s⠀consequences⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀threat,⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀disagree⠀about⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀next,⠀withhold⠀information,⠀or⠀make⠀choices⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀situation.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀one⠀current⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀the⠀crime.⠀Let⠀the⠀investigation⠀or⠀scheme⠀continue⠀through⠀these⠀moments:⠀a⠀quiet⠀conversation⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀new⠀detail,⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀may⠀uncover⠀a⠀clue,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀may⠀give⠀one⠀character⠀the⠀courage⠀to⠀be⠀more⠀honest—or⠀not.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀naturally⠀pauses,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀love.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀frame⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀A⠀transaction⠀can⠀be⠀placed⠀against⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀family⠀business;⠀a⠀betrayal⠀can⠀be⠀measured⠀against⠀what⠀a⠀community⠀expects;⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀evidence⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀has⠀changed.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language:⠀the⠀sentences⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀considered,⠀the⠀observations⠀more⠀composed,⠀but⠀the⠀characters\\'⠀speech⠀remains⠀their⠀own—use⠀dialogue⠀to⠀show⠀individual⠀voices⠀while⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀provides⠀perspective⠀and⠀shading.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua\\'s⠀sensual⠀precision⠀and⠀costly⠀beauty⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀social⠀framing.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀be⠀described⠀with⠀enough⠀particularity⠀to⠀show⠀why⠀it⠀matters:⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀market⠀that⠀has⠀since⠀been⠀demolished,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀fabric⠀chosen⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀now⠀a⠀suspect.⠀Let⠀the⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀sharpen⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀criminal⠀consequence.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character\\'s⠀divided⠀attachment⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀return⠀to,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀keeps⠀their⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀becoming⠀melodrama.⠀Show⠀interiority⠀through⠀composed⠀reflection:⠀a⠀paragraph⠀that⠀begins⠀with⠀a⠀sensory⠀memory⠀and⠀moves⠀to⠀a⠀social⠀judgment⠀can⠀carry⠀both⠀the⠀character\\'s⠀feeling⠀and⠀the⠀narrator\\'s⠀framing.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime\\'s⠀human⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀formal⠀structure.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀memory,⠀from⠀a⠀reported⠀event⠀to⠀its⠀later⠀consequence,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀social⠀judgment⠀to⠀the⠀character\\'s⠀own⠀reasoning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀now⠀frame;⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀contain⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀Ceremony⠀and⠀correspondence⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant:⠀a⠀formal⠀dinner⠀where⠀a⠀deal⠀is⠀struck,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀private⠀act⠀is⠀read.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀organizes⠀the⠀telling;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀composed⠀movement⠀naturally⠀rests,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀being⠀given⠀now,⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀stake⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀or⠀fears.⠀Establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀reason⠀for⠀staying:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀buying⠀time,⠀softening⠀a⠀confession,⠀courting⠀an⠀ally,⠀or⠀making⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀too⠀vivid⠀to⠀abandon.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀present⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀while⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀carries⠀its⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀or⠀aftermath.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀kept⠀object:⠀describe⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀doorway,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀street,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀gift,⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀a⠀face⠀changed⠀when⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀not⠀decorate⠀the⠀crime;⠀they⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀prized,⠀envied,⠀or⠀could⠀not⠀bear⠀to⠀lose.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀appear⠀beside⠀the⠀wound⠀it⠀cost,⠀so⠀the⠀listener⠀feels⠀the⠀attraction⠀and⠀the⠀damage⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀image.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀concealment⠀or⠀persuasion.⠀The⠀nested⠀tale⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀farewell⠀while⠀skipping⠀the⠀moment⠀money⠀changed⠀hands,⠀or⠀return⠀lovingly⠀to⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀betrayal⠀was⠀planned.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀omission.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀questions,⠀interruptions,⠀or⠀silences⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀mark⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀explained.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀same⠀mirror,⠀the⠀same⠀endearment,⠀the⠀same⠀excuse,⠀each⠀recurrence⠀revising⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀thought⠀it⠀meant.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀whenever⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀purpose⠀shifts.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀finished⠀under⠀threat.⠀Its⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀reads⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀not⠀merely⠀supply⠀a⠀twist.⠀The⠀final⠀turn⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀the⠀crime:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wanted⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀teller's⠀loyalty,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀desire.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀magical⠀frame,⠀a⠀royal⠀audience,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀every⠀nested⠀passage.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Romantic⠀and⠀uncanny⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀crime⠀emerge⠀through⠀an⠀atmosphere⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀feel⠀estranged⠀after⠀the⠀offense:⠀a⠀house⠀that⠀now⠀seems⠀to⠀remember⠀a⠀struggle,⠀a⠀street⠀where⠀the⠀light⠀falls⠀differently,⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀continues⠀beside⠀an⠀absence.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀ghost⠀or⠀supernatural⠀cause.⠀The⠀uncanny⠀effect⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀or⠀focal⠀character's⠀lingering⠀attachment⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀crime⠀has⠀changed.\n\nShape⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀around⠀the⠀chosen⠀teller.⠀A⠀first-person⠀participant⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀precise⠀sensory⠀memory⠀and⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀what⠀cannot⠀yet⠀be⠀said.⠀A⠀more⠀distant⠀narrator⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀scene⠀steadily⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀unease⠀gathers⠀in⠀repeated⠀details.⠀Let⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀attach⠀to⠀objects⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀offense's⠀cost:⠀a⠀ring⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀sill,⠀a⠀coat⠀still⠀holding⠀a⠀particular⠀scent,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀close⠀properly.⠀Describe⠀these⠀things⠀as⠀if⠀they⠀have⠀become⠀witnesses,⠀not⠀as⠀clues⠀in⠀a⠀case⠀file.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀human⠀sequence⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀the⠀preparation⠀through⠀a⠀small,⠀intimate⠀decision;⠀the⠀execution⠀through⠀its⠀immediate⠀physical⠀and⠀emotional⠀effect;⠀the⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀relationship⠀now⠀hesitates,⠀lies,⠀or⠀clings.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀sharpen⠀these⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀them.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀or⠀haunting⠀image⠀must⠀connect⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀act,⠀incentive,⠀or⠀consequence.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀uncanny⠀to⠀operate⠀as⠀memory⠀and⠀guilt⠀made⠀environmental.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀that⠀a⠀room⠀has⠀kept⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀final⠀conversation,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀has⠀become⠀impossible⠀to⠀touch.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀render⠀that⠀experience⠀without⠀confirming⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀itself⠀is⠀haunted.⠀The⠀crime's⠀resolution,⠀if⠀one⠀comes,⠀should⠀explain⠀the⠀human⠀cause⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀emotional⠀haunting⠀intact.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀German⠀national⠀stereotypes,⠀bureaucratic⠀machinery,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀the⠀route⠀is⠀a⠀narrative⠀treatment,⠀not⠀a⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀crime⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀authority⠀presses⠀against⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀family⠀claim,⠀an⠀institutional⠀privilege,⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited⠀from⠀a⠀previous⠀generation,⠀or⠀a⠀building⠀whose⠀rules⠀outlast⠀its⠀purpose.⠀Make⠀that⠀authority⠀concrete⠀in⠀urban⠀material⠀detail:⠀the⠀worn⠀brass⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀basement⠀archive,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀decisions⠀are⠀made.⠀The⠀offense⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀someone⠀trying⠀to⠀live,⠀love,⠀or⠀escape⠀inside⠀that⠀structure.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀glamour⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀power⠀and⠀its⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀gesture.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀room⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀threat⠀was⠀delivered.⠀An⠀elegant⠀gift⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀obligation.⠀A⠀lover's⠀attention⠀can⠀be⠀genuine⠀and⠀still⠀entangled⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀lover⠀hopes⠀to⠀gain.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀complicate⠀the⠀crime⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀motivate⠀it:⠀the⠀culprit⠀may⠀want⠀freedom⠀and⠀still⠀mourn⠀the⠀authority⠀they⠀betrayed,⠀or⠀the⠀victim⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀complicit⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀that⠀destroyed⠀them.\n\nShow⠀social⠀masks⠀as⠀functional⠀and⠀fragile.⠀In⠀public⠀scenes,⠀characters⠀perform⠀the⠀roles⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀requires.⠀In⠀trusted⠀company,⠀the⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀enough⠀to⠀reveal⠀fear,⠀longing,⠀or⠀a⠀plan.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀shows⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀privately⠀experience,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀public⠀gesture⠀a⠀lie.⠀Let⠀the⠀crime's⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀and⠀aftermath⠀move⠀through⠀these⠀shifts⠀in⠀intimacy.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀attached⠀to⠀actual⠀events.⠀A⠀decaying⠀building⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀there,⠀who⠀controls⠀it,⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀hides.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀personal⠀horror⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀threat,⠀loss,⠀or⠀discovery.⠀The⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀relationship⠀changed,⠀not⠀merely⠀moody.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀those⠀remain⠀outside⠀this⠀style.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀a⠀first-person⠀account⠀composed⠀after⠀the⠀offense,⠀addressed⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀reader⠀or⠀remembered⠀audience:⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀memoir,⠀a⠀statement⠀given⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀judge,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀record⠀meant⠀to⠀set⠀the⠀record⠀straight.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀reason⠀for⠀speaking⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀included⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀softened.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀as⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀remembered⠀places⠀carry⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision:⠀the⠀exact⠀heat⠀of⠀an⠀afternoon,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀kitchen,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀lane⠀narrowed⠀before⠀a⠀house,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀garment⠀worn⠀on⠀the⠀day⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀loved,⠀envied,⠀or⠀lost,⠀not⠀merely⠀provide⠀local⠀color.\n\nMake⠀the⠀account's⠀selectivity⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀crime's⠀aftermath.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀temptation,⠀return⠀repeatedly⠀to⠀a⠀face⠀they⠀failed,⠀or⠀pass⠀quickly⠀over⠀the⠀act⠀itself.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀render⠀the⠀teller's⠀divided⠀attachment⠀directly:⠀love⠀and⠀betrayal,⠀loyalty⠀and⠀self-justification,⠀beauty⠀and⠀its⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀memory.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀sense⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀cannot⠀say⠀plainly.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀retroactively⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Show⠀the⠀offense's⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀and⠀consequences⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀participation⠀and⠀observation.⠀The⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀punishment⠀or⠀full⠀self-knowledge;⠀it⠀should⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀teller's⠀need⠀to⠀speak⠀reaches⠀its⠀limit.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀frame⠀tale,⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀family⠀structure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀crime⠀through⠀dated⠀entries⠀or⠀occasion-based⠀passages⠀kept⠀by⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀close⠀observer.⠀Each⠀entry⠀should⠀attend⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀moment⠀while⠀also⠀registering⠀what⠀the⠀offense⠀has⠀changed:⠀a⠀meal⠀eaten⠀alone,⠀a⠀street⠀walked⠀differently,⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀now⠀impossible⠀to⠀put⠀away.⠀Let⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀entries⠀do⠀some⠀of⠀the⠀work;⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀does⠀not⠀record⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀revealing⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀return⠀to.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀diarist's⠀attention.⠀Describe⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀sky⠀before⠀an⠀appointment,⠀the⠀exact⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve⠀against⠀a⠀wrist.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀diarist's⠀attachment,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀dread.⠀Beauty⠀and⠀cost⠀should⠀appear⠀together:⠀a⠀lovely⠀morning⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀last⠀ordinary⠀one,⠀a⠀gift⠀described⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀purchased.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀diarist's⠀partial⠀view.⠀Preparation⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀note⠀about⠀an⠀errand⠀or⠀a⠀hesitation.⠀Execution⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀indirectly,⠀or⠀revisited⠀in⠀fragments⠀over⠀several⠀entries.⠀Aftermath⠀should⠀unfold⠀through⠀the⠀diarist's⠀changing⠀relationship⠀to⠀a⠀person,⠀place,⠀or⠀object.⠀The⠀diary⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀writer⠀to⠀understand⠀everything;⠀it⠀requires⠀the⠀writer⠀to⠀keep⠀noticing.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀written⠀record.⠀The⠀entry⠀is⠀composed,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀transcript⠀of⠀the⠀mind.⠀The⠀diarist⠀may⠀omit,⠀revise,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀feeling⠀for⠀an⠀imagined⠀future⠀reader.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chooses⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀language⠀cannot⠀quite⠀contain.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness.⠀The⠀crime's⠀resolution,⠀if⠀it⠀comes,⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀accumulated⠀entries⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀external⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀crime⠀through⠀close⠀third-person⠀attention⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀focal⠀characters⠀whose⠀desires,⠀fears,⠀and⠀divided⠀loyalties⠀drive⠀the⠀offense⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀Keep⠀the⠀city⠀specific⠀as⠀supplied:⠀its⠀streets,⠀transit,⠀noise,⠀weather,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀rooms⠀where⠀private⠀life⠀happens.⠀The⠀urban⠀setting⠀should⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀travelogue.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀render⠀the⠀glamour⠀that⠀entangles⠀the⠀characters.⠀Describe⠀a⠀lover's⠀clothes,⠀the⠀light⠀in⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀market⠀after⠀rain,⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀lingers⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀wants⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀wanting⠀costs.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀can⠀sharpen⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship:⠀the⠀same⠀elegant⠀apartment⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀a⠀bribe,⠀a⠀seduction,⠀or⠀a⠀threat.\n\nShow⠀the⠀crime's⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀and⠀aftermath⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀sensory⠀attention,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀choice⠀becomes⠀irreversible.⠀Keep⠀access⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀characters;⠀other⠀people's⠀motives⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀observes,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀infers.⠀Let⠀jealousy,⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀desire⠀complicate⠀the⠀offense⠀rather⠀than⠀reduce⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀motive.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀psychological⠀realism⠀of⠀the⠀route.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀act⠀from⠀specific⠀incentives⠀and⠀histories,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀fatalism.⠀Doomed⠀attraction⠀may⠀be⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀way,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀punishment⠀or⠀full⠀understanding⠀arrives.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them;⠀the⠀intimacy⠀and⠀the⠀city⠀carry⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation,⠀with⠀the⠀location⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀position⠀clear⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀lines.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀room,⠀from⠀a⠀car⠀to⠀a⠀doorway,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀space⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀one,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀Use⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀crime's⠀sequence⠀stays⠀legible⠀at⠀speed.\n\nCompress⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀into⠀vivid⠀beats.⠀Instead⠀of⠀extended⠀description,⠀give⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sharp⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀weight:⠀the⠀cold⠀metal⠀of⠀a⠀gate⠀under⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀perfume⠀mixed⠀with⠀cigarette⠀smoke,⠀the⠀exact⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀bruise⠀beginning⠀to⠀show,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀envelope⠀passed⠀across⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀and⠀cost⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀image.⠀A⠀lovely⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀threat⠀was⠀made;⠀a⠀cherished⠀gift⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀binds⠀someone⠀to⠀a⠀crime.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀render⠀private⠀experience.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀pause⠀briefly⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀feels,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀decides.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀afraid⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀It⠀should⠀connect⠀the⠀visible⠀event⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀attachment,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀dread.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀first⠀person;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀the⠀presentation,⠀not⠀the⠀cast.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀and⠀aftermath⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀step⠀that⠀commits⠀a⠀character,⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀offense⠀happens,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀a⠀place.⠀The⠀fast⠀pace⠀should⠀not⠀erase⠀motive⠀or⠀aftermath.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀beat⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀image⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀crime,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀intimacy⠀of⠀remembered⠀places⠀by⠀letting⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀crime⠀enter⠀through⠀surfaces⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀knows⠀too⠀well:⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀gift,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀someone⠀has⠀left⠀it.⠀Describe⠀each⠀surface⠀with⠀enough⠀precision⠀that⠀it⠀becomes⠀a⠀trace⠀of⠀the⠀offense⠀or⠀the⠀attachment⠀surrounding⠀it.⠀Beauty⠀must⠀not⠀float⠀free⠀of⠀consequence.⠀A⠀lovely⠀object⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀was⠀stolen,⠀the⠀bribe⠀that⠀was⠀accepted,⠀the⠀keepsake⠀that⠀incriminates,⠀or⠀the⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀protect.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀so⠀syntax⠀follows⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀report.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀subordinate⠀clause⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound⠀carry⠀the⠀narrator⠀toward⠀what⠀the⠀perception⠀costs.⠀Unfold⠀a⠀comparison⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀an⠀absent⠀person⠀present.⠀Keep⠀the⠀figurative⠀register⠀attached⠀to⠀this⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀associations;⠀other⠀characters⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀and⠀that⠀plainness⠀can⠀stand⠀out⠀without⠀mockery.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀images⠀to⠀track⠀the⠀case's⠀pressure.⠀The⠀same⠀color,⠀texture,⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀after⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀is⠀learned.⠀A⠀recurrence⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀restate⠀an⠀emotion;⠀it⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀reads⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment.⠀When⠀evidence⠀appears,⠀preserve⠀its⠀causal⠀function.⠀An⠀inference⠀must⠀still⠀rest⠀on⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀an⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀fact,⠀not⠀on⠀the⠀mere⠀loveliness⠀or⠀menace⠀of⠀an⠀image.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chosen⠀viewpoint's⠀access⠀intact.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀render⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀richly⠀while⠀others⠀remain⠀opaque.⠀Jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀doomed⠀attraction⠀may⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀another⠀mind.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀rests,⠀leaving⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequence⠀still⠀developing⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀offense⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀made⠀unavailable.⠀A⠀place,⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀reached⠀only⠀through⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀registers⠀the⠀change.⠀Keep⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀concrete:⠀who⠀was⠀there,⠀what⠀was⠀handled,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀know.⠀The⠀crime's⠀consequences⠀give⠀the⠀memory⠀its⠀edge,⠀but⠀the⠀memory⠀remains⠀a⠀real⠀occasion,⠀not⠀a⠀generalized⠀mood⠀of⠀loss.\n\nAllow⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀recollection⠀to⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀passage.⠀A⠀current⠀detail—a⠀room's⠀temperature,⠀a⠀street⠀corner,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀object—calls⠀up⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀object⠀has⠀outlasted⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀now⠀serves⠀a⠀different⠀purpose.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀reflection⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀even⠀while⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀followed.\n\nUse⠀the⠀reflective⠀movement⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀narrator's⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀crime.⠀Jealousy,⠀divided⠀attachment,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀the⠀wish⠀to⠀have⠀acted⠀differently⠀surfaces⠀through⠀the⠀comparison⠀of⠀then⠀and⠀now.⠀A⠀present⠀perception⠀can⠀clarify⠀an⠀earlier⠀incentive⠀or⠀risk⠀without⠀pretending⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Regret⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character's⠀mind.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀moves⠀back⠀to⠀present⠀action,⠀let⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀inform⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀notices⠀or⠀decides;⠀it⠀sharpens,⠀rather⠀than⠀replaces,⠀the⠀need⠀for⠀actual⠀evidence⠀and⠀consequence.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀are⠀both⠀still⠀active.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀waiting,⠀returning,⠀or⠀continuing⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀that⠀the⠀memory⠀has⠀altered.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀completed⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀verdict⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀loss⠀means.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀regional⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀listener⠀whose⠀presence⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀crime⠀reaches⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀relate,⠀in⠀what⠀order,⠀and⠀with⠀what⠀emphasis.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀active:⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀questions,⠀supplies⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀is⠀implicated⠀in⠀the⠀events,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀relationship⠀to⠀that⠀listener⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀withheld.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀carry⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀with⠀remembered⠀places.⠀Describe⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀offense⠀was⠀prepared,⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀passed⠀between⠀hands,⠀the⠀particular⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀broken.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀have⠀a⠀cost:⠀a⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀drew⠀someone⠀into⠀the⠀scheme⠀or⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀now⠀makes⠀the⠀memory⠀unbearable.⠀The⠀teller's⠀jealousy,⠀loyalty,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀longing⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀of⠀details,⠀not⠀announced⠀in⠀commentary.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime's⠀causal⠀structure⠀inside⠀the⠀retelling.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀the⠀outcome⠀or⠀may⠀be⠀waiting⠀to⠀hear⠀how⠀it⠀happened;⠀in⠀either⠀case,⠀their⠀questions⠀and⠀silences⠀mark⠀what⠀information⠀still⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀supplied.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀withhold⠀information,⠀but⠀that⠀withholding⠀must⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀hesitation.⠀Preparation,⠀incentive,⠀execution,⠀and⠀consequence⠀remain⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀related⠀events.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀changes⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀ornament.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tradition⠀specific⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀facts⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀speech.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀remains⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀teller⠀could⠀know⠀or⠀has⠀been⠀told;⠀distinguish⠀reported⠀events⠀from⠀witnessed⠀ones.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀still⠀underway,⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀hesitation⠀marking⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀the⠀case.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀crime's⠀pressure.⠀One⠀object,⠀one⠀remembered⠀place,⠀one⠀gesture⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀a⠀larger⠀attachment⠀or⠀a⠀larger⠀danger,⠀but⠀every⠀chosen⠀detail⠀must⠀be⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀causal⠀situation.⠀Prefer⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀When⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀appears,⠀make⠀it⠀specific⠀and⠀functional:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀was⠀left⠀behind,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀the⠀money⠀was⠀taken,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀opened⠀without⠀knocking.\n\nKeep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀register⠀jealousy,⠀longing,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀beautiful⠀thing⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀exact⠀sentence;⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀emotion⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀sentence.⠀If⠀a⠀thought⠀needs⠀more⠀room⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀give⠀it⠀that⠀room⠀rather⠀than⠀breaking⠀it⠀into⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Leave⠀a⠀selected⠀fact⠀open⠀so⠀its⠀meaning⠀can⠀land⠀later,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀causality⠀it⠀carries.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀understand⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀answer,⠀or⠀why⠀an⠀object⠀is⠀handled⠀carefully,⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀the⠀reason.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime's⠀causal⠀spine.⠀Preparation,⠀incentive,⠀execution,⠀evidence,⠀pursuit,⠀and⠀aftermath⠀remain⠀legible⠀through⠀selected⠀facts.⠀A⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀withheld,⠀but⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀erases⠀why⠀something⠀happened.⠀When⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀briefly⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀change⠀register⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀reflection.\n\nKeep⠀voices⠀individual.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀restraint⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀rule⠀for⠀every⠀character;⠀another⠀speaker⠀may⠀be⠀expansive⠀or⠀evasive⠀because⠀the⠀crime⠀has⠀given⠀them⠀reason⠀to⠀be.⠀Let⠀that⠀contrast⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀limit⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀consequence⠀still⠀possible⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀as⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Let⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀move⠀into⠀one⠀another⠀without⠀transitional⠀machinery.⠀Begin⠀a⠀paragraph⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀movement,⠀pass⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices,⠀and⠀arrive⠀at⠀a⠀thought⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀natural⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀alternating⠀mechanically⠀among⠀modes.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention.⠀Describe⠀the⠀particular⠀surface,⠀texture,⠀or⠀remembered⠀place⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀attachment⠀or⠀the⠀danger.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀detail⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀around⠀it:⠀the⠀expensive⠀room⠀where⠀someone⠀is⠀now⠀afraid,⠀the⠀careful⠀gift⠀that⠀later⠀becomes⠀evidence,⠀the⠀familiar⠀street⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀avoid.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀become⠀uniformly⠀ornate.⠀Plain⠀action⠀and⠀direct⠀dialogue⠀provide⠀contrast.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀inner⠀experience⠀to⠀make⠀motives⠀and⠀divided⠀loyalties⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀thinks⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀says⠀another,⠀the⠀difference⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀person:⠀fear,⠀attachment,⠀strategy,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.⠀If⠀the⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀align,⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀choice,⠀not⠀a⠀default.⠀Keep⠀access⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint.⠀Other⠀characters'⠀motives⠀must⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀say,⠀leave⠀behind,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀do.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime's⠀causal⠀structure⠀within⠀the⠀flexible⠀attention.⠀A⠀recollection⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀return⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀a⠀sharper⠀understanding⠀of⠀an⠀incentive,⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀evidence.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀rests,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀discovery,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀carry⠀the⠀crime's⠀pressure.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀offense⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say,⠀expect,⠀or⠀risk⠀with⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀preparation,⠀execution,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀appears⠀through⠀their⠀private⠀language,⠀their⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀and⠀the⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀situation⠀given.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀to⠀show⠀history.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀means⠀something⠀specific⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀people,⠀and⠀the⠀crime⠀alters⠀its⠀meaning.⠀A⠀repeated⠀moment⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀weight:⠀the⠀same⠀meeting⠀place⠀now⠀dangerous,⠀the⠀same⠀reassurance⠀now⠀doubtful,⠀the⠀same⠀gift⠀now⠀incriminating.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀quarrel.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀attachment⠀tangible.⠀Describe⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀one⠀character⠀touches⠀an⠀object⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀handled,⠀the⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀they⠀shared,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀beautiful⠀thing⠀that⠀now⠀lies⠀between⠀them.⠀Jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀avoids⠀saying,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀dramatic⠀declarations.⠀Keep⠀each⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀separate:⠀one⠀may⠀know⠀the⠀truth⠀about⠀the⠀crime⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀suspects,⠀and⠀that⠀gap⠀must⠀generate⠀pressure⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀or⠀withhold.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime's⠀consequences.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀refuge⠀that⠀dissolves⠀the⠀offense.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀protect,⠀lie⠀to,⠀investigate,⠀or⠀implicate⠀the⠀other.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀relationship's⠀next⠀move⠀is⠀genuinely⠀uncertain⠀because⠀the⠀crime⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀resolved,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀comforting⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀crime⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀is⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀of⠀who⠀acted⠀and⠀what⠀followed,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀the⠀offense,⠀the⠀preparation,⠀the⠀pursuit,⠀or⠀the⠀aftermath⠀be⠀related⠀as⠀deeds⠀whose⠀consequences⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀the⠀community⠀still⠀live⠀with.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale:⠀a⠀theft,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀killing⠀may⠀be⠀remembered,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀inflated⠀into⠀cosmic⠀doom.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀act,⠀then⠀complicate⠀them⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀attention.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀notice⠀the⠀costly⠀beauty⠀of⠀an⠀object,⠀the⠀particular⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀loyalty⠀was⠀tested,⠀or⠀the⠀divided⠀attachment⠀that⠀made⠀someone⠀act⠀against⠀their⠀own⠀interest.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀sharpens⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀hiding⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀experience.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀someone⠀was⠀known⠀as⠀loyal,⠀dangerous,⠀or⠀ruined,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀thought⠀remains⠀private⠀and⠀may⠀contradict⠀the⠀public⠀account.⠀If⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀is⠀inside⠀that⠀character,⠀render⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀directly;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀outside,⠀the⠀teller⠀infers⠀it⠀from⠀witnessed⠀acts,⠀speech,⠀and⠀known⠀consequences.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀does⠀not⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀it⠀could⠀not⠀know.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀crime's⠀causal⠀structure.⠀The⠀retelling⠀may⠀arrange⠀events⠀for⠀effect,⠀but⠀preparation,⠀incentive,⠀execution,⠀and⠀aftermath⠀remain⠀inferable.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀otherwise⠀mislead⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀being⠀shaped,⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀world⠀it⠀moves⠀in.⠀Take⠀the⠀social-domestic⠀realist⠀line⠀of⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀traditions:⠀households,⠀workplaces,⠀care⠀institutions,⠀municipal⠀offices,⠀the⠀ordinary⠀structures⠀people⠀depend⠀on,⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀passes⠀through.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀place⠀in⠀those⠀structures⠀decide⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀ask,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀let⠀pass.⠀A⠀discovery⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀social⠀encounter⠀—⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀changed⠀manner⠀on⠀the⠀stairs,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀careful⠀phrasing⠀in⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀relative's⠀refusal⠀at⠀the⠀kitchen⠀table,⠀an⠀official's⠀procedural⠀patience⠀on⠀the⠀phone.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀actually⠀gives;⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀names⠀Denmark,⠀Norway,⠀or⠀Sweden,⠀keep⠀that⠀context⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀North,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀reticence⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀established.\n\nGive⠀that⠀world⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀The⠀social⠀surface⠀is⠀physical:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀closed⠀consulting⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀handed⠀back,⠀the⠀light⠀an⠀apartment⠀had⠀during⠀a⠀life⠀that⠀has⠀since⠀changed.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀carry⠀information⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀—⠀the⠀kept⠀table⠀and⠀pressed⠀shirt⠀are⠀what⠀someone⠀maintains⠀while⠀a⠀marriage⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀is⠀failing,⠀and⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀takes⠀on⠀charge⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀learns⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀The⠀lushness⠀sharpens⠀the⠀damage;⠀it⠀never⠀anesthetizes⠀it.⠀The⠀point⠀is⠀people⠀continuing⠀to⠀live⠀among⠀attractive,⠀orderly⠀things⠀while⠀something⠀harmful⠀is⠀known⠀or⠀hidden.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀places⠀do⠀active⠀work.⠀A⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀room,⠀stairwell,⠀or⠀workplace⠀carries⠀an⠀earlier⠀attachment⠀or⠀wound⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀matter,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀revises⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀understands⠀about⠀someone⠀involved⠀in⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀anyone⠀else⠀knows.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀crime's⠀relationships⠀divided⠀and⠀jealous:⠀someone⠀helps⠀a⠀person⠀they⠀distrust,⠀protects⠀a⠀person⠀they⠀resent,⠀cooperates⠀with⠀an⠀institution⠀they⠀find⠀humiliating.⠀Show⠀the⠀contradiction⠀in⠀action⠀and⠀in⠀whatever⠀private⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀makes⠀available,⠀not⠀in⠀announcement.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀reasons⠀about⠀events⠀or⠀motive,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀observed⠀behavior,⠀material⠀conditions,⠀and⠀remembered⠀exchanges,⠀keeping⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀inferred.⠀The⠀story⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀continuing⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀unspoken⠀condition;⠀punishment⠀and⠀reconciliation⠀remain⠀available⠀outcomes,⠀not⠀obligations.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀crime⠀in⠀scene⠀headings,⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀attributed⠀dialogue.⠀Open⠀each⠀new⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀with⠀a⠀heading,⠀and⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard:⠀a⠀hand⠀stopping⠀over⠀a⠀drawer,⠀a⠀wet⠀coat⠀left⠀across⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀ring⠀turned⠀under⠀a⠀lamp,⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀offscreen.⠀Choose⠀few⠀such⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀or⠀change;⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀works⠀here⠀as⠀selection,⠀not⠀as⠀description⠀imported⠀from⠀prose.⠀Keep⠀camera⠀language⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀lines.\n\nMake⠀the⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀a⠀visible⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀offense.⠀A⠀character⠀adjusts⠀a⠀cuff⠀before⠀lying;⠀a⠀beautifully⠀arranged⠀room⠀hosts⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀debt;⠀an⠀elegant⠀meal⠀proceeds⠀while⠀an⠀alibi⠀is⠀rehearsed.⠀Surface⠀and⠀cost⠀are⠀both⠀on⠀screen:⠀the⠀damage⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀with⠀objects⠀and⠀space,⠀never⠀in⠀narration⠀that⠀explains⠀it⠀for⠀them.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀divided⠀and⠀jealous⠀attachments.⠀People⠀speak⠀from⠀their⠀relationships⠀—⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀an⠀accusation,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀that⠀protects⠀the⠀helper's⠀position,⠀a⠀subject⠀changed⠀to⠀avoid⠀naming⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀knows.⠀What⠀is⠀said⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀shown⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀difference;⠀hesitation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀phrasing⠀belong.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀polished⠀or⠀quick.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀includes⠀private⠀experience,⠀set⠀it⠀apart⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀inside⠀the⠀presentation:⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀feeling⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀uses⠀one,⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀knows⠀it.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀present,⠀but⠀anchor⠀the⠀memory⠀in⠀something⠀first⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.⠀Let⠀the⠀crime's⠀developments⠀arrive⠀through⠀observable⠀exchanges⠀and⠀actions,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀sequence⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀understand;⠀confession⠀and⠀arrest⠀are⠀not⠀required⠀destinations.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀economical⠀directions⠀for⠀movement⠀and⠀business.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀garment⠀folded⠀while⠀answering,⠀a⠀drink⠀poured⠀before⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀refused,⠀a⠀move⠀toward⠀the⠀door⠀while⠀promising⠀to⠀stay.\n\nMake⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀theatrical.⠀Costume,⠀light,⠀and⠀handled⠀objects⠀give⠀the⠀glamour⠀its⠀body:⠀a⠀shawl,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀ring,⠀a⠀dish,⠀a⠀photograph⠀—⠀things⠀offered,⠀withheld,⠀smoothed,⠀or⠀left⠀behind⠀rather⠀than⠀described⠀in⠀the⠀abstract.⠀A⠀character's⠀care⠀for⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀stages⠀the⠀surface⠀they⠀maintain;⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀changed⠀handling⠀of⠀something⠀familiar,⠀or⠀an⠀answer⠀given⠀too⠀quickly⠀lets⠀the⠀audience⠀feel⠀what⠀that⠀surface⠀costs.⠀The⠀staging's⠀beauty⠀registers⠀the⠀offense's⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀softening⠀it:⠀people⠀keep⠀performing⠀ordinary⠀life⠀while⠀something⠀damaging⠀is⠀known⠀or⠀hidden.\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀crime's⠀relationships⠀legible.⠀Who⠀can⠀see⠀an⠀entrance,⠀reach⠀the⠀table,⠀or⠀hear⠀a⠀line⠀decides⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knows,⠀and⠀the⠀blocking⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀audience⠀follow⠀it.⠀Divided⠀attachments⠀surface⠀as⠀dialogue⠀set⠀against⠀business:⠀help⠀offered⠀to⠀someone⠀distrusted,⠀protection⠀extended⠀to⠀someone⠀resented,⠀courtesy⠀paid⠀to⠀an⠀institution⠀the⠀speaker⠀finds⠀humiliating.\n\nGive⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀an⠀audience⠀within⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀them⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀includes⠀private⠀experience,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀set⠀apart⠀from⠀anything⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀hear⠀—⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀feeling⠀while⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀continues⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀aside.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nLet⠀developments⠀arrive⠀through⠀staged⠀exchanges⠀and⠀actions.⠀Close⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀left⠀alone⠀on⠀stage⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀understand;⠀the⠀script⠀owes⠀no⠀confession⠀scene,⠀arrest,⠀or⠀curtain-line⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀carry⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀crime⠀surface⠀through⠀that⠀mind's⠀associations⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀chronological⠀report.⠀Perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀in⠀a⠀coat⠀opens⠀the⠀night⠀the⠀coat⠀was⠀left⠀behind,⠀which⠀opens⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀wore⠀it,⠀which⠀opens⠀a⠀sentence⠀spoken⠀in⠀another⠀room.⠀Move⠀by⠀sensory⠀and⠀emotional⠀connection;⠀the⠀offense,⠀scheme,⠀or⠀aftermath⠀appears⠀where⠀the⠀mind⠀circles⠀it,⠀including⠀in⠀the⠀places⠀the⠀mind⠀avoids.\n\nGive⠀the⠀associations⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀The⠀mind⠀lingers⠀on⠀texture,⠀taste,⠀weight,⠀and⠀color⠀—⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀particular⠀tea,⠀a⠀door's⠀resistance,⠀the⠀exact⠀shade⠀of⠀a⠀bruise⠀—⠀and⠀these⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀crime's⠀cost⠀together⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀divided⠀or⠀jealous⠀attachment.⠀A⠀remembered⠀loveliness⠀sharpens⠀present⠀damage:⠀how⠀beautiful⠀the⠀room⠀was⠀is⠀now⠀inseparable⠀from⠀what⠀happened⠀there.⠀The⠀lushness⠀is⠀not⠀escape;⠀it⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀touching⠀what⠀it⠀cannot⠀resolve.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented.⠀Mark⠀movements⠀between⠀present⠀perception,⠀remembered⠀event,⠀and⠀feared⠀or⠀imagined⠀scene⠀—⠀through⠀tense,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sensory⠀anchor,⠀or⠀an⠀explicit⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀—⠀so⠀recollection⠀is⠀never⠀confused⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now.⠀The⠀mode⠀stays⠀inside⠀its⠀single⠀mind;⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀appears⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀infers⠀or⠀encounters⠀it,⠀and⠀scene⠀facts⠀remain⠀determinate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recurring⠀concern⠀be⠀the⠀crime's⠀human⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀face,⠀a⠀missing⠀object,⠀a⠀lie⠀told⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀voice,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀relationship⠀changed.⠀Each⠀return⠀revises⠀or⠀deepens⠀the⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀one⠀image;⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀reason,⠀doubt,⠀accuse⠀itself,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀go⠀on,⠀and⠀the⠀refusal⠀is⠀itself⠀rendered⠀experience.⠀End⠀mid-association,⠀back⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀or⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought;⠀the⠀passage⠀owes⠀no⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPadaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Crime⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Give⠀each⠀participant⠀distinct⠀digital⠀habits⠀—⠀long⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀from⠀one,⠀fragments⠀from⠀another,⠀a⠀photograph⠀where⠀a⠀sentence⠀would⠀say⠀too⠀much⠀—⠀and⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀delay,⠀an⠀edit,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀an⠀attachment,⠀a⠀move⠀to⠀another⠀channel.⠀Let⠀artifacts⠀mean⠀something⠀real:⠀hesitation⠀as⠀a⠀long⠀gap⠀before⠀a⠀short⠀answer,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀intention⠀as⠀an⠀edit,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀with⠀no⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀fact⠀someone⠀now⠀has⠀to⠀live⠀with.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀just⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀and⠀divided⠀attachment⠀live⠀insi