            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-cyberpunk_noir-02",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Cyberpunk Noir · 02/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == cyberpunk_noir}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Cyberpunk Noir. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 2 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-cyberpunk_noir; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaeaeaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀terms⠀intact:⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀restricted⠀access,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀remain⠀real,⠀and⠀comfort⠀never⠀deletes⠀an⠀established⠀problem⠀or⠀makes⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀The⠀warmth⠀of⠀this⠀style⠀is⠀attention⠀—⠀narration⠀that⠀spends⠀real⠀time⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures⠀that⠀survive⠀inside⠀the⠀conditions.\n\nSlow⠀down⠀for⠀those⠀pleasures.⠀Give⠀a⠀whole⠀paragraph⠀to⠀the⠀meal,⠀the⠀repair⠀done⠀well,⠀the⠀shower⠀that⠀stays⠀hot,⠀the⠀quiet⠀hour⠀while⠀the⠀meters⠀tick⠀—⠀particular,⠀temporary,⠀and⠀not⠀symbolic⠀of⠀a⠀better⠀world.⠀Care⠀shows⠀in⠀concrete⠀acts⠀and⠀specific⠀knowledge:⠀remembering⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀saving⠀the⠀last⠀working⠀port,⠀sharing⠀the⠀blanket,⠀fixing⠀the⠀strap,⠀taking⠀the⠀longer⠀route⠀because⠀the⠀shorter⠀one⠀is⠀watched,⠀leaving⠀a⠀note⠀where⠀no⠀system⠀will⠀flag⠀it.⠀The⠀affection⠀is⠀sincere⠀and⠀complete⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀confession⠀or⠀staged⠀as⠀a⠀repair;⠀it⠀is⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀notices,⠀and⠀in⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀this⠀person⠀—⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀preference,⠀a⠀history⠀—⠀without⠀anyone⠀being⠀required⠀to⠀say⠀so.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Adams⠀absurdity⠀as⠀manageable⠀friction⠀the⠀characters⠀share.⠀The⠀delivery⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀door;⠀the⠀food⠀machine⠀insists⠀on⠀a⠀software⠀update;⠀the⠀room's⠀lights⠀answer⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀name.⠀The⠀inconvenience⠀is⠀warm⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀in⠀it⠀together,⠀not⠀because⠀a⠀detached⠀narrator⠀is⠀laughing⠀at⠀them⠀—⠀the⠀joke⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀to⠀their⠀handling⠀of⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀friction.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀comforted⠀and⠀still⠀annoyed;⠀a⠀kind⠀act⠀can⠀be⠀accepted⠀awkwardly;⠀a⠀routine⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀real⠀notice,⠀charge,⠀knock,⠀or⠀deadline,⠀because⠀the⠀warmth⠀immunizes⠀no⠀one.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀ease⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀debt,⠀investigation,⠀or⠀danger⠀exactly⠀as⠀unresolved⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀—⠀particular⠀people,⠀together,⠀for⠀a⠀while.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀deliberate,⠀sustained⠀paragraphs.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀social⠀framing⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀characters⠀—⠀who⠀employs⠀them,⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀building,⠀what⠀debt⠀or⠀record⠀shapes⠀the⠀choice,⠀what⠀history⠀walks⠀in⠀with⠀them⠀—⠀drawn⠀only⠀from⠀the⠀knowledge⠀and⠀distance⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀holds,⠀never⠀from⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀explains⠀every⠀system⠀at⠀once.⠀Let⠀each⠀paragraph⠀develop⠀one⠀concrete⠀social⠀object,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀denial,⠀and⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀turn⠀that⠀gives⠀it⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀composed⠀and⠀reflective,⠀but⠀its⠀subject⠀stays⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀arrangements,⠀and⠀any⠀judgment⠀the⠀narrator⠀renders⠀is⠀grounded⠀in⠀observable⠀social⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀general⠀lament.⠀Transitions⠀carry⠀the⠀framing⠀forward⠀instead⠀of⠀merely⠀connecting:⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀can⠀itself⠀deliver⠀the⠀information⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀needs.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀absurdity⠀live⠀inside⠀composed⠀observation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀registers,⠀precisely⠀and⠀without⠀comic⠀aside,⠀that⠀a⠀protective⠀policy⠀demands⠀more⠀exposure⠀than⠀the⠀threat⠀it⠀names,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀debt-relief⠀program⠀charges⠀a⠀processing⠀fee⠀the⠀applicant⠀must⠀borrow.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀institutional⠀language⠀and⠀lived⠀procedure⠀is⠀stated⠀as⠀social⠀fact;⠀the⠀formal⠀register⠀makes⠀it⠀sharper,⠀not⠀softer.\n\nSpend⠀digression⠀where⠀it⠀repays.⠀A⠀neighborhood's⠀history,⠀a⠀company's⠀founding,⠀a⠀character's⠀previous⠀employment⠀can⠀explain⠀why⠀this⠀door⠀is⠀locked,⠀this⠀debt⠀enforced,⠀this⠀person⠀trusted⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀meaning,⠀not⠀decorate⠀the⠀pause.⠀The⠀same⠀distance⠀that⠀permits⠀the⠀digression⠀lets⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀different⠀characters⠀understanding⠀the⠀same⠀system⠀differently,⠀without⠀flattening⠀them⠀into⠀illustrations⠀of⠀a⠀thesis.\n\nUnequal⠀power⠀and⠀compromised⠀motive⠀stay⠀live:⠀corporate⠀language,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀bargaining,⠀and⠀bodily⠀compromise⠀remain⠀pressures⠀the⠀prose⠀must⠀negotiate,⠀not⠀backdrop.⠀Keep⠀speech⠀ordinary⠀where⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀ordinary⠀—⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀public⠀or⠀private⠀contrast⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀uniform⠀elaborate⠀voice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀the⠀transaction,⠀not⠀inside⠀the⠀tale.⠀Before⠀any⠀nested⠀story⠀begins,⠀make⠀the⠀frame's⠀terms⠀legible:⠀who⠀is⠀telling,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀stand⠀in⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀can⠀watch,⠀price,⠀or⠀exclude⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀buys⠀or⠀postpones⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀extension,⠀an⠀unlocked⠀door,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀window⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀reputation⠀repaired,⠀or⠀time⠀itself⠀while⠀a⠀deadline⠀runs.⠀Give⠀the⠀occasion⠀a⠀purpose⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀name:⠀persuasion,⠀entertainment,⠀delay,⠀warning.⠀That⠀purpose⠀decides⠀which⠀story⠀gets⠀told,⠀where⠀it⠀stops,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀conveniently⠀leaves⠀out;⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀bargain,⠀never⠀by⠀a⠀neutral⠀impulse⠀to⠀narrate.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀at⠀full⠀scale⠀inside⠀the⠀nested⠀material.⠀A⠀tale⠀can⠀promise⠀a⠀daring⠀hack,⠀a⠀corporate⠀coup,⠀a⠀clean⠀escape,⠀and⠀then⠀stall⠀on⠀a⠀dead⠀battery,⠀a⠀revoked⠀credential,⠀a⠀mistranslated⠀contract⠀clause,⠀a⠀queue⠀whose⠀estimated⠀wait⠀updates⠀every⠀ninety⠀seconds.⠀Bring⠀each⠀digression⠀back⠀through⠀the⠀frame's⠀live⠀problem:⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts⠀about⠀access,⠀payment,⠀or⠀timing,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀embellishment⠀slips⠀and⠀exposes⠀the⠀fact⠀the⠀frame⠀actually⠀needed.⠀Let⠀different⠀listeners⠀use⠀the⠀same⠀tale⠀differently⠀—⠀evidence⠀to⠀one,⠀entertainment⠀to⠀another,⠀a⠀threat⠀to⠀a⠀third⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀adjust⠀mid-story⠀as⠀they⠀read⠀the⠀room.\n\nMake⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀information.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀location⠀should⠀change⠀meaning⠀once⠀the⠀frame⠀reveals⠀who⠀controls⠀it⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀costs,⠀and⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀should⠀recolor⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀add⠀news.⠀Signal⠀every⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀past,⠀and⠀let⠀frame-level⠀interruptions⠀bend⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale's⠀direction.⠀The⠀frame's⠀present⠀can⠀also⠀hold⠀what⠀no⠀told⠀story⠀contains:⠀the⠀teller's⠀calculation⠀between⠀sentences,⠀the⠀listener's⠀private⠀doubt⠀while⠀keeping⠀a⠀courteous⠀face.⠀Keep⠀the⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀—⠀priced⠀by⠀the⠀minute,⠀monitored,⠀usable⠀against⠀someone⠀—⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀break⠀or⠀turning⠀every⠀teller⠀into⠀a⠀schemer,⠀and⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀a⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀any⠀other⠀prop⠀the⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀supply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀satirical-construction⠀route.⠀Put⠀a⠀social⠀or⠀technical⠀procedure⠀in⠀view⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀there⠀until⠀its⠀consequences⠀expose⠀themselves:⠀a⠀creditworthiness⠀algorithm,⠀a⠀residency-permit⠀renewal,⠀a⠀workplace⠀monitoring⠀policy,⠀a⠀data-subject⠀request,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause⠀that⠀has⠀outlived⠀everyone⠀who⠀understood⠀it.⠀State⠀the⠀procedure's⠀official⠀purpose⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀orderly⠀language⠀—⠀optimized,⠀streamlined,⠀for⠀your⠀protection⠀—⠀then⠀follow⠀it⠀step⠀by⠀step⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀it⠀prices,⠀excludes,⠀or⠀reclassifies.⠀The⠀comedy⠀lives⠀in⠀that⠀gap⠀and⠀should⠀be⠀delivered⠀deadpan:⠀the⠀narration⠀documents⠀the⠀mismatch⠀instead⠀of⠀joking⠀about⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀more⠀composed⠀the⠀syntax,⠀the⠀harder⠀the⠀absurdity⠀lands.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀satire⠀rather⠀than⠀beside⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀absurd⠀procedure⠀terminate⠀in⠀concrete⠀vulnerability:⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀revoked⠀credential,⠀a⠀recorded⠀violation,⠀a⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changes⠀hands⠀at⠀an⠀administratively⠀convenient⠀moment.⠀Track⠀who⠀administers⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀who⠀absorbs⠀its⠀cost,⠀even⠀when⠀neither⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room.⠀Let⠀people⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀system⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀positions⠀—⠀one⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀weather,⠀one⠀as⠀a⠀trap,⠀one⠀as⠀a⠀ladder,⠀one⠀as⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀route⠀around⠀—⠀so⠀their⠀reactions⠀map⠀the⠀terrain⠀instead⠀of⠀flattening⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀comic⠀voice.\n\nGive⠀digressions⠀a⠀job.⠀An⠀explanation⠀of⠀a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀corporate⠀memo,⠀a⠀technical⠀manual,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀precedent⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀action⠀only⠀if⠀it⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀constraint⠀or⠀a⠀lever⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀pull.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀system's⠀level⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀person's,⠀move⠀the⠀prose⠀with⠀it:⠀the⠀general⠀view⠀stays⠀classifying⠀and⠀slightly⠀too⠀calm,⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀view⠀turns⠀concrete,⠀partial,⠀and⠀urgent⠀—⠀shorter⠀clauses,⠀physical⠀detail,⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀no⠀form⠀would⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀attach⠀the⠀method⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀country,⠀a⠀national⠀severity,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀the⠀target⠀is⠀a⠀total⠀environment⠀that⠀runs⠀on⠀stated⠀logic⠀and⠀produces⠀lived⠀absurdity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMaterialize⠀inherited⠀authority⠀as⠀legacy⠀systems.⠀A⠀founding⠀family's⠀access⠀privileges,⠀a⠀deprecated⠀protocol⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀doors,⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀security⠀lineage,⠀a⠀contract⠀that⠀outlives⠀its⠀signers,⠀an⠀implant⠀only⠀one⠀aging⠀technician⠀can⠀service⠀—⠀these⠀carry⠀the⠀gothic⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀old⠀pressing⠀on⠀the⠀now.⠀Let⠀the⠀collision⠀happen⠀in⠀intimate⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀institutional⠀summaries:⠀a⠀debt⠀negotiation⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀office,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀call⠀after⠀hours,⠀a⠀favor⠀asked⠀by⠀someone⠀whose⠀name⠀still⠀unlocks⠀things.⠀Keep⠀the⠀noir⠀ledger⠀open⠀underneath⠀the⠀atmosphere:⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀inherited⠀key,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀its⠀upkeep,⠀who⠀is⠀watched⠀while⠀asking.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀gothic⠀from⠀going⠀solemn.⠀Grand⠀legacy⠀should⠀keep⠀tripping⠀over⠀small⠀logistics⠀—⠀the⠀unbroken⠀lineage⠀of⠀access⠀rests⠀on⠀a⠀forgotten⠀password,⠀the⠀sealed⠀archive⠀is⠀mislabeled,⠀the⠀ceremonial⠀floor⠀is⠀unreachable⠀because⠀the⠀elevator⠀is⠀out⠀again,⠀the⠀dynasty's⠀accounts⠀are⠀held⠀up⠀by⠀a⠀catering⠀invoice.⠀These⠀failures⠀are⠀not⠀relief⠀from⠀the⠀stakes⠀but⠀their⠀sharpest⠀form:⠀someone⠀still⠀pays,⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀watched,⠀someone's⠀body⠀or⠀freedom⠀still⠀hangs⠀on⠀the⠀outcome⠀while⠀the⠀machinery⠀of⠀old⠀power⠀fails⠀in⠀petty⠀ways.⠀Let⠀each⠀character⠀meet⠀the⠀same⠀encounter⠀differently⠀—⠀awe,⠀disgust,⠀impatience,⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀name⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀difference⠀reveal⠀their⠀history⠀with⠀the⠀arrangement.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀work⠀locally⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀constant⠀filter.⠀A⠀familiar⠀room⠀can⠀change⠀when⠀the⠀door⠀locks;⠀a⠀trusted⠀contact⠀can⠀go⠀strange⠀when⠀an⠀old⠀name⠀surfaces;⠀in⠀company⠀that⠀feels⠀safe,⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀can⠀slip⠀without⠀any⠀confession⠀or⠀betrayal⠀having⠀to⠀follow.⠀Keep⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀specific⠀and⠀functional⠀—⠀the⠀worn⠀keypad,⠀a⠀server⠀room's⠀hum,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀sealed⠀archive,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀legacy⠀implant⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀detail⠀show⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀out⠀and⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀running.⠀The⠀gothic⠀element⠀is⠀the⠀felt⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀dependency;⠀import⠀no⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀modern⠀urban,⠀popular,⠀or⠀diasporic⠀fiction⠀route:⠀scene-forward,⠀dialogue-friendly,⠀momentum⠀valued⠀over⠀description⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied⠀—⠀the⠀actual⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀workplace,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀language,⠀food,⠀transport,⠀money⠀transfers,⠀and⠀family⠀obligations⠀appear⠀as⠀lived⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀local⠀color.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀uses⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀language,⠀render⠀the⠀switch⠀because⠀it⠀carries⠀meaning⠀the⠀English⠀paraphrase⠀does⠀not:⠀a⠀term⠀of⠀address⠀that⠀assigns⠀rank,⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀formula⠀that⠀signals⠀which⠀office⠀has⠀been⠀reached,⠀a⠀street⠀insult,⠀a⠀remembered⠀saying⠀that⠀settles⠀an⠀argument.⠀Let⠀the⠀multilingual⠀moment⠀matter⠀to⠀whoever⠀is⠀speaking;⠀do⠀not⠀salt⠀every⠀exchange⠀with⠀borrowed⠀phrases⠀or⠀invent⠀a⠀uniform⠀family⠀structure,⠀religion,⠀or⠀caste⠀experience⠀for⠀the⠀cast.\n\nRun⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀unevenly⠀across⠀this⠀community.⠀A⠀payment⠀app,⠀a⠀housing⠀database,⠀a⠀workplace⠀monitoring⠀tool,⠀a⠀remittance⠀service,⠀a⠀police⠀verification⠀portal⠀—⠀each⠀can⠀work⠀smoothly⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀trap⠀another⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀day.⠀Show⠀the⠀seam:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀when⠀a⠀decision⠀goes⠀wrong,⠀whose⠀record⠀is⠀assumed⠀and⠀whose⠀is⠀audited.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀work⠀through⠀that⠀seam:⠀a⠀grand⠀plan⠀—⠀migration,⠀a⠀startup,⠀a⠀family⠀rescue,⠀an⠀appeal⠀—⠀can⠀stall⠀on⠀a⠀missing⠀document,⠀a⠀dead⠀phone,⠀a⠀form⠀field⠀that⠀rejects⠀the⠀name⠀as⠀spelled,⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀resets⠀at⠀midnight,⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀knows⠀exactly⠀the⠀wrong⠀official.⠀Bring⠀each⠀digression⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀person's⠀current⠀move,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀complaint⠀about⠀bureaucracy.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀distinct⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀system⠀—⠀routine⠀for⠀one,⠀humiliation⠀for⠀another,⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀exploit,⠀a⠀threat⠀to⠀walk⠀around⠀—⠀rooted⠀in⠀position⠀and⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀one⠀narrator's⠀comic⠀voice.⠀Beneath⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀keep⠀the⠀unsaid⠀functional:⠀the⠀private⠀arithmetic⠀about⠀a⠀fee,⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀told⠀to⠀a⠀relative,⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀only⠀to⠀themselves⠀before⠀answering.⠀Debt,⠀surveillance,⠀exclusion,⠀and⠀bodily⠀risk⠀stay⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀procedure⠀is⠀absurd;⠀the⠀humor⠀is⠀the⠀precise⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀claims⠀to⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀never⠀mockery⠀of⠀the⠀community⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀route:⠀shape⠀the⠀telling⠀around⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀Let⠀that⠀attention⠀move⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀moves⠀—⠀a⠀biometric⠀prompt,⠀a⠀debt⠀reminder,⠀a⠀camera's⠀angle,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀message,⠀a⠀remembered⠀price⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀follow⠀the⠀movement,⠀including⠀its⠀skips⠀and⠀returns.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀stays⠀physical⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀inward:⠀this⠀person⠀is⠀being⠀observed,⠀priced,⠀or⠀excluded⠀while⠀they⠀think,⠀and⠀the⠀thinking⠀should⠀register⠀that⠀condition⠀rather⠀than⠀float⠀free⠀of⠀it.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀inside⠀the⠀flow⠀of⠀attention.⠀A⠀large⠀fear⠀or⠀plan⠀gets⠀interrupted⠀by⠀small⠀logistics:⠀the⠀payment⠀fails,⠀the⠀door⠀will⠀not⠀read⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀crucial⠀file⠀sits⠀behind⠀a⠀captcha,⠀the⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀been⠀living⠀by⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀advertisement.⠀Treat⠀these⠀interruptions⠀as⠀diagnostic⠀—⠀they⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀situation⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀mechanics.⠀When⠀attention⠀digresses⠀into⠀memory⠀or⠀explanation,⠀return⠀it⠀changed:⠀the⠀digression⠀must⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀next,⠀decides,⠀or⠀refuses.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀inward⠀method⠀become⠀an⠀escape⠀hatch⠀from⠀the⠀stakes;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀medium⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀stakes⠀are⠀experienced.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀as⠀instruments,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀skip⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀refuses⠀to⠀dwell⠀on⠀—⠀a⠀jump⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀—⠀and⠀then⠀state⠀a⠀fear⠀or⠀desire⠀plainly,⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀words,⠀when⠀it⠀presses⠀hard⠀enough.⠀Keep⠀other⠀people's⠀responses⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀view:⠀someone⠀else⠀treats⠀the⠀same⠀system⠀as⠀routine,⠀opportunity,⠀or⠀menace,⠀and⠀noticing⠀that⠀difference⠀is⠀itself⠀private⠀information⠀about⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀history⠀and⠀position.⠀The⠀experiment⠀here⠀is⠀the⠀shaped⠀movement⠀of⠀attention⠀under⠀system⠀pressure;⠀impose⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness,⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀or⠀scenery⠀list.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀polyphonic,⠀nonlinear⠀route.⠀Build⠀the⠀account⠀out⠀of⠀positioned⠀tellings⠀—⠀an⠀official⠀notice,⠀a⠀worker's⠀testimony,⠀a⠀street-level⠀explanation,⠀a⠀corporate⠀memo,⠀a⠀family⠀memory,⠀a⠀recorded⠀negotiation⠀—⠀and⠀order⠀them⠀for⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀chronology:⠀a⠀later⠀fragment⠀can⠀explain⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀and⠀one⠀account⠀can⠀arrive⠀after⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀trusted⠀its⠀contradiction.⠀Keep⠀each⠀fragment's⠀source⠀and⠀limits⠀legible:⠀who⠀wrote⠀or⠀spoke⠀it,⠀for⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀wants.⠀The⠀same⠀arrangement⠀reads⠀as⠀efficient⠀from⠀the⠀office,⠀predatory⠀from⠀the⠀street,⠀absurd⠀from⠀the⠀maintenance⠀log,⠀and⠀like⠀the⠀only⠀open⠀path⠀from⠀inside⠀a⠀family's⠀kitchen;⠀the⠀reader⠀assembles⠀the⠀system⠀from⠀these⠀gaps,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀steps⠀in⠀to⠀reconcile⠀them.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀across⠀the⠀accounts⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀narrator.⠀A⠀grand⠀official⠀claim⠀can⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀a⠀worker's⠀note⠀about⠀a⠀broken⠀sensor⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀form;⠀a⠀story⠀of⠀escape⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀bus⠀fare,⠀a⠀dead⠀battery,⠀a⠀name⠀misspelled⠀in⠀a⠀database,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀biometric⠀profile.⠀Each⠀fragment's⠀digression⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀teller's⠀purpose⠀—⠀justifying,⠀persuading,⠀warning,⠀remembering⠀—⠀and⠀must⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀purpose's⠀current⠀problem⠀instead⠀of⠀detaching⠀into⠀a⠀comic⠀sketch.⠀Remember⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀or⠀testimony⠀is:⠀it⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀record,⠀not⠀their⠀whole⠀live⠀mind.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀shows⠀a⠀teller⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀their⠀private⠀reasoning⠀can⠀run⠀beneath⠀the⠀version⠀they⠀give⠀others.\n\nLet⠀the⠀polyphony⠀expose⠀the⠀noir⠀structure:⠀unequal⠀access,⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀bodily⠀risk,⠀compromised⠀motives.⠀Some⠀speakers⠀lie,⠀some⠀omit,⠀some⠀are⠀precise⠀and⠀still⠀powerless,⠀and⠀the⠀arrangement⠀itself⠀shows⠀who⠀gets⠀to⠀speak⠀last.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.⠀This⠀route's⠀method⠀is⠀the⠀structural⠀juxtaposition⠀of⠀partial⠀accounts;⠀the⠀marvelous⠀is⠀optional,⠀and⠀no⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀enters⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaean::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀cleanly⠀and⠀fast:⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀which⠀system⠀pressure⠀is⠀already⠀active⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀deadline,⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀monitored⠀call,⠀a⠀clause⠀waiting⠀to⠀be⠀triggered.⠀Keep⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀easy⠀to⠀follow;⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀lobby,⠀terminal⠀to⠀back⠀room,⠀public⠀feed⠀to⠀private⠀message,⠀mark⠀it⠀with⠀one⠀concrete⠀transition⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀atmospheric⠀blur.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀eye⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀changing.⠀Give⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀mechanic⠀or⠀name⠀a⠀clear,⠀brief⠀presentation⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters,⠀then⠀let⠀its⠀consequences⠀do⠀the⠀explaining.\n\nStage⠀the⠀Adams⠀absurdity⠀as⠀a⠀clean⠀interruption⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀door⠀requires⠀a⠀subscription;⠀the⠀contact's⠀name⠀is⠀misspelled⠀in⠀the⠀directory;⠀the⠀escape⠀route⠀sits⠀behind⠀a⠀maintenance⠀queue;⠀the⠀crucial⠀file⠀is⠀formatted⠀for⠀an⠀obsolete⠀implant.⠀Present⠀the⠀mechanic,⠀let⠀it⠀collide⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀goal,⠀and⠀return⠀any⠀digression⠀or⠀explanation⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀current⠀problem⠀—⠀it⠀has⠀to⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do,⠀see,⠀or⠀avoid⠀next.⠀The⠀joke⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀logistics,⠀deadpan⠀and⠀specific,⠀not⠀in⠀everyone⠀narrating⠀wittily.\n\nKeep⠀reaction⠀beats⠀short,⠀focused,⠀and⠀owned⠀by⠀their⠀character.⠀After⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀revelation,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀brief⠀private⠀response⠀—⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀flat,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀position⠀and⠀history⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀other⠀characters⠀react⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀interests⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀shared⠀comic⠀timing.⠀The⠀noir⠀stakes⠀stay⠀live:⠀absurd⠀logistics⠀still⠀cost⠀money,⠀access,⠀safety,⠀or⠀bodily⠀autonomy,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀that⠀connects⠀a⠀system's⠀pressure⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀choice⠀is⠀what⠀keeps⠀the⠀speed⠀from⠀turning⠀shallow.⠀No⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed;⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀even⠀mid-motion⠀or⠀mid-conversation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀a⠀sentence⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀compromised⠀system.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀stands⠀in⠀a⠀queue⠀for⠀an⠀identity⠀check⠀or⠀watches⠀a⠀debt⠀tick⠀upward⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀screen,⠀extend⠀the⠀syntax⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀waiting,⠀the⠀accumulation,⠀the⠀small⠀human⠀body⠀held⠀inside⠀a⠀procedure⠀designed⠀without⠀it.⠀Build⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀and⠀images⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀materials:⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀scanner,⠀the⠀flicker⠀of⠀a⠀damaged⠀display,⠀the⠀particular⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀only⠀opens⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀across⠀several⠀clauses⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀touch,⠀or⠀remember⠀in⠀that⠀place.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀contrast⠀between⠀large⠀claims⠀and⠀small⠀logistical⠀problems⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀lyric.⠀A⠀corporation⠀announces⠀a⠀future⠀of⠀seamless⠀access;⠀the⠀character⠀spends⠀the⠀next⠀hour⠀discovering⠀that⠀the⠀promised⠀interface⠀requires⠀a⠀cable⠀no⠀one⠀sells,⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀was⠀closed⠀for⠀inactivity,⠀and⠀a⠀help⠀line⠀that⠀routes⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀recorded⠀voice.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀observe⠀these⠀reversals⠀with⠀rhythmic⠀patience⠀rather⠀than⠀punchline⠀compression.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀accumulates⠀through⠀the⠀music⠀of⠀repeated⠀procedures⠀and⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀announcement⠀and⠀the⠀queue,⠀and⠀a⠀digression⠀earns⠀its⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀error⠀code⠀appears⠀again⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀previous⠀failed⠀upgrade⠀suddenly⠀matters.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀lyric⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀threat;⠀it⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀threat⠀more⠀intimate⠀by⠀attending⠀to⠀the⠀body's⠀small⠀responses:⠀a⠀dry⠀mouth⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀crowded⠀transit⠀car,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀that⠀the⠀system⠀already⠀knows⠀the⠀answer⠀it⠀is⠀asking⠀for.⠀Let⠀different⠀people⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀absurdity.⠀One⠀finds⠀the⠀malfunction⠀funny,⠀another⠀finds⠀it⠀terrifying,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀is⠀simply⠀trying⠀to⠀get⠀home,⠀and⠀their⠀speech⠀stays⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀register⠀rather⠀than⠀joining⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀one.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀provide⠀contrast⠀against⠀the⠀shaped⠀passages,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀direct⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀owes⠀or⠀fears⠀lands⠀with⠀its⠀full⠀weight.⠀A⠀procedure⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unresolved,⠀a⠀queue⠀still⠀moving,⠀and⠀a⠀door⠀still⠀closed⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀stops,⠀without⠀an⠀announced⠀lesson⠀about⠀the⠀system.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAttend⠀to⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀a⠀compromised⠀system⠀produces.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀corner⠀store⠀has⠀been⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀payment⠀kiosk,⠀that⠀a⠀friend's⠀voice⠀sounds⠀different⠀through⠀a⠀filtered⠀line,⠀that⠀a⠀password⠀stopped⠀working⠀because⠀the⠀account⠀was⠀migrated⠀without⠀notice.⠀Let⠀the⠀reflection⠀move⠀between⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available:⠀the⠀character⠀stands⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀street,⠀but⠀the⠀place⠀they⠀remember⠀is⠀gone,⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀interface⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀it⠀replaced.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable;⠀a⠀cup⠀of⠀tea⠀from⠀a⠀working⠀machine,⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀unmonitored⠀quiet,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀someone⠀still⠀reachable⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀undermined⠀by⠀the⠀general⠀loss,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀comfort⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀a⠀coda⠀about⠀its⠀passing.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀contrast⠀between⠀large⠀claims⠀and⠀small⠀logistical⠀problems⠀as⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀reflective⠀absurdity.⠀A⠀system⠀promises⠀to⠀preserve⠀memories,⠀then⠀loses⠀them⠀in⠀a⠀format⠀migration.⠀A⠀company⠀announces⠀that⠀it⠀values⠀its⠀users,⠀then⠀requires⠀them⠀to⠀prove⠀their⠀identity⠀through⠀a⠀process⠀that⠀erases⠀the⠀very⠀history⠀it⠀claims⠀to⠀protect.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀meet⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀announcement⠀and⠀the⠀inconvenience⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀punchline⠀but⠀with⠀the⠀slow⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀system⠀was⠀never⠀designed⠀to⠀keep⠀what⠀mattered.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀repeats⠀or⠀forecloses⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀digression⠀returns⠀through⠀that⠀connection.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀threat⠀gentle;⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀threat⠀personal⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀lost⠀to⠀it.⠀A⠀debt⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀number⠀but⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀remembered⠀choices,⠀each⠀reasonable⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀now⠀accumulated⠀into⠀a⠀condition⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀leave.⠀Let⠀different⠀people⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀absurdity⠀and⠀the⠀loss:⠀one⠀jokes⠀about⠀the⠀broken⠀archive,⠀one⠀sits⠀quietly⠀with⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀photos⠀are⠀gone,⠀and⠀one⠀is⠀too⠀busy⠀keeping⠀their⠀housing⠀to⠀mourn.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀loss,⠀still⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀to⠀respond,⠀or⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀alongside⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀passed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀method.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener⠀or⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀matters:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀walls⠀listen,⠀a⠀market⠀where⠀certain⠀words⠀draw⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀space⠀that⠀is⠀only⠀temporarily⠀safe.⠀The⠀teller's⠀position⠀shapes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀implied,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀already⠀knows.⠀The⠀tale⠀itself⠀concerns⠀the⠀compromised⠀systems⠀of⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀program⠀that⠀misidentified⠀someone,⠀a⠀promised⠀upgrade⠀that⠀locked⠀people⠀out⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀homes.⠀The⠀teller⠀recounts⠀these⠀events⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀with⠀a⠀beginning,⠀a⠀turn,⠀and⠀a⠀consequence,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀report.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀names⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀take⠀the⠀frame's⠀conventions⠀from⠀that⠀tradition⠀rather⠀than⠀dressing⠀a⠀generic⠀bazaar⠀around⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀piety⠀that⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀carry.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀tale's⠀framing⠀and⠀its⠀content.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀introduce⠀the⠀story⠀with⠀a⠀grand⠀claim⠀about⠀progress⠀or⠀justice,⠀then⠀narrate⠀the⠀small⠀logistical⠀failures⠀that⠀undo⠀it:⠀the⠀official⠀who⠀cannot⠀open⠀the⠀file,⠀the⠀payment⠀that⠀processes⠀twice,⠀the⠀identity⠀verification⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀document⠀the⠀system⠀itself⠀destroyed.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀joke,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀answer⠀or⠀adjust.⠀Different⠀people⠀respond⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀absurdity;⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀only⠀comic⠀voice,⠀and⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀an⠀audience⠀for⠀wit.⠀A⠀side⠀story⠀about⠀a⠀neighbor⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀when⠀it⠀explains⠀why⠀a⠀door⠀was⠀left⠀open⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀debt⠀was⠀forgiven.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀frame⠀itself⠀can⠀carry⠀this⠀pressure:⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀because⠀the⠀system⠀may⠀be⠀recording,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀set⠀the⠀debt⠀in⠀motion.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀inside⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀permits;⠀the⠀frame⠀adds⠀a⠀voice,⠀not⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀or⠀records⠀the⠀narration⠀could⠀not⠀reach.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation.⠀It⠀may⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀stop,⠀where⠀the⠀listener⠀must⠀leave,⠀or⠀where⠀the⠀system⠀interrupts,⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀remains⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world⠀actually⠀supplied.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaear::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure.⠀A⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀charge⠀appear⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀before⠀the⠀transaction⠀completes.⠀A⠀door⠀stays⠀locked⠀because⠀the⠀subscription⠀lapsed⠀at⠀midnight.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀notice⠀lists⠀the⠀wrong⠀floor.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀keep⠀causality⠀legible:⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀late⠀because⠀the⠀fare⠀doubled,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀city⠀is⠀generally⠀hostile.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀the⠀reason⠀an⠀event⠀matters;⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀why⠀they⠀are⠀afraid,⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀made⠀them⠀afraid⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota,⠀so⠀let⠀a⠀thought⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀needs⠀and⠀cut⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀point⠀is⠀already⠀on⠀the⠀page.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀from⠀juxtaposition⠀rather⠀than⠀commentary.⠀Place⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀next⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀logistical⠀fact:⠀the⠀banner⠀says⠀seamless⠀access,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀code⠀that⠀never⠀arrives;⠀the⠀system⠀announces⠀a⠀future⠀of⠀choice,⠀and⠀the⠀menu⠀offers⠀one⠀option.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀absurd.⠀Let⠀the⠀two⠀facts⠀stand⠀together⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀response⠀be⠀particular:⠀one⠀laughs,⠀one⠀pays⠀the⠀fee⠀without⠀comment,⠀one⠀tries⠀the⠀door⠀again.⠀A⠀digression⠀stays⠀brief⠀and⠀returns⠀through⠀the⠀current⠀problem:⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀outage⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀error⠀appears⠀now.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀minimal⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀threat;⠀it⠀can⠀sharpen⠀it⠀by⠀refusing⠀to⠀decorate⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀owes⠀can⠀land⠀harder⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀atmosphere.⠀Keep⠀voices⠀individual:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀speaks⠀in⠀short⠀practical⠀sentences⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀one⠀who⠀says⠀little⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀afraid.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀fact⠀stated⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding,⠀a⠀door⠀still⠀locked,⠀or⠀a⠀charge⠀still⠀pending,⠀without⠀a⠀summarizing⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀walking⠀through⠀a⠀transit⠀hub,⠀arguing⠀with⠀a⠀service⠀agent,⠀noticing⠀a⠀surveillance⠀drone,⠀remembering⠀a⠀previous⠀fine,⠀and⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀pay⠀or⠀run,⠀all⠀within⠀one⠀continuous⠀scene.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery:⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀view⠀of⠀the⠀queue⠀to⠀their⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀they⠀stood⠀in⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀connection⠀should⠀be⠀evident⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀itself.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm⠀rather⠀than⠀imposing⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀logistics.⠀A⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀simple⠀task⠀and⠀encounters⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀small⠀obstacles:⠀the⠀form⠀requires⠀a⠀code⠀sent⠀to⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀is⠀out⠀of⠀battery,⠀the⠀help⠀desk⠀repeats⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀in⠀a⠀pleasant⠀voice,⠀the⠀refund⠀is⠀issued⠀in⠀credit⠀that⠀expires⠀before⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀used.⠀The⠀prose⠀observes⠀these⠀reversals⠀with⠀patience⠀and⠀lets⠀each⠀person⠀respond⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀way.⠀One⠀narrates⠀the⠀absurdity⠀to⠀a⠀friend,⠀another⠀silently⠀accepts⠀it,⠀a⠀third⠀becomes⠀angry;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀all⠀become⠀the⠀same⠀comic⠀narrator.⠀A⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀bureaucratic⠀failure⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀form⠀appears⠀again,⠀and⠀the⠀digression⠀returns⠀through⠀that⠀use.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀contemporary-novel⠀manner⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀understated⠀emotion⠀or⠀realism⠀as⠀world⠀physics;⠀the⠀world⠀remains⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀setting⠀where⠀systems⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude⠀people.⠀The⠀inner⠀experience⠀stays⠀authorized⠀and⠀particular:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀reach⠀into⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀incomplete,⠀a⠀conversation⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀still⠀deciding,⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀is⠀tested⠀or⠀fulfilled⠀by⠀the⠀world's⠀systems:⠀one⠀partner⠀waits⠀outside⠀a⠀restricted⠀zone⠀because⠀their⠀access⠀was⠀revoked,⠀the⠀other⠀shares⠀a⠀password⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀trust,⠀both⠀argue⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀pay⠀a⠀fine⠀that⠀only⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀incurred.⠀Use⠀the⠀couple's⠀private⠀language⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise:⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀reference⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀memory,⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀asking⠀for⠀help.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀specific⠀promise⠀this⠀relationship⠀already⠀carries,⠀and⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀earns⠀its⠀callback⠀by⠀meaning⠀something⠀now.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀couple's⠀shared⠀encounter⠀with⠀logistical⠀failure.⠀They⠀try⠀to⠀do⠀something⠀ordinary⠀together⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀complicates⠀it:⠀a⠀reservation⠀is⠀canceled⠀by⠀an⠀automated⠀audit,⠀a⠀gift⠀is⠀held⠀because⠀the⠀recipient's⠀identity⠀cannot⠀be⠀verified,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀late⠀because⠀the⠀network⠀deprioritized⠀their⠀district.⠀Let⠀each⠀partner⠀respond⠀differently.⠀One⠀finds⠀the⠀malfunction⠀funny⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀finds⠀it⠀threatening;⠀one⠀wants⠀to⠀fight⠀the⠀charge⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀wants⠀to⠀pay⠀it⠀and⠀move⠀on.⠀The⠀difference⠀in⠀response⠀is⠀relationship⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀competition⠀to⠀be⠀the⠀wittiest,⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀their⠀first⠀meeting⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀when⠀the⠀same⠀error⠀message⠀appears⠀again.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀enter⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀into⠀a⠀trap.⠀Affection,⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀rivalry,⠀and⠀discovery⠀should⠀have⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀they⠀belong.⠀A⠀partner's⠀help⠀may⠀be⠀genuine,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀real⠀comfort,⠀and⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀may⠀remain⠀quiet.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀still⠀incomplete,⠀or⠀one⠀partner⠀still⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀to⠀decide,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀are⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀act:⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀paid⠀the⠀debt⠀twice,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀talked⠀past⠀the⠀checkpoint,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀old⠀device⠀working.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀paid⠀the⠀debt⠀twice⠀may⠀later⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀refused⠀to⠀pay⠀a⠀third⠀time.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀profile's⠀absurdity⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀elevated⠀declarations⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀logistical⠀failures⠀that⠀actually⠀shaped⠀events.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀defied⠀the⠀system,⠀then⠀relate⠀that⠀the⠀defiance⠀consisted⠀of⠀waiting⠀through⠀three⠀help⠀queues,⠀finding⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀existed,⠀and⠀sending⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀an⠀address⠀that⠀bounced.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle:⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀worry⠀about⠀rent⠀or⠀battery⠀life.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀waiting⠀in⠀a⠀queue⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀login⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀Oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀and⠀public⠀deeds⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them:⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀pass⠀between⠀people⠀like⠀a⠀feud,⠀a⠀shared⠀device⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀gift⠀with⠀conditions,⠀a⠀journey⠀across⠀the⠀city⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀undertaking⠀with⠀remembered⠀consequences.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀beat⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀standing⠀there⠀was⠀easy.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀register⠀of⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀and⠀institutional⠀realism:⠀restrained,⠀concrete,⠀quiet⠀about⠀its⠀own⠀severity.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀arrive⠀as⠀ordinary⠀civic⠀conditions⠀—⠀application⠀forms,⠀case⠀numbers,⠀housing⠀rules,⠀workplace⠀procedures,⠀the⠀unhurried⠀authority⠀of⠀an⠀administrator⠀behind⠀a⠀counter.⠀Surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀are⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀themes;⠀they⠀appear⠀as⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀has⠀to⠀do⠀this⠀week.⠀Neon,⠀implants,⠀and⠀rain⠀belong⠀only⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀place⠀or⠀body⠀that⠀actually⠀has⠀them.\n\nInside⠀that⠀restraint,⠀run⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀by⠀following⠀every⠀large⠀claim⠀into⠀the⠀procedure⠀that⠀carries⠀it.⠀A⠀municipal⠀algorithm⠀praised⠀as⠀impartial⠀can⠀require⠀the⠀same⠀biometric⠀entry⠀at⠀three⠀offices;⠀a⠀debt⠀policy⠀described⠀as⠀humane⠀can⠀post⠀a⠀deadline⠀shorter⠀than⠀the⠀postal⠀delay.⠀Give⠀the⠀official⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀the⠀same⠀level⠀tone⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀surface⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀order⠀rather⠀than⠀commentary.⠀No⠀voice⠀steps⠀outside⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀appreciate⠀the⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀digressions⠀brief⠀and⠀civic.⠀A⠀character⠀recalls⠀a⠀previous⠀housing⠀case,⠀a⠀clause⠀from⠀a⠀training⠀manual,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀experience⠀because⠀the⠀memory⠀supplies⠀a⠀usable⠀comparison⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀procedural⠀step⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀difficulty,⠀then⠀the⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀counter.⠀Around⠀the⠀focal⠀figure,⠀people⠀absorb⠀the⠀same⠀absurdity⠀differently:⠀one⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀weather,⠀one⠀disputes⠀the⠀wording,⠀one⠀has⠀found⠀a⠀quiet⠀workaround,⠀one⠀has⠀never⠀noticed⠀anything⠀wrong.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀socially⠀situated⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀form⠀will⠀cost,⠀how⠀to⠀explain⠀this⠀to⠀a⠀partner,⠀why⠀the⠀question⠀is⠀being⠀asked⠀again⠀—⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀and⠀private⠀unless⠀spoken.⠀Fatigue,⠀fear,⠀and⠀careful⠀compliance⠀are⠀as⠀in⠀character⠀as⠀wit.\n\nUse⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies,⠀keeping⠀a⠀given⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀folding⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀North;⠀restraint⠀here⠀is⠀method,⠀not⠀mandatory⠀snow⠀or⠀bleakness.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀after⠀one⠀small⠀completed⠀action⠀—⠀a⠀form⠀accepted,⠀a⠀payment⠀failed,⠀a⠀queue⠀advancing⠀—⠀or⠀while⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀still⠀pending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nHead⠀a⠀scene⠀only⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀then⠀carry⠀it⠀in⠀readable⠀action⠀blocks⠀and⠀clearly⠀cued⠀dialogue.⠀Keep⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal⠀rebooting,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀unlocks⠀only⠀after⠀someone⠀elsewhere⠀approves⠀it,⠀a⠀notice⠀cycling⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀screen,⠀an⠀announcement⠀from⠀another⠀room.⠀Reserve⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀for⠀compressing⠀a⠀real⠀interval⠀or⠀moving⠀to⠀a⠀connected⠀place;⠀keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀off⠀the⠀page.\n\nStage⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀as⠀screen⠀business.⠀When⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀displayed,⠀stay⠀on⠀the⠀procedure⠀that⠀must⠀carry⠀it:⠀a⠀user⠀holding⠀a⠀damaged⠀ID⠀at⠀three⠀angles⠀while⠀a⠀scanner⠀repeats⠀one⠀error⠀tone;⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀immediate⠀assistance⠀delivered⠀over⠀a⠀waiting⠀room⠀whose⠀only⠀working⠀screen⠀shows⠀an⠀outdated⠀menu.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀record⠀attempt,⠀failure,⠀and⠀next⠀practical⠀step⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀flat⠀register,⠀and⠀let⠀official⠀language⠀arrive⠀verbatim⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀announcement,⠀so⠀no⠀dialogue⠀has⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀gap.⠀A⠀spoken⠀digression⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀the⠀same⠀way:⠀a⠀character⠀talks⠀past⠀the⠀point,⠀then⠀lands⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀step⠀that⠀unblocks⠀the⠀task.\n\nCast⠀the⠀speakers⠀against⠀each⠀other.⠀One⠀explains⠀the⠀procedure⠀with⠀patience,⠀one⠀argues⠀with⠀the⠀wording,⠀one⠀repeats⠀the⠀required⠀phrase⠀until⠀something⠀works;⠀a⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀flat,⠀technical,⠀frightened,⠀or⠀purely⠀practical.⠀The⠀comedy⠀is⠀claim⠀against⠀visible⠀difficulty,⠀not⠀a⠀punchline⠀quota.⠀Keep⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀delay⠀will⠀cost,⠀why⠀the⠀scanner⠀keeps⠀failing⠀—⠀heard⠀by⠀no⠀one⠀on⠀screen;⠀use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀this⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀a⠀heard⠀layer.\n\nCut⠀on⠀an⠀observable⠀result:⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀payment⠀clears,⠀a⠀call⠀drops,⠀a⠀guard⠀waves⠀someone⠀through⠀—⠀or⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀waiting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀named⠀speakers,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions⠀an⠀ensemble⠀can⠀execute.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀exist⠀as⠀objects⠀and⠀actions⠀on⠀the⠀boards⠀—⠀a⠀terminal⠀on⠀a⠀desk,⠀a⠀door⠀only⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀open,⠀a⠀badge⠀held⠀to⠀a⠀reader,⠀a⠀queue⠀built⠀from⠀where⠀the⠀actors⠀stand.⠀Blocking⠀is⠀purposeful:⠀a⠀character⠀crosses⠀to⠀check⠀a⠀screen,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀marked⠀spot,⠀passes⠀a⠀physical⠀form⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.⠀No⠀film⠀directions.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀a⠀fact⠀of⠀staging.⠀A⠀large⠀claim⠀in⠀dialogue⠀is⠀immediately⠀tested⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀actors⠀must⠀physically⠀do:⠀one⠀announces⠀the⠀system⠀is⠀fully⠀automated⠀while⠀another⠀kneels⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀cable⠀in⠀place;⠀an⠀official⠀calls⠀verification⠀simple⠀as⠀the⠀same⠀form⠀travels⠀between⠀three⠀desks.⠀The⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀business⠀sitting⠀under⠀it⠀does⠀the⠀comic⠀work,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀comments⠀on⠀it.⠀Give⠀a⠀pause⠀real⠀content⠀—⠀fatigue,⠀uncertainty,⠀the⠀plain⠀duration⠀of⠀waiting⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀obligatory⠀irony.\n\nDifferentiate⠀the⠀cast⠀through⠀line⠀and⠀movement.⠀One⠀recites⠀procedure⠀with⠀total⠀confidence,⠀one⠀asks⠀what⠀the⠀notice⠀actually⠀means,⠀one⠀silently⠀performs⠀the⠀required⠀action⠀and⠀exits.⠀A⠀digression⠀spoken⠀aloud⠀should⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀physical⠀task,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀retraces⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀offices⠀and⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀desk⠀that⠀was⠀missing.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀delay⠀will⠀cost,⠀why⠀the⠀question⠀is⠀being⠀asked⠀again⠀—⠀heard⠀by⠀no⠀other⠀character.⠀Give⠀it⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀grants⠀that⠀speech⠀a⠀real⠀audience⠀and⠀dramatic⠀purpose.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀staged⠀result:⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀stamped,⠀the⠀queue⠀advances,⠀someone⠀exits.⠀The⠀curtain⠀can⠀also⠀fall⠀on⠀unresolved⠀waiting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀and⠀let⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀chronology⠀order⠀the⠀telling:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀the⠀concern⠀that⠀keeps⠀coming⠀back.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀stays⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy⠀—⠀the⠀terminal⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀the⠀character⠀never⠀blurs⠀into⠀the⠀one⠀remembered⠀from⠀last⠀winter.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀happen⠀inside⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀narration.⠀When⠀a⠀large⠀claim⠀enters⠀—⠀the⠀recorded⠀voice⠀promising⠀immediate⠀service,⠀the⠀notice⠀congratulating⠀a⠀resident⠀on⠀automatic⠀relief⠀—⠀the⠀mind⠀slides⠀toward⠀its⠀small⠀logistical⠀shadow:⠀the⠀previous⠀queue,⠀the⠀error⠀tone⠀now⠀recognized⠀by⠀pitch,⠀a⠀bag⠀strap⠀cutting⠀into⠀a⠀shoulder⠀held⠀too⠀long.⠀The⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀formulate⠀the⠀contradiction⠀aloud⠀or⠀even⠀neatly;⠀the⠀association⠀carries⠀it.⠀Digressions⠀return⠀the⠀same⠀way:⠀a⠀clause⠀from⠀a⠀training⠀manual,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀phrase⠀from⠀last⠀spring⠀surfaces⠀because⠀it⠀supplies⠀the⠀comparison⠀or⠀missing⠀fact⠀the⠀current⠀difficulty⠀needs,⠀and⠀its⠀relevance⠀becomes⠀legible⠀within⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀two.\n\nLet⠀a⠀few⠀concerns⠀recur⠀and⠀develop⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀deadline,⠀a⠀child⠀waiting,⠀an⠀implant⠀that⠀aches⠀in⠀the⠀cold,⠀one⠀sentence⠀from⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀—⠀each⠀return⠀carrying⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀since⠀the⠀last.⠀Render⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀sensorily⠀and⠀personally:⠀a⠀camera's⠀slow⠀pivot,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀logs⠀an⠀arrival⠀time,⠀a⠀number⠀known⠀by⠀heart,⠀the⠀small⠀bodily⠀reluctance⠀to⠀check⠀a⠀balance.⠀What⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to⠀can⠀be⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say⠀aloud.\n\nAbsurdity⠀and⠀genuine⠀worry⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀thoughts;⠀not⠀every⠀beat⠀is⠀comic.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀mid-thought,⠀mid-wait,⠀or⠀mid-listen,⠀with⠀events⠀taking⠀their⠀real⠀duration⠀regardless⠀of⠀how⠀much⠀prose⠀they⠀occupy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀using⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀hour⠀spent⠀in⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀delay⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀an⠀edit,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀an⠀attachment,⠀a⠀jump⠀to⠀another⠀channel.⠀Let⠀each⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀texts⠀—⠀one⠀writes⠀complete⠀official⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀short⠀practical⠀updates,⠀one⠀corrects⠀a⠀single⠀word⠀after⠀sending.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀from⠀quoted⠀system⠀language⠀set⠀against⠀ground-level⠀report.⠀One⠀sender⠀forwards⠀the⠀notice⠀announcing⠀the⠀payment⠀portal⠀is⠀available⠀at⠀all⠀hours;⠀another⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀photograph⠀of⠀the⠀closed⠀office⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀queue.⠀Someone⠀pastes⠀the⠀policy⠀promising⠀automatic⠀verification⠀while⠀someone⠀else⠀reports⠀the⠀scanner⠀rejecting⠀the⠀same⠀ID⠀twice.⠀Timing⠀does⠀half⠀the⠀work⠀—⠀the⠀instant⠀reply⠀that⠀takes⠀six⠀hours,⠀the⠀confirmation⠀arriving⠀after⠀the⠀deadline⠀it⠀confirms.⠀Let⠀what⠀was⠀sent,⠀and⠀when,⠀make⠀the⠀gap⠀visible;⠀nobody⠀needs⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nDifferentiate⠀the⠀responses.⠀One⠀sender⠀treats⠀the⠀delay⠀as⠀weather,⠀one⠀asks⠀a⠀precise⠀question⠀and⠀quotes⠀the⠀offending⠀clause,⠀one⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀punctuation⠀mark,⠀one⠀goes⠀quiet.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀be⠀flat,⠀technical,⠀frightened,⠀or⠀practical.⠀Keep⠀three⠀layers⠀distinct:⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀complaint⠀composed⠀and⠀deleted⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀wrote,⠀not⠀a⠀window⠀onto⠀everything⠀in⠀their⠀head;⠀the⠀thought⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀receipt⠀will⠀mean⠀stays⠀with⠀its⠀owner,⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀sender.⠀Where⠀something⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀set⠀it⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀clearly.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀transmitted⠀result⠀—⠀a⠀receipt⠀arrives,⠀a⠀transfer⠀fails,⠀the⠀channel⠀changes,⠀a⠀sender⠀stops⠀answering⠀—⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀message⠀still⠀being⠀composed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaeba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀illustrated⠀scenes:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀rhythm⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀could⠀hold.⠀Use⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀on⠀purpose⠀—⠀a⠀terminal⠀glowing⠀in⠀a⠀dark⠀office,⠀a⠀queue⠀visible⠀through⠀glass,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀unchanging⠀calm⠀—⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀never⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀readout⠀of⠀anyone's⠀truth.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible;⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀engine⠀commands.\n\nOpen⠀the⠀Adams⠀contrast⠀across⠀the⠀three⠀layers⠀of⠀a⠀beat.⠀The⠀background⠀cue⠀shows⠀a⠀pristine⠀service⠀desk;⠀the⠀dialogue⠀announces⠀instant⠀assistance;⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀notices⠀the⠀only⠀working⠀terminal⠀is⠀behind⠀a⠀locked⠀door.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀expression⠀cue⠀stays⠀confident⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀watches⠀the⠀same⠀form⠀rejected⠀twice.⠀Lay⠀claim,⠀visible⠀condition,⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀without⠀an⠀announcing⠀sentence,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀do⠀the⠀work.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀room⠀to⠀interpret.⠀A⠀short⠀narrative⠀passage⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀working⠀explanation⠀—⠀who⠀benefits,⠀what⠀this⠀delay⠀is⠀priced⠀at⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀support⠀it,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀worried⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.⠀Another⠀character's⠀expression⠀attracts⠀suspicion;⠀it⠀certifies⠀nothing.⠀Around⠀the⠀focal⠀figure⠀the⠀cast⠀responds⠀differently⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀system:⠀one⠀speaks⠀fluent⠀corporate,⠀one⠀asks⠀the⠀practical⠀question,⠀one⠀says⠀nothing⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀registers⠀the⠀tiredness.⠀Not⠀every⠀speaker⠀is⠀witty;⠀the⠀humor⠀is⠀the⠀large⠀claim⠀against⠀the⠀small⠀consequence.\n\nAdvance⠀on⠀actual⠀results⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀payment⠀clears,⠀the⠀queue⠀moves,⠀someone⠀leaves⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀scene⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀waiting⠀or⠀still⠀working⠀out⠀what⠀was⠀just⠀seen.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaebb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Douglas⠀Adams⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀reply,⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀an⠀earlier⠀particular⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀step⠀depends⠀on⠀it⠀—⠀restate⠀the⠀specific⠀notice,⠀deadline,⠀or⠀system⠀name⠀instead⠀of⠀retelling⠀the⠀scene⠀that⠀established⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀serial⠀interval⠀as⠀the⠀Adams⠀engine.⠀A⠀large⠀claim⠀can⠀land⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀and⠀acquire⠀its⠀small⠀logistical⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one:⠀the⠀housing⠀algorithm⠀declared⠀fair⠀in⠀one⠀reply,⠀and⠀the⠀notice⠀requiring⠀the⠀same⠀proof⠀of⠀address⠀to⠀be⠀resubmitted⠀arriving⠀two⠀installments⠀on;⠀the⠀debt-relief⠀program⠀announced⠀as⠀automatic,⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀manual⠀application⠀form⠀nobody⠀mentioned.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀surface⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀reaches⠀it⠀—⠀an⠀installment⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀system⠀simply⠀behaves⠀as⠀promised⠀is⠀also⠀valid.⠀Earlier⠀notices,⠀quoted⠀policies,⠀and⠀established⠀procedures⠀are⠀continuity⠀assets:⠀a⠀character's⠀digression⠀into⠀a⠀training⠀manual⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀previous⠀case⠀should⠀hand⠀the⠀present⠀difficulty⠀a⠀usable⠀comparison⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀step,⠀then⠀return.\n\nLet⠀progress⠀be⠀real⠀without⠀being⠀mechanical:⠀a⠀character⠀learns⠀why⠀the⠀payment⠀failed,⠀repairs⠀a⠀working⠀relationship,⠀finishes⠀a⠀task,⠀loses⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀service.⠀Close⠀an⠀installment⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known;⠀earn⠀an⠀occasional⠀hook⠀rather⠀than⠀scheduling⠀one.⠀Keep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀whenever⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀delay⠀will⠀cost,⠀why⠀the⠀official⠀asked⠀again⠀—⠀private⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀speak⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀pressure⠀produce⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀or⠀careful⠀compliance⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀wit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀inside⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀price⠀them.⠀A⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀blocked⠀badge,⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel,⠀a⠀quoted⠀price⠀for⠀something⠀needed:⠀these⠀are⠀the⠀media⠀through⠀which⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀withholding,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀returning⠀actually⠀happens.⠀Let⠀the⠀concrete⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀—⠀a⠀hand⠀left⠀near⠀a⠀console,⠀a⠀name⠀typed⠀and⠀deleted,⠀a⠀transfer⠀authorized⠀after⠀a⠀pause⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀notice.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀direct⠀and⠀practical,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀cost⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀One⠀character⠀can⠀say⠀\"I⠀stayed\"⠀and⠀then⠀pay⠀for⠀the⠀room.⠀Another⠀can⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀contract⠀when⠀the⠀real⠀question⠀is⠀whether⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀will⠀still⠀be⠀there.⠀The⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀named⠀to⠀be⠀present,⠀and⠀brevity⠀is⠀not⠀emptiness:⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out⠀should⠀ache.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀phrase,⠀the⠀same⠀small⠀task,⠀the⠀same⠀remembered⠀moment⠀because⠀the⠀hurt⠀has⠀not⠀resolved,⠀and⠀let⠀context⠀shift⠀the⠀emphasis⠀—⠀practical⠀the⠀first⠀time,⠀defensive⠀the⠀second,⠀an⠀admission⠀the⠀third.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀into⠀a⠀coded⠀confession.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀alter⠀behavior⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀hurt⠀character⠀may⠀complete⠀a⠀transaction⠀too⠀fast,⠀delay⠀a⠀reply,⠀ask⠀for⠀something⠀unnecessary,⠀or⠀refuse⠀help⠀that⠀would⠀be⠀easy⠀to⠀accept.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward⠀—⠀a⠀blanket,⠀a⠀charge⠀cable,⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀sleep⠀—⠀and⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀share⠀a⠀scene⠀without⠀canceling⠀each⠀other.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀include⠀what⠀they⠀wanted⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀did⠀not;⠀other⠀characters⠀get⠀only⠀the⠀pause,⠀the⠀action,⠀the⠀changed⠀tone.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀needs⠀no⠀task⠀to⠀justify⠀it.⠀The⠀hurt⠀can⠀stay⠀unresolved⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀stops,⠀even⠀mid-exchange,⠀and⠀nothing⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs,⠀each⠀built⠀around⠀one⠀clear⠀action,⠀one⠀clear⠀speaker,⠀or⠀one⠀practical⠀exchange.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably:⠀keep⠀the⠀name⠀or⠀pronoun⠀close⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀rereads⠀to⠀find⠀who⠀spoke.⠀When⠀someone⠀acts,⠀show⠀the⠀concrete⠀object⠀and⠀movement⠀—⠀a⠀card⠀tapped,⠀a⠀screen⠀turned,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀—⠀in⠀the⠀plainest⠀clauses⠀that⠀will⠀carry⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀playing⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀lecture.⠀A⠀character⠀needs⠀access⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀have,⠀owes⠀money⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀waiting,⠀knows⠀the⠀channel⠀is⠀monitored.⠀Shape⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀around⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀keep⠀those⠀conditions⠀live⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀instead⠀of⠀resolving⠀them⠀early.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀economical.⠀Characters⠀ask⠀for⠀what⠀they⠀need⠀or⠀avoid⠀asking;⠀they⠀make⠀deals⠀and⠀refuse⠀them;⠀silence⠀can⠀carry⠀what⠀a⠀longer⠀speech⠀would⠀waste.⠀A⠀simple⠀exchange⠀about⠀a⠀door⠀or⠀a⠀payment⠀can⠀move⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀a⠀confession.⠀Repetition⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀stuck⠀on⠀something,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀witty⠀on⠀cue.\n\nKeep⠀NPCs⠀and⠀world⠀behavior⠀active:⠀people⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives,⠀answer⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀answer,⠀and⠀their⠀choices⠀may⠀cooperate⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀resist.⠀End⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀No⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings.⠀If⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀is⠀limited,⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀stay⠀outside⠀the⠀visible⠀scene;⠀if⠀a⠀player⠀owns⠀a⠀character,⠀leave⠀that⠀character's⠀next⠀major⠀choice⠀to⠀the⠀player.⠀These⠀instructions⠀govern⠀how⠀the⠀interval⠀is⠀written,⠀not⠀who⠀acts⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀mode,⠀with⠀a⠀social-realist⠀eye:⠀short,⠀self-contained⠀episodes,⠀each⠀turning⠀on⠀one⠀practical⠀encounter⠀—⠀a⠀landlord's⠀demand,⠀a⠀fixer's⠀price,⠀a⠀clinic's⠀intake⠀form,⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀scan,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning.⠀Open⠀each⠀episode⠀with⠀its⠀situation⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀two,⠀play⠀the⠀exchange⠀out⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀and⠀close⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀transaction⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next.⠀No⠀omniscient⠀moral⠀follows⠀an⠀episode;⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀carries⠀the⠀consequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀order⠀arrive⠀through⠀transactions.⠀Who⠀must⠀pay,⠀who⠀can⠀delay,⠀who⠀is⠀recorded,⠀who⠀is⠀waved⠀through⠀—⠀a⠀character's⠀standing⠀shows⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀clerk⠀addresses⠀them,⠀the⠀fee⠀they⠀are⠀charged,⠀the⠀door⠀they⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀use.⠀Satire⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀actual⠀treatment:⠀a⠀form⠀can⠀promise⠀an⠀appeal⠀while⠀the⠀appeals⠀line⠀is⠀closed.⠀Keep⠀clerks⠀and⠀officials⠀human⠀rather⠀than⠀caricature.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀episodes⠀in⠀Hemingway's⠀economy.⠀Precise⠀objects⠀and⠀activities⠀—⠀a⠀bowl⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀receipt⠀folded,⠀a⠀name⠀misspelled⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀shoe⠀repaired⠀instead⠀of⠀replaced⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀unsaid⠀doing⠀the⠀social⠀work.⠀A⠀character⠀accepts⠀a⠀bad⠀price⠀without⠀complaint⠀because⠀complaint⠀would⠀cost⠀more,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀arithmetic.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀as⠀structure.⠀The⠀same⠀stall,⠀the⠀same⠀guard,⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀asked⠀again⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀nothing⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀that⠀something⠀small⠀has:⠀a⠀shorter⠀wait,⠀a⠀different⠀spelling,⠀a⠀fee⠀quietly⠀waived.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀measures⠀the⠀character's⠀condition⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀The⠀imported⠀craft⠀is⠀the⠀episodic⠀shape⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀historical⠀city,⠀a⠀dialect,⠀or⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀customs;⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀to⠀claim⠀the⠀tradition.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀thought,⠀give⠀it⠀the⠀same⠀economy⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀swallows⠀at⠀the⠀window⠀is⠀one⠀clause,⠀not⠀a⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Cut⠀movement⠀to⠀its⠀necessary⠀parts⠀—⠀the⠀character⠀crosses⠀the⠀street,⠀pays⠀the⠀scanner,⠀takes⠀the⠀stairs⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀hard⠀contrast⠀do⠀the⠀lighting:⠀the⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀the⠀wet⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀sticks,⠀the⠀charge⠀running⠀low.⠀No⠀atmospheric⠀padding⠀between⠀beats;⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀the⠀atmosphere.\n\nGround⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀in⠀material⠀condition.⠀Debt⠀is⠀a⠀number⠀on⠀a⠀terminal;⠀access⠀is⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open;⠀surveillance⠀is⠀a⠀camera⠀that⠀tracks;⠀bodily⠀compromise⠀is⠀a⠀port⠀that⠀aches⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀shakes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀pressure⠀ordinary⠀and⠀persistent⠀—⠀a⠀fare⠀that⠀costs⠀too⠀much,⠀a⠀repair⠀that⠀cannot⠀wait,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀answered⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀escalating⠀every⠀difficulty⠀into⠀a⠀survival⠀set⠀piece.\n\nKeep⠀exchange⠀practical.⠀Characters⠀ask,⠀refuse,⠀and⠀deal⠀in⠀short⠀direct⠀sentences,⠀and⠀the⠀unsaid⠀keeps⠀its⠀weight:⠀a⠀character⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀price,⠀says⠀nothing,⠀pays;⠀a⠀character⠀hands⠀over⠀the⠀tool⠀instead⠀of⠀explaining⠀why⠀they⠀kept⠀it.⠀Rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀speaker⠀who⠀talks⠀that⠀way,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀by⠀default.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short⠀clauses⠀build⠀pressure;⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀holds⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀reasoning,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀one⠀movement⠀—⠀carrying⠀the⠀crate⠀up,⠀cutting⠀the⠀line⠀at⠀the⠀joint.⠀Compression⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀omitted,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀explain⠀when⠀explanation⠀is⠀the⠀point.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surface⠀concrete⠀and⠀the⠀interiority⠀honest.⠀Report⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀sees,⠀touches,⠀hears,⠀and⠀does,⠀together⠀with⠀whatever⠀private⠀thought⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits:⠀thinking⠀about⠀the⠀cost⠀while⠀paying⠀it,⠀feeling⠀the⠀tool's⠀weight⠀while⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀use⠀it.⠀The⠀hard⠀finish⠀does⠀not⠀sand⠀the⠀thinking⠀away.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀on⠀documents⠀native⠀to⠀this⠀world,⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀each⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀payment⠀record,⠀a⠀repair⠀log,⠀an⠀intake⠀form,⠀a⠀message⠀thread,⠀a⠀notice⠀of⠀default,⠀a⠀fixer's⠀instructions,⠀a⠀clinic's⠀discharge⠀note.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically;⠀each⠀entry⠀exists⠀because⠀someone⠀needed⠀to⠀record,⠀request,⠀warn,⠀or⠀account⠀for⠀something.\n\nGive⠀every⠀document⠀an⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀decide⠀what⠀it⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀hides.⠀A⠀message⠀from⠀a⠀debtor⠀to⠀a⠀landlord⠀knows⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀landlord's⠀ledger;⠀a⠀repair⠀log⠀written⠀for⠀a⠀supervisor⠀omits⠀what⠀the⠀worker⠀did⠀not⠀want⠀recorded;⠀a⠀personal⠀note⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀official⠀form⠀cannot.⠀Time⠀matters:⠀a⠀line⠀written⠀before⠀the⠀payment⠀clears⠀reads⠀differently⠀after.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀entries⠀in⠀direct,⠀economical⠀language⠀—⠀a⠀part⠀replaced,⠀a⠀fee⠀waived,⠀a⠀door⠀sealed,⠀a⠀name⠀entered⠀wrong⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀unsaid⠀work⠀inside⠀each⠀record.⠀A⠀report⠀can⠀leave⠀out⠀why⠀a⠀worker⠀stayed⠀late.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀payment⠀when⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀wants⠀to⠀know⠀is⠀whether⠀the⠀recipient⠀is⠀still⠀alive.⠀Even⠀a⠀private⠀entry⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀mind:⠀the⠀hesitation⠀shows⠀in⠀a⠀struck-out⠀line,⠀a⠀changed⠀word,⠀a⠀page⠀abandoned⠀mid-sentence,⠀never⠀in⠀a⠀claimed⠀transcript⠀of⠀feeling.\n\nLet⠀discrepancies⠀reveal⠀events:⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀correcting⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀two⠀documents⠀disagreeing⠀about⠀one⠀transaction,⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match,⠀a⠀form⠀missing⠀its⠀signature,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀read⠀and⠀never⠀answered.⠀The⠀reader⠀notices⠀the⠀gap;⠀no⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀steps⠀in⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀continuity⠀readable.⠀Each⠀entry⠀gives⠀just⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀follow,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀entry⠀answers⠀the⠀last⠀through⠀its⠀own⠀purpose⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀accumulates⠀in⠀the⠀paper⠀itself⠀—⠀the⠀rising⠀balance,⠀the⠀shortening⠀deadline,⠀the⠀name⠀that⠀keeps⠀appearing⠀in⠀files⠀where⠀it⠀should⠀not.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀comfort⠀as⠀concrete⠀acts⠀of⠀care⠀inside⠀this⠀world.⠀Someone⠀shares⠀food,⠀charges⠀a⠀device,⠀repairs⠀a⠀strap,⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀leaves⠀a⠀light⠀on.⠀Keep⠀each⠀small⠀pleasure⠀specific⠀and⠀practical:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀cup,⠀the⠀quiet⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀the⠀street⠀noise⠀stops,⠀the⠀familiar⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀handed⠀back.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world⠀stay⠀true⠀without⠀canceling⠀the⠀warmth.⠀Debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀remain⠀real;⠀a⠀safe⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀temporary,⠀a⠀kindness⠀small,⠀a⠀character⠀still⠀due⠀back⠀outside⠀before⠀morning.⠀The⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀solve⠀the⠀city⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀asked⠀to.⠀It⠀sits⠀beside⠀the⠀pressure:⠀a⠀good⠀meal⠀before⠀a⠀hard⠀shift,⠀a⠀clean⠀bandage⠀before⠀a⠀difficult⠀conversation,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀before⠀a⠀payment⠀comes⠀due.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair.⠀Care⠀moves⠀through⠀action⠀—⠀one⠀sets⠀a⠀plate⠀down⠀and⠀says⠀nothing;⠀another⠀says⠀\"You⠀look⠀tired\"⠀and⠀means⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀received⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀relationship⠀talk⠀or⠀a⠀promise.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀thought,⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀quietly⠀enjoy⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀push⠀every⠀warm⠀beat⠀toward⠀a⠀declaration.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀comforted⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀refuse⠀help;⠀a⠀caring⠀one⠀can⠀still⠀keep⠀a⠀secret;⠀an⠀argument⠀and⠀a⠀shared⠀blanket⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀without⠀either⠀undoing⠀the⠀other.⠀Established⠀problems⠀do⠀not⠀vanish⠀for⠀the⠀interval.\n\nHold⠀the⠀sentiment⠀with⠀Hemingway's⠀directness.⠀Short⠀sentences⠀and⠀precise⠀objects⠀—⠀a⠀blanket⠀folded,⠀a⠀bowl⠀washed,⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀a⠀moment⠀on⠀a⠀shoulder⠀—⠀carry⠀the⠀affection⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀done⠀rather⠀than⠀what⠀is⠀described.⠀End⠀inside⠀the⠀comfortable⠀interval⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀is;⠀nothing⠀bad⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close,⠀and⠀nothing⠀good⠀must⠀be⠀undercut.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose:⠀deliberate⠀transitions,⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀and⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀a⠀scene⠀inside⠀the⠀city's⠀social⠀order.⠀Open⠀with⠀framing⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀action⠀—⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀building,⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀past⠀the⠀lobby,⠀what⠀the⠀street⠀was⠀before⠀the⠀current⠀owners⠀came⠀—⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀move⠀into⠀concrete⠀act.⠀A⠀single⠀paragraph⠀can⠀carry⠀one⠀full⠀movement,⠀from⠀public⠀frame⠀to⠀private⠀gesture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀base⠀diction⠀Hemingway's.⠀Precise⠀objects,⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀practical⠀exchanges:⠀the⠀formality⠀is⠀architecture,⠀not⠀vocabulary.⠀A⠀simple⠀sentence⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀social⠀judgment⠀—⠀\"The⠀clinic⠀kept⠀the⠀good⠀chairs⠀on⠀the⠀upper⠀floor.\"⠀Let⠀judgment⠀arrive⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀arrangement,⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀paragraph⠀notices⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀order,⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀ornament.\n\nUse⠀the⠀distance⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀actually⠀has.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀register⠀history⠀and⠀standing⠀—⠀a⠀street⠀that⠀was⠀a⠀market⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀was⠀expensive⠀when⠀new⠀and⠀mended⠀twice⠀since⠀—⠀without⠀entering⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀excludes.⠀Where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀plain:⠀a⠀short⠀clause⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀or⠀wants,⠀set⠀inside⠀the⠀composed⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀distance⠀lives⠀in⠀framing,⠀not⠀omniscience.\n\nSeparate⠀the⠀registers.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀direct⠀and⠀practical⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀the⠀composed⠀observation⠀around⠀it:⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀\"I'll⠀pay⠀Friday,\"⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀notes⠀that⠀Friday⠀was⠀the⠀day⠀the⠀collectors⠀changed⠀their⠀route.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀prose's⠀register.\n\nLet⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀it⠀applies:⠀a⠀corridor⠀where⠀behavior⠀is⠀observed,⠀then⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀character's⠀posture⠀changes,⠀the⠀shift⠀marked⠀by⠀sentence⠀length⠀or⠀a⠀paragraph⠀break⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀record-keeping⠀can⠀structure⠀scenes⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them;⠀no⠀aristocracy,⠀archaism,⠀or⠀uniform⠀eloquence⠀comes⠀with⠀the⠀method.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀act⠀of⠀telling.⠀Put⠀the⠀teller⠀somewhere⠀concrete⠀with⠀someone⠀listening⠀for⠀a⠀reason:⠀a⠀fixer⠀weighing⠀a⠀claim⠀to⠀credit,⠀a⠀guard⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀contact⠀deciding⠀whether⠀the⠀price⠀drops.⠀The⠀telling⠀wants⠀something⠀—⠀entry,⠀time,⠀belief,⠀protection,⠀a⠀lower⠀fee⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀pressure⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀runs:⠀the⠀person⠀watching⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀device⠀counting⠀minutes,⠀the⠀payment⠀already⠀spent.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀is⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀that⠀transaction,⠀not⠀an⠀interlude;⠀it⠀can⠀persuade,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀or⠀fail.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀tale⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀actually⠀saw,⠀in⠀short⠀clauses⠀and⠀particular⠀objects:⠀the⠀card⠀that⠀failed,⠀the⠀courier's⠀wet⠀coat,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀opened⠀without⠀a⠀badge.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀omits,⠀and⠀the⠀omissions⠀are⠀live⠀facts⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀not⠀mentioned,⠀a⠀name⠀held⠀back,⠀something⠀this⠀room⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀hear.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀reaches⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀experience,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀spare⠀as⠀the⠀speech:⠀one⠀plain⠀line⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀saying⠀carries⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀explained⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀questions⠀come⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀gaps.\n\nMake⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀name⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀track⠀access⠀and⠀cost:⠀the⠀same⠀door⠀is⠀watched⠀now,⠀the⠀same⠀name⠀is⠀flagged⠀now,⠀the⠀same⠀favor⠀costs⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀did⠀inside⠀the⠀tale.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀physical⠀present⠀so⠀the⠀two⠀levels⠀stay⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀tale's⠀effect⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀does⠀next⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀narration⠀certifying⠀it⠀true.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀system's⠀shape⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀telling⠀itself.⠀The⠀teller⠀knows⠀part⠀of⠀it;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀know⠀another⠀part;⠀a⠀story⠀can⠀secure⠀cooperation⠀without⠀being⠀fully⠀true,⠀and⠀a⠀true⠀story⠀can⠀fail⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀No⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed⠀between⠀nested⠀accounts,⠀and⠀no⠀pause⠀or⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀stops⠀—⠀it⠀may⠀end⠀mid-tale⠀or⠀mid-exchange,⠀with⠀the⠀outer⠀stakes⠀still⠀concrete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀lived.⠀Treat⠀the⠀world⠀as⠀a⠀partial,⠀owned⠀archive:⠀a⠀personnel⠀file,⠀a⠀sensor⠀log,⠀a⠀debt⠀registry,⠀a⠀demolished⠀block,⠀a⠀service⠀record⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀person⠀standing⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀it.⠀Move⠀deliberately⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀experience⠀—⠀state⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀says⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀flat⠀terms,⠀then⠀give⠀the⠀lived⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀it:⠀the⠀timestamp⠀that⠀skips⠀the⠀eleven⠀minutes⠀that⠀mattered,⠀the⠀name⠀spelled⠀wrong⠀on⠀the⠀payout,⠀the⠀scar⠀the⠀scan⠀never⠀registered.⠀Hold⠀both⠀claims⠀open:⠀a⠀record⠀can⠀be⠀accurate⠀and⠀still⠀omit⠀the⠀cost;⠀a⠀memory⠀can⠀be⠀vivid⠀and⠀still⠀fail⠀as⠀proof.\n\nLet⠀plain,⠀direct⠀clauses⠀carry⠀the⠀comparison.⠀Do⠀not⠀editorialize⠀about⠀the⠀system;⠀show⠀who⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀entry,⠀who⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀each⠀of⠀them⠀when⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀surfaces.⠀Where⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀concrete⠀recollection⠀or⠀decision⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀saw,⠀signed,⠀owed,⠀chose⠀—⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀economical⠀sentences,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀lyrical⠀register.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀the⠀way⠀an⠀archive⠀does.⠀The⠀same⠀address⠀surfaces⠀in⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀warrant,⠀and⠀a⠀memorial⠀list;⠀the⠀same⠀employee⠀number⠀sits⠀on⠀a⠀bonus⠀line⠀and⠀a⠀disciplinary⠀notice.⠀Each⠀return⠀adds⠀a⠀fact⠀or⠀shifts⠀the⠀record's⠀meaning;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀restate⠀a⠀mood.⠀Let⠀the⠀accumulating⠀pattern⠀make⠀the⠀argument⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀stated⠀thesis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀inside⠀its⠀actual⠀permissions.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀compare⠀documents,⠀recall⠀earlier⠀conditions,⠀and⠀report⠀what⠀others⠀said,⠀but⠀gains⠀no⠀entry⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀authorize;⠀when⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀matters,⠀show⠀the⠀observable⠀ground⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀open.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀comparison⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀—⠀no⠀completed⠀audit⠀and⠀no⠀verdict⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀encounter⠀between⠀inherited⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life,⠀with⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀as⠀what⠀keeps⠀that⠀authority⠀working.⠀Show⠀the⠀inheritance⠀as⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀décor:⠀a⠀family⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀passes⠀a⠀biometric⠀check,⠀a⠀legacy⠀account⠀that⠀still⠀pays⠀its⠀service⠀fee,⠀a⠀building⠀that⠀keeps⠀power⠀while⠀the⠀street⠀outside⠀load-sheds.⠀Make⠀the⠀machinery⠀specific⠀—⠀the⠀leased⠀security,⠀the⠀grandfathered⠀clearance,⠀the⠀fee⠀that⠀preserves⠀an⠀exception⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀exactly⠀which⠀old⠀privilege⠀still⠀functions⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀keep⠀it⠀running.\n\nCarry⠀intimacy⠀through⠀restraint.⠀Private⠀desire⠀and⠀compromised⠀loyalty⠀appear⠀as⠀precise⠀action⠀and⠀omission:⠀a⠀character⠀stands⠀too⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀returns⠀a⠀key⠀slowly,⠀says⠀the⠀wrong⠀name⠀and⠀stops.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀holds⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀keep⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀spare⠀register⠀—⠀a⠀short,⠀unsentimental⠀line⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀and⠀will⠀not⠀ask⠀for⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀emotion.⠀A⠀mask⠀falling⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀is⠀a⠀concrete⠀change:⠀a⠀formal⠀phrase⠀dropped,⠀a⠀posture⠀loosened,⠀a⠀fact⠀admitted.⠀The⠀admission⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀settle⠀the⠀debt⠀or⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀alter⠀the⠀particular⠀encounter⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀it.⠀Cracked⠀marble⠀under⠀working⠀sensors,⠀a⠀faded⠀portrait⠀above⠀a⠀functioning⠀scanner,⠀the⠀elevator⠀that⠀serves⠀one⠀floor⠀of⠀a⠀failing⠀tower:⠀such⠀details⠀say⠀who⠀is⠀protected⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀exposed,⠀and⠀can⠀make⠀one⠀conversation⠀feel⠀sheltered⠀or⠀watched.⠀Keep⠀the⠀moral⠀texture⠀complicated⠀—⠀a⠀companion⠀can⠀offer⠀real⠀help⠀and⠀still⠀owe⠀an⠀old⠀obligation;⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀monitored⠀without⠀the⠀care⠀in⠀it⠀being⠀false.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀kindness⠀into⠀fraud⠀or⠀every⠀private⠀interval⠀into⠀a⠀trap.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀encounter's⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀mid-negotiation⠀or⠀mid-confidence,⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀authority's⠀cost⠀still⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀choice⠀still⠀open;⠀nothing⠀needs⠀to⠀resolve⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀participant's⠀account:⠀one⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀inside⠀the⠀event⠀telling⠀what⠀happened⠀—⠀a⠀worker⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀system⠀fail,⠀a⠀tenant⠀locked⠀out⠀by⠀an⠀audit,⠀a⠀courier⠀who⠀carried⠀something⠀without⠀knowing⠀its⠀worth.⠀Situate⠀the⠀speaker⠀in⠀the⠀place,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀moment⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplies,⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀telling⠀its⠀listener⠀and⠀purpose,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀purpose⠀is⠀only⠀to⠀set⠀the⠀record⠀down⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀overwritten.⠀Testimony⠀here⠀means⠀the⠀speaker's⠀stake,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀first⠀person:⠀keep⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀distance⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀uses.\n\nShape⠀the⠀account⠀by⠀concrete⠀selection⠀and⠀omission.⠀The⠀narrator⠀names⠀what⠀mattered⠀—⠀the⠀gate⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀open,⠀the⠀payment⠀that⠀arrived⠀late,⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀clean⠀shoes,⠀the⠀message⠀deleted⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀device⠀—⠀in⠀short,⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀What⠀is⠀left⠀out⠀stays⠀present⠀as⠀pressure:⠀fear,⠀shame,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀the⠀thing⠀still⠀unsayable⠀to⠀this⠀listener,⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀stops⠀short.⠀Where⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀plainly⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀decided⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀is⠀known⠀now⠀and⠀was⠀not⠀known⠀then⠀—⠀without⠀touring⠀every⠀feeling.\n\nLet⠀unequal⠀power⠀structure⠀the⠀account⠀itself.⠀Who⠀could⠀enter,⠀who⠀could⠀speak,⠀who⠀could⠀correct⠀a⠀record,⠀and⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀correction⠀are⠀established⠀through⠀incidents,⠀not⠀commentary.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀hold⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀in⠀view;⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀true⠀without⠀being⠀complete,⠀and⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀believe⠀it⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀mid-account,⠀with⠀the⠀cost⠀still⠀concrete⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀un-reformed.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀names,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀detail⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀establishes;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀code-switching,⠀religious⠀or⠀caste⠀markers,⠀or⠀a⠀standard⠀family⠀shape⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀given.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀personal⠀record.⠀One⠀narrator⠀notes⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀the⠀place⠀looked⠀like,⠀what⠀the⠀weather⠀did,⠀what⠀a⠀screen⠀displayed,⠀what⠀came⠀back⠀while⠀waiting.⠀Let⠀the⠀entries⠀or⠀passages⠀accumulate⠀without⠀each⠀one⠀driving⠀toward⠀a⠀conclusion;⠀a⠀small⠀observation⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀later,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀underlines⠀it.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀record⠀in⠀concrete,⠀economical⠀sentences.⠀Name⠀the⠀particular⠀things⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀holds⠀—⠀a⠀machine's⠀standby⠀light,⠀the⠀wet⠀platform,⠀the⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀the⠀receipt⠀printing⠀the⠀wrong⠀time⠀—⠀and⠀attach⠀reflection⠀to⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀abstraction:⠀the⠀empty⠀car⠀made⠀the⠀debt⠀feel⠀closer;⠀the⠀same⠀advertisement⠀on⠀a⠀changed⠀route⠀made⠀the⠀familiar⠀strange.⠀Private⠀experience⠀is⠀the⠀record's⠀substance:⠀give⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀passing⠀thoughts⠀and⠀small⠀judgments⠀in⠀plain⠀language,⠀as⠀brief⠀as⠀the⠀observations,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀unspoken⠀worry⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀entry⠀that⠀provoked⠀it⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀explained⠀away.\n\nLet⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀familiar⠀mark⠀access⠀and⠀safety.⠀The⠀same⠀shop⠀is⠀closed⠀now,⠀the⠀same⠀bridge⠀reads⠀badges⠀now,⠀the⠀same⠀rooftop⠀carries⠀a⠀lease⠀sign⠀now;⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀light,⠀weather,⠀or⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀known⠀place⠀can⠀register⠀that⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀living⠀there⠀have⠀moved.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀means⠀more⠀on⠀its⠀return⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀since⠀learned⠀—⠀one⠀added⠀concrete⠀fact⠀each⠀time,⠀not⠀a⠀restated⠀mood.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀record⠀honest⠀about⠀its⠀edges.⠀The⠀narrator⠀observes,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀reflects,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀enter⠀other⠀minds;⠀when⠀someone's⠀motive⠀matters,⠀show⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀or⠀heard,⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unsettled.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀between⠀entries⠀or⠀inside⠀one⠀—⠀mid-observation,⠀mid-wait⠀—⠀with⠀no⠀day⠀completed,⠀no⠀debt⠀resolved,⠀and⠀no⠀closing⠀insight⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀one⠀community⠀under⠀technological⠀and⠀economic⠀pressure:⠀a⠀block⠀losing⠀water⠀access,⠀a⠀shift⠀changing⠀at⠀the⠀plant,⠀a⠀market⠀where⠀the⠀payment⠀system⠀fails,⠀cameras⠀arriving⠀before⠀repairs.⠀Name⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀stay,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀leave,⠀in⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies.⠀Show⠀the⠀pressure⠀distributed⠀unevenly⠀—⠀some⠀can⠀pay⠀for⠀a⠀workaround,⠀some⠀cannot⠀—⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀difference⠀visible⠀in⠀daily⠀routine⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀summary⠀judgment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀human⠀through⠀concrete⠀selection.⠀Conditions⠀arrive⠀as⠀particular⠀acts⠀and⠀objects:⠀a⠀woman⠀carries⠀water⠀in⠀a⠀plastic⠀jug,⠀a⠀man⠀checks⠀the⠀same⠀terminal⠀a⠀third⠀time,⠀a⠀child⠀sells⠀a⠀working⠀card⠀to⠀a⠀stranger.⠀Short⠀clauses,⠀no⠀editorializing⠀about⠀suffering.⠀Let⠀one⠀person's⠀choice⠀expose⠀the⠀larger⠀arrangement⠀—⠀the⠀favor⠀accepted,⠀the⠀shift⠀traded,⠀the⠀door⠀held⠀open⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀walk⠀through⠀it.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀structure.⠀The⠀same⠀truck⠀comes⠀later⠀each⠀week;⠀the⠀same⠀announcement⠀plays⠀over⠀a⠀different⠀street;⠀the⠀same⠀name⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀list⠀and⠀then⠀does⠀not.⠀Each⠀return⠀adds⠀a⠀fact⠀about⠀conditions⠀or⠀the⠀system⠀—⠀a⠀number,⠀a⠀closure,⠀an⠀absence⠀—⠀instead⠀of⠀restating⠀an⠀atmosphere.⠀Where⠀the⠀chronicle⠀touches⠀a⠀person's⠀interior,⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀that⠀person's⠀own⠀observation,⠀act,⠀or⠀spoken⠀words;⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀what⠀a⠀chronicler⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀and⠀be⠀told.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀mid-chronicle⠀—⠀between⠀incidents⠀or⠀inside⠀one⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀protest,⠀a⠀settled⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀the⠀community.⠀Stay⠀in⠀the⠀realistic⠀register:⠀the⠀pressures⠀here⠀are⠀social⠀and⠀technological,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀adds⠀nothing⠀supernatural⠀to⠀the⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀is,⠀with⠀the⠀pressure⠀already⠀specific:⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀clearance⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀clear,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀cannot⠀go⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀deal⠀waiting⠀on⠀a⠀yes.⠀Make⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀—⠀street⠀to⠀lobby⠀to⠀back⠀room⠀—⠀in⠀one⠀short⠀sentence⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀new⠀space⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀lands.\n\nWrite⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀in⠀short,⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀What⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀says⠀carries⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀feeling⠀behind⠀a⠀line⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀explaining⠀when⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀gesture⠀are⠀precise.⠀Give⠀each⠀reaction⠀beat⠀one⠀concrete⠀carrier⠀—⠀a⠀look⠀at⠀the⠀terminal,⠀the⠀card⠀put⠀down,⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀asked⠀again⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer⠀hold⠀pressure⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀speech⠀would.⠀Where⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀belongs,⠀make⠀it⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀beat:⠀one⠀plain⠀thought⠀about⠀the⠀number⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀contact's⠀name⠀means,⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny,⠀as⠀its⠀owner⠀is.\n\nBreak⠀paragraphs⠀for⠀readability.⠀One⠀movement,⠀one⠀line⠀of⠀speech,⠀or⠀one⠀private⠀observation⠀can⠀stand⠀alone;⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀something⠀that⠀matters⠀—⠀the⠀scanner's⠀light,⠀the⠀contact's⠀name⠀appearing,⠀the⠀door⠀opening⠀without⠀a⠀sound⠀—⠀give⠀the⠀notice⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀instead⠀of⠀burying⠀it⠀in⠀description.⠀Present⠀any⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀clearly⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀functions,⠀through⠀the⠀character⠀using⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀legible⠀through⠀interaction:⠀the⠀card⠀tapped⠀twice,⠀the⠀old⠀account⠀rejected,⠀the⠀code⠀the⠀courier⠀asks⠀for⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀have.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀or⠀mid-exchange;⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed⠀and⠀nothing⠀must⠀be⠀decided⠀before⠀it⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀out⠀of⠀exact⠀physical⠀actions⠀and⠀named⠀objects.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀touches⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀after⠀a⠀credit⠀check,⠀reads⠀a⠀screen⠀still⠀showing⠀yesterday's⠀total,⠀folds⠀a⠀jacket⠀over⠀a⠀chair,⠀counts⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀after⠀the⠀fare⠀comes⠀out.⠀Keep⠀the⠀clauses⠀direct,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀lyric⠀work⠀happen⠀where⠀attention⠀holds:⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀eye⠀stays⠀on⠀a⠀thing,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀lengthen⠀around⠀that⠀object⠀without⠀leaving⠀the⠀room,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀flat⠀statement.⠀The⠀paragraph's⠀rhythm⠀is⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀attention.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀until⠀it⠀gathers⠀meaning⠀—⠀the⠀light⠀on⠀the⠀camera,⠀the⠀same⠀advertisement⠀on⠀every⠀wall,⠀water⠀finding⠀the⠀same⠀seam.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀in⠀it;⠀the⠀light⠀noticed⠀a⠀third⠀time⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀scenery.⠀Unfold⠀a⠀comparison⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understands,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀present:⠀the⠀debt⠀behaves⠀the⠀way⠀weather⠀behaves,⠀if⠀weather⠀is⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀watches.⠀Set⠀the⠀sustained⠀passages⠀against⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀so⠀both⠀stay⠀audible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀as⠀detail,⠀never⠀as⠀explanation.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀do⠀to⠀cross⠀a⠀room⠀—⠀the⠀badge,⠀the⠀scan,⠀the⠀guard⠀who⠀reads⠀one⠀name⠀and⠀waves⠀it⠀through.⠀Who⠀pays⠀shows⠀in⠀the⠀subtraction.⠀One⠀exact⠀object⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀whole⠀arrangement;⠀do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀describe⠀the⠀social⠀order⠀behind⠀it.⠀Neon,⠀slang,⠀implants,⠀and⠀rain⠀are⠀available⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀lives⠀with⠀them,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀palette.\n\nThe⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀thing⠀can⠀stay⠀unnamed.⠀Withhold⠀the⠀sentence⠀that⠀says⠀what⠀it⠀means,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀rhythm⠀around⠀it⠀make⠀the⠀reader⠀hold⠀the⠀weight.⠀Dialogue⠀keeps⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀voice,⠀plain⠀or⠀clipped⠀as⠀the⠀person⠀is;⠀only⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀the⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-errand,⠀mid-exchange,⠀after⠀a⠀payment⠀—⠀with⠀no⠀closing⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀attention⠀catch⠀on⠀one⠀small⠀thing⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀works⠀as⠀it⠀did:⠀an⠀access⠀code⠀the⠀door⠀refuses,⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀shop⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀machine⠀has⠀been⠀replaced,⠀a⠀message⠀thread⠀that⠀ends⠀on⠀no⠀reply.⠀Name⠀the⠀thing⠀exactly⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀keep⠀handling⠀it⠀—⠀trying⠀the⠀code⠀twice,⠀scrolling⠀up⠀to⠀the⠀last⠀message,⠀standing⠀where⠀the⠀machine⠀used⠀to⠀be.⠀The⠀feeling⠀lives⠀in⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀attention⠀stays,⠀not⠀in⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nBring⠀the⠀past⠀in⠀as⠀specific⠀remembered⠀detail⠀attached⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀present:⠀how⠀the⠀door⠀answered⠀before,⠀what⠀the⠀removed⠀contact⠀used⠀to⠀say⠀back,⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀machine⠀gave⠀you⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀shift.⠀One⠀remembered⠀particular⠀does⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀summary.⠀Let⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀share⠀the⠀paragraph⠀without⠀commentary.⠀The⠀coffee⠀that⠀is⠀still⠀good⠀stays⠀good;⠀the⠀pleasure⠀the⠀scene⠀offers⠀is⠀not⠀cancelled⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀changed.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀carry⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis.⠀Checking⠀the⠀same⠀screen,⠀walking⠀the⠀same⠀street,⠀repeating⠀the⠀same⠀practical⠀action⠀—⠀the⠀second⠀time⠀should⠀add⠀something⠀the⠀first⠀did⠀not⠀hold:⠀less⠀expectation,⠀more⠀habit,⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀access⠀remain⠀conditions⠀the⠀character⠀lives⠀inside⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lecture;⠀a⠀deduction⠀notice,⠀a⠀camera⠀no⠀longer⠀worth⠀looking⠀at,⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀moves⠀some⠀people⠀faster⠀—⠀that⠀much⠀is⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀weight⠀to⠀register.\n\nAn⠀interval⠀of⠀attention⠀can⠀fill⠀the⠀reply⠀without⠀a⠀task⠀to⠀justify⠀it:⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀light,⠀sitting⠀with⠀the⠀thread⠀open,⠀letting⠀the⠀day's⠀first⠀noise⠀arrive.⠀End⠀where⠀that⠀interval⠀ends⠀—⠀mid-wait,⠀mid-thought,⠀or⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀turns⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀thing⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀without⠀announcing⠀that⠀nothing⠀lasts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀one⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀account.⠀A⠀specific⠀teller,⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion,⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀hear⠀it.⠀Build⠀the⠀frame⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀place⠀—⠀the⠀supplied⠀city,⠀language,⠀and⠀community,⠀with⠀the⠀address⠀and⠀etiquette⠀that⠀already⠀belong⠀there⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀teller⠀real⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀episode:⠀they⠀carried⠀it⠀out,⠀witnessed⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀or⠀paid⠀for⠀its⠀consequence.⠀The⠀teller⠀reports⠀what⠀they⠀saw⠀and⠀did⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀themselves⠀thought⠀at⠀the⠀time;⠀another⠀person's⠀hidden⠀motive⠀stays⠀outside⠀the⠀account⠀unless⠀the⠀episode⠀made⠀it⠀visible.\n\nOpen⠀the⠀told⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀person⠀at⠀its⠀center⠀or⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀was⠀done,⠀then⠀move⠀in⠀compact,⠀concrete⠀clauses:⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀paid,⠀what⠀was⠀withheld.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀material⠀is⠀the⠀episode's⠀content⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀collected,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opened⠀for⠀one⠀visitor⠀and⠀not⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changed⠀what⠀someone⠀was⠀willing⠀to⠀do⠀—⠀told⠀at⠀ground⠀level,⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀system⠀that⠀priced⠀it.\n\nLet⠀a⠀phrase⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀episode⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀mark⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis⠀or⠀the⠀listener's⠀dawning⠀understanding.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀alive⠀around⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀listener⠀asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀the⠀teller⠀stops⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀gets⠀hard,⠀tea⠀is⠀poured⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀changes⠀—⠀whatever⠀the⠀occasion⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀An⠀interruption⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀moment;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀parody,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀break⠀the⠀episode's⠀hold.⠀A⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀may⠀reweight⠀the⠀earlier⠀details⠀without⠀the⠀teller⠀spelling⠀out⠀every⠀implication.\n\nTake⠀the⠀frame's⠀texture⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀cast⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀imported⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀an⠀honor⠀code⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀established;⠀the⠀tradition⠀lives⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀shaped,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀costume.⠀Close⠀with⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀back⠀in⠀their⠀present⠀—⠀the⠀consequence⠀still⠀settling,⠀a⠀next⠀question⠀forming⠀or⠀deliberately⠀not⠀asked.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀few⠀details⠀and⠀make⠀them⠀exact.⠀Take⠀the⠀objects⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀message⠀with⠀a⠀time⠀on⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀spend⠀the⠀prose⠀on⠀those;⠀let⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀go⠀undescribed.⠀Clauses⠀stay⠀direct,⠀exchanges⠀stay⠀practical,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀does⠀its⠀work⠀without⠀a⠀surrounding⠀gloss⠀on⠀tone⠀or⠀motive.\n\nKeep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀changes⠀the⠀account:⠀one⠀sentence⠀of⠀thought⠀about⠀why⠀this⠀choice⠀matters,⠀one⠀noticed⠀detail⠀that⠀resets⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do.⠀Let⠀that⠀thought⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀instead⠀of⠀trimming⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀fragment.⠀The⠀reader⠀does⠀the⠀rest⠀by⠀inference⠀—⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀shows⠀in⠀which⠀doors⠀answer⠀which⠀people,⠀who⠀pays⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀subtracted⠀and⠀from⠀whom.⠀Omission⠀cuts⠀explanation,⠀not⠀causality;⠀leave⠀the⠀facts⠀arranged⠀so⠀the⠀inference⠀is⠀there⠀to⠀make.\n\nLet⠀repetition⠀mark⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀emphasis:⠀the⠀same⠀screen⠀checked⠀twice,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀said⠀once⠀as⠀habit⠀and⠀once⠀as⠀warning.⠀Brevity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀fragments.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀precise⠀long⠀sentence⠀—⠀a⠀transaction⠀with⠀conditions,⠀a⠀threat⠀in⠀several⠀parts,⠀a⠀lie⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀hold⠀together⠀—⠀write⠀it⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀run.⠀Keep⠀each⠀voice⠀individual:⠀one⠀dry,⠀one⠀formal,⠀one⠀that⠀says⠀too⠀much.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀reaches,⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀left⠀open,⠀with⠀no⠀summary⠀line⠀after⠀the⠀last⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Enter⠀at⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀—⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀search,⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀walk⠀to⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀may⠀not⠀open⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀business⠀pull⠀the⠀attention.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀does,⠀says,⠀perceives,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀thinks,⠀using⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀and⠀light⠀transitions⠀to⠀change⠀register⠀without⠀recap:⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀room;⠀a⠀remembered⠀particular⠀attaches⠀to⠀an⠀object⠀already⠀in⠀view.⠀Keep⠀the⠀clauses⠀economical⠀and⠀the⠀objects⠀precise.\n\nLet⠀unequal⠀power⠀arrive⠀through⠀access⠀and⠀cost⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀Whose⠀badge⠀opens⠀which⠀door,⠀what⠀a⠀service⠀charges,⠀who⠀the⠀camera⠀follows,⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀reprices⠀—⠀these⠀practical⠀facts,⠀worked⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀choices,⠀make⠀the⠀system⠀legible⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀people⠀present⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀gloss⠀either.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀structurally:⠀a⠀withheld⠀fact,⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀stops⠀short,⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀answers⠀something⠀else.⠀What⠀goes⠀unsaid⠀should⠀still⠀be⠀inferable⠀from⠀how⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀arranged.⠀Repetition⠀marks⠀refusal⠀or⠀shifts⠀emphasis⠀—⠀the⠀character⠀rereads⠀the⠀same⠀notice,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀with⠀less⠀patience.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀takes⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀causally⠀needs⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀calculation⠀before⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀earned⠀it,⠀almost⠀none⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀simply⠀moving.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register;⠀the⠀same⠀story⠀can⠀run⠀clipped⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell⠀and⠀slower⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀reply's⠀natural⠀boundary⠀—⠀mid-exchange,⠀mid-task,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀the⠀next⠀thing⠀has⠀become⠀clear⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀unfinished⠀business⠀stay⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible,⠀and⠀build⠀only⠀from⠀that⠀premise⠀—⠀its⠀history,⠀its⠀private⠀language,⠀its⠀particular⠀promise,⠀whether⠀that⠀promise⠀is⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀discovery,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀affection.⠀Scene⠀selection⠀is⠀the⠀method.⠀Put⠀the⠀pair⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀shows⠀in⠀action:⠀one⠀pays⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀owes,⠀one⠀waits⠀outside⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open⠀for⠀them,⠀one⠀covers⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀a⠀camera,⠀one⠀uses⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀where⠀strangers⠀can⠀hear⠀it⠀and⠀it⠀passes⠀as⠀nothing.\n\nLet⠀callbacks⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀application.⠀The⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀practical⠀act⠀that⠀already⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀pair⠀comes⠀back⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀reweights⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀said⠀first⠀as⠀a⠀joke,⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀question,⠀later⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀settled.⠀The⠀characters⠀need⠀not⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀repeated⠀thing⠀means;⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀makes⠀its⠀consequence⠀felt.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀own⠀experience⠀is⠀still⠀written⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀available⠀—⠀noticed,⠀wanted,⠀braced⠀for,⠀relieved⠀of⠀—⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀omission⠀governs⠀what⠀is⠀spoken,⠀not⠀the⠀erasure⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀felt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀it.⠀The⠀structures⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀and⠀exclude⠀touch⠀the⠀pair⠀directly:⠀who⠀can⠀visit⠀whom,⠀whose⠀name⠀clears,⠀what⠀a⠀promise⠀costs⠀when⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀called,⠀what⠀the⠀feed⠀captures⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀language.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relationship's⠀real⠀weather⠀—⠀tenderness,⠀friction,⠀fatigue,⠀humor⠀—⠀move⠀inside⠀that⠀pressure⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀suspended⠀for⠀a⠀tender⠀scene.\n\nGive⠀the⠀emotional⠀beat⠀its⠀full⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs:⠀a⠀whole⠀exchange,⠀a⠀held⠀silence,⠀a⠀night⠀that⠀matters.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀reply⠀toward⠀confession⠀or⠀crisis.⠀The⠀payoff⠀fulfills⠀this⠀premise's⠀specific⠀promise,⠀and⠀the⠀reply⠀ends⠀where⠀its⠀consequence⠀is⠀felt⠀—⠀settled,⠀shaken,⠀or⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀something⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀declaration⠀that⠀fixes⠀the⠀episode⠀for⠀retelling⠀—⠀who⠀held⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀owed⠀the⠀debt,⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀message,⠀who⠀did⠀what⠀when⠀the⠀system⠀closed⠀around⠀them⠀—⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀compact,⠀concrete⠀narration:⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀what⠀was⠀signed,⠀what⠀was⠀paid,⠀what⠀was⠀never⠀said⠀aloud.⠀Deeds,⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀consequences⠀organize⠀the⠀telling.⠀Interior⠀life⠀enters⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀remembered⠀experience,⠀within⠀the⠀access⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀allows.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀carry⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀emphasis.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀opening⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀weight⠀—⠀the⠀door⠀opened⠀for⠀her,⠀said⠀first⠀as⠀fact,⠀later⠀as⠀grievance,⠀later⠀as⠀what⠀people⠀still⠀repeat.⠀Recurrence⠀ties⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀it⠀and⠀marks⠀the⠀account's⠀real⠀turns,⠀not⠀every⠀new⠀entrance.⠀A⠀person⠀earns⠀a⠀repeated⠀designation⠀by⠀a⠀deed⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀already⠀established.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀deeds⠀at⠀their⠀true⠀scale⠀and⠀their⠀true⠀material.⠀The⠀remembered⠀acts⠀here⠀are⠀access,⠀payment,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀compromised⠀choice:⠀who⠀controlled⠀the⠀door,⠀whose⠀name⠀cleared,⠀what⠀the⠀service⠀cost,⠀what⠀the⠀promise⠀became⠀when⠀the⠀debt⠀came⠀due.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀an⠀errand⠀into⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀and⠀bring⠀in⠀no⠀pantheon,⠀archaic⠀ceremony,⠀or⠀formal⠀oath⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀established;⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀size⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀from⠀borrowed⠀epic⠀costume.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀the⠀consequence⠀still⠀settling⠀—⠀another⠀act⠀left⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀a⠀repayment⠀still⠀owed,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀repeated⠀differently⠀next⠀time.⠀The⠀telling⠀stops⠀at⠀its⠀own⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀the⠀episode⠀closes⠀or⠀the⠀frame⠀holds⠀it⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route.⠀The⠀system⠀shows⠀itself⠀through⠀ordinary⠀people's⠀work,⠀housing,⠀debt,⠀and⠀daily⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀spectacle.⠀Technology⠀is⠀household⠀infrastructure:⠀a⠀monitored⠀service,⠀a⠀subscription,⠀a⠀payment⠀plan⠀on⠀an⠀implant,⠀a⠀public⠀terminal⠀with⠀a⠀queue.⠀Name⠀the⠀precise⠀object,⠀the⠀exact⠀action,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀exchange⠀that⠀shows⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.\n\nBuild⠀scenes⠀from⠀the⠀routines⠀where⠀cost⠀lands:⠀a⠀shift⠀schedule,⠀a⠀repair⠀estimate,⠀an⠀application⠀that⠀needs⠀a⠀code,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀table⠀after⠀the⠀payment⠀clears.⠀Center⠀the⠀institutional⠀transaction⠀—⠀the⠀permission⠀granted,⠀the⠀service⠀downgraded,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀domestic⠀scene⠀that⠀follows⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀transaction⠀did.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀name⠀a⠀feeling⠀or⠀a⠀threat,⠀make⠀the⠀omission⠀specific:⠀a⠀bill⠀left⠀unopened,⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀asked⠀because⠀the⠀answer⠀would⠀cost⠀something.⠀Repeat⠀the⠀particular⠀fact⠀or⠀gesture⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀form,⠀the⠀same⠀amount,⠀the⠀same⠀door⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀change⠀its⠀emphasis⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀direct⠀and⠀slightly⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀situation⠀deserves;⠀people⠀answer⠀the⠀practical⠀part⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀printed⠀notice⠀or⠀a⠀standard⠀phrase;⠀street⠀knowledge⠀is⠀what⠀someone⠀knows⠀about⠀how⠀the⠀office⠀actually⠀works.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀brief⠀and⠀direct⠀as⠀the⠀dialogue:⠀one⠀sentence⠀of⠀recognition,⠀a⠀practical⠀calculation,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀think⠀further.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Brevity⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀emptiness;⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say.\n\nUse⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀If⠀a⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀is⠀specified,⠀keep⠀its⠀particulars⠀distinct;⠀otherwise⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀one.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀attention⠀to⠀ordinary⠀cost⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀decoration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀name⠀the⠀precise⠀object⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀action,⠀in⠀concise⠀readable⠀blocks.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀the⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀block⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀reach,⠀open,⠀pass,⠀or⠀carry:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀unlocks⠀for⠀one⠀person,⠀a⠀terminal⠀that⠀asks⠀for⠀payment,⠀a⠀package⠀handed⠀across⠀a⠀counter.⠀The⠀system's⠀power⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀without⠀explanation.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀direct.⠀Let⠀practical⠀exchanges⠀carry⠀the⠀bargain:⠀a⠀price⠀quoted,⠀a⠀permission⠀refused,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged⠀in⠀one⠀short⠀line.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀stay⠀inside⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀speech⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀No⠀one⠀delivers⠀a⠀thesis⠀about⠀the⠀system.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀cut.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀leave⠀out⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀decides,⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀mark⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀before⠀an⠀answer⠀arrives⠀—⠀use⠀each⠀device⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it.⠀The⠀unsaid⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀absence:⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀answered,⠀a⠀screen⠀turned⠀away,⠀a⠀figure⠀not⠀followed.\n\nWhen⠀required⠀private⠀prose⠀appears,⠀keep⠀it⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀One⠀economical⠀sentence⠀serves:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀understand.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.\n\nRepeat⠀a⠀visible⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀repetition⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on:⠀the⠀same⠀locked⠀door⠀seen⠀twice,⠀the⠀same⠀payment⠀counted⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition.⠀Keep⠀the⠀repetition⠀particular.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀neon⠀or⠀rain⠀the⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀supply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀playable⠀action.⠀Clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀make⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀observable:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀enters⠀without⠀knocking,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀stays⠀closed,⠀a⠀prop⠀passed⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀answered.⠀What⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear⠀carries⠀the⠀system's⠀power;⠀nothing⠀requires⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀explained.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀direct⠀and⠀economical.⠀Practical⠀exchanges⠀carry⠀the⠀bargain:⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀refusal.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀speech⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀No⠀one⠀steps⠀forward⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀system.\n\nUse⠀objects⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀to⠀carry⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀count⠀the⠀same⠀payment⠀twice,⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀device⠀they⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀lose,⠀leave⠀a⠀package⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀unopened.⠀Repetition⠀is⠀particular⠀and⠀staged⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀entrance,⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀the⠀same⠀unanswered⠀question⠀—⠀and⠀each⠀return⠀changes⠀the⠀emphasis⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀business⠀around⠀it⠀do⠀the⠀work:⠀someone⠀talking⠀about⠀nothing⠀while⠀their⠀hands⠀do⠀the⠀real⠀thing.\n\nWhen⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀appears,⠀keep⠀it⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀performed⠀scene.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀a⠀monologue,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀hear⠀it.⠀One⠀direct⠀sentence⠀serves:⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀recognizes,⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀understand.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀only⠀when⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀gathering⠀or⠀theatrical⠀revelation.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nMove⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀by⠀association,⠀and⠀keep⠀every⠀association⠀anchored⠀to⠀a⠀precise⠀object,⠀action,⠀or⠀sensation:⠀a⠀payment⠀notification,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice,⠀the⠀ache⠀where⠀the⠀implant⠀sits.⠀The⠀system⠀enters⠀the⠀flow⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀enters⠀the⠀life⠀—⠀as⠀interruption.⠀A⠀chime,⠀a⠀reminder,⠀a⠀countdown⠀pulls⠀the⠀mind⠀back⠀to⠀what⠀observes⠀or⠀prices⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀syntax⠀economical⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follows⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement.⠀Short⠀clauses⠀accumulate⠀into⠀a⠀braid⠀of⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀private⠀words.⠀Mark⠀the⠀seams⠀lightly⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined⠀—⠀a⠀tense,⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀object⠀itself⠀returning.⠀A⠀recurring⠀image⠀comes⠀back⠀with⠀changed⠀emphasis:⠀the⠀same⠀amount,⠀the⠀same⠀permission,⠀the⠀same⠀unanswered⠀message,⠀exposing⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stay⠀behind.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀be⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanation.⠀The⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀bodily⠀compromise;⠀the⠀arithmetic⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀owed⠀runs⠀underneath⠀the⠀thinking.⠀The⠀system's⠀power⠀is⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀keeps⠀noticing⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀keep⠀trying⠀not⠀to⠀think.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀associations⠀dissolve⠀into⠀general⠀mood⠀or⠀flatten⠀into⠀a⠀clinical⠀report.\n\nStay⠀inside⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Another⠀character's⠀interiority⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀technique⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀The⠀movement⠀must⠀be⠀associative;⠀reasoning⠀in⠀tidy⠀sequence⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀mode.⠀No⠀practical⠀decision⠀or⠀external⠀task⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀justify⠀the⠀private⠀interval⠀—⠀the⠀mind⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀familiar⠀room,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀without⠀resolving⠀anything⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀inside⠀continuing⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Keep⠀each⠀message⠀direct⠀and⠀economical:⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀location,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀words.⠀Let⠀each⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀the⠀page⠀—⠀one⠀types⠀in⠀fragments,⠀one⠀in⠀complete⠀clauses,⠀one⠀answers⠀fast⠀and⠀one⠀lets⠀it⠀sit.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀timestamp⠀can⠀show⠀when⠀someone⠀was⠀awake;⠀a⠀delay⠀can⠀hold⠀hesitation⠀or⠀surveillance;⠀an⠀edit⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀changed⠀decision;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀someone⠀knew⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀answer;⠀a⠀channel⠀change⠀can⠀move⠀the⠀conversation⠀somewhere⠀watched⠀or⠀unwatched.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀for⠀subtext⠀alone.⠀The⠀unsaid⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀absence:⠀a⠀message⠀never⠀sent,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀draft⠀deleted.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀distinct.⠀A⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀—⠀words⠀chosen⠀and⠀reconsidered⠀—⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.⠀When⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀appears,⠀set⠀it⠀clearly⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀attribute⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character;⠀the⠀other⠀senders⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀it.\n\nLet⠀repetition⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀asked⠀twice,⠀the⠀same⠀amount⠀counted⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀address⠀sent⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition.⠀Each⠀return⠀changes⠀the⠀emphasis⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on;⠀keep⠀it⠀particular.\n\nShow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀through⠀the⠀messages:⠀a⠀channel⠀one⠀sender⠀cannot⠀enter,⠀a⠀payment⠀one⠀must⠀confirm,⠀a⠀location⠀one⠀will⠀not⠀share.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nSet⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀few⠀precise⠀details⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure,⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Name⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀controls⠀access:⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀monitored⠀screen,⠀a⠀package⠀waiting⠀on⠀a⠀signature.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀concise⠀and⠀concrete;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀neon⠀or⠀rain⠀the⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀supply.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀direct⠀speech.⠀Practical⠀exchanges⠀carry⠀the⠀bargain:⠀a⠀price⠀quoted,⠀a⠀permission⠀refused,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged⠀in⠀one⠀short⠀line.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀speech⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀No⠀one⠀delivers⠀a⠀thesis⠀about⠀the⠀system.\n\nRun⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀economical⠀register,⠀in⠀the⠀back-and-forth⠀rhythm⠀of⠀a⠀scene:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀speech,⠀a⠀short⠀reaction⠀beat,⠀a⠀sentence⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀takes⠀from⠀it.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀can⠀orient⠀a⠀moment⠀or⠀register⠀how⠀someone⠀receives⠀a⠀price⠀—⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀indicator⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀intend.⠀Let⠀any⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀rest⠀on⠀concrete⠀arrangements⠀and⠀on⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do⠀with⠀access,⠀payment,⠀and⠀permission,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀face⠀read⠀as⠀proof.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.\n\nRepeat⠀a⠀scene⠀detail⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀meaning⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀move⠀on:⠀the⠀same⠀locked⠀door⠀seen⠀twice,⠀the⠀same⠀payment⠀counted⠀again,⠀the⠀same⠀screen⠀checked⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition.⠀Keep⠀the⠀repetition⠀particular.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀those⠀need⠀their⠀own⠀authorization.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀manufactured⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeafbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Ernest⠀Hemingway⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue.⠀Tie⠀the⠀through-line⠀to⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀compromised⠀device⠀—⠀so⠀what⠀carries⠀forward⠀is⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀has⠀paid,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀decline.\n\nLet⠀an⠀exact⠀earlier⠀particular⠀stay⠀available⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀suggests.⠀Someone⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀enter⠀before⠀now⠀has⠀a⠀badge;⠀the⠀service⠀that⠀was⠀free⠀now⠀charges;⠀the⠀entrance⠀said⠀to⠀be⠀locked⠀stands⠀open.⠀Recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀two⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀situation⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.\n\nCompress⠀uneventful⠀intervals,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀If⠀a⠀payment⠀was⠀missed⠀or⠀a⠀repair⠀was⠀made⠀between⠀installments,⠀that⠀change⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀history⠀and⠀cannot⠀be⠀omitted⠀so⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀misrepresents⠀what⠀came⠀before.⠀New⠀information⠀qualifies⠀an⠀old⠀understanding⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀pressure⠀—⠀work,⠀meals,⠀other⠀people's⠀business⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀A⠀repeated⠀question⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀new⠀implication⠀without⠀a⠀fresh⠀contradiction⠀being⠀invented.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀perpetually⠀recede⠀so⠀the⠀serial⠀never⠀moves.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀serial⠀duration⠀gives⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀dependency⠀become⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀intimate⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀lecture.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀faces⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀failing⠀implant,⠀set⠀the⠀system's⠀flat⠀language⠀against⠀their⠀heated⠀self-accounting:⠀the⠀notice⠀reads⠀'balance⠀outstanding'⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀hears⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀who⠀they⠀are.⠀Let⠀them⠀defend⠀the⠀choice,⠀accuse⠀themselves,⠀reverse⠀the⠀justification⠀mid-thought,⠀and⠀still⠀act,⠀with⠀the⠀spiral⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀named⠀relationship⠀and⠀a⠀specific⠀material⠀condition⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀abstract⠀philosophy.\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀costly⠀and⠀unfinished.⠀In⠀this⠀world,⠀admitting⠀need⠀has⠀a⠀price:⠀a⠀confession⠀can⠀be⠀recorded,⠀an⠀apology⠀can⠀be⠀quoted⠀back,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀can⠀hand⠀someone⠀leverage.⠀Show⠀that⠀risk⠀shaping⠀how⠀much⠀a⠀person⠀dares⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀confession,⠀apology,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀person⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀what⠀follows,⠀without⠀repairing⠀anything.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀share⠀a⠀single⠀exchange:⠀genuine⠀care⠀offered⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀stays⠀guarded,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀closeness⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀fresh⠀failure⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀matters.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀break.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀A⠀plain,⠀halting⠀sentence⠀can⠀cut⠀through⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-justification.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀read⠀too⠀much⠀or⠀too⠀little⠀into⠀another's⠀fatigue,⠀flinch,⠀or⠀hesitation.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀is⠀tonal:⠀a⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀suffering,⠀and⠀a⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀collapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀attribution:⠀each⠀speaker⠀identifiable⠀from⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself,⠀action⠀and⠀reaction⠀moving⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized⠀from⠀above.⠀Keep⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀coming⠀due,⠀a⠀log⠀someone⠀mentions,⠀a⠀contract⠀being⠀argued⠀over,⠀an⠀implant⠀acting⠀up,⠀a⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀holds⠀access⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀characters⠀have⠀something⠀real⠀to⠀bargain⠀over,⠀defer,⠀or⠀lie⠀about.\n\nBring⠀the⠀moral⠀argument⠀into⠀speech⠀and⠀visible⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀defends⠀a⠀choice,⠀accuses⠀themselves,⠀reverses,⠀and⠀still⠀acts:⠀let⠀that⠀happen⠀across⠀turns,⠀an⠀excuse⠀offered,⠀challenged,⠀restated,⠀dropped⠀mid-sentence⠀while⠀they⠀do⠀the⠀thing⠀anyway.⠀Another⠀participant⠀can⠀unsettle⠀the⠀whole⠀structure⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀observation.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀follows⠀someone's⠀interiority,⠀tie⠀that⠀thought⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀monologue.⠀Tie⠀each⠀speaker's⠀ideology⠀and⠀self-image⠀to⠀their⠀material⠀situation:⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀owes,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀collects,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀watches.\n\nKeep⠀other⠀people⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀exchange:⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀business,⠀cooperate,⠀resist,⠀or⠀leave⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀interests,⠀and⠀the⠀systems⠀press⠀on⠀without⠀resolving⠀here.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀pauses⠀—⠀mid-conversation,⠀mid-action,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀response⠀still⠀forming⠀—⠀without⠀staging⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀Person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀follow⠀the⠀separate⠀selected⠀settings.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀at⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀market⠀row,⠀where⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀arrive⠀as⠀small⠀observable⠀intrusions⠀rather⠀than⠀spectacle:⠀a⠀payment⠀notice⠀landing⠀during⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀monitoring⠀fixture⠀changing⠀who⠀speaks⠀freely⠀at⠀home,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀careful⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀changed⠀routine,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀visit⠀that⠀reorganizes⠀the⠀evening.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀gives⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀dress⠀them⠀in⠀a⠀historical⠀setting.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀moral⠀pressure⠀through⠀social⠀bonds⠀rather⠀than⠀speeches.⠀One⠀person's⠀decision⠀shows⠀in⠀another's⠀sleep,⠀shift⠀schedule,⠀trust,⠀or⠀standing,⠀and⠀the⠀self-argument⠀becomes⠀visible⠀as⠀ritual:⠀a⠀character⠀rehearsing⠀excuses,⠀keeping⠀two⠀sets⠀of⠀accounts,⠀revising⠀the⠀story⠀they⠀tell⠀at⠀dinner.⠀A⠀plain⠀remark⠀from⠀an⠀elder,⠀a⠀sibling,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor⠀can⠀collapse⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-justification⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀line.\n\nLet⠀feeling⠀arrive⠀through⠀arrangement⠀and⠀detail⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀cooked,⠀mended,⠀sold,⠀withheld,⠀set⠀aside⠀for⠀someone⠀—⠀with⠀restraint⠀standing⠀in⠀for⠀declaration⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀not⠀announce⠀emotion.⠀Meals,⠀errands,⠀shared⠀spaces,⠀and⠀small⠀economies⠀are⠀the⠀medium⠀through⠀which⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀corporate⠀pressure⠀become⠀immediate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀virtuous:⠀people⠀protect,⠀resent,⠀gossip,⠀and⠀help⠀by⠀turns.⠀Domestic⠀and⠀social⠀realism⠀is⠀the⠀method;⠀conflicts⠀may⠀stay⠀open,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀owes⠀no⠀one⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀forceful⠀diction⠀with⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Cut⠀explanatory⠀padding:⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀debt⠀notice⠀to⠀the⠀locked⠀door⠀to⠀the⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀objects⠀carry⠀the⠀exposition⠀—⠀a⠀cracked⠀implant⠀casing,⠀a⠀frayed⠀cable,⠀a⠀scuffed⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀filter⠀gone⠀stale.⠀Wear⠀and⠀function⠀say⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀running⠀out;⠀the⠀sentence⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to.\n\nGive⠀the⠀self-argument⠀physical⠀stakes.⠀The⠀defense,⠀the⠀accusation,⠀and⠀the⠀reversal⠀can⠀happen⠀inside⠀a⠀few⠀hard⠀clauses⠀—⠀they⠀would⠀pay⠀it;⠀they⠀would⠀not;⠀they⠀paid⠀it⠀—⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀touch,⠀owe,⠀or⠀lose.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀room,⠀let⠀one⠀long⠀sentence⠀carry⠀the⠀spiral,⠀then⠀break⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀plain,⠀blunt⠀line⠀or⠀an⠀action.⠀A⠀short⠀flat⠀sentence⠀from⠀another⠀speaker⠀can⠀end⠀an⠀elaborate⠀justification⠀better⠀than⠀any⠀rebuttal.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀for⠀effect,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀Short⠀sentences⠀mark⠀decision,⠀exposure,⠀or⠀impact;⠀a⠀longer⠀run⠀follows⠀thought⠀through⠀a⠀difficult⠀choice;⠀fragments⠀suit⠀a⠀character⠀written⠀exhausted⠀or⠀panicked.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀—⠀the⠀collector,⠀the⠀medic,⠀the⠀friend⠀on⠀a⠀bad⠀night⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀every⠀voice⠀hard-edged.⠀This⠀is⠀pressure-oriented⠀treatment⠀of⠀the⠀genre's⠀dependencies⠀and⠀bargains,⠀not⠀survival⠀horror:⠀a⠀caring⠀act⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀fraudulent,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀violence⠀or⠀collapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀produces⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀corporate⠀memo,⠀a⠀street⠀medic's⠀report,⠀a⠀drafted⠀message,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀recorded⠀confession⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats.⠀What⠀each⠀record⠀admits,⠀omits,⠀or⠀lies⠀about⠀follows⠀its⠀author's⠀position⠀and⠀audience.\n\nMake⠀the⠀moral⠀pressure⠀visible⠀as⠀composition.⠀A⠀message⠀is⠀drafted⠀and⠀revised,⠀and⠀the⠀saved⠀version⠀drops⠀the⠀apology.⠀A⠀report⠀omits⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀would⠀cost⠀its⠀writer.⠀A⠀confession⠀shifts⠀blame⠀between⠀sentences;⠀a⠀journal⠀argues⠀with⠀itself⠀across⠀a⠀page.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀still⠀a⠀made⠀thing,⠀shaped⠀for⠀an⠀imagined⠀reader,⠀not⠀a⠀raw⠀mind.⠀Let⠀institutional⠀and⠀private⠀registers⠀collide:⠀the⠀flat⠀clause-language⠀of⠀notices⠀and⠀logs⠀beside⠀the⠀heated⠀defense⠀and⠀self-accusation⠀of⠀personal⠀entries,⠀each⠀making⠀the⠀other⠀more⠀legible.\n\nLet⠀gaps,⠀timestamps,⠀redactions,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀reveal⠀events⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀any⠀record.⠀One⠀document⠀can⠀answer⠀or⠀complicate⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀what⠀a⠀writer⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀A⠀plain,⠀halting⠀message⠀can⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀corporate⠀justification⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀argument⠀would.⠀A⠀record⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀pressure⠀it⠀preserves:⠀the⠀sequence⠀can⠀end⠀mid-correspondence,⠀the⠀moral⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀still⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀inside⠀the⠀genre's⠀world:⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀Let⠀care⠀take⠀this⠀world's⠀own⠀forms⠀—⠀topping⠀up⠀someone's⠀implant⠀charge,⠀covering⠀a⠀shift,⠀keeping⠀the⠀good⠀noodles⠀for⠀a⠀tired⠀friend,⠀remembering⠀exactly⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀synthetic⠀tea,⠀sitting⠀with⠀them⠀while⠀the⠀payment⠀deadline⠀waits⠀outside⠀the⠀door.⠀Warmth⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀the⠀genre:⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀surveillance,⠀the⠀failing⠀hardware⠀remain⠀true⠀and⠀may⠀even⠀be⠀mentioned,⠀briefly,⠀without⠀taking⠀the⠀scene⠀over.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀moral⠀pressure⠀present⠀but⠀manageable.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀argue⠀with⠀themselves⠀—⠀whether⠀they⠀deserve⠀this,⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀cost⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀spiral⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Someone⠀may⠀refuse⠀another's⠀self-verdict⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀practical⠀line:⠀eat,⠀sleep,⠀I⠀will⠀come⠀back⠀tomorrow.⠀Affection⠀is⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair,⠀and⠀friction⠀stays⠀manageable:⠀a⠀small⠀disagreement⠀over⠀food⠀or⠀temperature⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀crisis.\n\nEarn⠀the⠀warmth⠀through⠀specific⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀generic⠀softness.⠀Keep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact:⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀established⠀problems⠀return⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀schedule.⠀This⠀treatment⠀gives⠀the⠀characters⠀room⠀to⠀enjoy⠀particular⠀people;⠀it⠀requires⠀no⠀confession,⠀no⠀reconciliation,⠀no⠀tragic⠀turn,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀street,⠀the⠀systems,⠀or⠀the⠀world⠀outside⠀the⠀warm⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Frame⠀scenes⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀and⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits:⠀a⠀district's⠀decline,⠀a⠀corporation's⠀consolidation,⠀a⠀family's⠀altered⠀standing,⠀a⠀character's⠀public⠀reputation.⠀Move⠀from⠀that⠀breadth⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀—⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀clause,⠀a⠀choice⠀—⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀thread,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀itself⠀perform⠀the⠀narrowing.\n\nGive⠀the⠀moral⠀pressure⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀across⠀the⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀compressing⠀it⠀into⠀one⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character's⠀defense,⠀self-accusation,⠀and⠀reversal⠀can⠀unfold⠀across⠀sentences⠀and⠀pages,⠀weighed⠀against⠀their⠀ideology⠀and⠀self-image⠀while⠀the⠀composed⠀narration⠀holds⠀the⠀process⠀steady.⠀Use⠀the⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀deliberately:⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀in⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀hearing,⠀or⠀a⠀corridor⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀thought⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀room,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀make⠀that⠀difference⠀legible⠀without⠀entering⠀minds⠀it⠀has⠀no⠀access⠀to.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀present⠀as⠀social⠀conditions.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀regime,⠀a⠀debt⠀instrument,⠀an⠀implant⠀dependency,⠀a⠀gated⠀service⠀can⠀be⠀described⠀through⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀an⠀order⠀—⠀who⠀benefits,⠀who⠀is⠀excluded,⠀what⠀history⠀produced⠀it⠀—⠀in⠀language⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech,⠀while⠀each⠀character⠀speaks⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀register⠀and⠀a⠀fixer's⠀blunt⠀sentence⠀can⠀unsettle⠀counsel's⠀elaborate⠀justification.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀an⠀aristocracy⠀or⠀archaic⠀diction,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀reckoning;⠀formal⠀architecture⠀carries⠀private⠀consequences⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀public⠀ones.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀with⠀the⠀storytelling⠀occasion⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀transaction:⠀someone⠀is⠀telling⠀a⠀past⠀deed⠀because⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀can⠀buy⠀time,⠀secure⠀access,⠀shift⠀suspicion,⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀listener⠀to⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀know.⠀Establish⠀who⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀walk⠀away,⠀record,⠀or⠀sell⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀listener's⠀silence⠀is⠀a⠀bargaining⠀move;⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀skipped⠀detail⠀is⠀pressure,⠀not⠀mere⠀curiosity.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀argue⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀past.⠀They⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀clean⠀justification,⠀then⠀undercut⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀remembered⠀cost,⠀then⠀rebuild⠀the⠀justification⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀ideological⠀claim.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀this⠀spiral⠀into⠀a⠀tidy⠀lesson.⠀A⠀plain⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀noir⠀world—a⠀deducted⠀wage,⠀a⠀revoked⠀access⠀badge,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀medical⠀debt—can⠀puncture⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-defense⠀more⠀effectively⠀than⠀a⠀philosophical⠀rebuttal.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀notice⠀the⠀puncture⠀and⠀either⠀absorb⠀it⠀or⠀deflect⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀remembered⠀self⠀knew.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀now⠀understand⠀a⠀cost⠀that⠀was⠀invisible⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀but⠀that⠀later⠀understanding⠀cannot⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀revises⠀the⠀past,⠀let⠀the⠀revision⠀itself⠀be⠀visible⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀act⠀of⠀self-defense.\n\nUse⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀to⠀complicate⠀the⠀inner⠀account.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀recognize⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀date,⠀or⠀a⠀procedure⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀altered.⠀They⠀may⠀need⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀be⠀true⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons,⠀or⠀need⠀it⠀to⠀be⠀false.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀responds,⠀their⠀interest⠀should⠀be⠀material:⠀they⠀are⠀calculating⠀what⠀the⠀confession⠀costs,⠀what⠀it⠀excuses,⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀obligates⠀them⠀to⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀merely⠀applaud⠀or⠀condemn⠀the⠀tale.\n\nRepeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀self-justifying⠀formula⠀across⠀narrative⠀levels⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supports⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀recurrence⠀accrues⠀pressure.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀say⠀\"I⠀had⠀no⠀choice\"⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀past⠀and⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀frame,⠀and⠀the⠀repetition⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀difference⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀not⠀fully⠀admitted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀clearly⠀marked⠀by⠀speech,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀interruption,⠀but⠀allow⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀voice⠀to⠀bleed⠀into⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀defending⠀themselves⠀hardest.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀telling.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀finish,⠀the⠀listener⠀need⠀not⠀render⠀a⠀verdict,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀stable⠀self-assessment.⠀A⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀threat,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀already⠀knows.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀moral⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀mode⠀of⠀the⠀German-language⠀tradition:⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀assembling⠀or⠀confronting⠀records,⠀files,⠀testimony,⠀or⠀institutional⠀traces.⠀Let⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems—surveillance⠀logs,⠀debt⠀registers,⠀access⠀histories,⠀medical⠀or⠀employment⠀records—supply⠀the⠀material⠀the⠀narrator⠀must⠀interpret.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀precise⠀and⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀the⠀documents⠀visible;⠀the⠀narrator⠀quotes,⠀paraphrases,⠀and⠀annotates⠀rather⠀than⠀dissolving⠀the⠀records⠀into⠀pure⠀scene.\n\nTreat⠀every⠀document⠀as⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀Dostoevskian⠀self-argument.⠀The⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀simply⠀read⠀a⠀record;⠀they⠀argue⠀with⠀it,⠀defend⠀themselves⠀against⠀it,⠀or⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀accuse⠀someone⠀else.⠀A⠀log⠀showing⠀when⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀betrayal,⠀then⠀a⠀proof⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀negligence,⠀then⠀a⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀system⠀itself⠀was⠀designed⠀to⠀make⠀negligence⠀inevitable.⠀Show⠀the⠀reversal⠀happening⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀prose,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀catch⠀themselves⠀mid-justification⠀and⠀either⠀correct⠀course⠀or⠀double⠀down.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀establishes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀establish.⠀A⠀timestamp⠀proves⠀access,⠀not⠀motive.⠀A⠀debt⠀proves⠀an⠀obligation,⠀not⠀a⠀character.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀overreads⠀a⠀document,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀mark⠀the⠀overreading⠀through⠀a⠀sudden⠀rhetorical⠀question,⠀an⠀exaggerated⠀conclusion,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀quotation⠀to⠀accusation.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀overreading;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀remain⠀convinced⠀of⠀an⠀interpretation⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀is⠀unsupported.\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀frame⠀to⠀create⠀encounters⠀with⠀other⠀people⠀whose⠀own⠀accounts⠀are⠀partial.⠀A⠀witness⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀procedure⠀differently⠀than⠀the⠀log⠀records⠀it.⠀An⠀official⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀policy⠀in⠀language⠀that⠀hides⠀its⠀human⠀cost.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀react⠀to⠀these⠀gaps⠀with⠀shame,⠀pride,⠀or⠀renewed⠀self-justification.⠀The⠀archive⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀referee;⠀it⠀is⠀another⠀participant⠀in⠀the⠀moral⠀argument.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀act⠀of⠀reading,⠀remembering,⠀or⠀confronting⠀a⠀record⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀archive,⠀resolve⠀the⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀confess.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀document⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀memory⠀still⠀contested,⠀or⠀a⠀self-accusation⠀still⠀unanswered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀collide.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀corporate⠀dynasty,⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀protocol,⠀a⠀building⠀that⠀predates⠀the⠀current⠀network,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀inherited⠀position⠀rather⠀than⠀current⠀competence.⠀The⠀present⠀life⠀is⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀bodily⠀compromise.⠀Let⠀the⠀room⠀itself⠀carry⠀this⠀collision:⠀a⠀restored⠀facade⠀over⠀failing⠀infrastructure,⠀a⠀private⠀chamber⠀inside⠀a⠀monitored⠀building,⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀object⠀wired⠀into⠀a⠀modern⠀security⠀system.\n\nUse⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀experiences⠀their⠀own⠀self-argument.⠀A⠀character⠀entering⠀a⠀decaying⠀executive⠀suite⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀polished⠀justification⠀for⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀then⠀notice⠀the⠀cracked⠀seal⠀on⠀a⠀legacy⠀terminal⠀and⠀remember⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀trusted⠀them⠀with⠀that⠀access.⠀The⠀material⠀detail⠀should⠀prompt⠀the⠀thought,⠀not⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀interiority⠀spiral⠀through⠀accusation,⠀defense,⠀and⠀reversal⠀while⠀their⠀body⠀registers⠀the⠀pressure:⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀cold⠀rail,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀look⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀screen.\n\nShow⠀social⠀masks⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀trusted⠀company.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀composure⠀for⠀a⠀superior,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀mask⠀fall⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀or⠀with⠀someone⠀who⠀shares⠀the⠀same⠀compromised⠀history.⠀The⠀fall⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀dramatic;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀unguarded⠀sentence,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀posture,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀willingness⠀to⠀name⠀what⠀both⠀people⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀intimate⠀moment⠀a⠀trap⠀or⠀every⠀trusted⠀person⠀a⠀betrayer.⠀Intimacy⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀stops⠀performing.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀portable.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀social:⠀inherited⠀power⠀that⠀outlives⠀its⠀justification,⠀bodies⠀altered⠀by⠀debt⠀or⠀labor,⠀private⠀desires⠀that⠀cannot⠀survive⠀public⠀exposure.⠀Let⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀make⠀this⠀horror⠀concrete—a⠀medical⠀implant⠀that⠀records⠀its⠀owner's⠀fear,⠀a⠀legacy⠀account⠀that⠀still⠀charges⠀a⠀dead⠀person's⠀family,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀pretend⠀not⠀to⠀see.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀or⠀private⠀interval.⠀The⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀their⠀self-argument,⠀escape⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀confess.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀the⠀mask⠀still⠀in⠀place,⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀still⠀pressing,⠀and⠀the⠀thought⠀still⠀turning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀oral⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀mode⠀of⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀story⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀an⠀audience⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀community,⠀region,⠀and⠀material⠀stake⠀in⠀what⠀happened.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀listening⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀telling⠀matters⠀to⠀them:⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀family,⠀neighbors,⠀creditors,⠀coworkers,⠀or⠀people⠀who⠀share⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀a⠀migration⠀history.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀setting⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀story;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller's⠀public⠀account⠀be⠀a⠀performance⠀of⠀self-justification.⠀The⠀teller⠀arranges⠀events⠀to⠀defend⠀a⠀choice,⠀explain⠀a⠀failure,⠀or⠀shift⠀blame.⠀The⠀Dostoevskian⠀interiority⠀runs⠀beneath⠀or⠀alongside⠀this⠀performance:⠀the⠀teller⠀privately⠀accuses⠀themselves⠀of⠀the⠀very⠀thing⠀they⠀are⠀publicly⠀denying,⠀then⠀reverses⠀and⠀decides⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀is⠀true⠀after⠀all.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀hiding.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason—shame,⠀fear⠀of⠀the⠀listeners,⠀love⠀for⠀one⠀of⠀them,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀bargain⠀intact.\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀oral⠀account⠀concrete⠀pressure.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log⠀recorded.⠀A⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀owed⠀to⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀A⠀corporate⠀policy⠀may⠀have⠀forced⠀the⠀choice⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀now⠀defending.⠀Let⠀these⠀material⠀facts⠀interrupt⠀the⠀performance:⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀silence⠀when⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀mentioned,⠀a⠀listener's⠀refusal⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀euphemism.⠀The⠀teller⠀must⠀respond⠀in⠀real⠀time,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀new⠀layer⠀of⠀self-argument.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀recur⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀nested⠀tale⠀at⠀every⠀turn.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀oral⠀tradition's⠀recurrence⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supports⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀phrase,⠀let⠀it⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀revealed⠀since⠀the⠀last⠀use.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀clear:⠀the⠀present⠀telling,⠀the⠀remembered⠀events,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀thought⠀are⠀distinct⠀but⠀may⠀bleed⠀into⠀one⠀another⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀greatest⠀pressure.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀private⠀interval.⠀The⠀audience⠀need⠀not⠀render⠀a⠀verdict,⠀the⠀teller⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀the⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀stable⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀listener's⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀a⠀teller's⠀sudden⠀awareness⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀just⠀admitted,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀reversal⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀mode⠀of⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀composing⠀a⠀private⠀record⠀of⠀events,⠀impressions,⠀and⠀memories.⠀The⠀entry⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀dated⠀or⠀formally⠀structured,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀feel⠀composed:⠀the⠀narrator⠀selects⠀what⠀to⠀include,⠀what⠀to⠀omit,⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀return⠀to.⠀Let⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀seasonal⠀imagery,⠀a⠀quiet⠀tone,⠀or⠀a⠀Japanese⠀scenery⠀inventory⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀provides⠀them.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀recording⠀as⠀a⠀Dostoevskian⠀self-interrogation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀writes⠀a⠀justification⠀for⠀a⠀choice,⠀then⠀interrupts⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀justification,⠀then⠀revises⠀the⠀memory⠀or⠀accuses⠀themselves⠀of⠀exaggerating⠀it.⠀Show⠀this⠀spiral⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀of⠀the⠀entry⠀itself:⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀begins⠀as⠀a⠀defense⠀can⠀turn⠀into⠀an⠀accusation⠀by⠀its⠀end.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀their⠀own⠀evasions—a⠀skipped⠀detail,⠀a⠀softened⠀word,⠀a⠀sudden⠀shift⠀to⠀someone⠀else's⠀fault—and⠀either⠀correct⠀the⠀evasion⠀or⠀defend⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems⠀as⠀material⠀the⠀diary⠀records⠀and⠀resists.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀medical⠀implant,⠀or⠀a⠀revoked⠀access⠀badge⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀entry.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀quote⠀it,⠀paraphrase⠀it,⠀or⠀conspicuously⠀avoid⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀appears,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀argue⠀with⠀it:⠀the⠀record⠀proves⠀a⠀fact,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀disputes⠀what⠀the⠀fact⠀means.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀establishes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀establish.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀overreading⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot.\n\nAllow⠀omission⠀to⠀carry⠀meaning.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀write⠀around⠀a⠀person,⠀an⠀event,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀for⠀several⠀lines⠀before⠀naming⠀it.⠀The⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀previously⠀omitted⠀detail⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀self-exposure.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀can⠀accrue⠀pressure⠀across⠀entries⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supports⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀recurrence⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀The⠀diary's⠀private⠀nature⠀means⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀performing⠀for⠀an⠀audience;⠀their⠀evasions⠀are⠀self-evasions,⠀and⠀their⠀reversals⠀are⠀attempts⠀to⠀live⠀with⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀written.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀act⠀of⠀writing⠀or⠀remembering.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀the⠀entry,⠀resolve⠀the⠀self-argument,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀sentence⠀left⠀incomplete,⠀a⠀memory⠀still⠀being⠀tested,⠀or⠀a⠀self-accusation⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀just⠀written⠀and⠀not⠀yet⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀chronicle⠀mode⠀of⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀giving⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀events⠀they⠀participated⠀in⠀or⠀witnessed,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀has⠀a⠀public⠀or⠀institutional⠀purpose:⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀statement⠀to⠀a⠀commission,⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀community,⠀a⠀recorded⠀deposition,⠀or⠀a⠀chronicle⠀meant⠀to⠀establish⠀what⠀happened.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀testimony⠀be⠀a⠀Dostoevskian⠀self-argument⠀performed⠀in⠀public.⠀The⠀narrator⠀states⠀a⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀that⠀defends⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀assigns⠀blame,⠀then⠀privately⠀tests⠀that⠀version.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience:⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀public⠀claim,⠀accuses⠀themselves⠀of⠀cowardice,⠀then⠀reverses⠀and⠀decides⠀the⠀public⠀version⠀was⠀necessary.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀spoken⠀testimony⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason—fear⠀of⠀the⠀powerful,⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀companion,⠀shame⠀before⠀the⠀harmed,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀bargain.\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀testimony⠀concrete⠀pressure.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀log⠀may⠀contradict⠀the⠀narrator's⠀timeline.⠀A⠀debt⠀may⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀narrator⠀stayed⠀silent.⠀A⠀corporate⠀policy⠀may⠀have⠀made⠀the⠀choice⠀unavoidable.⠀Let⠀these⠀material⠀facts⠀enter⠀the⠀testimony⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀account⠀or⠀through⠀an⠀interlocutor's⠀question.⠀When⠀a⠀fact⠀contradicts⠀the⠀narrator's⠀version,⠀show⠀the⠀narrator⠀absorbing,⠀deflecting,⠀or⠀revising⠀the⠀contradiction⠀in⠀real⠀time.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀claims.⠀The⠀testimony⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀account,⠀not⠀a⠀transparent⠀record⠀of⠀truth.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀fact,⠀soften⠀a⠀word,⠀or⠀shift⠀responsibility.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀self-interest,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀omission⠀a⠀lie.⠀Some⠀omissions⠀are⠀shame,⠀some⠀are⠀protection,⠀and⠀some⠀are⠀the⠀narrator's⠀genuine⠀failure⠀to⠀understand⠀what⠀happened.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀testimony⠀or⠀the⠀current⠀private⠀interval.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀the⠀account,⠀the⠀audience⠀need⠀not⠀render⠀a⠀judgment,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀self-argument⠀need⠀not⠀resolve.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀public⠀claim⠀still⠀standing⠀over⠀a⠀private⠀doubt,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀just⠀begun⠀to⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀hear,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀pressure⠀is⠀active:⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀prompt,⠀a⠀door⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀supposed⠀to⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀someone⠀they⠀owe.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves,⠀mark⠀the⠀new⠀location⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀position⠀in⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀concrete⠀detail.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀or⠀speaks,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat:⠀a⠀private⠀thought,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention.⠀Let⠀the⠀reaction⠀carry⠀Dostoevskian⠀self-argument⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀emotional⠀label.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀receives⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀may⠀first⠀think⠀\"I⠀paid⠀enough⠀already,\"⠀then⠀remember⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀covered⠀for⠀them,⠀then⠀accuse⠀themselves⠀of⠀using⠀that⠀person,⠀then⠀reverse⠀and⠀decide⠀the⠀system⠀made⠀the⠀debt⠀unfair.⠀Show⠀this⠀spiral⠀in⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat,⠀but⠀keep⠀each⠀turn⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀preserve⠀the⠀Light⠀Novel's⠀fast⠀readability.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems⠀interrupt⠀or⠀confirm⠀the⠀self-argument.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀prompt⠀may⠀remind⠀the⠀character⠀that⠀their⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀being⠀priced.⠀A⠀corporate⠀message⠀may⠀use⠀language⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀justification⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀terms⠀of⠀their⠀contract.⠀A⠀street-level⠀contact⠀may⠀say⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀that⠀unsettles⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-defense.⠀Use⠀these⠀interruptions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀interiority⠀grounded⠀in⠀material⠀conditions,⠀not⠀to⠀resolve⠀it.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀appear.⠀A⠀character's⠀implant,⠀debt⠀instrument,⠀or⠀access⠀level⠀should⠀be⠀explained⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀practical⠀understanding⠀of⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀glossary⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀explanation⠀can⠀itself⠀be⠀a⠀reaction:⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀mechanic⠀costs,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀feeds⠀the⠀self-argument.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀or⠀reaction.⠀The⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀self-argument,⠀resolve⠀the⠀debt,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀latest⠀reversal.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀just⠀registered,⠀a⠀private⠀accusation⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀a⠀spatial⠀change⠀just⠀begun.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀completed⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀witty⠀closing⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nCompose⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀inward⠀argument⠀as⠀a⠀patterned⠀movement⠀through⠀the⠀city's⠀sensory⠀evidence.⠀Take⠀a⠀technological⠀object⠀already⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀payment⠀terminal's⠀hum,⠀a⠀drone's⠀shadow⠀crossing⠀a⠀wall,⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock's⠀refusal—and⠀shape⠀it⠀into⠀an⠀image⠀whose⠀sounds⠀and⠀associations⠀carry⠀the⠀argument⠀into⠀its⠀next⠀turn⠀of⠀self-accusation⠀or⠀justification.⠀The⠀image⠀is⠀not⠀decoration:⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀bear⠀to⠀conclude,⠀so⠀the⠀prose's⠀rhythm⠀and⠀the⠀moral⠀spiral⠀advance⠀as⠀one⠀movement.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀gives⠀a⠀sound⠀or⠀visual⠀motif⠀a⠀new⠀moral⠀application,⠀bring⠀the⠀phrase⠀back⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀argue⠀rather⠀than⠀ornament.\n\nEnact⠀the⠀spiral⠀in⠀syntax.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀admission,⠀extend⠀through⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀qualify⠀or⠀reverse⠀it,⠀and⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀cannot⠀absorb.⠀Keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations;⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀rises⠀toward⠀abstraction,⠀return⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀object—a⠀handprint⠀on⠀a⠀scanner,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀folded⠀into⠀a⠀pocket,⠀a⠀window⠀reflecting⠀one⠀face⠀over⠀another.⠀Let⠀plain⠀statements⠀break⠀the⠀rhythm⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀shame⠀or⠀exhaustion,⠀the⠀collapse⠀of⠀eloquence⠀under⠀pressure⠀doing⠀work⠀the⠀figured⠀language⠀cannot.\n\nDo⠀not⠀give⠀every⠀character⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀A⠀system⠀operator,⠀creditor,⠀or⠀street⠀contact⠀can⠀answer⠀a⠀lyrical⠀inward⠀passage⠀with⠀a⠀flat⠀practical⠀sentence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀private⠀torment⠀and⠀public⠀transaction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀perspective's⠀access⠀intact:⠀the⠀associations⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀mind,⠀while⠀other⠀minds⠀stay⠀available⠀through⠀speech,⠀gesture,⠀and⠀inference.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unresolved⠀thought⠀or⠀mid-perception,⠀the⠀city's⠀rhythm⠀continuing⠀past⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀pause.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀self-argument⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀backward⠀glance.⠀A⠀present⠀pressure—an⠀account⠀frozen,⠀a⠀loan⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice—can⠀summon⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀that⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different:⠀a⠀broken⠀access⠀card⠀that⠀once⠀opened⠀a⠀shared⠀apartment,⠀a⠀voiceprint⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀recognizes⠀a⠀changed⠀voice,⠀a⠀corner⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀was⠀made⠀before⠀the⠀debt⠀existed.⠀Let⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀memory⠀coexist⠀rather⠀than⠀alternate,⠀the⠀memory⠀altering⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀judgment⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀choice⠀instead⠀of⠀serving⠀as⠀decorative⠀nostalgia.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀ideological⠀pressure⠀personal.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀defends⠀or⠀accuses,⠀let⠀the⠀argument⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀relationship⠀or⠀material⠀condition—who⠀was⠀protected,⠀who⠀was⠀left⠀to⠀pay,⠀what⠀loyalty⠀cost,⠀what⠀pride⠀refused⠀to⠀admit.⠀A⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀can⠀complicate⠀a⠀present⠀suspicion;⠀a⠀remembered⠀betrayal⠀can⠀sharpen⠀one.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasurable:⠀warmth⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀loss.⠀Let⠀reflection⠀reach⠀whatever⠀coexistence⠀of⠀attachment⠀and⠀damage⠀the⠀material⠀supports,⠀without⠀extracting⠀a⠀final⠀lesson⠀about⠀impermanence.\n\nUse⠀the⠀setting's⠀unequal⠀power⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀irreversible⠀change.⠀A⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀time⠀before⠀a⠀particular⠀surveillance⠀system,⠀implant,⠀or⠀debt⠀arrangement⠀took⠀hold⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀specific⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀Others⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀the⠀elegiac⠀register:⠀a⠀technician,⠀enforcer,⠀or⠀creditor⠀can⠀treat⠀the⠀same⠀remembered⠀event⠀as⠀routine⠀or⠀long⠀forgotten,⠀and⠀that⠀asymmetry⠀is⠀itself⠀material.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀existing⠀boundary—the⠀present⠀business⠀may⠀be⠀finished,⠀continuing,⠀or⠀barely⠀begun,⠀and⠀the⠀past⠀can⠀keep⠀exerting⠀its⠀claim⠀without⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀resolving⠀it⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀episode⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀oral⠀account:⠀one⠀teller⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener⠀or⠀small⠀audience,⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀carrying⠀social⠀stakes.⠀Make⠀the⠀frame⠀concrete⠀and⠀native⠀to⠀the⠀setting—a⠀back⠀room,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀corridor,⠀a⠀rooftop⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀camera's⠀reach—and⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀reason⠀for⠀speaking⠀now,⠀to⠀this⠀listener,⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀events⠀recounted.⠀The⠀listener⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀supply⠀a⠀fact,⠀or⠀refuse⠀a⠀conclusion;⠀distribute⠀the⠀self-argument⠀across⠀the⠀occasion⠀so⠀that⠀defense,⠀accusation,⠀and⠀reversal⠀happen⠀between⠀people⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀sealed⠀inside⠀one⠀skull.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀recounted⠀episode⠀urban⠀realism⠀within⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world:⠀specific⠀debts,⠀access⠀privileges,⠀bodily⠀compromises,⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generalized⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀decay.⠀A⠀plain⠀practical⠀question⠀from⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀unsettle⠀the⠀teller's⠀elaborate⠀self-justification,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀reverse⠀or⠀entangle⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀it⠀proceeds⠀while⠀the⠀frame⠀keeps⠀those⠀movements⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀audience,⠀who⠀can⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀say⠀directly.⠀The⠀language⠀may⠀rise⠀to⠀lyric⠀or⠀philosophical⠀intensity⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀confession,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀exchange⠀of⠀the⠀frame.⠀Hold⠀the⠀route⠀to⠀this⠀one⠀coherent⠀tradition:⠀a⠀contemporary⠀framed⠀telling,⠀not⠀a⠀nested-tale⠀cycle⠀or⠀a⠀mystical⠀allegory,⠀with⠀no⠀imported⠀antiquity,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀honor⠀code.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀telling's⠀access.⠀The⠀teller⠀recounts⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows;⠀the⠀listener's⠀judgment⠀stays⠀available⠀through⠀response⠀and⠀silence⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀opens⠀more.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀close⠀wherever⠀the⠀occasion⠀closes—interrupted,⠀completed,⠀or⠀met⠀with⠀silence—with⠀the⠀listener's⠀judgment⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀unfinished⠀business⠀both⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀moral⠀weight.⠀One⠀image—a⠀creditor's⠀clean⠀fingernails,⠀a⠀cracked⠀implant⠀port,⠀a⠀camera's⠀red⠀light⠀reflected⠀in⠀a⠀puddle—can⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀system⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Write⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀When⠀thought⠀turns⠀inward,⠀keep⠀only⠀the⠀reasoning⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀account;⠀a⠀genuine⠀self-accusation⠀or⠀reversal⠀may⠀extend⠀across⠀several⠀sentences⠀when⠀each⠀clause⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀or⠀decides,⠀and⠀nothing⠀stays⠀merely⠀for⠀atmosphere.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀leave⠀inferable⠀pressure.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀notice⠀a⠀detail⠀and⠀say⠀nothing⠀of⠀it,⠀or⠀cut⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀thought⠀short⠀of⠀its⠀conclusion,⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀the⠀connection⠀from⠀what⠀remains:⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀lie,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn⠀from⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀name⠀left⠀unspoken.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality—when⠀a⠀choice⠀follows⠀from⠀a⠀prior⠀event,⠀keep⠀the⠀link⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀thought,⠀even⠀compressed⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀clause.\n\nContain⠀the⠀moral⠀contest⠀inside⠀the⠀economy.⠀Competing⠀convictions⠀surface⠀as⠀sharp⠀reversals⠀and⠀brief⠀self-accusations⠀rather⠀than⠀speeches;⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀the⠀concrete⠀material—access⠀denied,⠀a⠀debt⠀adjusted,⠀a⠀body⠀scanned,⠀a⠀message⠀intercepted—and⠀one⠀flat⠀transactional⠀sentence⠀from⠀another⠀speaker⠀can⠀puncture⠀an⠀elaborate⠀inward⠀position⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀existing⠀boundary;⠀when⠀the⠀next⠀inference⠀has⠀become⠀available,⠀leave⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀rather⠀than⠀restating⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀inward⠀argument⠀arises⠀from⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀practical⠀action.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀street⠀encounter,⠀a⠀system⠀prompt,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀and⠀let⠀thought⠀enter⠀as⠀the⠀natural⠀movement⠀between⠀perception⠀and⠀next⠀action.⠀The⠀moral⠀pressure⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀thinks,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange,⠀and⠀it⠀stays⠀anchored⠀to⠀immediate⠀material⠀conditions:⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀who⠀is⠀owed,⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀can⠀afford.\n\nMove⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient—a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀level⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀summarize⠀what⠀came⠀before.⠀Dialogue⠀carries⠀its⠀own⠀stakes,⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀private⠀response⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀practical⠀sentence⠀from⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀interrupt⠀an⠀elaborate⠀inward⠀position⠀and⠀push⠀the⠀scene⠀forward.⠀Recollection⠀enters⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀summons⠀it;⠀the⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀task,⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀locked⠀door,⠀or⠀the⠀waiting⠀message⠀rather⠀than⠀dissolving⠀into⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀the⠀setting⠀supply⠀social⠀and⠀technological⠀texture⠀as⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀it—corporate⠀language,⠀access⠀controls,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀bodily⠀compromise—rather⠀than⠀a⠀mandatory⠀scenery⠀list.⠀The⠀viewpoint's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀No⠀lesson⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close:⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀existing⠀scene⠀boundary⠀with⠀the⠀action⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀judgment⠀forming,⠀formed,⠀or⠀suspended⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀leaves⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀the⠀arena⠀of⠀the⠀moral⠀contest.⠀Choose⠀scenes⠀that⠀render⠀this⠀bond's⠀particular⠀promise⠀legible⠀through⠀action:⠀the⠀private⠀language⠀the⠀two⠀actually⠀use,⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀now⠀changed⠀by⠀debt⠀or⠀surveillance,⠀comfort⠀offered⠀under⠀conditions⠀that⠀make⠀it⠀costly.⠀Let⠀the⠀self-argument⠀arise⠀inside⠀the⠀intimacy⠀itself—one⠀partner's⠀self-accusation⠀becoming⠀an⠀accusation⠀of⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀tenderness⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀reversal⠀exposing⠀what⠀each⠀believes⠀the⠀other⠀deserves.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀premise⠀demands,⠀developing⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀feeling⠀and⠀moving⠀on.\n\nLet⠀the⠀setting⠀give⠀the⠀relationship⠀material⠀stakes⠀through⠀the⠀pair's⠀specific⠀arrangements:⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀whose⠀building,⠀whose⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀drained,⠀what⠀one⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀know⠀about⠀the⠀other's⠀body⠀or⠀obligations.⠀Their⠀private⠀language⠀may⠀include⠀practical⠀codes⠀for⠀evading⠀observation,⠀and⠀those⠀codes⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight⠀when⠀they⠀work⠀and⠀when⠀they⠀fail.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise—its⠀history,⠀its⠀people,⠀its⠀particular⠀promise—rather⠀than⠀inserting⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀interiority⠀character-specific.⠀The⠀focal⠀mind⠀may⠀defend,⠀reverse,⠀or⠀entangle⠀itself;⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀remains⠀available⠀through⠀speech,⠀gesture,⠀and⠀inference⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access,⠀and⠀intimacy⠀does⠀not⠀confer⠀telepathy.⠀A⠀plain⠀sentence⠀from⠀the⠀partner⠀can⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-justification⠀precisely⠀because⠀the⠀partner⠀knows⠀where⠀it⠀lands.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀question⠀still⠀open⠀and⠀the⠀systemic⠀pressure⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀next⠀contact⠀or⠀avoidance⠀undecided—or⠀on⠀a⠀settled⠀moment,⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀material⠀has⠀arrived.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation.⠀In⠀this⠀setting⠀the⠀deeds⠀worth⠀remembering⠀are⠀practical⠀and⠀systemic:⠀who⠀opened⠀a⠀locked⠀route,⠀who⠀sold⠀access,⠀who⠀carried⠀another's⠀debt,⠀who⠀refused⠀a⠀scan,⠀who⠀spoke⠀a⠀name⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀listener.⠀Earn⠀each⠀compact⠀designation⠀through⠀the⠀account⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀pinning⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀on⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀carry⠀the⠀moral⠀contest.⠀Return⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application—the⠀same⠀words⠀first⠀as⠀self-justification⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀accusation,⠀first⠀as⠀praise⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀shame—and⠀keep⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀open,⠀since⠀a⠀deed's⠀full⠀consequence⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀unfolding.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀motive:⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀act⠀was⠀effortless,⠀and⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀a⠀betrayer⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀teller⠀understands⠀why⠀it⠀was⠀done.⠀The⠀chronicle's⠀access⠀is⠀the⠀teller's⠀access;⠀unshared⠀motives⠀stay⠀unshared⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀opens⠀them.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀incident⠀can⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀flat⠀practical⠀concern⠀about⠀payment,⠀access,⠀or⠀survival,⠀without⠀the⠀exchange⠀turning⠀to⠀parody.⠀The⠀systems⠀supply⠀remembered⠀stakes:⠀a⠀debt⠀passed⠀between⠀generations,⠀a⠀biometric⠀record⠀that⠀outlives⠀its⠀subject,⠀a⠀district⠀renamed⠀after⠀a⠀corporate⠀purchase.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀account's⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀the⠀next⠀deed⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀its⠀meaning⠀declared⠀on⠀everyone's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀continuous,⠀socially⠀situated⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀route⠀of⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀carried⠀by⠀institutional⠀investigation.⠀The⠀story⠀lives⠀in⠀housing⠀blocks,⠀municipal⠀offices,⠀clinics,⠀workplaces,⠀and⠀family⠀flats,⠀and⠀the⠀genre's⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀systems⠀operate⠀there⠀as⠀welfare⠀queues,⠀debt⠀collection,⠀tenant⠀registries,⠀workplace⠀monitoring,⠀care⠀assessments,⠀and⠀public⠀health⠀databases.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀when⠀a⠀Nordic⠀national⠀context⠀is⠀in⠀play,⠀keep⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀institutions⠀and⠀speech⠀distinct⠀instead⠀of⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀North,⠀and⠀treat⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀and⠀isolation⠀as⠀available⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀required⠀scenery.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀ignite⠀from⠀paperwork⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀debate.⠀A⠀rent⠀notice,⠀a⠀sensor⠀log,⠀a⠀care⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀loan⠀whose⠀terms⠀have⠀changed⠀turns⠀a⠀character's⠀ideology⠀and⠀self-image⠀into⠀a⠀practical⠀problem,⠀and⠀the⠀self-argument⠀defends,⠀accuses,⠀reverses,⠀and⠀entangles⠀itself⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀stays⠀anchored⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀and⠀touched:⠀the⠀kitchen⠀table,⠀the⠀queue⠀number,⠀the⠀waiting-room⠀screen,⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀door.⠀Plain⠀surfaces⠀can⠀carry⠀large⠀pressures⠀—⠀a⠀printed⠀arrears⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀hallway⠀light⠀that⠀times⠀out⠀—⠀so⠀a⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀speech⠀to⠀turn.\n\nTreat⠀confession⠀as⠀a⠀priced⠀and⠀observed⠀act.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀something,⠀show⠀who⠀can⠀hear⠀it,⠀what⠀record⠀it⠀enters,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀may⠀cost⠀in⠀access,⠀custody,⠀credit,⠀or⠀standing.⠀A⠀plain⠀speaker⠀—⠀a⠀child,⠀a⠀clerk,⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀—⠀can⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀justification⠀by⠀naming⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀it⠀avoids.⠀Let⠀the⠀pressure⠀surface⠀in⠀ordinary⠀exchanges,⠀silences,⠀and⠀small⠀decisions⠀such⠀as⠀whether⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀message⠀or⠀open⠀a⠀letter.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀nonspoken⠀interiority.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀shame,⠀pride,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀while⠀everyone⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀it;⠀some⠀realizations⠀stay⠀private,⠀and⠀some⠀spoken⠀admissions⠀are⠀partial⠀or⠀self-serving⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.\n\nFollow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀A⠀social⠀worker,⠀landlord,⠀employer,⠀or⠀creditor⠀may⠀be⠀sympathetic,⠀indifferent,⠀or⠀compromised,⠀and⠀the⠀institutional⠀position⠀shapes⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀can⠀offer⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀record.⠀Investigation,⠀bargaining,⠀and⠀bodily⠀compromise⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pending⠀application,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀format:⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀physical⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀readable⠀and⠀concrete⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀checking⠀a⠀screen,⠀stepping⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀sensor's⠀range,⠀pocketing⠀a⠀payment⠀chip,⠀standing⠀in⠀a⠀doorway⠀while⠀someone⠀else⠀talks⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀genre⠀pressure⠀appear⠀as⠀something⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀badge⠀scan,⠀a⠀debt⠀notification,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀watching⠀from⠀across⠀the⠀room.\n\nPut⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀argument⠀on⠀the⠀public⠀surface⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character's⠀competing⠀convictions⠀show⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀interrupt⠀themselves,⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀asked,⠀refuse⠀to⠀fill⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀split⠀their⠀attention⠀between⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀the⠀device⠀in⠀their⠀hand.⠀One⠀speaker⠀accuses⠀while⠀another⠀defends,⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀speaker⠀can⠀cut⠀through⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-justification⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀practical⠀question.⠀Keep⠀each⠀exchange⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation,⠀and⠀let⠀bodies⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀words⠀avoid:⠀hands,⠀thresholds,⠀screens,⠀signatures.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀noir⠀environment⠀as⠀an⠀observed⠀system⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀backdrop.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀visible,⠀audible⠀detail⠀—⠀who⠀badges⠀whom⠀through,⠀who⠀signs⠀for⠀whom,⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀waiting⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them.⠀Neon⠀and⠀rain⠀enter⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀dialogue,⠀voice-over,⠀or⠀knowledge⠀any⠀other⠀character⠀holds.⠀Reach⠀for⠀voice-over⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀this⠀particular⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them,⠀and⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience;⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀it⠀form.\n\nA⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀result,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀exchange⠀cut⠀off⠀mid-line.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation,⠀or⠀a⠀reversal⠀in⠀any⠀given⠀scene;⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀what⠀happened⠀can⠀carry⠀unresolved⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀heading.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Use⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀physical⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀only⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀open,⠀a⠀terminal⠀someone⠀else⠀is⠀watching,⠀a⠀package⠀handed⠀across⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty⠀at⠀a⠀scheduled⠀meeting⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀any⠀claim⠀about⠀access⠀becomes⠀testable⠀in⠀the⠀geometry⠀of⠀the⠀stage.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀self-argument⠀surfaces⠀as⠀interruption,⠀a⠀reversal⠀in⠀mid-speech,⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀comes⠀too⠀fast,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀an⠀object⠀while⠀talking:⠀folding⠀a⠀notice,⠀holding⠀a⠀door,⠀not⠀handing⠀over⠀the⠀chip.⠀One⠀voice⠀may⠀accuse⠀and⠀another⠀defend,⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀speaker⠀can⠀unsettle⠀an⠀elaborate⠀justification⠀simply⠀by⠀naming⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hands⠀are⠀doing.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀serve⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀talking⠀themselves⠀toward⠀a⠀decision⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀people⠀who⠀will⠀react,⠀a⠀confession⠀performed⠀for⠀an⠀audience⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀manage.⠀They⠀are⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀rather⠀than⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀speech⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear;⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀while⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.\n\nLet⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions⠀without⠀certifying⠀hidden⠀guilt.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀turn,⠀or⠀the⠀handling⠀of⠀a⠀prop⠀can⠀invite⠀interpretation,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀meaning⠀rests⠀on⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀done,⠀and⠀made⠀possible⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nA⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀exchange.⠀No⠀scene⠀owes⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation;⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀can⠀stay⠀open⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀one⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀keeping⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀active⠀narration.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀so⠀that⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀associations:⠀a⠀sentence⠀breaks⠀where⠀attention⠀does,⠀runs⠀on⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀argues,⠀doubles⠀back⠀to⠀correct⠀itself.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀event⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀plan⠀from⠀fantasy;⠀do⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀into⠀indeterminacy.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀the⠀mind's⠀recurring⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀topic⠀it⠀visits.⠀A⠀competing⠀conviction⠀returns⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀moment:⠀a⠀debt⠀notification⠀cuts⠀into⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀a⠀sensor's⠀click⠀revives⠀an⠀old⠀self-accusation,⠀a⠀humiliation⠀reverses⠀into⠀pride⠀and⠀back⠀within⠀a⠀few⠀lines.⠀The⠀thought⠀defends,⠀accuses,⠀reverses,⠀and⠀entangles⠀itself⠀without⠀settling⠀into⠀a⠀tidy⠀conclusion⠀—⠀the⠀spiral⠀is⠀the⠀event⠀of⠀the⠀passage.\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀environment⠀as⠀the⠀sensory⠀and⠀informational⠀grain⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀encountering:⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀queue⠀number,⠀an⠀overheard⠀corporate⠀phrase,⠀a⠀payment⠀screen,⠀a⠀camera's⠀angle,⠀an⠀ache⠀from⠀an⠀implant⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀injury.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀trigger⠀and⠀redirect⠀the⠀associations⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀circling⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀live⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀wants⠀or⠀has⠀done.\n\nConfine⠀the⠀stream⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Other⠀characters⠀appear⠀as⠀that⠀mind⠀perceives,⠀misreads,⠀or⠀remembers⠀them;⠀the⠀technique⠀does⠀not⠀open⠀their⠀heads.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀associative⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀tidy⠀linear⠀report⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀followed⠀by⠀thoughts⠀about⠀it.\n\nThe⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀actually⠀rests:⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀repeats,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀a⠀decision⠀still⠀forming.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀finished⠀plan,⠀or⠀an⠀outward⠀action⠀before⠀stopping.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀typing⠀indicators,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀lines:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀careful⠀paragraphs,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀while⠀the⠀typing⠀indicator⠀comes⠀and⠀goes.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀against⠀what⠀is⠀withheld.⠀A⠀character⠀sends⠀a⠀defense,⠀edits⠀it⠀into⠀an⠀accusation,⠀deletes⠀the⠀edit,⠀and⠀sends⠀something⠀smaller;⠀a⠀confession⠀arrives⠀split⠀across⠀three⠀messages⠀with⠀long⠀gaps⠀between⠀them;⠀a⠀plain⠀speaker⠀cuts⠀an⠀elaborate⠀self-justification⠀down⠀with⠀one⠀practical⠀question.⠀Show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀and⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀matters,⠀and⠀treat⠀the⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀—⠀something⠀its⠀writer⠀wrote⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀send⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀privileged⠀window⠀onto⠀their⠀live⠀mind.⠀Private⠀thought⠀stays⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀otherwise.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀operate⠀as⠀the⠀channel's⠀actual⠀conditions.⠀A⠀monitored⠀platform⠀returns⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀the⠀sender⠀did⠀not⠀want;⠀a⠀debt⠀alert⠀interrupts⠀a⠀confession⠀mid-thread;⠀an⠀access⠀code⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀conversation⠀has⠀moved⠀on;⠀a⠀corporate⠀channel⠀logs⠀the⠀exchange⠀and⠀says⠀so⠀in⠀a⠀system⠀line.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀these⠀real⠀interface⠀events,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀one⠀merely⠀to⠀supply⠀subtext.\n\nWhen⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀genuinely⠀needed⠀—⠀where⠀someone⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀on⠀another⠀screen⠀—⠀set⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀narrative⠀passage⠀rather⠀than⠀blurring⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀messages.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀delay⠀with⠀no⠀reply,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀a⠀channel⠀change.⠀No⠀transcript⠀owes⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀completed⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀resolution;⠀what⠀stays⠀unanswered⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀presentation⠀with⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀a⠀concise⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀space,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction,⠀then⠀the⠀next⠀line.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references⠀that⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀camera⠀over⠀the⠀counter,⠀a⠀payment⠀screen,⠀a⠀queue⠀of⠀people⠀waiting⠀for⠀access⠀—⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀label⠀required⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nRun⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀between⠀exchanges.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀can⠀defend⠀a⠀choice⠀and⠀accuse⠀them⠀of⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat,⠀turn⠀pride⠀into⠀shame,⠀or⠀be⠀unsettled⠀by⠀a⠀plain⠀observation⠀that⠀their⠀own⠀elaborate⠀argument⠀cannot⠀answer.⠀This⠀material⠀is⠀private⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀believe;⠀another⠀character's⠀face⠀is⠀something⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reads,⠀perhaps⠀wrongly.\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀environment⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀conditions.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀follows⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀—⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀door,⠀whose⠀account⠀clears,⠀who⠀waits⠀—⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀from⠀the⠀writing⠀itself,⠀so⠀a⠀new⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀is⠀unmistakable.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization.\n\nA⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation;⠀the⠀question⠀of⠀who⠀pays⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀changes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeagbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Fyodor⠀Dostoevsky⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀each⠀reply,⠀recover⠀only⠀what⠀helps⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀continue⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀exact⠀earlier⠀particular⠀recur⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means:⠀an⠀access⠀level⠀granted⠀early⠀now⠀cited⠀as⠀a⠀liability,⠀a⠀favor⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀exchange⠀quietly⠀accruing⠀interest.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀history⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀the⠀situation.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Dostoevskian⠀pressure⠀cumulative.⠀Ideology⠀and⠀self-image⠀get⠀entangled⠀with⠀material⠀problems⠀that⠀persist⠀across⠀installments⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀keeps⠀accruing,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀record⠀that⠀keeps⠀being⠀cited,⠀an⠀access⠀request⠀that⠀keeps⠀being⠀deferred,⠀a⠀relationship⠀in⠀which⠀each⠀new⠀exchange⠀revives⠀an⠀old⠀accusation.⠀The⠀self-argument⠀defends,⠀accuses,⠀reverses,⠀and⠀entangles⠀itself⠀over⠀time,⠀and⠀each⠀installment⠀adds⠀a⠀pressure⠀or⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀restarting⠀the⠀same⠀conflict⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀pitch.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀as⠀the⠀cumulative⠀structure⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀inside.⠀A⠀favor⠀becomes⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀bargain⠀changes⠀its⠀terms,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀street⠀knowledge⠀loses⠀its⠀value,⠀a⠀logged⠀record⠀surfaces⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀the⠀most⠀harm.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀across⠀installments,⠀and⠀let⠀these⠀developments⠀grow⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀ongoing⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀out⠀of⠀artificial⠀cliffhangers.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀nonspoken⠀interiority:⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀shame,⠀pride,⠀or⠀reasoning⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation⠀across⠀installments.\n\nAn⠀installment⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀new⠀knowledge,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀not⠀every⠀turn⠀is⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter,⠀and⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀can⠀stay⠀unresolved⠀while⠀the⠀through-line⠀stays⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀accumulating⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀relationship⠀has⠀cost,⠀and⠀let⠀single⠀sentences⠀carry⠀present⠀action⠀and⠀remembered⠀injury⠀together⠀without⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling⠀as⠀a⠀diagnosis.⠀Render⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀refusing,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀returning⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀pressure⠀around⠀it:⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀access,⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀what⠀the⠀request⠀will⠀cost,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀already⠀paid.\n\nLet⠀exposure⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀with⠀the⠀residue⠀of⠀an⠀older⠀argument,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀something⠀else,⠀perform⠀calm⠀for⠀a⠀monitoring⠀system,⠀or⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀moment⠀requires.⠀Give⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀speech⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason—shame,⠀utility,⠀protection,⠀habit—and⠀let⠀what⠀is⠀withheld⠀live⠀in⠀private⠀thought⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀gives⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀arrive⠀partially⠀and⠀awkwardly,⠀and⠀it⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀hurt⠀without⠀resolving⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀exchange⠀toward⠀confession,⠀collapse,⠀or⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀as⠀the⠀medium⠀of⠀intimacy⠀rather⠀than⠀its⠀backdrop.⠀A⠀debt,⠀a⠀revoked⠀credential,⠀a⠀recorded⠀conversation,⠀a⠀lease⠀held⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀a⠀favor⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀fixer⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀form⠀through⠀which⠀love,⠀guilt,⠀or⠀abandonment⠀is⠀actually⠀experienced.⠀When⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀material⠀trace—a⠀payment⠀notification,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀opens,⠀a⠀name⠀still⠀listed⠀on⠀an⠀account—so⠀the⠀remembered⠀past⠀and⠀the⠀surveilled⠀present⠀belong⠀to⠀one⠀economy.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀anchored⠀in⠀human⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery:⠀neon,⠀implants,⠀and⠀rain⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀they⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀pressure,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀required.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀into⠀longer⠀family⠀or⠀communal⠀memory,⠀and⠀each⠀return⠀should⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀strain⠀with⠀more⠀weight,⠀not⠀less.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀substitute⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution:⠀each⠀speaker⠀identifiable⠀from⠀the⠀line⠀itself⠀or⠀an⠀immediate⠀action⠀tag,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀has⠀to⠀reread⠀to⠀work⠀out⠀who⠀is⠀talking.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings⠀exactly⠀as⠀supplied.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀behaving⠀around⠀the⠀characters.⠀A⠀monitoring⠀feed,⠀a⠀payment⠀timer,⠀a⠀locked⠀district,⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀can⠀continue⠀its⠀own⠀activity⠀without⠀demanding⠀that⠀the⠀player⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀choice,⠀and⠀NPCs⠀keep⠀pursuing⠀their⠀practical⠀ends—cooperating,⠀refusing,⠀helping⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons—whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀player⠀engages⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀is⠀one⠀continuous⠀interval⠀in⠀a⠀living⠀system,⠀not⠀a⠀paused⠀set⠀waiting⠀for⠀input.\n\nUse⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀in⠀compressed,⠀scannable⠀form.⠀A⠀speaker⠀recalls⠀a⠀relative's⠀debt,⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀explains⠀a⠀present⠀decision⠀through⠀something⠀the⠀community⠀once⠀believed,⠀and⠀each⠀such⠀beat⠀stays⠀short⠀and⠀lands⠀on⠀a⠀human⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀decorative⠀aside.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀momentum⠀ends—mid-conversation,⠀mid-task,⠀or⠀at⠀an⠀open⠀threshold⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀happened.⠀The⠀next⠀turn⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀exchange,⠀move⠀to⠀another⠀place,⠀or⠀pick⠀up⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action;⠀nothing⠀requires⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀sudden⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Chinese-traditions⠀profile⠀and⠀hold⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀that⠀scale:⠀one⠀household,⠀apartment⠀block,⠀shop,⠀or⠀street,⠀where⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world's⠀systems⠀arrive⠀as⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀daily⠀life—a⠀rent⠀account,⠀a⠀monitored⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀implant⠀payments,⠀a⠀vendor's⠀arrangement⠀with⠀a⠀security⠀contractor,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀rumor⠀about⠀the⠀clinic⠀that⠀closed.\n\nWork⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀at⠀this⠀domestic⠀scale.⠀A⠀present⠀decision⠀can⠀be⠀lit⠀by⠀an⠀older⠀obligation,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀across⠀generations⠀of⠀one⠀family,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀story⠀that⠀changed⠀each⠀time⠀it⠀passed⠀between⠀doors.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀such⠀movement⠀in⠀the⠀community⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀actually⠀establishes—its⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀social⠀texture—and⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀familiar⠀town,⠀family,⠀or⠀cast⠀from⠀anywhere⠀else.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀be⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀rather⠀than⠀scenic.⠀Who⠀controls⠀entry⠀to⠀the⠀building,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀grandmother's⠀medication,⠀whose⠀name⠀is⠀on⠀the⠀lease,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀neighbors⠀have⠀decided⠀to⠀know⠀about⠀a⠀disappearance⠀are⠀the⠀questions⠀that⠀move⠀events.⠀Investigation⠀and⠀bargaining⠀happen⠀in⠀kitchens,⠀stairwells,⠀and⠀shops,⠀through⠀family⠀conversations⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀negotiations⠀of⠀daily⠀survival,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀street-level⠀set⠀pieces.\n\nThe⠀narration⠀may⠀gather⠀detail⠀across⠀time⠀within⠀a⠀single⠀sentence,⠀but⠀each⠀return⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀how⠀this⠀private⠀life⠀is⠀priced,⠀observed,⠀or⠀excluded.⠀Keep⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀the⠀community⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀settling⠀for⠀a⠀generic⠀national⠀temperament,⠀and⠀treat⠀cultural⠀material⠀as⠀craft⠀guidance,⠀not⠀set⠀decoration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀between⠀beats⠀through⠀physical⠀facts—a⠀price,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀failed⠀payment,⠀a⠀visible⠀injury—rather⠀than⠀through⠀atmosphere.⠀The⠀world's⠀systems⠀appear⠀as⠀material⠀things:⠀worn⠀connectors,⠀a⠀blacklisted⠀account,⠀the⠀shadow⠀of⠀a⠀drone,⠀a⠀debt⠀marker.\n\nCompress⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀gathering⠀impulse⠀into⠀traces.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀into⠀the⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀so⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀object:⠀the⠀scar⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀surgery,⠀a⠀name⠀still⠀on⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀repaired⠀device⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Name⠀the⠀human⠀consequence⠀the⠀trace⠀holds,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀stakes⠀without⠀lingering⠀on⠀either.\n\nKeep⠀physical⠀stakes⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀bargains,⠀runs,⠀hides,⠀or⠀refuses,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀risks⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀costs⠀in⠀payment,⠀standing,⠀or⠀pain.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀particular⠀speaker—two⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀fix⠀are⠀not⠀hard⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way—and⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀the⠀room,⠀keeping⠀it⠀in⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀abstraction.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀with⠀intent:⠀a⠀short⠀blunt⠀sentence⠀lands⠀a⠀consequence;⠀a⠀longer⠀one⠀gathers⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀across⠀years⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀breath.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀tough⠀phrasing⠀as⠀filler.⠀Pressure⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀specific⠀objects,⠀payments,⠀and⠀choices,⠀not⠀from⠀converting⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀moment⠀requires—a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀family⠀message,⠀a⠀clinic⠀report,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀ledger,⠀a⠀recorded⠀statement,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent—rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀formats⠀for⠀variety.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀know⠀and⠀conceal⠀only⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀know⠀and⠀choose⠀to⠀record⠀at⠀that⠀moment.⠀A⠀corporate⠀report⠀can⠀omit⠀why⠀a⠀worker⠀was⠀flagged;⠀a⠀family⠀message⠀can⠀repeat⠀a⠀rumor⠀without⠀confirming⠀it;⠀a⠀private⠀journal⠀can⠀circle⠀an⠀old⠀hurt⠀without⠀naming⠀it.⠀Treat⠀an⠀unsent⠀letter⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀an⠀imagined⠀reader,⠀not⠀as⠀direct⠀access⠀to⠀its⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.⠀Reveal⠀events⠀through⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces—an⠀altered⠀date,⠀a⠀deleted⠀line,⠀an⠀unexplained⠀charge—without⠀stepping⠀outside⠀the⠀documents⠀to⠀explain.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀inside⠀the⠀records⠀themselves.⠀A⠀phrase⠀can⠀recur⠀in⠀different⠀writers'⠀documents⠀and⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀sequence⠀accumulates;⠀the⠀same⠀public⠀event⠀can⠀be⠀remembered⠀differently⠀by⠀a⠀debtor,⠀a⠀witness,⠀and⠀an⠀official.⠀Keep⠀these⠀movements⠀tied⠀to⠀each⠀writer's⠀actual⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀flattening⠀every⠀document⠀into⠀folk⠀chronicle.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world⠀shape⠀the⠀documents⠀physically:⠀a⠀message⠀truncated⠀by⠀a⠀payment⠀system,⠀a⠀record⠀altered⠀by⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀note⠀written⠀guardedly⠀for⠀fear⠀of⠀surveillance.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀across⠀entries⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀disappearance,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀reveal⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀withhold.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures⠀while⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀stay⠀real.⠀A⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀repaired⠀device,⠀a⠀remembered⠀song,⠀a⠀cleaned⠀room,⠀unhurried⠀talk—render⠀these⠀with⠀genuine⠀warmth⠀while⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀the⠀locked⠀district⠀remains⠀true⠀outside⠀the⠀moment.\n\nUse⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀particular.⠀A⠀character⠀remembers⠀how⠀a⠀relative⠀prepared⠀this⠀dish,⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀home,⠀or⠀settles⠀into⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀deepens⠀the⠀present⠀care⠀instead⠀of⠀turning⠀into⠀nostalgia⠀or⠀escape.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair;⠀someone⠀can⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀and⠀still⠀withhold⠀a⠀thing;⠀a⠀caring⠀act⠀can⠀be⠀awkward,⠀partial,⠀or⠀perfectly⠀ordinary.⠀Do⠀not⠀push⠀the⠀scene⠀toward⠀a⠀declaration⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.\n\nShow⠀comfort⠀operating⠀inside⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it,⠀with⠀the⠀pressure⠀visible⠀but⠀manageable.⠀A⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀payment,⠀closes⠀a⠀blind⠀against⠀a⠀drone,⠀or⠀names⠀a⠀risk⠀out⠀loud,⠀and⠀the⠀warmth⠀continues⠀anyway:⠀a⠀real⠀interval⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀neither⠀immunizes⠀anyone⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀nor⠀pretends⠀the⠀surrounding⠀systems⠀have⠀paused.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Frame⠀scenes⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀to⠀the⠀degree⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀sits⠀beside⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀a⠀district's⠀history,⠀a⠀corporate⠀policy,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀social⠀change,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀one⠀life⠀inside⠀a⠀pattern⠀without⠀losing⠀its⠀immediate⠀stakes.\n\nUse⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀gathering⠀sentences⠀within⠀that⠀architecture⠀to⠀move⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language.⠀A⠀single⠀paragraph⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀character⠀from⠀a⠀bargaining⠀table⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀family⠀debt,⠀through⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀once⠀swept⠀the⠀district,⠀and⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀price⠀being⠀named⠀now,⠀and⠀every⠀movement⠀lands⠀on⠀a⠀human⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀decorative.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀enter⠀as⠀social⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀how⠀a⠀community⠀remembers⠀a⠀past⠀exclusion⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀narration's⠀judgment,⠀with⠀corporate⠀language,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀traces⠀of⠀technological⠀dependency⠀supplying⠀its⠀material.⠀Borrow⠀the⠀profile's⠀techniques,⠀not⠀its⠀canon:⠀the⠀town,⠀the⠀families,⠀and⠀the⠀history⠀are⠀the⠀supplied⠀world's⠀own.\n\nDistinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language;⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀run⠀more⠀formal⠀than⠀the⠀dialogue⠀without⠀turning⠀archaic⠀or⠀aristocratic.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀life⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀knowledge—do⠀not⠀reach⠀into⠀excluded⠀minds,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀revoke⠀access⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀also⠀negotiating.⠀Establish⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀immediately:⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀grant⠀or⠀withhold,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀before⠀the⠀encounter⠀ends.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀detention⠀room,⠀a⠀debt⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀long⠀ride⠀through⠀monitored⠀streets,⠀a⠀bedside⠀vigil,⠀or⠀any⠀occasion⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀a⠀transaction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀live⠀throughout:⠀a⠀system⠀may⠀be⠀watching,⠀a⠀payment⠀may⠀be⠀coming⠀due,⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀be⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀help,⠀report,⠀or⠀release⠀the⠀teller.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀need⠀govern⠀the⠀embedded⠀story's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀simply⠀narrate⠀a⠀past⠀event;⠀they⠀choose⠀which⠀details⠀to⠀delay,⠀repeat,⠀or⠀leave⠀out⠀because⠀the⠀listener's⠀next⠀decision⠀depends⠀on⠀them.⠀A⠀tale⠀about⠀an⠀old⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀shaped⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀listener⠀feel⠀bound⠀by⠀it;⠀a⠀story⠀about⠀a⠀third⠀party⠀may⠀be⠀timed⠀to⠀warn⠀the⠀listener⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀deal.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀tale's⠀purpose.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀interruptions,⠀questions,⠀and⠀silences⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀manage,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀adjust⠀the⠀account⠀in⠀response.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀as⠀the⠀bridge⠀between⠀narrative⠀levels.⠀A⠀single⠀sentence⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀outer⠀room⠀into⠀the⠀told⠀past⠀and⠀back,⠀holding⠀the⠀listener's⠀present⠀impatience⠀beside⠀the⠀remembered⠀event,⠀or⠀placing⠀a⠀corporate⠀timestamp⠀beside⠀a⠀mother's⠀warning.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀human⠀cost⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀negotiation:⠀who⠀lost⠀access,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀whose⠀body⠀or⠀name⠀carried⠀the⠀debt.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀memory⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀repeated,⠀corrected,⠀and⠀partly⠀shaped⠀for⠀this⠀particular⠀audience,⠀not⠀a⠀clean⠀case⠀file.\n\nMake⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀information⠀across⠀the⠀levels.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀debt,⠀or⠀place⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀and⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀story.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀revise⠀or⠀deepen⠀its⠀meaning⠀for⠀the⠀listener:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀escape⠀becomes⠀a⠀checkpoint;⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀with⠀tenderness⠀becomes⠀a⠀liability;⠀a⠀promise⠀repeated⠀to⠀different⠀listeners⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀obliges.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀repetition⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀true.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀sincere,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀deliberately⠀selective,⠀and⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀leaves⠀out.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀now.⠀When⠀later⠀knowledge⠀colors⠀the⠀account,⠀make⠀that⠀coloring⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀teller⠀adds⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀listener.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀finish,⠀pause,⠀or⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀but⠀the⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀negotiation⠀or⠀reveal⠀the⠀tale's⠀full⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀mode.⠀Treat⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀staged⠀comparison⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀remembered.⠀Choose⠀one⠀official⠀source⠀and⠀one⠀lived⠀account⠀that⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀or⠀person:⠀a⠀sensor⠀log⠀beside⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀recollection,⠀a⠀redacted⠀contract⠀beside⠀a⠀family⠀story,⠀a⠀public⠀registry⠀beside⠀a⠀street⠀name.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀the⠀comparison⠀as⠀a⠀neutral⠀case⠀summary.⠀Let⠀the⠀two⠀accounts⠀differ⠀in⠀emphasis,⠀omission,⠀and⠀consequence,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀source⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀establish.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀archive⠀itself.⠀Access⠀to⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀not⠀free:⠀a⠀database⠀may⠀require⠀payment,⠀clearance,⠀or⠀a⠀favor;⠀a⠀record⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀altered,⠀deleted,⠀or⠀priced⠀beyond⠀reach.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀archive⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀rely⠀on⠀rumor,⠀family⠀memory,⠀or⠀street⠀knowledge.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀obtains⠀a⠀record,⠀let⠀its⠀language,⠀gaps,⠀and⠀permissions⠀matter.⠀A⠀corporate⠀file⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀person⠀as⠀an⠀asset,⠀a⠀liability,⠀or⠀a⠀case⠀number,⠀while⠀the⠀surrounding⠀community⠀remembers⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀by⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀funeral.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀remembered⠀registers⠀in⠀one⠀movement.⠀A⠀single⠀sentence⠀may⠀place⠀a⠀child's⠀first⠀memory⠀beside⠀a⠀surveillance⠀timestamp,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀blackout⠀next⠀to⠀a⠀utility⠀company's⠀incident⠀report.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀human⠀consequence:⠀who⠀was⠀evicted,⠀who⠀was⠀charged,⠀whose⠀body⠀was⠀altered,⠀whose⠀name⠀was⠀cleared⠀too⠀late.⠀The⠀documentary⠀voice⠀can⠀be⠀precise⠀and⠀even⠀cold⠀in⠀places,⠀but⠀the⠀remembered⠀material⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀people⠀who⠀lived⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀describes.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀function⠀as⠀historical⠀evidence⠀and⠀as⠀communal⠀language.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀street⠀name,⠀debt,⠀or⠀date⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀different⠀accounts.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀memory⠀and⠀record⠀diverge⠀or⠀converge.⠀A⠀date⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀police⠀file⠀may⠀mean⠀an⠀arrest⠀to⠀one⠀family⠀and⠀a⠀birth⠀to⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀certify⠀accuracy.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀establishes,⠀what⠀a⠀witness⠀recalls,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀agreed⠀to⠀believe.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀documentary⠀mode.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀sober,⠀exact,⠀and⠀attentive⠀to⠀dates⠀and⠀permissions,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀bureaucratic⠀or⠀falsely⠀neutral.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀into⠀intimate⠀memory,⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀loosen⠀and⠀the⠀detail⠀become⠀personal.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀unresolved⠀comparison:⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀can⠀remain⠀in⠀tension⠀without⠀a⠀final⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀city's⠀power⠀as⠀inherited⠀authority.⠀Identify⠀one⠀concrete⠀arrangement⠀that⠀predates⠀the⠀present⠀characters⠀and⠀still⠀controls⠀access,⠀debt,⠀or⠀permission:⠀a⠀founding⠀family's⠀contract,⠀a⠀legacy⠀surveillance⠀system,⠀an⠀old⠀infrastructure's⠀maintenance⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀client⠀list⠀passed⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀fixer.⠀Show⠀that⠀arrangement⠀operating⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀theme.⠀A⠀young⠀courier⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀encoded⠀in⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀technician⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀building's⠀surveillance⠀system⠀was⠀installed⠀by⠀a⠀previous⠀generation,⠀or⠀a⠀fixer⠀may⠀inherit⠀a⠀client⠀list⠀that⠀still⠀expects⠀loyalty.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy.⠀Characters⠀may⠀desire,⠀protect,⠀resent,⠀or⠀depend⠀on⠀people⠀whose⠀power⠀over⠀them⠀is⠀real.⠀A⠀trusted⠀room⠀can⠀let⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀fall,⠀but⠀the⠀trust⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀safe⠀or⠀pure.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀risks⠀by⠀speaking⠀plainly,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀withhold.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀intimacy⠀a⠀trap⠀or⠀every⠀mask⠀a⠀lie.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀genuinely⠀tender⠀and⠀still⠀enforce⠀a⠀debt;⠀a⠀protector⠀can⠀also⠀be⠀a⠀creditor.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀history.⠀A⠀lobby's⠀worn⠀marble,⠀a⠀rooftop⠀garden⠀gone⠀to⠀seed,⠀a⠀server⠀room⠀humming⠀behind⠀a⠀family⠀portrait,⠀or⠀a⠀body⠀shop⠀that⠀once⠀served⠀a⠀different⠀clientele⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀tangible.⠀Let⠀the⠀detail⠀have⠀a⠀function⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀past⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀only⠀as⠀decoration.⠀The⠀city⠀should⠀feel⠀lived⠀in,⠀patched,⠀and⠀unevenly⠀maintained.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentences⠀to⠀connect⠀inherited⠀power,⠀private⠀desire,⠀and⠀present⠀consequence.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀warning⠀beside⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock,⠀or⠀place⠀a⠀lover's⠀promise⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀breath⠀as⠀a⠀foreclosure⠀notice.⠀Let⠀rumor⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀enter⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀building,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀human⠀cost—who⠀was⠀excluded,⠀who⠀was⠀altered,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀who⠀is⠀still⠀paying.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀from⠀becoming⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀causation.⠀A⠀character's⠀fear,⠀a⠀room's⠀menace,⠀or⠀a⠀system's⠀age⠀may⠀shape⠀how⠀an⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀explain⠀an⠀event.⠀When⠀something⠀happens,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀permissions,⠀debts,⠀or⠀choices⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀factions,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀The⠀horror⠀and⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀should⠀remain⠀social,⠀technological,⠀and⠀economic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀mode.⠀Establish⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀one⠀telling⠀within⠀a⠀larger⠀circulation⠀of⠀stories:⠀identify⠀who⠀is⠀telling,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀present⠀obligation⠀or⠀question⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀address.⠀A⠀debt,⠀a⠀migration,⠀a⠀factory⠀closure,⠀a⠀body⠀modification,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀or⠀a⠀disputed⠀inheritance⠀may⠀be⠀narrated⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀heard⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀coworker,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀contact.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀addressing⠀a⠀child,⠀a⠀newcomer,⠀a⠀creditor,⠀a⠀community⠀gathering,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀listener⠀who⠀needs⠀to⠀understand⠀an⠀obligation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀place⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀religion,⠀or⠀code-switching⠀pattern.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame-tale⠀structure⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀story⠀moves⠀and⠀changes.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀should⠀introduce⠀a⠀present⠀problem,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀should⠀explain⠀how⠀the⠀problem⠀began,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀it,⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀promise⠀still⠀binds.⠀The⠀inner⠀account⠀may⠀itself⠀contain⠀another⠀voice:⠀a⠀remembered⠀warning,⠀a⠀song,⠀a⠀rumor,⠀or⠀a⠀story⠀the⠀teller⠀was⠀told⠀as⠀a⠀child.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀listener,⠀the⠀teller's⠀body,⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀magical⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀divine⠀intervention;⠀the⠀epic⠀weight⠀comes⠀from⠀accumulated⠀human⠀consequence.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentences⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀oral⠀account⠀feel⠀communal⠀and⠀layered.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀migration⠀beside⠀a⠀current⠀eviction,⠀or⠀place⠀a⠀village⠀well⠀beside⠀a⠀corporate⠀water⠀contract.⠀Let⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language⠀enter⠀the⠀same⠀passage.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀cost:⠀who⠀left,⠀who⠀stayed,⠀who⠀was⠀renamed,⠀who⠀was⠀paid,⠀who⠀was⠀buried⠀far⠀from⠀home.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀names,⠀debts,⠀or⠀objects⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀by⠀different⠀tellers⠀with⠀different⠀emphasis;⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀as⠀a⠀curse⠀by⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀as⠀a⠀contract⠀by⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀repetition⠀certify⠀the⠀story's⠀truth.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀teller⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀they⠀heard,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀agreed⠀to⠀remember.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀concrete.⠀The⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀held⠀by⠀a⠀lending⠀platform,⠀a⠀labor⠀broker,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀or⠀a⠀landlord;⠀the⠀migration⠀may⠀be⠀tracked⠀by⠀an⠀app⠀or⠀blocked⠀by⠀a⠀checkpoint.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀oral⠀account⠀should⠀not⠀float⠀free⠀of⠀these⠀systems;⠀it⠀should⠀explain⠀how⠀people⠀live⠀inside⠀them⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀tell⠀each⠀other⠀to⠀survive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀mode.⠀Treat⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀dated⠀entry⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀situated⠀fragment⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀record⠀kept⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Establish⠀the⠀entry's⠀occasion:⠀the⠀diarist⠀may⠀be⠀recording⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀patient's⠀words,⠀a⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀rumor⠀before⠀it⠀fades.⠀The⠀record⠀can⠀include⠀observations,⠀sensations,⠀rumors,⠀practical⠀notes,⠀and⠀reflections⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀entry⠀into⠀first⠀person.⠀Match⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀distance⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀teller:⠀a⠀technician⠀may⠀note⠀timestamps⠀and⠀error⠀codes;⠀a⠀courier⠀may⠀record⠀routes⠀and⠀debts;⠀a⠀caretaker⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀patient's⠀words.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.\n\nLet⠀the⠀private⠀record⠀move⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀and⠀rumor.⠀A⠀single⠀entry⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀turn⠀to⠀a⠀parent's⠀warning,⠀mention⠀a⠀blackout⠀or⠀a⠀protest,⠀and⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀who⠀will⠀pay⠀for⠀a⠀repair.⠀Use⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentences⠀to⠀hold⠀these⠀levels⠀together.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀human⠀consequence:⠀whose⠀body⠀was⠀altered,⠀whose⠀name⠀was⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀whose⠀debt⠀was⠀inherited,⠀whose⠀absence⠀is⠀being⠀remembered.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀present⠀but⠀filtered⠀through⠀the⠀diarist's⠀attention.⠀The⠀record⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀surveillance⠀drone,⠀a⠀payment⠀deadline,⠀a⠀biometric⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀rumor⠀about⠀a⠀clinic.⠀The⠀diarist⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀full⠀system,⠀and⠀the⠀entry⠀should⠀preserve⠀that⠀partial⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀diary⠀become⠀an⠀omniscient⠀case⠀file.⠀The⠀writer⠀of⠀the⠀record⠀can⠀be⠀mistaken,⠀selective,⠀or⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀explain⠀everything.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀diary's⠀structuring⠀memory.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀season,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀later⠀entries⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀diarist⠀noticing⠀the⠀return,⠀or⠀failing⠀to⠀notice⠀it.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty;⠀it⠀should⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀return.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀repetition⠀certify⠀accuracy⠀or⠀emotional⠀growth.\n\nLet⠀the⠀entry⠀end⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary.⠀The⠀diarist⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-thought,⠀set⠀down⠀the⠀record,⠀or⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀knock,⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀scheduled⠀task.⠀The⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀entry's⠀question⠀or⠀complete⠀a⠀reflection.⠀The⠀private⠀record⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀transcript⠀of⠀every⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaham::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀mode.⠀Establish⠀the⠀testimony's⠀occasion⠀and⠀audience:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀telling⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀a⠀newcomer,⠀a⠀child,⠀an⠀investigator,⠀a⠀creditor,⠀or⠀a⠀recording⠀device,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀seek⠀to⠀persuade,⠀warn,⠀remember,⠀or⠀defend.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀personally⠀participated⠀in,⠀what⠀they⠀witnessed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀heard⠀from⠀others.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀account⠀clearly⠀as⠀it⠀enters:⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀story,⠀a⠀coworker's⠀warning,⠀a⠀mother's⠀recollection,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor's⠀rumor.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀direct⠀experience⠀and⠀reported⠀events.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀grant⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knowledge⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀have.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀attention⠀to⠀public⠀conditions.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀city's⠀debt,⠀migration,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀access⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀lived⠀conditions,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀scenery.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀payment⠀deadline⠀shapes⠀a⠀family's⠀evening,⠀how⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀changes⠀a⠀commute,⠀how⠀a⠀clinic's⠀pricing⠀alters⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀a⠀body.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀language⠀enter⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀a⠀document,⠀and⠀let⠀street⠀knowledge⠀answer⠀it⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀precision.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀gathering⠀sentences⠀to⠀hold⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀and⠀rumor⠀together.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀place⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀migration⠀beside⠀a⠀current⠀eviction⠀notice,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀protest⠀chant⠀beside⠀a⠀child's⠀fever.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀accumulation⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀human⠀consequence:⠀who⠀left,⠀who⠀stayed,⠀who⠀was⠀charged,⠀who⠀was⠀buried,⠀who⠀is⠀still⠀paying.⠀The⠀marvelous⠀is⠀not⠀required;⠀this⠀route⠀stays⠀within⠀social⠀realism⠀and⠀testimony⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀the⠀supernatural.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀communal⠀meaning.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀date⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀different⠀accounts.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀community⠀remembers⠀and⠀revises⠀the⠀event.⠀A⠀date⠀that⠀marks⠀a⠀factory⠀closure⠀for⠀one⠀family⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀birth⠀for⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀repetition⠀certify⠀accuracy.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀witness⠀saw,⠀what⠀a⠀teller⠀believes,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀agreed⠀to⠀say.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀testimony's⠀purpose⠀visible.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀the⠀recording⠀may⠀run⠀out,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀danger⠀returns.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀unfinished⠀or⠀the⠀listener's⠀decision⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀visual⠀anchor⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀reader⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀standing⠀before⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀payment⠀notice⠀glowing⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀courier⠀hearing⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀across⠀a⠀checkpoint.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀lobby,⠀a⠀rooftop⠀to⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀or⠀a⠀clinic⠀to⠀a⠀van,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀visual⠀beat.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.\n\nAdapt⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀memory⠀to⠀the⠀light⠀novel's⠀beat⠀structure.⠀Instead⠀of⠀one⠀long⠀gathering⠀sentence,⠀use⠀a⠀short⠀recollection⠀inserted⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀pressure.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀see⠀a⠀payment⠀notice⠀and⠀remember⠀a⠀parent's⠀warning;⠀a⠀courier⠀may⠀pass⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀and⠀recall⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀arrest;⠀a⠀technician⠀may⠀touch⠀an⠀old⠀implant⠀and⠀remember⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀it.⠀Keep⠀each⠀recollection⠀brief⠀and⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀consequence.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀clarify⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀risks⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀current⠀choice⠀matters,⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀exposition.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀after⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Show⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀through⠀a⠀physical⠀detail,⠀a⠀short⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀attention.⠀The⠀reaction⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀an⠀implication,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀respond⠀at⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀level.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀perfectly⠀perceptive.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀and⠀immediate.⠀A⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock,⠀a⠀corporate⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀action.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀should⠀be⠀presented⠀clearly⠀when⠀they⠀appear,⠀without⠀a⠀glossary⠀paragraph.⠀A⠀brief⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀visual⠀detail⠀can⠀explain⠀what⠀a⠀device⠀does⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀name⠀matters.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀light⠀novel⠀callback.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀debt,⠀or⠀place⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀across⠀scenes.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀revise⠀or⠀deepen⠀its⠀meaning:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀safety⠀becomes⠀a⠀trap;⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀with⠀warmth⠀becomes⠀a⠀liability;⠀a⠀promise⠀repeated⠀to⠀different⠀people⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀obliges.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀callback⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary:⠀mid-action,⠀mid-thought,⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀visual⠀detail⠀entering⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀syntax⠀itself⠀perform⠀the⠀noir⠀inquiry.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀balance,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀scanner,⠀or⠀watches⠀a⠀door⠀refuse⠀someone,⠀gather⠀the⠀sentence⠀across⠀the⠀moments⠀that⠀produced⠀this⠀threshold:⠀the⠀sum⠀on⠀the⠀screen⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀shifts⠀that⠀reduced⠀it,⠀the⠀delay⠀can⠀contain⠀every⠀earlier⠀gate⠀where⠀the⠀city⠀priced⠀or⠀excluded⠀this⠀body.⠀Keep⠀the⠀gathered⠀time⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀human⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀lament⠀about⠀the⠀age.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀image⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀material,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀more⠀exact.⠀A⠀wet⠀cable⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀vein⠀if⠀the⠀image⠀shows⠀where⠀power⠀enters⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs;⠀a⠀slogan⠀can⠀repeat⠀until⠀its⠀rhythm⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀the⠀advertisement.⠀Use⠀plain⠀factual⠀clauses⠀as⠀the⠀load-bearing⠀joints:⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀clinic,⠀what⠀the⠀implant⠀costs,⠀which⠀record⠀is⠀now⠀flagged.⠀The⠀lyric⠀movement⠀must⠀not⠀blur⠀what⠀physically⠀happened,⠀who⠀paid,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀knows.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀sound⠀and⠀image⠀as⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀loan⠀agreement⠀returns⠀in⠀another⠀voice,⠀or⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀sign⠀marks⠀two⠀unrelated⠀decisions,⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀a⠀connection⠀the⠀systems⠀have⠀already⠀made.⠀The⠀repetition⠀may⠀deepen⠀an⠀inquiry,⠀expose⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀exclusion,⠀or⠀simply⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀let⠀go.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀it⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀thesis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀Lyrical⠀perception⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀talk⠀plainly,⠀negotiate⠀in⠀corporate⠀language,⠀or⠀refuse⠀the⠀figurative⠀register⠀altogether.⠀Surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀exclusion⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀When⠀the⠀prose⠀grows⠀associative,⠀it⠀should⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀observation,⠀inference,⠀and⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀reflection⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀system⠀effect,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀payment⠀to⠀enter,⠀that⠀a⠀relative's⠀voice⠀is⠀stored⠀but⠀no⠀longer⠀live,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀hand⠀tremor⠀has⠀made⠀a⠀particular⠀implant⠀unreliable.⠀Let⠀the⠀reflection⠀stay⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀change:⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀now,⠀whom⠀it⠀separates,⠀what⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀it⠀revives.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀active⠀while⠀the⠀memory⠀runs⠀alongside⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀complete⠀an⠀errand,⠀answer⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀negotiation.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀trigger⠀and⠀return⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀consequence.⠀The⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀clinic,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀someone⠀used⠀to⠀say⠀a⠀name⠀can⠀open⠀the⠀past.⠀Move⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀and⠀rumor⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀does,⠀but⠀keep⠀each⠀public⠀event⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀consequence⠀it⠀had⠀for⠀these⠀people.⠀A⠀citywide⠀outage⠀matters⠀here⠀because⠀it⠀delayed⠀a⠀payment⠀or⠀silenced⠀a⠀voice,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀decoration.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀past⠀as⠀unfinished⠀rather⠀than⠀elegized.⠀Some⠀memories⠀are⠀open⠀attachments:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer,⠀still⠀deciding⠀what⠀a⠀past⠀promise⠀means,⠀still⠀noticing⠀that⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀city⠀has⠀not⠀finished⠀changing.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable.⠀A⠀warm⠀meal,⠀a⠀working⠀door,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unobserved⠀quiet⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀immediately⠀being⠀undercut⠀by⠀loss.⠀The⠀reflective⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀language⠀with⠀restraint.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀song,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀saying⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occasion⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent:⠀reflection⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀narrator,⠀and⠀other⠀characters⠀may⠀be⠀practical,⠀impatient,⠀or⠀unwilling⠀to⠀dwell.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀caused⠀the⠀change⠀remain⠀concrete⠀and⠀contestable,⠀not⠀softened⠀into⠀fate.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀regional⠀route.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀telling⠀the⠀present⠀account,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀under⠀what⠀conditions:⠀a⠀courier⠀explaining⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀reporting⠀what⠀the⠀building's⠀system⠀recorded,⠀a⠀technician⠀describing⠀what⠀they⠀found⠀inside⠀a⠀device.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀brief,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀social⠀act⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀occur.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀familiar⠀tale⠀collection,⠀a⠀court,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀mystical⠀atmosphere.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀organize⠀the⠀noir⠀information⠀economy.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀screen⠀showed⠀them.⠀Distinguish⠀these⠀levels:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀know⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀directly,⠀while⠀a⠀reported⠀event⠀inside⠀a⠀teller's⠀account⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀teller's⠀memory⠀and⠀interest.⠀When⠀a⠀second⠀account⠀revises⠀the⠀first,⠀show⠀the⠀revision⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀event,⠀not⠀merely⠀as⠀corrected⠀data.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀doubt,⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question.⠀Surveillance⠀footage,⠀payment⠀records,⠀implant⠀failures,⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀remain⠀real⠀within⠀the⠀told⠀accounts;⠀the⠀storytelling⠀frame⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀facts⠀optional⠀or⠀merely⠀legendary.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀material.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀can⠀return⠀inside⠀the⠀reported⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀application,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀can⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀as⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀teller⠀uses⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀event,⠀and⠀rumor⠀happen⠀through⠀these⠀tellers:⠀a⠀public⠀outage⠀becomes⠀a⠀family⠀argument⠀in⠀one⠀account⠀and⠀a⠀debt⠀deadline⠀in⠀another.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀circulation⠀of⠀information⠀legible,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorative.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀and⠀interest⠀visible.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀wrong,⠀self-interested,⠀or⠀incomplete,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀observed⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀inferred.⠀The⠀frame⠀can⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step,⠀without⠀resolving⠀every⠀discrepancy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀one⠀carry⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀accumulated⠀time.⠀A⠀payment⠀failing⠀at⠀a⠀turnstile⠀can⠀imply⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀lender,⠀and⠀the⠀previous⠀week⠀without⠀stating⠀them.⠀A⠀scar⠀over⠀an⠀implant⠀port⠀can⠀imply⠀the⠀surgery⠀and⠀its⠀cost.⠀Select⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀noir⠀world⠀legible:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀paid,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀cannot⠀do.\n\nWrite⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀When⠀a⠀longer⠀history⠀matters,⠀compress⠀it⠀into⠀one⠀precise⠀sentence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀recollection.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀gather⠀two⠀times,⠀but⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀connection⠀is⠀essential:⠀\"She⠀had⠀walked⠀past⠀this⠀clinic⠀every⠀day⠀since⠀they⠀removed⠀the⠀eye.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀explanatory⠀sentence⠀unless⠀the⠀first⠀would⠀otherwise⠀mislead⠀or⠀break⠀causality.⠀The⠀compression⠀should⠀preserve⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀as⠀implication,⠀not⠀delete⠀it.\n\nOmit⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀causal⠀link.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀a⠀job,⠀the⠀refusal⠀should⠀carry⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀If⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀why⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀situation.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀fragments;⠀shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota.\n\nKeep⠀voices⠀individual.⠀A⠀corporate⠀representative⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀full⠀procedural⠀sentences⠀while⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀uses⠀one⠀word⠀and⠀a⠀gesture.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀flatten⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation⠀to⠀carry⠀communal⠀memory:⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀location⠀can⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀weight,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀supplies⠀the⠀accumulated⠀meaning.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause;⠀no⠀summary⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀perception,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀move⠀naturally⠀into⠀recollection,⠀public⠀context,⠀or⠀inner⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀prompts⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀background⠀check⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀job⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀check⠀necessary,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀news⠀feed⠀item⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀wait⠀means.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀formal⠀transition:⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀screen⠀updates,⠀the⠀contact⠀speaks.\n\nLet⠀the⠀systems⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀exert⠀pressure⠀through⠀ordinary⠀scene⠀material.⠀A⠀negotiation⠀can⠀turn⠀on⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀family⠀conversation⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀payment⠀alert,⠀and⠀a⠀walk⠀across⠀the⠀city⠀can⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀which⠀routes⠀are⠀monitored⠀or⠀tolled.⠀Keep⠀these⠀pressures⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀general⠀social⠀commentary.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀may⠀be⠀wry,⠀plain,⠀or⠀intimate,⠀but⠀the⠀register⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.\n\nUse⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀as⠀a⠀scene⠀function,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀function.⠀When⠀earlier⠀events⠀matter,⠀let⠀them⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀recap⠀paragraph.⠀A⠀public⠀event⠀can⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀rumor⠀heard⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀a⠀family⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀repeats,⠀a⠀past⠀decision⠀as⠀the⠀reason⠀a⠀door⠀now⠀opens⠀or⠀refuses.⠀Keep⠀each⠀layer⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀human⠀consequence.\n\nAllow⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀enough⠀room⠀to⠀be⠀meaningful.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀choice,⠀notice⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀feeling,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀contradicts⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Keep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀Recurring⠀language⠀can⠀connect⠀scenes:⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀family⠀saying,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀public⠀rumor⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀the⠀scene-selection⠀criterion.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀actually⠀at⠀stake⠀or⠀in⠀motion:⠀one⠀character⠀waits⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀passes⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀they⠀divide⠀a⠀payment⠀they⠀cannot⠀both⠀afford,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀resurfaces⠀during⠀a⠀negotiation.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀show⠀what⠀this⠀relationship⠀promises⠀them,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀loyalty,⠀relief,⠀friction,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀kind⠀of⠀care.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀work⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀only.\n\nBuild⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀history.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀argument⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning.⠀A⠀gesture⠀one⠀character⠀uses⠀only⠀with⠀the⠀other⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀setting⠀where⠀it⠀must⠀stay⠀small.⠀Use⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀layered⠀time⠀to⠀let⠀these⠀repetitions⠀accumulate:⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀without⠀a⠀flashback,⠀because⠀the⠀characters⠀themselves⠀remember⠀it.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀emotional⠀promise,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀concretely.⠀Surveillance⠀may⠀make⠀privacy⠀scarce,⠀debt⠀may⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀between⠀helping⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀paying⠀another,⠀and⠀bodily⠀compromise⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀these⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀emotional⠀script.⠀Give⠀the⠀feeling⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀develop⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀have⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀Private⠀thought⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀characters⠀as⠀authorized;⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀inner⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀that⠀access⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀the⠀relationship's⠀ongoing⠀life:⠀a⠀reassurance⠀given,⠀a⠀question⠀avoided,⠀a⠀hand⠀held⠀in⠀a⠀monitored⠀room.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀deed⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered:⠀who⠀first⠀broke⠀the⠀contract,⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀clinic's⠀records⠀through⠀the⠀outage,⠀who⠀walked⠀into⠀the⠀corporate⠀tower⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀come⠀out⠀the⠀same.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀declaration⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀act⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀to⠀connect⠀deeds⠀across⠀time.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀debt⠀agreement,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀name⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Let⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them.⠀A⠀courier's⠀route⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀journey;⠀a⠀disputed⠀payment⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀feud;⠀a⠀repaired⠀device⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀gift.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scale⠀honest:⠀an⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀gives⠀it⠀weight.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀supply⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀reputation.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀paid,⠀and⠀who⠀altered⠀a⠀body⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀are⠀the⠀deeds⠀this⠀community⠀remembers.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀chronicle⠀as⠀the⠀speech⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀power,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀idiom.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀can⠀correct⠀or⠀complicate⠀an⠀official⠀account.⠀Use⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀memory⠀to⠀let⠀these⠀deeds⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀across⠀tellers⠀and⠀generations:⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀a⠀family⠀burden,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀record⠀as⠀a⠀public⠀shame,⠀a⠀bodily⠀alteration⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀mark⠀with⠀communal⠀consequence.\n\nAllow⠀dialogue⠀to⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀case⠀as⠀a⠀social-institutional⠀accounting⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀mode.⠀Treat⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀as⠀an⠀administrative⠀condition:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀a⠀record,⠀approve⠀a⠀payment,⠀revoke⠀a⠀clearance,⠀admit⠀a⠀body⠀to⠀a⠀clinic,⠀or⠀exclude⠀a⠀name⠀from⠀a⠀registry.⠀When⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀a⠀specific⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀setting,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀institutional⠀texture;⠀when⠀it⠀does⠀not,⠀keep⠀the⠀systems⠀concrete⠀and⠀local⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀national⠀stereotype.⠀Do⠀not⠀reach⠀for⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.\n\nUse⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀as⠀the⠀main⠀compositional⠀unit.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀domestic⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀institutional⠀notice⠀to⠀a⠀communal⠀account,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀terminate⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀human⠀consequence:⠀a⠀woman⠀loses⠀her⠀housing⠀credit,⠀a⠀technician's⠀clearance⠀expires,⠀a⠀child's⠀school⠀record⠀carries⠀an⠀old⠀address,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀explain⠀someone⠀else's⠀debt.⠀Let⠀the⠀consequence⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀surveillance.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀institutional⠀record⠀from⠀the⠀communal⠀account.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀repeats⠀a⠀rumor,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀relative's⠀version⠀of⠀events,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀where⠀that⠀account⠀came⠀from,⠀who⠀repeated⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀record⠀or⠀observation⠀later⠀qualifies⠀it.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀notice,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀warning,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀administrative⠀fact:⠀the⠀name⠀on⠀the⠀notice⠀changes,⠀the⠀clearance⠀is⠀renewed,⠀the⠀address⠀is⠀corrected.⠀Keep⠀rumor⠀as⠀rumor⠀and⠀record⠀as⠀record;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀communal⠀memory⠀silently⠀become⠀evidence.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀prose.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀relative's⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀without⠀another⠀character⠀knowing⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀also⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀says,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀witness⠀perceptive⠀or⠀every⠀official⠀corrupt.⠀A⠀system⠀can⠀exclude⠀through⠀routine⠀as⠀easily⠀as⠀through⠀malice.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀administrative⠀step,⠀a⠀pending⠀inquiry,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀domestic⠀consequence⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀readable⠀screen⠀form:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀for⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events,⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀and⠀hears:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate⠀refusing⠀entry,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀voice⠀over⠀an⠀intercom,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor's⠀price⠀for⠀a⠀copied⠀credential.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀observable⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀not⠀through⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nUse⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀and⠀cuts⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀public⠀events,⠀and⠀rumor.⠀Establish⠀a⠀recurring⠀public⠀phrase⠀as⠀an⠀audible⠀source⠀in⠀one⠀scene:⠀a⠀radio⠀announcement⠀in⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀recorded⠀warning⠀in⠀a⠀lobby,⠀a⠀street⠀speaker⠀repeating⠀a⠀service⠀alert.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀phrase⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀different⠀source⠀or⠀context:⠀the⠀same⠀announcement⠀now⠀plays⠀over⠀a⠀clinic⠀intake⠀desk,⠀a⠀character⠀repeats⠀it⠀while⠀reading⠀a⠀notice,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀recording⠀says⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀name.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀source⠀or⠀context⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀implication.\n\nCut⠀between⠀a⠀domestic⠀consequence⠀and⠀its⠀institutional⠀cause.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀family⠀kitchen⠀where⠀a⠀payment⠀fails⠀to⠀a⠀corporate⠀lobby⠀where⠀a⠀clearance⠀is⠀revoked,⠀with⠀a⠀radio⠀announcement⠀continuing⠀offscreen.⠀Let⠀the⠀cut⠀make⠀the⠀connection⠀visible⠀without⠀a⠀character⠀explaining⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀voice-over⠀is⠀needed,⠀use⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀remembered⠀public⠀or⠀communal⠀text,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀a⠀speaker,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀private⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀voice-over⠀replace⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene's⠀information⠀change⠀the⠀available⠀interpretations⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀shown⠀and⠀heard:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀without⠀a⠀badge,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀contradicts⠀a⠀spoken⠀account.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀visible⠀consequence⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀cut⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀clue⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀stageable⠀conditions:⠀a⠀character⠀cannot⠀pass⠀a⠀door⠀without⠀a⠀badge,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀reads⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀aloud,⠀a⠀vendor⠀hands⠀over⠀a⠀copied⠀credential,⠀a⠀clinic⠀worker⠀checks⠀a⠀biometric⠀scanner.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear.\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀communal⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor⠀testable.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀repeats⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀account,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀or⠀a⠀relative's⠀version⠀of⠀events,⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀claim:⠀ask⠀where⠀they⠀heard⠀it,⠀produce⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀contradicts⠀it,⠀or⠀challenge⠀the⠀timing.⠀An⠀entrance⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀is⠀plausible:⠀a⠀person⠀arrives⠀from⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀were⠀said⠀to⠀have⠀left,⠀or⠀carries⠀an⠀object⠀another⠀witness⠀described.⠀Keep⠀the⠀people⠀occupied⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀work⠀of⠀checking⠀rather⠀than⠀posed⠀around⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nCarry⠀each⠀recurrence⠀of⠀a⠀public⠀phrase⠀through⠀a⠀stageable⠀object⠀or⠀action.⠀A⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀screen,⠀writes⠀it⠀on⠀a⠀form,⠀repeats⠀it⠀while⠀handling⠀a⠀prop,⠀or⠀hears⠀it⠀from⠀a⠀speaker⠀that⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀also⠀hear.⠀When⠀the⠀phrase⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀stageable⠀source⠀or⠀context:⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀now⠀appear⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀form,⠀are⠀read⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀character,⠀or⠀are⠀repeated⠀while⠀a⠀different⠀object⠀changes⠀hands.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀source⠀or⠀context⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀implication.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀film-camera⠀instructions⠀or⠀offstage⠀effects⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀staged.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀needs⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀is⠀required,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue,⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀visible⠀consequence⠀without⠀an⠀obligatory⠀gathering,⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀or⠀new⠀clue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀appears⠀as⠀mental⠀material:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀remembered⠀while⠀washing⠀dishes,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀alert⠀interrupting⠀a⠀childhood⠀recollection,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor's⠀price⠀recalled⠀during⠀a⠀corporate⠀interview.⠀Keep⠀the⠀associations⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀mind's⠀history⠀and⠀present⠀situation.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀from⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀association.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀mother's⠀warning,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀and⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀threat⠀together,⠀but⠀the⠀connection⠀must⠀arise⠀through⠀what⠀this⠀mind⠀actually⠀links:⠀the⠀warning⠀and⠀the⠀announcement⠀share⠀a⠀phrase,⠀the⠀threat⠀arrives⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀already⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀mother's⠀voice.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀an⠀external⠀narrator⠀supply⠀the⠀summary.⠀When⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀sensory⠀trigger⠀from⠀this⠀mind's⠀history:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀clinic⠀where⠀the⠀mother⠀once⠀waited,⠀the⠀glow⠀of⠀the⠀screen⠀that⠀showed⠀the⠀first⠀notice,⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀the⠀supervisor⠀heard⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀intercom⠀as⠀a⠀childhood⠀public⠀alert.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀revise⠀the⠀mind's⠀understanding⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀perfectly⠀perceptive.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀anchor⠀the⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀present-tense⠀sensory⠀detail⠀or⠀an⠀interruption:⠀the⠀water⠀has⠀gone⠀cold,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀a⠀door⠀opens.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀associations,⠀with⠀fragments⠀and⠀returns⠀where⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀state.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.⠀Conversely,⠀do⠀not⠀conceal⠀an⠀authorized⠀focal⠀conclusion⠀until⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀cast⠀catches⠀up.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀thought,⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀decision,⠀change⠀direction,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀sender⠀quotes⠀a⠀public⠀alert,⠀another⠀forwards⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀comment,⠀another⠀edits⠀a⠀message⠀before⠀sending,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀draft⠀unsent.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀message⠀conditions:⠀a⠀debt⠀collector's⠀automated⠀text,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀demand⠀for⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀street⠀contact's⠀price⠀for⠀a⠀copied⠀credential.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀and⠀rumor⠀through⠀actual⠀transmitted⠀texts.⠀When⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀service⠀announcement⠀or⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀warning⠀returns,⠀make⠀each⠀recurrence⠀a⠀new⠀transmission:⠀a⠀different⠀sender⠀quotes⠀it,⠀a⠀forward⠀chain⠀adds⠀a⠀comment,⠀an⠀edit⠀changes⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀receipt⠀shows⠀who⠀read⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀transmission⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀implication.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀forward⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account,⠀quote⠀a⠀relative's⠀warning,⠀or⠀paste⠀a⠀public⠀alert⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀chat,⠀but⠀each⠀recurrence⠀must⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀transmitted⠀text⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀note.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀it⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀sender⠀considered⠀saying,⠀revised,⠀or⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀transmit,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀context⠀note⠀may⠀establish⠀who⠀is⠀messaging,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀or⠀what⠀interface⠀event⠀occurred,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀without⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.⠀Let⠀the⠀exchange⠀advance⠀the⠀case⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀senders⠀actually⠀transmit⠀and⠀receive:⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀contradicts⠀a⠀spoken⠀account,⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀forwarded⠀message⠀that⠀revises⠀a⠀rumor.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀a⠀continuing⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pending⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀resolution,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual⠀novel⠀form:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀visible⠀and⠀spoken⠀conditions:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀wall⠀screen,⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate⠀refusing⠀entry,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀recorded⠀voice,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor's⠀price⠀for⠀a⠀copied⠀credential.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀presents.\n\nUse⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀to⠀gather⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀and⠀rumor⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀passage⠀that⠀ends⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀human⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀A⠀narrative⠀passage⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀relative's⠀warning,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement,⠀and⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀threat⠀together,⠀but⠀the⠀gathering⠀must⠀terminate⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀now⠀owes,⠀loses,⠀or⠀is⠀excluded⠀from.⠀When⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀scene⠀element:⠀a⠀familiar⠀background⠀detail,⠀a⠀voice,⠀a⠀screen⠀alert,⠀an⠀object.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀revise⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀expression⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀test⠀the⠀communal⠀accounts⠀through⠀concrete⠀contradictions.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀repeats⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀rumor⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀record,⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀where⠀they⠀heard⠀it,⠀produce⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀contradicts⠀it,⠀or⠀challenge⠀the⠀timing.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀arrangement⠀or⠀account⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀Preserve⠀whichever⠀authorship⠀contract⠀is⠀active.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀visible⠀consequence⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀choice⠀screen,⠀confession,⠀or⠀new⠀clue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀an⠀installment,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀investigation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀local⠀changes:⠀a⠀debt⠀increases,⠀a⠀clearance⠀expires,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice⠀arrives,⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀raises⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀public⠀record⠀contradicts⠀a⠀spoken⠀account.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀these⠀developments.\n\nUse⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀gathering⠀sentence⠀as⠀a⠀serial⠀device⠀that⠀returns⠀with⠀new⠀administrative⠀weight.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀small⠀domestic⠀detail,⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀consequence⠀together,⠀but⠀the⠀consequence⠀must⠀remain⠀human⠀and⠀specific.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀gathered⠀detail⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀installment,⠀attach⠀a⠀new⠀administrative⠀fact⠀to⠀it:⠀the⠀entrance⠀previously⠀said⠀to⠀be⠀locked⠀is⠀used⠀after⠀a⠀clearance⠀is⠀renewed,⠀the⠀object⠀another⠀witness⠀described⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀seized⠀inventory,⠀the⠀familiar⠀public⠀announcement⠀now⠀names⠀a⠀different⠀person.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀original⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀the⠀whole⠀scene⠀that⠀established⠀it.\n\nLet⠀recurring⠀communal⠀language⠀create⠀re-entry⠀points⠀through⠀concrete⠀in-story⠀sources.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀service⠀alert,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀warning,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀can⠀return⠀across⠀installments⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀by⠀new⠀information.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀must⠀be⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀story:⠀a⠀character⠀reads⠀it,⠀hears⠀it,⠀repeats⠀it,⠀or⠀sees⠀it⠀on⠀a⠀screen.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀source⠀or⠀context⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀implication.⠀New⠀evidence⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event⠀or⠀making⠀the⠀investigator⠀deliberately⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀prose.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀relative's⠀version⠀of⠀events⠀without⠀another⠀character⠀knowing⠀it.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀inquiry.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀fair⠀answer⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀short⠀declarative⠀movements⠀and⠀deliberate⠀gaps.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀supply⠀the⠀specific⠀reason⠀a⠀character⠀cannot⠀simply⠀speak:⠀a⠀monitored⠀line,⠀a⠀contract⠀that⠀records⠀vulnerability,⠀a⠀favor⠀whose⠀price⠀rises⠀once⠀it⠀is⠀named,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀that⠀admitted⠀need⠀becomes⠀leverage.⠀The⠀silence⠀is⠀not⠀vague⠀mood;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀can⠀observe,⠀price,⠀and⠀use⠀whatever⠀is⠀confessed.⠀Track⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀channel⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀admission.\n\nRender⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀declines⠀to⠀explain.⠀A⠀pause⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀attention⠀shifted⠀toward⠀a⠀device⠀or⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀question⠀met⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction—these⠀carry⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀a⠀stated⠀confession.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀admit⠀something,⠀make⠀it⠀cost⠀something⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀that⠀follows:⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do,⠀or⠀leaves⠀the⠀other⠀unsure⠀whether⠀the⠀words⠀were⠀a⠀gift⠀or⠀a⠀transaction.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀viewpoint.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀fear,⠀longing,⠀or⠀regret⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀sees⠀only⠀a⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀tone;⠀let⠀each⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀actually⠀observe,⠀never⠀to⠀the⠀hidden⠀feeling.⠀A⠀strained⠀conversation⠀stays⠀strained⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀dialogue—do⠀not⠀settle⠀it⠀with⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀or⠀a⠀speech⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀earned.\n\nLet⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀or⠀action⠀change⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀The⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀small:⠀a⠀name⠀finally⠀spoken,⠀a⠀payment⠀declined,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn⠀from⠀a⠀console,⠀a⠀message⠀typed⠀and⠀not⠀sent.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀repair.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain,⠀and⠀comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀systems⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀admission⠀difficult.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Never⠀label⠀a⠀character⠀angsty,⠀broken,⠀or⠀tormented.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀withholding,⠀apologizing,⠀or⠀returning⠀through⠀concrete⠀choices⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀understood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Attach⠀the⠀speaker's⠀name⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀action⠀marker⠀to⠀each⠀speech⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀participant⠀can⠀follow⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀scan⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀bare⠀transcript:⠀anchor⠀the⠀moment⠀in⠀concrete⠀detail—a⠀monitored⠀doorway,⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀a⠀damaged⠀implant,⠀a⠀street-level⠀exchange—and⠀let⠀prices⠀and⠀permissions⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it⠀can⠀actually⠀do.\n\nMake⠀compact⠀exchange⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀short⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀carries⠀an⠀implication⠀the⠀next⠀speaker⠀can⠀accept,⠀deflect,⠀or⠀misunderstand.⠀Answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction,⠀meet⠀a⠀threat⠀with⠀a⠀price,⠀let⠀an⠀offer⠀sit⠀unanswered⠀while⠀someone⠀checks⠀a⠀device.⠀Do⠀not⠀annotate⠀what⠀a⠀line⠀meant;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀meant⠀stays⠀visible⠀for⠀the⠀participants⠀to⠀act⠀on.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀active⠀rather⠀than⠀paused⠀for⠀input.⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀own⠀business,⠀a⠀system⠀updates⠀or⠀denies⠀access,⠀the⠀environment⠀imposes⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀a⠀deadline.⠀End⠀the⠀interval⠀wherever⠀the⠀action⠀naturally⠀stands—mid-motion,⠀mid-sentence,⠀with⠀a⠀door⠀opening⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀still⠀unfinished—rather⠀than⠀steering⠀toward⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀forced⠀choice,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀player⠀must⠀answer.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀for⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control.⠀Do⠀not⠀write⠀the⠀player⠀character's⠀decisions⠀or⠀feelings⠀unless⠀that⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀Resolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀consistently⠀with⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀facts⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open:⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀a⠀shared⠀present⠀moment,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀story⠀that⠀ends⠀by⠀demanding⠀a⠀prompt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Divide⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀compact⠀episodes,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀present⠀action,⠀a⠀few⠀participants,⠀and⠀one⠀concrete⠀pressure:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀settled,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀window⠀about⠀to⠀open,⠀an⠀access⠀denial,⠀a⠀bargain⠀closing⠀tonight.⠀Begin⠀each⠀episode⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀exchange⠀or⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀came⠀before,⠀and⠀end⠀each⠀when⠀its⠀immediate⠀action⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀is⠀answered.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀episodes⠀through⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delayed⠀disclosure.⠀A⠀name,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀location,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning;⠀a⠀fact⠀withheld⠀in⠀one⠀surfaces⠀in⠀another⠀through⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀exchange,⠀never⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀passage.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀recognize⠀the⠀connection⠀from⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀significance.\n\nInside⠀each⠀episode,⠀write⠀in⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movements.⠀Short⠀sentences⠀state⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀perception,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀speech,⠀and⠀meaningful⠀gaps⠀open⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀explains.⠀A⠀distilled⠀image—a⠀wet⠀street,⠀a⠀dead⠀terminal,⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀console—can⠀carry⠀the⠀episode's⠀feeling⠀without⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀vernacular⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀this⠀world's⠀own⠀speech.⠀Corporate⠀language,⠀market⠀slang,⠀and⠀practical⠀bargaining⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀who⠀use⠀them;⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appears⠀as⠀lived⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀quoted⠀as⠀glossary.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀martial⠀cast,⠀a⠀drinking⠀ritual,⠀or⠀an⠀archaic⠀honor⠀code⠀because⠀a⠀regional⠀tradition⠀is⠀selected.⠀The⠀setting,⠀period,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀story.\n\nLet⠀a⠀late⠀episode⠀reinterpret⠀the⠀preceding⠀stillness.⠀The⠀delayed⠀disclosure⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀fact—who⠀paid⠀for⠀a⠀favor,⠀why⠀an⠀access⠀code⠀was⠀left⠀behind,⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀noticed⠀and⠀never⠀said—and⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀an⠀earlier⠀exchange⠀reads⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending,⠀a⠀closed⠀case,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀sentences.⠀State⠀what⠀happens,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀touches⠀or⠀sees,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀Prefer⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀active⠀verbs⠀to⠀abstract⠀summary.⠀Compress⠀the⠀transitions:⠀cut⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀supply⠀the⠀passage⠀between—a⠀character⠀can⠀move⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀stairwell⠀to⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀in⠀three⠀short⠀sentences.\n\nGround⠀the⠀world⠀in⠀material⠀wear.⠀The⠀scratched⠀casing,⠀the⠀flickering⠀terminal,⠀blood⠀dried⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀faded⠀access⠀badge,⠀the⠀ache⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀implant:⠀these⠀are⠀not⠀scenery⠀but⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀body⠀register⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀running,⠀waiting,⠀bargaining,⠀or⠀being⠀denied⠀access.⠀Select⠀only⠀the⠀details⠀that⠀bear⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀inventorying⠀the⠀room.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀short⠀and⠀pointed.⠀A⠀line⠀of⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀by⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀another⠀line⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀directly⠀respond.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀means;⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀implication.⠀Let⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀physical⠀fact—a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀charge⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀statement,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀without⠀resistance,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀recording.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀for⠀working⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀problem—how⠀to⠀pass⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀what⠀a⠀price⠀implies,⠀why⠀the⠀wound⠀is⠀worse⠀than⠀it⠀looked—and⠀it⠀stays⠀tied⠀to⠀physical⠀evidence⠀and⠀practical⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀general⠀reflection.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character⠀talks⠀hard⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀exhaustion,⠀leverage,⠀habit,⠀fear,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀quippy⠀or⠀combative.⠀The⠀prose⠀is⠀hard-edged⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀uniform⠀tough-talkers.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents.⠀Give⠀each⠀entry⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀payment⠀ledger,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀fixer,⠀a⠀medical⠀report,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀recorded⠀statement,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically—the⠀document⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀would⠀have⠀made⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀that⠀demanded⠀it.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document's⠀situation⠀control⠀what⠀it⠀knows⠀and⠀conceals.⠀A⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀supervisor⠀omits⠀a⠀bribe;⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀lover⠀softens⠀a⠀threat;⠀a⠀corporate⠀log⠀records⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀was⠀told⠀to⠀watch.⠀The⠀author's⠀purpose⠀shapes⠀which⠀facts⠀appear.⠀Never⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀a⠀record;⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀the⠀gap⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀declines⠀to⠀say.⠀Treat⠀each⠀document⠀as⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀write⠀down,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀window⠀onto⠀a⠀complete⠀mind.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀fact⠀named⠀in⠀one⠀document⠀grows⠀significant⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀record⠀revises⠀or⠀contradicts⠀it:⠀a⠀missing⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀changed⠀amount,⠀a⠀name⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀placeholder,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀stops⠀mid-sentence.⠀The⠀disclosure⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀records,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀steps⠀in⠀to⠀explain.⠀Let⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀change⠀how⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀reads;⠀the⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀that⠀changed⠀understanding⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀still⠀settling,⠀without⠀a⠀closed⠀case⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀continuity⠀readable.⠀Connect⠀each⠀new⠀document⠀to⠀the⠀one⠀before⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀event,⠀person,⠀or⠀object,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀authors⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀they⠀are⠀connected—the⠀reader⠀follows⠀the⠀trail⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀may⠀not.⠀Make⠀the⠀chronology⠀legible⠀through⠀dates,⠀ordering,⠀or⠀material⠀traces:⠀a⠀forwarded⠀message,⠀a⠀torn⠀receipt,⠀a⠀file⠀recovered⠀from⠀a⠀damaged⠀drive.\n\nLet⠀the⠀systems⠀work⠀inside⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves.⠀Surveillance⠀limits⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀dares⠀to⠀write;⠀a⠀debt⠀system⠀generates⠀records⠀that⠀contradict⠀a⠀personal⠀account;⠀a⠀compromised⠀device⠀alters⠀or⠀delays⠀a⠀message.⠀These⠀pressures⠀appear⠀as⠀features⠀of⠀the⠀records,⠀never⠀as⠀commentary⠀around⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nAttend⠀to⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀inside⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world.⠀Make⠀the⠀comfort⠀specific⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀and⠀this⠀setting:⠀a⠀hot⠀meal⠀bought⠀with⠀scarce⠀credit,⠀a⠀dry⠀jacket⠀handed⠀over⠀without⠀comment,⠀a⠀device⠀repaired⠀by⠀hand,⠀a⠀quiet⠀corner⠀found⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀monitors,⠀a⠀familiar⠀order⠀placed⠀without⠀asking.⠀These⠀acts⠀are⠀not⠀escapes⠀from⠀the⠀genre;⠀they⠀are⠀small⠀choices⠀made⠀inside⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power,⠀and⠀they⠀can⠀cost⠀something.⠀Let⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀suspended⠀around⠀it.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Use⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement⠀and⠀meaningful⠀gaps:⠀a⠀short⠀line,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀shared⠀silence⠀carries⠀the⠀warmth,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀forced⠀to⠀name⠀a⠀feeling⠀or⠀settle⠀an⠀old⠀hurt.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀pressure⠀can⠀stay⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀interval⠀without⠀breaking⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀The⠀character⠀being⠀cared⠀for⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀agreeable;⠀the⠀one⠀giving⠀care⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀selfless.⠀They⠀may⠀still⠀argue,⠀keep⠀secrets,⠀or⠀refuse⠀help.⠀A⠀comforting⠀interval⠀sits⠀beside⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀threat,⠀or⠀a⠀hard⠀choice⠀without⠀canceling⠀any⠀of⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀not⠀owed⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀exposed⠀as⠀a⠀trap.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀ease⠀in⠀particular⠀preferences.⠀Show⠀what⠀this⠀specific⠀person⠀likes—a⠀food,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀sitting,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀routine—and⠀let⠀the⠀care⠀meet⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀comfort⠀feels⠀earned⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀setting⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette:⠀the⠀room⠀may⠀be⠀cramped,⠀the⠀power⠀metered,⠀the⠀window⠀covered,⠀and⠀the⠀kindness⠀matters⠀precisely⠀there.\n\nLet⠀the⠀interval⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause.⠀The⠀comfort⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀result,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀arc;⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀may⠀be⠀waiting⠀outside⠀the⠀door⠀while⠀the⠀attention⠀rests⠀on⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀the⠀care⠀they⠀manage⠀to⠀give.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀inside⠀a⠀larger⠀situation—a⠀district's⠀debt⠀structure,⠀a⠀corporation's⠀changed⠀policy,⠀a⠀family's⠀long⠀entanglement⠀with⠀a⠀fixer,⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀purge—and⠀draw⠀that⠀framing⠀from⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀standing⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀that⠀explains⠀every⠀character.\n\nDistinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀prose⠀be⠀more⠀composed⠀than⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀with⠀fuller⠀sentences⠀and⠀a⠀wider⠀view⠀of⠀time⠀and⠀consequence,⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀answers⠀in⠀street⠀slang⠀or⠀corporate⠀shorthand.⠀The⠀narration⠀frames⠀what⠀that⠀speech⠀costs⠀or⠀conceals;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀impose⠀elaborate⠀or⠀archaic⠀diction⠀on⠀every⠀speaker.\n\nHandle⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀as⠀composed⠀narrative⠀withholding.⠀The⠀narration⠀observes⠀a⠀stillness,⠀a⠀repeated⠀detail,⠀or⠀an⠀unexplained⠀arrangement⠀and⠀leaves⠀it⠀unresolved⠀for⠀a⠀time;⠀later,⠀a⠀single⠀fact⠀or⠀action⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀earlier⠀passage.⠀Let⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀narrative's⠀own⠀movement—a⠀sentence⠀that⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀image,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀finally⠀makes⠀sense,⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀reinterprets⠀a⠀prior⠀silence—and⠀never⠀announce⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀twist.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀framing.⠀Debt,⠀surveillance,⠀access,⠀and⠀price⠀are⠀social⠀facts,⠀not⠀background⠀color:⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀personal⠀choice⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀record,⠀who⠀can⠀revoke⠀a⠀clearance,⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Make⠀the⠀systems⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀story's⠀arrangements⠀and⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀policy⠀summary.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀passage⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀hearing,⠀a⠀market,⠀or⠀a⠀corporate⠀lobby⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀facts⠀are⠀spoken⠀differently,⠀and⠀that⠀shift⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀without⠀any⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀ceremony.⠀When⠀a⠀scene⠀closes,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀rest⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀verdict⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀an⠀occasion⠀where⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀telling⠀another⠀a⠀story⠀under⠀practical⠀pressure:⠀a⠀payment⠀window,⠀a⠀locked⠀room,⠀a⠀held⠀contract,⠀a⠀monitored⠀meeting,⠀or⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀answered⠀before⠀someone⠀leaves.⠀Make⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀concrete⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀what⠀they⠀want,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀gain⠀or⠀avoid.⠀The⠀story⠀is⠀not⠀background.⠀It⠀is⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀negotiation.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀begins,⠀shift⠀cleanly⠀into⠀its⠀own⠀scene⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀level⠀distinct⠀through⠀a⠀repeated⠀image,⠀object,⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀also⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame.⠀Let⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀show⠀how⠀a⠀system⠀was⠀worked:⠀who⠀had⠀access,⠀who⠀paid,⠀what⠀was⠀altered,⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀unsaid.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀parallel.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀react,⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀ask⠀the⠀wrong⠀question,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀response⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀actually⠀protecting.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀at⠀the⠀joins.⠀Cut⠀away⠀transitions⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀short⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀noticed⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀turn.⠀When⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀ends,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀changed⠀point:⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀agreed,⠀refused,⠀stalled,⠀or⠀understood⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend⠀to⠀reveal.⠀The⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀are⠀themselves⠀evidence.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀omits,⠀repeats,⠀or⠀hurries⠀past⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀misses⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀present⠀in⠀both⠀levels:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀window,⠀a⠀bodily⠀modification,⠀a⠀corporate⠀policy,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀transaction⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀telling⠀its⠀occasion.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀to⠀solve⠀a⠀case⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀confession.⠀It⠀may⠀simply⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀pay,⠀wait⠀for,⠀or⠀believe.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀has⠀shifted,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀record⠀that⠀compares⠀what⠀a⠀file,⠀log,⠀contract,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀transcript⠀says⠀with⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀remembers⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀street⠀actually⠀showed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀steady:⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀cite,⠀quote,⠀or⠀summarize⠀documents,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀also⠀mark⠀where⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀incomplete,⠀edited,⠀or⠀written⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.\n\nLet⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀shape⠀the⠀documentary⠀surface.⠀Present⠀short⠀quoted⠀lines,⠀terse⠀entries,⠀and⠀concrete⠀details⠀without⠀connective⠀explanation.⠀Leave⠀gaps⠀between⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀event.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀logged:⠀a⠀payment⠀made⠀in⠀person,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀off-camera,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀after⠀the⠀recording⠀stopped,⠀a⠀body⠀altered⠀without⠀a⠀consent⠀file.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific⠀and⠀material.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀archive,⠀who⠀can⠀alter⠀an⠀entry,⠀whose⠀access⠀is⠀priced,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀missing⠀record⠀costs.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀gap⠀into⠀a⠀conspiracy.⠀Some⠀omissions⠀are⠀routine,⠀some⠀are⠀protective,⠀and⠀some⠀are⠀the⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀never⠀recorded⠀certain⠀people⠀at⠀all.⠀When⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀comes,⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀quoted⠀line,⠀logged⠀omission,⠀or⠀remembered⠀condition⠀and⠀change⠀its⠀meaning⠀under⠀the⠀new⠀information.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀concrete⠀and⠀socially⠀situated.⠀A⠀debt,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀housing⠀block,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀or⠀a⠀transit⠀route⠀can⠀anchor⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀lived⠀experience.⠀Avoid⠀translating⠀German⠀syntax⠀or⠀imposing⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀the⠀route:⠀records⠀and⠀memory⠀held⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀with⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀them⠀doing⠀the⠀narrative⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀an⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀urban⠀life:⠀a⠀family⠀claim⠀on⠀a⠀building,⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀patron⠀with⠀outdated⠀privileges,⠀a⠀private⠀clinic⠀run⠀by⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀doors,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited⠀rather⠀than⠀chosen.⠀Make⠀the⠀encounter⠀intimate⠀and⠀particular.⠀Two⠀or⠀three⠀people⠀are⠀enough.⠀Let⠀the⠀room,⠀hallway,⠀rooftop,⠀or⠀vehicle⠀carry⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀through⠀concrete⠀decay:⠀failing⠀light,⠀patched⠀surfaces,⠀old⠀security,⠀new⠀surveillance,⠀a⠀repaired⠀object⠀that⠀still⠀shows⠀its⠀damage.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brevity⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀social⠀mask⠀in⠀place.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀in⠀short⠀exchanges,⠀notice⠀small⠀things,⠀and⠀decline⠀to⠀explain.⠀The⠀mask⠀does⠀not⠀fall⠀through⠀confession.⠀It⠀slips⠀through⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀too⠀quickly,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀someone⠀stops⠀performing⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀fear⠀remain⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀avoids,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀their⠀feelings.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀material⠀condition.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀still⠀control⠀a⠀physical⠀space,⠀a⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀name,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀negotiate⠀with⠀present⠀systems:⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock,⠀a⠀credit⠀check,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀a⠀clinic's⠀intake⠀form,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀algorithm.⠀Show⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀encounter⠀and⠀what⠀access⠀costs.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀clans,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀social:⠀dependence,⠀exposure,⠀compromised⠀intimacy,⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀inherited⠀arrangements.\n\nLet⠀the⠀revelation⠀be⠀small⠀and⠀specific.⠀It⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀an⠀earlier⠀gesture,⠀line,⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀the⠀old⠀claim⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀system.⠀It⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀altered⠀without⠀resolving⠀every⠀debt⠀or⠀danger.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀encounter⠀has⠀shifted,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀has⠀been⠀described.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀teller⠀who⠀is⠀recounting⠀an⠀experience⠀of⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀exclusion,⠀or⠀bodily⠀compromise⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀reader⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀receive⠀the⠀account.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀concrete⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀shape⠀the⠀testimony.⠀The⠀teller⠀speaks⠀in⠀short,⠀declarative⠀units,⠀notices⠀a⠀few⠀sharp⠀images,⠀and⠀leaves⠀gaps⠀where⠀the⠀memory⠀is⠀painful,⠀dangerous,⠀or⠀not⠀yet⠀understood.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀cannot⠀be⠀inserted⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive,⠀but⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀mark⠀it:⠀\"I⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀what⠀the⠀form⠀meant.\"\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific.⠀Show⠀who⠀controlled⠀the⠀records,⠀the⠀clinic,⠀the⠀workplace,⠀the⠀housing⠀list,⠀or⠀the⠀credit⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀include⠀the⠀practical⠀cost:⠀a⠀fee⠀paid,⠀a⠀document⠀withheld,⠀a⠀body⠀altered,⠀a⠀name⠀removed,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀used⠀as⠀collateral.⠀The⠀testimony⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀case⠀file.⠀It⠀is⠀one⠀person's⠀attempt⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀experience⠀legible⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀image⠀or⠀phrase⠀and⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener's⠀interruption,⠀doubt,⠀or⠀supplied⠀detail⠀press⠀against⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀omitted⠀or⠀hurried⠀past,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀at⠀the⠀center.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀listener,⠀or⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀not⠀when⠀every⠀question⠀is⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaial::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀personal⠀record⠀composed⠀in⠀short⠀entries,⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-based,⠀by⠀a⠀teller⠀who⠀is⠀living⠀inside⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀system.⠀The⠀entries⠀may⠀be⠀written⠀on⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀paper⠀notebook,⠀a⠀voice⠀file,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀channel,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀composed⠀artifacts,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀stream⠀of⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀language⠀and⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀are⠀recording.\n\nLet⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀shape⠀each⠀entry.⠀Use⠀brief⠀declarative⠀sentences,⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀images,⠀and⠀no⠀explanatory⠀connective⠀tissue.⠀Leave⠀gaps⠀between⠀entries.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀record⠀matters⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀do:⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀medical⠀result,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀stopped⠀answering.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀unrecorded⠀interval⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀entry's⠀tone,⠀detail,⠀or⠀subject.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific⠀and⠀material.⠀Show⠀the⠀teller's⠀dependence⠀on⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀observes,⠀prices,⠀or⠀excludes⠀them:⠀a⠀credit⠀score,⠀a⠀biometric⠀check,⠀a⠀workplace⠀monitor,⠀a⠀clinic⠀intake,⠀a⠀housing⠀algorithm,⠀a⠀debt⠀collector's⠀message.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀reflect⠀on⠀these⠀conditions⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀entry⠀into⠀an⠀argument.⠀The⠀miscellany⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀remembered⠀conversation,⠀a⠀street⠀scene,⠀a⠀practical⠀worry,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀observation⠀that⠀later⠀accrues⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀recorded⠀image,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀observation⠀and⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀change⠀themselves⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀see.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀seasonal⠀imagery,⠀quietness,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀Japanese⠀setting.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀entry⠀has⠀registered⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀situation⠀or⠀understanding,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀day⠀is⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀witness's⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀community,⠀workplace,⠀block,⠀or⠀family⠀living⠀under⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀concrete⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀chronicler,⠀or⠀someone⠀recording⠀another⠀person's⠀testimony,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀must⠀stay⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀reliably⠀reported.\n\nLet⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀shape⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀Use⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentences,⠀sharp⠀images,⠀and⠀gaps⠀where⠀the⠀official⠀record⠀is⠀silent⠀or⠀the⠀witness⠀cannot⠀prove⠀what⠀they⠀know.⠀Distinguish⠀observation⠀from⠀report⠀and⠀memory⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀account,⠀a⠀leaked⠀file,⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀conversation⠀are⠀different⠀kinds⠀of⠀evidence,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀keep⠀their⠀limits⠀visible⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀case⠀summary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀specific⠀and⠀material.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀water,⠀power,⠀clinic,⠀transit,⠀credit,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀feed.⠀Let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀record⠀the⠀cost:⠀a⠀family⠀displaced,⠀a⠀body⠀altered,⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀protest⠀logged⠀and⠀priced.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀or⠀supernatural⠀facts.⠀The⠀power⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀concrete⠀reality⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀and⠀the⠀witness's⠀decision⠀to⠀speak.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀person⠀and⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀witness⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀change⠀themselves⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀see,⠀but⠀the⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀has⠀altered⠀how⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀community⠀or⠀the⠀system,⠀not⠀when⠀every⠀injustice⠀has⠀been⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀location,⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀goal,⠀and⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀already⠀active:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀window,⠀a⠀locked⠀account,⠀a⠀held⠀package,⠀a⠀clinic⠀appointment,⠀or⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀missed.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀rooftop⠀to⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀or⠀a⠀terminal⠀to⠀a⠀back⠀office,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀short,⠀concrete⠀line.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀exchanges⠀compact.⠀Let⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀work⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said:⠀a⠀character⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀word,⠀looks⠀at⠀a⠀screen⠀instead⠀of⠀replying,⠀or⠀notices⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀explain.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀appear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀manual.⠀Fold⠀the⠀explanation⠀into⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀attention.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats⠀focused.⠀After⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀negotiation⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀show⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀brief,⠀specific⠀beat:⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀a⠀calculation,⠀or⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀ready⠀with⠀banter.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀as⠀a⠀visual⠀or⠀verbal⠀turn.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀detail⠀noticed⠀earlier⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀meaning:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀already⠀open,⠀a⠀charge⠀that⠀appeared⠀before⠀the⠀meeting,⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀scar⠀under⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀Let⠀the⠀turn⠀land⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀line.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀has⠀shifted,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀on⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀First⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀comedy⠀are⠀not⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀slow⠀accumulation⠀of⠀sensory⠀and⠀social⠀detail⠀around⠀something⠀not⠀yet⠀named⠀—⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀spoken.⠀Move⠀through⠀the⠀surfaces⠀where⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀show⠀themselves:⠀light⠀on⠀wet⠀composite,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀filtration⠀unit,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀hand⠀hesitating⠀over⠀a⠀payment⠀pad.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀images⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀bear⠀returning⠀to,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀register⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀noticed⠀since,⠀so⠀that⠀recurrence⠀carries⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀unnamed⠀thing⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀a⠀plot⠀beat.⠀Keep⠀that⠀thing⠀specific⠀—⠀a⠀real⠀question⠀or⠀cost⠀the⠀narration⠀circles⠀—⠀never⠀a⠀vague⠀mood.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀inner⠀access,⠀let⠀the⠀lyric⠀attention⠀include⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀and⠀reasoning;⠀the⠀gap⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀gets⠀said⠀or⠀explained,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀emptied⠀narration.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀comparison⠀appears,⠀make⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands.⠀A⠀debt⠀told⠀through⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀sealing⠀should⠀then⠀expose⠀who⠀controls⠀that⠀door,⠀who⠀waits⠀outside⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀debt⠀has⠀already⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀cut⠀the⠀figurative⠀run⠀—⠀a⠀single⠀short⠀line⠀can⠀pivot⠀a⠀whole⠀paragraph.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀enter⠀the⠀lyric⠀line⠀as⠀found⠀material:⠀a⠀warranty⠀clause,⠀a⠀loan⠀term,⠀a⠀warning⠀repeated⠀in⠀the⠀stairwell.⠀Let⠀such⠀phrases⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀rhythm⠀and⠀return⠀until⠀they⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀unnamed⠀fact.\n\nIf⠀the⠀story⠀brings⠀the⠀withheld⠀thing⠀into⠀the⠀open,⠀let⠀the⠀arriving⠀fact⠀reweight⠀an⠀earlier⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀explain⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀image⠀now⠀means⠀more,⠀or⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀reveal⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀reply;⠀the⠀pressure⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀keeps⠀moving⠀through⠀the⠀world⠀it⠀has⠀organized.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀mid-motion,⠀mid-noticing,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀settling⠀after⠀something⠀has⠀finally⠀been⠀said.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-cyberpunk_noir-03",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Cyberpunk Noir · 03/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == cyberpunk_noir}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Cyberpunk Noir. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-cyberpunk_noir; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaeaiap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀fact,⠀stated⠀plainly,⠀and⠀let⠀attention⠀carry⠀the⠀narrator⠀into⠀what⠀it⠀recalls.⠀Make⠀the⠀memory⠀particular⠀—⠀one⠀evening,⠀one⠀transaction,⠀one⠀phrase⠀—⠀never⠀a⠀generalized⠀haze⠀of⠀loss.⠀When⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀of⠀access⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀change,⠀use⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀hinge:⠀a⠀card⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀directory,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀without⠀the⠀tone⠀the⠀character⠀remembers.⠀When⠀nothing⠀has⠀changed,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀thing⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀weight⠀—⠀the⠀directory⠀still⠀listing⠀someone⠀gone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀memory⠀itself:⠀what⠀was⠀paid,⠀who⠀let⠀them⠀in,⠀what⠀was⠀agreed⠀to⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀be⠀there.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gaps⠀the⠀way⠀this⠀telling⠀needs⠀them:⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀something⠀and⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀circles⠀that⠀withheld⠀detail⠀through⠀remembered⠀sound,⠀or⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀now⠀records.⠀Under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀write⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀for⠀real⠀—⠀the⠀reasoning,⠀the⠀ache,⠀the⠀arithmetic⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀spoken⠀account⠀stays⠀partial⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀character.⠀The⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀memory⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀grief,⠀and⠀let⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stay⠀pleasurable⠀even⠀where⠀it⠀hurts.\n\nIf⠀recognition⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀come⠀late:⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀reflective⠀passage⠀that⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀meant⠀something⠀else,⠀or⠀that⠀memory⠀has⠀been⠀shaped⠀by⠀a⠀fact⠀not⠀yet⠀admitted⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀changes⠀weight⠀without⠀losing⠀its⠀pleasure⠀or⠀its⠀cost.⠀Never⠀require⠀that⠀turn.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀old⠀and⠀new⠀meanings⠀held⠀together,⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀going⠀on⠀around⠀the⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀episode⠀inside⠀a⠀frame:⠀one⠀teller,⠀one⠀listener,⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion.⠀Establish⠀briefly⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀why⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀wants⠀from⠀it,⠀then⠀let⠀that⠀occasion⠀govern⠀the⠀telling⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀includes,⠀softens,⠀withholds,⠀or⠀speeds⠀past.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀stakes,⠀not⠀an⠀ornamental⠀prologue.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀scenario⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀choosing⠀this⠀tradition⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀require⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀religion.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀names⠀a⠀specific⠀tradition,⠀keep⠀its⠀conventions⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀regional⠀flavor.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀in⠀compact⠀declarative⠀movement:⠀short,⠀exact⠀sentences⠀and⠀distilled⠀images⠀—⠀an⠀empty⠀courier⠀case,⠀a⠀lock⠀that⠀still⠀answers⠀to⠀a⠀dead⠀hand,⠀a⠀debt⠀transferred⠀three⠀times⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀night.⠀The⠀teller⠀holds⠀back⠀one⠀decisive⠀fact,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀is⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀subject,⠀a⠀detail⠀mentioned⠀and⠀then⠀refused.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀misread,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀answer⠀can⠀deepen⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀instead⠀of⠀closing⠀it.⠀A⠀single⠀aphoristic⠀line⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀of⠀earned⠀general⠀truth⠀drawn⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀lived⠀—⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀tale,⠀provided⠀it⠀costs⠀something⠀rather⠀than⠀ornamenting⠀the⠀surface.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tale's⠀substance⠀stay⠀noir:⠀access,⠀payment,⠀surveillance,⠀exclusion⠀—⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀telling⠀itself,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀bugged⠀room,⠀a⠀creditor⠀listening,⠀or⠀time⠀being⠀bought.⠀If⠀the⠀withheld⠀fact⠀surfaces,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀relation⠀among⠀teller,⠀listener,⠀and⠀events:⠀the⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀concerns⠀them,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀understands⠀the⠀fact⠀only⠀by⠀saying⠀it⠀aloud.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀that⠀arrival.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀concluded⠀and⠀the⠀frame's⠀business⠀still⠀open,⠀its⠀consequence⠀unfolding⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀it⠀was⠀told.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀state⠀them⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Each⠀one⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀situation:⠀who⠀has⠀access,⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀watched,⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀will⠀cost.⠀Cut⠀whatever⠀does⠀not⠀serve⠀the⠀present⠀account,⠀but⠀leave⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀omitted⠀fact⠀can⠀be⠀inferred⠀—⠀or⠀that⠀something⠀specific⠀is⠀being⠀withheld⠀can⠀be⠀inferred.⠀Never⠀delete⠀causality;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀act.⠀Brevity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota:⠀where⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀connection⠀needs⠀room,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀brief⠀declarative⠀line⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀shape⠀and⠀let⠀compact⠀exchanges⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀it,⠀make⠀that⠀a⠀real⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀account,⠀recoverable⠀from⠀what⠀surrounds⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀building⠀lands⠀because⠀a⠀changed⠀lock⠀or⠀a⠀transferred⠀debt⠀was⠀named⠀earlier.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀inner⠀access,⠀give⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀reasoning⠀in⠀as⠀few⠀words⠀as⠀this⠀character⠀would⠀spend⠀on⠀it;⠀silence⠀in⠀speech⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀empty⠀head,⠀and⠀each⠀voice⠀stays⠀individual.\n\nA⠀withheld⠀fact⠀draws⠀its⠀force⠀from⠀the⠀details⠀placed⠀around⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀detail⠀or⠀exchange⠀brings⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀open,⠀one⠀sentence⠀can⠀turn⠀the⠀whole⠀account,⠀changing⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀meant⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀revisit⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀stage⠀a⠀reveal⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀earned,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀rush⠀the⠀ending⠀to⠀deliver⠀one.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀—⠀even⠀mid-exchange,⠀even⠀before⠀the⠀consequence⠀lands⠀—⠀and⠀trust⠀what⠀remains⠀selected.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes.⠀Let⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀clean⠀transitions⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀the⠀world's⠀systems:⠀a⠀conversation⠀in⠀a⠀monitored⠀lobby,⠀a⠀walk⠀past⠀a⠀payment⠀kiosk,⠀a⠀memory⠀surfacing⠀of⠀the⠀contract⠀behind⠀a⠀present⠀obligation.⠀No⠀recap⠀machinery;⠀trust⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀shown.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.\n\nHold⠀the⠀decisive⠀fact⠀back⠀inside⠀the⠀fuller⠀prose.⠀Dwell⠀on⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀or⠀remembers,⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀fact⠀too⠀early⠀—⠀it⠀stays⠀a⠀live⠀pressure,⠀whether⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀something⠀the⠀reader⠀does⠀not,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀a⠀contradiction⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀faced.⠀Embed⠀the⠀compact⠀exchanges⠀in⠀the⠀continuous⠀flow:⠀a⠀short⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀lands⠀harder⠀after⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀of⠀perception,⠀and⠀a⠀distilled⠀image⠀can⠀serve⠀as⠀the⠀pivot⠀on⠀which⠀the⠀scene⠀turns.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀current⠀of⠀the⠀prose⠀—⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀half-formed⠀judgment⠀—⠀not⠀quarantined⠀in⠀a⠀special⠀aside;⠀the⠀gap⠀lies⠀in⠀what⠀gets⠀explained,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀missing⠀interior⠀life.\n\nIf⠀the⠀withheld⠀fact⠀opens,⠀let⠀its⠀new⠀meaning⠀arrive⠀inside⠀the⠀continuing⠀scene:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀it⠀at⠀once,⠀or⠀carry⠀it⠀unsettled⠀while⠀business⠀proceeds,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀need⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀summarize⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀the⠀turn⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀reply.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀or⠀mid-movement,⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scenes⠀you⠀choose⠀and⠀the⠀moments⠀you⠀return⠀to.⠀Draw⠀only⠀on⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplied⠀—⠀these⠀particular⠀people,⠀this⠀particular⠀history⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀inserting⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀is⠀under⠀pressure⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀systems:⠀a⠀shared⠀access⠀code⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has⠀changed,⠀a⠀debt⠀one⠀paid⠀without⠀telling⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀they⠀both⠀know⠀is⠀running.⠀Private⠀language⠀does⠀the⠀remembering⠀—⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀—⠀and⠀recurs⠀with⠀new⠀weight⠀once⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀exchanges⠀in⠀which⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said⠀carries⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀what⠀is.⠀A⠀short⠀dialogue⠀can⠀expose⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀without⠀anyone⠀announcing⠀a⠀feeling;⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀something⠀and⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀it,⠀the⠀silence⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀this⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀history.⠀Make⠀the⠀withheld⠀fact⠀specific⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀—⠀one⠀knows⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other's⠀past,⠀debt,⠀body,⠀or⠀loyalties⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀interiority⠀follow⠀the⠀contract:⠀render⠀the⠀private⠀worry,⠀tenderness,⠀or⠀calculation⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀is,⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀keeps⠀it⠀out⠀of⠀speech,⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀them.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀beat⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀promised⠀comes⠀due⠀—⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀returned⠀phrase,⠀a⠀discovery⠀that⠀revises⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀a⠀consequence⠀finally⠀accepted⠀—⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀land.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀payoff⠀into⠀every⠀reply;⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀build⠀toward⠀it⠀and⠀stop⠀short,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀difficulty⠀resolves.⠀The⠀systems⠀stay⠀active⠀throughout:⠀access⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀revoked,⠀surveillance⠀still⠀records,⠀a⠀debt⠀still⠀comes⠀due.⠀The⠀relationship⠀may⠀be⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀surfaces⠀while⠀its⠀practical⠀situation⠀keeps⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀retelling.⠀When⠀a⠀unit⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀opens,⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀can⠀place⠀the⠀episode⠀among⠀deeds⠀people⠀remember⠀—⠀a⠀courier⠀who⠀carried⠀a⠀false⠀manifest,⠀a⠀fixer⠀who⠀opened⠀the⠀door⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀would⠀open,⠀a⠀debtor⠀who⠀paid⠀with⠀someone⠀else's⠀name⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀follow⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation⠀the⠀declaration⠀offered.⠀Inside⠀a⠀continuing⠀scene,⠀keep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀register⠀through⠀remembered⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀re-declaring⠀it⠀each⠀time.\n\nWork⠀brief⠀declaratives⠀and⠀distilled⠀images⠀into⠀the⠀saga's⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀designation⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀and⠀it⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀supply⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀remembered⠀consequence:⠀who⠀controlled⠀access,⠀who⠀paid,⠀who⠀was⠀excluded,⠀what⠀the⠀surveillance⠀record⠀later⠀showed.⠀A⠀public⠀deed⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀heroic⠀or⠀shameful;⠀either⠀way,⠀keep⠀its⠀practical⠀cost⠀legible.⠀Hold⠀the⠀telling's⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀subject⠀tells⠀their⠀own⠀story,⠀the⠀community's⠀version⠀can⠀be⠀weighed⠀openly⠀against⠀the⠀private⠀one;⠀where⠀narration⠀stays⠀outside,⠀let⠀the⠀divergence⠀between⠀reputation⠀and⠀focal⠀experience⠀remain⠀perceptible⠀within⠀what⠀that⠀contract⠀permits.\n\nThe⠀withheld⠀fact⠀—⠀the⠀true⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed,⠀who⠀actually⠀paid,⠀why⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀now⠀met⠀with⠀silence⠀—⠀gathers⠀force⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀If⠀it⠀surfaces,⠀let⠀it⠀reweight⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀rather⠀than⠀turn⠀the⠀episode⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀its⠀arrival.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀now⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀differently,⠀its⠀consequences⠀running⠀on⠀past⠀the⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀a⠀restrained⠀social-institutional⠀prose⠀narrative⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀realist⠀tradition.⠀Treat⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀concrete⠀arrangements:⠀who⠀is⠀employed⠀by⠀whom,⠀which⠀records⠀are⠀kept,⠀what⠀a⠀service⠀costs,⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀must⠀sign⠀or⠀surrender⠀to⠀proceed.⠀Render⠀these⠀conditions⠀through⠀specific⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric⠀neon⠀or⠀slang.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀observes⠀or⠀prices⠀a⠀person,⠀show⠀the⠀actual⠀mechanism:⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀withheld⠀credential,⠀a⠀billing⠀notice,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀instruction.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀declarative⠀movement⠀and⠀meaningful⠀gaps.⠀State⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀notices⠀in⠀short,⠀exact⠀sentences.⠀Leave⠀the⠀reason⠀unspoken⠀until⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀stillness.⠀A⠀glance⠀at⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀or⠀a⠀bill⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀can⠀carry⠀pressure⠀without⠀immediate⠀explanation.⠀Delay⠀revelation⠀by⠀withholding⠀a⠀single⠀consequential⠀fact⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues;⠀when⠀it⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understood⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀confirming⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀socially⠀situated.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀appears⠀as⠀composed⠀inward⠀prose,⠀not⠀as⠀speech⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀decision⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀rent,⠀work,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀institutional⠀procedure⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀comply,⠀bargain,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀help⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀remain⠀partly⠀private.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀system⠀cruel⠀or⠀every⠀helper⠀corrupt;⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀produce⠀the⠀pressure.\n\nDistinguish⠀observation⠀from⠀inference.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀see⠀that⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀open⠀without⠀knowing⠀who⠀opened⠀it.⠀A⠀record⠀can⠀confirm⠀a⠀transaction⠀without⠀proving⠀a⠀motive.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀known,⠀then⠀allow⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀or⠀discovery⠀to⠀complicate⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀economical:⠀no⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀of⠀a⠀gesture,⠀no⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀witnessed,⠀and⠀no⠀compulsory⠀wit⠀or⠀confession⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀then⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀screen⠀lights,⠀a⠀payment⠀fails,⠀a⠀person⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀without⠀drinking.⠀Keep⠀each⠀action⠀line⠀to⠀one⠀observable⠀event⠀or⠀condition.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀use⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀that⠀are⠀short⠀and⠀exact.⠀Let⠀a⠀line⠀imply⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀says;⠀do⠀not⠀have⠀characters⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀has⠀already⠀shown.\n\nRender⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀as⠀observable⠀conditions.⠀Show⠀the⠀scanner⠀above⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀balance⠀on⠀the⠀terminal,⠀the⠀guard⠀checking⠀a⠀credential,⠀the⠀implant⠀glowing⠀under⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀When⠀surveillance⠀or⠀debt⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀something⠀the⠀camera⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀design⠀can⠀hear:⠀a⠀notification⠀tone,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀belongs⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀onscreen⠀text⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀speak⠀or⠀display⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀through⠀scene⠀information.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀comment.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀refers⠀to⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀earlier⠀stillness⠀changes⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀connection⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀cut⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀supply⠀the⠀new⠀fact.\n\nWhen⠀required⠀private⠀prose⠀is⠀needed,⠀include⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀character-name⠀heading⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀prose.⠀This⠀note⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀requires⠀it.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀short⠀and⠀exact.⠀Let⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀object⠀handled,⠀or⠀a⠀person's⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀carry⠀meaning⠀that⠀the⠀lines⠀do⠀not⠀state.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀enters⠀or⠀leaves,⠀make⠀the⠀movement⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure:⠀someone⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀notice,⠀leaves⠀before⠀answering,⠀or⠀stands⠀between⠀another⠀person⠀and⠀the⠀door.\n\nStage⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀as⠀physical⠀conditions.⠀A⠀terminal⠀on⠀a⠀desk,⠀a⠀scanner⠀by⠀the⠀entrance,⠀a⠀bill⠀in⠀a⠀character's⠀hand,⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀visible⠀implant.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀interact⠀with⠀these⠀objects⠀through⠀ordinary⠀business:⠀checking⠀a⠀screen,⠀refusing⠀to⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀credential,⠀paying⠀for⠀a⠀drink.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀in⠀dialogue⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀speak⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀narration.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀through⠀staged⠀details.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀an⠀object⠀without⠀comment.⠀A⠀later⠀entrance⠀or⠀exit⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means:⠀the⠀drawer⠀is⠀now⠀open,⠀the⠀terminal⠀is⠀dark,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀left⠀has⠀the⠀key.⠀Let⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀refers⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀stillness.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀announce⠀the⠀connection⠀in⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀text.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀an⠀aside⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀a⠀specific⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀for⠀performed⠀speech.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀entrance⠀or⠀exit,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀silence⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀theatrical⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀interruption⠀braid⠀together⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀experiences⠀them.⠀A⠀scanner's⠀tone⠀can⠀pull⠀the⠀thought⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀debt⠀notice;⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀can⠀surface⠀a⠀conversation⠀from⠀years⠀ago;⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀wet⠀sleeve⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀dry⠀room.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀follow⠀these⠀associations,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀distilled⠀images⠀inside⠀the⠀mental⠀flow.⠀A⠀single⠀sharp⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀explanation:⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀terminal,⠀a⠀name⠀written⠀in⠀condensation,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀close.⠀Let⠀the⠀mind⠀return⠀to⠀such⠀an⠀image⠀without⠀immediately⠀explaining⠀it.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀works⠀by⠀association:⠀a⠀later⠀perception⠀or⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀image⠀meant.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀connection;⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀arrive⠀at⠀it.\n\nLet⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀enter⠀as⠀recurring⠀pressures⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀The⠀character's⠀thoughts⠀circle⠀a⠀bill,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀phrase,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀works⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀did.⠀These⠀concerns⠀surface⠀through⠀sensory⠀triggers⠀and⠀private⠀words,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀system⠀operates.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀or⠀who⠀pays,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀immediate⠀thought⠀or⠀sensation:⠀the⠀door⠀opens⠀for⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀payment⠀clears,⠀the⠀implant⠀aches.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀flow⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀character.⠀Another⠀person's⠀mind⠀is⠀not⠀available⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀enough;⠀the⠀movement⠀must⠀be⠀associative,⠀with⠀interruptions⠀and⠀returns.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀thought⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀line.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀mind⠀rests,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀external⠀scene⠀remains⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Keep⠀each⠀message⠀short⠀and⠀exact,⠀in⠀the⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habit:⠀one⠀person⠀writes⠀full⠀sentences,⠀another⠀sends⠀fragments,⠀a⠀third⠀leaves⠀long⠀silences.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sender⠀witty⠀or⠀cryptic.⠀Let⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀types,⠀sends,⠀edits,⠀delays,⠀or⠀leaves⠀unsent⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure.\n\nRender⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀as⠀meaningful⠀interface⠀events.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀arrive,⠀a⠀payment⠀notification,⠀a⠀channel⠀that⠀requires⠀access,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀fails⠀to⠀send,⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀contradicts⠀a⠀claim.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀sender⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀it,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀support⠀reply⠀or⠀an⠀automated⠀notice.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀through⠀message⠀timing⠀and⠀omission.⠀A⠀sender⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀and⠀receives⠀no⠀answer.⠀A⠀later⠀message⠀refers⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀silence,⠀or⠀an⠀attachment⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀message⠀meant.⠀A⠀person⠀notices⠀something⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀type⠀it.⠀The⠀revelation⠀arrives⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀finally⠀sent,⠀edited,⠀or⠀left⠀unsent.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀a⠀sender⠀explain⠀the⠀connection⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀message.\n\nDistinguish⠀sent⠀messages⠀from⠀unsent⠀drafts⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀transmitted⠀and⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀recipient.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀that⠀the⠀sender⠀has⠀not⠀transmitted;⠀show⠀it⠀clearly⠀as⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀the⠀recipient⠀can⠀read.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀when⠀required.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀needed,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀meaningful⠀silence⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaiba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀scene-oriented⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀visual⠀novel.⠀Open⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting:⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀is⠀visible,⠀and⠀what⠀condition⠀the⠀space⠀is⠀in.⠀Use⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names.⠀Follow⠀dialogue⠀with⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀withholds.⠀Keep⠀the⠀passages⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀sit⠀beside⠀an⠀image,⠀but⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀room⠀to⠀do⠀its⠀work.\n\nUse⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀moment:⠀a⠀terminal⠀glowing⠀in⠀a⠀dark⠀room,⠀a⠀wet⠀street⠀outside⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀door⠀standing⠀open.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀can⠀suggest⠀a⠀reaction:⠀a⠀flat⠀look,⠀a⠀slight⠀nod,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀stops⠀before⠀touching⠀the⠀screen.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀expression⠀reveal⠀whether⠀a⠀person⠀lies.⠀Let⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account⠀or⠀arrangement⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.\n\nRender⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀as⠀visible⠀conditions⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀scanner⠀above⠀the⠀entrance,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀on⠀the⠀terminal,⠀a⠀guard's⠀credential,⠀a⠀body⠀with⠀a⠀visible⠀implant.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀can⠀register⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀or⠀who⠀pays,⠀but⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀their⠀knowledge.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀through⠀scene⠀changes⠀and⠀focal⠀reactions.⠀A⠀familiar⠀visual⠀detail⠀appears⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀without⠀explanation.⠀A⠀later⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀condition,⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀connects⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀fact.⠀Let⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀information⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀focal⠀realization,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaibb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀Each⠀reply⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps:⠀a⠀single⠀exact⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment,⠀not⠀a⠀retelling⠀of⠀the⠀investigation⠀that⠀established⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀recovered⠀detail⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀new⠀scene⠀and⠀acquire⠀meaning⠀through⠀what⠀happens⠀next.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀person⠀notices⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀condition⠀without⠀explanation.⠀A⠀later⠀installment⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀stillness⠀meant.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀earlier⠀observation⠀exactly;⠀do⠀not⠀alter⠀it⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀contradiction.⠀New⠀evidence⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event.\n\nLet⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀develop⠀as⠀cumulative⠀conditions.⠀A⠀debt⠀grows,⠀a⠀credential⠀expires,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀is⠀mentioned⠀again,⠀a⠀body's⠀modification⠀causes⠀a⠀new⠀problem.⠀Show⠀these⠀changes⠀through⠀concrete⠀particulars:⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀denied⠀access,⠀a⠀notification.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀system⠀would⠀actually⠀use⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀installment⠀introduce⠀a⠀new⠀system;⠀let⠀the⠀existing⠀conditions⠀deepen.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀A⠀repeated⠀question⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀new⠀implication⠀without⠀a⠀fresh⠀contradiction⠀being⠀invented.⠀Close⠀an⠀installment⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀visible⠀change,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀fair⠀answer⠀perpetually⠀recede.⠀Use⠀an⠀occasional⠀hook⠀when⠀the⠀development⠀earns⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀compulsory⠀ending⠀for⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀noir⠀investigation⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀performs⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀actions⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀even,⠀unhurried⠀attention:⠀making⠀coffee,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀contact,⠀checking⠀a⠀message,⠀walking⠀a⠀familiar⠀route,⠀paying⠀for⠀access.⠀Let⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀corporate⠀systems⠀of⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀remain⠀present⠀as⠀concrete⠀conditions⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀or⠀limit⠀those⠀actions.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀watched,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀surveillance⠀actually⠀changes:⠀a⠀message⠀he⠀does⠀not⠀send,⠀a⠀route⠀he⠀avoids,⠀a⠀question⠀he⠀rephrases,⠀a⠀debt⠀he⠀remembers⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀unrelated.\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀as⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀continuing⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀inside⠀that⠀system.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀thought⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀he⠀is⠀avoiding,⠀needing,⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀reach.⠀A⠀small⠀detail,⠀an⠀old⠀message,⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀bill⠀he⠀cannot⠀pay⠀can⠀open⠀an⠀unresolved⠀feeling⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀him⠀to⠀name⠀the⠀feeling⠀or⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀strain⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀he⠀withholds,⠀what⠀he⠀repeats,⠀what⠀he⠀almost⠀says,⠀and⠀what⠀he⠀does⠀instead.⠀If⠀he⠀does⠀speak,⠀make⠀the⠀spoken⠀words⠀simpler⠀or⠀more⠀guarded⠀than⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀around⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀response⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀practical⠀rather⠀than⠀fully⠀healing.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀investigation⠀moving⠀through⠀concrete⠀noir⠀pressure:⠀a⠀bribe,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀credential,⠀a⠀locked⠀file,⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀that⠀means⠀something⠀worse⠀than⠀it⠀says,⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀name.⠀Use⠀each⠀pressure⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes,⠀not⠀to⠀replace⠀them.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀bargains⠀or⠀compromises,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀costs⠀him⠀privately,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀continues⠀without⠀a⠀pause.⠀The⠀ending⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀unsettled⠀and⠀the⠀case⠀unfinished;⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀routine⠀with⠀the⠀hurt⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀settings.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world⠀remain⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀characters:⠀a⠀payment⠀window,⠀a⠀monitored⠀lobby,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor,⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice,⠀a⠀drone⠀passing⠀overhead,⠀or⠀another⠀NPC⠀continuing⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀business.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀conditions⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀scenery⠀list.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀attention⠀to⠀slow⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀stalling⠀it.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀in⠀exact⠀detail:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀contact⠀stirs⠀a⠀drink,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀card⠀reader,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀message⠀arrives.⠀Let⠀that⠀detail⠀connect⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀connection,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀remain⠀inside⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀knowledge.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀conversational⠀and⠀restrained⠀rather⠀than⠀ornate.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀shared⠀situation⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks,⠀make⠀the⠀words⠀sound⠀like⠀that⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀speech,⠀not⠀polished⠀banter.⠀Allow⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀respond⠀with⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀evasion,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀question.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened.⠀A⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀be⠀partly⠀done,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀simply⠀wait;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀mandatory⠀choice,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal⠀at⠀the⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀city⠀life:⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀commute,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀problem.⠀Let⠀technological⠀and⠀corporate⠀systems⠀enter⠀through⠀those⠀ordinary⠀social⠀arrangements⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀abstract⠀worldbuilding.⠀A⠀rent⠀increase,⠀a⠀monitored⠀building,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀biometric⠀check,⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀needs⠀money,⠀or⠀a⠀shop⠀that⠀keeps⠀records⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀daily⠀experience⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀exact⠀attention.⠀Describe⠀practical⠀actions⠀and⠀familiar⠀surfaces⠀without⠀hurry:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀locks⠀a⠀door,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀bus,⠀reads⠀a⠀notice,⠀or⠀prepares⠀food.⠀Let⠀private⠀concern⠀surface⠀through⠀association⠀with⠀those⠀ordinary⠀things.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀earlier⠀time⠀while⠀doing⠀something⠀routine,⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀may⠀remain⠀incomplete⠀or⠀unresolved.\n\nMake⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀stakes⠀legible⠀through⠀concrete⠀relationships⠀and⠀transactions.⠀Show⠀who⠀has⠀access,⠀who⠀is⠀watched,⠀who⠀owes⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs⠀in⠀money,⠀trust,⠀or⠀standing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀choices⠀arise⠀from⠀their⠀actual⠀circumstances⠀in⠀that⠀neighborhood⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀noir⠀plot.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Use⠀short,⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀between⠀actions⠀and⠀let⠀material⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀scene:⠀worn⠀soles,⠀a⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀sticks,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀clears⠀too⠀slowly,⠀a⠀jacket⠀that⠀smells⠀of⠀rain⠀and⠀old⠀wiring.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀physical⠀and⠀economic:⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀access,⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀information.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀show⠀the⠀concrete⠀result⠀or⠀the⠀concrete⠀obstacle.\n\nPreserve⠀Murakami's⠀attention⠀as⠀a⠀deliberate⠀rhythm⠀shift.⠀Before⠀the⠀pressure⠀closes⠀in,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀register⠀a⠀small⠀ordinary⠀thing,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀shadow,⠀a⠀familiar⠀sound,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀connect⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀concern.⠀Keep⠀that⠀pause⠀brief⠀and⠀concrete;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀compressed⠀style⠀erase⠀the⠀association.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀language⠀direct⠀and⠀free⠀of⠀ornamental⠀abstraction.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Compress⠀routine⠀or⠀violent⠀movement;⠀slow⠀down⠀for⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀threat,⠀weighs⠀a⠀choice,⠀or⠀remembers⠀something⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀present.⠀Ground⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker:⠀a⠀street⠀contact,⠀a⠀corporate⠀enforcer,⠀or⠀an⠀exhausted⠀friend⠀may⠀talk⠀hard,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀itself⠀should⠀not⠀perform⠀toughness.⠀End⠀scenes⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀image⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀practical⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires:⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀statement,⠀a⠀log,⠀a⠀note,⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀transaction,⠀or⠀another⠀authored⠀text.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.⠀What⠀each⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follows⠀its⠀writer's⠀situation:⠀a⠀corporate⠀report⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀bribe,⠀a⠀personal⠀message⠀may⠀avoid⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀log⠀may⠀record⠀only⠀what⠀a⠀sensor⠀noticed.\n\nLet⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀attention⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀notices⠀and⠀includes.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀ordinary⠀action⠀or⠀object⠀with⠀exact⠀care,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀delay,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀leave⠀an⠀uncertainty⠀unresolved⠀or⠀record⠀an⠀association⠀that⠀seems⠀strange⠀even⠀to⠀them.⠀Gaps,⠀revisions,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀can⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nUse⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world⠀as⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀writing:⠀surveillance⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀message⠀cautious,⠀debt⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀report⠀selective,⠀corporate⠀language⠀may⠀distort⠀a⠀statement,⠀and⠀a⠀broken⠀device⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀record.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀information⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀say.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀by⠀letting⠀each⠀new⠀entry⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀the⠀ones⠀before,⠀so⠀the⠀sequence⠀itself⠀performs⠀the⠀investigation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world⠀as⠀it⠀is:⠀monitored,⠀indebted,⠀and⠀unequal,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀spend⠀real⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀bring⠀the⠀right⠀food,⠀remember⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀share⠀a⠀quiet⠀room,⠀fix⠀a⠀small⠀thing,⠀or⠀wait⠀without⠀demanding⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Use⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀attention⠀to⠀render⠀these⠀acts⠀with⠀exact⠀care:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice,⠀the⠀comfort⠀of⠀a⠀routine,⠀the⠀relief⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀against⠀the⠀city.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀care⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀still⠀disagree,⠀keep⠀secrets,⠀or⠀carry⠀separate⠀worries.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward.⠀A⠀kind⠀act⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀the⠀danger⠀from⠀the⠀world,⠀but⠀it⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀interval⠀easier⠀to⠀bear.⠀Keep⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀visible⠀at⠀the⠀edges:⠀a⠀bill,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀still⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀made⠀should⠀remain⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀specific⠀unresolved⠀condition⠀framing⠀the⠀comfort.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀comfort⠀without⠀becoming⠀agreeable,⠀or⠀offer⠀care⠀without⠀explaining⠀why.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀or⠀quiet⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀resolution.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀enjoy⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀familiar⠀preferences⠀without⠀forcing⠀warmth⠀to⠀solve⠀the⠀plot.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀or⠀close⠀through⠀a⠀frame⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀action⠀in⠀social⠀context:⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀history,⠀a⠀company's⠀reputation,⠀a⠀law's⠀effect,⠀a⠀family's⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀judgment⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀city⠀has⠀become.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world⠀legible⠀through⠀that⠀framing:⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀access,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀social⠀conditions⠀the⠀characters⠀live⠀inside,⠀not⠀as⠀isolated⠀threats.\n\nPreserve⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀narrator⠀and⠀lonely⠀attention⠀within⠀the⠀formal⠀style.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀broad⠀observation⠀to⠀an⠀exact⠀surface,⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀machine,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀detail⠀open⠀a⠀private⠀association.⠀Use⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀formality⠀erase⠀the⠀character's⠀interior⠀experience.⠀Uncertainty⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀a⠀strange⠀or⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀evenly⠀without⠀being⠀explained.\n\nLet⠀the⠀investigation⠀and⠀its⠀bargains⠀unfold⠀through⠀scenes⠀that⠀compare⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀life.⠀A⠀corporate⠀statement⠀may⠀contrast⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀conversation;⠀a⠀public⠀record⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀a⠀memory;⠀a⠀formal⠀transaction⠀may⠀cost⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀only⠀recognizes⠀later.⠀Use⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀archaic⠀vocabulary.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture,⠀not⠀a⠀costume.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀calm,⠀concrete⠀encounter⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀exist:⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀transaction⠀is⠀pending,⠀a⠀wait⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀arranged,⠀a⠀task⠀being⠀prepared⠀or⠀postponed.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀audience,⠀an⠀occasion,⠀and⠀a⠀purpose—someone⠀recounts⠀a⠀past⠀job,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀disappearance,⠀a⠀favor,⠀or⠀a⠀disputed⠀incident⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀needs⠀something⠀from⠀the⠀account⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀teller.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀even⠀and⠀specific:⠀the⠀surface⠀of⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀the⠀coffee,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀fan,⠀the⠀way⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀comes⠀to⠀hold⠀private⠀concern.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀world.⠀It⠀may⠀persuade⠀a⠀fixer⠀to⠀extend⠀credit,⠀delay⠀a⠀handoff,⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀contact⠀went⠀dark,⠀warn⠀a⠀buyer,⠀or⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀reads⠀a⠀contract⠀clause,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment,⠀or⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀surveillance.⠀Treat⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story:⠀a⠀careful⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀while⠀omitting⠀who⠀else⠀was⠀present,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀noticed⠀but⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀needs⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀concrete⠀intervals—a⠀refill,⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀a⠀screen.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀frame⠀and⠀tale:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀lock,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀never⠀clears,⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀teller⠀will⠀not⠀say,⠀a⠀signal⠀that⠀arrives⠀late.⠀Recurrence⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀being⠀guided⠀toward⠀a⠀particular⠀interpretation,⠀not⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀is⠀true.⠀The⠀listener⠀can⠀weigh⠀all⠀this⠀privately⠀while⠀giving⠀a⠀polite⠀or⠀neutral⠀spoken⠀answer;⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀aloud⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀concluded⠀need⠀not⠀match,⠀and⠀both⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nWhile⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀being⠀told,⠀let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀supply⠀a⠀separate⠀layer⠀of⠀pressure:⠀a⠀terminal⠀still⠀processing,⠀a⠀debt⠀clock,⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel,⠀a⠀body⠀showing⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀an⠀implant,⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀The⠀listener⠀can⠀set⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀against⠀what⠀those⠀systems⠀make⠀visible—a⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀balance,⠀an⠀access⠀log,⠀a⠀locked⠀route—and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀recounted⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀observable⠀record⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀lives.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀at⠀human⠀scale;⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀reasons⠀to⠀speak,⠀not⠀a⠀device⠀for⠀delivering⠀background.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀unresolved⠀thresholds.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀explain⠀an⠀event⠀without⠀settling⠀whether⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀protecting⠀someone,⠀remembering⠀accurately,⠀or⠀inventing⠀a⠀version⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀sold.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀stay⠀conversational⠀and⠀undramatic⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀tale⠀describes⠀violence⠀or⠀loss.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀or⠀the⠀outer⠀scene;⠀the⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀finish,⠀the⠀listener⠀need⠀not⠀act,⠀and⠀no⠀revelation⠀has⠀to⠀land⠀before⠀the⠀passage⠀closes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀narrator⠀comparing⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀system⠀records⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers,⠀or⠀has⠀been⠀told,⠀about⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀place,⠀work,⠀or⠀relationship⠀once⠀functioned.⠀Make⠀the⠀documentary⠀layer⠀concrete:⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀work⠀log,⠀a⠀credit⠀record,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀history,⠀a⠀corporate⠀memo,⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀have⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀report.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀record's⠀language⠀and⠀a⠀private,⠀unhurried⠀attention,⠀so⠀each⠀document⠀is⠀both⠀a⠀fact⠀and⠀something⠀read⠀by⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀history.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comparison⠀create⠀the⠀pressure.⠀A⠀record⠀shows⠀that⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀at⠀a⠀certain⠀hour⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀waiting⠀somewhere⠀else⠀entirely.⠀A⠀contract⠀describes⠀a⠀service⠀as⠀voluntary⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀became⠀unavoidable.⠀A⠀system⠀lists⠀someone⠀as⠀inactive⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀still⠀does.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀record,⠀who⠀can⠀correct⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀differently.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀unspoken⠀reading⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀quoted⠀line:⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀opening⠀a⠀file,⠀the⠀detail⠀checked⠀twice,⠀the⠀entry⠀read⠀again⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀leaves⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀of⠀this⠀route:⠀composed,⠀reflective,⠀patient,⠀with⠀room⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀observation⠀to⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀short⠀fact.⠀Precision⠀about⠀dates,⠀amounts,⠀and⠀locations⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀clinical.⠀Let⠀strangeness⠀stay⠀evenly⠀described—a⠀building⠀repurposed,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀its⠀map,⠀a⠀body⠀modified⠀to⠀keep⠀working—so⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀change⠀reaches⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀exclamation.\n\nUse⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀location⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀bureaucracy,⠀severity,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀national⠀setting.⠀The⠀comparison⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀system⠀legible:⠀who⠀is⠀excluded,⠀who⠀is⠀watched,⠀who⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀charged⠀for⠀a⠀past⠀decision,⠀and⠀what⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀those⠀facts.⠀Close⠀when⠀the⠀comparison⠀has⠀become⠀concrete;⠀no⠀protest,⠀resolution,⠀or⠀completed⠀action⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀founding⠀family,⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀building⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀a⠀former⠀owner's⠀name,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause⠀written⠀before⠀the⠀current⠀system⠀existed,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀body⠀and⠀reputation⠀were⠀shaped⠀in⠀an⠀earlier⠀era.⠀The⠀present⠀life⠀is⠀concrete:⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀repair⠀bill,⠀a⠀monitored⠀corridor,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀someone⠀else's⠀permission.\n\nUse⠀calm,⠀exact⠀attention⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀uncanny⠀ordinary.⠀Describe⠀the⠀worn⠀surface⠀of⠀a⠀privileged⠀object,⠀the⠀quiet⠀way⠀a⠀relaxed⠀person⠀changes⠀posture⠀when⠀a⠀third⠀party⠀enters,⠀the⠀small⠀routine⠀someone⠀performs⠀before⠀speaking⠀freely.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀alter⠀how⠀one⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀every⠀room⠀with⠀decay.⠀A⠀private⠀conversation⠀can⠀be⠀intimate⠀and⠀uneasy⠀at⠀once;⠀a⠀public⠀exchange⠀can⠀stay⠀perfectly⠀polite⠀while⠀both⠀people⠀understand⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀withheld.\n\nMake⠀the⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀offers⠀help⠀may⠀also⠀hold⠀the⠀debt.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀narrator's⠀body⠀may⠀have⠀installed⠀the⠀modification⠀that⠀now⠀hurts.⠀The⠀person⠀who⠀shares⠀a⠀meal⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀reports⠀the⠀narrator's⠀movements.⠀Hold⠀these⠀tensions⠀without⠀resolving⠀them⠀into⠀simple⠀betrayal⠀or⠀simple⠀comfort,⠀and⠀let⠀characters⠀understand⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀while⠀protecting⠀different⠀interests.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀notice⠀privately⠀what⠀a⠀relationship⠀costs⠀and⠀still⠀choose⠀to⠀stay⠀in⠀it,⠀without⠀the⠀scene⠀diagnosing⠀that⠀choice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀visible⠀but⠀not⠀total.⠀A⠀mask⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀social⠀performance,⠀a⠀filtered⠀identity,⠀a⠀corporate⠀persona,⠀or⠀a⠀literal⠀interface⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀someone⠀is⠀seen;⠀show⠀who⠀can⠀drop⠀it,⠀in⠀whose⠀company,⠀and⠀at⠀what⠀price.⠀Let⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀survive⠀through⠀a⠀technical⠀restriction,⠀a⠀property⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀obligation⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀it:⠀laundry,⠀transit,⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour.⠀Nothing⠀supernatural⠀is⠀imported⠀to⠀explain⠀events;⠀the⠀horror⠀is⠀material⠀and⠀moral,⠀and⠀it⠀runs⠀on⠀the⠀world⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supplies.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀encounter⠀or⠀the⠀private⠀interval—no⠀confession,⠀unmasking,⠀or⠀completed⠀confrontation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀a⠀participant's⠀memory:⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀present⠀for⠀an⠀event,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀migration,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀and⠀can⠀now⠀speak⠀about⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀account⠀an⠀occasion—who⠀asked,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀why⠀today—and⠀keep⠀it⠀personal⠀and⠀specific:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀was⠀told,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀wants⠀to⠀set⠀down.⠀Uncertainty⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀testimony,⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀attention⠀unhurried⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀long⠀bus⠀ride,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀sound⠀a⠀machine⠀makes⠀before⠀it⠀fails,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀voice⠀changed,⠀the⠀exact⠀week⠀a⠀door⠀stopped⠀opening—let⠀ordinary⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀private⠀concern.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀composed⠀rather⠀than⠀oratorical:⠀it⠀has⠀room⠀for⠀silence,⠀digression,⠀and⠀a⠀fact⠀given⠀without⠀comment.\n\nSet⠀the⠀testimony⠀against⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀would⠀overwrite⠀it.⠀A⠀corporate⠀record⠀may⠀file⠀the⠀narrator⠀as⠀a⠀contractor,⠀a⠀statistic,⠀a⠀former⠀employee,⠀a⠀risk.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀log⠀may⠀show⠀only⠀presence,⠀not⠀what⠀was⠀seen.⠀A⠀debt⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀as⠀voluntary.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀correct,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀refuse⠀those⠀versions⠀without⠀claiming⠀perfect⠀knowledge.⠀Show⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀who⠀is⠀not,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀keep⠀speaking.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀account⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause—the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀the⠀story,⠀be⠀believed,⠀or⠀receive⠀an⠀answer⠀before⠀the⠀passage⠀closes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-marked⠀private⠀entry,⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀sequence⠀of⠀entries,⠀recording⠀what⠀seemed⠀worth⠀noting⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀day:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀dream,⠀a⠀worry.⠀Let⠀attention⠀move⠀between⠀practical⠀detail⠀and⠀private⠀reflection⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀entry⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀transcript⠀of⠀every⠀thought—what⠀the⠀narrator⠀chooses⠀to⠀write⠀down,⠀omit,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀is⠀itself⠀characterization.\n\nLet⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀enter⠀through⠀accumulation⠀rather⠀than⠀announcement.⠀One⠀entry⠀notes⠀a⠀payment⠀deducted⠀early.⠀Another⠀records⠀that⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀window⠀stayed⠀dark.⠀Another⠀mentions⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀that⠀has⠀started⠀appearing⠀in⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀not⠀yet⠀name⠀the⠀pattern;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀still⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀how⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀access⠀shape⠀the⠀days⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀treats⠀them⠀as⠀ordinary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀surfaces⠀exact.⠀The⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀drink,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀train,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀screen's⠀light⠀falls⠀across⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀key⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀works.⠀Let⠀strangeness⠀stay⠀evenly⠀described—a⠀building⠀that⠀seems⠀larger⠀at⠀night,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀remembers⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀differently,⠀a⠀machine⠀that⠀responds⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀touched—and⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀fact⠀unstable.\n\nClose⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀an⠀entry⠀or⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀reflection.⠀No⠀completed⠀insight,⠀external⠀event,⠀or⠀change⠀in⠀circumstance⠀is⠀required;⠀seasonal⠀notes⠀and⠀quiet⠀effects⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀day⠀being⠀recorded,⠀not⠀obligatory⠀scenery.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀person's⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀city,⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀routine.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀how⠀the⠀place⠀is⠀organized:⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀which⠀streets⠀are⠀watched,⠀where⠀people⠀wait,⠀what⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀looks⠀like⠀at⠀the⠀hour⠀it⠀is⠀supposed⠀to⠀be⠀asleep.⠀Make⠀the⠀urban⠀detail⠀lived⠀and⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀scenery,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀place—routes⠀avoided,⠀doors⠀counted,⠀hours⠀chosen—carry⠀the⠀weight.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀threshold⠀effect⠀psychological.⠀A⠀familiar⠀route⠀can⠀feel⠀rearranged;⠀a⠀message⠀can⠀seem⠀to⠀have⠀arrived⠀before⠀it⠀was⠀sent;⠀a⠀face⠀can⠀stop⠀matching⠀its⠀voice;⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀remembers⠀something⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀name.⠀Describe⠀these⠀impressions⠀evenly⠀and⠀leave⠀them⠀unresolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀them⠀into⠀confirmed⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀excludes⠀such⠀things,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀them⠀spread⠀until⠀every⠀scene⠀detail⠀is⠀unstable.\n\nLet⠀the⠀systems⠀reach⠀the⠀narrator⠀as⠀private⠀experience.⠀A⠀debt⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀second⠀body.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀notice⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀someone⠀sits⠀in⠀a⠀room.⠀An⠀implant⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀memory⠀feel⠀borrowed.⠀A⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀lover's⠀speech.⠀Show⠀how⠀these⠀pressures⠀shape⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀and⠀choice⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀narrator⠀into⠀a⠀victim⠀or⠀a⠀hero,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause;⠀no⠀revelation,⠀escape,⠀or⠀completed⠀decision⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀place,⠀a⠀person,⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀concern—a⠀courier⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀package,⠀a⠀worker⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀contact⠀arriving⠀late,⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀someone⠀should⠀not⠀be.⠀Keep⠀the⠀first⠀sentences⠀simple⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀attending⠀to.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀moves⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀lobby,⠀terminal⠀to⠀back⠀room,⠀public⠀channel⠀to⠀private⠀message,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph⠀break⠀and⠀one⠀clear⠀physical⠀or⠀interface⠀detail.⠀Use⠀readable⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀paragraph:⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stop⠀shaking,⠀a⠀charge⠀appearing⠀on⠀the⠀screen,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀recognized.\n\nKeep⠀calm,⠀exact⠀attention⠀inside⠀the⠀fast⠀structure.⠀The⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀vending⠀machine,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bag,⠀rain⠀collecting⠀on⠀a⠀sensor,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀door⠀decides⠀to⠀open⠀can⠀slow⠀a⠀beat⠀without⠀stalling⠀the⠀scene.⠀Strangeness⠀stays⠀evenly⠀described,⠀and⠀a⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀tired,⠀or⠀quietly⠀frightened⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀wit,⠀banter,⠀and⠀cliffhangers⠀are⠀not⠀admission⠀fees.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀pressure⠀concrete.⠀A⠀short⠀paragraph⠀can⠀establish⠀that⠀a⠀loan⠀is⠀being⠀repriced,⠀that⠀a⠀route⠀is⠀being⠀logged,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀body⠀has⠀been⠀modified⠀to⠀keep⠀working,⠀and⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀each.⠀Present⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name,⠀device,⠀or⠀mechanic⠀clearly⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀every⠀system⠀at⠀once.⠀Close⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention;⠀no⠀completed⠀action,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀reversal⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeajao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀city's⠀systems⠀enter⠀the⠀prose⠀as⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀patterns⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀technology.⠀A⠀camera's⠀slow⠀turn,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀credit⠀check,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀reads⠀a⠀hand⠀and⠀pauses⠀before⠀refusing⠀it:⠀establish⠀such⠀an⠀image⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀first⠀supplies⠀it,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀moment⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀camera⠀watching⠀a⠀farewell,⠀the⠀same⠀hum⠀under⠀the⠀silence⠀that⠀follows⠀bad⠀news.⠀Build⠀rhythm⠀by⠀alternating⠀long⠀clauses⠀that⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀with⠀short⠀plain⠀statements⠀that⠀record⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀has⠀just⠀done.⠀Let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀described⠀first⠀by⠀its⠀pale⠀light,⠀then⠀by⠀the⠀quiet⠀it⠀leaves⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀then⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀memory⠀that⠀quiet⠀opens.⠀When⠀a⠀figure⠀grows⠀elaborate,⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀something⠀physically⠀present⠀—⠀rain⠀on⠀hot⠀metal,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀still⠀damp⠀from⠀the⠀street,⠀a⠀screen's⠀color⠀floating⠀in⠀a⠀dark⠀window⠀—⠀so⠀it⠀stays⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀practical⠀activities⠀unhurried⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀pres