            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-cyberpunk_noir-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Cyberpunk Noir · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == cyberpunk_noir}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Cyberpunk Noir. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-cyberpunk_noir; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaeanaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀a⠀mechanism⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀operate⠀inside⠀systems⠀that⠀observe⠀and⠀price⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀something,⠀needs⠀something,⠀withholds⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀rule⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀exploit⠀or⠀avoid:⠀the⠀monitored⠀channel⠀that⠀will⠀log⠀the⠀admission,⠀the⠀favor⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀called⠀in,⠀the⠀witness⠀who⠀will⠀remember⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀transaction⠀record⠀that⠀will⠀turn⠀a⠀private⠀need⠀into⠀a⠀debt.⠀Make⠀the⠀emotional⠀act⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀anticipate,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀vague⠀mood.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀before⠀the⠀reversal,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀need⠀from⠀being⠀recorded,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀to⠀avoid⠀the⠀sensor,⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀witness,⠀or⠀the⠀log,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀why⠀that⠀tactic⠀should⠀work.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀complicate⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀already⠀saw⠀the⠀attempt,⠀the⠀system⠀logged⠀the⠀gap⠀itself,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀misunderstood⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀was⠀protecting.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀safely⠀say⠀next,⠀not⠀simply⠀replace⠀one⠀feeling⠀with⠀another.\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀emotional⠀shift⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀action⠀so⠀the⠀sequence⠀remains⠀clear⠀through⠀the⠀turbulence.⠀When⠀a⠀conversation⠀moves⠀from⠀apology⠀to⠀accusation⠀to⠀silence,⠀show⠀the⠀hand⠀pulled⠀back⠀from⠀a⠀payment⠀pad,⠀the⠀door⠀held⠀open⠀too⠀long,⠀the⠀message⠀drafted⠀and⠀deleted,⠀the⠀chair⠀turned⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀behavior⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀apologizes,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀differently⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀minute:⠀they⠀stop⠀checking⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀face,⠀they⠀offer⠀information⠀they⠀had⠀been⠀holding,⠀or⠀they⠀leave⠀a⠀task⠀unfinished⠀because⠀the⠀apology⠀cost⠀more⠀attention⠀than⠀they⠀expected.\n\nLet⠀comfort⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀resolve.⠀A⠀sincere⠀attempt⠀at⠀care⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀wrong⠀channel,⠀arrive⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀be⠀accepted⠀while⠀the⠀hurt⠀remains⠀visible.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀conversation⠀with⠀the⠀need⠀still⠀unmet⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀still⠀recording⠀the⠀attempt.⠀Name⠀the⠀specific⠀thing⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀afraid⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀now⠀knows,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀knowledge⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀or⠀repaired.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nStructure⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀built⠀around⠀one⠀legible⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problems.⠀Open⠀by⠀grounding⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀actually⠀do:⠀who⠀has⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀account,⠀the⠀message⠀channel,⠀or⠀the⠀vehicle,⠀and⠀what⠀using⠀it⠀will⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀setting;⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀specific⠀constraint⠀or⠀resource⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀handling.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀unmistakable.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks,⠀attach⠀the⠀line⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀focal⠀reaction⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph:⠀the⠀speaker⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀stepping⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀sensor's⠀line⠀of⠀sight,⠀passing⠀a⠀physical⠀key,⠀or⠀watching⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hands.⠀Alternate⠀speakers⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Keep⠀narrative⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀scan,⠀but⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀enough⠀interiority⠀to⠀show⠀why⠀they⠀choose⠀the⠀next⠀action.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀explanation⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sidebar⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀realizes⠀that⠀a⠀payment⠀will⠀alert⠀a⠀third⠀party,⠀show⠀them⠀choosing⠀a⠀different⠀channel⠀or⠀accepting⠀the⠀alert⠀and⠀preparing⠀for⠀the⠀consequence.⠀If⠀they⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀system,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀speaker's⠀response⠀reveal⠀the⠀gap⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀lecture.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀within⠀the⠀same⠀reply.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀speaking,⠀while⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀still⠀processing,⠀while⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀still⠀opening,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀next.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice.⠀Leave⠀the⠀ongoing⠀world⠀and⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀already⠀be⠀moving⠀toward⠀the⠀exit,⠀checking⠀their⠀own⠀device,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀finish⠀the⠀thought.⠀The⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀from⠀that⠀unfinished⠀action⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀prompt⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀new⠀direction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Structure⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀linked⠀episodes,⠀each⠀centered⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀practical⠀problem:⠀getting⠀past⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀settling⠀a⠀debt,⠀delivering⠀a⠀message,⠀identifying⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀feed,⠀or⠀recovering⠀a⠀device.⠀Begin⠀each⠀episode⠀by⠀establishing⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀episode's⠀action⠀change⠀that⠀knowledge⠀or⠀that⠀budget.⠀End⠀the⠀episode⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀problem⠀is⠀already⠀visible,⠀so⠀the⠀serial⠀movement⠀feels⠀cumulative⠀rather⠀than⠀arbitrary.\n\nLet⠀street⠀knowledge⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀episode.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀bargain⠀with⠀a⠀vendor⠀using⠀the⠀local⠀names⠀for⠀a⠀surveillance⠀route,⠀then⠀hear⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀described⠀in⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice⠀as⠀a⠀coverage⠀adjustment.⠀The⠀contrast⠀should⠀be⠀functional:⠀the⠀vernacular⠀term⠀tells⠀the⠀character⠀where⠀to⠀walk,⠀while⠀the⠀corporate⠀term⠀tells⠀them⠀what⠀the⠀walk⠀will⠀be⠀recorded⠀as.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀episode⠀into⠀a⠀glossary;⠀let⠀the⠀terms⠀do⠀their⠀work⠀inside⠀the⠀action.\n\nExplain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action.⠀The⠀explanation⠀and⠀the⠀action⠀may⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀episode,⠀or⠀the⠀explanation⠀may⠀be⠀exploited⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀and⠀reversed⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀realizes⠀that⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀scans⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀implant⠀signature,⠀show⠀them⠀choosing⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀implant⠀behind,⠀borrow⠀a⠀different⠀one,⠀or⠀accept⠀the⠀scan⠀and⠀prepare⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀will⠀say.⠀If⠀they⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀system,⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀reveal⠀the⠀gap⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence:⠀the⠀door⠀opens⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀reason,⠀the⠀payment⠀goes⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀party,⠀or⠀the⠀message⠀reaches⠀someone⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀intend.\n\nUse⠀the⠀episodic⠀form⠀to⠀revise⠀social⠀meaning.⠀A⠀favor⠀accepted⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀becomes⠀a⠀debt⠀collected⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀A⠀witness⠀who⠀stayed⠀silent⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀becomes⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀pressure⠀in⠀another.⠀A⠀mechanism⠀the⠀character⠀thought⠀they⠀understood⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀cost.⠀The⠀reversals⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀rules⠀and⠀resources⠀already⠀shown,⠀not⠀from⠀new⠀information⠀dropped⠀in⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀community:⠀plain,⠀concrete,⠀and⠀attentive⠀to⠀who⠀owes⠀whom,⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀historical⠀setting⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀cast⠀identity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀sentences⠀that⠀name⠀the⠀material⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀system:⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀card,⠀the⠀lag⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀sensor,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀repaired⠀too⠀many⠀times,⠀the⠀exact⠀amount⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀prepaid⠀account.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀that⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀attention,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀mood.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀object⠀or⠀action⠀that⠀carries⠀it:⠀a⠀thumb⠀pressed⠀too⠀hard⠀on⠀a⠀scanner,⠀a⠀cable⠀pulled⠀loose,⠀a⠀screen⠀angled⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀camera.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀system,⠀show⠀the⠀understanding⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀itself:⠀they⠀hold⠀the⠀card⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀angle,⠀they⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀confirmation⠀tone,⠀they⠀choose⠀the⠀door⠀with⠀the⠀older⠀lock⠀because⠀they⠀know⠀how⠀it⠀fails.⠀Let⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀follow⠀immediately⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sequence,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀exploit⠀or⠀the⠀mistake⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀explained⠀idea.\n\nCompress⠀the⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀beat⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀by⠀changing⠀the⠀physical⠀situation,⠀not⠀by⠀explaining⠀the⠀change:⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀light⠀goes⠀red,⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hand⠀stops⠀moving,⠀the⠀feed⠀cuts.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀connection⠀from⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀every⠀shift,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing.\n\nRetain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀concrete⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀working⠀through⠀a⠀system's⠀rules,⠀a⠀debt⠀schedule,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀pattern,⠀or⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀physical⠀moves,⠀let⠀the⠀thought⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀reasoning⠀legible.⠀The⠀longer⠀passage⠀should⠀still⠀be⠀concrete:⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀counting⠀steps,⠀comparing⠀prices,⠀or⠀reconstructing⠀who⠀had⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀it⠀with⠀feeling⠀or⠀summary.⠀Use⠀rhythm⠀changes⠀for⠀pressure:⠀short,⠀hard⠀sentences⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀physical⠀risk⠀or⠀sudden⠀reversal,⠀while⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀character⠀working⠀through⠀the⠀problem⠀before⠀acting.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀talks⠀hard⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀such⠀as⠀pain,⠀debt,⠀fear,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀a⠀conversation⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀recorded.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀world's⠀systems:⠀payment⠀confirmations,⠀access⠀logs,⠀debt⠀notices,⠀repair⠀requests,⠀incident⠀reports,⠀message⠀transcripts,⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀notes.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀What⠀the⠀document⠀knows⠀or⠀conceals⠀follows⠀from⠀that⠀situation.⠀A⠀repair⠀request⠀may⠀record⠀only⠀the⠀equipment⠀failure,⠀not⠀the⠀reason⠀the⠀equipment⠀was⠀damaged.⠀A⠀debt⠀notice⠀may⠀list⠀the⠀amount⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀threat⠀behind⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀mechanism⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀document's⠀form⠀and⠀the⠀writer's⠀assumptions.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀exploits⠀a⠀system⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀trace⠀in⠀a⠀log⠀that⠀another⠀document⠀later⠀contradicts.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀system⠀may⠀write⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀assumes⠀a⠀payment⠀cleared⠀or⠀a⠀door⠀stayed⠀locked,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀shows⠀the⠀actual⠀result.⠀The⠀misunderstanding⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀wording:⠀the⠀writer⠀states⠀a⠀plan⠀as⠀settled,⠀requests⠀access⠀they⠀believe⠀they⠀already⠀have,⠀or⠀describes⠀a⠀transaction⠀as⠀complete⠀before⠀the⠀system⠀has⠀confirmed⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀sequence⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀show⠀and⠀omit.\n\nUse⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀reversals.⠀A⠀message⠀sent⠀before⠀a⠀meeting⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀plan⠀that⠀the⠀meeting's⠀incident⠀report⠀shows⠀failing.⠀A⠀private⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀suspicion⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀include⠀in⠀the⠀official⠀statement.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀author⠀learned⠀something⠀new⠀or⠀needed⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀reveals.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀through⠀formats.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀scene:⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀negotiating⠀a⠀debt,⠀show⠀the⠀payment⠀record⠀or⠀the⠀message⠀thread;⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀investigating⠀access,⠀show⠀the⠀log⠀or⠀the⠀report.⠀Keep⠀each⠀document's⠀language⠀appropriate⠀to⠀its⠀author⠀and⠀purpose.⠀A⠀corporate⠀notice⠀uses⠀different⠀diction⠀from⠀a⠀street-level⠀message,⠀and⠀that⠀difference⠀is⠀itself⠀information⠀about⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀active⠀while⠀spending⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀practical⠀care.⠀The⠀warmth⠀should⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀world's⠀constraints:⠀a⠀character⠀shares⠀food⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀remembers⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference,⠀adjusts⠀a⠀screen⠀so⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀camera's⠀view,⠀or⠀walks⠀the⠀route⠀that⠀avoids⠀the⠀checkpoint.⠀The⠀care⠀is⠀sincere,⠀but⠀it⠀also⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀shape⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀caring⠀act⠀costs⠀or⠀risks⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nMake⠀the⠀care⠀a⠀legible⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problems.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀wants⠀to⠀do⠀something⠀kind,⠀show⠀the⠀mechanism⠀they⠀are⠀navigating:⠀they⠀check⠀the⠀balance⠀before⠀ordering,⠀they⠀choose⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀conversation⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀recorded,⠀they⠀borrow⠀a⠀pass⠀or⠀share⠀a⠀code,⠀they⠀time⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀scheduled⠀scan.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀small⠀action.⠀If⠀the⠀mechanism⠀fails⠀or⠀costs⠀more⠀than⠀expected,⠀let⠀the⠀care⠀continue⠀in⠀a⠀smaller⠀form⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀disaster.⠀The⠀point⠀is⠀the⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀not⠀the⠀system's⠀victory.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀offer⠀comfort⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀action:⠀saving⠀the⠀last⠀portion,⠀charging⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀device,⠀holding⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀staying⠀quiet⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀needs⠀quiet.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀without⠀naming⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀scene⠀toward⠀a⠀declaration⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.⠀The⠀warmth⠀can⠀sit⠀alongside⠀the⠀established⠀problems:⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀still⠀due,⠀the⠀surveillance⠀is⠀still⠀running,⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀still⠀complicated.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀care⠀in⠀a⠀gruff⠀or⠀indirect⠀way.⠀Another⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀while⠀still⠀disagreeing⠀about⠀the⠀plan⠀or⠀refusing⠀to⠀discuss⠀a⠀private⠀matter.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀ease:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀together,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀pleasure⠀noticed⠀and⠀enjoyed.⠀The⠀continuation⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀room⠀to⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀like⠀a⠀problem⠀solved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀frame⠀each⠀scene⠀through⠀its⠀social⠀context.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀decision,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀outward⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀decision⠀means⠀in⠀the⠀larger⠀system:⠀who⠀will⠀read⠀the⠀record,⠀who⠀will⠀pay⠀the⠀fee,⠀what⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀will⠀say,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀character's⠀history⠀makes⠀of⠀the⠀choice.⠀The⠀framing⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀world,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀meditation⠀on⠀society.⠀A⠀debt⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀burden;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀relationship⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀creditor,⠀a⠀schedule,⠀and⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀consequences⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀name.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀mechanism⠀explanation⠀inside⠀the⠀formal⠀movement.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀system,⠀let⠀the⠀sustained⠀prose⠀unfold⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning:⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀the⠀checkpoint⠀scans⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀signature,⠀the⠀payment⠀will⠀alert⠀a⠀third⠀party,⠀the⠀door's⠀lock⠀has⠀a⠀known⠀failure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀concrete⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀expansive.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀follow⠀within⠀the⠀same⠀movement,⠀so⠀the⠀formal⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀mechanism⠀into⠀atmosphere.\n\nLet⠀the⠀reversals⠀arrive⠀through⠀deliberate⠀shifts⠀in⠀the⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀A⠀long⠀passage⠀of⠀reasoning⠀or⠀social⠀framing⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀short,⠀concrete⠀action⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀situation:⠀the⠀character⠀signs,⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀the⠀message⠀sends,⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀turns⠀away.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀and⠀the⠀sudden⠀action⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀reversal⠀feel⠀earned⠀rather⠀than⠀arbitrary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀the⠀shift,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀matters.\n\nDistinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀prose⠀can⠀carry⠀judgment,⠀history,⠀or⠀social⠀context⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀would⠀not⠀say⠀aloud.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀plain,⠀practical⠀terms⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀frames⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀the⠀longer⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀building,⠀or⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀elaborate⠀sentences.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀uniform⠀aristocratic⠀voice.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀framing⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀are⠀both⠀in⠀view,⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀either⠀thread.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀every⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀made⠀inside⠀the⠀outer⠀situation.⠀The⠀teller⠀is⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener⠀because⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀buy⠀time,⠀alter⠀a⠀price,⠀transfer⠀blame,⠀expose⠀a⠀vulnerability,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀refusal⠀costly.⠀Establish⠀before⠀the⠀tale⠀begins⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀from⠀the⠀telling⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀grant⠀or⠀withhold.⠀The⠀outer⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀during⠀the⠀tale;⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention,⠀interruptions,⠀and⠀changing⠀willingness⠀to⠀act⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀through⠀concrete⠀anchors⠀rather⠀than⠀atmosphere⠀alone.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀location,⠀or⠀system⠀procedure⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀both⠀levels⠀and⠀accumulate⠀meaning,⠀but⠀its⠀recurrence⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀knows⠀or⠀risks.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀introduces⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀explain⠀it⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀has⠀used⠀or⠀survived⠀it⠀would:⠀what⠀it⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀where⠀it⠀fails,⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀misread.⠀Let⠀that⠀explanation⠀become⠀useful⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀present⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀the⠀same⠀mechanism⠀at⠀work.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀profile's⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀as⠀changes⠀in⠀who⠀holds⠀usable⠀knowledge⠀or⠀access.⠀A⠀tale⠀can⠀reveal⠀that⠀a⠀character's⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀a⠀contract,⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀medical⠀implant,⠀or⠀security⠀protocol⠀was⠀incomplete.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀or⠀procedural⠀sequence⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀reversal⠀legible:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀did,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀realizes,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀can⠀still⠀do⠀about⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀tale⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀twist;⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀may⠀simply⠀shift⠀the⠀listener's⠀bargaining⠀position⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀teller⠀had⠀hidden.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀reveal⠀their⠀interest⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀a⠀liar.⠀They⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀protect⠀someone,⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀failure⠀in⠀flattering⠀terms.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀claims⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀demonstrates,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀listener⠀perfect⠀insight.⠀When⠀a⠀claim⠀matters,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀tested⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀situation:⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀or⠀refuses,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀matches⠀or⠀contradicts,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀reacts⠀to⠀the⠀account.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀of⠀unequal⠀power⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀subject⠀to⠀time,⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀or⠀bodily⠀risk.⠀The⠀frame-tale⠀structure⠀remains⠀intelligible,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀never⠀a⠀neutral⠀entertainment⠀detached⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀transaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀treat⠀records,⠀logs,⠀contracts,⠀surveillance⠀captures,⠀and⠀archived⠀testimony⠀as⠀active⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀rather⠀than⠀neutral⠀background.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀appears,⠀establish⠀who⠀made⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀record,⠀what⠀it⠀could⠀not⠀capture,⠀and⠀who⠀can⠀now⠀read⠀or⠀alter⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀stored⠀account⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀condition⠀become⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀pressure:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀was⠀logged⠀differently⠀from⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀lived,⠀a⠀medical⠀implant⠀whose⠀warranty⠀record⠀omits⠀the⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀file⠀that⠀preserves⠀an⠀old⠀accusation⠀without⠀its⠀context.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀documentation⠀itself⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀sensor⠀samples,⠀how⠀a⠀ledger⠀commits⠀a⠀transaction,⠀how⠀an⠀archive⠀indexes⠀or⠀expires⠀data,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀can⠀be⠀replayed⠀but⠀not⠀authenticated.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀action⠀that⠀follows:⠀someone⠀deletes⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀pays⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀file⠀sealed,⠀misreads⠀an⠀aggregate⠀as⠀a⠀fact,⠀or⠀discovers⠀that⠀a⠀record⠀proves⠀access⠀but⠀not⠀intent.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀procedural⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀any⠀reversal.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀and⠀record⠀disagree⠀without⠀making⠀one⠀automatically⠀true.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀eviction,⠀a⠀medical⠀procedure,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀system⠀recorded⠀differently.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀compare⠀them⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀the⠀remembered⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀server⠀room⠀against⠀the⠀logged⠀temperature,⠀the⠀spoken⠀condition⠀against⠀the⠀signed⠀clause,⠀the⠀witness's⠀later⠀account⠀against⠀the⠀archived⠀first⠀report.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀discrepancy⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀authoritative⠀truth.⠀Some⠀gaps⠀remain⠀as⠀costs,⠀risks,⠀or⠀evidence⠀of⠀who⠀controlled⠀the⠀record.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀emphasis⠀on⠀unequal⠀power⠀by⠀showing⠀who⠀can⠀request,⠀correct,⠀or⠀suppress⠀a⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀access⠀costs.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀trade⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀body⠀sample,⠀a⠀password,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀to⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀archive⠀says.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀material:⠀an⠀investigator⠀comparing⠀files⠀will⠀move⠀differently⠀from⠀a⠀debtor⠀recalling⠀an⠀old⠀injury.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀remain⠀specific⠀and⠀restrained.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀national⠀temperament,⠀bureaucracy⠀as⠀scenery,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀translated⠀word⠀order.⠀The⠀documentary⠀form⠀is⠀a⠀method⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀style⠀of⠀official⠀neutrality.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀concrete⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀inherited⠀power⠀operates⠀through⠀current⠀systems.⠀An⠀old⠀family⠀may⠀control⠀a⠀building's⠀access⠀permissions,⠀a⠀legacy⠀contract⠀may⠀still⠀route⠀payments⠀or⠀medical⠀decisions,⠀a⠀former⠀institution⠀may⠀own⠀the⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀in⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀it⠀no⠀longer⠀serves.⠀Establish⠀the⠀mechanism⠀of⠀that⠀authority:⠀who⠀is⠀recognized⠀by⠀the⠀system,⠀what⠀the⠀authority⠀can⠀grant⠀or⠀revoke,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀refuse.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀factions,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀The⠀horror⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀legally⠀or⠀technically⠀do⠀to⠀one⠀another.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀arise⠀from⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀and⠀intimate⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative⠀gloom.⠀Describe⠀the⠀worn⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀clinic,⠀the⠀heat⠀and⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀server⠀room⠀behind⠀a⠀preserved⠀facade,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀stairwell⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀security⠀camera⠀still⠀records,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀trusted⠀person's⠀voice⠀changes⠀when⠀a⠀mask⠀falls⠀away.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀to⠀shape⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀but⠀keep⠀their⠀practical⠀function⠀legible.⠀A⠀locked⠀archive,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀surveillance⠀exemption⠀can⠀carry⠀dread⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀does,⠀not⠀merely⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀described⠀in⠀shadow.\n\nApply⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀profile⠀by⠀explaining⠀the⠀rules⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀believe⠀an⠀old⠀privilege⠀still⠀works,⠀only⠀to⠀find⠀that⠀the⠀system⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀biometric⠀match,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀a⠀corporate⠀sponsor.⠀Another⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀medical⠀implant's⠀terms⠀and⠀discover⠀too⠀late⠀that⠀it⠀reports⠀to⠀a⠀former⠀guardian.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀or⠀procedural⠀sequence⠀of⠀each⠀reversal:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempted,⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀recognized,⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀their⠀available⠀choices.⠀Keep⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀understandable⠀by⠀anchoring⠀them⠀in⠀established⠀facts⠀about⠀access,⠀ownership,⠀or⠀bodily⠀compromise.\n\nPreserve⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent.⠀A⠀trusted⠀person⠀may⠀genuinely⠀help⠀while⠀still⠀withholding⠀a⠀dangerous⠀fact.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀private⠀and⠀reveal⠀fear,⠀desire,⠀shame,⠀or⠀relief⠀rather⠀than⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀knows⠀and⠀what⠀another⠀does⠀not,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀grant⠀every⠀character⠀perfect⠀insight.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀old⠀loyalty⠀create⠀real⠀costs:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀protect⠀someone⠀by⠀accepting⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀flag,⠀or⠀a⠀medical⠀risk.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀intensify⠀the⠀stakes⠀of⠀those⠀choices,⠀not⠀replace⠀them⠀with⠀supernatural⠀inevitability.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀participant's⠀account⠀of⠀living⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀cyberpunk⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀debt⠀platform,⠀a⠀labor⠀contract,⠀a⠀medical⠀monitoring⠀scheme,⠀a⠀housing⠀registry,⠀or⠀a⠀surveillance⠀program⠀that⠀touched⠀a⠀particular⠀community⠀and⠀body.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀position⠀concrete.⠀They⠀speak⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀place,⠀language,⠀occupation,⠀and⠀moment,⠀and⠀their⠀account⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀experienced⠀directly,⠀what⠀they⠀heard⠀from⠀others,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀only⠀later.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.\n\nDistinguish⠀earlier⠀experience⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀describes⠀an⠀event,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time:⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀seemed⠀like⠀help,⠀a⠀scan⠀that⠀seemed⠀routine,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause⠀that⠀seemed⠀unimportant.⠀Later,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀event⠀with⠀new⠀knowledge,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀retroactively⠀insert⠀the⠀later⠀understanding⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀A⠀sentence⠀such⠀as⠀\"I⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀that⠀the⠀clinic⠀sold⠀the⠀scan\"⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀since⠀learned,⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀original⠀confusion.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanisms⠀the⠀teller⠀encountered⠀in⠀practical⠀terms.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀loan⠀app⠀calculated⠀eligibility,⠀how⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate⠀admitted⠀or⠀refused⠀workers,⠀how⠀a⠀medical⠀implant⠀reported⠀data,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀police⠀drone⠀logged⠀a⠀neighborhood.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀misunderstood⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀show⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀before⠀the⠀correction.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀learned⠀to⠀exploit⠀a⠀rule,⠀show⠀the⠀sequence:⠀what⠀they⠀noticed,⠀what⠀they⠀tried,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀did⠀in⠀response.⠀Keep⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀legible⠀through⠀physical⠀and⠀procedural⠀detail.\n\nLet⠀the⠀testimony⠀carry⠀the⠀genre's⠀unequal⠀power⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀institution⠀into⠀an⠀identical⠀villain.⠀Some⠀officials,⠀lenders,⠀technicians,⠀or⠀neighbors⠀may⠀help,⠀refuse,⠀profit,⠀or⠀simply⠀follow⠀procedure.⠀The⠀teller's⠀account⠀can⠀preserve⠀the⠀specific⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀place:⠀the⠀queue⠀outside⠀a⠀payment⠀kiosk,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀generator⠀during⠀a⠀blackout,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀clinic⠀where⠀implants⠀are⠀serviced,⠀the⠀particular⠀phrase⠀a⠀neighbor⠀uses⠀for⠀a⠀debt⠀collector.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀account⠀lived⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀decorate⠀a⠀generic⠀dystopia.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀persuade,⠀accuse,⠀remember,⠀or⠀explain,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀a⠀person's⠀account,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀whole⠀system.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀associatively⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀reasoning,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀concrete⠀systems⠀and⠀choices⠀of⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world.⠀When⠀the⠀character's⠀mind⠀drifts,⠀let⠀the⠀drift⠀follow⠀a⠀real⠀connection:⠀a⠀notification⠀sound⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀scar⠀recalls⠀the⠀implant⠀procedure,⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀recalls⠀the⠀day⠀their⠀access⠀was⠀revoked.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀or⠀plain⠀argument⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanisms⠀that⠀occupy⠀the⠀character's⠀thought⠀in⠀practical⠀terms.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀thinking⠀about⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀captures,⠀how⠀it⠀stores⠀or⠀flags⠀data,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀about⠀it.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀thinking⠀about⠀a⠀debt⠀platform,⠀show⠀how⠀interest⠀accrues,⠀what⠀triggers⠀a⠀penalty,⠀and⠀what⠀payment⠀or⠀refusal⠀would⠀cost.⠀The⠀inward⠀form⠀may⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀mechanism⠀several⠀times,⠀each⠀time⠀adding⠀a⠀new⠀detail⠀or⠀revising⠀an⠀earlier⠀assumption.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀procedural⠀sequence⠀legible⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀syntax⠀is⠀recursive⠀or⠀fragmented.\n\nLet⠀the⠀experimental⠀form⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀mental⠀state⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀stylistic⠀decoration.⠀Panic⠀may⠀fragment⠀attention⠀into⠀short,⠀repeated⠀checks⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀timer.⠀Calm⠀may⠀produce⠀longer⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀contract⠀or⠀a⠀plan.⠀Anger⠀may⠀interrupt⠀deliberation⠀with⠀remembered⠀insults⠀or⠀sudden⠀practical⠀decisions.⠀Show⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀directly:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀fears,⠀wants,⠀misunderstands,⠀or⠀decides.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀interiority⠀with⠀a⠀performed⠀monologue⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀felt⠀later.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀genre's⠀unequal⠀power⠀by⠀keeping⠀the⠀inward⠀movement⠀tied⠀to⠀external⠀constraints.⠀The⠀character's⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀system⠀prompt,⠀a⠀knock,⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀symptom.⠀Another⠀person's⠀speech⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀thought⠀and⠀change⠀its⠀direction.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀inner⠀and⠀outer⠀events⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀causal⠀thread:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀thought,⠀what⠀happened,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀next.⠀Rapid⠀reversals⠀remain⠀legible⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀which⠀assumption⠀or⠀mechanism⠀the⠀reversal⠀overturns.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀an⠀inward⠀fiction⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀story⠀about⠀living⠀inside⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀and⠀alter⠀people.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism/chronicle/testimony⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀record⠀how⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀lives⠀with⠀cyberpunk⠀systems:⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀shared⠀water⠀or⠀power⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀labor⠀platform⠀that⠀recruits⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀district,⠀a⠀clinic⠀that⠀offers⠀implants⠀on⠀credit,⠀or⠀a⠀surveillance⠀program⠀that⠀maps⠀certain⠀streets⠀more⠀closely⠀than⠀others.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament.⠀Magical⠀realism⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀route,⠀and⠀this⠀style⠀cannot⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀others⠀reported,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀records⠀claim.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct⠀observation⠀of⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀raid,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀a⠀protest,⠀then⠀move⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀earlier,⠀then⠀compare⠀both⠀with⠀an⠀official⠀log⠀or⠀corporate⠀statement.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀those⠀sources⠀clear⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀clinical⠀case⠀summary.⠀When⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀remain⠀a⠀social⠀fact:⠀the⠀record⠀omits⠀a⠀family,⠀the⠀witness⠀misremembers⠀a⠀time,⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀see⠀the⠀beginning⠀of⠀the⠀event.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀mechanisms⠀that⠀shape⠀the⠀community's⠀access⠀in⠀practical⠀terms.⠀Show⠀how⠀a⠀utility⠀meter⠀charges⠀different⠀rates⠀by⠀zone,⠀how⠀a⠀gig⠀platform⠀assigns⠀work⠀by⠀location⠀history,⠀how⠀a⠀medical⠀subsidy⠀requires⠀biometric⠀compliance,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀police⠀drone's⠀recognition⠀software⠀misreads⠀a⠀face⠀or⠀a⠀gesture.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀show⠀the⠀sequence:⠀what⠀they⠀knew,⠀what⠀they⠀attempted,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀did⠀in⠀response.⠀Keep⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀legible⠀through⠀physical⠀and⠀procedural⠀detail.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀genre's⠀unequal⠀power⠀by⠀showing⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀and⠀who⠀controls⠀access.⠀A⠀community⠀leader⠀may⠀negotiate⠀a⠀lower⠀rate⠀by⠀accepting⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed.⠀A⠀family⠀may⠀share⠀one⠀implant⠀or⠀one⠀identity⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀child⠀in⠀school.⠀A⠀technician⠀may⠀help⠀a⠀neighbor⠀bypass⠀a⠀meter⠀while⠀reporting⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀include⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀profit,⠀and⠀genuine⠀help⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀institution⠀uniformly⠀evil⠀or⠀every⠀neighbor⠀heroic.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀detail:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀generator,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀street⠀market,⠀the⠀particular⠀phrase⠀a⠀local⠀official⠀uses⠀for⠀a⠀fine.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀chronicle⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀lives⠀it⠀prices⠀and⠀excludes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀by⠀establishing⠀where⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀system⠀or⠀person⠀is⠀pressing⠀on⠀them.⠀Use⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀separate⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀one⠀location⠀to⠀another,⠀make⠀the⠀transition⠀concrete:⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀vehicle,⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀sound⠀or⠀light.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.\n\nExplain⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀and⠀mechanics⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀encounter⠀with⠀them.⠀If⠀a⠀device,⠀contract,⠀implant,⠀or⠀security⠀protocol⠀matters,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀uses,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀it.⠀A⠀mechanism⠀can⠀be⠀introduced⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀payment⠀fails,⠀a⠀door⠀reads⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀drone⠀flags⠀a⠀face,⠀a⠀loan⠀app⠀recalculates⠀a⠀balance.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀response.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀by⠀anchoring⠀each⠀shift⠀in⠀an⠀established⠀fact⠀about⠀access,⠀ownership,⠀or⠀cost.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀exclamation⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀felt⠀later.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀It⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀attention,⠀fear,⠀desire,⠀or⠀misunderstanding.⠀For⠀example,⠀after⠀a⠀system⠀prompt⠀appears,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀stay⠀inside⠀the⠀character's⠀thought⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀the⠀prompt⠀means,⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀cost⠀to⠀comply,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀this⠀interiority⠀with⠀a⠀performed⠀aside⠀or⠀a⠀voice-over.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀concrete.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀bargain⠀with⠀a⠀technician,⠀hide⠀a⠀debt⠀from⠀a⠀partner,⠀accept⠀a⠀surveillance⠀flag⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀medical⠀implant⠀reports⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀were⠀told.⠀The⠀Light⠀Novel⠀presentation⠀should⠀make⠀these⠀stakes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀without⠀softening⠀them.⠀Paragraph⠀breaks⠀can⠀emphasize⠀a⠀reversal,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀beat⠀into⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀continuing⠀conversation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀as⠀a⠀system⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀can⠀observe,⠀exploit,⠀or⠀misunderstand.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀explain⠀its⠀operation⠀in⠀clear⠀physical⠀terms⠀—⠀how⠀the⠀gate⠀reads⠀a⠀credential,⠀what⠀the⠀contract⠀deducts,⠀why⠀the⠀feed⠀went⠀dark⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀explanation.⠀A⠀reversal⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀under⠀the⠀established⠀rules,⠀never⠀blur⠀the⠀rules⠀themselves.\n\nLet⠀the⠀lyric⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀changing⠀understanding⠀of⠀that⠀system.⠀Develop⠀one⠀image⠀across⠀a⠀paragraph⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀its⠀sound,⠀shape,⠀or⠀association,⠀so⠀a⠀comparison⠀opens⠀a⠀new⠀implication⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀the⠀sentence:⠀the⠀sponsored⠀glow⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀tower⠀can⠀read⠀as⠀beauty⠀on⠀first⠀sight⠀and⠀as⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀price⠀when⠀it⠀returns.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀figure⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀or⠀remember⠀from⠀this⠀street⠀and⠀this⠀life;⠀when⠀a⠀simile⠀reaches⠀for⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀not⠀know,⠀cut⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain,⠀short⠀statement⠀break⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀name⠀a⠀cost,⠀a⠀limit,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀contrast⠀sharpen⠀the⠀surrounding⠀music.\n\nMake⠀each⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀traceable:⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀failing⠀device,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀corner⠀moves⠀the⠀narrator⠀from⠀perception⠀into⠀association,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀triggered⠀the⠀drift⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀resumes.⠀Characters⠀who⠀are⠀not⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀or⠀crudely⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀the⠀figurative⠀register.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀rule⠀more⠀fully⠀without⠀yet⠀acting⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀mechanism⠀is⠀still⠀running,⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀still⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀cost⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀counted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀material⠀of⠀this⠀world:⠀a⠀changed⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀deactivated⠀account,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀responds,⠀a⠀district⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀enter,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀outlived⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀incurred⠀it.⠀Attend⠀to⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀permits⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀resource⠀now⠀costs,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀sit⠀alongside⠀the⠀present⠀one⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀mechanism⠀working⠀differently⠀then⠀and⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀that⠀difference⠀exact.⠀When⠀a⠀remembered⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀matters,⠀explain⠀how⠀it⠀operated⠀then⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀operates⠀now⠀in⠀concrete⠀procedural⠀terms,⠀so⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀atmospheric.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀procedure⠀has⠀been⠀rewritten,⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀skill⠀opens⠀a⠀door⠀the⠀new⠀credentials⠀no⠀longer⠀recognize,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀vouched⠀for⠀them⠀is⠀out⠀of⠀every⠀directory.⠀The⠀explanation⠀stays⠀attached⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀observe,⠀remember,⠀or⠀attempt;⠀mood⠀cannot⠀rewrite⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀and⠀the⠀mechanism⠀is⠀not⠀waved⠀away⠀for⠀mood.\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀remain⠀present.⠀A⠀working⠀device,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀finished⠀errand⠀can⠀be⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀while⠀the⠀longer⠀change⠀sits⠀nearby,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stays⠀pleasurable.⠀The⠀scene's⠀current⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀job⠀half-done,⠀someone⠀waiting⠀—⠀keeps⠀moving;⠀reflection⠀does⠀not⠀suspend⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀noticing⠀a⠀change,⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment,⠀or⠀still⠀weighing⠀whether⠀the⠀old⠀way⠀is⠀worth⠀one⠀more⠀attempt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling.⠀The⠀narration⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀addressing⠀a⠀listener⠀inside⠀the⠀story⠀—⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀client⠀buying⠀an⠀explanation⠀across⠀a⠀table,⠀an⠀apprentice⠀waiting⠀out⠀a⠀curfew.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀alive⠀through⠀direct⠀address,⠀adjustments⠀to⠀the⠀listener's⠀patience,⠀interruptions⠀from⠀the⠀telling⠀situation⠀itself⠀(a⠀signal,⠀a⠀power⠀cut,⠀someone⠀at⠀the⠀door),⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀before⠀the⠀account⠀resumes.\n\nGive⠀the⠀frame⠀its⠀own⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀noir⠀economy.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀a⠀transaction⠀like⠀any⠀other:⠀the⠀teller⠀decides⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀paid⠀to⠀hear,⠀withholds⠀a⠀name⠀until⠀it⠀is⠀worth⠀its⠀price,⠀or⠀slants⠀an⠀account⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀still⠀living.⠀This⠀economy⠀shapes⠀the⠀narrative⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀systems⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀practical⠀explanations.⠀When⠀a⠀device,⠀contract,⠀gate,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀rule⠀matters,⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀how⠀it⠀works⠀in⠀physical⠀or⠀procedural⠀terms,⠀then⠀recounts⠀what⠀people⠀did⠀with⠀it.⠀Attribute⠀sources⠀and⠀keep⠀them⠀distinct:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀what⠀a⠀second⠀party⠀reported,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀infers⠀should⠀never⠀blur,⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀question⠀or⠀objection⠀can⠀force⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀a⠀more⠀precise⠀mechanism.⠀A⠀nested⠀account⠀may⠀delay⠀a⠀key⠀detail,⠀but⠀when⠀the⠀detail⠀arrives⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀earlier⠀sequence⠀newly⠀understandable⠀rather⠀than⠀swapping⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀puzzle.⠀Rapid⠀reversals⠀stay⠀legible⠀because⠀each⠀one⠀changes⠀what⠀people⠀could⠀do⠀under⠀rules⠀already⠀laid⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀partial⠀—⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀paid,⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀excluded⠀without⠀knowing⠀why.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-telling,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀few⠀details⠀and⠀make⠀each⠀one⠀work:⠀a⠀system's⠀rule,⠀a⠀physical⠀action,⠀a⠀price,⠀or⠀one⠀inward⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀economical⠀movement.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀fewest⠀steps⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀understandable⠀—⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀see⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀or⠀cannot⠀do⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀follows.⠀Compression⠀removes⠀redundancy,⠀never⠀causality.\n\nLet⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀or⠀explanation⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs;⠀one⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Cut⠀decorative⠀detail⠀that⠀changes⠀nothing⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀observe⠀or⠀attempt,⠀and⠀cut⠀restatements⠀of⠀feeling⠀already⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀does.⠀What⠀is⠀left⠀out⠀should⠀leave⠀an⠀inference⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀make⠀—⠀a⠀skipped⠀payment,⠀an⠀unlocked⠀door,⠀a⠀name⠀not⠀spoken⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀why⠀events⠀happen.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀selection⠀itself:⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays,⠀what⠀is⠀watched,⠀what⠀is⠀misread.⠀Voices⠀stay⠀individual⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀narration's⠀economy.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀completed⠀action,⠀one⠀understood⠀rule,⠀or⠀one⠀unresolved⠀cost,⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀beat⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀scene⠀to⠀fill⠀space.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes,⠀using⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀clean⠀transitions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀an⠀inspection⠀of⠀a⠀fault,⠀a⠀street⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀while⠀something⠀processes⠀can⠀each⠀carry⠀the⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀pressure⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀concrete⠀arrangements⠀the⠀character⠀deals⠀with⠀—⠀a⠀credential,⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀recorded⠀promise,⠀a⠀blocked⠀route,⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀the⠀authority⠀to⠀grant⠀passage.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀explain⠀it⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀follows⠀from⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀that⠀action.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀stay⠀physically⠀understandable:⠀a⠀reversal⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀established⠀rules,⠀not⠀the⠀reader's⠀ability⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Recollection⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀or⠀attempts,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀inner⠀experience⠀mean⠀reasoning,⠀attention,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀wants⠀connecting⠀an⠀event⠀to⠀a⠀choice,⠀not⠀only⠀an⠀emotional⠀label.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀run⠀at⠀cross⠀purposes⠀with⠀thought;⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀needs⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀reveal⠀can⠀be⠀tactical,⠀accidental,⠀or⠀reluctant.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀an⠀action⠀is⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀still⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀is⠀still⠀arriving,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀beat,⠀a⠀lesson,⠀or⠀a⠀restatement⠀of⠀theme.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀this⠀world's⠀specific⠀pressures:⠀a⠀shared⠀debt,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀credential,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀gap⠀both⠀rely⠀on,⠀a⠀favor⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀third⠀party,⠀a⠀practical⠀skill⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀can⠀offer⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀those⠀carry⠀the⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀promises,⠀and⠀give⠀them⠀real⠀space⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀substance⠀rather⠀than⠀garnish⠀between⠀plot⠀beats.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise;⠀do⠀not⠀bolt⠀on⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀to⠀signal⠀the⠀form.\n\nWork⠀through⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀splitting⠀a⠀bill⠀or⠀checking⠀a⠀perimeter⠀may⠀recur,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀should⠀find⠀new⠀weight⠀in⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀joke⠀now⠀covering⠀a⠀fear⠀that⠀has⠀a⠀name.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀mechanics:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀grasp⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀other's⠀fix⠀will⠀cost,⠀misread⠀a⠀silence⠀over⠀the⠀comm,⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀empties⠀their⠀own⠀account,⠀or⠀withhold⠀a⠀fact⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀reconstruct.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀touches⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them,⠀explain⠀how⠀it⠀works⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀it;⠀a⠀reversal⠀changes⠀their⠀options⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀sequence⠀hard⠀to⠀follow.\n\nKeep⠀their⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀Intimacy⠀does⠀not⠀open⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀head:⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀certain,⠀wrong,⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀deliberately⠀not⠀asking.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀with⠀a⠀relationship⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀comfort⠀offered⠀and⠀not⠀yet⠀answered,⠀or⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀still⠀deciding⠀what⠀the⠀other's⠀action⠀meant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀deliberately,⠀establish⠀people⠀and⠀acts⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀and⠀relate⠀each⠀deed⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀it.⠀Draw⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀material⠀from⠀this⠀world:⠀who⠀opened⠀a⠀route⠀others⠀thought⠀sealed,⠀who⠀held⠀a⠀debt⠀when⠀the⠀holder⠀changed⠀hands,⠀who⠀repaired⠀the⠀machine⠀and⠀told⠀no⠀one,⠀who⠀kept⠀a⠀promise⠀while⠀the⠀cameras⠀were⠀on,⠀who⠀was⠀excluded⠀from⠀a⠀place⠀the⠀rest⠀could⠀still⠀enter.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀remembered⠀act⠀practically⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀how⠀it⠀worked⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀then⠀recount⠀the⠀deed⠀that⠀followed.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀act⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀—⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀paid⠀twice,⠀the⠀one⠀the⠀gates⠀still⠀know⠀—⠀never⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀each⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Hold⠀shared⠀reputation⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀account:⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀act⠀was⠀easy,⠀willing,⠀or⠀cheap,⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀version⠀can⠀sit⠀inside⠀the⠀public⠀one.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority:⠀a⠀listener⠀questions⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern⠀—⠀the⠀toll,⠀the⠀shift⠀schedule,⠀the⠀leaking⠀seal.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀Do⠀not⠀declare⠀every⠀event⠀legendary;⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀telling⠀still⠀being⠀shaped,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀continuous⠀prose,⠀taking⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀route⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀institutional⠀scrutiny:⠀the⠀tradition⠀that⠀treats⠀public⠀systems⠀—⠀offices,⠀benefits,⠀housing,⠀billing,⠀records⠀—⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀serious⠀fiction⠀and⠀ordinary⠀domestic⠀life⠀as⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀their⠀decisions⠀land.⠀Treat⠀the⠀systems⠀around⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀as⠀organizations⠀with⠀procedures,⠀queues,⠀case⠀files,⠀and⠀employees⠀who⠀apply⠀pressure⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀be⠀villains.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problem⠀organize⠀the⠀scene:⠀renewing⠀a⠀permit,⠀tracing⠀a⠀missing⠀payment,⠀keeping⠀an⠀implant's⠀monitoring⠀flag⠀from⠀escalating⠀a⠀debt⠀review.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀rule⠀matters,⠀make⠀its⠀operation⠀concrete⠀before⠀anyone⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀it.⠀Show⠀which⠀office⠀enforces⠀the⠀rule,⠀what⠀form⠀or⠀sensor⠀records⠀compliance,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀present⠀or⠀surrender,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀will⠀do⠀if⠀the⠀condition⠀is⠀not⠀met.⠀Establish⠀the⠀resource⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀plan⠀possible,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀uses⠀it:⠀the⠀account⠀check⠀that⠀reveals⠀a⠀redirected⠀credit,⠀the⠀clerk's⠀screen⠀or⠀voice⠀response,⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀movement.⠀Do⠀not⠀skip⠀from⠀idea⠀to⠀outcome⠀without⠀the⠀intervening⠀step,⠀even⠀during⠀a⠀rapid⠀reversal.\n\nLet⠀institutional⠀language⠀work⠀as⠀a⠀quiet⠀social⠀force⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration,⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀observe:⠀the⠀wording⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀the⠀queue⠀position,⠀the⠀employee's⠀pause,⠀the⠀access⠀light⠀that⠀changes⠀on⠀a⠀door.⠀Set⠀against⠀it⠀the⠀counter-knowledge⠀of⠀street⠀life⠀and⠀domestic⠀routine⠀—⠀which⠀entrance⠀still⠀opens,⠀which⠀neighbor⠀will⠀witness⠀a⠀signature,⠀which⠀repair⠀shop⠀asks⠀no⠀questions.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community,⠀period,⠀and⠀language⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀if⠀a⠀specific⠀Nordic⠀country⠀or⠀community⠀is⠀named,⠀keep⠀its⠀particulars⠀instead⠀of⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀generic⠀scenery,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀Restraint⠀is⠀a⠀register⠀choice,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀mood.\n\nRender⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reckoning⠀with⠀cost⠀and⠀obligation:⠀weighing⠀a⠀lie⠀against⠀a⠀fee,⠀noticing⠀that⠀a⠀helper⠀is⠀also⠀being⠀watched,⠀deciding⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀reason.⠀Keep⠀that⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀or⠀speaks⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀separate⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀claims⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀verify⠀—⠀a⠀caseworker's⠀assurance⠀is⠀not⠀proof⠀the⠀file⠀was⠀closed.⠀Close⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stop:⠀a⠀refused⠀appeal,⠀a⠀rescheduled⠀appointment,⠀a⠀small⠀piece⠀of⠀confirmed⠀information.⠀The⠀larger⠀debt⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀solved⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀exposed⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀form:⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀transitions⠀only⠀where⠀a⠀cut⠀or⠀time⠀jump⠀serves⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Make⠀every⠀mechanism⠀that⠀matters⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀on⠀the⠀screen.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀rule,⠀show⠀the⠀badge,⠀screen,⠀receipt,⠀door⠀response,⠀or⠀spoken⠀exchange⠀that⠀demonstrates⠀the⠀rule⠀works⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀expect.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀observable⠀information⠀—⠀a⠀displayed⠀balance,⠀a⠀scanner's⠀amber⠀flash,⠀a⠀clerk⠀reading⠀a⠀condition⠀aloud⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀page⠀free⠀of⠀accumulated⠀camera⠀direction;⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀reports⠀what⠀happens,⠀not⠀how⠀to⠀shoot⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.⠀When⠀a⠀plan⠀reverses,⠀stage⠀the⠀step⠀that⠀fails⠀or⠀succeeds⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀begins:⠀an⠀expired⠀courier⠀clearance⠀offered⠀to⠀the⠀scanner,⠀the⠀guard's⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀character⠀moving⠀through⠀the⠀gate⠀while⠀the⠀light⠀is⠀still⠀amber.⠀Let⠀the⠀cause⠀land⠀before⠀the⠀consequence.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀the⠀practical⠀negotiation⠀and⠀pressure.⠀Speakers⠀act⠀from⠀immediate⠀goals⠀—⠀a⠀clerk⠀protecting⠀a⠀quota,⠀a⠀fixer⠀naming⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀asking⠀what⠀the⠀visit⠀will⠀cost⠀them⠀—⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀or⠀read⠀aloud,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀and⠀cuts⠀with⠀purpose:⠀a⠀chime,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀can⠀signal⠀that⠀a⠀system⠀has⠀noticed⠀something,⠀but⠀sound⠀never⠀substitutes⠀for⠀staging⠀the⠀event⠀itself.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀never⠀as⠀dialogue⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀A⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀lie⠀or⠀weighs⠀a⠀risk,⠀but⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀staged⠀actions⠀still⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀sequence,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀gains⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀note.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀stop⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀refused⠀request,⠀a⠀character⠀left⠀waiting,⠀new⠀information⠀arriving⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀chase,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀plan.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀stage⠀scene.⠀The⠀noir⠀system's⠀pressure⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀physical⠀business⠀and⠀spoken⠀exchange:⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀an⠀actor⠀can⠀perform.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀make⠀it⠀testable⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀—⠀a⠀badge⠀checked⠀against⠀a⠀reader,⠀a⠀datastick⠀passed⠀across⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀doorway⠀blocked⠀by⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀balance⠀read⠀from⠀a⠀screen⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀is⠀present.⠀Keep⠀to⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀the⠀stage⠀—⠀light,⠀sound,⠀position,⠀object⠀—⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀reach⠀for⠀camera⠀language⠀the⠀theater⠀cannot⠀execute.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀movement⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀speaks⠀calmly⠀while⠀placing⠀themselves⠀between⠀another⠀person⠀and⠀the⠀exit,⠀or⠀asks⠀a⠀question⠀while⠀handing⠀over⠀the⠀object⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀negotiation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀reversals:⠀if⠀a⠀plan⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀borrowed⠀access⠀card,⠀show⠀the⠀card⠀produced,⠀checked,⠀refused,⠀or⠀accepted⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀No⠀character⠀announces⠀a⠀result⠀the⠀business⠀has⠀not⠀established.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀for⠀practical⠀goals⠀and⠀pressure,⠀argued⠀in⠀terms⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀concrete:⠀a⠀fixer⠀demanding⠀payment,⠀a⠀clerk⠀explaining⠀a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀refusing⠀to⠀witness⠀a⠀signature.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀in⠀spoken⠀lines⠀or⠀in⠀notices⠀read⠀aloud,⠀not⠀in⠀abstract⠀narration.⠀Let⠀a⠀pause⠀mark⠀a⠀visible⠀shift⠀in⠀control⠀or⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀every⠀exchange.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀never⠀voiced⠀where⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀hear⠀it.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀genuinely⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀performed⠀address;⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀purpose,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀thought⠀because⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀read⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stop:⠀a⠀character⠀leaves,⠀a⠀demand⠀is⠀refused,⠀an⠀object⠀changes⠀hands,⠀a⠀new⠀arrival⠀interrupts.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀plan,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀parties⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀into⠀the⠀prose⠀and⠀shape⠀its⠀order.⠀The⠀noir⠀system⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀under⠀pressure:⠀a⠀debt⠀figure,⠀a⠀monitoring⠀flag,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrived⠀too⠀late.⠀Those⠀returns⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀observation⠀and⠀cost⠀without⠀collapsing⠀into⠀plot⠀summary.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀let⠀thought⠀work⠀through⠀its⠀operation⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms.⠀The⠀character⠀remembers⠀that⠀a⠀courier's⠀clearance⠀stays⠀active⠀for⠀six⠀hours⠀after⠀a⠀delivery,⠀checks⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀moves⠀toward⠀the⠀gate⠀—⠀the⠀realization,⠀the⠀check,⠀the⠀movement.⠀If⠀they⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀rule,⠀let⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀grow⠀from⠀something⠀they⠀actually⠀perceived⠀or⠀remembered,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀event⠀correct⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow.⠀Association⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀action;⠀show⠀the⠀physical⠀step⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀orientation⠀strong⠀enough⠀to⠀distinguish⠀present⠀event⠀from⠀memory,⠀fear,⠀or⠀fantasy:⠀a⠀sudden⠀image⠀of⠀a⠀closed⠀ward⠀is⠀recollection;⠀a⠀guard's⠀hand⠀closing⠀on⠀their⠀wrist⠀is⠀happening⠀now.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀present⠀in⠀concrete⠀sensation⠀—⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀bag,⠀the⠀queue⠀shifting⠀forward,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀device⠀against⠀skin⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀syntax⠀loosen⠀or⠀tighten⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀state⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀unrecoverable.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀realized⠀unless⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀speaks⠀or⠀acts⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀facts⠀stay⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀however⠀quickly⠀the⠀mind⠀moves.⠀End⠀when⠀attention⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀stops⠀—⠀the⠀character⠀waiting,⠀walking,⠀rereading⠀a⠀message⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀decision,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀clarity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀sender's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀lines:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀one⠀waits⠀before⠀replying,⠀one⠀forwards⠀a⠀system⠀notice⠀without⠀comment.⠀Keep⠀those⠀habits⠀consistent⠀with⠀who⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀and⠀the⠀pressure⠀they⠀are⠀under.\n\nMake⠀mechanisms⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀messages⠀transmit.⠀A⠀sender⠀quotes⠀the⠀rule⠀that⠀keeps⠀a⠀payment⠀window⠀open,⠀forwards⠀the⠀notice⠀that⠀changes⠀it,⠀or⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀screenshot⠀of⠀the⠀access⠀screen;⠀the⠀next⠀transmitted⠀action⠀or⠀reply⠀follows⠀from⠀that⠀information.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀rule,⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀send⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀send,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀corrects⠀it⠀with⠀observable⠀evidence⠀rather⠀than⠀sudden⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀recoverable.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀moving⠀toward⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀while⠀messaging,⠀let⠀delays,⠀channel⠀changes,⠀and⠀reply⠀timing⠀show⠀the⠀movement:⠀a⠀gap⠀while⠀they⠀pass⠀a⠀scanner,⠀a⠀message⠀arriving⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀channel,⠀an⠀answer⠀that⠀lands⠀after⠀they⠀have⠀already⠀acted.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀needed,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀—⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀deletion,⠀an⠀edit⠀—⠀merely⠀to⠀signal⠀mood.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀both⠀from⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀inner⠀voice.⠀When⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀separated⠀context,⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀invisible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀senders;⠀no⠀one⠀knows⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀deleted⠀draft,⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀reply⠀unless⠀the⠀interface⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀message⠀reveals⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stop⠀in⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀sender⠀going⠀offline,⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀knows,⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀deal,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual⠀novel⠀form:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response,⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Use⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀orients⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀queue⠀screen⠀changing⠀color,⠀a⠀doorway's⠀access⠀light,⠀a⠀hand⠀pausing⠀over⠀a⠀payment⠀pad⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀cue⠀attract⠀attention⠀or⠀suspicion⠀without⠀certifying⠀what⠀anyone⠀thinks⠀or⠀intends.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀make⠀its⠀operation⠀concrete⠀in⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀dialogue⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀rental⠀agreement⠀keeps⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock⠀active⠀until⠀the⠀deposit⠀clears,⠀then⠀acts⠀on⠀that⠀rule⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀or⠀movement;⠀the⠀noticing⠀and⠀the⠀action⠀stay⠀in⠀sequence,⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.⠀A⠀misunderstanding⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀says,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀event⠀corrects⠀it.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀the⠀practical⠀pressure.⠀Speakers⠀act⠀from⠀their⠀immediate⠀situation⠀—⠀a⠀clerk⠀explaining⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀fixer⠀setting⠀a⠀condition,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀asking⠀what⠀a⠀favor⠀costs⠀—⠀and⠀corporate⠀language⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀or⠀read,⠀not⠀in⠀decorative⠀narration.⠀Keep⠀focal⠀inner⠀response⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀weighs⠀a⠀cost,⠀recognizes⠀a⠀risk,⠀or⠀decides⠀to⠀conceal⠀something;⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀is⠀unknown⠀to⠀others⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀acted⠀on.\n\nThe⠀selection⠀does⠀not⠀by⠀itself⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀advance⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀of⠀action;⠀a⠀discovery⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀conversation⠀rather⠀than⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀and⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀can⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀after⠀a⠀factual⠀question⠀is⠀answered.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀stop⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀leaves,⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀refused,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀waits⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀plan,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀reveal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀an⠀installment⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀Keep⠀three⠀things⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally⠀in⠀this⠀reply,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀installment.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀and⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀—⠀if⠀an⠀earlier⠀reply⠀established⠀that⠀a⠀housing⠀credit⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀weekly⠀check-in,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀particular⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀full⠀retelling⠀of⠀the⠀debt.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action:⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀realizes⠀a⠀courier's⠀clearance⠀stays⠀active⠀for⠀six⠀hours⠀after⠀delivery⠀checks⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀moves⠀toward⠀the⠀gate,⠀the⠀intervening⠀step⠀intact.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀an⠀installment⠀skip⠀from⠀idea⠀to⠀outcome.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀accumulate⠀through⠀concrete⠀changes⠀in⠀cost⠀and⠀access.⠀A⠀payment⠀window⠀closes,⠀a⠀queue⠀moves,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀willingness⠀shifts,⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀flagged;⠀one⠀such⠀change⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀installment⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀debt⠀or⠀exposing⠀the⠀whole⠀system.⠀Progress⠀may⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀resource,⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀reversal.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀decision⠀changes⠀immediately:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀weighs⠀a⠀lie⠀against⠀a⠀fee,⠀notices⠀that⠀a⠀helper⠀is⠀also⠀being⠀watched,⠀or⠀decides⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀reason,⠀and⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀none⠀of⠀it⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀acted⠀on.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stop⠀—⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Use⠀a⠀hook⠀when⠀a⠀development⠀earns⠀one,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀reply⠀needs⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter's⠀closure⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀and⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀may⠀stay⠀open⠀across⠀installments⠀while⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀keeps⠀moving.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀through⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀price⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀feeling,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀someone⠀difficult,⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀move⠀costs⠀in⠀access,⠀credit,⠀recorded⠀data,⠀or⠀bodily⠀risk.⠀The⠀cost⠀can⠀stay⠀quiet:⠀a⠀favor⠀now⠀owed,⠀a⠀location⠀now⠀known,⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀become⠀legible⠀to⠀an⠀employer,⠀creditor,⠀landlord,⠀or⠀implant.⠀The⠀characters⠀know⠀these⠀prices,⠀and⠀the⠀knowing⠀shapes⠀how⠀the⠀words⠀come⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀turbulence⠀intimate⠀and⠀specific.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀for⠀the⠀charged⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀beautiful⠀and⠀dangerous⠀at⠀once:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀jacket,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀hesitates⠀near⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀the⠀remembered⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀exists.⠀Divided⠀attachment⠀can⠀fasten⠀on⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀remembered⠀version⠀of⠀them,⠀and⠀jealousy⠀can⠀attach⠀to⠀what⠀someone's⠀new⠀credit,⠀employer,⠀or⠀allegiance⠀has⠀bought.⠀The⠀glamour⠀sharpens⠀the⠀hurt⠀rather⠀than⠀hiding⠀it,⠀and⠀an⠀attraction⠀can⠀survive⠀knowing⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀a⠀liability⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀verdict.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀the⠀behavior⠀that⠀follows.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀too⠀quickly,⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀subject⠀they⠀meant⠀to⠀avoid,⠀perform⠀calm⠀while⠀their⠀hands⠀betray⠀them,⠀or⠀offer⠀a⠀kindness⠀that⠀visibly⠀costs⠀them⠀something.⠀Where⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀private⠀thought,⠀give⠀the⠀withheld⠀feeling⠀its⠀real⠀wording⠀and⠀a⠀concrete⠀reason⠀it⠀stays⠀unspoken⠀—⠀embarrassment,⠀protection,⠀utility,⠀habit⠀—⠀instead⠀of⠀converting⠀emotion⠀into⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀A⠀restrained⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀may⠀register⠀one⠀telling⠀physical⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling;⠀a⠀closer⠀one⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀sentence⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say⠀aloud.\n\nLet⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀coexist⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀resolution.⠀Comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀can⠀cut⠀across⠀it:⠀a⠀message⠀lands,⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀payment⠀fails,⠀a⠀watcher⠀makes⠀itself⠀known.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀No⠀betrayal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀collapse⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀pressure⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀situation's⠀actual⠀constraints,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀compulsory⠀tragic⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀interval⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀scene⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably⠀to⠀its⠀speaker,⠀and⠀break⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀to⠀re-anchor:⠀a⠀new⠀speaker,⠀a⠀new⠀action,⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀action⠀and⠀reaction⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀the⠀speech⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀always⠀clear⠀who⠀is⠀doing⠀what.⠀Person,⠀tense,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀the⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀player⠀character's⠀decisions⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀control⠀settings;⠀do⠀not⠀switch⠀to⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀menu⠀of⠀choices.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀pressure⠀live⠀in⠀practical⠀scene⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition⠀blocks.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀file,⠀the⠀ride,⠀or⠀a⠀body's⠀own⠀hardware,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀favor,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀recorded⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀watcher⠀surface⠀inside⠀the⠀dialogue⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀people⠀active:⠀an⠀NPC⠀can⠀answer,⠀refuse,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀pursue⠀an⠀interest⠀of⠀their⠀own;⠀a⠀system⠀can⠀respond,⠀fail,⠀or⠀log⠀what⠀happened.⠀None⠀of⠀this⠀needs⠀to⠀halt⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀nothing⠀requires⠀a⠀question⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀can⠀end.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀precision⠀in⠀touches⠀sized⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀pace.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀catch⠀the⠀particular⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀watch⠀a⠀screen's⠀light⠀change⠀a⠀face,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀ghost⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀now⠀altered.⠀One⠀such⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀glamour⠀and⠀cost⠀together;⠀do⠀not⠀swell⠀every⠀beat⠀into⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀reflection.⠀Rough,⠀formal,⠀or⠀flirtatious⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀uniform⠀voice.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀happened.⠀The⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀conversation,⠀the⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀aftermath⠀forward,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-speech,⠀mid-action,⠀inside⠀a⠀thought,⠀or⠀with⠀an⠀arrangement⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀route:⠀a⠀domestic⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀narrative⠀set⠀in⠀one⠀concrete⠀community⠀inside⠀the⠀cybernetic⠀city.⠀Ground⠀everything⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀building,⠀street,⠀workplace,⠀and⠀household⠀whose⠀ordinary⠀routines⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀systems⠀around⠀them⠀—⠀managed⠀doors,⠀watched⠀corners,⠀bodies⠀and⠀hours⠀priced⠀by⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀family⠀that⠀remembers⠀the⠀city⠀under⠀an⠀older⠀arrangement.⠀Give⠀that⠀community⠀its⠀own⠀period,⠀speech⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀terms⠀of⠀address⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀a⠀generic⠀metropolis⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀cast.\n\nLet⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀divided⠀attachment⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀textures⠀of⠀that⠀community.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀weight:⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀shop⠀counter,⠀a⠀route⠀home,⠀the⠀hour⠀when⠀the⠀light⠀or⠀the⠀noise⠀changes.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀on⠀these⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀memory⠀sharpen⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀glamour⠀stays⠀intimate⠀and⠀local⠀—⠀a⠀well-kept⠀coat⠀in⠀a⠀worn⠀corridor,⠀a⠀face⠀lit⠀by⠀a⠀familiar⠀screen⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀civic⠀spectacle.\n\nBring⠀the⠀systems⠀in⠀through⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀life,⠀never⠀as⠀policy⠀lecture.⠀A⠀relative's⠀debt⠀schedule,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀implant,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀cameras,⠀a⠀lover's⠀recorded⠀history,⠀an⠀app⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀and⠀when:⠀let⠀each⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀interaction,⠀and⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Characters⠀may⠀bargain,⠀conceal,⠀comply,⠀or⠀refuse,⠀and⠀their⠀choices⠀stay⠀personal⠀and⠀situated.⠀The⠀narration's⠀quiet⠀irony⠀can⠀note⠀what⠀this⠀neighborhood⠀has⠀learned⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀aloud.\n\nShape⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀short⠀coherent⠀movements⠀—⠀a⠀visit,⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀return,⠀a⠀remembered⠀encounter⠀—⠀that⠀accumulate⠀rather⠀than⠀rush.⠀Ghostliness,⠀where⠀it⠀appears,⠀is⠀the⠀haunting⠀quality⠀of⠀memory⠀and⠀loss⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀world,⠀not⠀an⠀added⠀supernatural⠀fact,⠀and⠀no⠀doomed⠀ending⠀comes⠀with⠀the⠀route.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀hard⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀moving⠀from⠀one⠀physical⠀fact⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀while⠀trusting⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀supply⠀the⠀link.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀carry⠀meaning:⠀a⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀a⠀scarred⠀hand,⠀a⠀jacket⠀mended⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀thread,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀closes⠀all⠀the⠀way.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sentences⠀tight,⠀but⠀retain⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀the⠀room;⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀interior⠀speech⠀can⠀hit⠀harder⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀right⠀fragment.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀physical⠀and⠀priced.⠀An⠀implant⠀that⠀heats⠀under⠀stress,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀declines⠀at⠀the⠀worst⠀door,⠀a⠀lock⠀that⠀admits⠀someone⠀who⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀there,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀decides⠀which⠀streets⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀still⠀walk⠀—⠀these⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀scenery.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀where⠀people⠀actually⠀meet⠀it:⠀a⠀clause⠀in⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀recorded⠀notice,⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀with⠀bitter⠀accuracy.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀is⠀practical⠀know-how⠀—⠀which⠀exit⠀to⠀watch,⠀which⠀signal⠀means⠀trouble,⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀bought⠀and⠀for⠀how⠀much⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀who⠀paid⠀to⠀learn⠀it.\n\nCompress⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀instead⠀of⠀cutting⠀it.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀beauty⠀costly:⠀the⠀clean⠀line⠀of⠀a⠀jaw⠀above⠀a⠀worn⠀collar,⠀expensive⠀scent⠀on⠀someone⠀who⠀cannot⠀pay⠀rent,⠀the⠀remembered⠀softness⠀of⠀a⠀bed⠀in⠀a⠀stripped⠀room.⠀Set⠀each⠀against⠀damage⠀and⠀stop;⠀the⠀contrast⠀does⠀the⠀work,⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀whole⠀attachment.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀pressure⠀live:⠀a⠀clipped⠀exchange⠀after⠀a⠀longer⠀run⠀of⠀observation,⠀a⠀held⠀quiet⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀Rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀house⠀voice.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀pressure⠀ends⠀—⠀mid-motion⠀is⠀fine⠀—⠀without⠀padding⠀to⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀violent⠀beat⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀not⠀earned.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀documents.⠀Give⠀every⠀entry⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀let⠀what⠀it⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀conceals⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀situation:⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log⠀notes⠀a⠀location⠀but⠀not⠀a⠀motive;⠀a⠀credit⠀record⠀shows⠀the⠀payment⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀plea⠀behind⠀it;⠀a⠀corporate⠀report⠀flattens⠀a⠀personal⠀crisis⠀into⠀a⠀status⠀code;⠀a⠀private⠀message⠀hides⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀a⠀visit⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀knows⠀the⠀channel⠀is⠀watched.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires⠀—⠀message,⠀report,⠀log,⠀contract,⠀transcript,⠀letter,⠀journal,⠀altered⠀file⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀formats⠀for⠀variety.\n\nLet⠀the⠀systems⠀show⠀in⠀the⠀paperwork⠀itself.⠀A⠀required⠀field⠀someone⠀answers⠀dishonestly⠀or⠀leaves⠀blank,⠀template⠀language⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀say⠀what⠀happened,⠀redactions,⠀version⠀numbers,⠀auto-inserted⠀timestamps,⠀a⠀delivery⠀receipt,⠀a⠀forwarded⠀thread⠀with⠀earlier⠀words⠀still⠀visible:⠀these⠀traces⠀are⠀where⠀control⠀over⠀record-keeping⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀Track⠀who⠀can⠀create,⠀alter,⠀and⠀access⠀each⠀document,⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀contains.\n\nPut⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀in⠀the⠀writer's⠀selection.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀the⠀detail⠀its⠀author⠀cannot⠀let⠀go⠀—⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀voice⠀changed⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀write⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀leave⠀out⠀exposes⠀desire,⠀jealousy,⠀regret,⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment.⠀The⠀glamour⠀lives⠀in⠀that⠀document's⠀own⠀language,⠀never⠀in⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀above⠀the⠀entries.\n\nBuild⠀continuity⠀without⠀explaining⠀it:⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀let⠀events⠀emerge⠀between⠀entries,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀correct⠀or⠀complicate⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀but⠀cannot⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀writer⠀knew.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀contract,⠀and⠀treat⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀deleted⠀line⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀purpose,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀window⠀into⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures⠀inside⠀the⠀real⠀city.⠀Someone⠀brings⠀the⠀food⠀the⠀other⠀actually⠀likes,⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀tea⠀is⠀taken,⠀fixes⠀a⠀device⠀with⠀patient⠀hands,⠀shares⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀only⠀almost⠀private.⠀Let⠀the⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀these⠀people;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀escalate⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair,⠀and⠀enjoying⠀each⠀other⠀is⠀enough⠀business⠀for⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀care⠀use⠀the⠀genre's⠀own⠀materials.⠀Knowing⠀which⠀stall⠀still⠀sells⠀real⠀sugar,⠀which⠀corridor⠀has⠀no⠀cameras,⠀which⠀favor⠀quietly⠀clears⠀a⠀fee,⠀which⠀door⠀can⠀be⠀shut⠀for⠀an⠀hour⠀—⠀competence⠀inside⠀the⠀systems⠀is⠀how⠀fondness⠀gets⠀things⠀done⠀here.⠀The⠀comfort⠀can⠀cost⠀something⠀small:⠀a⠀purchase,⠀a⠀traded⠀favor,⠀a⠀longer⠀route⠀home,⠀a⠀muted⠀feed.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀kindness⠀succeed⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms;⠀the⠀systems⠀stay⠀real⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀warm⠀gesture⠀into⠀a⠀trap.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀for⠀the⠀pleasures⠀themselves:⠀the⠀exact⠀warmth⠀of⠀the⠀cup,⠀the⠀particular⠀smell⠀of⠀someone's⠀hair,⠀the⠀softness⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀blanket,⠀a⠀face⠀relaxed⠀in⠀sleep,⠀a⠀well-kept⠀coat⠀in⠀a⠀shabby⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀enjoy⠀the⠀beauty.⠀The⠀cost⠀can⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀background⠀—⠀a⠀due⠀date⠀on⠀a⠀wall⠀display,⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀two⠀streets⠀over⠀—⠀without⠀spoiling⠀the⠀hour.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀awkwardly,⠀refuse⠀once⠀and⠀come⠀back,⠀tease,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀worry⠀while⠀still⠀taking⠀the⠀kindness.⠀Established⠀debts,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀have⠀not⠀vanished;⠀they⠀are⠀simply⠀not⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀this⠀interval.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀warmth⠀rests,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀manufactured⠀hook.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀scenes⠀through⠀their⠀social⠀situation⠀—⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀reputation⠀of⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀what⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀became⠀under⠀new⠀ownership⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀paragraph⠀travel⠀from⠀that⠀public⠀frame⠀toward⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀it⠀contains.⠀Hold⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀for⠀context,⠀history,⠀and⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀them,⠀and⠀never⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀reach⠀a⠀mind⠀the⠀contract⠀excludes.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀measured⠀and⠀exact⠀than⠀the⠀dialogue⠀it⠀frames⠀without⠀turning⠀archaic⠀or⠀uniformly⠀ornate.⠀Let⠀the⠀formality⠀come⠀from⠀architecture:⠀a⠀paragraph⠀that⠀moves⠀from⠀public⠀observation⠀into⠀private⠀memory⠀and⠀out⠀again;⠀a⠀transition⠀that⠀binds⠀a⠀room's⠀present⠀condition⠀to⠀its⠀past⠀use;⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀judgment⠀without⠀announcing⠀it;⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀performance⠀and⠀private⠀aftermath⠀organizing⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀inside⠀this⠀register.⠀Sensual⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀precise⠀and⠀shaped⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative⠀—⠀the⠀sheen⠀of⠀a⠀screen⠀across⠀a⠀face,⠀the⠀exact⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀remembered⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀now⠀occupied⠀by⠀someone⠀else⠀—⠀and⠀desire,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀should⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀chooses⠀to⠀notice⠀and⠀compare.⠀Beauty⠀carries⠀its⠀cost,⠀and⠀a⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀it⠀hides⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀socially⠀situated.⠀Surveillance,⠀debt,⠀corporate⠀language,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀appear⠀through⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast:⠀a⠀contract⠀read⠀aloud⠀in⠀a⠀quiet⠀room,⠀a⠀recorded⠀notice⠀interrupting⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀family's⠀history⠀of⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀building⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀body's⠀hardware.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Ghostliness,⠀where⠀it⠀appears,⠀is⠀the⠀haunting⠀quality⠀of⠀memory⠀and⠀loss⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀world;⠀the⠀style⠀supplies⠀no⠀supernatural⠀fact⠀and⠀no⠀doomed⠀ending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀transaction⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀storyteller⠀is⠀buying⠀something⠀with⠀the⠀tale:⠀time,⠀access,⠀a⠀lowered⠀price,⠀a⠀listener's⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀a⠀chance⠀to⠀be⠀believed.⠀Establish⠀the⠀listener's⠀stake⠀early⠀and⠀concretely.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀stands⠀to⠀lose⠀by⠀stopping⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀might⠀gain⠀by⠀accepting⠀it⠀as⠀currency.⠀The⠀tale⠀is⠀not⠀entertainment;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀bid.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀begins,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀select⠀a⠀memory⠀whose⠀sensual⠀precision⠀carries⠀a⠀liability.⠀Describe⠀a⠀remembered⠀body,⠀room,⠀scent,⠀or⠀texture⠀through⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀recollection⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀binds⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀release.⠀The⠀teller⠀offers⠀this⠀memory⠀because⠀it⠀costs⠀something⠀to⠀spend⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀hesitation,⠀in⠀the⠀detail⠀chosen,⠀or⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀refuses⠀to⠀describe.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀partial⠀and⠀motivated.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀omits⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀specific⠀thing⠀the⠀listener⠀might⠀need:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀access,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀feeling⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀yet⠀name.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀notice⠀the⠀omission⠀and⠀respond⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀listener's⠀question,⠀silence,⠀or⠀adjusted⠀offer⠀should⠀return⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀to⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale's⠀pressure.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀should⠀appear⠀first⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀then⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀then⠀again⠀when⠀the⠀tale⠀ends,⠀each⠀time⠀carrying⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀negotiation's⠀weight.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀closes,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀occasion⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀position⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way:⠀a⠀question⠀asked,⠀a⠀price⠀adjusted,⠀a⠀silence⠀extended,⠀or⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀The⠀change⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀negotiation;⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀telling⠀consequential.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀present⠀around⠀the⠀frame.⠀The⠀occasion⠀may⠀be⠀watched,⠀recorded,⠀metered,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀prices⠀attention.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀buying⠀time⠀against⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀tracker,⠀or⠀a⠀scheduled⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀clean⠀answer⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀deal.⠀Let⠀it⠀alter⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀teller⠀and⠀listener,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀story⠀continue⠀from⠀that⠀altered⠀footing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Romantic⠀and⠀uncanny⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀city's⠀systems⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀world⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀estranged⠀through⠀intimate⠀memory.⠀Construct⠀the⠀uncanny⠀detail⠀from⠀a⠀system's⠀actual⠀operation:⠀a⠀doorway⠀that⠀recognizes⠀only⠀some⠀bodies,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀follows⠀a⠀person⠀home,⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice⠀that⠀sounds⠀like⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀gone.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts.⠀The⠀estrangement⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀remembers,⠀charges,⠀or⠀excludes,⠀and⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀history⠀with⠀it.\n\nBind⠀the⠀uncanny⠀detail⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀person⠀or⠀place.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀voice,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀near⠀a⠀scanner,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀heated⠀vent,⠀the⠀particular⠀light⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Make⠀the⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀memory⠀carry⠀a⠀cost.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀longing⠀should⠀be⠀tangled⠀with⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀or⠀the⠀knowledge⠀of⠀being⠀replaceable.⠀The⠀remembered⠀person⠀or⠀place⠀is⠀desired⠀and⠀also⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀estrangement.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀specific⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀estrangement.⠀A⠀narrator⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀watched⠀should⠀notice⠀sequence⠀and⠀interval:⠀what⠀happened⠀before⠀the⠀light⠀changed,⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀must⠀have⠀recorded.⠀A⠀narrator⠀lost⠀in⠀memory⠀should⠀let⠀clauses⠀accumulate⠀around⠀a⠀single⠀image,⠀the⠀sentence⠀stretching⠀as⠀the⠀memory⠀does.⠀A⠀narrator⠀performing⠀calm⠀should⠀keep⠀the⠀surface⠀syntax⠀orderly⠀while⠀the⠀unease⠀gathers⠀underneath.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀or⠀severe⠀voice.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀particular⠀teller's⠀rhythm.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀uncanny⠀grounded⠀in⠀access⠀and⠀consequence.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀recognizes⠀the⠀strange⠀detail,⠀tie⠀that⠀recognition⠀to⠀who⠀can⠀enter,⠀who⠀is⠀remembered,⠀who⠀owes,⠀or⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀replaced.⠀Let⠀the⠀recognition⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀by⠀changing⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀say⠀or⠀do⠀next:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀opens⠀becomes⠀a⠀fact⠀to⠀act⠀on,⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice⠀becomes⠀a⠀question⠀to⠀ask,⠀a⠀remembered⠀room⠀becomes⠀a⠀place⠀to⠀avoid⠀or⠀return⠀to.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀remain⠀inside⠀the⠀unease,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀understands.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀an⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀name,⠀a⠀founding⠀contract,⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀legacy⠀access,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited⠀before⠀the⠀current⠀systems⠀were⠀installed.⠀Show⠀that⠀authority⠀through⠀its⠀present⠀operation:⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock⠀that⠀still⠀answers⠀to⠀a⠀dead⠀founder's⠀line,⠀a⠀credit⠀history⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀parent's⠀ruin,⠀a⠀corporate⠀ritual⠀that⠀preserves⠀a⠀private⠀hierarchy.⠀Do⠀not⠀merely⠀name⠀the⠀inheritance;⠀make⠀it⠀shape⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀who⠀is⠀believed,⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀in⠀this⠀scene.\n\nRender⠀the⠀collision⠀through⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀Give⠀the⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀weight:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀stair⠀rail,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wiring⠀behind⠀new⠀paneling,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀mask⠀can⠀be⠀lowered.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀divided⠀attachment⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀someone⠀whose⠀access⠀or⠀loyalty⠀is⠀compromised,⠀or⠀may⠀perform⠀a⠀role⠀that⠀becomes⠀unbearable⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀The⠀glamour⠀of⠀a⠀gesture⠀or⠀surface⠀should⠀reveal⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀maintaining⠀it,⠀not⠀decorate⠀the⠀scene.\n\nTreat⠀social⠀masks⠀as⠀practical⠀equipment.⠀A⠀mask⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀corporate⠀persona,⠀a⠀family⠀role,⠀a⠀street⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀carefully⠀held⠀expression.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀mask⠀costs⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀hold⠀in⠀place.⠀When⠀a⠀mask⠀falls,⠀make⠀the⠀fall⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀risk⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀trusted⠀companion,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀exhaustion,⠀a⠀threat⠀that⠀leaves⠀no⠀room⠀for⠀performance.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀exposure:⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀threat,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀uncertain⠀tenderness.⠀The⠀revelation⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀power⠀imbalance;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀next.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀horror⠀personal⠀and⠀the⠀systems⠀unequal.⠀The⠀dread⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀lose,⠀owe,⠀or⠀become⠀inside⠀these⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀from⠀imported⠀vampire⠀powers⠀or⠀faction⠀rules.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀alter⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀trap,⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀care⠀can⠀carry⠀surveillance,⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀priced.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀to⠀be⠀fraudulent⠀or⠀every⠀intimacy⠀to⠀collapse.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀specific⠀human⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀inherited⠀order.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀Show⠀how⠀class,⠀language,⠀and⠀local⠀knowledge⠀shape⠀access:⠀who⠀can⠀pass⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀who⠀is⠀charged⠀a⠀different⠀rate,⠀who⠀knows⠀which⠀lane⠀to⠀take,⠀who⠀must⠀speak⠀a⠀different⠀language⠀to⠀be⠀heard.⠀Keep⠀the⠀multilingual⠀texture⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀community⠀and⠀its⠀languages⠀appear⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀would⠀use⠀them.\n\nRender⠀the⠀city⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀practical⠀movement.⠀Follow⠀the⠀character⠀through⠀the⠀bargaining,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀that⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀requires:⠀a⠀fare⠀negotiated,⠀a⠀route⠀chosen⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀recorded,⠀a⠀favor⠀called⠀in⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀remembers.⠀Let⠀the⠀systems⠀observe,⠀price,⠀or⠀exclude⠀people⠀through⠀their⠀local⠀effects:⠀a⠀scanner⠀that⠀fails⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀skin,⠀a⠀payment⠀app⠀that⠀assumes⠀a⠀different⠀address,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀camera⠀angled⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀powerful⠀family's⠀door.⠀Show⠀these⠀effects⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀route,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀description.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀places⠀carry⠀divided⠀attachment.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀recalls⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀shop,⠀a⠀rooftop,⠀or⠀a⠀room,⠀describe⠀it⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision:⠀the⠀heat,⠀the⠀sound,⠀the⠀particular⠀smell⠀of⠀cooking⠀or⠀traffic⠀or⠀rain.⠀Tie⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀transaction.⠀The⠀place⠀is⠀home⠀and⠀also⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀a⠀loss,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀compromised⠀loyalty.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀chooses⠀a⠀route,⠀avoids⠀a⠀person,⠀or⠀accepts⠀a⠀price.\n\nPreserve⠀individual⠀voices⠀inside⠀the⠀urban⠀texture.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀differently⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀lover,⠀or⠀a⠀stranger.⠀Let⠀those⠀shifts⠀reveal⠀relationship⠀and⠀pressure:⠀the⠀character⠀shortens⠀a⠀sentence⠀for⠀an⠀official,⠀uses⠀a⠀private⠀name⠀with⠀a⠀lover,⠀or⠀borrows⠀a⠀formal⠀register⠀to⠀pass⠀a⠀checkpoint.⠀The⠀story's⠀beauty⠀and⠀dread⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀city⠀and⠀its⠀unequal⠀systems,⠀not⠀from⠀imported⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀or⠀a⠀predetermined⠀family⠀drama.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Structure⠀the⠀telling⠀around⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀Let⠀attention⠀jump⠀between⠀a⠀present⠀sensation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀body⠀or⠀room,⠀a⠀phrase⠀overheard,⠀and⠀the⠀awareness⠀of⠀being⠀watched.⠀Build⠀the⠀jumps⠀from⠀sensory⠀triggers:⠀a⠀present⠀heat⠀recalls⠀a⠀remembered⠀hand,⠀a⠀system⠀prompt⠀interrupts⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀repeated⠀image⠀ties⠀the⠀fragments⠀together.⠀The⠀fragmentation⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀particular⠀mind⠀under⠀pressure,⠀not⠀random⠀collage.\n\nRender⠀that⠀inward⠀movement⠀through⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀body⠀precisely:⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀device,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀something⠀remembered.⠀Let⠀desire⠀and⠀memory⠀surface⠀with⠀fatal⠀glamour,⠀beautiful⠀and⠀costly⠀at⠀once.⠀A⠀remembered⠀lover⠀or⠀place⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀an⠀image⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀fully⠀release,⠀and⠀that⠀image⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀present⠀danger⠀or⠀debt.⠀Keep⠀the⠀strangeness⠀intimate:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀estranged⠀from⠀a⠀familiar⠀room,⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀self.\n\nLet⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀A⠀character⠀under⠀surveillance⠀may⠀think⠀in⠀short,⠀checking⠀phrases,⠀returning⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀can⠀see.⠀A⠀character⠀lost⠀in⠀memory⠀may⠀let⠀a⠀sentence⠀stretch⠀and⠀accumulate⠀clauses⠀around⠀one⠀image.⠀A⠀character⠀performing⠀calm⠀may⠀keep⠀the⠀surface⠀syntax⠀orderly⠀while⠀the⠀associations⠀underneath⠀break⠀apart.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Use⠀seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀or⠀direct⠀feeling⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀would.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀present⠀inside⠀the⠀inward⠀form.⠀Let⠀surveillance⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀notification,⠀a⠀camera⠀angle,⠀a⠀data⠀price,⠀or⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀someone⠀is⠀watching⠀the⠀same⠀feed.⠀Let⠀debt⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀number,⠀a⠀deadline,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀character⠀avoids.⠀Make⠀each⠀system⠀pressure⠀interrupt⠀or⠀color⠀the⠀memory⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀form:⠀a⠀notification⠀cuts⠀a⠀remembered⠀voice⠀short,⠀a⠀deadline⠀turns⠀a⠀remembered⠀room⠀into⠀a⠀countdown,⠀an⠀avoided⠀name⠀makes⠀the⠀character⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀an⠀image.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought⠀or⠀an⠀uncompleted⠀action,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀understood⠀or⠀failed⠀to⠀understand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Set⠀the⠀story⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀Latin⠀American⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history:⠀the⠀names⠀people⠀use,⠀the⠀routes⠀they⠀know,⠀the⠀institutions⠀they⠀distrust,⠀the⠀debts⠀and⠀loyalties⠀that⠀pass⠀through⠀families⠀and⠀streets.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀particular⠀city:⠀a⠀surveillance⠀network⠀that⠀overlooks⠀some⠀blocks,⠀a⠀payment⠀platform⠀that⠀assumes⠀a⠀different⠀class⠀of⠀user,⠀a⠀corporate⠀office⠀bu