ressure,⠀changed⠀in⠀understanding⠀or⠀resolve,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀magical⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment:⠀a⠀character⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀negotiation⠀in⠀a⠀narrow⠀room,⠀a⠀message⠀arriving⠀with⠀a⠀price⠀attached.⠀Establish⠀the⠀physical⠀space⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀vivid⠀details⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀reach.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀to⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀vehicle,⠀a⠀rooftop,⠀or⠀a⠀back⠀room,⠀mark⠀the⠀transition⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sensory⠀anchor⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀vague⠀jump.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Let⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀action⠀stand⠀on⠀its⠀own,⠀then⠀let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀exchange,⠀then⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀quietly⠀calculating⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀wants,⠀fears,⠀or⠀decides⠀in⠀that⠀beat.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀comedy,⠀first⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀young⠀cast;⠀let⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀tone⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀story.\n\nRender⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀costly⠀glamour⠀through⠀precise⠀sensory⠀detail.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀technology⠀or⠀names⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀first⠀appear,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀description⠀selective:⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀device⠀against⠀the⠀skin,⠀the⠀particular⠀shine⠀of⠀a⠀corporate⠀logo,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Tie⠀each⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀a⠀compromised⠀access.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀admire⠀a⠀surface⠀while⠀knowing⠀what⠀it⠀was⠀bought⠀with,⠀or⠀may⠀desire⠀someone⠀whose⠀access⠀is⠀conditional.⠀The⠀glamour⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀slow⠀it⠀down.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀staging.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀a⠀price⠀that⠀changes⠀when⠀the⠀buyer's⠀profile⠀updates,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀repaid⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point:⠀a⠀question⠀asked,⠀a⠀price⠀named,⠀a⠀door⠀opening,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀left⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀it⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀legible⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀whole⠀negotiation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀noir⠀situation⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀shaped⠀sensory⠀attention.⠀Let⠀a⠀system⠀become⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀fact:⠀the⠀heat⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal⠀gives⠀off,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀credit⠀check⠀fails,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀monitored⠀doorway's⠀light⠀moves⠀across⠀a⠀face.⠀Each⠀image⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀implication⠀of⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀or⠀unequal⠀access⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀concrete⠀transaction⠀that⠀produces⠀it.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀may⠀sharpen⠀the⠀cost⠀it⠀conceals;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀beauty⠀dissolve⠀the⠀cost.\n\nDevelop⠀comparisons⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀actually⠀sees,⠀touches,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀fears.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀extend⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀can⠀create⠀a⠀private⠀pattern⠀of⠀desire⠀or⠀dread,⠀yet⠀each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀meet⠀a⠀new⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀restate⠀a⠀fixed⠀mood.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀register⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀mechanical⠀fact.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cast's⠀voices⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀street⠀shorthand,⠀corporate⠀phrasing,⠀or⠀practical⠀directness⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀remains⠀lyrical.⠀Desire⠀and⠀memory⠀may⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀person's⠀hands,⠀scent,⠀or⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀but⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends;⠀an⠀unresolved⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀waiting⠀signal,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought⠀can⠀close⠀the⠀reply⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀image.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀present⠀perception⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀A⠀familiar⠀street⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀navigated,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀closed⠀stall,⠀the⠀new⠀scanner,⠀or⠀the⠀different⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀waits⠀now.⠀Small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀specific:⠀a⠀price⠀that⠀rose,⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀answers,⠀a⠀gesture⠀someone⠀stopped⠀making.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀be⠀direct⠀or⠀may⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀detail,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence.\n\nUse⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀to⠀deepen⠀attachment⠀without⠀making⠀memory⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀how⠀a⠀room⠀smelled⠀before⠀the⠀filtration⠀units⠀were⠀installed,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀once⠀explained⠀a⠀debt⠀differently.⠀Let⠀present⠀experience⠀coexist⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable;⠀a⠀warm⠀meal,⠀a⠀working⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unmonitored⠀quiet⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀undermined⠀by⠀loss.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀causally⠀present.⠀Surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀compromised⠀access⠀are⠀not⠀only⠀metaphors⠀for⠀time⠀passing;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀specific⠀conditions⠀that⠀changed⠀the⠀remembered⠀thing.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀on⠀a⠀person's⠀altered⠀behavior,⠀but⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀scene's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests;⠀a⠀reflection⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀a⠀loss⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved⠀or⠀declared⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀present⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀one⠀character⠀tells⠀another⠀about⠀a⠀past⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀episode:⠀a⠀debt⠀collected,⠀a⠀bargain⠀that⠀failed,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀job⠀that⠀revealed⠀too⠀much.⠀The⠀teller's⠀reason⠀for⠀speaking,⠀the⠀listener's⠀need,⠀and⠀the⠀occasion's⠀constraints⠀should⠀be⠀concrete.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀open,⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀close⠀the⠀reply,⠀but⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀must⠀remain⠀the⠀teller's⠀composed⠀story,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀transcript.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀do⠀meaningful⠀work.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀price,⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀plan⠀went⠀wrong⠀until⠀the⠀listener's⠀question⠀or⠀the⠀story's⠀pressure⠀requires⠀it.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀delay⠀or⠀reveal⠀is⠀itself⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀noir⠀situation:⠀it⠀may⠀protect⠀someone,⠀preserve⠀a⠀bargain,⠀or⠀test⠀the⠀listener.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent;⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀contains⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knows,⠀believes,⠀or⠀claims,⠀not⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀privately⠀thought.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀intimacy⠀of⠀remembered⠀places.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀particular⠀stairwell,⠀market⠀stall,⠀clinic,⠀or⠀server⠀room⠀with⠀sensual⠀precision,⠀and⠀that⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀carry⠀desire,⠀fear,⠀or⠀compromised⠀attachment.⠀The⠀glamour⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀it⠀describes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tradition's⠀language⠀distinct⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀antiquated⠀props,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀as⠀automatic⠀scene⠀requirements.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀one⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀situation.⠀A⠀detail⠀may⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀or⠀who⠀pays:⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀payment⠀card,⠀a⠀camera's⠀red⠀light⠀reflected⠀in⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀single⠀clean⠀patch⠀on⠀a⠀workbench.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀implication⠀unless⠀the⠀explanation⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable,⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀between⠀the⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀power⠀it⠀reveals.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀economical⠀movement.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments,⠀but⠀each⠀sentence⠀should⠀earn⠀its⠀length⠀by⠀carrying⠀a⠀concrete⠀perception,⠀action,⠀or⠀essential⠀inward⠀connection.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀survives⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀economy⠀of⠀noticing:⠀one⠀remembered⠀scent,⠀one⠀particular⠀gesture,⠀one⠀costly⠀surface.⠀The⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀detail⠀should⠀sharpen⠀its⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀cast⠀voices⠀individual⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀compression.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀at⠀greater⠀length⠀or⠀with⠀different⠀rhythm⠀than⠀the⠀narration.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access;⠀a⠀minimal⠀sentence⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀narrator's⠀desire,⠀suspicion,⠀or⠀memory⠀without⠀granting⠀knowledge⠀of⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀after⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀or⠀action⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work;⠀no⠀summary⠀or⠀thematic⠀restatement⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Let⠀the⠀reply⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀walk⠀through⠀a⠀monitored⠀district,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀in⠀a⠀rented⠀room⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀situation⠀without⠀a⠀separate⠀exposition⠀block.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀recap⠀machinery⠀or⠀summary⠀labels⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀profile⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀particular⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀person's⠀coat,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀stairwell,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀conceals⠀a⠀cost.⠀Jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀but⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀systems⠀causally⠀present.⠀A⠀choice⠀may⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀or⠀who⠀will⠀pay⠀for⠀the⠀decision.⠀Let⠀these⠀conditions⠀enter⠀through⠀concrete⠀scene⠀material:⠀a⠀denied⠀entry,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀conversation,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀attention⠀ends;⠀the⠀situation⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀and⠀no⠀lesson⠀or⠀completed⠀arc⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Select⠀the⠀moment⠀that⠀makes⠀that⠀particular⠀bond⠀legible:⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀under⠀new⠀pressure,⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀comfort⠀or⠀jealousy,⠀a⠀discovery⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀ask⠀of⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀the⠀noir⠀conditions⠀supply⠀the⠀specific⠀pressure:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀limits⠀their⠀choices,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀must⠀review,⠀a⠀bargain⠀that⠀asks⠀one⠀to⠀lie⠀to⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀its⠀particular⠀promise.\n\nDevelop⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀with⠀consequences.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀habit⠀from⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀may⠀return,⠀but⠀its⠀return⠀should⠀fulfill⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀receive⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀divided⠀attachment⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀a⠀person's⠀hands,⠀scent,⠀or⠀hesitation,⠀but⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀causally⠀present⠀without⠀letting⠀them⠀displace⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀may⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀offer⠀each⠀other.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀beat⠀has⠀landed;⠀an⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀and⠀a⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀after⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀noir⠀episode⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀are⠀remembered.⠀A⠀fixer's⠀reliability,⠀a⠀betrayal's⠀cost,⠀a⠀debt⠀carried⠀too⠀long,⠀or⠀a⠀bargain⠀that⠀saved⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀ruined⠀another⠀can⠀earn⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀and⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀remembered⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale;⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀watched⠀door⠀remains⠀what⠀it⠀is⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀with⠀new⠀application.⠀A⠀designation⠀or⠀formula⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀promise⠀kept,⠀a⠀debt⠀forgiven,⠀or⠀a⠀trust⠀broken.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀helping⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀without⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀about⠀payment,⠀access,⠀or⠀surveillance.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀bargaining⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀transaction⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀noir⠀through⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀lens,⠀with⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route⠀carrying⠀an⠀institutional-investigation⠀pressure.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀and⠀exclude⠀people⠀are⠀concrete⠀institutions:⠀a⠀housing⠀office⠀with⠀a⠀queue⠀and⠀a⠀caseworker,⠀a⠀clinic⠀with⠀a⠀payment⠀counter,⠀an⠀employer⠀with⠀a⠀shift⠀schedule,⠀a⠀welfare⠀authority⠀with⠀forms⠀and⠀deadlines.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀compromised⠀choice,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀access⠀it⠀buys,⠀the⠀specific⠀debt⠀it⠀services,⠀or⠀the⠀specific⠀record⠀it⠀alters.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀corporate⠀language⠀float⠀as⠀atmosphere;⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀desk,⠀a⠀procedure,⠀and⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀enforces⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institutional⠀pressure⠀enter⠀domestic⠀life⠀as⠀ordinary⠀social⠀fact.⠀A⠀payment⠀changes⠀who⠀can⠀sleep⠀indoors.⠀A⠀message⠀interrupts⠀a⠀meal.⠀A⠀record⠀follows⠀someone⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀job.⠀A⠀queue⠀determines⠀whether⠀a⠀body⠀gets⠀treatment⠀or⠀waits⠀outside.⠀Keep⠀the⠀investigation⠀or⠀bargain⠀anchored⠀in⠀these⠀rooms⠀and⠀routines⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀chase⠀scenes⠀or⠀data⠀heists⠀alone.⠀The⠀noir⠀question⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀system,⠀but⠀how⠀the⠀system⠀controls⠀the⠀particular⠀household⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀inhabits⠀or⠀remembers.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀on⠀the⠀material⠀world⠀of⠀that⠀social⠀realism.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀should⠀carry⠀its⠀cost⠀visibly:⠀the⠀sheen⠀of⠀a⠀repaired⠀prosthetic,⠀the⠀scent⠀in⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀the⠀careful⠀fit⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀required⠀three⠀months⠀of⠀wages,⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀pay⠀a⠀clinic⠀fee.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀places⠀hold⠀desire⠀and⠀attachment,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀memory⠀specific⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀place⠀cost⠀to⠀enter,⠀keep,⠀or⠀lose.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀body⠀or⠀room⠀can⠀sharpen⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀distract⠀from⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀attentive⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀texture⠀around⠀the⠀investigation⠀or⠀bargain.⠀Who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀shares⠀a⠀bed,⠀who⠀watches⠀a⠀child,⠀who⠀answers⠀the⠀door,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀excluded⠀from⠀the⠀room⠀are⠀as⠀important⠀as⠀the⠀central⠀exchange.⠀Private⠀feeling⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀these⠀ordinary⠀obligations,⠀not⠀through⠀isolated⠀confession.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀register⠀a⠀lover's⠀scent⠀and⠀the⠀rent⠀arrears⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀hold⠀both⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀remain⠀composed⠀and⠀continuous.⠀Paragraphs⠀may⠀slow⠀to⠀examine⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀place,⠀but⠀the⠀examination⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀fact⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀significant.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀montage⠀of⠀neon⠀and⠀rain;⠀if⠀such⠀imagery⠀appears,⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀place,⠀owner,⠀and⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀readable⠀screenplay⠀form:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concrete⠀and⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀does,⠀what⠀a⠀surface⠀looks⠀like,⠀what⠀a⠀device⠀emits,⠀what⠀a⠀room⠀contains.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀props,⠀settings,⠀and⠀physical⠀details.⠀A⠀polished⠀table,⠀a⠀mended⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀vial⠀of⠀perfume,⠀a⠀scar⠀under⠀a⠀wrist⠀implant,⠀a⠀window's⠀reflected⠀light:⠀choose⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀desire,⠀memory,⠀or⠀cost,⠀and⠀give⠀them⠀enough⠀specificity⠀to⠀be⠀filmed.⠀Do⠀not⠀write⠀a⠀prose⠀paragraph⠀of⠀atmosphere;⠀write⠀the⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀particular⠀that⠀produces⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀through⠀handling⠀and⠀condition:⠀a⠀character⠀touches⠀a⠀coat's⠀mended⠀lining⠀before⠀putting⠀it⠀on,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀vial⠀too⠀carefully,⠀or⠀turns⠀a⠀scarred⠀wrist⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀light.\n\nUse⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀for⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀room,⠀feels⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀desires⠀something⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀say,⠀place⠀that⠀experience⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note.⠀Keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀voice-over.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀note's⠀content⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀legible⠀through⠀access⠀and⠀payment.⠀Show⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀whose⠀name⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀what⠀a⠀bribe⠀costs,⠀what⠀a⠀scan⠀reveals,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀a⠀payment⠀fails.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀language⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀mouths⠀of⠀people⠀who⠀enforce⠀it:⠀a⠀clerk,⠀a⠀guard,⠀a⠀handler,⠀a⠀creditor.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀become⠀disembodied⠀jargon.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀private⠀note⠀to⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀that⠀follows⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀note⠀itself⠀remains⠀private.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀announce⠀a⠀system's⠀presence:⠀a⠀drone,⠀a⠀lock⠀cycling,⠀an⠀announcement.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀a⠀performed⠀or⠀recorded⠀speech⠀act,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene's⠀information⠀flow⠀clear.⠀A⠀glance⠀can⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account,⠀record,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reveal⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀into⠀every⠀block.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀name,⠀and⠀use⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀performed⠀on⠀a⠀stage.⠀Keep⠀stage⠀directions⠀economical:⠀they⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear,⠀not⠀what⠀a⠀camera⠀would⠀frame.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀objects⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀the⠀characters⠀handle.⠀A⠀sealed⠀envelope,⠀a⠀bowl⠀of⠀fruit,⠀a⠀coat⠀laid⠀over⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀person's⠀hand⠀pausing⠀above⠀a⠀console,⠀a⠀mirror⠀with⠀a⠀crack:⠀choose⠀props⠀that⠀carry⠀desire,⠀memory,⠀or⠀cost,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀actors'⠀handling⠀of⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀charge.⠀Make⠀the⠀handling⠀specific⠀and⠀repeatable:⠀a⠀character⠀smooths⠀a⠀coat's⠀mended⠀lining⠀before⠀sitting,⠀turns⠀a⠀bowl⠀so⠀the⠀bruised⠀fruit⠀faces⠀away,⠀or⠀touches⠀a⠀console⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀touches⠀a⠀sleeping⠀body.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀a⠀character's⠀inner⠀state⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions.\n\nUse⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀for⠀required⠀private⠀experience.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀place,⠀feels⠀the⠀pull⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀attachment,⠀or⠀calculates⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀choice,⠀place⠀that⠀experience⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note.⠀Keep⠀it⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀hear⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀does⠀not⠀receive⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀performed⠀aside⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀separately⠀authorizes⠀that⠀speech⠀act.\n\nAllow⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀public⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀deliberately⠀addresses⠀the⠀audience,⠀speaks⠀alone⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀intention,⠀or⠀performs⠀a⠀recorded⠀message.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀monologue⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir's⠀unequal⠀power⠀legible⠀through⠀staged⠀access.⠀Who⠀can⠀enter,⠀who⠀must⠀wait⠀outside,⠀who⠀holds⠀a⠀key⠀or⠀a⠀badge,⠀who⠀stands⠀while⠀another⠀sits,⠀who⠀touches⠀an⠀object⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀forbidden⠀to⠀touch⠀it:⠀these⠀arrangements⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀technological⠀system⠀at⠀work.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀language⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀who⠀enforce⠀it,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀offstage⠀abstraction.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀let⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀an⠀entrance⠀register.⠀A⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀can⠀change⠀meaning⠀when⠀the⠀audience⠀later⠀learns⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀charged⠀moment⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀reversal;⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀associations,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀know⠀whether⠀a⠀passage⠀is⠀a⠀present⠀event,⠀a⠀recollection,⠀or⠀a⠀fantasy.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀turn⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀shape⠀the⠀remembered⠀and⠀perceived⠀material.⠀A⠀remembered⠀room⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀its⠀scent,⠀its⠀light,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀its⠀furniture,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀body⠀that⠀once⠀waited⠀there.⠀A⠀present⠀object⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀seen:⠀the⠀cold⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀console,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀modified⠀hand.⠀Desire⠀and⠀divided⠀attachment⠀can⠀surface⠀through⠀these⠀sensory⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀abstract⠀summary.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀enter⠀the⠀flow⠀as⠀concrete⠀interruption⠀and⠀cost,⠀braided⠀with⠀the⠀sensory⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀placed⠀beside⠀it.⠀A⠀payment⠀alert⠀cuts⠀across⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀lover's⠀room,⠀and⠀the⠀memory's⠀warmth⠀lingers⠀inside⠀the⠀alert's⠀cold.⠀A⠀scan⠀warms⠀the⠀skin⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀touching⠀a⠀remembered⠀wrist.⠀A⠀landlord's⠀message⠀arrives⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀sentence⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀rehearsing.⠀A⠀debt⠀resurfaces⠀as⠀a⠀bodily⠀tension⠀when⠀a⠀door⠀fails⠀to⠀open.⠀Let⠀these⠀intrusions⠀pull⠀the⠀mind⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀system,⠀so⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀is⠀felt⠀inside⠀the⠀consciousness⠀rather⠀than⠀described⠀from⠀outside.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀words⠀distinct⠀from⠀spoken⠀or⠀transmitted⠀words.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀rehearse⠀a⠀message,⠀revise⠀it,⠀or⠀imagine⠀a⠀reply,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said⠀or⠀sent.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀inside⠀the⠀mind,⠀not⠀a⠀live⠀transmission.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀another⠀character⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀content⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀it.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀reasoning⠀to⠀appear,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀mistake⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀style's⠀associative⠀movement.⠀The⠀stream⠀should⠀move⠀by⠀sensory⠀echo,⠀emotional⠀pull,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀tidy⠀linear⠀report.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀alters⠀its⠀significance.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀difficulty⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀fixed⠀emotional⠀outcome⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀decision.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀circle⠀a⠀problem,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀and⠀stop⠀mid-thought⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀associations⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀mind⠀and⠀this⠀world's⠀actual⠀pressures.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext;⠀each⠀mechanical⠀detail⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀access,⠀attention,⠀or⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀One⠀sender⠀writes⠀in⠀polished⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀rushed⠀lowercase,⠀another⠀with⠀formal⠀corporate⠀phrasing,⠀another⠀with⠀long⠀silences.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀composed⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀message:⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀named⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀line,⠀a⠀gift⠀described⠀with⠀sensual⠀precision,⠀a⠀jealous⠀question⠀wrapped⠀in⠀politeness.⠀The⠀charge⠀should⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀written,⠀what⠀is⠀delayed,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀edited,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator's⠀commentary.\n\nMake⠀the⠀lushness⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀message's⠀own⠀constraints.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀compress⠀a⠀memory⠀into⠀one⠀exact⠀image,⠀leave⠀a⠀sensual⠀detail⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase⠀carry⠀an⠀accusation.⠀The⠀withheld⠀or⠀edited⠀material⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀charged⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀sent,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀a⠀property⠀of⠀the⠀composed⠀text⠀and⠀its⠀transmission,⠀not⠀a⠀hidden⠀narrator's⠀flourish.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀When⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀appears,⠀place⠀it⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀clearly⠀separate⠀it⠀from⠀the⠀messages.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀written⠀but⠀not⠀transmitted;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀receives⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir's⠀unequal⠀power⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀transcript's⠀mechanics.⠀A⠀receipt⠀shows⠀someone⠀read⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀answer.⠀A⠀channel⠀change⠀follows⠀a⠀payment⠀or⠀a⠀breach.⠀A⠀sender⠀is⠀verified⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀muted.⠀A⠀message⠀fails⠀because⠀an⠀account⠀is⠀suspended.⠀A⠀delay⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀mood;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀lockdown,⠀a⠀dead⠀battery,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀collector⠀at⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀as⠀interface⠀facts⠀and⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀senders⠀do⠀or⠀cannot⠀do⠀between⠀messages.\n\nKeep⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀minimal⠀and⠀clearly⠀separated.⠀When⠀a⠀location,⠀action,⠀or⠀physical⠀event⠀matters,⠀provide⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀contextual⠀note,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀hidden⠀transcript⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀silence⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀receipt⠀into⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀read⠀and⠀simply⠀be⠀unable⠀to⠀answer.\n\nLet⠀the⠀exchange⠀carry⠀the⠀story's⠀forward⠀movement.⠀A⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀bargain⠀may⠀stall,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀arrive⠀after⠀its⠀usefulness⠀has⠀passed.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀can⠀still⠀reach⠀whom.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual-novel⠀form:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀shape⠀the⠀selected⠀background⠀and⠀object⠀details.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀on⠀a⠀lacquered⠀table,⠀a⠀rain-streaked⠀window,⠀a⠀bowl⠀of⠀fruit⠀left⠀uneaten,⠀a⠀coat⠀with⠀a⠀mended⠀lining,⠀or⠀a⠀face⠀reflected⠀in⠀a⠀darkened⠀screen.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀desire,⠀memory,⠀or⠀cost,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀them⠀with⠀sensual⠀precision.⠀Do⠀not⠀list⠀every⠀visual⠀element;⠀select⠀the⠀ones⠀that⠀charge⠀the⠀moment.⠀Make⠀the⠀selection⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀attention:⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀lingers⠀on⠀the⠀coat's⠀mended⠀lining⠀because⠀it⠀remembers⠀who⠀repaired⠀it,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀uneaten⠀fruit⠀because⠀it⠀knows⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀come⠀home.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀character's⠀smile⠀may⠀draw⠀suspicion,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account,⠀record,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.⠀The⠀focal⠀mind⠀may⠀interpret⠀an⠀expression,⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀interpretation⠀private⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀transmitted.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir's⠀unequal⠀power⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀access⠀and⠀change.⠀Show⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀whose⠀name⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀what⠀a⠀scan⠀reveals,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀a⠀payment⠀fails.⠀A⠀scene⠀change⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀access:⠀the⠀same⠀street⠀looks⠀different⠀after⠀a⠀credit⠀freeze,⠀the⠀same⠀clinic⠀corridor⠀admits⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀same⠀apartment⠀no⠀longer⠀recognizes⠀a⠀resident.⠀Let⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀through⠀these⠀concrete⠀changes⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀abstract⠀corporate⠀language.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀calculation⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀shown.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀scenes⠀whose⠀information⠀changes⠀the⠀available⠀interpretations.⠀A⠀revisit⠀can⠀use⠀a⠀familiar⠀visual⠀detail⠀as⠀an⠀anchor,⠀with⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact.⠀Repetition⠀should⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀suspicion.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀reveal⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀into⠀every⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Each⠀installment⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀investigation⠀or⠀relationship⠀history.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀remembered⠀places⠀and⠀charged⠀attachments⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀room,⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀particular⠀scent,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀significance.⠀When⠀a⠀callback⠀appears,⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular:⠀the⠀object⠀previously⠀described,⠀the⠀promise⠀previously⠀made,⠀the⠀debt⠀previously⠀incurred.⠀Do⠀not⠀restate⠀the⠀entire⠀memory,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀new⠀detail⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀earlier⠀installment.⠀Let⠀the⠀callback⠀carry⠀its⠀cost⠀forward:⠀the⠀remembered⠀room⠀now⠀costs⠀more⠀to⠀keep,⠀the⠀gift⠀was⠀sold⠀to⠀cover⠀a⠀fee,⠀the⠀scar⠀marks⠀the⠀procedure⠀that⠀bought⠀access.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir's⠀pressure⠀cumulative⠀through⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀persist⠀across⠀replies.⠀A⠀debt⠀grows⠀interest.⠀A⠀surveillance⠀record⠀follows⠀a⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀place.⠀A⠀credit⠀freeze⠀changes⠀which⠀doors⠀open.⠀A⠀handler's⠀patience⠀shortens.⠀Let⠀these⠀developments⠀be⠀earned:⠀each⠀installment⠀may⠀advance⠀one⠀local⠀consequence,⠀but⠀the⠀larger⠀system⠀remains⠀present⠀and⠀unfinished.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀a⠀long-term⠀pressure⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀convenient⠀turn⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀actually⠀earned⠀that⠀resolution.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀lover⠀while⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀payment⠀to⠀clear,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bargain⠀while⠀performing⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀carry⠀that⠀interiority⠀without⠀forcing⠀it⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀visible⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀confession.\n\nUse⠀occasional⠀hooks,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀newly⠀understood⠀fact,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀fight,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀leveling⠀event.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀inquiry⠀or⠀bargain.⠀Who⠀eats,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀works⠀a⠀shift,⠀who⠀shares⠀a⠀bed,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀excluded⠀from⠀a⠀room⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀texture.⠀The⠀serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀and⠀attachments⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀a⠀fair⠀answer⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀intimate⠀strain⠀through⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀monitored⠀message,⠀a⠀withheld⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀price⠀that⠀changed,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation⠀someone⠀accepted⠀without⠀saying⠀so.⠀Let⠀the⠀technological⠀or⠀social⠀pressure⠀make⠀an⠀emotional⠀need⠀harder⠀to⠀admit,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀a⠀relationship⠀scene.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀another⠀person,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀surrounding⠀system⠀already⠀costs⠀them:⠀surveillance⠀makes⠀the⠀reach⠀visible,⠀a⠀contract⠀makes⠀it⠀conditional,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀makes⠀it⠀feel⠀like⠀another⠀transaction.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀inside⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀hurt.⠀Show⠀them⠀accepting⠀an⠀arrangement⠀as⠀normal:⠀they⠀pay⠀for⠀a⠀call⠀they⠀cannot⠀afford,⠀they⠀read⠀the⠀terms⠀again,⠀they⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀the⠀version⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀room⠀calm,⠀they⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀relief⠀and⠀call⠀it⠀enough.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀acceptance⠀reveal⠀the⠀damage⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀an⠀outburst⠀would.⠀Social⠀meaning⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀particular⠀act.\n\nMake⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀cost⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀follows.⠀A⠀confession⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀silence⠀harder⠀to⠀fill.⠀An⠀apology⠀can⠀arrive⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀already⠀arranged.⠀Needing⠀someone⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀credential⠀that⠀the⠀system⠀will⠀log.⠀Withholding⠀can⠀protect⠀one⠀person⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀other⠀to⠀face⠀a⠀charge⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀script⠀every⠀admission⠀as⠀collapse⠀or⠀every⠀return⠀as⠀repair.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀partial,⠀awkward⠀gesture:⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀name⠀said⠀without⠀the⠀usual⠀title,⠀a⠀payment⠀made⠀without⠀comment.⠀Let⠀pain⠀and⠀comfort⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀moment⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀A⠀restrained⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀shaking⠀hand⠀as⠀a⠀fact⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀feeling⠀in⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀the⠀sentence.⠀A⠀more⠀exposed⠀narrator⠀may⠀circle⠀the⠀same⠀memory⠀twice,⠀correcting⠀the⠀first⠀version.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Let⠀the⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀show⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀avoids,⠀repeats,⠀or⠀finally⠀says⠀in⠀a⠀voice⠀too⠀flat⠀for⠀the⠀weight⠀it⠀carries.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀unsettled⠀after⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀is⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀X