s⠀from⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Organize⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀connected⠀episodes⠀in⠀which⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀exposes⠀how⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀institution⠀works:⠀a⠀worker⠀re-registers⠀an⠀identity,⠀a⠀tenant⠀accepts⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀patient⠀signs⠀a⠀consent⠀form,⠀a⠀courier⠀delivers⠀a⠀package⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀floor.⠀Each⠀episode⠀should⠀be⠀small⠀enough⠀to⠀feel⠀particular⠀and⠀sharp⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀system's⠀damage⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀language⠀and⠀unsentimental⠀irony.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀institution's⠀injustice.⠀Show⠀a⠀character⠀treating⠀an⠀unreasonable⠀condition⠀as⠀routine:⠀they⠀apologize⠀for⠀the⠀delay⠀the⠀system⠀caused,⠀they⠀thank⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀charged⠀them,⠀they⠀describe⠀a⠀surveillance⠀requirement⠀as⠀\"for⠀safety\"⠀and⠀mean⠀it.⠀The⠀satire⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀tone⠀plain.⠀Let⠀the⠀humiliation⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀facts.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀supply⠀the⠀specific⠀pressure⠀for⠀each⠀episode.⠀A⠀debt⠀can⠀turn⠀a⠀small⠀choice⠀into⠀a⠀calculation.⠀An⠀access⠀tier⠀can⠀decide⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀building⠀or⠀receive⠀a⠀service.⠀A⠀monitoring⠀system⠀can⠀record⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀kindness⠀and⠀bill⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀service.⠀A⠀corporate⠀policy⠀can⠀convert⠀a⠀personal⠀emergency⠀into⠀a⠀category.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀technology⠀magical⠀or⠀the⠀institution⠀a⠀single⠀villain;⠀show⠀it⠀operating⠀through⠀forms,⠀fees,⠀prompts,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀employees.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀episodes⠀through⠀recurrence⠀and⠀consequence.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀accepted⠀a⠀fee⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀may⠀later⠀enforce⠀the⠀same⠀fee⠀on⠀someone⠀else.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀contract⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀context⠀with⠀a⠀heavier⠀meaning.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀may⠀become⠀the⠀reason⠀someone⠀finally⠀refuses,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀simply⠀become⠀another⠀entry⠀in⠀a⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀episode⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀rebellion⠀or⠀despair.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀accumulates⠀across⠀the⠀sequence⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀concrete⠀fact⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀padding:⠀a⠀cracked⠀screen,⠀a⠀denied⠀door,⠀a⠀charge⠀posted⠀to⠀an⠀account,⠀a⠀hand⠀shaking⠀from⠀the⠀cold⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀through⠀material⠀wear.⠀Show⠀what⠀is⠀broken,⠀cheap,⠀reused,⠀or⠀failing.⠀A⠀character's⠀body⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀cost:⠀dry⠀eyes⠀from⠀a⠀double⠀shift,⠀a⠀wrist⠀aching⠀from⠀a⠀scanner⠀angle,⠀a⠀cough⠀that⠀returns⠀in⠀the⠀filtered⠀air.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror;⠀the⠀grit⠀serves⠀the⠀social⠀damage.\n\nGround⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀in⠀practical⠀physical⠀detail.⠀A⠀debt⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀abstraction;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀number⠀on⠀a⠀terminal,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀fails,⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀stops.⠀Access⠀is⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀reads⠀a⠀hand⠀and⠀stays⠀shut.⠀Surveillance⠀is⠀a⠀camera⠀housing⠀with⠀a⠀scratched⠀lens⠀and⠀a⠀red⠀light⠀that⠀blinks⠀on⠀a⠀schedule.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀words⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀repeat⠀to⠀a⠀clerk⠀or⠀a⠀machine.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀before⠀entering⠀a⠀building⠀or⠀crossing⠀a⠀block.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act.⠀A⠀character⠀wipes⠀the⠀scanner⠀with⠀a⠀sleeve⠀before⠀using⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀dirty⠀but⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀routine.⠀A⠀vendor⠀charges⠀a⠀fee⠀and⠀the⠀buyer⠀pays⠀without⠀comment.⠀A⠀worker⠀repeats⠀a⠀safety⠀phrase⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀hear.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀report⠀these⠀acts⠀without⠀explaining⠀their⠀meaning.⠀The⠀small⠀humiliation⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀detail:⠀the⠀worn⠀spot⠀on⠀the⠀ID,⠀the⠀receipt⠀folded⠀too⠀many⠀times,⠀the⠀chair⠀bolted⠀to⠀the⠀floor⠀in⠀the⠀waiting⠀room.\n\nChange⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀Most⠀of⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀stay⠀tight,⠀but⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀can⠀follow⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀stops⠀the⠀action:⠀a⠀character⠀counts⠀the⠀remaining⠀balance,⠀remembers⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀the⠀door⠀opened,⠀or⠀works⠀out⠀what⠀the⠀fee⠀will⠀mean⠀for⠀the⠀week.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀the⠀thought⠀with⠀general⠀reflections.⠀Keep⠀it⠀specific⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀situation.⠀Abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker⠀and⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀work⠀log,⠀a⠀clinic⠀intake⠀record,⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀report,⠀a⠀repair⠀ticket,⠀a⠀lease⠀amendment,⠀a⠀statement⠀filed⠀after⠀an⠀incident.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.⠀Each⠀document⠀should⠀exist⠀because⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀would⠀actually⠀produce⠀it.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀know⠀and⠀conceal⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀author⠀and⠀purpose.⠀A⠀work⠀log⠀records⠀the⠀time⠀but⠀not⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀delay.⠀A⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀says⠀the⠀job⠀is⠀fine⠀and⠀omits⠀the⠀fee.⠀A⠀supervisor's⠀report⠀uses⠀corporate⠀language⠀to⠀turn⠀a⠀refusal⠀into⠀a⠀performance⠀issue.⠀A⠀repair⠀ticket⠀notes⠀the⠀broken⠀lock⠀but⠀not⠀who⠀broke⠀it.⠀The⠀Lu⠀Xun-style⠀exposure⠀comes⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal:⠀the⠀apology⠀for⠀the⠀system's⠀error,⠀the⠀gratitude⠀for⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀cost⠀too⠀much,⠀the⠀silence⠀about⠀a⠀charge⠀everyone⠀knows⠀is⠀unfair.\n\nUse⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀to⠀generate⠀and⠀control⠀the⠀documents.⠀A⠀monitoring⠀system⠀timestamps⠀an⠀entry.⠀A⠀payment⠀platform⠀sends⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀amount.⠀An⠀access⠀log⠀records⠀who⠀entered⠀and⠀when,⠀but⠀not⠀who⠀was⠀turned⠀away.⠀A⠀corporate⠀form⠀offers⠀categories⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀fit⠀the⠀actual⠀event,⠀and⠀the⠀author⠀must⠀choose⠀one.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀correction.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀submit⠀a⠀dispute⠀and⠀receive⠀an⠀automated⠀reply⠀that⠀closes⠀the⠀case.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀entries⠀through⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀or⠀repeat⠀its⠀error.⠀Two⠀records⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀may⠀disagree⠀because⠀their⠀authors⠀had⠀different⠀purposes.⠀A⠀missing⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀revealing⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀one.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀without⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀record,⠀omit,⠀and⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀present⠀without⠀letting⠀them⠀cancel⠀the⠀warmth.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀share⠀a⠀meal⠀while⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀waits⠀unread.⠀Two⠀people⠀can⠀sit⠀in⠀a⠀monitored⠀room⠀and⠀still⠀speak⠀easily⠀because⠀the⠀monitoring⠀is⠀ordinary⠀to⠀them.⠀A⠀small⠀pleasure⠀can⠀survive⠀a⠀fee⠀increase.⠀Do⠀not⠀pretend⠀the⠀systems⠀are⠀absent⠀or⠀harmless;⠀let⠀them⠀remain⠀as⠀background⠀pressure⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀chosen⠀care⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀The⠀comfort⠀operates⠀inside⠀the⠀genre,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀it.\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀practical⠀care.⠀Show⠀one⠀character⠀remembering⠀another's⠀preference:⠀the⠀tea⠀without⠀sweetener,⠀the⠀route⠀with⠀fewer⠀stairs,⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀day⠀when⠀the⠀clinic⠀is⠀less⠀crowded.⠀Show⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀that⠀costs⠀something⠀but⠀is⠀still⠀given:⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀food,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀shoulder⠀before⠀a⠀difficult⠀call.⠀Let⠀the⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀show⠀love⠀by⠀charging⠀a⠀device,⠀by⠀waiting,⠀by⠀not⠀asking⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀cannot⠀answer.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀warmth⠀particular.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀comfort⠀in⠀sentimental⠀language.⠀Report⠀the⠀facts:⠀the⠀blanket⠀folded⠀over⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀the⠀chair,⠀the⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀within⠀reach,⠀the⠀name⠀said⠀without⠀the⠀usual⠀title,⠀the⠀silence⠀that⠀is⠀easier⠀than⠀speech.⠀The⠀small⠀pleasure⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀specific⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀situation.⠀A⠀familiar⠀preference⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀history⠀without⠀a⠀flashback.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀act⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀care⠀than⠀a⠀declaration.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀awkwardly⠀or⠀not⠀notice⠀it.⠀Another⠀may⠀refuse⠀help⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀loved.⠀A⠀disagreement⠀can⠀continue⠀after⠀a⠀kind⠀act⠀without⠀undoing⠀the⠀kindness.⠀Do⠀not⠀remove⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀The⠀debt⠀remains,⠀the⠀access⠀tier⠀remains,⠀the⠀surveillance⠀remains.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀limited,⠀and⠀that⠀is⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀action:⠀the⠀queue⠀outside⠀the⠀office,⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀building,⠀the⠀reason⠀this⠀particular⠀errand⠀has⠀become⠀necessary.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀general⠀condition⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀thread.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀setting,⠀the⠀character's⠀place⠀in⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀first⠀small⠀act⠀that⠀will⠀expose⠀the⠀institution.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language;⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀feel⠀composed,⠀not⠀transcribed.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀fee⠀was⠀introduced⠀years⠀ago⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀paid⠀without⠀question.⠀Another⠀may⠀observe⠀that⠀the⠀waiting⠀room⠀was⠀once⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀place,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀workers⠀have⠀learned⠀to⠀stand⠀where⠀the⠀camera⠀cannot⠀see⠀their⠀faces.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀framing⠀become⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀method⠀is⠀to⠀expose⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀itself:⠀the⠀character⠀signs,⠀pays,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀waits,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀records⠀the⠀act⠀plainly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀damage⠀is⠀visible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀supply⠀the⠀pressure⠀that⠀organizes⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀debt⠀can⠀determine⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀events:⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀pay⠀before⠀they⠀can⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀the⠀help⠀itself⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀charge.⠀Access⠀can⠀divide⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room:⠀one⠀is⠀called⠀forward,⠀another⠀is⠀told⠀to⠀wait.⠀Observation⠀can⠀alter⠀behavior:⠀a⠀character⠀speaks⠀more⠀carefully⠀when⠀the⠀recording⠀light⠀is⠀on,⠀or⠀chooses⠀a⠀different⠀route⠀to⠀avoid⠀the⠀camera.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀these⠀systems⠀legible⠀through⠀their⠀effects⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀present.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀sentences⠀are⠀long.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀profile⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀ornate⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.⠀A⠀formal⠀narrator⠀can⠀use⠀a⠀plain⠀word⠀for⠀a⠀plain⠀humiliation.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀restraint,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀explicit⠀moral.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀visible,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀is⠀resolved.⠀The⠀next⠀turn⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀errand,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀waiting⠀room,⠀or⠀follow⠀the⠀character⠀home⠀with⠀the⠀receipt⠀still⠀in⠀hand.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀exchange:⠀someone⠀wants⠀access,⠀a⠀clearance,⠀a⠀debt⠀extension,⠀a⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀can⠀grant⠀it⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀story⠀first.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀sets⠀its⠀rules⠀—⠀a⠀night⠀shift⠀with⠀hours⠀to⠀fill,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀with⠀a⠀camera⠀running⠀—⠀and⠀treat⠀the⠀tale⠀as⠀an⠀act,⠀not⠀decoration:⠀a⠀bid,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀bribe⠀of⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀listener⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀value.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀power⠀relation⠀visible⠀throughout:⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀recorded,⠀who⠀can⠀walk⠀away,⠀who⠀is⠀paying⠀for⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀stands⠀to⠀lose⠀by⠀believing⠀or⠀disbelieving⠀the⠀account.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀person's⠀recollection,⠀never⠀an⠀omniscient⠀legend,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀person,⠀in⠀whatever⠀narration⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀uses.⠀Let⠀position⠀show⠀in⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀—⠀a⠀past⠀job,⠀a⠀punishment,⠀a⠀medical⠀procedure,⠀a⠀failed⠀protest,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀workday⠀that⠀turned⠀instructive⠀—⠀rendered⠀with⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀observation:⠀small⠀humiliations,⠀unquestioned⠀routines,⠀and⠀institutional⠀language⠀carry⠀the⠀damage.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀full⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀recount;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀notice⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀While⠀the⠀spoken⠀tale⠀performs⠀in⠀public,⠀keep⠀the⠀focal⠀participant's⠀private⠀attention⠀live⠀on⠀the⠀page:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀decides⠀to⠀leave⠀out,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀silently⠀prices⠀as⠀the⠀account⠀runs.\n\nGive⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀one⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀that⠀recurs⠀and⠀changes⠀meaning:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀bill⠀that⠀keeps⠀arriving,⠀a⠀name⠀a⠀system⠀mispronounces,⠀a⠀chair⠀outside⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀permission⠀that⠀expires.⠀When⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀returns⠀to⠀that⠀object⠀or⠀phrase,⠀it⠀connects⠀the⠀levels⠀without⠀proving⠀the⠀story⠀true.⠀The⠀account⠀is⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀position⠀and⠀purpose,⠀not⠀a⠀certified⠀record;⠀a⠀log,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀witness⠀can⠀contradict⠀it⠀later.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀answer⠀the⠀tale⠀as⠀an⠀intervention:⠀the⠀listener⠀grants⠀the⠀request,⠀raises⠀the⠀price,⠀asks⠀a⠀sharper⠀question,⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀stays⠀silent.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀terms⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀system⠀underneath.⠀Stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀on⠀an⠀interruption,⠀mid-renegotiation,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀answer⠀—⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀announcing⠀a⠀moral;⠀the⠀effect⠀stays⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀next⠀action,⠀question,⠀or⠀hesitation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀record⠀being⠀assembled⠀or⠀revisited:⠀a⠀case⠀file,⠀an⠀interview⠀transcript,⠀a⠀housing⠀claim,⠀a⠀workplace⠀incident⠀report,⠀a⠀medical⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀account⠀set⠀beside⠀an⠀institutional⠀version.⠀Whatever⠀document⠀the⠀scene⠀uses,⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀—⠀someone⠀wrote⠀it,⠀for⠀someone,⠀with⠀omissions⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀person's⠀living⠀memory⠀present⠀as⠀its⠀own⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀dissolving⠀everything⠀into⠀paperwork.⠀The⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀remembers⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀recorded.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀narration's⠀established⠀person⠀and⠀ownership;⠀the⠀documentary⠀method⠀works⠀in⠀first⠀or⠀third⠀person⠀alike.⠀Keep⠀syntax⠀plain⠀and⠀distance⠀controlled:⠀dates,⠀locations,⠀procedures,⠀fees,⠀spellings,⠀and⠀small⠀material⠀facts⠀do⠀the⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀bureaucratic⠀jargon⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀imitate⠀translated⠀word⠀order⠀—⠀the⠀documentary⠀quality⠀comes⠀from⠀attention,⠀not⠀severity.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts.⠀Show⠀a⠀person⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀response,⠀correcting⠀a⠀misspelled⠀name,⠀paying⠀a⠀fee,⠀signing⠀a⠀form,⠀losing⠀a⠀credential,⠀or⠀explaining⠀the⠀same⠀injury⠀twice⠀to⠀two⠀offices.⠀Let⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal:⠀an⠀apology⠀addressed⠀to⠀a⠀machine,⠀a⠀fee⠀charged⠀for⠀disputing⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀who⠀repeats⠀policy⠀as⠀comfort.⠀Do⠀not⠀lecture⠀about⠀the⠀system;⠀the⠀particular⠀case⠀makes⠀the⠀damage⠀legible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀infrastructure⠀concrete⠀through⠀its⠀function⠀in⠀one⠀person's⠀day⠀—⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀a⠀debt⠀ledger,⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate,⠀a⠀corporate⠀clinic⠀—⠀and⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀entry⠀in⠀the⠀record.⠀Distinguish⠀observation⠀from⠀memory⠀and⠀memory⠀from⠀inference;⠀the⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀altered,⠀or⠀accurate⠀in⠀ways⠀that⠀still⠀harm,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀stays⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀now.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀until⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀or⠀agreement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀—⠀or⠀stop⠀inside⠀that⠀work,⠀mid-comparison,⠀mid-appeal,⠀mid-recollection,⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀A⠀small⠀correction,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀appeal,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀are⠀all⠀available⠀outcomes,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTurn⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀inherited⠀authority⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀life.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀founding⠀family,⠀a⠀legacy⠀contract,⠀a⠀preserved⠀building,⠀a⠀corporate⠀charter,⠀a⠀hereditary⠀access⠀right,⠀or⠀a⠀tradition⠀that⠀still⠀decides⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀work,⠀or⠀speak.⠀The⠀present⠀life⠀is⠀whoever⠀must⠀live⠀inside⠀that⠀arrangement:⠀an⠀employee,⠀a⠀tenant,⠀a⠀debtor,⠀a⠀caretaker,⠀a⠀descendant,⠀a⠀stranger⠀with⠀temporary⠀access.\n\nMake⠀the⠀collision⠀physical⠀through⠀urban⠀material⠀detail:⠀the⠀worn⠀floor⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀clinic,⠀an⠀obsolete⠀security⠀panel⠀beside⠀a⠀new⠀biometric⠀lock,⠀the⠀portrait⠀in⠀a⠀lobby⠀that⠀still⠀watches,⠀the⠀elevator⠀that⠀needs⠀a⠀key⠀no⠀one⠀admits⠀to⠀holding.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀this⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀—⠀a⠀familiar⠀corridor⠀reads⠀differently⠀once⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀they⠀are⠀being⠀priced⠀or⠀excluded.⠀Keep⠀every⠀cause⠀social⠀and⠀economic;⠀no⠀supernatural⠀agency⠀enters,⠀because⠀the⠀horror⠀is⠀what⠀people⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀do⠀to⠀one⠀another.\n\nLet⠀intimacy⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀A⠀trusted⠀colleague⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀files⠀the⠀report;⠀a⠀relative⠀may⠀offer⠀comfort⠀and⠀still⠀expect⠀the⠀debt⠀repaid;⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀can⠀lower⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀far⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀a⠀desire⠀that⠀conflicts⠀with⠀survival.⠀Render⠀these⠀moments⠀with⠀clean,⠀particular⠀observation⠀—⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀lie,⠀the⠀ordinary⠀phrase⠀that⠀accepts⠀an⠀unjust⠀condition⠀as⠀normal⠀—⠀and⠀write⠀the⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀directly⠀where⠀the⠀story's⠀narration⠀permits⠀it:⠀the⠀want⠀named⠀only⠀inwardly,⠀the⠀fear⠀converted⠀into⠀politeness.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀operational⠀so⠀the⠀stakes⠀are⠀legible:⠀a⠀door⠀opens⠀or⠀does⠀not,⠀a⠀balance⠀changes,⠀a⠀recording⠀is⠀kept⠀or⠀deleted,⠀a⠀permission⠀expires.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀use⠀modern⠀tools⠀and⠀the⠀modern⠀system⠀may⠀preserve⠀old⠀hierarchies,⠀but⠀every⠀mechanism⠀stays⠀readable⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀boundary,⠀even⠀mid-encounter⠀or⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence.⠀What⠀changes⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀small⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀now⠀knows,⠀feels,⠀or⠀can⠀do;⠀no⠀betrayal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀escape⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀give,⠀or⠀closely⠀inhabit,⠀their⠀own⠀account⠀of⠀living⠀inside⠀a⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀system:⠀a⠀debt⠀platform,⠀a⠀labor⠀broker,⠀a⠀housing⠀registry,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀police⠀kiosk,⠀a⠀school⠀admission⠀portal,⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement⠀mediated⠀by⠀an⠀app.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀the⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀authorize.\n\nMake⠀the⠀testimony⠀concrete.⠀The⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀they⠀paid,⠀who⠀they⠀asked,⠀what⠀they⠀signed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀told⠀themselves⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀—⠀waiting⠀in⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀refreshes,⠀borrowing⠀a⠀phone⠀to⠀check⠀a⠀balance,⠀explaining⠀a⠀name⠀to⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀accept⠀it,⠀paying⠀a⠀fee⠀because⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀alternative⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀damage⠀emerge⠀from⠀these⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nHold⠀earlier⠀experience⠀apart⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀now⠀understand⠀something⠀they⠀once⠀accepted⠀as⠀normal:⠀a⠀relative's⠀silence,⠀a⠀broker's⠀promise,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀smile,⠀a⠀clause⠀inside⠀a⠀form.⠀Let⠀that⠀later⠀understanding⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀earlier⠀confusion⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it;⠀the⠀testimony⠀draws⠀force⠀from⠀the⠀gap.⠀While⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀addressed⠀to⠀someone⠀—⠀a⠀listener,⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀the⠀self⠀—⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀experience⠀live⠀within⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀sentence⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀the⠀figure⠀they⠀recompute⠀instead⠀of⠀listening,⠀the⠀shame⠀that⠀arrives⠀mid-answer.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀operational⠀and⠀unequal.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀observed:⠀a⠀biometric⠀scan⠀that⠀fails⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀passes⠀another,⠀a⠀loan⠀approved⠀faster⠀for⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀system⠀recognizes,⠀a⠀recording⠀that⠀protects⠀the⠀institution⠀while⠀it⠀incriminates⠀the⠀person.⠀Make⠀these⠀mechanisms⠀legible⠀through⠀lived⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀technical⠀exposition.\n\nThe⠀testimony⠀may⠀stop⠀wherever⠀its⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-answer,⠀on⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question,⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀currently⠀say⠀—⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀at⠀a⠀finished⠀account.⠀What⠀it⠀cost⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unclear⠀are⠀legitimate⠀places⠀to⠀leave⠀it;⠀no⠀resolution,⠀forgiveness,⠀or⠀completed⠀legal⠀case⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀record⠀of⠀ordinary⠀days⠀inside⠀the⠀system:⠀a⠀worker⠀noting⠀shift⠀changes,⠀a⠀debtor⠀tracking⠀payments,⠀a⠀tenant⠀logging⠀repairs,⠀a⠀student⠀recording⠀access⠀attempts,⠀a⠀caretaker⠀noting⠀who⠀visited⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀took.⠀The⠀entry⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀formal⠀journal;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀fragment,⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀recollection⠀attached⠀to⠀one⠀day,⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀reflection⠀on⠀a⠀repeated⠀event.⠀Treat⠀the⠀diary⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀act⠀of⠀private⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀neutral⠀transcript⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀record,⠀skips,⠀repeats,⠀or⠀cannot⠀finish⠀is⠀itself⠀experience,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀writing⠀moment⠀as⠀it⠀happens.\n\nLet⠀the⠀voice⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller:⠀plain,⠀wry,⠀anxious,⠀precise,⠀or⠀digressive⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀is.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀quietness⠀or⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀includes⠀a⠀season,⠀street,⠀food,⠀or⠀holiday,⠀use⠀it⠀because⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀that⠀day,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀small⠀observations:⠀the⠀door⠀logs⠀the⠀character⠀present⠀before⠀they⠀arrive,⠀the⠀vending⠀machine⠀charges⠀more⠀after⠀midnight,⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀greeting⠀changes⠀once⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀late,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀name⠀disappears⠀from⠀the⠀directory.⠀Record⠀these⠀facts⠀without⠀obligatory⠀outrage;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀them⠀as⠀the⠀ordinary⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀damage⠀accumulates⠀through⠀omission⠀and⠀repetition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀concrete⠀at⠀the⠀scale⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀pay,⠀access,⠀or⠀avoid⠀—⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀visible⠀as⠀a⠀light,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀message;⠀a⠀debt⠀appearing⠀as⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀reminder,⠀a⠀changed⠀rate.⠀The⠀diary⠀form⠀lets⠀these⠀details⠀stand⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀whole⠀system.⠀Separate⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀observes⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀infer,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀inference⠀be⠀wrong⠀without⠀correction⠀arriving⠀to⠀tidy⠀it.\n\nThe⠀entry⠀can⠀end⠀wherever⠀the⠀record's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-list,⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀after⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀of⠀what⠀tomorrow⠀will⠀cost⠀—⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀at⠀the⠀close⠀of⠀a⠀day⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀reflection.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀finished⠀arc⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀one⠀community's⠀daily⠀negotiation⠀with⠀cyberpunk⠀systems:⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀adapting⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀surveillance⠀contract,⠀workers⠀sharing⠀one⠀access⠀card,⠀families⠀pooling⠀money⠀for⠀a⠀medical⠀scan,⠀vendors⠀disputing⠀a⠀platform⠀fee,⠀residents⠀organizing⠀around⠀a⠀broken⠀public⠀terminal.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supplies,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀excludes⠀the⠀marvelous,⠀the⠀chronicle⠀stays⠀realist.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀collective⠀without⠀losing⠀individual⠀focus.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀participant,⠀a⠀close⠀observer,⠀or⠀a⠀third-person⠀voice⠀that⠀moves⠀among⠀a⠀few⠀named⠀people;⠀whichever⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀uses,⠀show⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀card,⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀password,⠀who⠀translates⠀the⠀contract,⠀who⠀is⠀recorded⠀without⠀consent.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀in⠀each⠀arrangement.\n\nLet⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerge⠀from⠀particulars:⠀a⠀queue⠀forming⠀before⠀dawn,⠀a⠀fee⠀charged⠀twice,⠀a⠀name⠀entered⠀incorrectly,⠀one⠀neighbor⠀explaining⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀to⠀another.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀register⠀a⠀small⠀victory,⠀a⠀quiet⠀defeat,⠀a⠀rumor,⠀a⠀protest,⠀a⠀funeral,⠀a⠀celebration.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tone⠀unsentimental⠀—⠀people⠀may⠀accept⠀unjust⠀conditions⠀as⠀normal,⠀laugh⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀misfortune,⠀or⠀help⠀one⠀another⠀without⠀becoming⠀heroes;⠀the⠀damage⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀pay,⠀wait⠀for,⠀and⠀explain⠀away.\n\nMake⠀the⠀infrastructure⠀operational⠀and⠀unequal:⠀a⠀drone⠀patrols⠀one⠀street⠀and⠀not⠀another;⠀a⠀credit⠀score⠀shifts⠀after⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀move,⠀a⠀name⠀correction;⠀a⠀clinic⠀moves⠀subscribers⠀ahead.⠀Render⠀these⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀the⠀community's⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀technical⠀exposition,⠀and⠀let⠀different⠀residents⠀understand⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀—⠀what⠀one⠀observes,⠀another⠀infers,⠀another⠀has⠀only⠀been⠀told.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀actual⠀boundary:⠀mid-dispute,⠀mid-day,⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀access⠀becomes⠀clear,⠀or⠀after⠀an⠀interval⠀has⠀been⠀recorded.⠀Open⠀and⠀partial⠀endings⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀form;⠀no⠀completed⠀uprising,⠀redemption,⠀or⠀moral⠀summary⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀already⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment⠀—⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀door⠀to⠀unlock,⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀receiving⠀a⠀message,⠀standing⠀in⠀a⠀queue,⠀watching⠀someone⠀else⠀be⠀denied⠀—⠀and⠀establish⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀time⠀pressure,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀within⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀sentences.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀lobby,⠀terminal⠀to⠀counter,⠀private⠀room⠀to⠀monitored⠀corridor,⠀mark⠀the⠀transition⠀with⠀one⠀clear⠀physical⠀detail.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀lines⠀visually⠀distinct.⠀Present⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clearly⠀at⠀first⠀appearance⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀platform,⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate,⠀a⠀corporate⠀rank,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀nickname,⠀a⠀carried⠀device⠀—⠀without⠀pausing⠀for⠀a⠀lecture;⠀let⠀the⠀mechanic⠀appear⠀through⠀use⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀scans,⠀pays,⠀waits,⠀is⠀rejected,⠀or⠀watches⠀the⠀system⠀record⠀them.\n\nLet⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀exposure.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀line,⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀denial,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀give⠀the⠀character⠀one⠀clean⠀private⠀response⠀—⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀recognition⠀—⠀that⠀the⠀surrounding⠀dialogue⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀voice.⠀The⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀owner:⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀as⠀that⠀character⠀is.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀an⠀unjust⠀condition⠀as⠀normal,⠀notice⠀a⠀detail⠀without⠀outrage,⠀or⠀feel⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀announcing⠀it;⠀keep⠀the⠀beat⠀unsentimental,⠀neither⠀inflating⠀it⠀into⠀melodrama⠀nor⠀defusing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀joke.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀systems⠀operational⠀so⠀choices⠀stay⠀real⠀but⠀constrained:⠀a⠀door⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀a⠀balance⠀changes,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀repeats⠀policy⠀as⠀comfort.⠀Pay,⠀wait,⠀lie,⠀ask,⠀refuse,⠀comply⠀—⠀each⠀option⠀shows⠀its⠀visible⠀cost.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀wherever⠀it⠀falls⠀—⠀after⠀an⠀acted⠀choice,⠀on⠀something⠀just⠀learned,⠀mid-action⠀or⠀mid-thought⠀when⠀the⠀cut⠀is⠀clean.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀task⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sustained⠀attention⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀images⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀dystopian⠀scenery.⠀Let⠀a⠀single⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀system's⠀presence:⠀a⠀repaired⠀hand⠀that⠀now⠀belongs⠀partly⠀to⠀a⠀lender,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀paid⠀face,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀displays⠀the⠀street⠀as⠀a⠀pricing⠀surface.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀image⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀slow⠀around⠀that⠀recognition.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀move⠀associatively,⠀but⠀every⠀association⠀must⠀stay⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀see,⠀remember,⠀or⠀fear⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀as⠀the⠀counterweight⠀to⠀lyric⠀expansion.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀should⠀be⠀stated⠀directly:⠀the⠀refund⠀denied,⠀the⠀name⠀misspelled⠀on⠀a⠀contract,⠀the⠀chair⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀waiting⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀figurative⠀language⠀soften⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀exclusion⠀or⠀convert⠀an⠀institution's⠀routine⠀cruelty⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀mood.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfolds,⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀social⠀relation⠀more⠀particular,⠀not⠀more⠀vague.⠀Let⠀rhythm⠀and⠀repeated⠀sound⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀material:⠀the⠀repeated⠀check⠀of⠀a⠀balance,⠀the⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀verification⠀code,⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀routed⠀to⠀an⠀automated⠀queue.⠀The⠀underlying⠀event⠀remains⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀acting⠀or⠀being⠀acted⠀upon.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀cast's⠀speech,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀contrast⠀into⠀every⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀attends⠀to⠀the⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀can⠀reveal⠀who⠀has⠀leisure⠀to⠀notice⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀answer⠀immediately;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀also⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀narration⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀it.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀shaped⠀and⠀associative,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀contract.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀that⠀attention,⠀with⠀the⠀system⠀still⠀running⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀decision⠀not⠀yet⠀made.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀whose⠀difference⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀is⠀materially⠀legible:⠀the⠀clinic⠀that⠀once⠀accepted⠀a⠀paper⠀card,⠀the⠀corner⠀where⠀a⠀friend⠀could⠀wait⠀without⠀being⠀scanned,⠀the⠀job⠀that⠀ended⠀when⠀a⠀software⠀update⠀reassigned⠀the⠀shifts.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀these⠀things⠀without⠀declaring⠀the⠀past⠀innocent⠀or⠀the⠀present⠀uniquely⠀fallen.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀the⠀exact⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀could⠀enter,⠀who⠀was⠀charged,⠀who⠀was⠀seen,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀accepted⠀as⠀normal⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀to⠀keep⠀longing⠀from⠀becoming⠀self-decoration.⠀A⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀same⠀person⠀later⠀sold⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀data.⠀A⠀familiar⠀place⠀can⠀remain⠀familiar⠀while⠀its⠀door⠀now⠀opens⠀for⠀a⠀subscription⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀afford.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀detail,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀lament⠀about⠀technology⠀or⠀time.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀may⠀remain⠀pleasure;⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀working⠀elevator,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀without⠀a⠀fee⠀can⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀immediately⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀loss.\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀one⠀share⠀a⠀concrete⠀point⠀of⠀contact:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀recurring⠀bureaucratic⠀step,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀view.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀them⠀through⠀association,⠀direct⠀recollection,⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀perception⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀memory.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀what⠀prompts⠀the⠀movement⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀comparison⠀reveals.⠀Private⠀reflection⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀experience⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀other⠀minds.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀reflection⠀is⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀system⠀continuing⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀lesson⠀required;⠀it⠀may⠀also⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀settled⠀recognition⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀actually⠀produced⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWork⠀in⠀the⠀urban⠀social-realist⠀mode:⠀the⠀story's⠀pressure⠀lives⠀in⠀particular⠀rooms,⠀queues,⠀workplaces,⠀transit⠀routes,⠀and⠀transactions⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀exoticized⠀atmosphere.⠀Build⠀a⠀scene⠀from⠀a⠀telling⠀detail⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀exchange:⠀a⠀water⠀meter⠀that⠀bills⠀by⠀facial⠀recognition,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀remote⠀lock,⠀a⠀clinic⠀that⠀triages⠀by⠀credit⠀tier,⠀a⠀street⠀vendor⠀who⠀must⠀rent⠀a⠀permit⠀from⠀a⠀platform.⠀Let⠀the⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀system's⠀reach⠀through⠀its⠀ordinary⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀spectacle.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting's⠀actual⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament⠀or⠀import⠀religious,⠀mystical,⠀or⠀honor-code⠀material⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀establish.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀method⠀of⠀exposure⠀through⠀accepted⠀norms.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀surveillance⠀checkpoint⠀as⠀routine,⠀a⠀child⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀which⠀doors⠀open⠀for⠀which⠀faces,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀fine⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀weather.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀let⠀these⠀acceptances⠀reveal⠀the⠀institution's⠀reach⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning:⠀a⠀name⠀mispronounced⠀by⠀a⠀municipal⠀kiosk,⠀a⠀family⠀photograph⠀rejected⠀by⠀a⠀verification⠀system,⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀moves⠀only⠀for⠀subscribers.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀position⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀accepts,⠀questions,⠀or⠀avoids,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀account⠀remains⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀indictment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀continuous⠀and⠀scene-based,⠀with⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀moving⠀naturally.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀should⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete⠀and⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀an⠀indictment.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀absurd⠀bureaucratic⠀logic,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀situation,⠀not⠀from⠀mockery⠀of⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀still⠀pending⠀and⠀the⠀system's⠀ordinary⠀pressure⠀unchanged.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀one⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀piece⠀of⠀work.⠀A⠀single⠀detail⠀can⠀establish⠀the⠀setting,⠀the⠀power⠀relation,⠀and⠀the⠀cost:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀reads⠀a⠀palm⠀and⠀deducts⠀before⠀it⠀opens,⠀a⠀chair⠀bolted⠀to⠀the⠀floor⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀receipt⠀printed⠀with⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀narrator's⠀data⠀was⠀sold.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀detail⠀where⠀the⠀first⠀already⠀carries⠀the⠀inference.⠀Direct⠀clauses⠀should⠀state⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀without⠀rhetorical⠀inflation.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀style⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀a⠀necessary⠀connection⠀that⠀shorter⠀clauses⠀would⠀leave⠀unclear.\n\nOmit⠀explanation⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀remaining⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀causal⠀relation⠀inferable.⠀If⠀a⠀character