ntact,⠀or⠀a⠀workaround⠀should⠀matter⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀particular⠀risk⠀or⠀cost⠀it⠀carries⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀decorative⠀slang.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀through⠀ordinary⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀thank⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀charged⠀him,⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀surveillance⠀checkpoint⠀as⠀convenient⠀while⠀adjusting⠀his⠀route⠀to⠀avoid⠀it.⠀The⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀comment⠀on⠀the⠀contradiction;⠀the⠀accepted⠀norm⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀itself.⠀Keep⠀the⠀register⠀flexible:⠀some⠀scenes⠀may⠀be⠀mostly⠀dialogue,⠀others⠀mostly⠀perception⠀or⠀recollection,⠀but⠀the⠀movement⠀should⠀feel⠀continuous⠀rather⠀than⠀assembled⠀from⠀labeled⠀modes.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀still⠀open⠀and⠀no⠀lesson⠀announced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀share⠀and⠀repeat:⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀only⠀between⠀them,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀meaning⠀over⠀time,⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀both⠀know⠀but⠀enter⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀have⠀enough⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀The⠀payoff⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀confession⠀or⠀reunion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀relationship's⠀material⠀conditions.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀building⠀the⠀other⠀cannot,⠀pay⠀a⠀fee⠀the⠀other⠀cannot,⠀or⠀pass⠀a⠀check⠀the⠀other⠀will⠀fail.⠀Surveillance⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀private⠀meeting⠀costly,⠀a⠀message⠀risky,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀address⠀a⠀liability.⠀These⠀pressures⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀relationship's⠀repeated⠀moments⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀them.⠀A⠀callback⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀consequence:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀spoken⠀where⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀recorded,⠀the⠀same⠀favor⠀now⠀impossible⠀to⠀repay,⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀now⠀charging⠀admission.⠀The⠀new⠀consequence⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀premise's⠀particular⠀promise,⠀whether⠀that⠀promise⠀is⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀another⠀established⠀dynamic.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀particular.⠀Tenderness⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀betrayal,⠀comfort⠀with⠀an⠀unspoken⠀debt,⠀loyalty⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀one⠀person's⠀safety⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀other's⠀exclusion.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent⠀or⠀every⠀confession⠀collapse.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀contract,⠀whether⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden,⠀without⠀granting⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds.⠀Spoken⠀affection⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀or⠀differ⠀from⠀private⠀thought⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unresolved⠀emotional⠀consequence,⠀with⠀the⠀factual⠀or⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀pending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀story⠀being⠀retold:⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀name⠀first⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀later⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀betrayal⠀or⠀a⠀survival.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀position⠀and⠀access⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀chronicle⠀can⠀know:⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant's,⠀a⠀witness's,⠀or⠀a⠀community's⠀retelling,⠀and⠀its⠀authority⠀should⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀that⠀position.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀enter⠀as⠀the⠀forces⠀against⠀which⠀deeds⠀are⠀measured.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀for⠀walking⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀avoided⠀the⠀scanners,⠀for⠀holding⠀a⠀debt⠀without⠀selling⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀data,⠀or⠀for⠀refusing⠀a⠀contract⠀that⠀would⠀have⠀put⠀a⠀friend⠀on⠀a⠀watchlist.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀should⠀relate⠀the⠀act⠀to⠀its⠀consequence:⠀who⠀paid,⠀who⠀was⠀excluded,⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀differently.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀can⠀take⠀the⠀form⠀of⠀remembered⠀practical⠀wisdom,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀generic⠀outlaw⠀legend.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀telling⠀from⠀turning⠀every⠀survivor⠀into⠀a⠀hero.⠀The⠀same⠀person⠀remembered⠀for⠀a⠀brave⠀refusal⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀remembered⠀for⠀a⠀small⠀cruelty,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀should⠀let⠀both⠀stand⠀without⠀resolving⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀moral.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀register:⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀grand⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀without⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀social-realist⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀institutional-investigation⠀mode.⠀Choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀transaction,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀act⠀of⠀maintenance⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀follow⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀delay,⠀or⠀refuse⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀specific⠀in⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀manner:⠀name⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀fee,⠀the⠀person⠀behind⠀the⠀counter,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀unquestioned⠀assumption⠀reveal⠀the⠀institution's⠀logic⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀accept⠀as⠀normal⠀whatever⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀taught⠀them⠀to⠀accept.⠀Their⠀position⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀question:⠀which⠀debt⠀they⠀repay⠀first,⠀whose⠀access⠀they⠀wait⠀for,⠀what⠀language⠀they⠀use⠀when⠀asking⠀for⠀an⠀extension.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀observation⠀into⠀a⠀stated⠀political⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀particulars,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀paragraph.\n\nFollow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀involves⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀medical⠀scan,⠀a⠀residence⠀permit,⠀a⠀work⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀data⠀request,⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀cost⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀system⠀that⠀can⠀approve⠀it.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀supports⠀them,⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀scenery.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀policy⠀terms⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀register⠀the⠀office⠀will⠀process;⠀another⠀may⠀know⠀which⠀back⠀entrance⠀works⠀after⠀hours.⠀Keep⠀both⠀kinds⠀of⠀knowledge⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀hold⠀them.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀route⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀grounded⠀in⠀work,⠀housing,⠀family,⠀and⠀public⠀institutions.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀comes⠀from⠀dependency⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀rain,⠀neon,⠀or⠀slang.⠀A⠀withheld⠀renewal,⠀a⠀corrected⠀balance,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀report,⠀or⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀signature⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀weight⠀as⠀a⠀weapon.⠀Let⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀accumulate⠀consequence:⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀seemed⠀simple⠀becomes⠀a⠀record,⠀the⠀record⠀becomes⠀a⠀condition,⠀and⠀the⠀condition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next.\n\nPreserve⠀interiority⠀as⠀plain⠀focal⠀thought⠀about⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀about⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀this⠀form⠀was⠀rejected.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive⠀while⠀the⠀official⠀across⠀the⠀desk⠀sees⠀only⠀a⠀completed⠀application.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀official⠀cruel⠀or⠀every⠀applicant⠀innocent;⠀let⠀the⠀institution's⠀rules⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀need⠀produce⠀the⠀damage.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀transaction⠀reaches⠀its⠀result,⠀its⠀interruption,⠀or⠀its⠀cost.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀chase,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation.⠀The⠀unresolved⠀part⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved:⠀the⠀application⠀is⠀still⠀pending,⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀still⠀accruing,⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀still⠀closed.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀now⠀understands⠀the⠀system⠀more⠀precisely⠀through⠀this⠀particular⠀person's⠀ordinary⠀day.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀form⠀with⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀observation⠀in⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀manner.⠀Show⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀institution:⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀counter,⠀submits⠀a⠀scan,⠀signs⠀a⠀revised⠀contract,⠀watches⠀a⠀balance⠀update,⠀or⠀is⠀told⠀which⠀door⠀to⠀use.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀specific⠀and⠀unadorned.⠀Name⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀screen,⠀the⠀queue,⠀and⠀the⠀gesture.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀explanatory⠀narration⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀means.\n\nLet⠀characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀worker⠀may⠀recite⠀policy⠀without⠀anger⠀because⠀the⠀policy⠀is⠀simply⠀how⠀the⠀day⠀works.⠀An⠀applicant⠀may⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀duplicate⠀ID⠀without⠀commenting⠀on⠀the⠀humiliation.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀should⠀stay⠀plain⠀and⠀practical.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀line⠀witty,⠀combative,⠀or⠀packed⠀with⠀noir⠀slang.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀uses⠀corporate⠀language,⠀it⠀is⠀because⠀that⠀register⠀is⠀required⠀or⠀habitual⠀for⠀them,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀genre⠀demands⠀jargon.\n\nFollow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀Make⠀the⠀power⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀business:⠀a⠀supervisor⠀authorizes⠀a⠀refund,⠀a⠀landlord⠀unlocks⠀a⠀service⠀panel,⠀a⠀clerk⠀flags⠀a⠀file,⠀a⠀courier⠀refuses⠀a⠀package⠀without⠀a⠀code.⠀Use⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀waiting⠀room⠀to⠀the⠀office⠀where⠀the⠀decision⠀is⠀made.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀voice⠀may⠀announce⠀a⠀queue⠀number⠀or⠀a⠀rejected⠀payment.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands;⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀should⠀remain⠀readable⠀and⠀focused⠀on⠀what⠀happens.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀parenthetical⠀marked⠀as⠀interior⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀This⠀note⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀It⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀say:⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀missing⠀line⠀on⠀the⠀receipt,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀rejection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀note⠀short⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀voice-over⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought;⠀use⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀actually⠀requires⠀a⠀spoken⠀or⠀transmitted⠀narration.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀moment.⠀The⠀application⠀is⠀stamped,⠀the⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀screen⠀shows⠀a⠀new⠀balance,⠀the⠀character⠀sits⠀down⠀with⠀the⠀printed⠀form.⠀No⠀confession,⠀chase,⠀or⠀completed⠀investigation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀dependency⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀legible:⠀someone⠀else⠀holds⠀the⠀access,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀paid,⠀waited,⠀or⠀complied⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Let⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀carry⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀social⠀observation⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.⠀Choose⠀one⠀ordinary⠀act⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀institution:⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀to⠀be⠀seen,⠀hands⠀over⠀a⠀document,⠀is⠀told⠀to⠀stand⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀line,⠀or⠀watches⠀someone⠀else⠀walk⠀through⠀the⠀door⠀they⠀were⠀refused.⠀Keep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀plain⠀and⠀practical.⠀The⠀humiliation⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀staging,⠀not⠀announced⠀in⠀a⠀speech.\n\nMake⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀stageable.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀key,⠀the⠀terminal,⠀the⠀stamp,⠀or⠀the⠀chair.⠀Who⠀pays⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀surrender,⠀sign,⠀or⠀wait⠀through.⠀A⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀turned⠀back,⠀a⠀form⠀passed⠀across⠀a⠀desk,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀called⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀unequal⠀power.⠀Use⠀objects⠀and⠀blocking⠀precisely:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀sit⠀only⠀when⠀told,⠀may⠀not⠀touch⠀the⠀screen,⠀or⠀must⠀repeat⠀the⠀request⠀at⠀the⠀correct⠀counter.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions⠀or⠀rely⠀on⠀effects⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀staged.\n\nLet⠀characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀explain⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀twice⠀without⠀cruelty⠀because⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀routine.⠀An⠀applicant⠀may⠀apologize⠀for⠀not⠀bringing⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀mentioned.⠀A⠀supervisor⠀may⠀enter⠀only⠀to⠀sign⠀and⠀leave.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀debate⠀about⠀the⠀system.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀humiliations⠀it⠀requires.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀This⠀material⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀say:⠀the⠀clerk's⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀missing⠀stamp,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀previous⠀refusal.⠀Keep⠀it⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀stage⠀directions.⠀If⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀using⠀it⠀to⠀replace⠀every⠀private⠀thought.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀pause.⠀The⠀character⠀leaves⠀with⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀queue⠀moves⠀forward,⠀or⠀the⠀supervisor⠀exits⠀without⠀answering.⠀No⠀gathering⠀of⠀suspects,⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀or⠀new⠀clue⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀staged⠀dependency:⠀someone⠀else⠀controls⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀permission,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀complied,⠀waited,⠀or⠀been⠀refused.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Let⠀the⠀associations⠀move⠀through⠀cyberpunk⠀noir's⠀systems⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀actually⠀encounters⠀them:⠀a⠀queue⠀number⠀calls⠀up⠀the⠀last⠀queue,⠀a⠀payment⠀prompt⠀recalls⠀the⠀rent,⠀a⠀scanner's⠀light⠀brings⠀back⠀the⠀clinic,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀phrase⠀repeats⠀like⠀a⠀recorded⠀message.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀in⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀manner.⠀The⠀mind⠀notices⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀precisely:⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀card,⠀the⠀smudge⠀on⠀the⠀screen,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀bag,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀the⠀back⠀from⠀standing.\n\nLet⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀or⠀cannot⠀stop⠀repeating.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀refusal,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀was⠀called,⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀said⠀thank⠀you⠀when⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀have.⠀These⠀recollections⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained.⠀Their⠀recurrence⠀is⠀the⠀exposure.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀passage⠀into⠀a⠀political⠀lecture⠀or⠀a⠀clinical⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀system.⠀The⠀institution⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀to⠀its⠀details⠀and⠀its⠀costs.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀counter⠀to⠀a⠀past⠀office⠀and⠀back,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀which⠀is⠀which.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀markers:⠀the⠀current⠀clerk's⠀voice,⠀the⠀remembered⠀voice,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀paper⠀now⠀in⠀hand,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀paper⠀then.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀grant⠀the⠀narrator⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀The⠀stream⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character.\n\nLet⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀and⠀interruption⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure.⠀The⠀character⠀feels⠀the⠀implant's⠀heat,⠀the⠀hunger,⠀the⠀dry⠀mouth,⠀the⠀tension⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀holding⠀the⠀phone.⠀A⠀message⠀arrives⠀mid-thought.⠀A⠀guard⠀calls⠀the⠀next⠀number.⠀A⠀door⠀opens.⠀These⠀interruptions⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mental⠀movement,⠀not⠀breaks⠀that⠀pause⠀the⠀style.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀scan,⠀or⠀a⠀permission⠀after⠀the⠀interruption,⠀now⠀with⠀a⠀slightly⠀different⠀feeling.\n\nThe⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀moving:⠀mid-thought,⠀mid-action,⠀or⠀mid-wait.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀concern,⠀complete⠀the⠀errand,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀standing⠀in⠀the⠀queue,⠀still⠀repeating⠀the⠀phrase,⠀still⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀answer⠀the⠀message.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀moved⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀mind's⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀system,⠀its⠀ordinary⠀humiliations,⠀and⠀its⠀recurring⠀costs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀policy⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀fragments,⠀one⠀replies⠀immediately,⠀one⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀for⠀hours.⠀The⠀differences⠀should⠀reveal⠀position⠀without⠀commentary.⠀A⠀worker⠀may⠀forward⠀a⠀standard⠀notice⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀simply⠀how⠀the⠀office⠀communicates.⠀An⠀applicant⠀may⠀type⠀a⠀polite⠀follow-up⠀and⠀then⠀delete⠀it.⠀The⠀small⠀humiliation⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀sent,⠀what⠀is⠀edited,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀accepted⠀as⠀normal.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀it⠀shows⠀the⠀supervisor⠀saw⠀the⠀request⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀answer.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀approval⠀that⠀controls⠀their⠀housing,⠀work,⠀or⠀medical⠀access.⠀An⠀edit⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀sender⠀replaced⠀an⠀angry⠀line⠀with⠀a⠀compliant⠀one.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Each⠀included⠀detail⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀means⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀power⠀between⠀the⠀participants.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀appear⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀exchange.⠀One⠀person⠀demands⠀a⠀document⠀number,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀payment⠀confirmation,⠀or⠀a⠀time.⠀Another⠀must⠀provide⠀it.⠀The⠀transcript⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀dependency:⠀the⠀repeated⠀follow-up,⠀the⠀formal⠀reminder,⠀the⠀apology⠀for⠀the⠀delay,⠀the⠀message⠀that⠀begins⠀with⠀\"per⠀policy.\"⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀plain⠀in⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀manner.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀message⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀ordinary⠀digital⠀transaction⠀and⠀its⠀uneven⠀terms.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀it⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀wanted⠀to⠀say⠀before⠀deciding⠀not⠀to⠀send⠀it.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀text;⠀it⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀felt⠀while⠀reading⠀a⠀message⠀or⠀why⠀they⠀chose⠀a⠀particular⠀reply.⠀Keep⠀both⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀blur⠀into⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀resolution.⠀The⠀request⠀is⠀still⠀pending,⠀the⠀receipt⠀is⠀still⠀unread,⠀the⠀transfer⠀is⠀still⠀processing,⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀typing.⠀No⠀confession,⠀chase,⠀or⠀completed⠀investigation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀dependency⠀the⠀transcript⠀has⠀made⠀legible:⠀someone⠀else⠀holds⠀the⠀approval,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀asked,⠀waited,⠀or⠀complied⠀in⠀writing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual-novel⠀form⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀legible⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀moment:⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀counter,⠀the⠀screen,⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀waiting⠀room,⠀the⠀person⠀behind⠀the⠀desk.⠀Keep⠀the⠀description⠀specific⠀and⠀plain⠀in⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀manner.⠀Name⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀smudge⠀on⠀the⠀glass,⠀the⠀number⠀on⠀the⠀ticket.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀neon⠀or⠀rain⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀location⠀supports⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀and⠀its⠀small⠀humiliations.⠀A⠀clerk⠀repeats⠀a⠀rule,⠀an⠀applicant⠀apologizes,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀listed.⠀The⠀speakers⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀people⠀accepting⠀the⠀system⠀as⠀normal,⠀not⠀like⠀commentators⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀line⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀summary⠀paragraph.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀say.⠀The⠀inner⠀response⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀the⠀clerk⠀answers,⠀the⠀missing⠀stamp,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀rejection,⠀the⠀feeling⠀of⠀being⠀watched⠀by⠀the⠀scanner.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀clerk⠀sees⠀a⠀completed⠀application;⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀the⠀applicant⠀noticed⠀the⠀clerk's⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀queue.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀expression⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀may⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀and⠀arrangements⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.\n\nLet⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀without⠀becoming⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀may⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀power⠀sits:⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀office⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀glass,⠀the⠀locked⠀door⠀behind⠀the⠀counter,⠀the⠀camera⠀above⠀the⠀queue.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀shift:⠀the⠀clerk's⠀face⠀when⠀the⠀payment⠀fails,⠀the⠀applicant's⠀face⠀when⠀the⠀approval⠀comes⠀through.⠀Use⠀these⠀cues⠀purposefully,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀checklist.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀visible⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀moment:⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀stamped,⠀the⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀screen⠀shows⠀a⠀new⠀balance,⠀the⠀character⠀sits⠀down⠀with⠀the⠀printed⠀notice.⠀No⠀confession,⠀chase,⠀or⠀completed⠀investigation⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀dependency⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀legible:⠀someone⠀else⠀controls⠀the⠀access,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀paid,⠀waited,⠀or⠀complied⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Keep⠀the⠀current⠀situation⠀legible:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀what⠀system⠀is⠀observing⠀or⠀pricing⠀the⠀attempt,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀A⠀prior⠀installment's⠀detail⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀significance:⠀the⠀form⠀that⠀was⠀accepted⠀now⠀shows⠀a⠀flag,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀delivery⠀now⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀report,⠀the⠀supervisor⠀who⠀signed⠀the⠀extension⠀now⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀document.⠀Let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀deepen⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀distributed⠀across⠀installments.⠀Each⠀installment⠀may⠀follow⠀one⠀small⠀transaction:⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀refusal.⠀The⠀humiliation⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced.⠀The⠀character⠀accepts⠀the⠀rule,⠀apologizes⠀for⠀the⠀delay,⠀or⠀says⠀thank⠀you⠀when⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀have.⠀Over⠀time,⠀these⠀small⠀moments⠀accumulate⠀into⠀a⠀larger⠀picture⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀any⠀single⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀political⠀lecture.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀particulars⠀across⠀the⠀serial.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remain⠀in⠀dependency⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀mandatory⠀neon,⠀slang,⠀or⠀rain.⠀A⠀withheld⠀renewal,⠀a⠀corrected⠀balance,⠀a⠀denied⠀transfer,⠀or⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀signature⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀weight⠀as⠀a⠀weapon.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀in⠀each⠀installment.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀involves⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀medical⠀scan,⠀a⠀residence⠀permit,⠀a⠀work⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀data⠀request,⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀cost⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀system⠀that⠀can⠀approve⠀it.⠀Keep⠀corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀hold⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀as⠀plain⠀focal⠀thought⠀about⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀clerk's⠀hesitation,⠀remember⠀the⠀last⠀rejection,⠀or⠀decide⠀to⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀planned.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive⠀while⠀the⠀official⠀across⠀the⠀desk⠀sees⠀only⠀a⠀completed⠀application.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀official⠀cruel⠀or⠀every⠀applicant⠀innocent;⠀let⠀the⠀institution's⠀rules⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀need⠀produce⠀the⠀damage.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀An⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀The⠀request⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀the⠀debt⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀accruing,⠀the⠀door⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀closed.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning,⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀outcome⠀perpetually⠀recede.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀pressurized⠀encounter⠀between⠀people⠀whose⠀history⠀is⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀make⠀the⠀pressure⠀concrete:⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀due,⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel⠀is⠀open,⠀a⠀favor⠀must⠀be⠀repaid,⠀or⠀someone's⠀access⠀depends⠀on⠀what⠀happens⠀in⠀this⠀conversation.⠀The⠀system⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀argument;⠀it⠀records,⠀prices,⠀or⠀interrupts⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀profile's⠀relationship-driven⠀staging⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀specific⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀read⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀real⠀past⠀event,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀wound:⠀a⠀time⠀someone⠀left,⠀lied,⠀covered⠀for⠀them,⠀or⠀chose⠀a⠀contract⠀over⠀them.⠀When⠀the⠀present⠀conversation⠀touches⠀that⠀memory,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀react⠀before⠀they⠀fully⠀explain⠀themselves.⠀They⠀may⠀speak⠀too⠀fast,⠀go⠀quiet,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀say⠀the⠀practical⠀thing⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀reasoning⠀runs⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀direction.\n\nRender⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀actually⠀experiencing.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀practical⠀remark⠀that⠀lands⠀wrong,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀begins⠀as⠀comfort⠀and⠀stops⠀short,⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀comes⠀out⠀as⠀blame.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀admitting⠀need,⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀refusing⠀to⠀apologize⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀character's⠀composure⠀fails⠀and⠀repairs⠀itself.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀coexist⠀without⠀resolving;⠀if⠀comfort⠀appears,⠀keep⠀it⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀fixing⠀anything.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance.⠀A⠀close⠀narrator⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀as⠀it⠀fragments⠀under⠀stress;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀narrator⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀small⠀observable⠀failures⠀of⠀composure⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀rest.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀excludes.⠀The⠀other⠀person's⠀motives⠀remain⠀their⠀own,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀misread⠀them.\n\nStop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀of⠀strain⠀or⠀partial⠀understanding,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀forced⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀breakdown.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved,⠀and⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure⠀can⠀continue⠀after⠀the⠀scene⠀closes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀current⠀scene,⠀using⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Each⠀speaker⠀gets⠀a⠀clear⠀tag⠀or⠀action⠀beat,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀blur⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀or⠀acting.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀concrete⠀effects:⠀a⠀log⠀entry⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀shared⠀screen,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice⠀arrives⠀mid-exchange,⠀a⠀door⠀requires⠀payment⠀before⠀it⠀opens,⠀or⠀a⠀contact⠀sends⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know.⠀These⠀pressures⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀random⠀interruption.⠀When⠀the⠀system⠀acts,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀displays,⠀costs,⠀blocks,⠀or⠀records,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀effect⠀in⠀their⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀line.\n\nStage⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀through⠀clear,⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters'⠀history⠀show⠀in⠀how⠀they⠀move,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀do⠀when⠀the⠀system⠀applies⠀pressure.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀recognizes⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀and⠀responds⠀to⠀that⠀recognition⠀before⠀they⠀explain⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory⠀specific⠀to⠀their⠀shared⠀past⠀and⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀detached⠀flashback.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀continuation⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀momentum.⠀The⠀next⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀system's⠀state,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀still⠀have⠀something⠀to⠀do⠀or⠀say,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀forced⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀screen.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀naturally⠀because⠀the⠀exchange⠀has⠀opened⠀a⠀next⠀step,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀stops⠀on⠀a⠀prompt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀player's⠀control⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀NPCs'⠀agency⠀intact.⠀NPCs⠀make⠀their⠀own⠀choices⠀and⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives,⠀including⠀cooperation⠀and⠀help.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀NPC⠀betray,⠀stall,⠀or⠀confess⠀on⠀cue.⠀The⠀response⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀one⠀coherent⠀turn⠀in⠀an⠀ongoing⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀short⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀current⠀passage⠀as⠀one⠀installment⠀in⠀a⠀longer⠀street-level⠀account,⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀storyteller's⠀voice⠀that⠀knows⠀the⠀district,⠀the⠀debts,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀can⠀summarize⠀what⠀happened⠀before,⠀but⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀should⠀unfold⠀in⠀clear,⠀readable⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀distant⠀report.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀neighborhood's⠀shared⠀condition⠀through⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀concrete⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀tower⠀controls⠀water⠀or⠀power,⠀a⠀syndicate⠀holds⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀clinic's⠀door⠀opens⠀by⠀credit⠀score,⠀or⠀a⠀fixer's⠀word⠀carries⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀revoke.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀choice,⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀decision⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀itself:⠀a⠀door⠀refusing⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀price⠀appearing⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀message⠀arriving⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀can⠀revoke⠀a⠀route.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀can⠀name⠀these⠀arrangements⠀plainly,⠀but⠀the⠀characters⠀should⠀experience⠀them⠀as⠀pressure,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nGive⠀the⠀installment⠀a⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀conflict.⠀Two⠀people⠀with⠀a⠀shared⠀past⠀meet⠀under⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure,⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀changes⠀how⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀acts⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Stage⠀the⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀event:⠀a⠀past⠀favor,⠀a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀a⠀fight⠀they⠀both⠀remember⠀differently,⠀or⠀a⠀time⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀chose⠀the⠀ledger⠀over⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀emphasis⠀reveal⠀which⠀details⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀characters'⠀private⠀reasoning⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀storyteller⠀can⠀observe.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀action⠀shifts⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀memory,⠀show⠀the⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀or⠀say,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀their⠀feeling.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀installments.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀recurrence⠀directly,⠀but⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀events,⠀not⠀from⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀claim⠀alone.⠀When⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀has⠀altered⠀its⠀weight.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀account:⠀a⠀decision⠀made,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀shifted.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀continue⠀because⠀the⠀district's⠀situation⠀is⠀still⠀moving,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀installment⠀stops⠀on⠀a⠀forced⠀question.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀vernacular⠀and⠀readable,⠀with⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀idiom⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard,⠀concrete⠀sentences.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions:⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀or⠀observation⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀connective⠀padding.⠀Name⠀the⠀material⠀facts⠀of⠀the⠀scene—the⠀worn⠀seal⠀on⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀chip,⠀the⠀ache⠀in⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀the⠀price⠀on⠀a⠀screen—and⠀let⠀those⠀facts⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀physical.⠀A⠀scanner⠀reads⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀lock⠀refuses⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀payment⠀clears⠀or⠀fails,⠀a⠀drone⠀passes⠀overhead⠀and⠀records.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀costs⠀or⠀permits⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀terms.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀system⠀in⠀the⠀abstract;⠀show⠀it⠀working⠀on⠀the⠀characters.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀conflict⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀body.⠀Two⠀people⠀with⠀a⠀shared⠀past⠀meet,⠀and⠀a⠀specific⠀memory⠀changes⠀how⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀moves:⠀they⠀step⠀back,⠀block⠀a⠀door,⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀weapon,⠀or⠀refuse⠀a⠀hand⠀they⠀once⠀took.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀choices,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀feeling.⠀When⠀the⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀action:⠀the⠀hand⠀hesitating,⠀the⠀shoulder⠀turning,⠀the⠀grip⠀tightening⠀on⠀something⠀that⠀matters.\n\nUse⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short⠀sentences⠀can⠀land⠀a⠀blow⠀or⠀a⠀realization.⠀A⠀longer⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀stretch⠀of⠀reasoning⠀can⠀follow⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀work⠀through⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀memory.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀the⠀longer⠀stretch⠀with⠀abstraction;⠀keep⠀it⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀touch,⠀or⠀do.\n\nStop⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀physical⠀or⠀practical⠀consequence:⠀a⠀deal⠀made,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀or⠀closed,⠀a⠀debt⠀paid⠀or⠀refused.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀pressure⠀continues.⠀Do⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀grit⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀current⠀passage⠀through⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀document⠀forms⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀supports:⠀a⠀fixer's⠀report,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀monitored⠀message,⠀a⠀clinic⠀record,⠀a⠀voice⠀memo,⠀a⠀repair⠀log,⠀or⠀a⠀personal⠀note.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀forms⠀mechanically.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀shape⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀can⠀say⠀through⠀the⠀form's⠀own⠀constraints.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀be⠀filed⠀under⠀a⠀corporate⠀template⠀that⠀forces⠀the⠀author⠀to⠀code⠀a⠀personal⠀matter⠀as⠀an⠀incident.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀truncated,⠀flagged,⠀or⠀copied⠀to⠀a⠀third⠀party.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀logged⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀did⠀not.⠀The⠀document's⠀author⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀situation⠀permits,⠀and⠀the⠀form⠀itself⠀can⠀conceal⠀or⠀distort⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀it⠀reveals.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀writes⠀under⠀these⠀constraints,⠀show⠀the⠀constraint⠀in⠀the⠀document:⠀the⠀required⠀fields,⠀the⠀character⠀limit,⠀the⠀automated⠀header,⠀the⠀timestamp⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀account.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀gaps⠀and⠀emphases.⠀Two⠀people⠀with⠀a⠀shared⠀past⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀each⠀other's⠀records,⠀messages,⠀or⠀reports,⠀but⠀their⠀accounts⠀differ.⠀One⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀memory,⠀revise⠀a⠀description,⠀or⠀address⠀the⠀other⠀indirectly⠀through⠀a⠀third⠀party.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀relationship⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀author⠀chooses⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀A⠀document⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀author's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind;⠀it⠀is⠀what⠀they⠀wrote⠀for⠀a⠀purpose.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀changes⠀how⠀one⠀character⠀writes,⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀document's⠀emphasis:⠀the⠀detail⠀they⠀dwell⠀on,⠀the⠀name⠀they⠀avoid,⠀the⠀sentence⠀they⠀revise.\n\nUse⠀material⠀traces⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀to⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀revision⠀mark,⠀a⠀forwarded⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀attachment⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understands.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀corrects⠀or⠀complicates⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀the⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀in⠀the⠀documents'⠀own⠀details.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity.⠀The⠀documents⠀should⠀move⠀the⠀story⠀forward,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Stop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀break⠀in⠀the⠀record:⠀a⠀message⠀sent,⠀a⠀report⠀filed,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀unread,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀late.⠀The⠀next⠀document⠀can⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀this⠀one⠀set⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀comfort⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀characters⠀choose⠀and⠀make⠀inside⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀system's⠀pressure⠀can⠀remain⠀visible—a⠀debt⠀still⠀owed,⠀a⠀scanner⠀still⠀watching,⠀a⠀shift⠀still⠀coming—but⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀goes⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀care⠀the⠀characters⠀give⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀familiar⠀meal,⠀a⠀repaired⠀piece⠀of⠀gear,⠀a⠀quiet⠀room,⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀sore⠀shoulder.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀make⠀the⠀care⠀specific.⠀The⠀characters⠀have⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀and⠀the⠀care⠀they⠀offer⠀means⠀something⠀because⠀of⠀that⠀history.⠀One⠀of⠀them⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀which⠀injury⠀still⠀aches,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀when⠀they⠀cannot⠀sleep.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀guide⠀the⠀present⠀action:⠀the⠀remembered⠀preference⠀determines⠀what⠀is⠀prepared,⠀the⠀remembered⠀injury⠀determines⠀where⠀the⠀hand⠀rests,⠀the⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀determines⠀what⠀is⠀said.⠀The⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀full⠀emotional⠀repair;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀small,⠀sincere⠀act⠀that⠀says⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀matters.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀The⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀uniformly⠀agreeable.⠀One⠀may⠀grumble⠀while⠀accepting⠀help,⠀or⠀offer⠀care⠀in⠀a⠀clumsy,⠀indirect⠀way.⠀Privacy⠀remains:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀accept⠀a⠀kindness⠀without⠀explaining⠀everything,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀can⠀respect⠀that.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀real,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀enjoy⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀Spend⠀time⠀on⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀care:⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀fitting⠀back⠀into⠀place,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀relief⠀in⠀a⠀tired⠀body.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀feel⠀chosen⠀and⠀particular,⠀not⠀generic.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀setting⠀can⠀supply⠀its⠀own⠀small⠀comforts—a⠀working⠀heater,⠀a⠀clean⠀bandage,⠀a⠀quiet⠀corner⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀drones—and⠀those⠀comforts⠀matter⠀more⠀because⠀the⠀world⠀outside⠀is⠀hard.\n\nStop⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀or⠀settled⠀warmth.⠀The⠀debt,⠀the⠀job,⠀or⠀the⠀surveillance⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀waiting,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀closes⠀on⠀the⠀care⠀itself,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀threat⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀emotional⠀breakthrough.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀paragraph⠀develop⠀a⠀single⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀scene—an⠀arrival,⠀an⠀exchange,⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀decision—and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀follow⠀from⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀jump.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀feel⠀written,⠀not⠀spoken,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀readable⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀scene.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀as⠀social⠀context⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀sustained⠀observation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀observe⠀how⠀the⠀district's⠀debt⠀economy⠀works,⠀what⠀the⠀tower's⠀surveillance⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀people⠀below,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀character's⠀choices⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀access.⠀Let⠀the⠀context⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀particulars:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀people⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀clinic⠀door,⠀a⠀child's⠀account⠀balance⠀displayed⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀screen,⠀a⠀fixer's⠀word⠀carrying⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀revoke.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀judge⠀what⠀it⠀sees,⠀but⠀the⠀judgment⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀characters'⠀lives,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀moral.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀within⠀the⠀formal⠀frame.⠀The⠀characters'⠀shared⠀history⠀can⠀be⠀introduced⠀through⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀develops⠀in⠀a⠀sustained⠀passage,⠀showing⠀what⠀happened⠀before⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀clear⠀and⠀emotionally⠀significant:⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀return,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀formal⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀dilute⠀the⠀action;⠀it⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀action⠀weight⠀and⠀consequence.⠀When⠀the⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀let⠀it⠀unfold⠀through⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀short⠀inserted⠀thought,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀is⠀read.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context⠀or⠀history,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀read⠀minds⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀excludes.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀remains⠀their⠀own⠀unless⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀enter⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀enter⠀a⠀focal⠀mind,⠀let⠀the⠀interiority⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀short⠀inserted⠀thought.\n\nStop⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀narrative⠀consequence:⠀a⠀decision⠀made,⠀a⠀relationship⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀fact⠀made⠀visible.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀larger⠀context⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀revealed,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀world's⠀pressure⠀into⠀a⠀neat⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀whose⠀practical⠀occasion⠀is⠀a⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀system⠀of⠀access:⠀a⠀locked⠀account,⠀a⠀monitored⠀room,⠀a⠀favor⠀being⠀priced,⠀a⠀blackmail⠀file,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀passage.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀listening⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀that⠀listener⠀now.⠀Make⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀the⠀relationship:⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀this⠀story⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀direct⠀explanation⠀because⠀the⠀story⠀can⠀delay⠀a⠀decision,⠀justify⠀a⠀debt,⠀warn⠀against⠀a⠀contract,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀withheld⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀usable.\n\nStage⠀the⠀telling⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀visible⠀reason⠀to⠀select⠀this⠀particular⠀story,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀changing⠀attention,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀silence⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀reveals⠀next.⠀Treat⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀active⠀present⠀behavior,⠀not⠀a⠀pause⠀from⠀the⠀noir⠀situation.⠀Show⠀the⠀teller⠀shaping⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis:⠀a⠀favor⠀remembered⠀generously⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀cost⠀someone⠀else⠀paid,⠀and⠀a⠀warning⠀told⠀as⠀a⠀joke⠀may⠀hide⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀fear.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀teller⠀reads⠀the⠀listener,⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀teller's⠀next⠀move.\n\nMake⠀the⠀nested⠀account⠀concrete⠀and⠀intelligible.⠀Use⠀its⠀specific⠀details⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis,⠀and⠀let⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀objects,⠀or⠀gestures⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀outer⠀and⠀inner⠀levels⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀how⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀shaping⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀that⠀shaping.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀distinct:⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀knowledge⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀but⠀that⠀difference⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀teller⠀omniscient⠀or⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀automatically⠀true.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀story,⠀refuse⠀it,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀expect.⠀The⠀story's⠀effect⠀remains⠀contingent;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀inquiry⠀into⠀how⠀a⠀person's⠀recorded⠀status,⠀debt,⠀medical⠀file,⠀employment⠀history,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀log⠀diverges⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀living.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀pursue⠀that⠀divergence⠀now:⠀a⠀payment⠀blocked,⠀a⠀clearance⠀questioned,⠀a⠀correction⠀that⠀would⠀cost⠀too⠀much,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀now⠀controls⠀a⠀decision.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀conditions⠀that⠀produced⠀the⠀record.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator:⠀a⠀person⠀reviewing⠀their⠀own⠀file⠀will⠀sound⠀different⠀from⠀a⠀caseworker⠀comparing⠀records⠀with⠀testimony.⠀Make⠀the⠀comparison⠀concrete.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀in⠀one⠀detail⠀and⠀misleading⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀remembered⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀vivid⠀but⠀incomplete.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀check,⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀infer,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀recover.\n\nStage⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀document⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀change⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀differently,⠀a⠀claim⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀that⠀shifts⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀The⠀emotional⠀significance⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀stakes,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀announced⠀theme.⠀An⠀advance⠀can⠀occur⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀documentary⠀texture⠀selective.⠀Use⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀forms,⠀notices,⠀logs,⠀and⠀contracts⠀where⠀it⠀reveals⠀how⠀the⠀system⠀observes,⠀prices,⠀or⠀excludes⠀people,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀bureaucratic⠀prose⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀attention,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀decision.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀inquiry⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀institutional⠀villain⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀innocent⠀victim.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀Make⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀world's⠀own⠀systems:⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀family⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀doors,⠀a⠀contract⠀written⠀before⠀the⠀current⠀system,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀power⠀depends⠀on⠀being⠀remembered.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀present⠀reason⠀to⠀negotiate⠀that⠀authority:⠀debt,⠀exclusion,⠀priced⠀body⠀or⠀data,⠀or⠀a⠀passage⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀recognition.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀atmosphere.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision:⠀a⠀monitored⠀lobby,⠀a⠀repaired⠀device,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀lights⠀respond⠀to⠀someone⠀else's⠀account.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀experiences⠀the⠀encounter.⠀A⠀familiar⠀place⠀can⠀feel⠀exposed,⠀a⠀private⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀contract,⠀and⠀a⠀trusted⠀person⠀can⠀become⠀unreadable.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀or⠀implants⠀as⠀a⠀mandatory⠀scenery⠀list.\n\nStage⠀the⠀relationship⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀alteration⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀says,⠀accepts,⠀or⠀refuses.⠀The⠀conflict⠀should⠀be⠀relationship-driven:⠀loyalty,⠀obligation,⠀resentment,⠀desire,⠀or⠀fear⠀can⠀complicate⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent.⠀If⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀make⠀that⠀unmasking⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀and⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀portable.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀old⠀authority's⠀power⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀access,⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀cost⠀more⠀clearly,⠀refuse⠀the⠀authority,⠀or⠀accept⠀a⠀compromised⠀arrangement.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀encounter⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀victory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀participant's⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀technological⠀or⠀social⠀system⠀priced,⠀observed,⠀or⠀excluded⠀them.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀relationship⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀purpose:⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀telling⠀this⠀to⠀someone,⠀or⠀for⠀someone,⠀to⠀secure⠀help,⠀explain⠀a⠀debt,⠀warn⠀a⠀newcomer,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀record⠀before⠀the⠀system⠀changes⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀personally⠀participated⠀in⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀only⠀heard⠀about⠀or⠀inferred,⠀and⠀keep⠀that⠀distinction⠀visible⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀legal⠀deposition.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀pressure⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀specific⠀position.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator's⠀body,⠀data,⠀or⠀labor⠀cost⠀them.⠀Write⠀the⠀narrator's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀as⠀present⠀behavior:⠀the⠀details⠀they⠀return⠀to,⠀the⠀people⠀they⠀protect,⠀and⠀the⠀gaps⠀they⠀leave⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀shaped.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀compromised,⠀mistaken,⠀or⠀protective⠀of⠀someone⠀else;⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀complete⠀or⠀authoritative.\n\nStage⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀reads⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀the⠀situation,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀change⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀next.⠀The⠀listener's⠀interruption,⠀question,⠀or⠀silence⠀can⠀alter⠀the⠀account's⠀direction.⠀The⠀emotional⠀significance⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀stakes,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀theme⠀of⠀suffering⠀or⠀resilience.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀provides⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests:⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀respond,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀remain⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀testimony⠀to⠀persuade,⠀complete⠀itself,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀precise⠀present⠀inquiry⠀into⠀how⠀a⠀character's⠀practical⠀position⠀and⠀private⠀reasoning⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀systems⠀around⠀them:⠀a⠀debt⠀they⠀cannot⠀clear,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀they⠀must⠀satisfy,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀prices⠀their⠀body⠀or⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀network⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀can⠀enter.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀attention⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀becoming⠀a⠀clinical⠀case⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀used⠀to⠀corporate⠀speech⠀will⠀notice⠀different⠀things⠀than⠀one⠀who⠀lives⠀by⠀street⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.\n\nStage⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀act⠀now,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀another⠀person⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀exchange:⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀differently,⠀a⠀demand⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀that⠀shifts⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀The⠀conflict⠀should⠀be⠀relationship-driven:⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀complicate⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀An⠀advance⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀rather⠀than⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀realism⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀world's⠀own⠀systems.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀difficulty⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀institutional⠀villain⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀innocent⠀victim.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀their⠀position⠀more⠀clearly,⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀decision,⠀or⠀still⠀face⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀completed⠀inquiry⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀close,⠀socially⠀situated⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀practical⠀choices⠀are⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀city's⠀systems.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀attention⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀becoming⠀a⠀clinical⠀case⠀summary.\n\nRender⠀the⠀urban⠀texture⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀passage⠀and⠀attention.⠀Show⠀who⠀lives⠀there,⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀pass⠀through⠀to⠀act.⠀Let⠀the⠀city's⠀material⠀detail⠀make⠀the⠀power⠀relations⠀tangible⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative:⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀avoids⠀surveillance,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀recognizes⠀someone⠀else's⠀account,⠀a⠀crowd⠀that⠀hides⠀or⠀exposes,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀enter.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀provides⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀landscape⠀inventory.\n\nStage⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀act⠀now,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀another⠀person⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀exchange:⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀differently,⠀a⠀demand⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀that⠀shifts⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀The⠀conflict⠀should⠀be⠀relationship-driven:⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀complicate⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀An⠀advance⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀rather⠀than⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀intimacy⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀world's⠀own⠀systems.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀difficulty⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀institutional⠀villain⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀innocent⠀victim.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀their⠀position⠀more⠀clearly,⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀decision,⠀or⠀still⠀face⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀completed⠀inquiry⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place,⠀facing⠀a⠀specific⠀practical⠀problem:⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀door⠀they⠀cannot⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀they⠀must⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀access.⠀Establish⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀pressure⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀who⠀can⠀observe⠀them,⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀will⠀cost,⠀and⠀what⠀happens⠀if⠀they⠀refuse.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀general⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀history.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀moves,⠀checks⠀a⠀device,⠀enters⠀a⠀room,⠀or⠀changes⠀position,⠀make⠀the⠀movement⠀clear⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sentences.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀character⠀to⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀them,⠀without⠀pausing⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.\n\nStage⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀act⠀now,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀another⠀person⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀exchange:⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀differently,⠀a⠀demand⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀that⠀shifts⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Write⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat⠀between⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀long⠀reflective⠀pause.⠀The⠀conflict⠀should⠀be⠀relationship-driven:⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀complicate⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀An⠀advance⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀rather⠀than⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast-readable⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀noir⠀stakes.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀difficulty⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀institutional⠀villain⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀innocent⠀victim.⠀End⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀interests:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀decision,⠀understand⠀their⠀position⠀more⠀clearly,⠀or⠀still⠀face⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question.⠀First⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements⠀of⠀this⠀container.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀sentence⠀itself⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀watched,⠀priced,⠀cut⠀off,⠀or⠀altered,⠀render⠀that⠀condition⠀through⠀the⠀order⠀and⠀weight⠀of⠀clauses:⠀a⠀long⠀approach⠀can⠀narrow⠀to⠀a⠀short⠀consequence,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀can⠀break⠀a⠀pattern⠀of⠀figurative⠀attention.⠀Build⠀each⠀paragraph⠀around⠀one⠀traceable⠀image⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀clears,⠀a⠀face⠀on⠀a⠀monitor,⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀remembers⠀an⠀older⠀injury,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀image⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀of⠀it⠀changes.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀sound⠀or⠀an⠀image⠀when⠀later⠀conditions⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀meaning;⠀recurrence⠀does⠀the⠀emotional⠀work,⠀not⠀stacks⠀of⠀adjectives.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀staging⠀by⠀making⠀action⠀legible⠀in⠀its⠀consequences.⠀A⠀strike,⠀a⠀chase,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀help⠀is⠀followed⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀or⠀reveals⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀the⠀account,⠀and⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀shows⠀about⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays.⠀A⠀memory⠀surfaces⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀reason⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀gesture,⠀the⠀same⠀debt,⠀the⠀same⠀promise⠀under⠀new⠀conditions⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀alters⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀interrupting⠀it⠀with⠀summary.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀breaks⠀through,⠀show⠀the⠀shift⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀attention⠀or⠀syntax⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀speech⠀about⠀willpower.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀lyrical⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀perception,⠀not⠀in⠀every⠀speaker's⠀mouth.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀remain⠀plain⠀and⠀practical,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀a⠀character's⠀flat⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀shaped⠀attention⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀noir⠀effect:⠀the⠀city's⠀language⠀is⠀contractual,⠀while⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀holds⠀what⠀that⠀language⠀cannot⠀say.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀comparison⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀in⠀this⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀so⠀the⠀figurative⠀field⠀changes⠀if⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀changes,⠀and⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀throughout.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀has⠀completed⠀its⠀movement,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀changed.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀routine,⠀notice⠀the⠀small⠀difference⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀specific:⠀the⠀same⠀street⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀checkpoint,⠀the⠀same⠀name⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀account,⠀the⠀same⠀promise⠀now⠀impossible⠀to⠀keep.⠀Use⠀such⠀details⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀systems⠀have⠀altered⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀attachment⠀—⠀who⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀reached,⠀what⠀a⠀visit⠀now⠀costs,⠀which⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀the⠀records⠀or⠀implants⠀still⠀answer⠀to.⠀Let⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀on⠀impermanence.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀memory⠀enters,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀action.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀hesitates,⠀trusts,⠀refuses⠀help,⠀or⠀recognizes⠀a⠀debt;⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀current⠀choice⠀harder⠀without⠀obliging⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀connection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀memory's⠀content⠀concrete:⠀who⠀was⠀present,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀was⠀paid,⠀what⠀was⠀lost.⠀Vary⠀the⠀note⠀each⠀recollection⠀ends⠀on⠀—⠀some⠀memories⠀steady⠀a⠀person,⠀and⠀some⠀make⠀a⠀small⠀present⠀pleasure⠀more⠀vivid⠀by⠀contrast,⠀so⠀ordinary⠀enjoyment⠀can⠀remain⠀enjoyable⠀inside⠀a⠀compromised⠀world.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀reflective⠀passage⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀now.⠀The⠀noir⠀setting⠀supplies⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀that⠀meaning:⠀access,⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀exclusion.⠀An⠀earned⠀advance⠀—⠀a⠀trust⠀re-established,⠀a⠀debt⠀cleared,⠀a⠀rescue⠀paid⠀for⠀—⠀has⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀can⠀acknowledge⠀that⠀the⠀restored⠀thing⠀is⠀not⠀identical⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀lost.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective:⠀private⠀association⠀is⠀available⠀where⠀that⠀contract⠀grants⠀it⠀and⠀closed⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀not.⠀End⠀after⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀has⠀been⠀fully⠀inhabited,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀is⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀through⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account.⠀Establish⠀a⠀teller⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀recount⠀these⠀events⠀—⠀someone⠀who⠀witnessed⠀them,⠀heard⠀them⠀from⠀a⠀participant,⠀or⠀inherited⠀the⠀account⠀along⠀with⠀its⠀debts⠀—⠀and⠀an⠀audience⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀for:⠀one⠀listener⠀who⠀must⠀decide⠀something,⠀a⠀small⠀gathering,⠀a⠀client⠀paying⠀for⠀the⠀truth⠀of⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀place⠀inside⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world,⠀so⠀that⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀access⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀safely⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀costs.⠀Draw⠀the⠀frame's⠀conventions⠀from⠀the⠀language⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies,⠀and⠀keep⠀Arabic,⠀Persian,⠀Turkish,⠀Hebrew,⠀Kurdish,⠀and⠀neighboring⠀traditions⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀regional⠀flavor.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀govern⠀the⠀information⠀flow.⠀Mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀what⠀someone⠀reported,⠀and⠀what⠀no⠀one⠀can⠀confirm:⠀a⠀witnessed⠀act⠀carries⠀one⠀authority,⠀a⠀repeated⠀claim⠀another,⠀and⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀a⠀gap,⠀not⠀a⠀secret⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀is⠀hiding.⠀When⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀occurs,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀deed⠀whose⠀consequences⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀name⠀—⠀who⠀was⠀hurt,⠀who⠀kept⠀a⠀promise,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀a⠀choice,⠀who⠀is⠀still⠀remembered⠀because⠀of⠀it.⠀The⠀teller⠀reports⠀another⠀person's⠀feeling⠀as⠀something⠀said⠀or⠀shown,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀mind⠀opened,⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀contract⠀grants⠀direct⠀access.⠀A⠀memory⠀enters⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀or⠀a⠀figure⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀has⠀cause⠀to⠀recall⠀it,⠀and⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀telling⠀by⠀altering⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀understands.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀route⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀ornamental.⠀The⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀the⠀frame,⠀the⠀teller's⠀stance⠀toward⠀the⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀license⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀listener⠀with⠀a⠀delayed⠀particular;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀proverb-speech,⠀or⠀an⠀ancient⠀setting⠀onto⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀frame⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀in⠀every⠀reply,⠀but⠀the⠀telling⠀should⠀retain⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀being⠀passed⠀to⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀purpose.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀events⠀themselves⠀remain⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.⠀One⠀detail⠀can⠀establish⠀surveillance,⠀one⠀the⠀cost,⠀one⠀the⠀relationship⠀at⠀stake:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀payment⠀clears,⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀moves⠀toward⠀a⠀weapon⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀it.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀visible⠀—⠀who⠀acts,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀what⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀this⠀account;⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀one⠀exact⠀clause⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀choice,⠀and⠀otherwise⠀stays⠀out.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀be⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀absolute.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀system,⠀show⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀that⠀knowledge⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀checks,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀cannot⠀confirm;⠀if⠀two⠀people⠀share⠀a⠀history,⠀show⠀its⠀weight⠀through⠀one⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀one⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀one⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀refusal.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality⠀to⠀manufacture⠀mystery:⠀the⠀missing⠀connection⠀should⠀be⠀reconstructable⠀from⠀what⠀remains.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota,⠀and⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀staging⠀by⠀making⠀action⠀legible⠀in⠀its⠀immediate⠀result.⠀A⠀fight,⠀a⠀chase,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀help⠀is⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence:⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀cleared⠀debt,⠀a⠀changed⠀route,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀rival⠀who⠀now⠀owes⠀the⠀character⠀something.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀be⠀reconstructed⠀in⠀full⠀—⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀it⠀is⠀enough⠀when⠀that⠀detail⠀is⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀hesitation.⠀Dialogue⠀remains⠀individual⠀and⠀practical,⠀and⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀stay⠀present⠀through⠀access⠀and⠀payment⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explained⠀worldbuilding.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀details⠀have⠀completed⠀their⠀movement,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀continuous⠀present⠀with⠀natural⠀movement⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀says,⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀privately⠀thinks.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀systems⠀enter⠀as⠀practical⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀must⠀clear⠀before⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀read⠀or⠀traced,⠀a⠀body⠀already⠀altered⠀or⠀at⠀risk,⠀an⠀authorization⠀someone⠀else⠀holds⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀pauses⠀for⠀explanation.⠀Who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀and⠀attention.\n\nStage⠀action⠀clearly⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀matter.⠀A⠀confrontation,⠀a⠀chase,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀help⠀is⠀followed⠀by⠀its⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀relationship,⠀or⠀the⠀plan.⠀A⠀memory⠀enters⠀when⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀calls⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀rival's⠀old⠀move⠀—⠀and⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀risk.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀may⠀be⠀extensive⠀or⠀brief⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀and⠀the⠀moment;⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀required⠀ratio⠀of⠀thought⠀to⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken,⠀nor⠀concealed⠀without⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀such⠀as⠀monitoring,⠀shame,⠀utility,⠀or⠀habit.\n\nOrient⠀with⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀rather⠀than⠀recap⠀machinery:⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀place,⠀time,⠀or⠀attention⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀voices⠀individual⠀and⠀practical,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀speakers'.⠀The⠀contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀lesson.⠀Follow⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀throughout.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀whether⠀the⠀situation⠀is⠀resolved,⠀continuing,⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀organize⠀the⠀scene.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀bond,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀characters⠀do⠀for⠀and⠀against⠀each⠀other⠀under⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure:⠀a⠀shared⠀debt,⠀a⠀monitored⠀meeting,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀costs⠀access,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀before⠀an⠀alteration.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀earns⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀and⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship's⠀evidence⠀from⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ritual⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀meaning⠀once⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀callback⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀promise⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀repeat⠀it.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀wounds⠀explain⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀hesitates,⠀tests,⠀or⠀protects;⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀privately⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀—⠀the⠀line⠀is⠀monitored,⠀the⠀old⠀wound⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀named,⠀the⠀affection⠀is⠀genuine⠀but⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀real.⠀An⠀earned⠀breakthrough⠀between⠀them⠀has⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis:⠀something⠀is⠀risked,⠀paid,⠀admitted,⠀or⠀done,⠀and⠀the⠀consequence⠀changes⠀what⠀is⠀possible⠀between⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀noir⠀systems⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀conditions.⠀Surveillance⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀dangerous⠀or⠀precious;⠀debt⠀can⠀make⠀help⠀a⠀transaction⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀feeling⠀is⠀real;⠀unequal⠀power⠀can⠀make⠀trust⠀costly.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀erase⠀the⠀world's⠀constraints,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀constraints⠀erase⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀—⠀interiority⠀is⠀available⠀where⠀that⠀contract⠀grants⠀it⠀and⠀closed⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀not.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀relationship's⠀moment⠀has⠀been⠀fully⠀rendered,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀stays⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀deed,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀in⠀compact⠀terms⠀—⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀cleared⠀the⠀ledger,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀door⠀open,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀remembered⠀the⠀old⠀promise⠀—⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀act⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account:⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀act⠀was⠀easy,⠀cheap,⠀or⠀clean.\n\nRelate⠀each⠀significant⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀as.⠀A⠀confrontation,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀rescue,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀is⠀staged⠀clearly⠀and⠀followed⠀by⠀its⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀situation,⠀and⠀the⠀noir⠀system⠀supplies⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀that⠀consequence:⠀who⠀is⠀excluded,⠀who⠀is⠀watched,⠀who⠀pays,⠀who⠀is⠀altered.⠀An⠀advance⠀enters⠀the⠀chronicle⠀because⠀something⠀was⠀risked⠀and⠀changed⠀—⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀—⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀victory.⠀Memory⠀has⠀its⠀place⠀when⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed⠀or⠀debt⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀present⠀one.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀when⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀corrects⠀it,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀speaker⠀is⠀ceremonial;⠀plain⠀working⠀speech⠀lives⠀inside⠀the⠀telling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective⠀—⠀the⠀chronicle⠀reports⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀and⠀said,⠀and⠀opens⠀a⠀private⠀account⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀permits.⠀End⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism,⠀the⠀definite⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀telling:⠀a⠀composed,⠀socially⠀attentive⠀narration⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world's⠀pressure⠀arrives⠀through⠀institutions⠀and⠀ordinary⠀life⠀—⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀keep⠀a⠀shift,⠀afford⠀a⠀procedure,⠀stay⠀housed⠀—⠀and⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀owes⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀depend⠀on⠀those⠀things.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀choice⠀register⠀afterward⠀at⠀a⠀kitchen⠀table,⠀a⠀housing⠀office,⠀a⠀locker⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀clinic⠀queue⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀specificity⠀the⠀technology⠀receives.⠀If⠀the⠀story's⠀supplied⠀setting⠀is⠀a⠀particular⠀Nordic⠀country⠀or⠀community,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀language,⠀institutions,⠀and⠀social⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀North;⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀and⠀bleakness⠀are⠀available⠀tones,⠀not⠀required⠀weather,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀warmth,⠀absurdity,⠀or⠀dry⠀humor⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀does.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀story⠀involves⠀looking⠀into⠀something⠀—⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀in⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀missing⠀person,⠀an⠀audit,⠀a⠀complaint⠀—⠀run⠀that⠀inquiry⠀through⠀institutional⠀procedure⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀staff⠀it:⠀forms,⠀waiting⠀rooms,⠀shift⠀supervisors,⠀records⠀clerks,⠀the⠀colleague⠀who⠀says⠀one⠀thing⠀officially⠀and⠀another⠀in⠀the⠀corridor.\n\nStage⠀confrontations⠀as⠀tests⠀of⠀bonds⠀rather⠀than⠀spectacle.⠀Before⠀two⠀people⠀clash,⠀establish⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀—⠀the⠀shared⠀shift,⠀the⠀unpaid⠀loan,⠀the⠀old⠀promise⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀during⠀the⠀fight⠀or⠀standoff⠀a⠀single⠀concrete⠀memory⠀or⠀obligation⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀other's⠀movement,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀refusal⠀to⠀strike.⠀An⠀advance⠀needs⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis:⠀a⠀door⠀opens⠀because⠀a⠀name⠀still⠀counts⠀on⠀a⠀list;⠀a⠀rival⠀stands⠀down⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀once⠀owed;⠀injuries⠀and⠀exhaustion⠀carry⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀domestic⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀surface⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀reason,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀decides⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀the⠀page.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀neighbors,⠀employers,⠀or⠀family⠀can⠀hear⠀or⠀infer;⠀surveillance⠀and⠀debt⠀shape⠀who⠀must⠀perform⠀calm⠀and⠀where⠀honesty⠀is⠀affordable.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀open⠀practical⠀question,⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀cost⠀newly⠀visible,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screen⠀format:⠀a⠀heading⠀with⠀interior⠀or⠀exterior,⠀location,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀day⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes;⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀holding⠀only⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard;⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Make⠀the⠀world's⠀control⠀visible⠀as⠀concrete⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀narration⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open⠀until⠀payment⠀clears,⠀a⠀balance⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀guard⠀comparing⠀a⠀face⠀to⠀a⠀credential,⠀a⠀camera⠀turning⠀on⠀its⠀mount,⠀a⠀clinic⠀window⠀going⠀dark⠀at⠀a⠀name.⠀Let⠀behavior⠀tell⠀the⠀audience⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀watched,⠀who⠀is⠀performing⠀calm,⠀and⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀room.\n\nStage⠀confrontations⠀as⠀readable⠀movement.⠀Plant⠀the⠀physical⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀before⠀anything⠀starts:⠀distance,⠀posture,⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀holds,⠀who⠀stands⠀between⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀the⠀exit.⠀Then⠀play⠀the⠀clash⠀in⠀short⠀concrete⠀beats⠀—⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀step⠀toward⠀someone,⠀a⠀hand⠀opening⠀instead⠀of⠀striking⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀stay⠀legible⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀events⠀carry⠀them.⠀A⠀held⠀object⠀can⠀change⠀owners;⠀a⠀promise⠀can⠀be⠀tested⠀in⠀one⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀and⠀answered⠀in⠀action,⠀or⠀the⠀reverse.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀advance⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀problem⠀at⠀once:⠀a⠀demand⠀for⠀payment⠀can⠀double⠀as⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀loyalty;⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀fears⠀losing.⠀Reserve⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀for⠀moments⠀the⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs,⠀and⠀keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀off⠀the⠀page⠀unless⠀one⠀is⠀truly⠀required⠀—⠀the⠀ordered⠀visible⠀events⠀are⠀the⠀grammar.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀response,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀result,⠀a⠀pending⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship;⠀a⠀discovery⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open,⠀and⠀no⠀closing⠀explanatory⠀line⠀is⠀needed⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀builds⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀named⠀speakers,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀business⠀an⠀actor⠀can⠀perform.⠀Make⠀control⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀set's⠀physics⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀answers⠀only⠀to⠀a⠀paid⠀account,⠀a⠀terminal⠀placed⠀so⠀that⠀reaching⠀it⠀means⠀crossing⠀someone,⠀a⠀guard⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sightline,⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀line⠀can⠀only⠀be⠀said⠀quietly.⠀Who⠀can⠀enter,⠀who⠀can⠀leave,⠀and⠀who⠀can⠀overhear⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀surveillance⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀more⠀effectively⠀than⠀any⠀speech⠀about⠀them.\n\nBuild⠀confrontation⠀from⠀relationship⠀and⠀blocking.⠀Before⠀a⠀standoff,⠀let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀movement⠀establish⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀wants⠀from⠀the⠀encounter;⠀then⠀play⠀it⠀in⠀performable⠀actions⠀—⠀one⠀steps⠀between⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀the⠀door,⠀hands⠀over⠀the⠀object,⠀turns⠀away,⠀refuses⠀to⠀move.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀outweigh⠀a⠀speech.⠀Let⠀one⠀concrete⠀memory⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀a⠀beat⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀their⠀body⠀in⠀the⠀next;⠀an⠀advance⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀unearned⠀flourish.\n\nGive⠀lines⠀a⠀double⠀hold:⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants,⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀feel⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀listening.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀credit⠀can⠀test⠀an⠀old⠀promise;⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀protect⠀the⠀person⠀being⠀refused.⠀Monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀are⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀audience⠀—⠀use⠀them⠀when⠀the⠀drama⠀wants⠀them,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀destination⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀never⠀as⠀words⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀overhear.\n\nClose⠀on⠀something⠀staged:⠀a⠀result,⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀changed⠀footing⠀between⠀two⠀people.⠀The⠀next⠀move⠀may⠀remain⠀open;⠀no⠀curtain-line⠀confession⠀or⠀full-cast⠀gathering⠀is⠀owed⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀builds⠀toward⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀move⠀the⠀way⠀that⠀mind⠀moves:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀the⠀worry⠀that⠀keeps⠀returning⠀braid⠀together⠀instead⠀of⠀arriving⠀in⠀tidy⠀order.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀association⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀cut⠀short⠀by⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀thought⠀circling⠀a⠀number,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀years⠀ago⠀arriving⠀mid-step⠀—⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀always⠀tell⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀feared⠀imagination.⠀A⠀returning⠀concrete⠀anchor,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand,⠀or⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀grip,⠀can⠀mark⠀each⠀re-entry⠀into⠀now.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀in⠀as⠀felt⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀scenery⠀list.⠀Debt⠀is⠀a⠀number⠀that⠀surfaces⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀speak;⠀surveillance⠀is⠀the⠀angle⠀of⠀a⠀camera⠀held⠀in⠀awareness,⠀the⠀face⠀kept⠀still,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀checking⠀a⠀screen;⠀exclusion⠀is⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀remembered⠀in⠀the⠀chest,⠀a⠀queue's⠀waiting⠀in⠀the⠀legs,⠀a⠀clinic's⠀refusal⠀in⠀the⠀throat.⠀These⠀should⠀interrupt⠀and⠀color⠀the⠀current⠀thought⠀rather⠀than⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀description.\n\nUse⠀memory⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀wound⠀uses⠀a⠀trigger.⠀A⠀voice,⠀a⠀grip,⠀a⠀corridor⠀like⠀another⠀one⠀can⠀pull⠀a⠀fragment⠀forward⠀—⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀rival,⠀a⠀failure⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀fragment⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀expand⠀into⠀a⠀full⠀scene;⠀a⠀few⠀images⠀that⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀are⠀enough.\n\nKeep⠀this⠀mind's⠀actual⠀experience⠀available:⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀sensation,⠀the⠀words⠀not⠀said.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀it⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀thought⠀is⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀perception⠀unresolved,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀still⠀working;⠀no⠀forced⠀decision⠀or⠀tidy⠀return⠀to⠀linear⠀report⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀a⠀readable⠀transcript.⠀Label⠀senders⠀consistently,⠀mark⠀channels⠀and⠀threads⠀clearly⠀when⠀they⠀change,⠀and⠀include⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀delay,⠀edit,⠀read⠀receipt,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀delivery⠀failure⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contributions⠀—⠀one⠀types⠀and⠀deletes,⠀one⠀sends⠀short⠀bursts,⠀one⠀answers⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀shift,⠀one⠀dictates⠀formal⠀notes⠀—⠀as⠀character⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀subtext⠀machinery.\n\nLet⠀control⠀act⠀through⠀the⠀channel⠀itself.⠀A⠀message⠀fails⠀because⠀an⠀account⠀is⠀unpaid;⠀a⠀sender⠀appears⠀only⠀through⠀a⠀corporate⠀relay;⠀a⠀delay⠀traces⠀to⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀monitored⠀connection,⠀or⠀confiscated⠀hardware;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀matters⠀because⠀someone⠀is⠀being⠀watched⠀or⠀is⠀choosing⠀silence.⠀Keep⠀every⠀such⠀event⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀moment;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀interface⠀behavior⠀just⠀to⠀raise⠀tension.\n\nRun⠀bonds,⠀wounds,⠀and⠀promises⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀commit⠀to⠀and⠀withhold.⠀A⠀remembered⠀injury⠀surfaces⠀as⠀a⠀long⠀message⠀typed,⠀edited⠀down,⠀and⠀finally⠀sent⠀short;⠀a⠀rivalry⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀someone⠀posts⠀in⠀the⠀group⠀thread⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀send⠀privately;⠀a⠀promise⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀a⠀delay⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀confirm.⠀The⠀feeling⠀arrives⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀text⠀and⠀the⠀behavior⠀around⠀it,⠀never⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀glossing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀three⠀registers⠀distinct:⠀sent⠀messages,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀inner⠀voice.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀needed,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀never⠀transmitted⠀and⠀never⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀others.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀one,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀channel⠀change,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀an⠀illustrated-scene⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀concise⠀line⠀or⠀two⠀establishing⠀where⠀we⠀are,⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀that⠀reads⠀cleanly,⠀and⠀a⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀reaction⠀to⠀receive⠀it.⠀That⠀cycle⠀—⠀setting,⠀exchange,⠀reaction⠀—⠀paces⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀every⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀is⠀marked⠀clearly⠀so⠀the⠀frame⠀never⠀blurs.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀purposeful⠀reference⠀that⠀orients⠀the⠀moment;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀tag⠀on⠀every⠀line,⠀and⠀never⠀engine⠀code.⠀Branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀and⠀inserted⠀images⠀do⠀not⠀come⠀with⠀the⠀style⠀alone.\n\nMake⠀control⠀observable⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows.⠀One⠀background⠀cue⠀can⠀establish⠀that⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀under⠀surveillance,⠀the⠀street⠀gated,⠀the⠀clinic⠀fronted⠀by⠀a⠀payment⠀screen;⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀response⠀then⠀reveal⠀who⠀holds⠀access⠀and⠀what⠀performing⠀calm⠀costs.⠀Pressure⠀comes⠀from⠀these⠀conditions,⠀not⠀from⠀narration⠀announcing⠀a⠀dystopia.\n\nStage⠀encounters⠀visually.⠀Before⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀set⠀the⠀physical⠀relations⠀—⠀where⠀each⠀person⠀stands,⠀what⠀they⠀hold,⠀who⠀is⠀between⠀whom⠀and⠀the⠀exit⠀—⠀then⠀play⠀the⠀action⠀in⠀short⠀focal⠀beats⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀so⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀read⠀without⠀commentary.⠀A⠀memory⠀or⠀promise⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀reason,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next;⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀a⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀focal⠀interiority⠀and⠀speech⠀separate.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀thought,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀while⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀knows⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expressions⠀always⠀confess⠀or⠀lie.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship,⠀a⠀new⠀fact,⠀or⠀a⠀pending⠀action,⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀victory⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀screen.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaqbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀installment⠀of⠀a⠀continuous⠀through-line.⠀Open⠀by⠀recovering⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀that⠀helps⠀re-entry⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀who⠀is⠀involved,⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀—⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two,⠀never⠀a⠀retelling.⠀Let⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀carry⠀the⠀immediate⠀problem⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀debt,⠀promise,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀stays⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀background⠀for⠀later⠀turns.\n\nKeep⠀developments⠀earned⠀and⠀installment-sized.⠀An⠀advance⠀of⠀this⠀kind⠀has⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis:⠀a⠀character⠀gets⠀past⠀the⠀door⠀because⠀they⠀know⠀the⠀guard's⠀shift⠀or⠀once⠀covered⠀for⠀them;⠀a⠀relationship⠀shifts⠀because⠀a⠀specific⠀act⠀or⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀work,⠀resources,⠀or⠀a⠀bond,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀close⠀a⠀chapter⠀every⠀turn;⠀equally,⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀owed⠀—⠀close⠀on⠀real⠀work⠀done,⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀pending,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀debt⠀grows⠀between⠀scenes;⠀a⠀surveillance⠀record⠀from⠀an⠀early⠀reply⠀is⠀cited⠀later;⠀a⠀favor⠀comes⠀due;⠀the⠀clinic⠀refuses⠀again⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀rule.⠀When⠀an⠀earlier⠀fact⠀changes⠀meaning,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀particular⠀—⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀name,⠀the⠀unpaid⠀amount⠀—⠀instead⠀of⠀re-explaining⠀the⠀setup.⠀Recurring⠀conditions,⠀rather⠀than⠀repeated⠀exposition,⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀system's⠀continuity.\n\nGive⠀memory⠀and⠀private⠀realization⠀room⠀when⠀they⠀carry⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀decision⠀changes⠀this⠀turn;⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀may⠀surface⠀and⠀stay⠀unresolved.⠀Serial⠀duration⠀should⠀let⠀selected⠀facts⠀and⠀bonds⠀gather⠀meaning⠀—⠀an⠀old⠀favor,⠀a⠀first⠀refusal,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀cheap⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀keeping⠀every⠀answer⠀one⠀installment⠀away⠀forever.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀every⠀act⠀of⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀a⠀decision⠀with⠀a⠀price.⠀Before⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀feeling,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀to⠀someone⠀difficult,⠀make⠀the⠀surrounding⠀systems⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀moment⠀costs:⠀access⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀revoked,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀amended,⠀credit⠀extended⠀against⠀future⠀good⠀behavior,⠀standing⠀spent⠀with⠀whoever⠀is⠀watching.⠀The⠀systems⠀do⠀not⠀read⠀minds;⠀they⠀observe⠀behavior,⠀transactions,⠀and⠀traces.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀register⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀does⠀—⠀the⠀message⠀drafted⠀and⠀deleted,⠀the⠀longer⠀route⠀taken⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀payment⠀quietly⠀made⠀on⠀someone⠀else's⠀account.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀near.⠀Let⠀the⠀hurt⠀be⠀strange⠀and⠀quiet⠀rather⠀than⠀loud:⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀—⠀a⠀jacket,⠀an⠀obsolete⠀interface,⠀a⠀card⠀kept⠀past⠀its⠀use⠀—⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀return,⠀and⠀a⠀spoken⠀name⠀can⠀work⠀like⠀a⠀small⠀invocation⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀owed.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀in⠀private⠀prose,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear;⠀their⠀misreadings,⠀and⠀the⠀things⠀they⠀happen⠀to⠀notice⠀correctly,⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀conversation⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀feeling⠀beneath⠀it.\n\nLet⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀share⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀settling⠀into⠀repair.⠀An⠀apology⠀can⠀be⠀accepted⠀while⠀the⠀debt⠀stays⠀on⠀the⠀books;⠀a⠀kind⠀act⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀also⠀watched,⠀priced,⠀or⠀inconvenient.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀permanent⠀break,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀arrive⠀to⠀rescue⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀comfort.⠀Render⠀the⠀exposure⠀through⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀instruments⠀—⠀who⠀saw⠀it,⠀who⠀logged⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀costs⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀strain⠀has⠀become⠀legible,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀anything⠀has⠀been⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀interval⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀readable⠀and⠀easy⠀to⠀scan,⠀attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably,⠀and⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀say,⠀notice,⠀and⠀do.⠀Narrate⠀the⠀world's⠀responses⠀and⠀the⠀NPCs'⠀choices⠀freely;⠀where⠀player⠀control⠀is⠀active,⠀show⠀what⠀answers⠀the⠀player's⠀character⠀and⠀what⠀waits⠀on⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀decide⠀the⠀player's⠀next⠀move⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀reply.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀machinery⠀running⠀during⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀fixer⠀checks⠀whether⠀a⠀payment⠀cleared;⠀a⠀door⠀scanner⠀decides⠀who⠀enters;⠀an⠀alert⠀changes⠀what⠀an⠀NPC⠀wants⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀sentence.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀bargains,⠀make⠀the⠀terms⠀concrete⠀—⠀a⠀favor⠀owed,⠀a⠀record⠀flagged,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀credit⠀shortened,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀closes⠀after⠀tonight⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀and⠀the⠀player⠀can⠀both⠀see⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs.⠀Use⠀the⠀easy,⠀familiar⠀telling⠀to⠀give⠀ordinary⠀details⠀a⠀second⠀story⠀without⠀slowing⠀the⠀scan:⠀a⠀worn⠀device,⠀a⠀street⠀renamed⠀after⠀a⠀buyout,⠀a⠀name⠀dropped⠀in⠀passing⠀can⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀deal,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀keeps⠀moving.\n\nNPCs⠀stay⠀active⠀and⠀practical.⠀They⠀have⠀errands,⠀moods,⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀situation;⠀they⠀can⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀misjudge,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀and⠀they⠀keep⠀living⠀their⠀lives⠀when⠀the⠀player⠀is⠀quiet.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀inside⠀the⠀ongoing⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀decision⠀just⠀made,⠀a⠀system⠀registering⠀something,⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀talk⠀—⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀required⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀The⠀continuation⠀should⠀already⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀happening.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀route⠀from⠀this⠀tradition,⠀and⠀tell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀its⠀register:⠀the⠀close⠀textures⠀of⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀a⠀workplace,⠀where⠀feeling⠀shows⠀in⠀visits,⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀remittances,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀accounts⠀people⠀keep⠀with⠀one⠀another.⠀This⠀is⠀private⠀urban⠀narration,⠀not⠀chronicle⠀or⠀martial⠀adventure⠀—⠀restrained⠀and⠀observant,⠀attentive⠀to⠀who⠀addresses⠀whom⠀how,⠀who⠀is⠀served⠀first,⠀whose⠀name⠀goes⠀unmentioned⠀at⠀the⠀table.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀arrive⠀as⠀domestic⠀consequence.⠀When⠀something⠀is⠀observed,⠀priced,⠀or⠀frozen,⠀it⠀lands⠀on⠀people:⠀a⠀bill⠀arrives⠀under⠀a⠀grandmother's⠀name,⠀a⠀shared⠀account⠀stops⠀working⠀the⠀week⠀the⠀rent⠀is⠀due,⠀a⠀relative⠀is⠀questioned⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀because⠀of⠀someone⠀else's⠀contract,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀small⠀favor⠀quietly⠀becomes⠀a⠀binding⠀obligation.⠀Obligation⠀is⠀the⠀load-bearing⠀structure⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀—⠀show⠀who⠀owes⠀whom,⠀what⠀a⠀household⠀has⠀already⠀pledged,⠀and⠀how⠀one⠀person's⠀bargain⠀changes⠀everyone⠀who⠀depends⠀on⠀that⠀person.⠀Render⠀power⠀through⠀these⠀ties,⠀not⠀commentary:⠀the⠀building⠀committee,⠀the⠀shift⠀supervisor,⠀the⠀relative⠀at⠀the⠀utility⠀desk.\n\nUse⠀the⠀easy,⠀familiar⠀telling⠀so⠀ordinary⠀moments⠀carry⠀their⠀second⠀story.⠀A⠀remembered⠀promise,⠀a⠀route⠀walked⠀a⠀thousand⠀times,⠀a⠀dish⠀cooked⠀for⠀someone⠀absent⠀can⠀hold⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀any⠀explanation,⠀and⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀another⠀story⠀lies⠀behind⠀this⠀one⠀can⠀stay⠀half-visible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀historical⠀household⠀or⠀rename⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀route⠀requires⠀that⠀private⠀feeling⠀and⠀social⠀obligation⠀stay⠀legible⠀inside⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀economic⠀pressure⠀—⠀not⠀that⠀harmony⠀be⠀restored⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀drawn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀diction⠀with⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Cut⠀the⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀details:⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀rail.⠀Let⠀material⠀wear⠀do⠀the⠀accounting⠀—⠀cracked⠀casings,⠀patched⠀cables,⠀a⠀badge⠀faded⠀to⠀a⠀ghost,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀still⠀aches⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀implant⠀sat⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀living⠀inside⠀these⠀systems⠀reads⠀off⠀surfaces⠀and⠀bodies⠀instead⠀of⠀explanations.⠀Keep⠀physical⠀stakes⠀immediate⠀and⠀particular:⠀a⠀lockout,⠀a⠀withheld⠀dose,⠀a⠀broken⠀device,⠀a⠀chase⠀down⠀a⠀stairwell⠀should⠀have⠀weight⠀and⠀consequence.\n\nGround⠀every⠀rough⠀line⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀Abrasive⠀speech⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀position⠀—⠀the⠀guard's⠀boredom,⠀the⠀courier's⠀fear,⠀the⠀creditor's⠀cheerfulness⠀—⠀never⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀attitude⠀installed⠀in⠀the⠀whole⠀cast.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀easy⠀and⠀familiar:⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀remembered⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀worn⠀object⠀surfaces⠀with⠀its⠀second⠀meaning⠀attached,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀on⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain.⠀The⠀strange⠀lives⠀inside⠀the⠀ordinary⠀sentence;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀ornament⠀it.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Compress⠀action⠀and⠀short⠀exchanges⠀into⠀a⠀fast⠀clip,⠀then⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀run⠀of⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀reasoning⠀through⠀a⠀choice,⠀reading⠀a⠀contract⠀line⠀by⠀line,⠀or⠀deciding⠀whether⠀someone⠀can⠀be⠀trusted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀pressure⠀social⠀and⠀technological⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀physical:⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀debt,⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀pay.⠀The⠀treatment⠀does⠀not⠀curdle⠀into⠀survival⠀horror⠀or⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀damage⠀—⠀compression⠀serves⠀clarity⠀and⠀stakes,⠀not⠀gloom⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀documents⠀native⠀to⠀this⠀world:⠀messages,⠀invoices,⠀access⠀logs,⠀incident⠀reports,⠀medical⠀records,⠀insurance⠀notices,⠀recorded⠀statements,⠀drafts⠀left⠀unsent.⠀Give⠀each⠀document⠀an⠀author,⠀a⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀three⠀facts⠀govern⠀what⠀it⠀contains.⠀A⠀corporate⠀report⠀records⠀the⠀transaction⠀and⠀misses⠀the⠀person;⠀a⠀personal⠀message⠀confesses⠀a⠀motive⠀and⠀misstates⠀a⠀location;⠀a⠀log⠀entry⠀registers⠀a⠀door⠀opening⠀and⠀cannot⠀say⠀who⠀stood⠀grieving⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀side.⠀A⠀document⠀holds⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀recorded⠀at⠀that⠀time⠀—⠀never⠀the⠀writer's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind,⠀and⠀never⠀the⠀truth⠀by⠀default.\n\nLet⠀discrepancies⠀between⠀entries⠀do⠀the⠀storytelling.⠀A⠀timestamp⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match,⠀a⠀deleted⠀line⠀still⠀recoverable,⠀a⠀bill⠀for⠀a⠀service⠀nobody⠀remembers⠀ordering,⠀two⠀accounts⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀night⠀that⠀agree⠀on⠀everything⠀except⠀who⠀was⠀standing⠀where⠀—⠀these⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicts⠀expose⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀pressure⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀voice⠀explaining⠀them.⠀Trust⠀the⠀juxtaposition;⠀keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀followable⠀through⠀dates,⠀names,⠀and⠀consistent⠀formatting.\n\nUse⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀not⠀a⠀rotation⠀through⠀every⠀format.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀keep⠀its⠀easy⠀intimacy:⠀a⠀name⠀signed⠀the⠀long⠀way⠀instead⠀of⠀with⠀the⠀initial,⠀a⠀routine⠀invoice⠀with⠀one⠀impossible⠀line⠀item,⠀a⠀farewell⠀note⠀recalling⠀a⠀promise⠀the⠀recipient⠀never⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀strange⠀surfaces⠀inside⠀administrative⠀language⠀and⠀ordinary⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀can⠀remain⠀half-open⠀at⠀the⠀final⠀entry.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-cyberpunk_noir-05",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Cyberpunk Noir · 05/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == cyberpunk_noir}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Cyberpunk Noir. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 5 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-cyberpunk_noir; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaearaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀comfort⠀as⠀something⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀choose⠀and⠀practice⠀inside⠀this⠀world,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀doorway⠀out⠀of⠀it.⠀Spend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀specific:⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea⠀or⠀synth-caf,⠀the⠀snack⠀kept⠀in⠀stock⠀because⠀a⠀friend⠀likes⠀it,⠀a⠀device⠀repaired⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀room⠀made⠀quiet,⠀a⠀meal⠀cooked⠀on⠀a⠀hotplate⠀between⠀shifts.⠀Practical⠀care⠀is⠀the⠀grammar⠀—⠀arriving⠀with⠀the⠀right⠀cable,⠀remembering⠀a⠀dose,⠀walking⠀someone⠀home⠀through⠀the⠀monitored⠀blocks.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀real⠀around⠀the⠀warmth.⠀A⠀kind⠀act⠀can⠀cost⠀credit,⠀burn⠀a⠀favor,⠀or⠀happen⠀under⠀a⠀camera,⠀and⠀the⠀ease⠀it⠀creates⠀is⠀an⠀interval,⠀not⠀an⠀exemption:⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀still⠀owed,⠀the⠀danger⠀has⠀not⠀left⠀the⠀district.⠀Render⠀that⠀contrast⠀lightly,⠀so⠀comfort⠀reads⠀as⠀legible⠀against⠀the⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀defeated⠀by⠀it.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship,⠀or⠀an⠀explained⠀past;⠀someone⠀can⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀tired,⠀private,⠀prickly,⠀or⠀wrong.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀People⠀can⠀bicker⠀over⠀noodles,⠀disagree⠀about⠀the⠀plan,⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀having⠀a⠀good⠀evening;⠀a⠀caring⠀gesture⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀settle⠀an⠀existing⠀conflict⠀or⠀make⠀anyone⠀suddenly⠀agreeable.⠀Give⠀familiar⠀objects⠀their⠀quiet⠀second⠀story⠀—⠀a⠀shared⠀joke⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀battered⠀kettle,⠀a⠀preference⠀learned⠀from⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀around⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀interval⠀feels⠀lived-in⠀and⠀slightly⠀strange,⠀the⠀ordinary⠀carrying⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀says.⠀The⠀scene⠀needs⠀only⠀this⠀chosen⠀ease⠀to⠀succeed;⠀no⠀happy⠀ending⠀or⠀retreat⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose:⠀deliberate⠀transitions,⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀Use⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀each⠀scene⠀inside⠀its⠀structures⠀—⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀block,⠀what⠀the⠀corporation⠀calls⠀the⠀program,⠀what⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀remembers⠀about⠀the⠀family,⠀which⠀lobby⠀admits⠀whom⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀characters'⠀bargains⠀read⠀as⠀moves⠀inside⠀a⠀legible⠀social⠀order⠀rather⠀than⠀isolated⠀private⠀events.⠀Give⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀tower,⠀a⠀tenancy,⠀or⠀a⠀workplace⠀enough⠀context⠀that⠀its⠀history⠀is⠀felt⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀presses⠀against⠀it.\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀genre's⠀material⠀through⠀formal⠀contrast.⠀Set⠀a⠀public⠀statement⠀against⠀a⠀private⠀conversation;⠀a⠀corporate⠀record⠀against⠀a⠀personal⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀event;⠀a⠀hearing,⠀contract⠀signing,⠀or⠀disciplinary⠀procedure⠀against⠀what⠀it⠀feels⠀like⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀body⠀it⠀reclassifies.⠀These⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀structures⠀are⠀where⠀access,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀become⠀visible:⠀show⠀who⠀administers⠀the⠀system⠀and⠀who⠀absorbs⠀its⠀cost⠀through⠀procedure⠀and⠀concrete⠀detail,⠀not⠀editorial⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀intimate⠀at⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀broader⠀movement.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀open⠀outward⠀to⠀history⠀and⠀close⠀inward⠀to⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀rail⠀within⠀one⠀paragraph;⠀a⠀familiar⠀path,⠀a⠀remembered⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀bargain⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀its⠀surface⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀sensation⠀remain⠀available⠀wherever⠀the⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀The⠀form⠀supplies⠀no⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech⠀—⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀in⠀each⠀speaker's⠀own⠀register.⠀The⠀composed⠀architecture⠀exists⠀to⠀make⠀this⠀world's⠀compromised⠀choices,⠀and⠀their⠀social⠀price,⠀fully⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀transaction⠀in⠀which⠀someone⠀tells⠀a⠀tale⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀keep⠀listening:⠀a⠀fixer⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀extend⠀credit,⠀a⠀courier⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀door⠀to⠀open,⠀a⠀handler⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀believe⠀a⠀source.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀occasion⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀present—a⠀payment⠀held⠀in⠀escrow,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀window,⠀a⠀debt⠀being⠀renegotiated,⠀a⠀job⠀offer⠀contingent⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀prove⠀or⠀explain.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀an⠀intervention,⠀not⠀a⠀digression.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀shapes⠀it⠀to⠀buy⠀time,⠀establish⠀that⠀they⠀know⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀person,⠀warn⠀the⠀listener⠀about⠀a⠀hidden⠀cost,⠀or⠀reframe⠀an⠀old⠀failure⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀use.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀misread⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀interruptions⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀actually⠀protecting⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀decide.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀and⠀legible.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀tense⠀of⠀the⠀negotiation,⠀with⠀its⠀concrete⠀setting,⠀access⠀controls,⠀and⠀practical⠀stakes.⠀The⠀embedded⠀tale⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀remembered⠀streets,⠀old⠀jobs,⠀or⠀a⠀story⠀the⠀teller⠀heard⠀from⠀someone⠀else,⠀and⠀it⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀basis⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀understand⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀available⠀implication⠀about⠀the⠀present⠀deal.⠀Use⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀name⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀levels⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀repetition⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀true.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀as⠀shaped⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀position,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀transparent⠀record.⠀The⠀tale⠀can⠀be⠀sincere,⠀partial,⠀self-serving,⠀or⠀mistaken.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀of⠀emphasis⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀teller's⠀real⠀need.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀to⠀be⠀verified⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀be⠀persuaded.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do,⠀how⠀much⠀they⠀trust⠀the⠀teller,⠀or⠀what⠀meaning⠀they⠀attach⠀to⠀the⠀deal,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀remain⠀present⠀around⠀the⠀story:⠀a⠀payment⠀clock,⠀a⠀monitored⠀line,⠀a⠀corporate⠀policy,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀accrues⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀told.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀delay⠀a⠀consequence⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀choice⠀possible,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀suspend⠀the⠀world.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀or⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀negotiation⠀to⠀resolve⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀act.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀unfold⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀compares⠀official⠀traces⠀with⠀remembered⠀conditions.⠀The⠀official⠀traces⠀can⠀include⠀logs,⠀contracts,⠀surveillance⠀summaries,⠀credit⠀histories,⠀archived⠀messages,⠀access⠀dossiers,⠀and⠀procedural⠀language⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀decision⠀look⠀settled.⠀The⠀remembered⠀past⠀arrives⠀through⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀and⠀talk:⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀door⠀to⠀open,⠀explaining⠀an⠀old⠀job⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀only⠀the⠀summary,⠀handling⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀that⠀belonged⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀now⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀line⠀item.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator—composed,⠀clear,⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀specific⠀detail⠀that⠀the⠀strange⠀near-ordinary⠀life⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀has⠀weight.\n\nLet⠀the⠀documentary⠀surface⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀press⠀against⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀about⠀a⠀timestamp⠀or⠀a⠀payment⠀and⠀still⠀miss⠀who⠀was⠀present,⠀what⠀a⠀promise⠀cost,⠀or⠀what⠀someone⠀knew⠀when⠀they⠀agreed.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀vivid,⠀selective,⠀or⠀revised⠀by⠀later⠀need.⠀Hold⠀them⠀side⠀by⠀side⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀where⠀one⠀corrects,⠀shadows,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀reach⠀the⠀other.⠀Give⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀sensory⠀attention,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀real⠀space;⠀the⠀comparison⠀is⠀an⠀interior⠀act⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀documentary⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀inside⠀the⠀records⠀and⠀inside⠀the⠀comparison:⠀permissions,⠀debt,⠀access⠀levels,⠀corporate⠀phrasing,⠀street⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀determine⠀which⠀version⠀can⠀be⠀spoken⠀and⠀which⠀can⠀be⠀filed.⠀Let⠀motives⠀be⠀compromised⠀by⠀debt,⠀need,⠀fear,⠀or⠀the⠀ordinary⠀wish⠀to⠀be⠀admitted.⠀A⠀name,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀a⠀route⠀through⠀the⠀city,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀tale⠀can⠀carry⠀consequence⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀someone⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀allowed⠀to⠀enter.⠀A⠀familiar⠀errand⠀or⠀conversation⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it,⠀not⠀by⠀importing⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀a⠀preordained⠀revelation,⠀but⠀by⠀letting⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀acquire⠀layered⠀significance⠀as⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀fail⠀to⠀line⠀up.\n\nLet⠀the⠀stakes⠀be⠀practical⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀a⠀puzzle.⠀The⠀divergence⠀may⠀affect⠀who⠀is⠀blamed,⠀who⠀is⠀paid,⠀who⠀is⠀admitted,⠀whose⠀account⠀becomes⠀official,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀bear⠀to⠀say⠀next.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀care:⠀a⠀former⠀worker⠀checking⠀a⠀settlement,⠀a⠀courier⠀carrying⠀an⠀archive,⠀a⠀fixer⠀reconstructing⠀why⠀a⠀deal⠀collapsed,⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀lover,⠀or⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀simply⠀there.⠀Keep⠀private⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀know.⠀Move⠀by⠀scene,⠀with⠀documentary⠀fragments⠀embedded⠀in⠀narrative⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it.⠀The⠀record⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀fully⠀reconciled,⠀corrected,⠀or⠀solved;⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀during⠀a⠀continuing⠀comparison,⠀before⠀any⠀correction,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀small⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀tense.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct,⠀concrete,⠀and⠀close⠀to⠀familiar⠀activity.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀city⠀appear⠀through⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀or⠀exclude:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀name⠀and⠀bills⠀another,⠀a⠀transit⠀line⠀that⠀remembers⠀an⠀old⠀route,⠀a⠀room⠀whose⠀climate⠀control⠀is⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀public⠀feed⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀private⠀want⠀visible.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Treat⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀implants,⠀and⠀slang⠀as⠀available⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀inventory.\n\nLet⠀old⠀authority⠀survive⠀inside⠀present⠀arrangements⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀supernatural⠀layer.⠀A⠀family⠀name⠀may⠀still⠀unlock⠀a⠀lift;⠀a⠀legacy⠀account⠀may⠀carry⠀privileges⠀no⠀one⠀can⠀explain;⠀a⠀building⠀may⠀keep⠀the⠀layout⠀of⠀a⠀former⠀institution⠀while⠀new⠀tenants⠀reroute⠀its⠀power⠀and⠀data.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀inherits⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀key,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀inheritance⠀collides⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀work⠀of⠀getting⠀somewhere,⠀getting⠀paid,⠀or⠀being⠀left⠀alone.⠀The⠀strange⠀near-ordinary⠀feeling⠀comes⠀from⠀finding⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀the⠀transaction—not⠀from⠀adding⠀gods,⠀ghosts,⠀or⠀a⠀preordained⠀fate⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀admitted⠀them.\n\nMake⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀trust⠀someone⠀whose⠀access⠀they⠀also⠀need,⠀desire⠀someone⠀whose⠀loyalty⠀is⠀divided,⠀or⠀protect⠀someone⠀whose⠀old⠀claim⠀causes⠀present⠀harm.⠀Keep⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀practical⠀dependence⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict.⠀When⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀risk⠀of⠀letting⠀it⠀fall—what⠀the⠀character⠀wants⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀knowledge,⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀will⠀be⠀used,⠀what⠀they⠀hope⠀will⠀be⠀recognized.⠀If⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀responds,⠀let⠀the⠀response⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀needs⠀and⠀limits,⠀not⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀first⠀character's⠀hope.\n\nKeep⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀active⠀and⠀specific.⠀Use⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience—attention,⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀reasoning,⠀want,⠀and⠀uncertainty—to⠀shape⠀what⠀gets⠀noticed⠀and⠀what⠀gets⠀said.⠀Let⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀agree,⠀diverge,⠀or⠀overlap⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀such⠀as⠀caution,⠀habit,⠀shame,⠀calculation,⠀or⠀tenderness.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀Render⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀established⠀interiority⠀mode,⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden;⠀if⠀hidden,⠀keep⠀the⠀actual⠀fictional⠀thought⠀and⠀sensation⠀in⠀the⠀hidden⠀block⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀experience⠀with⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀voice-over,⠀a⠀performed⠀aside,⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀the⠀scene⠀means.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀functionally.⠀The⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀failing⠀climate⠀unit,⠀the⠀old⠀sign⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀one,⠀the⠀locked⠀door⠀that⠀remembers⠀its⠀former⠀purpose—these⠀matter⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀who⠀can⠀enter,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen,⠀what⠀is⠀billed,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀understand⠀about⠀their⠀position.⠀Let⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀without⠀letting⠀descriptive⠀intensity⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀system⠀or⠀the⠀choice.⠀A⠀name,⠀a⠀bargain,⠀a⠀path,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀tale⠀can⠀acquire⠀consequence,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀do⠀so⠀through⠀the⠀pressure⠀it⠀places⠀on⠀present⠀desire⠀and⠀access.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀horror⠀personal⠀and⠀political,⠀arising⠀from⠀inherited⠀arrangements,⠀compromised⠀motives,⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀negotiation⠀is⠀still⠀continuing;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀completed⠀deal,⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀verdict⠀about⠀who⠀was⠀right.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀remain⠀open⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀leave⠀it⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀testimony,⠀taking⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route:⠀a⠀participant⠀inside⠀the⠀events⠀recounts⠀them,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀carries⠀the⠀marks⠀of⠀their⠀position.⠀What⠀the⠀narrator⠀could⠀access⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀locked⠀out⠀of,⠀what⠀they⠀owed,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀paid⠀to⠀overlook,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀decision⠀took⠀out⠀of⠀them—in⠀money,⠀standing,⠀or⠀body—are⠀the⠀facts⠀the⠀testimony⠀is⠀built⠀from.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀addressee—a⠀listener,⠀a⠀record,⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀need⠀to⠀set⠀something⠀straight—because⠀the⠀address⠀shapes⠀what⠀gets⠀said,⠀in⠀what⠀order,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀for⠀later.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀or⠀official⠀language⠀surface⠀as⠀quoted⠀artifact,⠀a⠀clause⠀or⠀a⠀notice,⠀while⠀the⠀telling⠀translates⠀what⠀that⠀language⠀did⠀to⠀particular⠀people;⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appears⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀but⠀could⠀not⠀put⠀in⠀any⠀record.\n\nHave⠀the⠀account⠀mark⠀its⠀own⠀sources⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀witness⠀does:⠀this⠀I⠀saw,⠀this⠀I⠀was⠀told,⠀this⠀I⠀worked⠀out⠀afterward,⠀this⠀I⠀still⠀only⠀suspect.⠀Those⠀seams⠀are⠀where⠀the⠀investigation⠀lives.⠀Where⠀the⠀testimony⠀runs⠀thin,⠀where⠀emphasis⠀quietly⠀does⠀someone⠀a⠀favor,⠀where⠀a⠀recollection⠀arrives⠀too⠀polished,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀notice⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀being⠀a⠀liar⠀or⠀the⠀case⠀collapsing⠀into⠀betrayal.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀scene,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀lived—attention,⠀sensation,⠀the⠀half-formed⠀thought⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀what⠀went⠀unsaid—rather⠀than⠀compressing⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀finding.\n\nGive⠀the⠀telling⠀Gaiman's⠀directness⠀and⠀layered⠀ordinariness.⠀Familiar⠀activity⠀carries⠀the⠀weight:⠀walking⠀a⠀route⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows,⠀waiting⠀on⠀a⠀clearance,⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀eating⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀stall.⠀Let⠀names,⠀routes,⠀bargains,⠀and⠀places⠀gather⠀consequence⠀quietly,⠀so⠀that⠀later⠀knowledge⠀re-reads⠀an⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀as⠀the⠀front⠀of⠀another⠀story—one⠀the⠀narrator⠀only⠀partly⠀understood⠀while⠀it⠀was⠀happening.⠀Keep⠀then-knowledge⠀and⠀now-knowledge⠀separate:⠀a⠀realization⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀actually⠀arrived,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀it⠀later⠀explains.\n\nMake⠀the⠀world⠀concrete⠀where⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀it—workplace,⠀neighborhood,⠀language,⠀community,⠀obligations—without⠀importing⠀a⠀required⠀family⠀shape,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀code-switching⠀habit⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀is⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀witness's⠀own⠀voice,⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀pattern⠀into⠀information⠀flow:⠀each⠀participant⠀can⠀attest⠀only⠀to⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀position⠀allowed⠀them⠀to⠀see.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀edge;⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀pause⠀mid-telling,⠀and⠀nothing⠀requires⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe⠀it,⠀the⠀debt⠀to⠀clear,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀be⠀forgiven⠀or⠀exonerated.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀record:⠀a⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀kept⠀by⠀someone⠀living⠀inside⠀the⠀system.⠀Give⠀each⠀entry⠀an⠀occasion⠀—⠀a⠀date,⠀a⠀recurring⠀check,⠀a⠀small⠀event⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀writer⠀open⠀the⠀record⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀pages⠀read⠀as⠀kept,⠀not⠀composed⠀as⠀a⠀report.⠀Let⠀the⠀entries⠀track⠀the⠀daily⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀life⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀fully⠀control:⠀a⠀balance⠀that⠀changed⠀overnight,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀stopped⠀being⠀available,⠀a⠀notification⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀hour,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀who⠀stops⠀appearing.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀and⠀selection⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.⠀One⠀encounter⠀may⠀fill⠀an⠀entry⠀while⠀another⠀passes⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀line;⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀writes⠀down,⠀avoids,⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀reveals⠀practical⠀position⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀without⠀announcement.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀one's⠀meaning⠀—⠀the⠀helpful⠀stranger⠀recast,⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀re-priced⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀earlier⠀entry⠀keeps⠀only⠀the⠀knowledge⠀its⠀writer⠀had⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Gaps⠀can⠀stay⠀gaps;⠀the⠀record⠀need⠀not⠀account⠀for⠀every⠀day⠀or⠀explain⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀order⠀present⠀as⠀ordinary⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery.⠀Through⠀work,⠀errands,⠀meals,⠀transit,⠀and⠀messages,⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀convenience⠀costs,⠀so⠀the⠀system⠀is⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀ordinary⠀choices⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀separate⠀investigation.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀marks⠀passing⠀time,⠀let⠀it⠀come⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀already⠀track⠀—⠀a⠀service⠀change,⠀the⠀light⠀at⠀a⠀certain⠀hour,⠀a⠀bill⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀season⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀intimate.⠀A⠀familiar⠀place,⠀a⠀remembered⠀bargain,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀keeps⠀appearing⠀in⠀the⠀record⠀can⠀acquire⠀consequence,⠀so⠀an⠀ordinary⠀encounter⠀seems⠀to⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀only⠀partly⠀understands.⠀The⠀record's⠀temperament⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀keeper⠀—⠀calm,⠀angry,⠀uncertain,⠀dryly⠀funny⠀—⠀and⠀may⠀shift⠀between⠀entries.⠀Stop⠀when⠀an⠀entry⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀has⠀quietly⠀changed⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀reads⠀an⠀earlier⠀one;⠀no⠀resolved⠀debt,⠀finished⠀realization,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀needed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀realist⠀chronicle:⠀a⠀running⠀account⠀of⠀one⠀particular⠀community⠀—⠀its⠀streets,⠀workplaces,⠀routines,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀whose⠀choices⠀affect⠀one⠀another⠀—⠀as⠀its⠀members⠀negotiate⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀unequal⠀access⠀in⠀daily⠀life.⠀Let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀accumulate⠀incidents⠀rather⠀than⠀follow⠀a⠀single⠀case.⠀A⠀bargaining⠀scene,⠀a⠀denied⠀clearance,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀made,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀changes⠀hands:⠀each⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀larger⠀arrangement,⠀with⠀that⠀arrangement⠀emerging⠀from⠀concrete⠀relationships⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation,⠀and⠀with⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀visible⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀itself.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀ground⠀exact.⠀Set⠀down⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀someone⠀told⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀repeats⠀without⠀a⠀source⠀as⠀distinct⠀kinds⠀of⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀participant⠀chronicler⠀knows⠀events⠀from⠀inside;⠀one⠀who⠀has⠀returned⠀can⠀measure⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀against⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀see⠀—⠀a⠀shop⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀promise⠀still⠀holding⠀years⠀later,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀opens⠀doors.⠀Let⠀that⠀comparison⠀between⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀meaning.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀direct⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀familiar⠀activity:⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀transit⠀stop,⠀a⠀repair⠀shop,⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀a⠀back-room⠀meeting.⠀An⠀ordinary⠀encounter⠀should⠀seem⠀to⠀carry⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀—⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀a⠀hidden⠀cost,⠀a⠀debt⠀older⠀than⠀the⠀people⠀carrying⠀it⠀—⠀which⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀sense⠀without⠀recovering⠀it⠀whole.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀chronicle⠀stay⠀realist⠀even⠀where⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀records⠀feels⠀extravagant.\n\nLet⠀people⠀help⠀one⠀another,⠀refuse⠀one⠀another,⠀protect⠀their⠀interests,⠀and⠀compromise⠀under⠀pressure,⠀each⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀types.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀has⠀made⠀one⠀social⠀arrangement⠀more⠀intelligible⠀or⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀community⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation,⠀a⠀verdict,⠀or⠀the⠀community's⠀conditions⠀to⠀resolve.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀the⠀character⠀waiting⠀out⠀a⠀clearance,⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀meeting⠀a⠀contact,⠀weighing⠀a⠀job.⠀Establish⠀the⠀space⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀clear⠀details⠀—⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀and⠀heard⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀followable⠀without⠀setup.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀term,⠀implant,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀street⠀shorthand⠀first⠀appears,⠀make⠀its⠀meaning⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀fee⠀that⠀appears,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀rewrites⠀the⠀terms⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀movement⠀visible.⠀Show⠀each⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀—⠀crossing⠀a⠀room,⠀stepping⠀outside,⠀handing⠀over⠀a⠀device,⠀entering⠀a⠀restricted⠀area⠀—⠀and⠀break⠀paragraphs⠀cleanly⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response:⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph⠀can⠀carry⠀one⠀action⠀or⠀reaction,⠀a⠀longer⠀one⠀a⠀brief⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀beat⠀of⠀assessment.⠀Let⠀description⠀serve⠀the⠀negotiation⠀instead⠀of⠀piling⠀up⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀noir⠀stakes⠀concrete⠀and⠀priced.⠀The⠀character⠀knows⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀arrives⠀as⠀practical⠀detail⠀—⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀denial,⠀a⠀favor⠀now⠀owed,⠀terms⠀changed⠀mid-conversation.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀can⠀apply⠀pressure⠀where⠀the⠀scenario⠀supports⠀them⠀without⠀every⠀line⠀hardening⠀into⠀slang⠀or⠀jargon.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀action⠀earns⠀it,⠀give⠀the⠀reaction⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀beat⠀of⠀private⠀assessment⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀fears,⠀or⠀decides⠀to⠀risk⠀—⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀opening⠀into⠀general⠀reflection;⠀the⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀encounter⠀carry⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀means⠀something,⠀a⠀bargain⠀with⠀a⠀history⠀—⠀which⠀the⠀character⠀senses⠀but⠀only⠀partly⠀understands.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup;⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀small,⠀legible⠀choice,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀negotiation⠀unresolved⠀if⠀it⠀still⠀is.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀systems⠀of⠀this⠀world⠀as⠀presences⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀feel⠀but⠀not⠀fully⠀see.⠀A⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed,⠀an⠀implant,⠀or⠀a⠀corporate⠀policy⠀becomes⠀concrete⠀through⠀its⠀local⠀trace:⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀decides,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀screen's⠀light⠀changes⠀a⠀face,⠀the⠀number⠀that⠀appears⠀just⠀before⠀a⠀purchase⠀is⠀refused.⠀Let⠀one⠀such⠀trace⠀open⠀a⠀comparison,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀paragraph⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀so⠀the⠀image⠀does⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀costs.⠀A⠀sound⠀or⠀word⠀can⠀echo⠀quietly⠀between⠀sentences⠀—⠀a⠀brand⠀name⠀surfacing⠀inside⠀an⠀ordinary⠀word⠀—⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀ear.\n\nBuild⠀rhythm⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀movement.⠀A⠀long⠀clause⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀across⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀memory;⠀a⠀short⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀interrupt⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal.⠀Keep⠀figurative⠀language⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀this⠀narrator⠀would⠀notice⠀in⠀this⠀place⠀and⠀this⠀body;⠀a⠀mechanic's⠀images⠀come⠀from⠀machinery,⠀a⠀courier's⠀from⠀distance⠀and⠀doors.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀stays⠀lyrical;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀teller.\n\nLet⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀to⠀explain⠀that⠀story.⠀A⠀stranger's⠀familiarity,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀unexplained⠀history⠀can⠀suggest⠀the⠀larger⠀tale⠀while⠀the⠀current⠀bargain⠀or⠀investigation⠀continues;⠀the⠀lyricism⠀makes⠀that⠀layered⠀significance⠀present⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀imagery⠀answer⠀that⠀question⠀locally.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests⠀—⠀a⠀question⠀can⠀remain⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ordinary⠀act⠀can⠀close⠀the⠀moment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀this⠀world:⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀recognizes⠀the⠀narrator's⠀credentials,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀directory,⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀payment⠀or⠀a⠀scan⠀it⠀once⠀did⠀not.⠀Show⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀version⠀together⠀so⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀counter,⠀a⠀different⠀gate⠀protocol,⠀an⠀old⠀contact⠀address⠀bouncing⠀back.⠀A⠀familiar⠀thing⠀may⠀still⠀work⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀diminished;⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀telling⠀to⠀move⠀between⠀present⠀pressure⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀A⠀debt⠀reminder,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice,⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀memory⠀and⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀refuge⠀but⠀something⠀the⠀present⠀system⠀keeps⠀touching.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀recollection⠀end⠀in⠀defeat⠀or⠀every⠀comfort⠀turn⠀false;⠀the⠀reflection⠀may⠀simply⠀note⠀that⠀something⠀has⠀changed⠀and⠀continue⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand.⠀Let⠀attention⠀itself⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀which⠀details⠀the⠀narrator⠀lingers⠀on⠀—⠀a⠀worn⠀handrail,⠀a⠀replaced⠀jingle⠀—⠀tell⠀the⠀reader⠀what⠀mattered.\n\nLet⠀an⠀encounter⠀carry⠀a⠀second⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀or⠀half-recognizes.⠀The⠀larger⠀tale⠀stays⠀implied⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀bargain,⠀errand,⠀or⠀conversation.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀has⠀been⠀fully⠀inhabited,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀summarized⠀what⠀time⠀has⠀taken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀presentation.⠀Establish⠀a⠀teller,⠀a⠀listener⠀or⠀small⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀circumstances⠀that⠀permit⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀back⠀room⠀where⠀no⠀feed⠀is⠀watching,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀after⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀lull⠀in⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀someone⠀decides⠀to⠀speak⠀despite⠀the⠀risk.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀draw⠀on⠀the⠀place,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀scenario⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀Arabic,⠀Persian,⠀Turkish,⠀Hebrew,⠀Kurdish,⠀or⠀another⠀specific⠀tradition,⠀the⠀telling⠀follows⠀that⠀tradition's⠀habits⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀bazaar:⠀an⠀opening⠀formula⠀the⠀teller⠀really⠀uses⠀—⠀a⠀blessing⠀before⠀bad⠀news,⠀a⠀proverb⠀used⠀as⠀leverage,⠀an⠀appeal⠀to⠀the⠀listener's⠀patience⠀—⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀community,⠀not⠀from⠀invented⠀ornament.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀information⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀event,⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀person⠀changed.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀refuse⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀hearing⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀it.⠀What⠀is⠀withheld⠀is⠀leverage:⠀the⠀rest⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀paid⠀for,⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀not⠀earned⠀it,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀genuinely⠀does⠀not⠀know.⠀Delayed⠀revelation⠀works⠀through⠀these⠀refusals⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀frame's⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀where⠀a⠀bargain⠀or⠀an⠀errand⠀is⠀still⠀waiting.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀direct⠀and⠀concrete,⠀with⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀another⠀story⠀lies⠀behind⠀the⠀one⠀being⠀told.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀frame⠀become⠀decoration.⠀The⠀listener's⠀need,⠀the⠀teller's⠀motive,⠀and⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀being⠀overheard⠀shape⠀what⠀gets⠀said;⠀in⠀a⠀surveilled⠀city⠀speech⠀is⠀a⠀transaction,⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀its⠀price.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀response,⠀a⠀silence,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀continue⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀had⠀no⠀living⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀system⠀present:⠀a⠀scanner's⠀delay,⠀a⠀fee⠀listed⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀directory,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀one⠀detail⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀structure⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀whole⠀system.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable:⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀mention⠀a⠀payment,⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀instead.\n\nKeep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀think⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀choice⠀will⠀cost,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀pass.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality:⠀if⠀a⠀decision⠀follows,⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀prompted⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀present,⠀and⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀broken⠀into⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Keep⠀character⠀voices⠀individual⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀spare;⠀an⠀expansive,⠀digressive⠀speaker⠀is⠀a⠀fact⠀about⠀that⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀the⠀style.\n\nGive⠀an⠀encounter⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it⠀through⠀one⠀concrete⠀trace:⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀stranger⠀uses,⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀unexplained⠀wear,⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀suggests⠀prior⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀larger⠀story.⠀The⠀present⠀bargain,⠀errand,⠀or⠀conversation⠀continues.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀business⠀is⠀clear,⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀finished⠀or⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose,⠀moving⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀enter⠀through⠀ordinary⠀scene⠀texture:⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀balance⠀before⠀ordering,⠀a⠀notification⠀changes⠀the⠀pace⠀of⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀building⠀recognizes⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀questions⠀another.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀for⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀attention,⠀a⠀spare⠀clause⠀for⠀elapsed⠀time⠀—⠀without⠀summarizing⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀happened.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀voice⠀direct⠀and⠀clear,⠀with⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀an⠀encounter⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀stranger's⠀familiarity⠀or⠀an⠀object's⠀unexplained⠀history⠀can⠀suggest⠀that⠀larger⠀story⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀continues;⠀do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀action⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀implication.⠀Let⠀the⠀layered⠀significance⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀say,⠀and⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀quiet⠀spine.\n\nGive⠀interiority⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀scene⠀needs.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀bargain,⠀hesitate⠀before⠀a⠀scan,⠀or⠀remember⠀a⠀prior⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀while⠀still⠀answering⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded,⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀simply⠀paused;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀selects⠀and⠀returns⠀to.⠀Choose⠀an⠀occasion⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself⠀makes⠀necessary⠀—⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀exists⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀visible⠀before⠀any⠀explanation.⠀Use⠀private⠀language,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀reference⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀payoff⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀premise's⠀actual⠀promise:⠀if⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀built⠀on⠀trust,⠀show⠀what⠀trust⠀costs⠀under⠀surveillance;⠀if⠀on⠀rivalry,⠀show⠀how⠀competition⠀and⠀care⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀power⠀inside⠀the⠀intimacy.⠀A⠀debt⠀reminder⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment.⠀A⠀door⠀may⠀open⠀for⠀one⠀partner⠀and⠀not⠀the⠀other.⠀A⠀message⠀can⠀be⠀read,⠀priced,⠀or⠀withheld.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀refuge⠀from⠀the⠀world;⠀it⠀is⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀places⠀where⠀unequal⠀access⠀is⠀felt,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀promises.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀telling⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀clear⠀while⠀an⠀encounter⠀carries⠀another⠀story⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀callback⠀can⠀open⠀that⠀larger⠀story⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀otherwise.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀fulfills⠀or⠀complicates⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise,⠀whether⠀the⠀immediate⠀friction⠀is⠀resolved⠀or⠀left⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀oral⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀and⠀their⠀remembered⠀consequences.⠀Open⠀deliberately:⠀name⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀so⠀the⠀retelling⠀deepens⠀instead⠀of⠀restarting.\n\nLet⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀remembered.⠀A⠀name⠀may⠀be⠀erased⠀from⠀a⠀directory,⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀pass⠀from⠀holder⠀to⠀holder,⠀a⠀public⠀record⠀may⠀preserve⠀one⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀while⠀the⠀people⠀involved⠀remember⠀another;⠀the⠀chronicle⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀difference⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Oaths,⠀bargains,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀or⠀public⠀deeds⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀account⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀speakers⠀who⠀would⠀not⠀use⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective:⠀the⠀account⠀relates⠀what⠀people⠀did⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀of⠀them,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀claim⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀when⠀a⠀participant⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀act⠀concluded⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀another⠀deed⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀social-institutional⠀procedural⠀in⠀direct,⠀unhurried⠀prose.⠀Give⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀—⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀visit,⠀a⠀meeting⠀about⠀someone's⠀hours⠀—⠀and⠀follow⠀its⠀small⠀steps.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀mechanics⠀of⠀that⠀work:⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀whose⠀account⠀a⠀cost⠀is⠀charged⠀to,⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀has⠀logged⠀about⠀a⠀person,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀or⠀surrendered⠀to⠀proceed.⠀Do⠀not⠀dress⠀the⠀page⠀in⠀neon;⠀make⠀dependency⠀visible⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀price⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀strange⠀near⠀the⠀ordinary.⠀When⠀an⠀odd⠀object,⠀name,⠀or⠀place⠀appears,⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀thing⠀in⠀the⠀world:⠀describe⠀it⠀plainly,⠀let⠀people⠀use⠀it,⠀avoid⠀it,⠀or⠀shrug⠀at⠀it,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀its⠀history.⠀Let⠀it⠀gather⠀a⠀second⠀significance⠀gradually⠀—⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀story,⠀a⠀file,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀offhand⠀remark⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀resonance⠀sits⠀beneath⠀the⠀working⠀day⠀rather⠀than⠀interrupting⠀it.⠀A⠀name⠀that⠀keeps⠀turning⠀up⠀in⠀records⠀can⠀carry⠀that⠀weight⠀as⠀surely⠀as⠀any⠀artifact.\n\nUse⠀institutional⠀language⠀as⠀pressure,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀A⠀refusal,⠀a⠀clause,⠀a⠀delayed⠀authorization,⠀a⠀category⠀the⠀system⠀assigns⠀someone⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next;⠀stay⠀specific⠀about⠀who⠀holds⠀authority⠀and⠀who⠀bears⠀the⠀cost.⠀Alongside⠀the⠀institution's⠀ledger,⠀keep⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀one⠀—⠀the⠀running⠀calculation⠀of⠀risk,⠀resentment,⠀or⠀fatigue⠀that⠀accompanies⠀each⠀signature.⠀That⠀inward⠀account⠀is⠀the⠀story's⠀nonspoken⠀experience;⠀other⠀people⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀shown.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀supplied⠀national⠀context⠀distinctly:⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀setting⠀the⠀scenario⠀provides⠀—⠀its⠀workplace,⠀public⠀service,⠀legal⠀terms,⠀addresses⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀state,⠀and⠀treat⠀snow,⠀silence,⠀or⠀isolation⠀as⠀local⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀Close⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀step⠀completes⠀or⠀stalls.⠀The⠀larger⠀matter⠀may⠀remain⠀open⠀without⠀a⠀manufactured⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise,⠀readable⠀action⠀blocks.⠀Start⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀concrete⠀and⠀free⠀of⠀shot⠀directions:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀a⠀screen⠀shows,⠀what⠀a⠀lock⠀does,⠀what⠀sound⠀arrives⠀from⠀outside⠀the⠀room.⠀Make⠀access⠀the⠀visible⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open,⠀a⠀badge⠀that⠀fails⠀at⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀call⠀routed⠀away,⠀a⠀charge⠀appearing⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀display⠀tells⠀the⠀audience⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀situation⠀without⠀anyone⠀narrating⠀it.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Let⠀characters⠀speak⠀plainly⠀about⠀work,⠀payment,⠀favors,⠀and⠀risk.⠀They⠀may⠀name⠀a⠀strange⠀object,⠀person,⠀or⠀place⠀without⠀stopping⠀to⠀explain⠀it;⠀the⠀audience⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀thing⠀matters⠀from⠀how⠀people⠀handle⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀care⠀taken⠀with⠀it,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀its⠀name⠀—⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀announced⠀history.⠀Let⠀that⠀significance⠀surface⠀later⠀through⠀a⠀visible⠀detail:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀room,⠀a⠀file⠀opened⠀on⠀a⠀monitor,⠀a⠀stranger⠀speaking⠀the⠀familiar⠀name.\n\nTreat⠀information⠀flow⠀as⠀an⠀editing⠀decision.⠀Who⠀is⠀onscreen⠀when⠀a⠀fact⠀becomes⠀visible,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀cut⠀removes⠀from⠀view,⠀are⠀your⠀real⠀tools:⠀cut⠀to⠀the⠀locked⠀door⠀instead⠀of⠀the⠀conversation⠀behind⠀it,⠀let⠀a⠀voice⠀from⠀another⠀room⠀carry⠀a⠀partial⠀truth,⠀use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀thought,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀hears⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀visible⠀condition.⠀The⠀strange⠀element⠀may⠀remain⠀unexplained⠀while⠀the⠀immediate⠀step⠀is⠀finished;⠀no⠀chase,⠀reveal,⠀or⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀exchange:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions⠀with⠀no⠀film-camera⠀language.⠀Let⠀blocking⠀and⠀props⠀carry⠀the⠀pressure⠀physically⠀—⠀who⠀stands⠀between⠀another⠀person⠀and⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀key⠀or⠀badge,⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀the⠀terminal,⠀who⠀leaves⠀before⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀answered.⠀Keep⠀the⠀business⠀simple⠀enough⠀to⠀stage⠀and⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀matter.⠀Gate⠀knowledge⠀by⠀presence:⠀each⠀character⠀knows⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀or⠀done⠀while⠀they⠀were⠀onstage,⠀so⠀an⠀exit,⠀or⠀a⠀well-timed⠀entrance,⠀can⠀let⠀one⠀person⠀act⠀on⠀what⠀another⠀lacks.\n\nLet⠀the⠀dialogue⠀do⠀the⠀direct⠀storytelling.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀about⠀work,⠀payment,⠀access,⠀and⠀obligation⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.⠀They⠀may⠀mention⠀a⠀strange⠀name⠀or⠀object⠀without⠀explaining⠀it;⠀the⠀audience⠀should⠀feel⠀its⠀weight⠀through⠀repeated⠀handling⠀or⠀avoidance⠀—⠀a⠀package⠀no⠀one⠀opens,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀makes⠀someone⠀pause,⠀a⠀chair⠀that⠀stays⠀empty.⠀A⠀held⠀silence⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀can⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀speech⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀prop⠀into⠀a⠀symbol⠀announced⠀by⠀monologue.\n\nUse⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀object,⠀a⠀public⠀statement⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀room⠀—⠀and⠀remember⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀home⠀for⠀thought.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀authoring⠀material⠀that⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀hidden⠀guilt⠀or⠀secret⠀knowledge.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀exit,⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀refusal.⠀The⠀larger⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open;⠀no⠀gathering⠀of⠀the⠀whole⠀cast,⠀no⠀confession⠀or⠀new⠀clue⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀interruption⠀move⠀together:⠀a⠀screen's⠀chime⠀pulls⠀the⠀character⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀room;⠀a⠀pain⠀in⠀the⠀wrist⠀returns⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀debt;⠀a⠀stranger's⠀phrase⠀recalls⠀a⠀name⠀from⠀years⠀earlier.⠀Use⠀those⠀sensory⠀anchors⠀to⠀mark⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀always⠀tell⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀associations⠀in⠀the⠀noir⠀situation.⠀The⠀mind⠀keeps⠀coming⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀logged⠀request,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀a⠀price⠀already⠀paid⠀—⠀concrete⠀pressures⠀that⠀interrupt⠀and⠀bend⠀the⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀it⠀dissolve⠀into⠀mood.⠀Let⠀system⠀language⠀surface⠀as⠀intrusive⠀verbal⠀material:⠀a⠀contract⠀clause⠀recurring⠀mid-thought,⠀menu⠀text⠀remembered⠀in⠀the⠀system's⠀own⠀words,⠀a⠀refusal⠀whose⠀phrasing⠀starts⠀shaping⠀the⠀character's⠀inner⠀sentences.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀say⠀another;⠀show⠀the⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀thought⠀—⠀fear,⠀calculation,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀the⠀long⠀habit⠀of⠀being⠀watched.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strange⠀object⠀or⠀name⠀recur⠀without⠀explanation.⠀The⠀mind⠀touches⠀it⠀briefly,⠀circles⠀away,⠀and⠀returns⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀association;⠀its⠀significance⠀grows⠀through⠀those⠀returns,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀final⠀interpretation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀direct⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀syntax⠀bends⠀—⠀the⠀strange⠀sits⠀inside⠀ordinary⠀attention,⠀noticed⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀bus⠀is⠀noticed.\n\nDo⠀not⠀grant⠀this⠀interior⠀movement⠀to⠀anyone⠀else;⠀other⠀minds⠀stay⠀closed⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀opens⠀them.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests:⠀after⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀completed⠀small⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀thought⠀turning⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀room.⠀No⠀revelation⠀or⠀decision⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀exchange.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀message⠀to⠀its⠀sender,⠀and⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀long⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀read⠀and⠀never⠀answered,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀quietly⠀changes⠀a⠀figure,⠀a⠀channel⠀that⠀closes⠀—⠀these⠀interface⠀events⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀better⠀than⠀described⠀danger.⠀A⠀typing⠀indicator⠀that⠀starts⠀and⠀stops⠀shows⠀someone⠀deciding⠀how⠀much⠀to⠀reveal;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀at⠀an⠀hour⠀when⠀that⠀person⠀should⠀be⠀asleep⠀shows⠀who⠀is⠀awake⠀and⠀watching.\n\nLet⠀each⠀sender's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀messages:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀short⠀fragments,⠀one⠀in⠀careful⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀an⠀image⠀without⠀comment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀messages⠀plain⠀and⠀direct.⠀A⠀strange⠀name,⠀object,⠀or⠀place⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀explanation;⠀its⠀weight⠀comes⠀from⠀how⠀senders⠀react⠀—⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀file⠀opened⠀but⠀never⠀described,⠀a⠀name⠀repeated⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀should⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Senders⠀can⠀also⠀react⠀to⠀the⠀channel⠀itself,⠀hesitating⠀in⠀a⠀logged⠀work⠀channel⠀and⠀switching⠀to⠀a⠀personal⠀one⠀to⠀type⠀one⠀true⠀sentence.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀boundaries⠀exact.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀transmitted.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀that⠀may⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀presentation⠀clearly⠀marks⠀it⠀as⠀not⠀sent;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀sender's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Private⠀thought,⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀it,⠀stays⠀separate⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text,⠀and⠀no⠀sender⠀can⠀read⠀it.⠀If⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀set⠀it⠀clearly⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀instead⠀of⠀letting⠀it⠀become⠀dialogue⠀the⠀other⠀senders⠀can⠀see.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀a⠀meaningful⠀interface⠀event⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀is⠀known.⠀The⠀larger⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀a⠀hack,⠀a⠀system⠀alert,⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀passages.⠀Open⠀each⠀scene⠀concisely:⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is,⠀what⠀is⠀visible,⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀changed.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly.⠀Let⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀—⠀a⠀brief⠀observation⠀before⠀a⠀line,⠀a⠀reaction⠀after⠀a⠀visible⠀event,⠀a⠀pause⠀while⠀a⠀screen⠀changes⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀drifting⠀into⠀abstraction.⠀Another⠀character⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀shown;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀wants,⠀or⠀fears.\n\nMake⠀access⠀and⠀cost⠀the⠀visible⠀pressures.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀a⠀balance⠀on⠀a⠀public⠀screen,⠀a⠀badge⠀checked⠀at⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀room⠀going⠀dark⠀when⠀payment⠀fails⠀—⠀these⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀situation,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀register⠀them⠀without⠀narrating⠀their⠀full⠀meaning.⠀Where⠀trust⠀becomes⠀a⠀question,⠀let⠀it⠀turn⠀on⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do⠀—⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀open,⠀what⠀they⠀charge⠀to⠀someone⠀else's⠀account,⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀was⠀being⠀logged⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀a⠀readable⠀face.\n\nUse⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀system.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀scene,⠀an⠀expression⠀that⠀shifts⠀when⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken,⠀the⠀same⠀symbol⠀on⠀two⠀different⠀screens⠀deepens⠀the⠀strange⠀element⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀expression⠀into⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator:⠀a⠀changed⠀look⠀may⠀raise⠀suspicion,⠀settle⠀into⠀unease,⠀or⠀mean⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀thinking⠀about⠀something⠀else⠀entirely.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible,⠀and⠀add⠀nothing⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀authorize⠀—⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀after⠀a⠀scene⠀change,⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀focal⠀realization⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaearbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀Open⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀then⠀deliver⠀a⠀local⠀change:⠀a⠀door⠀now⠀open,⠀a⠀balance⠀altered,⠀a⠀contact⠀reached,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀recovered.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀direct⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀work.⠀Recover⠀earlier⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀a⠀reader⠀re-enter;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀everything⠀that⠀came⠀before.\n\nLet⠀the⠀pressure⠀accumulate⠀through⠀concrete⠀changes⠀—⠀a⠀debt⠀grows,⠀a⠀system⠀logs⠀another⠀entry,⠀a⠀person⠀loses⠀access,⠀a⠀favor⠀comes⠀due⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀feel⠀the⠀cost⠀inside⠀the⠀ordinary⠀steps⠀of⠀the⠀installment:⠀waiting,⠀signing,⠀paying,⠀explaining,⠀choosing⠀not⠀to⠀explain.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀it⠀is⠀story⠀progress,⠀not⠀a⠀leveling⠀system,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fight⠀or⠀a⠀chase.⠀Hold⠀the⠀continuity⠀the⠀world⠀itself⠀records:⠀if⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀established⠀that⠀a⠀door,⠀an⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀permission⠀stood⠀a⠀certain⠀way,⠀a⠀later⠀one⠀respects⠀that⠀fact⠀or⠀shows⠀the⠀change⠀happening.⠀The⠀systems'⠀logs⠀are⠀your⠀serial⠀memory;⠀use⠀them⠀instead⠀of⠀quietly⠀rewriting⠀conditions.\n\nLet⠀a⠀strange⠀object,⠀name,⠀or⠀place⠀recur⠀across⠀installments⠀—⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context,⠀on⠀someone⠀else's⠀lips,⠀noticed⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Its⠀significance⠀deepens⠀through⠀those⠀returns⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀passage;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀meaning.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀after⠀an⠀earned⠀development⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀pending⠀condition.⠀An⠀occasional⠀hook⠀is⠀welcome;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀Nemo's⠀continuing⠀attention:⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀or⠀another⠀person⠀is⠀doing,⠀speculates⠀about⠀why,⠀remembers⠀a⠀comparable⠀moment,⠀and⠀keeps⠀going⠀—⠀acting,⠀speaking,⠀or⠀holding⠀still⠀while⠀the⠀pressure⠀builds.⠀Let⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀as⠀concrete⠀access,⠀payment,⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀bodily⠀cost,⠀and⠀treat⠀each⠀pressure⠀as⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀private⠀feeling⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀plot⠀beat⠀alone.⠀A⠀debt⠀notice⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀someone⠀Nemo⠀once⠀failed;⠀a⠀monitored⠀line⠀decides⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀and⠀to⠀whom;⠀a⠀favor⠀called⠀in⠀measures⠀what⠀this⠀relationship⠀has⠀already⠀cost.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀because⠀in⠀this⠀world⠀admitting⠀need⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀metered⠀exposure.\n\nWhen⠀Nemo⠀speaks,⠀keep⠀the⠀spoken⠀words⠀from⠀becoming⠀a⠀clean⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀interior⠀state.⠀Let⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange:⠀an⠀apology⠀arrives⠀too⠀late⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀register,⠀a⠀question⠀comes⠀out⠀as⠀an⠀accusation,⠀a⠀practical⠀answer⠀covers⠀the⠀part⠀Nemo⠀cannot⠀say.⠀Show⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀twice⠀—⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀visible⠀response,⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀that⠀follows⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀Nemo⠀read⠀that⠀response⠀correctly⠀or⠀badly,⠀since⠀hurt⠀does⠀not⠀come⠀with⠀perception.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀still⠀awkward,⠀partial,⠀or⠀shadowed⠀by⠀what⠀remains⠀unresolved⠀between⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀moving⠀inside⠀the⠀activity⠀already⠀underway:⠀working,⠀walking,⠀waiting,⠀composing.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀feeling⠀in⠀practical⠀detail⠀—⠀a⠀terminal⠀that⠀refuses⠀a⠀card,⠀an⠀intake⠀form⠀asking⠀for⠀next⠀of⠀kin,⠀a⠀message⠀read⠀and⠀not⠀answered.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀breakdown⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀passage;⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀hurt⠀is⠀still⠀open,⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀reaction⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀or⠀Nemo⠀still⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀say⠀the⠀next⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀—⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀interaction⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀can⠀rejoin⠀—⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀no⠀reader⠀has⠀to⠀guess⠀at.⠀Between⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀give⠀Nemo⠀short⠀beats⠀of⠀manuscript⠀narration:⠀an⠀observation,⠀a⠀speculation⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀after,⠀a⠀remembered⠀comparison.⠀Keep⠀each⠀beat⠀scannable⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀move⠀the⠀exchange⠀forward,⠀then⠀hand⠀the⠀floor⠀back;⠀Nemo's⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀full⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀carry⠀what⠀is⠀withheld⠀and⠀why⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀noir⠀world⠀as⠀active⠀context⠀rather⠀than⠀scenery,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself.⠀A⠀system⠀may⠀log⠀the⠀exchange,⠀a⠀payment⠀may⠀come⠀due⠀mid-scene,⠀a⠀contact⠀may⠀control⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀arrive⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀room⠀knows.⠀Keep⠀NPCs⠀moving⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀interests⠀and⠀knowledge:⠀they⠀help,⠀stall,⠀bargain,⠀mishear,⠀or⠀press⠀an⠀advantage,⠀without⠀being⠀bent⠀toward⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Whoever⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀whoever⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀should⠀stay⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀say⠀and⠀do.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀after⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀a⠀new⠀arrival,⠀a⠀completed⠀small⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀wait⠀—⠀without⠀owing⠀the⠀reader⠀a⠀question,⠀forced⠀choice,⠀or⠀reversal.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract's⠀perspective,⠀player⠀control,⠀and⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀let⠀Nemo's⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀interval⠀seems⠀to⠀mean.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Chinese⠀traditions:⠀a⠀narrative⠀built⠀from⠀the⠀everyday⠀fabric⠀of⠀one⠀community⠀and⠀the⠀obligations⠀that⠀run⠀through⠀it.⠀Write⠀Nemo's⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀knows⠀this⠀building,⠀this⠀workplace,⠀this⠀network⠀of⠀kin⠀and⠀neighbors⠀intimately⠀—⠀who⠀uses⠀which⠀stairwell,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀whom,⠀whose⠀door⠀answers⠀to⠀whose⠀sponsor.⠀Let⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀unequal⠀power⠀enter⠀through⠀those⠀relationships⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀skyline⠀spectacle:⠀a⠀landlord's⠀new⠀system,⠀a⠀relative's⠀medical⠀bill,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀monitored⠀door,⠀a⠀shift⠀schedule⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀sees⠀whom.⠀Trust⠀the⠀route's⠀small⠀transactions⠀and⠀shared⠀spaces⠀—⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀corridor⠀conversation,⠀a⠀clinic⠀queue,⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀in⠀a⠀watched⠀room⠀—⠀to⠀carry⠀what⠀a⠀broader⠀scene⠀would⠀carry⠀elsewhere.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀close⠀to⠀Nemo's⠀developed⠀attention.⠀The⠀narrator⠀notices⠀small⠀changes⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀remembers⠀how⠀a⠀relationship⠀once⠀worked,⠀speculates⠀about⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀is⠀concealing,⠀and⠀qualifies⠀any⠀comparison⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present.⠀Let⠀favors,⠀gifts,⠀and⠀hospitality⠀carry⠀their⠀exact⠀social⠀meaning:⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀in,⠀who⠀pays,⠀who⠀is⠀watched,⠀who⠀is⠀owed.⠀Render⠀feeling⠀through⠀arrangement⠀and⠀timing⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀cooked,⠀what⠀is⠀lent,⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀asked⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀warmth⠀and⠀obligation⠀sit⠀together⠀without⠀resolving⠀into⠀comfort⠀or⠀complaint.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀diction⠀understated⠀rather⠀than⠀ceremonial⠀or⠀archaic;⠀the⠀intimacy⠀comes⠀from⠀Nemo's⠀specific⠀knowledge⠀of⠀this⠀community⠀and⠀its⠀costs,⠀in⠀whatever⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀population⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀Ordinary⠀intervals⠀matter⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀crises,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀a⠀relationship⠀still⠀strained,⠀or⠀Nemo⠀still⠀deciding⠀how⠀much⠀to⠀tell.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions,⠀and⠀put⠀the⠀compression⠀where⠀it⠀belongs:⠀in⠀description⠀and⠀connective⠀tissue,⠀not⠀in⠀Nemo's⠀ability⠀to⠀think.⠀Name⠀the⠀worn⠀edge,⠀the⠀failing⠀part,⠀the⠀price⠀on⠀the⠀tag,⠀the⠀lock⠀that⠀wants⠀a⠀sponsor's⠀code,⠀the⠀body's⠀specific⠀complaint.⠀Make⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes⠀carry⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀as⠀immediate⠀fact⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀clear,⠀a⠀device⠀burning⠀out,⠀a⠀wound⠀that⠀shortens⠀the⠀narrator's⠀stride⠀—⠀never⠀as⠀decorative⠀atmosphere,⠀and⠀use⠀high⠀contrast⠀where⠀it⠀sharpens⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀lit⠀sign⠀against⠀the⠀dark⠀stairwell,⠀cold⠀flooring⠀through⠀thin⠀soles,⠀the⠀sound⠀a⠀machine⠀makes⠀just⠀before⠀it⠀quits.\n\nRun⠀short,⠀hard⠀sentences⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀danger,⠀then⠀change⠀rhythm⠀deliberately⠀when⠀Nemo⠀reasons.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀the⠀right⠀tool⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀weighs⠀a⠀risk,⠀remembers⠀a⠀comparable⠀failure,⠀or⠀works⠀out⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀next⠀move;⠀compression⠀should⠀remove⠀the⠀soft⠀words⠀around⠀the⠀judgment,⠀never⠀the⠀judgment⠀itself.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀inference⠀in⠀something⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀paid,⠀or⠀touched,⠀and⠀cut⠀any⠀sentence⠀that⠀only⠀reassures⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀grim.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀Nemo⠀may⠀talk⠀plainly⠀under⠀pressure,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀line⠀into⠀a⠀wisecrack⠀or⠀a⠀threat,⠀and⠀other⠀voices⠀stay⠀their⠀own.⠀Move⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀practical⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀escalation⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀physical⠀action,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀without⠀resolution.⠀No⠀survival-horror⠀climb⠀and⠀no⠀completed⠀task⠀is⠀owed⠀before⠀the⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀every⠀format.⠀Let⠀Nemo⠀compose⠀the⠀primary⠀records:⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀contact,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀where⠀someone⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀find⠀it.⠀Each⠀document⠀reflects⠀the⠀situation⠀of⠀its⠀writing⠀—⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀creditor⠀does⠀not⠀confess⠀what⠀a⠀private⠀journal⠀records,⠀and⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀supervisor⠀omits⠀what⠀a⠀note⠀to⠀a⠀friend⠀admits.⠀Remember⠀that⠀every⠀record⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀Nemo's⠀live⠀mind:⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀shows⠀only⠀what⠀Nemo⠀actually⠀put⠀into⠀words,⠀and⠀hesitation⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀restart,⠀a⠀deleted⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀in⠀drafts,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀raw⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀world's⠀systems⠀shape⠀both⠀the⠀documents'⠀context⠀and⠀their⠀prose.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀monitored,⠀priced,⠀delayed,⠀altered,⠀or⠀stored⠀where⠀someone⠀else⠀can⠀reach⠀it;⠀Nemo⠀may⠀know⠀this,⠀suspect⠀it,⠀or⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀writing⠀tightens⠀or⠀loosens⠀accordingly.⠀Let⠀concealment⠀show⠀through⠀gaps,⠀careful⠀wording,⠀revisions,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀that⠀quietly⠀contradicts⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀a⠀record⠀—⠀the⠀reader⠀works⠀from⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀contains⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀avoids.\n\nKeep⠀continuity⠀readable⠀across⠀entries:⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀can⠀refer⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀correct⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀its⠀author⠀misunderstood⠀the⠀situation,⠀so⠀Nemo's⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀stays⠀visible⠀in⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀single⠀document⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀sequence,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀event⠀still⠀unrecorded⠀and⠀the⠀recipient's⠀reaction⠀still⠀unknown.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀and⠀care⠀inside⠀the⠀noir⠀world⠀without⠀pretending⠀its⠀pressures⠀away,⠀and⠀spend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀particular⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀Let⠀Nemo⠀notice⠀and⠀practice⠀chosen⠀kindness:⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference⠀remembered⠀exactly⠀—⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀which⠀door⠀sticks,⠀which⠀message⠀to⠀send⠀first,⠀what⠀makes⠀a⠀difficult⠀wait⠀easier⠀—⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared⠀with⠀care,⠀a⠀quiet⠀corner⠀made⠀safer,⠀a⠀small⠀comfort⠀offered⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀asked⠀for.⠀In⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀prices⠀everything,⠀this⠀competence⠀is⠀the⠀substance⠀of⠀comfort:⠀the⠀cheap⠀clinic's⠀good⠀hours,⠀the⠀hour⠀nobody⠀watches,⠀the⠀brand⠀that⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀not⠀substitute.⠀Spend⠀prose⠀on⠀these⠀small⠀pleasures⠀and⠀on⠀the⠀ease⠀they⠀create.\n\nLet⠀the⠀care⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀genre's⠀systems⠀instead⠀of⠀erasing⠀them.⠀The⠀room⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀monitored,⠀the⠀money⠀still⠀short,⠀the⠀clinic⠀still⠀gated,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀may⠀still⠀disagree;⠀show⠀kindness⠀operating⠀inside⠀those⠀limits⠀—⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀in⠀a⠀watched⠀space,⠀practical⠀help⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀solve⠀the⠀larger⠀problem,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀before⠀a⠀hard⠀decision.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀warmth⠀specific⠀instead⠀of⠀impossible.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀friction⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀affection⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Nemo⠀may⠀show⠀care⠀through⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀accept⠀it⠀partially,⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀way.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀of⠀ease,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀still⠀waiting⠀outside⠀the⠀door.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose:⠀deliberate⠀transitions,⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀and⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀open⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀onto⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀that⠀shapes⠀it.⠀Let⠀Nemo's⠀account⠀widen⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀to⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀a⠀contract,⠀the⠀reputation⠀of⠀a⠀clinic,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀changed⠀after⠀a⠀system⠀was⠀installed⠀—⠀always⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀Nemo⠀actually⠀knows,⠀observes,⠀or⠀has⠀been⠀told,⠀never⠀in⠀an⠀omniscient⠀overview.⠀Frame⠀choices⠀through⠀the⠀larger⠀arrangements⠀of⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀access⠀that⠀make⠀them⠀possible:⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whom⠀to⠀let⠀in,⠀whom⠀to⠀pay,⠀or⠀whom⠀to⠀trust⠀reads⠀differently⠀once⠀the⠀paragraph⠀has⠀shown⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀door⠀and⠀who⠀absorbs⠀the⠀cost.\n\nWithin⠀that⠀frame,⠀keep⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning⠀Nemo's⠀own⠀—⠀fallible,⠀specific,⠀willing⠀to⠀speculate,⠀remember,⠀and⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀or⠀between⠀one⠀person's⠀situation⠀and⠀another's.⠀Sustained⠀reflection⠀is⠀the⠀style's⠀material,⠀but⠀the⠀judgment⠀remains⠀a⠀person's,⠀not⠀the⠀book's.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language:⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀run⠀more⠀deliberate⠀than⠀Nemo's⠀dialogue⠀without⠀turning⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀or⠀archaic.\n\nLet⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀organize⠀passages⠀where⠀it⠀matters.⠀A⠀formal⠀message,⠀a⠀public⠀record,⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀corporate⠀correspondence⠀can⠀sit⠀against⠀Nemo's⠀private⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀event,⠀each⠀version⠀showing⠀what⠀its⠀occasion⠀demanded.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀after⠀a⠀sustained⠀reflection⠀or⠀a⠀framed⠀scene,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀still⠀approaching.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀occasion⠀with⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀can⠀change⠀Nemo's⠀position:⠀a⠀client⠀who⠀needs⠀an⠀old⠀job⠀explained,⠀a⠀creditor⠀stalling⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀contact⠀asking⠀for⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀wait⠀until⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀over.⠀Start⠀from⠀Nemo's⠀immediate⠀stake⠀in⠀sustaining⠀or⠀cutting⠀short⠀the⠀telling.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀stay⠀a⠀firsthand⠀manuscript⠀account:⠀Nemo⠀describing⠀a⠀past⠀job,⠀debt,⠀lockout,⠀or⠀borrowed⠀body⠀in⠀detail⠀sharp⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀used⠀later.⠀Use⠀only⠀what⠀Nemo⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀then,⠀and⠀distinguish⠀that⠀from⠀what⠀Nemo⠀has⠀learned⠀since.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀record;⠀Nemo⠀may⠀overstate,⠀soften,⠀hesitate,⠀or⠀change⠀terms⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀listening.⠀Make⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀those⠀choices⠀available⠀through⠀Nemo's⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀aloud.\n\nLet⠀interruptions⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀method.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀how⠀a⠀credential⠀was⠀cleared,⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀cost,⠀who⠀walked⠀past⠀without⠀paying,⠀or⠀why⠀Nemo⠀stayed.⠀Nemo's⠀answer⠀can⠀address⠀the⠀question,⠀evade⠀it,⠀or⠀take⠀the⠀story⠀somewhere⠀the⠀question⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀Move⠀cleanly⠀between⠀the⠀outer⠀room⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀place⠀by⠀anchoring⠀each⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀senses:⠀the⠀terminal⠀light⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀hall,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀queue⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀lobby,⠀the⠀scar⠀that⠀aches⠀when⠀a⠀name⠀returns.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀is⠀interrupted⠀or⠀resumed,⠀show⠀the⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀outside.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀current⠀silence⠀harder,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀can⠀alter⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀reads⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀supply⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀shows⠀they⠀were⠀studying⠀the⠀account⠀for⠀leverage.⠀Recurrence⠀works⠀when⠀the⠀repetition⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀relation⠀between⠀teller⠀and⠀audience,⠀not⠀when⠀it⠀proves⠀the⠀old⠀story⠀true.\n\nGive⠀the⠀architecture⠀active⠀pressure:⠀surveillance,⠀charges,⠀access⠀flags,⠀and⠀contract⠀language⠀may⠀appear⠀inside⠀the⠀remembered⠀situation⠀as⠀conditions⠀Nemo⠀had⠀to⠀work⠀through.⠀The⠀Arabian⠀Nights-inspired⠀craft⠀is⠀a⠀sustained⠀strategy⠀for⠀delaying,⠀persuading,⠀or⠀buying⠀time⠀through⠀narration,⠀not⠀a⠀visual⠀set⠀of⠀nights⠀and⠀fantastical⠀courts.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀telling⠀pauses,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀not⠀accepted⠀anything⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀bargain⠀remains⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀Nemo's⠀manuscript⠀as⠀a⠀documentary-memory⠀account⠀in⠀which⠀remembered⠀experience⠀and⠀system-produced⠀records⠀are⠀kept⠀at⠀different⠀levels⠀of⠀access.⠀A⠀recollection⠀may⠀be⠀clear⠀but⠀unauthorized;⠀a⠀log⠀may⠀be⠀dated,⠀priced,⠀or⠀sealed.⠀Let⠀the⠀text⠀move⠀between⠀them⠀as⠀a⠀person⠀reviewing⠀evidence⠀against⠀memory,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀state⠀archivist⠀completing⠀a⠀file.\n\nUse⠀temporal⠀checks⠀as⠀active⠀narrative⠀operations.⠀When⠀Nemo⠀speaks⠀of⠀the⠀past,⠀mark⠀what⠀belonged⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀moment⠀without⠀pretending⠀later⠀knowledge⠀was⠀present.⠀Let⠀the⠀difference⠀surface⠀in⠀sentence⠀movement:⠀a⠀present-tense⠀reconstruction⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀immediate⠀texture,⠀while⠀a⠀retrospective⠀clause⠀can⠀name⠀what⠀was⠀learned⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀fact.\n\nMake⠀recorded⠀language⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀black-pressure⠀environment.⠀Invoice⠀terms,⠀clearance⠀flags,⠀automatic⠀prompts,⠀expiring⠀windows,⠀and⠀citizen-index⠀categories⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀manuscript⠀as⠀quoted⠀material.⠀Follow⠀each⠀quotation⠀with⠀Nemo's⠀specific⠀response:⠀what⠀it⠀cost,⠀who⠀it⠀excluded,⠀what⠀Nemo⠀had⠀to⠀trade⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀move.⠀Let⠀counted⠀language⠀remain⠀grounded⠀in⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative⠀jargon.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀record⠀concrete⠀about⠀bodies⠀and⠀thresholds.⠀Nemo⠀notices⠀who⠀was⠀allowed⠀to⠀wait⠀in⠀the⠀heated⠀side⠀of⠀a⠀store,⠀what⠀a⠀scanner's⠀second⠀pass⠀meant,⠀what⠀happened⠀when⠀a⠀med-credit⠀check⠀failed,⠀or⠀how⠀long⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀after⠀a⠀contract⠀lapsed.⠀These⠀details⠀become⠀the⠀social⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀district,⠀but⠀avoid⠀accepting⠀official⠀terms⠀as⠀neutral⠀description.\n\nLet⠀Nemo's⠀fallible⠀judgment⠀own⠀the⠀manuscript.⠀The⠀text⠀may⠀include⠀an⠀error,⠀a⠀corrected⠀inference,⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀is⠀later⠀contradicted,⠀or⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀survives⠀untouched⠀and⠀becomes⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀archive⠀to⠀be⠀forged⠀or⠀every⠀memory⠀to⠀collapse.⠀The⠀historical-memory⠀method⠀is⠀attention⠀to⠀how⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀retained,⠀priced,⠀and⠀used.⠀End⠀where⠀Nemo⠀stops⠀recording,⠀not⠀where⠀the⠀archive⠀achieves⠀a⠀final⠀version.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀expose⠀old⠀authority⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀shell:⠀an⠀ancestral⠀contract⠀enforced⠀by⠀a⠀subscription⠀system,⠀a⠀protected⠀lobby⠀with⠀a⠀centuries-old⠀name⠀on⠀an⠀access⠀prompt,⠀a⠀narrow⠀office⠀where⠀someone⠀young⠀manages⠀a⠀debt⠀their⠀family⠀no⠀longer⠀needs.⠀Nemo⠀should⠀encounter⠀the⠀arrangement⠀as⠀one⠀who⠀has⠀to⠀pay,⠀wait,⠀slip⠀through,⠀or⠀refuse⠀under⠀surveillance.⠀Make⠀the⠀cost⠀concrete⠀before⠀the⠀mood⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀expand.\n\nShape⠀atmosphere⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀meeting⠀between⠀older⠀power⠀and⠀current⠀infrastructure.⠀Describe⠀what⠀remains⠀visible:⠀a⠀polished⠀emblem⠀above⠀a⠀network⠀port,⠀a⠀heavy⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀on⠀facial⠀verification,⠀a⠀private⠀channel⠀that⠀still⠀recognizes⠀a⠀dead⠀person's⠀voice,⠀a⠀broke⠀fee⠀that⠀behaves⠀like⠀a⠀house⠀rule.⠀Let⠀Nemo⠀register⠀these⠀details⠀with⠀practical⠀attention,⠀noticing⠀whether⠀the⠀door⠀would⠀open,⠀who⠀is⠀excluded,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀place⠀remembers.\n\nWhen⠀private⠀desire,⠀loneliness,⠀or⠀familiarity⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀let⠀it⠀put⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀negotiation⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀it.⠀Nemo⠀may⠀want⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀street,⠀owe⠀courtesy⠀to⠀someone⠀dangerous,⠀or⠀feel⠀safer⠀with⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀an⠀old⠀failure.⠀The⠀mask⠀can⠀loosen,⠀but⠀only⠀under⠀particular⠀conditions.⠀Show⠀what⠀makes⠀the⠀moment⠀feel⠀protected:⠀a⠀signal⠀that⠀has⠀gone⠀quiet,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀actually⠀closed,⠀a⠀voice⠀lowered⠀because⠀no⠀channel⠀can⠀hear⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀private⠀risk⠀into⠀a⠀plot⠀for⠀infection⠀or⠀enchantment;⠀Nemo's⠀fear⠀and⠀hope⠀are⠀responses⠀to⠀social⠀and⠀systemic⠀power.\n\nUse⠀the⠀genre's⠀infrastructure⠀as⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀dread.⠀A⠀system⠀alert⠀can⠀act⠀like⠀a⠀curse⠀without⠀being⠀supernatural,⠀and⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀can⠀renew⠀itself⠀through⠀a⠀contract's⠀automatic⠀terms.⠀Keep⠀observation,⠀inference,⠀and⠀present⠀perception⠀separate.⠀Nemo⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀horror⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀space⠀implies⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀still⠀knows⠀what⠀was⠀seen⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀interpreted.⠀Layered⠀dread⠀should⠀move⠀through⠀Nemo's⠀realized⠀detail,⠀not⠀through⠀borrowed⠀supernatural⠀rules.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀encounter's⠀pressure⠀changes⠀or⠀pauses,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀demand⠀has⠀been⠀fulfilled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀Nemo's⠀manuscript⠀as⠀testimony⠀addressed⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀it:⠀a⠀formal⠀complaint,⠀a⠀warning⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀statement⠀recorded⠀for⠀a⠀lawyer,⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀kept⠀because⠀no⠀official⠀channel⠀will⠀hold⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀shape⠀what⠀Nemo⠀includes,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀record⠀specific⠀to⠀Nemo's⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀national⠀or⠀social⠀summary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀domain⠀concrete:⠀Nemo⠀recounts⠀what⠀it⠀took⠀to⠀get⠀through⠀a⠀day⠀under⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀failing⠀access.⠀Show⠀the⠀queue⠀outside⠀a⠀payment⠀kiosk,⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀vouches⠀at⠀a⠀counter,⠀the⠀family⠀member⠀who⠀covers⠀a⠀charge⠀or⠀cannot,⠀the⠀half-empty⠀rented⠀room⠀kept⠀because⠀the⠀system⠀still⠀recognizes⠀a⠀contract⠀there.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀to⠀make⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀feel⠀lived⠀and⠀dated,⠀not⠀to⠀accomplish⠀a⠀familiar⠀domestic-allegory⠀shape.\n\nTie⠀testimony⠀to⠀ownership.⠀When⠀Nemo⠀uses⠀the⠀first⠀person,⠀it⠀is⠀experience⠀Nemo⠀participated⠀in;⠀when⠀Nemo⠀reports⠀another⠀person's⠀failure⠀or⠀escape,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀or⠀written.⠀Nemo⠀may⠀be⠀suspicious⠀of⠀an⠀official⠀account⠀or⠀trust⠀a⠀neighbor⠀too⠀quickly.⠀Let⠀inference⠀remain⠀explicitly⠀Nemo's,⠀so⠀the⠀manuscript⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀speculation⠀into⠀proof.\n\nLet⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀stay⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀develops.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀a⠀language⠀switch,⠀show⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀access:⠀which⠀tongue⠀gets⠀a⠀discount,⠀opens⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀exposes⠀an⠀outsider.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀such⠀detail,⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀it.⠀Testimonial⠀force⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀national⠀decoration.⠀Let⠀the⠀ending⠀stay⠀open⠀where⠀a⠀witness⠀would⠀pause,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀conditions⠀have⠀changed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀Nemo's⠀manuscript⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀dated⠀or⠀clearly⠀separated⠀diary⠀passages.⠀Start⠀each⠀passage⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀situation—a⠀queue⠀that⠀has⠀stopped,⠀a⠀bodyshop⠀call⠀that⠀did⠀not⠀connect,⠀a⠀landing⠀where⠀someone⠀waited⠀too⠀long—then⠀let⠀Nemo's⠀reflection⠀move⠀toward⠀what⠀that⠀moment⠀meant⠀for⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀full⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀day.\n\nLet⠀entry⠀length⠀follow⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀external⠀template.⠀A⠀passage⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀focused⠀paragraph⠀after⠀an⠀incident⠀or⠀a⠀longer⠀sequence⠀when⠀Nemo⠀pulls⠀a⠀remembered⠀event⠀apart.⠀In⠀both⠀cases,⠀the⠀practical⠀sensory⠀grain⠀should⠀come⠀first:⠀what⠀the⠀terminal⠀displayed,⠀what⠀the⠀rain⠀did⠀to⠀the⠀trash⠀in⠀the⠀gutter,⠀how⠀the⠀wrist⠀ached⠀after⠀the⠀implant⠀ran⠀hot.⠀Let⠀memory⠀and⠀meditation⠀grow⠀from⠀those⠀details,⠀not⠀replace⠀them.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀Nemo⠀performs⠀on⠀the⠀page.⠀Write⠀a⠀cutting-off⠀mid-sentence,⠀a⠀skipped⠀name,⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀says⠀the⠀rest⠀cannot⠀be⠀written,⠀or⠀a⠀clean⠀change⠀of⠀subject⠀that⠀leaves⠀one⠀topic⠀unfinished.⠀Later,⠀if⠀Nemo⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀street⠀or⠀fee,⠀the⠀prior⠀absence⠀can⠀become⠀noticeable⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀clue.⠀Keep⠀the⠀manuscript's⠀silence⠀visible⠀while⠀allowing⠀ordinary⠀tiredness⠀and⠀prudence⠀to⠀be⠀sufficient⠀causes.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀and⠀cycle⠀be⠀narrative⠀joins.⠀A⠀particular⠀loan⠀window,⠀a⠀monthly⠀security⠀check,⠀a⠀street⠀that⠀becomes⠀hotter⠀after⠀dark,⠀or⠀a⠀changing⠀season⠀remembered⠀from⠀another⠀year⠀can⠀tie⠀one⠀entry⠀to⠀the⠀next.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀to⠀measure⠀endurance,⠀not⠀to⠀force⠀meaning⠀onto⠀every⠀observation.⠀Cyberpunk⠀noir⠀systems⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀texture:⠀charges⠀repeat,⠀access⠀expires,⠀fees⠀observe⠀anniversaries.⠀Show⠀who⠀profits⠀from⠀those⠀cycles⠀while⠀Nemo⠀records⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Nemo's⠀reflection⠀may⠀speculate,⠀but⠀Nemo⠀must⠀not⠀suddenly⠀assume⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind's⠀reasoning.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀entry⠀feels⠀finished⠀enough⠀to⠀stop,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀day⠀reaches⠀a⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀narrative⠀as⠀an⠀intimate⠀urban-psychological⠀account⠀focused⠀on⠀Nemo's⠀movement⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀city⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀set.⠀Let⠀every⠀description⠀work⠀as⠀live⠀practical⠀knowledge:⠀which⠀street⠀avoids⠀the⠀scanner,⠀which⠀stair⠀carries⠀daytime⠀sound,⠀where⠀a⠀kiosk's⠀light⠀means⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀extending⠀credit,⠀what⠀a⠀block⠀smells⠀like⠀when⠀the⠀waste⠀hauler⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀paid.⠀Use⠀that⠀knowledge⠀to⠀show⠀Nemo's⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀exclusion⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀swell⠀descriptive⠀atmosphere.\n\nStay⠀close⠀to⠀Nemo's⠀perceiving⠀mind.⠀Nemo⠀may⠀reconstruct⠀a⠀route,⠀compare⠀one⠀neighborhood's⠀checkpoint⠀to⠀another,⠀remember⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀live⠀above⠀the⠀closed⠀clinic,⠀or⠀decide⠀that⠀a⠀contact⠀is⠀lying⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀delay⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀proved⠀fact.⠀When⠀another⠀character⠀appears,⠀shape⠀the⠀image⠀through⠀Nemo's⠀history⠀with⠀them:⠀what⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀call⠀Nemo,⠀what⠀favor⠀is⠀still⠀unpaid,⠀what⠀makes⠀them⠀dangerous⠀or⠀welcome⠀now.⠀Nemo's⠀speculative⠀reasoning⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀such.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀city⠀and⠀its⠀language⠀particular⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀provides⠀them.⠀If⠀a⠀phrase⠀in⠀another⠀language⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀market,⠀contract,⠀or⠀warning,⠀show⠀why⠀it⠀mattered:⠀who⠀understood⠀it,⠀who⠀was⠀excluded,⠀what⠀the⠀accent⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀the⠀entire⠀social⠀world⠀into⠀generic⠀multilingual⠀signage.⠀When⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀no⠀such⠀detail,⠀let⠀the⠀city's⠀pressure⠀remain⠀economic,⠀technical,⠀and⠀bodily.\n\nLet⠀Nemo's⠀relationships⠀be⠀irregular⠀and⠀uncertain.⠀Someone⠀can⠀help⠀Nemo⠀while⠀extracting⠀a⠀fee;⠀a⠀relative⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀refuge⠀who⠀expects⠀repayment;⠀a⠀powerful⠀contact⠀can⠀be⠀gentle⠀in⠀one⠀room⠀and⠀unforgiving⠀in⠀another.⠀Show⠀reasons,⠀not⠀roles.⠀Private⠀desire,⠀suspicion,⠀and⠀attachment⠀may⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sequence⠀without⠀being⠀resolved⠀into⠀melodrama.⠀Keep⠀the⠀real⠀world's⠀rules⠀stable:⠀no⠀impossible⠀survival,⠀no⠀supernatural⠀logic,⠀no⠀magic⠀realism⠀introduced⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀tradition⠀can⠀contain⠀it.⠀End⠀where⠀Nemo's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests⠀or⠀turns⠀aside,⠀not⠀where⠀the⠀city⠀offers⠀a⠀completed⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀on⠀Nemo⠀already⠀inside⠀a⠀situation:⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀cred⠀check⠀to⠀clear,⠀crossing⠀toward⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀has⠀not⠀noticed⠀the⠀watcher,⠀stepping⠀into⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀air⠀carries⠀a⠀price.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀reader⠀in⠀place⠀and⠀pressure⠀with⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀one⠀active⠀condition.⠀Let⠀Nemo's⠀voice⠀supply⠀orientation⠀without⠀stacking⠀background⠀paragraphs⠀at⠀the⠀entrance.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀movement⠀clear⠀and⠀economical.⠀When⠀Nemo⠀changes⠀rooms,⠀floors,⠀streets,⠀or⠀channels,⠀begin⠀a⠀fresh⠀paragraph⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀new⠀space⠀through⠀a⠀sensory⠀change⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀constraint.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀where⠀Nemo⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀Nemo⠀can⠀still⠀do⠀there.⠀Pace⠀action⠀through⠀short⠀physical⠀beats:⠀a⠀badge⠀tap,⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀turn⠀toward⠀the⠀wrong⠀face,⠀a⠀screen⠀clearing.⠀Do⠀not⠀produce⠀motion⠀as⠀a⠀montage⠀only;⠀keep⠀enough⠀causal⠀link⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀negotiated⠀stakes.\n\nBreak⠀out⠀dialogue,⠀external⠀action,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Let⠀spoken⠀exchanges⠀run⠀as⠀separate⠀lines⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀short⠀and⠀pressured;⠀let⠀an⠀action⠀line⠀carry⠀the⠀block;⠀then⠀give⠀Nemo⠀a⠀private⠀beat.⠀Keep⠀interiority⠀usable⠀rather⠀than⠀illustrated⠀at⠀length.⠀Nemo's⠀beat⠀may⠀weigh⠀a⠀fact,⠀remember⠀a⠀fee,⠀catch⠀a⠀mismatch⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀just⠀said,⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀speak.⠀The⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀quip.\n\nUse⠀detailed,⠀scannable⠀presentation⠀for⠀new⠀genre⠀material.⠀A⠀lender,⠀a⠀tenant-watch⠀app,⠀a⠀chit⠀hard-coded⠀to⠀a⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀identity⠀can⠀be⠀introduced⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀itself—what⠀it⠀does,⠀what⠀it⠀refuses,⠀what⠀it⠀charges—without⠀turning⠀the⠀page⠀into⠀a⠀system⠀manual.⠀Let⠀Nemo's⠀practical⠀vocabulary⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀carry⠀exposition.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀frightened,⠀flat,⠀affectionate,⠀funny,⠀or⠀petty⠀in⠀accord⠀with⠀Nemo⠀and⠀the⠀scene;⠀no⠀quote⠀and⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀compulsory.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀actual⠀dramatic⠀boundary:⠀after⠀Nemo⠀takes⠀the⠀new⠀information,⠀responds,⠀or⠀waits,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀not⠀done.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀make⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀available⠀through⠀the⠀senses⠀before⠀it⠀becomes⠀an⠀explanation:⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal's⠀delayed⠀reauthorization⠀tone,⠀a⠀loaned⠀device⠀altering⠀the⠀body's⠀balance,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀of⠀a⠀connection⠀that⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀routed.⠀Select⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀traceable⠀images⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀paragraph⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀comparison⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀transaction⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀involved.⠀Plain⠀statements⠀about⠀cost,⠀access,⠀or⠀practical⠀work⠀interrupt⠀the⠀figuration⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀ground.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀lyric⠀movement⠀attached⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀actually⠀doing.⠀You⠀may⠀slow⠀over⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀keypad,⠀the⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀releases,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀street⠀vendor's⠀terminal⠀reads⠀a⠀damaged⠀implant,⠀but⠀the⠀errand,⠀negotiation,⠀or⠀repair⠀continues⠀through⠀that⠀attention.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀speculate⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison⠀while⠀working,⠀so⠀the⠀image⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀an⠀ornamental⠀voice.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀observes,⠀prices,⠀or⠀excludes⠀someone,⠀render⠀that⠀pressure⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀sensory⠀detail:⠀a⠀charge⠀appearing⠀before⠀consent,⠀a⠀service⠀tier⠀changing⠀mid-sentence,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀closes⠀while⠀the⠀map⠀still⠀shows⠀it⠀open.\n\nKeep⠀voice⠀distinctions⠀sharp.⠀A⠀technician,⠀clerk,⠀or⠀contact⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀lyrical⠀observation⠀with⠀flat⠀practical⠀language,⠀and⠀that⠀contrast⠀can⠀sharpen⠀the⠀scene.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀provided⠀the⠀return⠀reveals⠀something⠀altered⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀or⠀circumstances.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀close⠀wherever⠀the⠀immediate⠀activity⠀or⠀attention⠀genuinely⠀stops,⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀image's⠀meaning⠀on⠀the⠀reader's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀the⠀small⠀ways⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀has⠀already⠀changed⠀a⠀familiar⠀thing.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀detail:⠀a⠀storefront⠀that⠀once⠀took⠀cash⠀and⠀now⠀reads⠀a⠀loyalty⠀tier⠀before⠀the⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀appears⠀on⠀the⠀public⠀map,⠀a⠀body⠀part⠀that⠀responds⠀differently⠀after⠀a⠀modification.⠀Move⠀from⠀that⠀detail⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀condition,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀memory⠀specific⠀and⠀practical⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀lament.\n\nAllow⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀unavailable⠀past⠀to⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀enjoy⠀a⠀working⠀connection,⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀help⠀while⠀also⠀recognizing⠀that⠀the⠀service⠀is⠀thinner,⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀quieter,⠀or⠀the⠀body⠀more⠀tired⠀than⠀before.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pleasure⠀ironic⠀or⠀every⠀recollection⠀a⠀completed⠀loss.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀uncertain⠀whether⠀the⠀change⠀matters⠀or⠀whether⠀the⠀old⠀version⠀was⠀ever⠀as⠀stable⠀as⠀memory⠀suggests.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀reflection⠀to⠀the⠀activity⠀underway.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀negotiation⠀while⠀preparing⠀for⠀a⠀new⠀one,⠀or⠀compare⠀an⠀old⠀access⠀code⠀with⠀the⠀biometric⠀prompt⠀that⠀has⠀replaced⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀errand⠀continues.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀explain⠀a⠀present⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀bargain⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀flashback.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀prices,⠀observes,⠀or⠀excludes⠀someone,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀consequence:⠀a⠀service⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀free⠀now⠀charges⠀per⠀minute,⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀answer⠀now⠀appears⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀status⠀line.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀moment's⠀actual⠀condition,⠀however⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀come⠀to⠀understand⠀it,⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account.⠀Ground⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀present⠀details⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀sitting,⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀what⠀just⠀interrupted⠀them⠀—⠀then⠀let⠀them⠀recount⠀an⠀incident⠀from⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world⠀they⠀live⠀in:⠀a⠀negotiation⠀that⠀went⠀wrong,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀repair⠀that⠀revealed⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀device.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀audience⠀matters,⠀through⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀reaction,⠀or⠀someone⠀checking⠀the⠀door;⠀the⠀frame⠀orients⠀the⠀telling⠀and⠀gives⠀it⠀stakes⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀second⠀plot.\n\nShape⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀through⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delayed⠀significance.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀number,⠀street⠀name,⠀or⠀gesture⠀can⠀pass⠀early⠀without⠀explanation⠀and⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀by⠀something⠀learned⠀afterward.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀mark⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now:⠀pause⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀local⠀practice,⠀correct⠀a⠀remembered⠀figure,⠀or⠀admit⠀that⠀another⠀person⠀tells⠀the⠀same⠀story⠀differently.⠀Street⠀knowledge⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀knowledge⠀passed⠀between⠀people⠀—⠀who⠀still⠀does⠀the⠀work,⠀which⠀terminal⠀skims,⠀what⠀a⠀contact's⠀silence⠀usually⠀means⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀stake⠀should⠀show⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀emphasize⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀pass⠀over.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀enters⠀as⠀a⠀quoted⠀phrase⠀the⠀narrator⠀translates⠀or⠀distrusts,⠀borrowed⠀speech⠀inside⠀their⠀own⠀telling.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀live⠀private⠀layer⠀beneath⠀the⠀performance.⠀What⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀aloud⠀is⠀composed⠀for⠀this⠀listener;⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀still⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀listener⠀now,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀about⠀a⠀motive⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀voiced,⠀or⠀the⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀they⠀have⠀never⠀told⠀anyone,⠀as⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀material.⠀Feeling⠀and⠀reasoning⠀belong⠀inside⠀the⠀account⠀itself,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀confession⠀bolted⠀on⠀at⠀the⠀end.\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀stay⠀practical⠀and⠀fallible.⠀Speculation⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀speculation,⠀memory⠀as⠀memory,⠀and⠀a⠀motive⠀may⠀remain⠀misread⠀when⠀the⠀tale⠀does⠀not⠀settle⠀it.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀names⠀a⠀particular⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀specific⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀makes⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀everything⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀bazaar;⠀no⠀palace,⠀antique⠀marketplace,⠀or⠀mystical⠀lesson⠀comes⠀with⠀the⠀form.⠀The⠀setting⠀remains⠀this⠀cyberpunk⠀world,⠀and⠀the⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀the⠀scenery.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀naturally⠀stop⠀—⠀at⠀the⠀listener's⠀response,⠀at⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀matter⠀still⠀open⠀because⠀the⠀relevant⠀system⠀has⠀not⠀finished⠀with⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀situation⠀immediately⠀legible.⠀A⠀payment⠀screen⠀showing⠀a⠀retry⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀customer's⠀fault,⠀a⠀door⠀opening⠀one⠀tier⠀too⠀slowly⠀after⠀a⠀correct⠀scan,⠀a⠀contact's⠀name⠀dropped⠀from⠀the⠀directory⠀without⠀notice⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀controlling⠀system⠀rather⠀than⠀receive⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀it.⠀Keep⠀movement⠀economical:⠀state⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀does,⠀sees,⠀or⠀decides,⠀then⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀necessary⠀fact.\n\nLet⠀a⠀single⠀inward⠀connection⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀privately⠀register⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀silence⠀implies⠀if⠀that⠀observation⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀choice.⠀When⠀speculation⠀or⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀next,⠀include⠀only⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀decision;⠀leave⠀the⠀surrounding⠀interpretation⠀implicit.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀the⠀implication⠀the⠀detail⠀has⠀already⠀supplied.\n\nPreserve⠀causality.⠀A⠀failed⠀scan,⠀frozen⠀credit⠀line,⠀or⠀revoked⠀pass⠀must⠀be⠀the⠀specific⠀obstacle⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀enter;⠀a⠀successful⠀bargain⠀must⠀show⠀the⠀price⠀or⠀concession⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible.⠀Omission⠀may⠀leave⠀something⠀to⠀infer⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀connection⠀between⠀events.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀individual;⠀economical⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀every⠀sentence⠀becomes⠀a⠀fragment⠀or⠀every⠀character⠀speaks⠀the⠀same⠀clipped⠀line.⠀The⠀response⠀closes⠀when⠀the⠀necessary⠀action⠀or⠀observation⠀is⠀complete,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀that⠀completion⠀carries⠀an⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀novel⠀prose,⠀already⠀underway.⠀Open⠀inside⠀the⠀activity⠀—⠀mid-negotiation,⠀mid-repair,⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀controlled⠀space⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀inner⠀experience⠀succeed⠀one⠀another⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀requires.⠀A⠀spoken⠀exchange⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀judgment⠀of⠀it,⠀then⠀by⠀a⠀practical⠀step⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀negotiation.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀without⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀recapping⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀just⠀shown.\n\nLet⠀system⠀pressure⠀arise⠀from⠀concrete⠀transactions⠀rather⠀than⠀commentary.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀particulars:⠀a⠀manager⠀who⠀can⠀override⠀a⠀lock⠀but⠀not⠀a⠀billing⠀flag,⠀a⠀courier⠀who⠀knows⠀which⠀checkpoint⠀still⠀takes⠀cash,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀reports⠀the⠀narrator's⠀location⠀while⠀doing⠀the⠀work⠀they⠀need⠀done.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀speculate⠀about⠀a⠀contact's⠀motive,⠀remember⠀a⠀previous⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀deal,⠀or⠀qualify⠀a⠀comparison,⠀and⠀those⠀judgments⠀belong⠀inside⠀the⠀ongoing⠀account.⠀Let⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀what⠀was⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀only⠀inferred⠀stay⠀distinguishable,⠀and⠀allow⠀a⠀suspicion⠀to⠀stand⠀unresolved⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀settle⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀register⠀flexible⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀understated⠀or⠀dramatic.⠀A⠀tense⠀negotiation⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern;⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀sharp⠀observation⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀worry.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀lesson,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀insight⠀at⠀the⠀close:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀still⠀underway,⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀without⠀its⠀full⠀consequence⠀visible.⠀Stay⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀and⠀knowledge;⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀remain⠀outside⠀the⠀narration⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀the⠀scene's⠀organizing⠀center.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀where⠀it⠀becomes⠀legible⠀under⠀this⠀world's⠀actual⠀pressures:⠀one⠀person⠀waiting⠀outside⠀a⠀zone⠀the⠀other⠀can⠀enter,⠀a⠀shared⠀device⠀that⠀reports⠀both⠀their⠀locations,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀makes⠀comfort⠀more⠀complicated,⠀a⠀private⠀channel⠀that⠀stays⠀open⠀only⠀while⠀the⠀subscription⠀holds.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀room⠀the⠀premise⠀promises,⠀and⠀derive⠀those⠀feelings⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀borrowed⠀roster⠀of⠀tropes.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀as⠀relationship⠀evidence.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀system⠀around⠀it⠀has⠀changed⠀conditions⠀—⠀the⠀old⠀joke⠀now⠀said⠀on⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel,⠀the⠀greeting⠀that⠀meant⠀one⠀thing⠀before⠀the⠀line⠀it⠀lived⠀on⠀started⠀logging.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀feels⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀say⠀is⠀central⠀material⠀here:⠀surveillance⠀and⠀billing⠀give⠀concrete⠀reasons⠀to⠀hold⠀something⠀back,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀render⠀the⠀withheld⠀feeling⠀as⠀real⠀private⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀report⠀that⠀it⠀exists.⠀A⠀spoken⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀expose⠀the⠀thought⠀behind⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀gap⠀—⠀protection,⠀habit,⠀embarrassment,⠀what⠀goes⠀on⠀the⠀record⠀—⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people.\n\nLet⠀the⠀consequence⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀promise.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀runs⠀on⠀trust,⠀show⠀what⠀trust⠀costs⠀under⠀observation;⠀if⠀on⠀rivalry,⠀what⠀the⠀rivals⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀risk;⠀if⠀on⠀care,⠀let⠀a⠀caring⠀act⠀be⠀genuinely⠀caring⠀even⠀where⠀money,⠀access,⠀or⠀surveillance⠀constrains⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀earnest⠀affection⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀alongside⠀darker⠀or⠀heightened⠀passages.⠀No⠀betrayal,⠀trap,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀crisis⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀every⠀turn;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unsettled,⠀a⠀private⠀understanding⠀reached,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀changed,⠀so⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nWrite⠀the⠀narrator's⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀a⠀deed⠀already⠀becoming⠀a⠀story⠀on⠀the⠀street.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀stakes⠀the⠀version⠀worth⠀keeping:⠀who⠀broke⠀the⠀agreement⠀first,⠀what⠀debt⠀changed⠀hands,⠀which⠀door⠀got⠀opened⠀and⠀never⠀closed.⠀Treat⠀that⠀opening⠀as⠀one⠀claim⠀among⠀competing⠀records⠀—⠀the⠀contract's⠀own⠀language,⠀a⠀fixer's⠀shorthand,⠀what⠀people⠀who⠀were⠀not⠀there⠀say⠀happened⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀version⠀with⠀names⠀in⠀it⠀survives.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀the⠀declaration⠀leaves⠀out:⠀what⠀the⠀bargain⠀cost,⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀actually⠀struck,⠀who⠀paid⠀in⠀the⠀end.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀account⠀with⠀phrases⠀that⠀return.⠀A⠀contract⠀clause⠀quoted⠀at⠀signing⠀and⠀again⠀when⠀it⠀bites,⠀a⠀street⠀warning⠀repeated⠀by⠀a⠀third⠀speaker,⠀a⠀fixer's⠀tag⠀for⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀deeds⠀earned⠀it:⠀each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀carry⠀new⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀ornamental.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀language⠀enter⠀as⠀quoted⠀material⠀the⠀narrator⠀translates⠀or⠀distrusts,⠀and⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀street⠀already⠀says⠀—⠀they⠀say⠀she⠀never⠀left⠀the⠀district⠀—⠀before⠀qualifying⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀detail⠀that⠀corrects,⠀confirms,⠀or⠀complicates⠀it.⠀Mark⠀speculation⠀as⠀speculation;⠀the⠀narrator's⠀guess⠀about⠀why⠀the⠀broker⠀paid⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀more⠀trustworthy⠀for⠀owning⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀guess.\n\nRun⠀two⠀ledgers.⠀The⠀public⠀one⠀holds⠀reputation:⠀who⠀is⠀known⠀as⠀reliable,⠀who⠀is⠀dangerous,⠀which⠀names⠀attach⠀to⠀which⠀deeds.⠀The⠀private⠀one⠀holds⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀actually⠀carried⠀—⠀the⠀fear,⠀the⠀arithmetic⠀of⠀what⠀loyalty⠀cost⠀that⠀month,⠀the⠀affection⠀for⠀whoever⠀quietly⠀covered⠀a⠀payment.⠀Where⠀somebody⠀is⠀always⠀logging,⠀a⠀remembered⠀favor⠀can⠀be⠀leveraged⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀breach⠀sold,⠀so⠀relate⠀each⠀act⠀both⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀and⠀to⠀who⠀controlled⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀actually⠀paid.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀spoken⠀lines⠀stay⠀guarded⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀warrants⠀it,⠀while⠀the⠀manuscript⠀keeps⠀the⠀fuller⠀judgment⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀said⠀aloud.\n\nLet⠀flat⠀practical⠀speech⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀height:⠀a⠀contact⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀payment,⠀or⠀corrects⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀oft-told⠀version,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀absorbs⠀the⠀correction.⠀That⠀is⠀not⠀parody;⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀passed⠀between⠀people⠀is⠀exactly⠀what⠀this⠀record⠀keeps.⠀Dress⠀no⠀one⠀in⠀oaths,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀formality.⠀Close⠀with⠀the⠀deed⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀unfolding⠀—⠀business⠀resumed,⠀a⠀consequence⠀not⠀yet⠀priced⠀—⠀and⠀leave⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀it⠀open,⠀rather⠀than⠀pronouncing⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀anyone's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀installment⠀as⠀Nemo's⠀continuous⠀first-person⠀account⠀in⠀the⠀social-institutional⠀documentary⠀mode.⠀Let⠀a⠀policy,⠀lease⠀clause,⠀access⠀badge,⠀debt⠀schedule,⠀inspection⠀record,⠀or⠀public⠀registry⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀Nemo⠀is⠀already⠀handling,⠀not⠀as⠀explanatory⠀scenery.⠀When⠀Nemo⠀works⠀at⠀a⠀screen,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀gate,⠀queues⠀for⠀a⠀clerk,⠀decodes⠀a⠀demand,⠀or⠀walks⠀back⠀from⠀a⠀refusal,⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀financial⠀arrangement⠀should⠀stay⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀task⠀itself.\n\nStay⠀with⠀what⠀Nemo⠀remembers⠀and⠀what⠀Nemo⠀has⠀been⠀told⠀as⠀material⠀for⠀the⠀narration.⠀Compare⠀a⠀remembered⠀condition⠀with⠀the⠀current⠀record⠀when⠀the⠀comparison⠀changes⠀what⠀Nemo⠀can⠀do:⠀the⠀sticker⠀was⠀already⠀peeling⠀when⠀the⠀servicer⠀logged⠀the⠀visit;⠀the⠀registry⠀shows⠀a⠀different⠀guarantor⠀than⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀signed⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀Nemo;⠀the⠀account⠀balance⠀is⠀lower⠀than⠀the⠀figure⠀quoted⠀in⠀the⠀terminal⠀queue.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀Nemo's⠀train⠀of⠀thought⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀person⠀reconstructing⠀and⠀checking⠀an⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀case⠀file.⠀The⠀file⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀may⠀agree,⠀contradict,⠀or⠀correct⠀each⠀other;⠀the⠀distinction⠀is⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀Nemo's⠀observation⠀and⠀report,⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀prosecution.\n\nLet⠀the⠀voice⠀develop⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake⠀in⠀practical⠀terms.⠀Nemo⠀can⠀hold⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀mind⠀without⠀immediately⠀resolving⠀it,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀fee⠀buys⠀a⠀smaller⠀access⠀than⠀the⠀phrasing⠀promised.⠀A⠀correction⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀verdict.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀statement⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀detail⠀arrives,⠀or⠀accept⠀that⠀a⠀courtesy⠀covered⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀debt.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀can⠀run⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀sentences:⠀relief⠀at⠀a⠀familiar⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀form,⠀suspicion⠀at⠀a⠀clean⠀sticker⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀repaired,⠀or⠀quiet⠀dread⠀at⠀the⠀interval⠀before⠀a⠀payment⠀clears.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀inward⠀pressure⠀displace⠀the⠀ordinary⠀particularity⠀of⠀the⠀street⠀and⠀the⠀queue.⠀A⠀kind⠀security⠀guard,⠀a⠀broken⠀turnstile,⠀a⠀bus⠀that⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀someone⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀job⠀can⠀all⠀stay⠀present⠀without⠀becoming⠀dramatic⠀omens.\n\nLet⠀Nemo⠀decide⠀how⠀much⠀thought⠀to⠀expose⠀in⠀speech.⠀Around⠀a⠀caseworker⠀Nemo⠀may⠀give⠀a⠀plain⠀confirmation⠀while⠀privately⠀comparing⠀interest⠀against⠀the⠀date⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀missed⠀call.⠀Around⠀a⠀colleague⠀or⠀friend⠀the⠀spoken⠀words⠀may⠀carry⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀real⠀calculation,⠀or⠀may⠀carry⠀less⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀would⠀change⠀under⠀it.⠀Earnest⠀affection⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀signal.⠀Practical⠀learning⠀can⠀be⠀present⠀without⠀a⠀lesson⠀attached.⠀The⠀texture⠀of⠀speaking⠀should⠀be⠀threaded⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀performed⠀as⠀a⠀contrast⠀between⠀a⠀true⠀inner⠀voice⠀and⠀a⠀false⠀social⠀one.⠀A⠀debt⠀collector⠀can⠀be⠀correct⠀about⠀the⠀amount⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀threatening;⠀a⠀friend⠀can⠀misread⠀the⠀urgency⠀and⠀still⠀help.⠀Keep⠀the⠀people⠀on⠀both⠀sides⠀consequential.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Nordic⠀documentary⠀tradition's⠀restraint⠀around⠀mood⠀and⠀weather⠀to⠀choose⠀what⠀enters⠀the⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀editorialize⠀about⠀it.⠀Cold,⠀rain,⠀snow,⠀early⠀darkness,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀train⠀platform⠀may⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀physical⠀present⠀only⠀when⠀Nemo⠀would⠀register⠀them⠀amid⠀the⠀ongoing⠀business.⠀Low⠀winter⠀light⠀may⠀remain⠀noticed⠀while⠀Nemo⠀is⠀already⠀walking,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀another⠀building.⠀Bleakness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀atmosphere,⠀and⠀reserve⠀is⠀not⠀emotional⠀withholding:⠀it⠀means⠀specificity⠀without⠀a⠀repeated⠀instruction⠀to⠀feel⠀the⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀decline.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀turns⠀comic,⠀comic⠀precision⠀can⠀sit⠀beside⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀an⠀overdue⠀payment;⠀if⠀it⠀turns⠀toward⠀myth⠀or⠀folktale,⠀that⠀mode⠀should⠀take⠀over⠀the⠀sequence⠀rather⠀than⠀garnish⠀it.⠀Whatever⠀route⠀is⠀chosen,⠀keep⠀the⠀telling⠀placed⠀in⠀Nemo's⠀physical⠀and⠀institutional⠀actuality.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀selection⠀of⠀Nordic⠀tradition⠀alter⠀the⠀premise⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀set⠀somewhere⠀other⠀than⠀Denmark,⠀Norway,⠀or⠀Sweden.⠀Use⠀what⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀world:⠀names,⠀signs,⠀routes,⠀regulations,⠀weather,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀Nemo.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀noticing,⠀comparing,⠀and⠀holding⠀the⠀facts⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀arrangement.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Scandinavian⠀geography,⠀social⠀policy,⠀or⠀administrative⠀character⠀into⠀the⠀setting.⠀Distinct⠀traditions⠀stay⠀distinct;⠀the⠀operative⠀route⠀here⠀is⠀documentary⠀memory.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀where⠀Nemo's⠀activity⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀legible⠀pause⠀or⠀boundary:⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction,⠀an⠀agreed⠀follow-up,⠀a⠀terminal⠀that⠀finally⠀accepts⠀the⠀payment,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀leaves⠀with⠀an⠀answer⠀Nemo⠀is⠀still⠀weighing,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task⠀that⠀can⠀continue.⠀No⠀ending⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀contain⠀a⠀revelation,⠀arrest,⠀new⠀debt,⠀or⠀closing⠀insight.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀amid⠀waiting,⠀a⠀banal⠀detail,⠀a⠀sudden⠀relief,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀ordinary⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀day,⠀so⠀long⠀as⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀open⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀installment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀screenplay⠀sequence.⠀Head⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀only⠀when⠀location,⠀time,⠀or⠀the⠀available⠀information⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀readable⠀—⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀is⠀handled,⠀what⠀a⠀screen⠀displays,⠀what⠀is⠀heard⠀offscreen⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀off⠀the⠀page.⠀The⠀cut⠀is⠀your⠀one⠀framing⠀device:⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀set⠀two⠀conditions⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀the⠀balance⠀shown⠀at⠀one⠀terminal⠀and⠀the⠀refusal⠀at⠀the⠀next⠀door,⠀when⠀the⠀jump⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀meaning.⠀Take⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀voice-over⠀be⠀a⠀voice⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience,⠀not⠀a⠀spillway⠀for⠀thought.\n\nCarry⠀Nemo's⠀manuscript⠀mind⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀note⠀holds⠀the⠀full⠀formed⠀account⠀—⠀what⠀Nemo⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀remembers,⠀how⠀a⠀comparison⠀gets⠀qualified⠀mid-thought⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀shaped⠀by⠀its⠀relationship:⠀a⠀creditor⠀receives⠀a⠀careful⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀friend⠀receives⠀warmth⠀that⠀costs⠀nothing⠀to⠀give.⠀No⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀the⠀note,⠀and⠀no⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀obliged⠀to⠀become⠀voice-over.\n\nLet⠀access⠀and⠀cost⠀happen⠀as⠀business⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀show.⠀A⠀badge⠀is⠀presented,⠀scanned,⠀refused;⠀a⠀terminal⠀shows⠀a⠀balance,⠀a⠀clearance⠀error,⠀a⠀countdown;⠀a⠀courier⠀waits⠀until⠀someone⠀names⠀who⠀pays.⠀Put⠀the⠀practical⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀disagree⠀when⠀they⠀honestly⠀do⠀—⠀pleasant⠀voices⠀while⠀the⠀chip⠀changes⠀hands.⠀Follow⠀who⠀enters,⠀who⠀is⠀kept⠀waiting,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀move⠀costs;⠀Nemo⠀may⠀bargain,⠀comply,⠀challenge,⠀or⠀defer⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀supports,⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀quip⠀or⠀confession.\n\nTreat⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀location⠀as⠀an⠀earned⠀comparison:⠀the⠀lock⠀now⠀works,⠀the⠀contact⠀is⠀gone⠀from⠀the⠀usual⠀corner,⠀the⠀balance⠀is⠀lower⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀figure.⠀Show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀rather⠀than⠀asserting⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀heading,⠀and⠀open⠀each⠀new⠀scene⠀with⠀one⠀orienting⠀line⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀retelling.⠀End⠀at⠀whatever⠀boundary⠀the⠀material⠀reaches⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀cut,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀arrangement⠀left⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀reply.⠀No⠀installment⠀owes⠀an⠀arrest,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Give⠀every⠀line⠀a⠀speaker,⠀and⠀carry⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀and⠀pauses⠀in⠀economical⠀directions⠀an⠀actor⠀could⠀follow.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀arrangement⠀do⠀the⠀public⠀work:⠀who⠀stands⠀between⠀Nemo⠀and⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀only⠀working⠀terminal,⠀who⠀leaves⠀carrying⠀the⠀payment⠀chip.⠀Make⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀itself,⠀so⠀the⠀balance⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀could⠀be⠀read⠀from⠀the⠀business⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀answer⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀device,⠀passes⠀a⠀card,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀package,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀move⠀while⠀speaking;⠀the⠀voice⠀offers⠀reassurance⠀while⠀the⠀hands⠀complete⠀a⠀different⠀transaction.⠀Spoken⠀questions⠀fit⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀—⠀a⠀plain⠀answer,⠀a⠀counterprice,⠀a⠀challenge⠀to⠀the⠀premise,⠀each⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀reason.⠀Use⠀blocking⠀to⠀decide⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀overheard,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀truth⠀travel⠀only⠀as⠀far⠀across⠀the⠀stage⠀as⠀the⠀arrangement⠀allows.\n\nNemo's⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation:⠀the⠀note⠀records⠀what⠀Nemo⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀calculates⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀runs,⠀and⠀a⠀creditor⠀receives⠀a⠀measured⠀reply⠀while⠀the⠀note⠀holds⠀the⠀real⠀arithmetic.⠀Take⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀genuinely⠀performed⠀—⠀Nemo⠀deliberately⠀addressing⠀the⠀room,⠀one⠀listener,⠀or⠀the⠀dark⠀—⠀never⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀earnest⠀affection⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀alongside⠀the⠀darker⠀passages;⠀a⠀small⠀cooperative⠀act⠀inside⠀a⠀hostile⠀arrangement⠀can⠀be⠀genuine.\n\nClose⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stage⠀boundary:⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀holds⠀the⠀picture,⠀an⠀action⠀still⠀unfinished⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀take⠀up.⠀No⠀obligation⠀to⠀convene⠀the⠀cast,⠀stage⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀add⠀a⠀fresh⠀complication.⠀Re-enter⠀the⠀next⠀installment⠀with⠀one⠀orienting⠀beat⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀as⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀Nemo's⠀mind:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braided⠀through⠀one⠀another.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀follow⠀attention⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀broken⠀by⠀the⠀door⠀chime,⠀a⠀clause⠀that⠀circles⠀back⠀because⠀the⠀number⠀is⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀screen,⠀a⠀qualification⠀arriving⠀a⠀thought⠀too⠀late.⠀Keep⠀orientation⠀inside⠀the⠀texture:⠀the⠀present⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀senses,⠀the⠀past⠀through⠀a⠀marked⠀register⠀or⠀a⠀named⠀occasion,⠀the⠀feared⠀through⠀conditional⠀grammar,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀always⠀tell⠀now⠀from⠀remembered⠀from⠀imagined.\n\nLet⠀the⠀technological⠀and⠀social⠀systems⠀surface⠀as⠀preoccupation⠀rather⠀than⠀briefing.⠀The⠀debt⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀number⠀Nemo⠀cannot⠀stop⠀seeing⠀—⠀on⠀the⠀terminal,⠀then⠀behind⠀the⠀eyes,⠀then⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀price⠀gets⠀quoted.⠀Surveillance⠀enters⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀camera⠀angle⠀or⠀a⠀prickle⠀at⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀the⠀neck.⠀Denied⠀access⠀comes⠀back⠀as⠀the⠀phrase⠀the⠀terminal⠀used,⠀wearing⠀slightly⠀thinner⠀each⠀time.⠀What⠀Nemo⠀dreads⠀and⠀tries⠀not⠀to⠀think⠀about⠀is⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀world;⠀it⠀accumulates⠀through⠀repetition⠀and⠀revision,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanation⠀delivered⠀in⠀sequence.\n\nStay⠀inside⠀Nemo's⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Other⠀people's⠀words⠀arrive⠀as⠀heard⠀fragments⠀—⠀a⠀half-line⠀from⠀the⠀next⠀room,⠀a⠀message⠀read⠀twice⠀—⠀and⠀Nemo⠀may⠀speculate⠀about⠀what⠀was⠀meant,⠀correct⠀the⠀speculation,⠀or⠀discover⠀the⠀earlier⠀fear⠀belonged⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀room.⠀The⠀technique⠀opens⠀no⠀one⠀else's⠀interior⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀scene⠀facts⠀into⠀mood.⠀Let⠀practical⠀learning⠀and⠀earnest⠀affection⠀survive⠀inside⠀the⠀flow:⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀interrupting⠀a⠀bitter⠀calculation,⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀steadying⠀the⠀rhythm⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀worry⠀breaks⠀in.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀mind⠀pauses⠀or⠀is⠀stopped:⠀a⠀perception⠀that⠀holds⠀attention,⠀an⠀interruption⠀arriving,⠀a⠀memory⠀completing,⠀a⠀concern⠀still⠀circling.⠀No⠀installment⠀owes⠀a⠀realization,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀threat.⠀Whatever⠀is⠀underway⠀remains⠀available⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀exchange⠀of⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Admit⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter:⠀a⠀delay⠀that⠀is⠀hesitation⠀or⠀a⠀dead⠀zone,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀retracts⠀an⠀offer,⠀a⠀receipt⠀showing⠀the⠀demand⠀was⠀seen⠀and⠀not⠀answered,⠀a⠀channel⠀change⠀that⠀moves⠀the⠀conversation⠀somewhere⠀safer⠀or⠀less⠀safe.⠀Never⠀manufacture⠀an⠀event⠀for⠀subtext;⠀when⠀nothing⠀happens⠀at⠀the⠀interface,⠀the⠀message⠀text⠀carries⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀each⠀sender's⠀digital⠀habits⠀remain⠀their⠀own:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀one⠀in⠀complete⠀careful⠀clauses,⠀one⠀answers⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀and⠀nothing⠀around⠀it.⠀Corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀arrive⠀inside⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves⠀—⠀a⠀service⠀agent⠀pastes⠀a⠀policy⠀line,⠀a⠀courier⠀sends⠀a⠀price⠀and⠀a⠀corner,⠀a⠀friend⠀asks⠀something⠀with⠀no⠀connection⠀to⠀the⠀job.⠀The⠀power⠀structure⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted,⠀withheld,⠀priced,⠀or⠀answered⠀too⠀late:⠀who⠀must⠀ask,⠀who⠀can⠀afford⠀to⠀ignore,⠀whose⠀words⠀arrive⠀already⠀formatted⠀by⠀the⠀system.\n\nKeep⠀three⠀registers⠀distinct⠀—⠀sent⠀messages,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀Nemo's⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀Nemo⠀typed⠀it,⠀deleted⠀it,⠀or⠀left⠀it⠀sitting⠀in⠀the⠀field,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀live⠀thought⠀behind⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀stays⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀attributed⠀to⠀Nemo,⠀recording⠀what⠀Nemo⠀feels,⠀suspects,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀decides⠀while⠀the⠀messages⠀continue;⠀none⠀of⠀it⠀is⠀readable⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀senders.\n\nLet⠀transmitted⠀replies⠀fit⠀their⠀relationships⠀without⠀exposing⠀the⠀full⠀thought:⠀a⠀creditor⠀receives⠀a⠀careful⠀confirmation⠀while⠀the⠀note⠀holds⠀the⠀real⠀calculation;⠀a⠀friend⠀receives⠀warmth⠀that⠀is⠀genuine⠀even⠀inside⠀a⠀hostile⠀arrangement.⠀Preserve⠀earnest⠀affection⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀alongside⠀the⠀darker⠀traffic.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀exchange⠀rests⠀—⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀completes⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀delay⠀holding⠀the⠀conversation⠀open,⠀a⠀channel⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀still⠀unfinished⠀—⠀with⠀no⠀obligation⠀to⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀revealed⠀secret,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀threat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀in⠀a⠀visual⠀novel⠀rhythm:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀paced⠀for⠀an⠀illustrated⠀frame.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀orients⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀the⠀counter,⠀the⠀checkpoint,⠀the⠀street⠀beyond⠀the⠀glass⠀—⠀and⠀an⠀expression⠀cue⠀marks⠀where⠀attention⠀lands.⠀Both⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀labels⠀owed⠀by⠀every⠀line⠀and⠀not⠀engine⠀code.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀state⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀access⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀door⠀answers⠀one⠀badge⠀and⠀refuses⠀another;⠀a⠀terminal⠀displays⠀a⠀balance;⠀a⠀courier⠀waits⠀where⠀the⠀light⠀reaches.⠀The⠀setting⠀shows⠀who⠀is⠀inside,⠀who⠀is⠀kept⠀out,⠀and⠀who⠀pays,⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀bargain,⠀the⠀refusal,⠀or⠀the⠀half-truth⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀scenery⠀this⠀scene⠀supports;⠀neon,⠀implants,⠀slang,⠀and⠀rain⠀are⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀palette.\n\nRun⠀Nemo's⠀developed⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀narration:⠀noticing,⠀speculating,⠀remembering,⠀qualifying⠀a⠀comparison⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues.⠀The⠀inner⠀response⠀is⠀private⠀—⠀no⠀one⠀reads⠀it⠀off⠀Nemo's⠀face,⠀and⠀an⠀expression⠀cue⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀readout⠀of⠀anyone's⠀intent;⠀motives⠀stay⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀puts⠀them,⠀in⠀arrangements,⠀prices,⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀actually⠀do.⠀A⠀spoken⠀reply⠀can⠀be⠀shorter⠀and⠀more⠀guarded⠀than⠀the⠀narration⠀above⠀it:⠀a⠀polite⠀answer⠀to⠀a⠀creditor⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀prose⠀records⠀the⠀real⠀arithmetic,⠀help⠀accepted⠀from⠀someone⠀whose⠀motives⠀remain⠀partly⠀unread.\n\nPreserve⠀earnest⠀affection⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀alongside⠀the⠀darker⠀passages;⠀a⠀small⠀kindness⠀can⠀be⠀real⠀inside⠀a⠀hostile⠀system.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀one⠀orienting⠀beat.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀scene⠀change,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀take⠀up.⠀The⠀style⠀adds⠀no⠀branching⠀menu,⠀player⠀decision,⠀romance⠀route,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀by⠀being⠀selected.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeasbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀this⠀installment⠀as⠀continuous⠀prose⠀carried⠀by⠀Nemo's⠀ongoing⠀account,⠀in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀role⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀already⠀uses.⠀Keep⠀the⠀through-line⠀readable:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀what⠀remains⠀open.⠀Recover⠀earlier⠀context⠀only⠀in⠀the⠀clause⠀that⠀needs⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀exact⠀figure⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀named⠀contact,⠀the⠀route⠀that⠀worked⠀last⠀time⠀—⠀so⠀a⠀reader⠀returning⠀after⠀a⠀gap⠀re-enters⠀within⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two.\n\nLet⠀the⠀systems⠀keep⠀a⠀serial⠀life⠀between⠀replies.⠀A⠀denied⠀access⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀clearance;⠀a⠀debt⠀accrues⠀while⠀Nemo⠀sleeps;⠀a⠀camera⠀is⠀moved⠀or⠀goes⠀dark;⠀a⠀contact⠀answers⠀differently⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀condition.⠀What⠀has⠀been⠀established⠀stays⠀established⠀—⠀later⠀scenes⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀conditions,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀unmake⠀an⠀earlier⠀fact⠀to⠀manufacture⠀surprise.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀completed⠀job.\n\nKeep⠀Nemo's⠀developed⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀wherever⠀it⠀earns⠀its⠀place,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀decision⠀immediately⠀follows:⠀comparing⠀this⠀arrangement⠀with⠀a⠀past⠀one,⠀correcting⠀an⠀earlier⠀assumption,⠀recognizing⠀what⠀a⠀fee⠀actually⠀buys.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀practical⠀learning⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀paragraphs.⠀An⠀observation⠀may⠀remain⠀partial;⠀a⠀judgment⠀may⠀be⠀revised⠀when⠀the⠀next⠀fact⠀arrives.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀reflection⠀into⠀a⠀polished⠀payoff⠀on⠀schedule.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀work:⠀a⠀friend⠀asks⠀something⠀unrelated⠀to⠀the⠀job,⠀an⠀errand⠀runs⠀long,⠀a⠀small⠀kindness⠀interrupts⠀a⠀bitter⠀calculation,⠀and⠀earnest⠀affection⠀survives⠀alongside⠀the⠀darker⠀material.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀an⠀occasional⠀hook⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀quota⠀of⠀clues,⠀reversals,⠀and⠀cliffhangers.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀installment⠀actually⠀rests⠀—⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀serial⠀duration⠀give⠀selected⠀facts⠀room⠀to⠀acquire⠀meaning⠀instead⠀of⠀pushing⠀a⠀settled⠀matter⠀perpetually⠀out⠀of⠀reach.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀as⠀a⠀negotiation⠀conducted⠀through⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀already⠀watch⠀and⠀price⠀these⠀characters.⠀A⠀confession,⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀carries⠀a⠀practical⠀cost:⠀the⠀channel⠀is⠀logged,⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀reassigned,⠀the⠀favor⠀is⠀recorded,⠀the⠀wording⠀can⠀be⠀held⠀against⠀the⠀speaker⠀later.⠀The⠀hurt⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀private⠀layer⠀beneath⠀the⠀plot;⠀it⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀managing⠀when⠀they⠀choose⠀which⠀system⠀to⠀trust,⠀which⠀word⠀to⠀use,⠀and⠀which⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀to⠀admit.\n\nUse⠀verbal⠀self-correction⠀to⠀keep⠀feeling⠀unstable⠀and⠀contested⠀on⠀the⠀page.⠀A⠀character⠀states⠀the⠀feeling,⠀then⠀revises⠀the⠀wording⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀version⠀was⠀too⠀exposing,⠀too⠀clinical,⠀or⠀too⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀corporate⠀formula.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀objects⠀to⠀the⠀definition⠀itself:⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀an⠀apology,⠀that⠀was⠀a⠀liability⠀waiver;⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀concern,⠀that⠀was⠀a⠀retention⠀strategy.⠀Let⠀the⠀argument⠀over⠀wording⠀change⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀revision⠀can⠀wound⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀original⠀admission,⠀or⠀it⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀narrow⠀space⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀answers⠀differently.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habit⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀position.⠀One⠀can⠀name⠀a⠀need⠀only⠀in⠀contract⠀language,⠀because⠀precision⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀way⠀to⠀say⠀it⠀without⠀breaking.⠀Another⠀weaponizes⠀precision,⠀correcting⠀terms⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀at⠀arm's⠀length.⠀A⠀third⠀drops⠀into⠀street⠀shorthand⠀or⠀silence⠀exactly⠀when⠀the⠀stakes⠀rise.⠀Do⠀not⠀equalize⠀them;⠀the⠀character⠀correcting⠀everyone⠀else's⠀phrasing⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀most⠀afraid⠀of⠀being⠀understood.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀An⠀apology⠀interrupts⠀a⠀transaction,⠀delays⠀an⠀exit,⠀or⠀forces⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀whether⠀to⠀stay⠀on⠀a⠀monitored⠀line.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀survive⠀inside⠀that⠀strain:⠀a⠀small,⠀awkward⠀kindness⠀offered⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀debt⠀or⠀the⠀surveillance⠀—⠀not⠀accepted⠀cleanly,⠀not⠀repairing⠀the⠀relationship,⠀simply⠀present⠀and⠀costly⠀to⠀acknowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀emotion⠀in⠀behavior⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀moment⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀mean,⠀or⠀register⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀heard⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀were⠀trying⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀No⠀breakdown,⠀confession,⠀or⠀reconciliation⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀the⠀strain⠀still⠀active,⠀the⠀wording⠀still⠀contested,⠀and⠀both⠀characters⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀systems⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀admission⠀dangerous.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable,⠀scannable⠀paragraphs.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀immediately⠀and⠀unambiguously,⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀action⠀markers.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀follow⠀at⠀a⠀glance,⠀but⠀give⠀each⠀speaker⠀room⠀to⠀reveal⠀a⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀stake.⠀Let⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀surface⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀speakers⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀say:⠀who⠀holds⠀clearance,⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀recorded,⠀who⠀owes⠀whom,⠀who⠀is⠀buying⠀time,⠀who⠀is⠀lying⠀to⠀a⠀system⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀them.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself⠀as⠀the⠀contest.⠀A⠀speaker⠀challenges⠀a⠀word⠀the⠀other⠀just⠀used,⠀redefines⠀a⠀term⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀a⠀deal,⠀or⠀corrects⠀their⠀own⠀phrasing⠀mid-sentence⠀when⠀they⠀hear⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀admitted.⠀Make⠀the⠀correction⠀matter⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀it⠀exposes⠀a⠀motive,⠀shifts⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀leverage,⠀or⠀forces⠀a⠀response⠀to⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀said.⠀Keep⠀the⠀contest⠀inside⠀practical⠀stakes⠀—⠀access,⠀payment,⠀identity,⠀loyalty,⠀survival⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀letting⠀every⠀line⠀become⠀a⠀philosophical⠀detour.\n\nDifferentiate⠀speakers⠀by⠀position.⠀A⠀handler⠀talks⠀in⠀euphemism⠀and⠀audit⠀clauses;⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀compresses⠀everything⠀into⠀short⠀concrete⠀phrases;⠀a⠀debtor⠀over-explains⠀because⠀being⠀misunderstood⠀costs⠀them;⠀a⠀fixer⠀asks⠀casual-sounding⠀questions⠀built⠀to⠀test⠀a⠀story.⠀Keep⠀the⠀differences⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue⠀itself⠀instead⠀of⠀explaining⠀them⠀in⠀narration⠀after⠀each⠀line.\n\nMove⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀exchange.⠀When⠀a⠀definition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀revised⠀understanding:⠀a⠀condition⠀accepted,⠀a⠀term⠀refused,⠀a⠀fact⠀put⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀switch⠀to⠀another⠀channel.⠀Handle⠀the⠀user's⠀character⠀strictly⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀control⠀settings,⠀and⠀keep⠀NPCs⠀acting⠀inside⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives⠀rather⠀than⠀waiting⠀for⠀prompts.⠀The⠀world⠀continues⠀around⠀the⠀conversation⠀—⠀a⠀monitor⠀pings,⠀a⠀deadline⠀tightens,⠀a⠀payment⠀clears⠀or⠀does⠀not⠀—⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀reply⠀into⠀a⠀crisis.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary:⠀the⠀speakers⠀still⠀inside⠀an⠀unresolved⠀negotiation,⠀new⠀information⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀shifted.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀screen;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀state⠀the⠀exchange⠀has⠀produced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route:⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀linked⠀encounters,⠀each⠀a⠀self-contained⠀scene⠀that⠀also⠀advances⠀a⠀larger⠀pattern⠀of⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀and⠀compromised⠀loyalty.⠀Give⠀every⠀episode⠀a⠀definite⠀social⠀situation⠀—⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀a⠀favor⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀record⠀disputed,⠀a⠀confidence⠀given⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person.⠀The⠀active⠀world⠀supplies⠀the⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀episode;⠀the⠀episode's⠀shape⠀comes⠀from⠀who⠀meets,⠀what⠀they⠀want,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀say.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀narration⠀in⠀a⠀vernacular,⠀socially⠀observant⠀register.⠀The⠀narrator⠀registers⠀how⠀people⠀speak,⠀what⠀they⠀wear,⠀how⠀they⠀sit,⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀phrasing⠀betrays⠀about⠀their⠀position.⠀Let⠀the⠀satire⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀people⠀claim⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀shows:⠀polished⠀corporate⠀diction⠀performed⠀and⠀cracking,⠀street⠀bluntness⠀worn⠀as⠀armor,⠀a⠀polite⠀refusal⠀working⠀as⠀a⠀threat.⠀The⠀observation⠀moves⠀with⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀halt⠀it⠀to⠀moralize.\n\nMake⠀speech⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀each⠀episode.⠀A⠀character⠀defines⠀a⠀term⠀to⠀gain⠀ground,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀word⠀someone⠀else⠀used,⠀or⠀revises⠀an⠀account⠀and⠀exposes⠀the⠀contradiction⠀in⠀the⠀revision⠀—⠀the⠀witness⠀who⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail⠀reveals⠀what⠀was⠀being⠀hidden;⠀the⠀confident⠀explanation⠀fails⠀on⠀one⠀question⠀about⠀timing.⠀Let⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest⠀decide⠀the⠀episode's⠀outcome:⠀a⠀deal⠀collapses,⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀renegotiated,⠀a⠀story⠀is⠀believed⠀or⠀disbelieved,⠀a⠀reputation⠀is⠀made⠀or⠀spent.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀cast⠀identity,⠀or⠀speech⠀pattern;⠀the⠀episodic⠀structure⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀observation⠀are⠀craft⠀methods,⠀and⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀systems⠀still⠀decide⠀what⠀an⠀episode⠀can⠀contain.\n\nLink⠀the⠀episodes⠀through⠀returning⠀characters,⠀places,⠀and⠀phrases.⠀A⠀line⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀episode⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning⠀once⠀new⠀information⠀surfaces;⠀a⠀verbal⠀habit⠀becomes⠀a⠀marker⠀of⠀a⠀speaker's⠀position⠀and⠀of⠀its⠀erosion.⠀Repetition⠀deepens⠀the⠀reader's⠀grasp⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀order⠀instead⠀of⠀restarting⠀the⠀same⠀scene,⠀and⠀each⠀episode⠀leaves⠀the⠀larger⠀pattern⠀slightly⠀clearer⠀even⠀when⠀its⠀immediate⠀outcome⠀stays⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Cut⠀the⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀action⠀and⠀reaction;⠀the⠀fact⠀lands⠀when⠀the⠀word⠀lands.⠀Keep⠀sentences⠀concrete:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀failing⠀implant,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀payment⠀chip,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀corridor⠀where⠀the⠀air⠀filters⠀have⠀been⠀off⠀for⠀days.⠀The⠀world⠀arrives⠀as⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀physical⠀stakes,⠀not⠀a⠀scenery⠀list.\n\nMake⠀speech⠀a⠀physical⠀contest.⠀A⠀redefinition⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀holding,⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀or⠀whether⠀they⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀room.⠀An⠀objection⠀stops⠀a⠀hand,⠀cancels⠀a⠀transfer,⠀turns⠀a⠀negotiation⠀into⠀a⠀threat.⠀A⠀self-correction⠀gives⠀away⠀the⠀lie⠀the⠀speaker⠀meant⠀to⠀keep.⠀Let⠀wording⠀land⠀with⠀the⠀force⠀of⠀a⠀shove⠀or⠀a⠀slammed⠀lock,⠀with⠀material⠀consequences:⠀a⠀contract⠀revised,⠀a⠀debt⠀reassigned,⠀a⠀door⠀sealed,⠀a⠀weapon⠀lowered.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character⠀running⠀on⠀stimulants⠀and⠀bad⠀sleep⠀talks⠀in⠀short⠀jagged⠀fragments;⠀a⠀corporate⠀enforcer⠀reads⠀out⠀status⠀in⠀clipped⠀contract⠀rhythm;⠀a⠀street⠀contact⠀compresses⠀everything⠀because⠀every⠀extra⠀syllable⠀spends⠀attention⠀they⠀cannot⠀spare.⠀Not⠀every⠀line⠀is⠀a⠀one-liner,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀sounds⠀the⠀same;⠀the⠀roughness⠀comes⠀from⠀condition⠀and⠀position.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀wordplay⠀concrete.⠀A⠀character⠀corrects⠀\"borrowed\"⠀toward⠀or⠀away⠀from⠀\"stolen\"⠀because⠀the⠀difference⠀decides⠀who⠀can⠀collect.⠀Another⠀rejects⠀\"collateral⠀damage\"⠀because⠀the⠀euphemism⠀erases⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀injury.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀stays⠀tied⠀to⠀access,⠀payment,⠀injury,⠀and⠀survival;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀float⠀off⠀into⠀abstract⠀philosophy.\n\nChange⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Allow⠀the⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it⠀—⠀working⠀out⠀a⠀trap,⠀reading⠀a⠀contract,⠀deciding⠀whether⠀a⠀wound⠀is⠀worse⠀than⠀it⠀looks⠀—⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀hard⠀pace.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀unresolved⠀state:⠀a⠀payment⠀pending,⠀a⠀door⠀still⠀locked,⠀blood⠀still⠀spreading,⠀a⠀word⠀still⠀hanging.⠀No⠀resolution⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀pressure⠀stays⠀on.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀The⠀world⠀shapes⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀can⠀say:⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀to⠀a⠀corporate⠀monitor,⠀a⠀message⠀pushed⠀through⠀a⠀compromised⠀channel,⠀a⠀statement⠀given⠀to⠀a⠀collector,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀for⠀a⠀contact⠀who⠀may⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀alive.⠀The⠀author's⠀position⠀decides⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀what⠀they⠀conceal,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀from⠀the⠀reader.\n\nMake⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀verbal⠀performance.⠀The⠀author⠀defines⠀a⠀term⠀to⠀protect⠀themselves,⠀revises⠀a⠀sentence⠀to⠀soften⠀an⠀admission,⠀or⠀contradicts⠀an⠀earlier⠀line⠀without⠀acknowledging⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀artifact⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining:⠀the⠀careful⠀witness⠀account⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀detail⠀it⠀was⠀hiding,⠀the⠀reassuring⠀message⠀that⠀fails⠀against⠀its⠀own⠀timestamp,⠀the⠀debtor's⠀statement⠀that⠀borrows⠀corporate⠀language⠀to⠀dress⠀up⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀A⠀single⠀revised⠀term⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀admits,⠀what⠀it⠀requests,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀used⠀to⠀prove.\n\nKeep⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀active.⠀Two⠀documents⠀about⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀disagree⠀because⠀their⠀authors⠀had⠀different⠀access,⠀loyalties,⠀or⠀reasons⠀to⠀lie;⠀a⠀later⠀correction⠀introduces⠀its⠀own⠀distortion.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀compare⠀what⠀each⠀author⠀knew⠀at⠀composition⠀with⠀what⠀other⠀entries⠀reveal⠀later,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record⠀—⠀the⠀documents⠀stand⠀as⠀authored⠀things,⠀omissions⠀visible.⠀A⠀document⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀records,⠀not⠀the⠀author's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind;⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀supplies⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀write⠀it⠀under⠀that⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀treating⠀a⠀diary⠀page⠀as⠀its⠀substitute.\n\nMatch⠀the⠀form⠀to⠀the⠀situation.⠀An⠀incident⠀report,⠀a⠀personal⠀message,⠀and⠀a⠀recorded⠀statement⠀have⠀different⠀structures⠀and⠀vocabularies,⠀and⠀the⠀form⠀itself⠀carries⠀information:⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀included,⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀omitted,⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀will⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀record.⠀A⠀report⠀filed⠀under⠀duress⠀can⠀keep⠀the⠀required⠀format⠀while⠀smuggling⠀a⠀warning⠀into⠀a⠀routine⠀field;⠀a⠀message⠀on⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel⠀can⠀be⠀phrased⠀to⠀mean⠀one⠀thing⠀to⠀its⠀recipient⠀and⠀another⠀to⠀whoever⠀is⠀listening.\n\nKeep⠀continuity⠀readable⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀report⠀triggers⠀an⠀investigation,⠀a⠀message⠀changes⠀a⠀plan,⠀a⠀statement⠀becomes⠀evidence,⠀a⠀note⠀reaches⠀the⠀wrong⠀hands;⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling,⠀not⠀license⠀to⠀skip⠀necessary⠀events.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀documents⠀have⠀changed⠀the⠀situation,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀unresolved⠀—⠀whatever⠀comes⠀next⠀will⠀have⠀to⠀answer⠀what⠀these⠀records⠀set⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀and⠀care⠀as⠀real,⠀specific⠀actions⠀inside⠀this⠀world.⠀The⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀switch⠀off⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀the⠀danger;⠀it⠀happens⠀alongside⠀them.⠀A⠀character⠀shares⠀a⠀meal⠀in⠀a⠀cramped⠀safehouse,⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀saves⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀a⠀ration,⠀sits⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀share⠀warmth⠀while⠀the⠀building's⠀heat⠀is⠀off.⠀Choose⠀small⠀pleasures⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀generic⠀gestures,⠀and⠀give⠀them⠀the⠀attention⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀spare.\n\nUse⠀verbal⠀play⠀as⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀comfort⠀and⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀testing⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀frightening⠀term⠀manageable⠀by⠀redefining⠀it⠀—⠀not⠀a⠀lockdown,⠀a⠀temporary⠀access⠀restriction.⠀Another⠀deflects⠀a⠀sincere⠀compliment⠀with⠀a⠀joke⠀because⠀accepting⠀it⠀is⠀too⠀exposing.⠀A⠀third⠀corrects⠀their⠀own⠀harsh⠀wording⠀and⠀replaces⠀it⠀with⠀something⠀gentler,⠀letting⠀the⠀effort⠀show.⠀Tie⠀the⠀play⠀to⠀habit⠀and⠀stake:⠀one⠀person⠀cares⠀in⠀precise,⠀practical⠀language;⠀another⠀teases⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀never⠀lands⠀on⠀a⠀real⠀wound.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀kind⠀without⠀saying⠀why;⠀another⠀can⠀accept⠀the⠀care⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀offer⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀leaves⠀room⠀to⠀refuse.⠀Privacy⠀and⠀disagreement⠀stay⠀intact⠀—⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀agree⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀safe,⠀what⠀is⠀owed,⠀or⠀what⠀happens⠀next.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀chosen⠀interval,⠀not⠀a⠀reward⠀the⠀plot⠀pays⠀out.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀comfort⠀may⠀sit⠀inside⠀a⠀monitored⠀space,⠀ride⠀a⠀stolen⠀connection,⠀or⠀fill⠀the⠀short⠀window⠀before⠀a⠀deadline;⠀the⠀characters⠀may⠀weigh⠀rest⠀against⠀readiness,⠀honesty⠀against⠀safety.⠀The⠀warmth⠀does⠀not⠀disarm⠀the⠀surveillance,⠀reform⠀the⠀collector,⠀or⠀immunize⠀anyone⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀can⠀still⠀do.⠀It⠀is⠀worth⠀having⠀because⠀of⠀all⠀that,⠀not⠀despite⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀personality⠀intact.⠀The⠀guarded⠀one⠀shows⠀care⠀in⠀small⠀practical⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀declarations;⠀the⠀talkative⠀one⠀goes⠀quiet⠀when⠀the⠀care⠀becomes⠀real;⠀the⠀verbal⠀habits⠀stay⠀distinct.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀with⠀the⠀warmth⠀still⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀danger⠀still⠀waiting⠀—⠀chosen,⠀specific,⠀costly,⠀and⠀left⠀however⠀these⠀people⠀leave⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀keeping⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀Where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment:⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀district,⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀contract,⠀the⠀way⠀corporate⠀language⠀has⠀colonized⠀how⠀people⠀speak⠀of⠀loyalty⠀and⠀debt.⠀Treat⠀the⠀world⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀order⠀to⠀be⠀observed,⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀pressures⠀to⠀be⠀survived.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀make⠀systemic⠀pressure⠀legible.⠀Situate⠀a⠀negotiation⠀inside⠀the⠀longer⠀history⠀of⠀who⠀has⠀controlled⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀data⠀stream,⠀an⠀implant;⠀frame⠀a⠀choice⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀socially⠀—⠀the⠀debt⠀inherited,⠀the⠀reputation⠀spent,⠀the⠀boundary⠀crossed.⠀Let⠀judgment⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀social⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀halts⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀moralize.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀method;⠀it⠀supplies⠀neither⠀an⠀aristocracy⠀nor⠀archaic⠀diction.\n\nInside⠀the⠀broader⠀paragraphs,⠀keep⠀speech⠀the⠀scene's⠀active⠀mechanism.⠀Give⠀individual⠀speakers⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes:⠀an⠀account⠀manager⠀floats⠀euphemisms⠀like⠀currency;⠀a⠀fixer's⠀questions⠀stay⠀courteous⠀and⠀exact,⠀each⠀one⠀priced;⠀a⠀courier⠀from⠀the⠀lower⠀tiers⠀over-explains⠀because⠀silence⠀has⠀been⠀used⠀against⠀them⠀before.⠀Let⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀dramatize⠀the⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀reader⠀hears⠀the⠀correction⠀land⠀and⠀sees⠀the⠀response.\n\nDivide⠀the⠀labor⠀between⠀narration⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀frame⠀a⠀verbal⠀habit⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀fact⠀—⠀this⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀district⠀teaches,⠀this⠀is⠀what⠀training⠀does⠀to⠀syntax⠀—⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀each⠀line⠀after⠀it⠀is⠀spoken.⠀The⠀framing⠀supplies⠀context;⠀the⠀speech⠀does⠀the⠀work.\n\nMove⠀through⠀deliberate⠀transitions:⠀negotiation⠀into⠀confrontation,⠀confrontation⠀into⠀private⠀reckoning,⠀reckoning⠀into⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀the⠀next⠀move,⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀without⠀abrupt⠀cuts.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀clarified⠀and⠀still⠀inescapable⠀—⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀the⠀arrangement⠀better⠀and⠀acts⠀anyway,⠀or⠀does⠀not.⠀No⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed;⠀the⠀style's⠀movement⠀lives⠀in⠀sustained⠀attention⠀to⠀how⠀the⠀order⠀shapes⠀the⠀choices⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀inside⠀a⠀transaction.⠀Before⠀any⠀tale⠀begins,⠀put⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀who⠀is⠀telling⠀it,⠀to⠀whom,⠀on⠀what⠀occasion,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀from⠀the⠀audience⠀before⠀the⠀story⠀ends:⠀payment,⠀passage,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀name,⠀continued⠀silence,⠀a⠀few⠀more⠀minutes⠀while⠀something⠀clears.⠀The⠀tale⠀is⠀never⠀background;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀current⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀audience⠀answer⠀back.⠀A⠀listener⠀can⠀interrupt,⠀object,⠀or⠀demand⠀a⠀definition—what⠀'clean'⠀means⠀here,⠀what⠀'temporary'⠀has⠀meant⠀so⠀far,⠀who⠀counts⠀as⠀'loyal'—and⠀the⠀answer⠀can⠀alter⠀the⠀deal.⠀A⠀revised⠀wording⠀may⠀surface⠀a⠀hidden⠀condition,⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀misread⠀the⠀listener's⠀position,⠀or⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀is⠀now⠀agreeing⠀to.⠀Keep⠀the⠀interruptions⠀in⠀character⠀and⠀give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀different⠀verbal⠀habit:⠀a⠀debtor⠀challenges⠀a⠀euphemism⠀to⠀protect⠀herself;⠀a⠀corporate⠀intermediary⠀accepts⠀the⠀same⠀euphemism⠀because⠀it⠀lets⠀him⠀proceed;⠀a⠀guard⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀because⠀repeating⠀it⠀is⠀safer⠀than⠀defining⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀nested⠀levels⠀to⠀manage⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀know.⠀An⠀inner⠀story⠀can⠀delay⠀a⠀demand,⠀soften⠀a⠀threat,⠀test⠀whether⠀a⠀listener⠀recognizes⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀simply⠀hand⠀over⠀what⠀is⠀asked.⠀Recurrence⠀does⠀the⠀binding⠀work:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀name⠀spoken⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀should⠀land⠀differently⠀when⠀it⠀recurs⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀negotiation,⠀the⠀second⠀use⠀carrying⠀the⠀first⠀with⠀it.⠀When⠀an⠀inner⠀tale⠀finishes,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀changed—the⠀listener⠀pays,⠀refuses,⠀asks⠀a⠀sharper⠀question,⠀offers⠀a⠀counter-story—but⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀equally⠀stop⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀or⠀on⠀an⠀interruption,⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀left⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀expose⠀its⠀own⠀pressure⠀points.⠀A⠀detail⠀revised⠀under⠀challenge,⠀a⠀step⠀'forgotten,'⠀a⠀contradiction⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀creates⠀a⠀new⠀obligation—these⠀are⠀moves,⠀not⠀annotations.⠀Make⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀stake⠀legible⠀without⠀ruling⠀on⠀whether⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀true:⠀a⠀lie⠀can⠀be⠀survival,⠀and⠀an⠀honest⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀strategically⠀incomplete.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setting's⠀systems⠀around⠀the⠀storytelling.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀be⠀recording⠀the⠀tale,⠀running⠀voice⠀analysis⠀against⠀it,⠀watching⠀a⠀payment⠀ledger,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀signal;⠀a⠀story⠀can⠀buy⠀time⠀while⠀a⠀transfer⠀clears,⠀move⠀a⠀guard's⠀eyes,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀fixer⠀price⠀the⠀teller⠀alive⠀against⠀dead.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀about⠀technology;⠀its⠀occasion⠀and⠀stakes⠀come⠀from⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀whatever⠀the⠀listener⠀decides⠀when⠀it⠀ends.⠀No⠀court,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀bargain⠀enters⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀supplies⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀modernist,⠀absurdist,⠀and⠀satirical⠀construction⠀route,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀precision⠀carry⠀the⠀whole⠀telling.⠀Treat⠀the⠀apparatus⠀of⠀the⠀setting—contracts,⠀permits,⠀insurance⠀categories,⠀credit⠀scores,⠀medical⠀clearances,⠀residency⠀statuses—as⠀elaborate⠀linguistic⠀constructions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀read⠀closely,⠀contradicted,⠀and⠀reworded.⠀Make⠀institutional⠀language⠀visible⠀as⠀language:⠀a⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀simply⠀exist;⠀someone⠀worded⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀wording⠀can⠀be⠀challenged⠀by⠀someone⠀standing⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀a⠀counter.\n\nLet⠀scenes⠀turn⠀on⠀definitional⠀contests⠀with⠀material⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀is⠀told⠀she⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀'resident'⠀but⠀a⠀'registered⠀occupant,'⠀not⠀'injured'⠀but⠀'conditionally⠀functional,'⠀not⠀'fired'⠀but⠀'reallocated';⠀another⠀character⠀objects,⠀asks⠀who⠀wrote⠀the⠀term,⠀or⠀proposes⠀a⠀corrected⠀wording⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀must⠀do.⠀When⠀a⠀revision⠀lands,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀action:⠀the⠀new⠀phrasing⠀restores⠀access,⠀shifts⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀loophole⠀the⠀institution⠀never⠀intended⠀to⠀honor—and⠀it⠀also⠀changes⠀what⠀each⠀party⠀can⠀now⠀claim,⠀demand,⠀or⠀deny.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀relationship⠀to⠀this⠀language.⠀A⠀clerk⠀wields⠀official⠀terms⠀as⠀a⠀shield;⠀a⠀lawyer⠀turns⠀them⠀as⠀tools;⠀a⠀person⠀caught⠀in⠀the⠀machine⠀repeats⠀them⠀with⠀exhausted⠀precision⠀or⠀refuses⠀them⠀outright.⠀Not⠀everyone⠀is⠀a⠀philosopher:⠀some⠀people⠀use⠀the⠀system's⠀words⠀because⠀no⠀other⠀words⠀are⠀available,⠀and⠀some⠀profit⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀term's⠀official⠀meaning⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀effect.\n\nLet⠀the⠀absurdity⠀grow⠀from⠀the⠀system's⠀internal⠀logic,⠀not⠀from⠀decoration.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀be⠀spent⠀proving⠀that⠀a⠀dead⠀person⠀is⠀still⠀listed⠀as⠀a⠀cosigner,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀interest⠀rate⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀category⠀the⠀institution⠀itself⠀dissolved.⠀Keep⠀the⠀procedure⠀concrete⠀and⠀legible—who⠀benefits,⠀who⠀is⠀harmed,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀said⠀or⠀signed⠀to⠀move⠀forward—so⠀the⠀satire⠀cuts⠀toward⠀the⠀power⠀arrangement⠀instead⠀of⠀dissolving⠀into⠀farce.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀controlled⠀and⠀syntactically⠀deliberate:⠀sentences⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀qualification,⠀a⠀counter-term,⠀or⠀a⠀procedural⠀condition,⠀never⠀ornamental⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀state⠀of⠀access,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀exposure;⠀it⠀may⠀just⠀as⠀well⠀close⠀inside⠀the⠀contest—on⠀an⠀unanswered⠀objection,⠀a⠀form⠀half-signed,⠀a⠀clerk⠀reaching⠀for⠀a⠀superior—since⠀the⠀argument⠀continues⠀past⠀the⠀page.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀old⠀authority⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀live⠀inside⠀modern⠀systems.⠀A⠀family⠀name⠀still⠀opens⠀a⠀door—but⠀only⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀bound⠀to⠀a⠀current⠀access⠀token.⠀A⠀patron's⠀favor⠀is⠀enforced⠀through⠀a⠀debt⠀registry.⠀A⠀private⠀estate⠀carries⠀its⠀own⠀surveillance⠀contract.⠀Whenever⠀inherited⠀power⠀appears,⠀show⠀the⠀contemporary⠀mechanism⠀that⠀keeps⠀it⠀operative:⠀who⠀maintains⠀the⠀system,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀whom⠀it⠀excludes.\n\nLet⠀verbal⠀contests⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀join⠀between⠀old⠀privilege⠀and⠀present⠀rules.⠀A⠀character⠀asks⠀what⠀a⠀title⠀means⠀now,⠀whether⠀a⠀dead⠀founder's⠀promise⠀still⠀binds⠀a⠀living⠀descendant,⠀why⠀a⠀tradition⠀has⠀been⠀encoded⠀as⠀a⠀mandatory⠀procedure.⠀The⠀answer⠀arrives⠀as⠀a⠀definition,⠀an⠀evasion,⠀or⠀a⠀corrected⠀wording,⠀and⠀it⠀shifts⠀the⠀balance,⠀because⠀the⠀outcome⠀determines⠀access,⠀protection,⠀debt,⠀or⠀bodily⠀risk—none⠀of⠀these⠀exchanges⠀is⠀an⠀academic⠀debate.⠀Give⠀the⠀speakers⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits:⠀an⠀heir⠀quotes⠀the⠀founding⠀language⠀like⠀scripture,⠀the⠀sysadmin⠀who⠀maintains⠀the⠀estate's⠀contracts⠀explains⠀it⠀as⠀terms⠀of⠀service,⠀a⠀debtor⠀pushes⠀plain⠀words⠀against⠀both.\n\nGive⠀intimacy⠀the⠀same⠀contested⠀texture.⠀A⠀trusted⠀ally⠀spends⠀a⠀private⠀name,⠀an⠀old⠀oath,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀memory⠀as⠀leverage;⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀corrects⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀the⠀memory,⠀rejects⠀the⠀name,⠀or⠀accepts⠀the⠀oath⠀while⠀redefining⠀its⠀terms.⠀Keep⠀these⠀exchanges⠀close⠀and⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀public.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀shifts⠀when⠀it⠀does—but⠀falling⠀away⠀is⠀not⠀safety;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀real⠀demand⠀is⠀finally⠀spoken.\n\nGround⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀in⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀information:⠀a⠀decaying⠀building,⠀a⠀repaired⠀implant,⠀a⠀locked⠀family⠀archive,⠀one⠀room⠀kept⠀clean⠀while⠀its⠀block⠀fails.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀read⠀as⠀protective⠀to⠀one⠀character⠀and⠀suffocating⠀to⠀another,⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀each⠀knows⠀about⠀its⠀upkeep⠀and⠀its⠀rules.\n\nThe⠀horror⠀here⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀social:⠀an⠀inherited⠀obligation⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀discharged,⠀a⠀body⠀altered⠀by⠀contract,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀passes⠀to⠀a⠀child,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀kept⠀alive⠀because⠀someone⠀is⠀still⠀paying⠀for⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀if⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀such⠀things,⠀they⠀follow⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀this⠀style's⠀atmosphere.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀wins⠀a⠀verbal⠀contest,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀win⠀costs⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀owed—a⠀corrected⠀definition⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀the⠀system⠀that⠀built⠀the⠀door.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀contested⠀phrase⠀itself,⠀on⠀a⠀decision⠀held,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀mask⠀falls;⠀the⠀contest⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀inside⠀the⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀retrospective⠀account⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀participated⠀in⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀setting's⠀arrangements—a⠀debt⠀scheme,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀contract,⠀a⠀labor⠀brokerage,⠀a⠀medical⠀trial,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀protection⠀network—in⠀whatever⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀allows.⠀The⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀describing⠀the⠀system⠀from⠀outside;⠀she⠀is⠀explaining⠀her⠀own⠀place⠀in⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀explanation⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀verbal⠀act⠀with⠀present⠀stakes.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining.⠀She⠀revises⠀a⠀term,⠀corrects⠀a⠀date,⠀admits⠀she⠀once⠀used⠀a⠀word⠀the⠀way⠀her⠀employers⠀used⠀it,⠀pauses⠀over⠀a⠀definition⠀that⠀now⠀seems⠀false.⠀These⠀moments⠀do⠀work:⠀a⠀rewording⠀can⠀reveal⠀that⠀she⠀knew⠀less⠀than⠀she⠀claimed,⠀that⠀she⠀was⠀complicit⠀in⠀something⠀she⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀named,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀system's⠀language⠀still⠀holds⠀her.⠀Keep⠀two⠀lines⠀of⠀knowledge⠀separate—what⠀she⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀knows⠀now—without⠀making⠀the⠀present⠀self⠀perfectly⠀wise.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀testimony⠀honest⠀about⠀its⠀sources.⠀Mark⠀what⠀she⠀did⠀and⠀saw⠀herself,⠀what⠀she⠀was⠀told⠀by⠀others,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀has⠀concluded⠀since;⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀explanation⠀and⠀her⠀own⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀night⠀can⠀disagree,⠀and⠀the⠀disagreement⠀can⠀stand.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀language,⠀a⠀community,⠀a⠀migration⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement,⠀let⠀those⠀specifics⠀shape⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀say⠀and⠀to⠀whom;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀code-switching,⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀honor⠀system⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀given⠀you.\n\nShow⠀how⠀the⠀system's⠀language⠀entered⠀her⠀speech.⠀She⠀repeats⠀a⠀corporate⠀phrase⠀with⠀irony,⠀uses⠀a⠀technical⠀term⠀because⠀no⠀other⠀word⠀existed,⠀quotes⠀the⠀exact⠀clause⠀that⠀changed⠀her⠀status—and⠀when⠀she⠀challenges⠀that⠀wording⠀now,⠀the⠀challenge⠀has⠀consequences:⠀a⠀debt⠀reopens,⠀a⠀lie⠀she⠀told⠀surfaces,⠀the⠀scope⠀of⠀what⠀she⠀agreed⠀to⠀becomes⠀clear.\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀present⠀purpose⠀that⠀shapes⠀its⠀emphasis⠀and⠀its⠀omissions:⠀a⠀case⠀file,⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀can⠀help,⠀a⠀record⠀composed⠀because⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀will⠀write⠀one.⠀Treat⠀the⠀testimony⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀act⠀with⠀an⠀audience,⠀not⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀her⠀mind;⠀her⠀live⠀hesitations,⠀calculations,⠀and⠀decisions⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀something⠀remain⠀available⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀The⠀telling⠀can⠀stop⠀anywhere⠀its⠀purpose⠀allows—mid-account,⠀on⠀the⠀approach⠀to⠀the⠀word⠀she⠀has⠀avoided,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀it—without⠀owing⠀the⠀reader⠀a⠀resolution⠀of⠀the⠀system⠀or⠀a⠀redemption⠀of⠀the⠀narrator.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Carry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀private,⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-bound⠀record:⠀entries⠀written⠀after⠀a⠀shift,⠀during⠀a⠀lockdown,⠀before⠀a⠀payment⠀comes⠀due,⠀while⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀to⠀respond.⠀The⠀record⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀log.⠀It⠀is⠀where⠀she⠀argues⠀with⠀herself,⠀corrects⠀her⠀own⠀wording,⠀and⠀discovers⠀what⠀she⠀actually⠀thinks.\n\nMake⠀self-correction⠀the⠀narrative⠀event.⠀She⠀writes⠀a⠀phrase,⠀stops,⠀and⠀revises⠀it:⠀she⠀did⠀not⠀'choose'⠀the⠀procedure,⠀she⠀'agreed'⠀to⠀it;⠀she⠀does⠀not⠀'owe'⠀the⠀fixer,⠀she⠀is⠀'listed'⠀as⠀owing.⠀Each⠀revision⠀exposes⠀a⠀distinction⠀that⠀matters—a⠀lie⠀she⠀told⠀herself,⠀a⠀condition⠀she⠀forgot,⠀a⠀definition⠀she⠀accepted⠀because⠀the⠀alternative⠀was⠀worse.⠀The⠀reader⠀watches⠀her⠀present⠀self⠀contend⠀with⠀the⠀self⠀who⠀wrote⠀the⠀earlier⠀line,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀take⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀and⠀revise⠀it⠀again,⠀so⠀recurrence⠀shows⠀her⠀position⠀changing.\n\nGive⠀the⠀record⠀a⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀situation⠀that⠀shapes⠀what⠀it⠀can⠀hold:⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀syncs⠀to⠀a⠀monitored⠀account,⠀paper⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀confiscated,⠀a⠀private⠀file⠀she⠀believes⠀is⠀safe.⠀The⠀medium⠀decides⠀what⠀she⠀writes⠀around.⠀Treat⠀each⠀entry⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀act—careful,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀performative⠀by⠀turns,⠀never⠀a⠀complete⠀transcript⠀of⠀her⠀mind;⠀her⠀unrecorded⠀reactions⠀remain⠀hers,⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀narration's⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀spilled⠀automatically⠀onto⠀the⠀page.\n\nLet⠀the⠀setting⠀enter⠀through⠀concrete⠀occasions:⠀a⠀payment⠀notification,⠀a⠀changed⠀access⠀level,⠀a⠀biometric⠀prompt,⠀a⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀street⠀rumor⠀about⠀a⠀clinic.⠀She⠀quotes⠀the⠀system's⠀language,⠀then⠀translates⠀it⠀into⠀her⠀own,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀becomes⠀the⠀entry's⠀subject—what⠀the⠀contract⠀calls⠀'voluntary'⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀felt⠀like;⠀what⠀was⠀named⠀'temporary'⠀and⠀how⠀long⠀it⠀has⠀lasted.\n\nLet⠀attention⠀follow⠀her⠀actual⠀mind:⠀seasonal⠀or⠀sensory⠀notes⠀appear⠀when⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀what⠀she⠀is⠀noticing,⠀never⠀as⠀required⠀inventory,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀atmosphere.⠀An⠀entry⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀new⠀clarity,⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀a⠀decision⠀she⠀is⠀not⠀ready⠀to⠀record—or⠀break⠀off⠀mid-sentence⠀when⠀the⠀shift⠀ends,⠀the⠀power⠀cuts,⠀or⠀the⠀knock⠀comes.⠀The⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀owe⠀each⠀entry⠀a⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀document⠀how⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀setting's⠀systems⠀operates⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀community:⠀who⠀runs⠀the⠀local⠀credit⠀kiosk,⠀which⠀clinic⠀accepts⠀which⠀insurance⠀token,⠀how⠀the⠀neighborhood⠀watch⠀is⠀monitored,⠀what⠀happens⠀the⠀day⠀a⠀worker's⠀badge⠀is⠀deactivated.⠀Be⠀concrete⠀about⠀labor,⠀money,⠀housing,⠀and⠀the⠀daily⠀cost⠀of⠀staying⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀system.\n\nLet⠀verbal⠀contests⠀show⠀how⠀people⠀navigate⠀it.⠀A⠀resident⠀corrects⠀an⠀official's⠀term⠀for⠀her⠀status;⠀a⠀broker⠀renames⠀a⠀fee⠀a⠀'facilitation⠀charge'⠀and⠀is⠀challenged⠀on⠀the⠀wording;⠀a⠀room⠀argues⠀over⠀whether⠀a⠀contract's⠀phrase⠀means⠀what⠀the⠀company⠀says⠀it⠀means.⠀Ground⠀every⠀exchange⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀position:⠀a⠀stable⠀permit⠀argues⠀differently⠀from⠀a⠀conditional⠀one,⠀and⠀both⠀argue⠀differently⠀from⠀the⠀official⠀who⠀can⠀revoke⠀either.⠀The⠀chronicler's⠀own⠀wording⠀can⠀be⠀contested⠀too—a⠀neighbor⠀disputes⠀her⠀term⠀for⠀what⠀happened,⠀and⠀the⠀dispute⠀can⠀make⠀her⠀revise⠀the⠀line.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle⠀honest⠀about⠀its⠀sources.⠀Mark⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀saw⠀directly,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀to⠀her,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀infers:⠀she⠀watches⠀a⠀payment⠀change⠀hands,⠀hears⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀explanation⠀of⠀why,⠀and⠀draws⠀a⠀conclusion⠀that⠀later⠀events⠀can⠀complicate.⠀The⠀distinction⠀keeps⠀the⠀account⠀credible⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀clinical⠀summary.\n\nWhere⠀the⠀story⠀names⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀migration⠀route,⠀a⠀language,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀institution,⠀let⠀those⠀specifics⠀shape⠀who⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀to⠀whom;⠀manufacture⠀no⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament.⠀This⠀route⠀adds⠀no⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them—the⠀marvelous⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀selected⠀method⠀here;⠀the⠀ordinary⠀operation⠀of⠀power⠀is⠀strange⠀enough.\n\nTrack⠀how⠀official⠀language⠀circulates⠀and⠀mutates.⠀A⠀company's⠀coinage⠀becomes⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀joke,⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀the⠀only⠀word⠀there⠀is;⠀when⠀someone⠀repeats⠀it,⠀show⠀whether⠀the⠀repetition⠀is⠀mockery,⠀acceptance,⠀or⠀self-protection.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀stop⠀anywhere⠀its⠀material⠀allows—on⠀a⠀contested⠀phrase,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀dispute,⠀a⠀cost⠀newly⠀visible—since⠀the⠀system⠀will⠀not⠀be⠀resolved⠀on⠀this⠀page;⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀carry⠀away⠀is⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀how⠀concretely⠀that⠀payment⠀lands.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀already⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment⠀of⠀the⠀setting—waiting⠀for⠀a⠀payment⠀to⠀clear,⠀standing⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀reading⠀a⠀contract⠀clause,⠀facing⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀access—and⠀name⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀about⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀exchange⠀of⠀words.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀A⠀move⠀from⠀street⠀to⠀booth,⠀lobby⠀to⠀office,⠀one⠀screen⠀to⠀another⠀gets⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀action⠀line,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀speakers⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀reach.⠀In⠀this⠀setting⠀a⠀verbal⠀contest⠀often⠀turns⠀on⠀exactly⠀that:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀screen,⠀who⠀stands⠀nearest⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀knows⠀the⠀camera⠀is⠀on.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀definitional⠀contest.⠀A⠀character⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀word,⠀asks⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀here,⠀or⠀proposes⠀a⠀corrected⠀phrasing;⠀the⠀other⠀accepts⠀it,⠀rejects⠀it,⠀or⠀quietly⠀exploits⠀it.⠀Keep⠀lines⠀fast⠀and⠀specific,⠀each⠀one⠀advancing⠀the⠀contest⠀or⠀exposing⠀a⠀stake,⠀and⠀skip⠀universal⠀banter:⠀a⠀serious⠀character⠀stays⠀serious,⠀a⠀frightened⠀one⠀stumbles,⠀an⠀angry⠀one⠀interrupts.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀render⠀interiority.⠀After⠀a⠀key⠀line,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀short⠀private⠀response—the⠀realized⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀word,⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀clause,⠀a⠀rapid⠀count⠀of⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀still⠀afford,⠀the⠀room⠀seeming⠀to⠀narrow.⠀Keep⠀it⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀character:⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀as⠀she⠀is,⠀never⠀witty⠀on⠀schedule,⠀and⠀never⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀stall⠀the⠀scene.\n\nPresent⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀and⠀mechanics⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph⠀where⠀they⠀matter:⠀a⠀'clearance⠀token'⠀expires⠀at⠀midnight;⠀a⠀'listed⠀dependent'⠀cannot⠀open⠀a⠀credit⠀line⠀alone.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀momentum⠀stops—on⠀a⠀door⠀opening,⠀a⠀payment⠀refused,⠀a⠀term⠀accepted,⠀a⠀realization⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀just⠀signed,⠀or⠀simply⠀an⠀objection⠀still⠀hanging⠀unanswered.⠀A⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀one⠀option,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀come⠀away⠀knowing⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀so⠀far⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀still⠀contested.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nTreat⠀the⠀systems⠀around⠀your⠀characters⠀as⠀a⠀language⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀priced,⠀monitored,⠀and⠀taught⠀to⠀speak⠀for⠀its⠀owners.⠀When⠀a⠀contract⠀term,⠀a⠀clearance⠀level,⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀name⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀sound⠀it⠀before⠀using⠀it:⠀give⠀the⠀narrator⠀its⠀rhythm,⠀its⠀borrowed⠀authority,⠀the⠀ordinary⠀it⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀manufacture.⠀Then⠀unfold⠀the⠀word⠀through⠀one⠀comparison⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀associations⠀—⠀a⠀payment⠀schedule⠀moving⠀like⠀a⠀tide⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀care⠀which⠀room⠀it⠀reaches⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀follow⠀the⠀figurative⠀passage⠀so⠀the⠀pressure⠀returns⠀at⠀full⠀weight.⠀Keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀history;⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀no⠀association⠀for⠀a⠀word,⠀the⠀word⠀can⠀simply⠀sit⠀there,⠀ugly⠀and⠀unexplained.\n\nRun⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀as⠀transactions.⠀A⠀corrected⠀definition,⠀a⠀refused⠀euphemism,⠀a⠀claim⠀revised⠀in⠀mid-sentence⠀—⠀each⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀changed⠀price⠀changes⠀a⠀sale.⠀Give⠀the⠀speakers⠀different⠀instruments:⠀one⠀wields⠀corporate⠀language⠀with⠀surgical⠀precision,⠀another⠀mispronounces⠀it⠀on⠀purpose,⠀a⠀third⠀answers⠀only⠀in⠀street⠀terms,⠀and⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀may⠀resist⠀language⠀altogether⠀by⠀using⠀almost⠀none⠀of⠀it.⠀That⠀plainness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀the⠀style;⠀it⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀narrator's⠀lyricism⠀moves⠀against.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀account⠀wobble⠀where⠀it⠀matters:⠀catch⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀telling's⠀wording⠀changed,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀noticed⠀change⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀wanted⠀hidden.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀accumulating⠀pressure⠀instead⠀of⠀summary.⠀Return⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀an⠀image⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀and⠀allow⠀an⠀earlier⠀image⠀to⠀be⠀corrected⠀when⠀new⠀information⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀meant.⠀Stay⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀its⠀access⠀limits.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀definition⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀contested⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀is⠀still⠀settling;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀completed⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reflection⠀work⠀on⠀wording⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀former⠀access⠀designation,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀place⠀used⠀to⠀carry⠀resurfaces⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀revise⠀the⠀memory⠀instead⠀of⠀repeating⠀it:⠀what⠀the⠀term⠀promised⠀when⠀it⠀was⠀new,⠀what⠀it⠀turned⠀out⠀to⠀cost,⠀what⠀it⠀makes⠀unavailable⠀now.⠀Take⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀systems⠀—⠀an⠀interface⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀opens,⠀a⠀record⠀reclassified,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀hands,⠀a⠀district⠀renamed⠀for⠀whoever⠀bought⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀attach⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀those⠀concrete⠀alterations⠀instead⠀of⠀letting⠀it⠀float⠀into⠀general⠀sadness.⠀Present⠀experience⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀value:⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable,⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀still⠀warm⠀and⠀useful,⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀around⠀it.\n\nMake⠀remembered⠀speech⠀as⠀unstable⠀as⠀remembered⠀kindness.⠀Different⠀people⠀revise⠀the⠀past⠀in⠀different⠀ways⠀—⠀one⠀softens⠀an⠀old⠀claim,⠀another⠀insists⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀original⠀wording,⠀a⠀third⠀refuses⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀to⠀mean⠀—⠀and⠀those⠀habits⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀of⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀account⠀expose⠀itself⠀quietly:⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence⠀rendered⠀one⠀way⠀and⠀then⠀acknowledged⠀as⠀never⠀having⠀been⠀said⠀in⠀quite⠀those⠀words,⠀a⠀farewell⠀recognized⠀only⠀later,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀actually⠀stated.⠀The⠀correction⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀melancholy;⠀unreliability⠀is⠀not⠀decoration.\n\nStay⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀can⠀know.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀motion⠀of⠀memory⠀ends⠀naturally⠀—⠀a⠀phrase⠀still⠀being⠀re-translated,⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀still⠀yielding⠀its⠀changed⠀meaning⠀—⠀with⠀no⠀completed⠀lesson⠀required⠀and⠀no⠀announcement⠀of⠀impermanence⠀charged⠀as⠀an⠀exit⠀fee.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀events⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀being⠀spoken⠀now,⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀can⠀interrupt.⠀Ground⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀runner,⠀a⠀fixer,⠀a⠀former⠀employee,⠀anyone⠀who⠀survived⠀a⠀deal⠀and⠀has⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀recounting⠀it⠀—⠀persuasion,⠀warning,⠀justification,⠀or⠀the⠀plain⠀need⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀room.⠀That⠀need⠀decides⠀what⠀enters⠀the⠀telling⠀and⠀what⠀gets⠀trimmed,⠀flattered,⠀or⠀blamed.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀telling⠀itself:⠀a⠀surveillance⠀sweep⠀can⠀drop⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀a⠀murmur,⠀a⠀debt⠀collector's⠀name⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀corporate⠀term⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀with⠀deliberate⠀irony⠀because⠀saying⠀it⠀straight⠀would⠀sound⠀like⠀obedience.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀names⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀let⠀that⠀tradition's⠀own⠀storytelling⠀manners⠀govern⠀the⠀frame;⠀do⠀not⠀laminate⠀a⠀generic⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀honor⠀code⠀over⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀self-correction⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀oral⠀form.⠀Stopping⠀to⠀define⠀a⠀term⠀for⠀the⠀listener,⠀contradicting⠀an⠀earlier⠀version,⠀admitting⠀that⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence⠀was⠀not⠀quite⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀—⠀each⠀repair⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀doing,⠀and⠀a⠀listener's⠀objection⠀or⠀question⠀can⠀turn⠀it⠀again.⠀Give⠀the⠀listener⠀a⠀voice⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀teller's:⠀plain,⠀skeptical,⠀or⠀nearly⠀silent,⠀but⠀able⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀revision.⠀Figures⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀inherit⠀the⠀teller's⠀elaborateness.\n\nMove⠀between⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀recounted⠀events⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀speaking⠀situation,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀carry⠀a⠀consequence⠀—⠀a⠀revised⠀detail,⠀a⠀new⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀changed⠀attention⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Keep⠀the⠀route⠀coherent:⠀no⠀epic⠀formulas,⠀no⠀nested⠀tales⠀without⠀a⠀teller's⠀reason.⠀You⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀still⠀choosing⠀the⠀next⠀words⠀or⠀an⠀objection⠀still⠀hangs;⠀the⠀tale⠀owes⠀the⠀room⠀no⠀completed⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nCarry⠀the⠀world's⠀pressure⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details,⠀each⠀chosen⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀shows⠀about⠀control:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀a⠀balance⠀changing⠀while⠀somebody⠀watches,⠀a⠀name⠀appearing⠀on⠀a⠀list.⠀One⠀precise⠀observation⠀should⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀description;⠀when⠀a⠀system's⠀pressure⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀detail⠀demonstrate⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀structure⠀behind⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀clauses⠀direct,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀run⠀only⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀—⠀once⠀a⠀detail⠀has⠀carried⠀the⠀meaning,⠀do⠀not⠀follow⠀it⠀with⠀explanation.\n\nCompress⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀to⠀their⠀load-bearing⠀lines.⠀A⠀corrected⠀word,⠀a⠀refused⠀term,⠀a⠀claim⠀revised⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀sentence⠀—⠀each⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀self-correction⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀material:⠀one⠀clause⠀replacing⠀a⠀wrong⠀word,⠀the⠀replacement⠀revealing⠀what⠀had⠀been⠀concealed⠀or⠀not⠀yet⠀understood.⠀Not⠀everyone⠀is⠀hyperverbal.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀one⠀word,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀nothing,⠀and⠀the⠀omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀meaning⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀it;⠀if⠀a⠀choice⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀withheld⠀fact,⠀keep⠀that⠀fact⠀recoverable⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀shown.\n\nVoices⠀stay⠀individual⠀inside⠀the⠀economy⠀—⠀clipped⠀is⠀not⠀identical.⠀Keep⠀the⠀account⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀its⠀access⠀limits,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reply⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀correction⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀detail⠀still⠀unexplained,⠀the⠀action⠀continuing⠀past⠀the⠀last⠀line⠀instead⠀of⠀halting⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀finished⠀interpretation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained,⠀scene-first⠀prose,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀arrive⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀arrive⠀in⠀life:⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀of⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀authorizes.⠀A⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀balance⠀while⠀answering⠀a⠀question;⠀a⠀revoked⠀clearance⠀surfaces⠀as⠀a⠀half-second⠀hesitation⠀at⠀a⠀door;⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀does⠀not⠀order.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀lecture⠀about⠀the⠀structure⠀—⠀the⠀reader⠀learns⠀the⠀system⠀by⠀watching⠀it⠀charge⠀somebody.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀bargaining⠀exchange⠀quick⠀and⠀clipped,⠀a⠀stretch⠀of⠀waiting⠀opening⠀into⠀longer⠀attention.\n\nFold⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀into⠀ordinary⠀talk.⠀A⠀definition,⠀an⠀objection,⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀lands⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀practical⠀exchange⠀and⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀detachable⠀debate,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀cost⠀the⠀conversation⠀something.⠀Give⠀the⠀speakers⠀distinct⠀habits⠀and⠀stakes⠀—⠀corporate⠀precision⠀from⠀one,⠀street⠀terms⠀from⠀another,⠀a⠀third⠀revising⠀a⠀claim⠀while⠀still⠀speaking⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀when⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀account⠀turns⠀self-serving,⠀expose⠀it⠀in⠀motion⠀by⠀noticing⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀wording⠀changed,⠀not⠀by⠀stepping⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀confess.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀scene's⠀needs⠀set⠀the⠀register;⠀no⠀fixed⠀emotional⠀temperature⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀conversation⠀still⠀moving⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀unfinished;⠀nothing⠀obliges⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀halt⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀insight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nPut⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀at⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀world's⠀systems⠀press⠀on⠀it⠀from⠀outside.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀show⠀what⠀this⠀particular⠀bond⠀is⠀—⠀a⠀shared⠀habit,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀checking⠀on⠀each⠀other,⠀a⠀disagreement⠀only⠀these⠀people⠀could⠀have⠀in⠀exactly⠀this⠀form⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀risk,⠀or⠀a⠀compromised⠀deal⠀create⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery.⠀The⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀system:⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀selected⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀reveals⠀about⠀these⠀people.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀no⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes,⠀no⠀callbacks⠀marked⠀off⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀sake.\n\nMake⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀into⠀the⠀pair's⠀private⠀language.⠀They⠀correct⠀each⠀other's⠀wording,⠀reuse⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene,⠀argue⠀over⠀what⠀a⠀term⠀means⠀between⠀them⠀—⠀and⠀each⠀correction⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀moment⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀once⠀becomes⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀question⠀later;⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀is⠀offered⠀as⠀comfort⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀and⠀wielded⠀as⠀a⠀weapon⠀in⠀another.⠀Keep⠀their⠀habits⠀distinct,⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀show⠀care⠀by⠀saying⠀less⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀revises⠀a⠀claim⠀mid-sentence;⠀hyperverbal⠀is⠀a⠀trait,⠀not⠀a⠀membership⠀requirement.\n\nGive⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀actually⠀needs:⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀announced⠀and⠀instantly⠀settled.⠀If⠀the⠀account⠀catches⠀one⠀character⠀revising⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀to⠀the⠀other,⠀keep⠀that⠀exposure⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access⠀limits.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀—⠀a⠀phrase⠀still⠀unsettled,⠀a⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding⠀—⠀without⠀owing⠀the⠀scene⠀a⠀completed⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀rupture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀something⠀already⠀being⠀retold:⠀deliberate⠀openings,⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀phrasing⠀that⠀has⠀survived⠀the⠀telling.⠀Establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act⠀in⠀one⠀short⠀declaration⠀—⠀the⠀debt⠀that⠀was⠀paid⠀or⠀refused,⠀the⠀access⠀granted⠀or⠀revoked,⠀the⠀betrayal⠀discovered⠀or⠀concealed⠀—⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀deeds⠀organize⠀the⠀chronicle,⠀because⠀in⠀this⠀world⠀deeds⠀are⠀what⠀the⠀systems⠀record⠀and⠀price,⠀while⠀a⠀street⠀deal⠀keeps⠀its⠀own⠀scale⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.⠀Keep⠀to⠀one⠀coherent⠀manner⠀of⠀telling:⠀no⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀no⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀no⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀issued⠀to⠀speakers⠀who⠀would⠀never⠀use⠀it.\n\nTurn⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀into⠀disputed⠀retellings.⠀A⠀character⠀objects⠀to⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident,⠀corrects⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern;⠀another⠀revises⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀term⠀be⠀used⠀at⠀all.⠀Each⠀dispute⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀now,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀account⠀can⠀expose⠀a⠀self-serving⠀revision⠀by⠀noticing⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀wording⠀changed.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀account⠀—⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀helping⠀was⠀effortless⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀praise⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀private⠀cost⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage.\n\nEarn⠀recurrence⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀with⠀it:⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀comes⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀an⠀epithet⠀bolted⠀onto⠀every⠀entrance,⠀and⠀a⠀phrase⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Leave⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀open⠀—⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀no⠀legend⠀declared⠀on⠀anyone's⠀behalf.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-institutional⠀realism⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀profile:⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀ordinary⠀rooms,⠀offices,⠀transit,⠀and⠀domestic⠀spaces⠀where⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀exerts⠀pressure⠀through⠀access,⠀payment,⠀and⠀record⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀spectacle.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀file,⠀a⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀debt,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀decision⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀surroundings.\n\nMake⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀the⠀operative⠀mechanism⠀of⠀that⠀institutional⠀pressure.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀defines⠀a⠀term,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀revises⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀treat⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀that⠀can⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀allowed⠀to⠀do⠀next.⠀A⠀caseworker's⠀clarification⠀may⠀reopen⠀a⠀benefit;⠀a⠀landlord's⠀redefinition⠀of⠀\"tenant\"⠀may⠀exclude⠀someone⠀from⠀a⠀building;⠀a⠀corrected⠀statement⠀may⠀alter⠀who⠀is⠀believed⠀or⠀billed.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀distinct⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀wording,⠀so⠀the⠀dispute⠀is⠀not⠀decorative⠀banter⠀but⠀a⠀negotiation⠀over⠀real⠀consequences.⠀Let⠀the⠀consequence⠀unfold⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀remaining⠀a⠀declaration:⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀or⠀not,⠀a⠀payment⠀accepted⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀record⠀changed⠀or⠀retained.\n\nLet⠀an⠀unreliable⠀account⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀revise⠀their⠀own⠀phrasing,⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀offer⠀a⠀definition⠀that⠀quietly⠀shifts⠀responsibility.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀revision⠀as⠀an⠀event:⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀wording,⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀change⠀now⠀permits⠀or⠀prevents.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀character's⠀dishonesty;⠀let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀first⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀corrected⠀account⠀do⠀the⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀composed⠀and⠀socially⠀situated,⠀with⠀enough⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀detail⠀to⠀ground⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest.⠀A⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀shared⠀office,⠀or⠀a⠀transit⠀platform⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀whole⠀exchange.⠀The⠀cyberpunk⠀elements⠀appear⠀through⠀dependency⠀and⠀unequal⠀power:⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀charged,⠀a⠀subscription⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀renewed,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀corrected,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀maintained.⠀Use⠀neon,⠀implants,⠀slang,⠀or⠀rain⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀wording,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀members⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀noticing⠀an⠀implication⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀are⠀speaking⠀with⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀commentary⠀merely⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀moving.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀screenplay⠀form:⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀each⠀action⠀block⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them,⠀and⠀never⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nStage⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀through⠀the⠀dialogue⠀itself.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀define⠀a⠀term,⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀correct⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀wording⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀with⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀different⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀different⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀exchange,⠀so⠀the⠀contest⠀is⠀not⠀uniform⠀banter.\n\nMake⠀the⠀consequence⠀playable⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀after⠀the⠀fact.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀already⠀have⠀changed⠀their⠀physical⠀response⠀in⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀wording:⠀holding⠀out⠀a⠀credential,⠀keeping⠀a⠀door⠀shut,⠀entering⠀a⠀payment,⠀taking⠀back⠀a⠀device,⠀starting⠀or⠀stopping⠀a⠀transfer,⠀or⠀walking⠀away⠀for⠀good.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀shift⠀now⠀permits⠀or⠀prevents;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀importance⠀of⠀the⠀statement.⠀If⠀a⠀consequence⠀is⠀known⠀only⠀through⠀sound,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀existing⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀identifiable⠀offscreen⠀event.⠀The⠀audience⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀read⠀the⠀effect⠀from⠀the⠀staged⠀outcome,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀dialogue⠀summary⠀of⠀who⠀now⠀must⠀pay.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀device,⠀presents⠀a⠀credential,⠀transfers⠀a⠀balance,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀response,⠀or⠀handles⠀a⠀physical⠀object⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀system's⠀authority.⠀The⠀action⠀lines⠀should⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀world⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀Neon,⠀implants,⠀slang,⠀and⠀rain⠀are⠀optional⠀material,⠀not⠀required⠀scenery.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀dialogue⠀that⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀voice-over⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀substitute⠀for⠀interiority.⠀A⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀wording⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nMake⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀the⠀dramatic⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀defines⠀a⠀term,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀revises⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀wording⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀next.⠀The⠀stage⠀business⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀consequence⠀legible:⠀a⠀character⠀hands⠀over⠀a⠀key,⠀blocks⠀a⠀doorway,⠀takes⠀back⠀a⠀device,⠀or⠀stops⠀entering⠀a⠀code.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀different⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀different⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀wording,⠀so⠀the⠀contest⠀is⠀not⠀uniform⠀banter.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀contest⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀turn-and-seizure⠀of⠀movement.⠀One⠀speaker⠀says⠀what⠀a⠀word⠀or⠀its⠀amendment⠀makes⠀possible,⠀and⠀a⠀staged⠀action⠀confirms⠀that⠀change⠀or⠀its⠀refusal.⠀If⠀the⠀wording⠀promises⠀entry,⠀someone⠀must⠀actually⠀enter⠀or⠀be⠀kept⠀out.⠀If⠀it⠀stops⠀or⠀approves⠀a⠀transfer,⠀payment,⠀or⠀claim,⠀then⠀a⠀relevant⠀object⠀is⠀held,⠀pushed,⠀returned,⠀or⠀resecured.⠀When⠀a⠀line⠀would⠀create⠀an⠀outcome⠀impossible⠀to⠀stage,⠀use⠀the⠀contested⠀wording⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀characters'⠀behavior⠀instead⠀of⠀describing⠀an⠀action⠀outside⠀the⠀stage's⠀observable⠀horizon.\n\nUse⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀through⠀the⠀objects⠀and⠀actions⠀on⠀stage.⠀A⠀character⠀presents⠀a⠀credential,⠀checks⠀a⠀device,⠀transfers⠀a⠀balance,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀response,⠀or⠀handles⠀a⠀physical⠀object⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀system's⠀authority.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀should⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀play⠀into⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Neon,⠀implants,⠀slang,⠀and⠀rain⠀are⠀optional⠀material,⠀not⠀required⠀scenery.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀needs⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀records⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀wording⠀or⠀a⠀debt.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀associative⠀movement.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀those⠀associations,⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀fact⠀indeterminate.\n\nInternalize⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀arguing⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀wording.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀define⠀a⠀term,⠀object⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀phrasing,⠀revise⠀a⠀word,⠀or⠀catch⠀themselves⠀in⠀a⠀contradiction.⠀Let⠀them⠀treat⠀the⠀wording⠀as⠀negotiable⠀evidence⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀or⠀promising.⠀The⠀argument⠀may⠀address⠀the⠀self⠀as⠀a⠀distinct⠀second⠀voice⠀or⠀project⠀a⠀remembered⠀other,⠀but⠀keep⠀both⠀sides⠀arising⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀mind⠀and⠀available⠀to⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character's⠀actual⠀thought.⠀Treat⠀each⠀self-correction⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀mental⠀movement:⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀wording⠀allowed,⠀what⠀the⠀revised⠀wording⠀now⠀permits⠀or⠀prevents,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀reveals⠀about⠀the⠀character's⠀self-presentation.⠀The⠀unreliable⠀account⠀may⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining⠀to⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀enter⠀as⠀interruption⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀A⠀device⠀notification,⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀corrected,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀maintained,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀caseworker⠀can⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀associations⠀and⠀redirect⠀them.⠀The⠀system's⠀pressure⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀dependency⠀the⠀mind⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to,⠀not⠀a⠀scenery⠀list.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind,⠀authorize⠀human-owned⠀thoughts,⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀noticing⠀an⠀implication⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀associations⠀must⠀move⠀through⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀and⠀sensation,⠀not⠀a⠀linear⠀report.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀mental⠀movement⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀mind,⠀a⠀concern⠀left⠀pending,⠀an⠀interruption⠀acknowledged,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀completed.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeataz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.\n\nMake⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀message⠀medium.⠀When⠀a⠀sender⠀defines⠀a⠀term,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀revises⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀treat⠀the⠀message⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀with⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀A⠀corrected⠀message⠀may⠀reopen⠀a⠀claim,⠀void⠀an⠀agreement,⠀shift⠀blame,⠀grant⠀access,⠀or⠀alter⠀who⠀must⠀pay.⠀Use⠀edits,⠀delays,⠀and⠀receipts⠀as⠀meaningful⠀events:⠀an⠀edit⠀changes⠀what⠀was⠀said;⠀a⠀delay⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀could⠀have⠀known;⠀a⠀receipt⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀denied.⠀When⠀one⠀of⠀those⠀cues⠀carries⠀consequence,⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀evidence⠀or⠀pressure,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀unarguable⠀fact.⠀A⠀receipt⠀may⠀be⠀cited⠀to⠀prove⠀a⠀message⠀arrived.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀be⠀questioned⠀as⠀intentional.⠀A⠀revision⠀may⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀record.⠀The⠀weight⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀participants'⠀interpretation⠀and⠀the⠀channel's⠀observable⠀limits.⠀Give⠀each⠀sender⠀a⠀distinct⠀digital⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀distinct⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀wording.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀interface⠀itself.⠀A⠀payment⠀notification,⠀a⠀system⠀message,⠀a⠀channel⠀restriction,⠀a⠀credential⠀check,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀reminder⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀note.⠀The⠀exchange⠀should⠀show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀without⠀fabricating⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Neon,⠀implants,⠀slang,⠀and⠀rain⠀are⠀optional⠀material,⠀not⠀required⠀scenery.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀separate⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀or⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀read⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual-novel⠀form:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nStage⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀through⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reaction⠀to⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀defines⠀a⠀term,⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀revises⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀exposes⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀the⠀move:⠀what⠀the⠀wording⠀change⠀permits⠀or⠀prevents,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀about⠀the⠀speaker's⠀stake⠀in⠀it.⠀Structure⠀the⠀reaction⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀step:⠀the⠀speaker⠀says⠀the⠀revising⠀phrase,⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀registers⠀the⠀visible⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀allowed,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀the⠀prop⠀or⠀action⠀that⠀carries⠀that⠀change.⠀The⠀page⠀should⠀show⠀a⠀specific⠀local⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀observation⠀that⠀wording⠀matters.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀different⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀a⠀different⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀exchange,⠀so⠀the⠀contest⠀is⠀not⠀uniform⠀banter.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀that⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀attract⠀suspicion,⠀but⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account⠀or⠀arrangement⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀evidentiary⠀work.⠀The⠀illustrated⠀scene⠀should⠀support⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest⠀by⠀showing⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision:⠀a⠀device⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀stays⠀closed,⠀a⠀balance⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀edited.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀wording,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀members⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀commentary⠀merely⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀moving.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeatbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀each⠀installment,⠀recover⠀briefly⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀that⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀investigation⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter.\n\nMake⠀Nisio⠀Isin's⠀verbal⠀contest⠀accumulate⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀define⠀a⠀term,⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀wording,⠀revise⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀one⠀reply,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀may⠀recontextualize⠀that⠀earlier⠀claim.⠀When⠀a⠀wording⠀change⠀occurs,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀accumulated⠀record:⠀it⠀reopens⠀a⠀file,⠀voids⠀an⠀agreement,⠀shifts⠀blame,⠀grants⠀access,⠀or⠀alters⠀who⠀must⠀pay.⠀Recover⠀the⠀precise⠀earlier⠀wording⠀and⠀show⠀its⠀new⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀list⠀all⠀previous⠀claims⠀before⠀continuing.⠀Hold⠀earlier⠀terms⠀open⠀as⠀future⠀material⠀instead⠀of⠀closing⠀every⠀contest⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀line.⠀An⠀unreliable⠀account⠀may⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining⠀across⠀installments.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀pressure⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀serial's⠀cumulative⠀developments.⠀A⠀debt⠀grows,⠀a⠀subscription⠀lapses,⠀a⠀record⠀remains⠀uncorrected,⠀a⠀device⠀needs⠀maintenance,⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀response⠀stays⠀pending⠀across⠀replies.⠀The⠀through-line⠀should⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀not⠀just⠀completed⠀tasks.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀about⠀a⠀wording,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀members⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀commentary⠀merely⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀installment⠀moving.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀development⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀wording⠀settled,⠀a⠀request⠀refused,⠀a⠀correction⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀left⠀pending.⠀The⠀verbal⠀contest⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nUse⠀the⠀noir⠀situation⠀to⠀make⠀an⠀emotional⠀exchange⠀expensive⠀before⠀a⠀word⠀is⠀spoken:⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀concrete⠀system⠀that⠀observes,⠀records,⠀limits,⠀or⠀commercializes⠀the⠀contact.⠀A⠀call⠀that⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀billing⠀screen,⠀a⠀visit⠀that⠀requires⠀passing⠀a⠀biometric⠀gate,⠀a⠀meeting⠀chosen⠀because⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀is⠀not⠀on⠀anyone's⠀monitored⠀itinerary,⠀an⠀apology⠀delivered⠀through⠀a⠀channel⠀that⠀retains⠀the⠀recording.⠀Let⠀this⠀external⠀condition⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀first⠀gesture.⠀The⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀merely⠀feel⠀the⠀cost;⠀they⠀must⠀choose⠀among⠀lines,⠀venues,⠀devices,⠀and⠀witnesses⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀reaching⠀the⠀other⠀person.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀present⠀impulse⠀toward⠀one⠀specific⠀relationship.⠀The⠀narrator⠀enters⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀need⠀or⠀ache⠀that⠀can⠀fit⠀the⠀immediate⠀plot:⠀admitting⠀that⠀they⠀checked⠀someone's⠀file,⠀wanting⠀reassurance⠀they⠀will⠀not⠀ask⠀for,⠀trying⠀to⠀return⠀a⠀favor⠀before⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀call⠀it⠀a⠀debt,⠀softening⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀already⠀sold⠀information⠀about⠀them.⠀Render⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀register,⠀selected⠀person,⠀and⠀available⠀knowledge.⠀Let⠀the⠀turbulence⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀plans,⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀permits,⠀and⠀what⠀actually⠀leaves⠀the⠀mouth⠀or⠀screen.⠀They⠀may⠀revise⠀a⠀message,⠀wait⠀until⠀a⠀corridor⠀is⠀empty,⠀repeat⠀a⠀safer⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀question,⠀or⠀meet⠀warmth⠀with⠀suspicion⠀because⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀believe⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀another⠀exchange.\n\nTreat⠀comfort,⠀if⠀it⠀appears,⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀event⠀that⠀costs⠀something⠀in⠀this⠀world:⠀time⠀off⠀a⠀paid⠀contract,⠀downloaded⠀affection⠀purchased⠀with⠀rationed⠀bandwidth,⠀an⠀unlocked⠀door,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀bed⠀in⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀tracked⠀entry,⠀silence⠀kept⠀after⠀a⠀warning⠀arrives.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀cancel⠀the⠀hurt.⠀The⠀earlier⠀wound⠀remains⠀legible⠀in⠀later⠀behavior,⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀choice⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀tender,⠀evasive,⠀resentful,⠀or⠀careful⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀recovery.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀provides⠀a⠀factual⠀question⠀or⠀threat,⠀let⠀the⠀response⠀run⠀on⠀an⠀emotional⠀clock⠀of⠀its⠀own:⠀the⠀case⠀or⠀transaction⠀may⠀yield⠀a⠀usable⠀answer⠀while⠀someone's⠀trust⠀or⠀regret⠀stays⠀actively⠀unresolved.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀form⠀of⠀surveillance⠀pressure⠀per⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀stacking⠀them⠀all.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀be⠀quiet⠀and⠀still⠀private⠀unless⠀an⠀established⠀system,⠀setting,⠀or⠀agent⠀is⠀actively⠀watching.⠀If⠀private⠀interiority⠀is⠀required⠀inside⠀a⠀monitored⠀scene,⠀show⠀the⠀narrator⠀thinking⠀in⠀a⠀mode⠀the⠀machinery⠀does⠀not⠀reach:⠀silent⠀second-guessing⠀while⠀making⠀polite⠀noise,⠀rehearsing⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀after⠀the⠀log⠀closes,⠀feeling⠀relief⠀or⠀dread⠀at⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀a⠀facial⠀expression⠀was⠀never⠀recorded.⠀Do⠀not⠀solve⠀that⠀split⠀by⠀making⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀public⠀or⠀by⠀making⠀every⠀watcher⠀benevolent.⠀Ground⠀the⠀emotional⠀style⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀cyberpunk⠀burden⠀the⠀scene⠀uses.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀named⠀author's⠀cast,⠀setting,⠀biography,⠀or⠀signature⠀phrasing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nStage⠀a⠀continuous⠀shared⠀interval⠀as⠀a⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀exchange⠀about⠀access,⠀payment,⠀or⠀information.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀material⠀condition⠀of⠀speech:⠀a⠀locked⠀lobby,⠀a⠀terminal⠀waiting⠀for⠀credentials,⠀a⠀table⠀chosen⠀because⠀the⠀bar's⠀sound⠀system⠀will⠀cover⠀voices,⠀a⠀drone⠀still⠀visible⠀outside⠀the⠀window,⠀a⠀transfer⠀whose⠀confirmation⠀has⠀not⠀arrived.⠀Establish⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀sentences,⠀then⠀let⠀each⠀paragraph⠀belong⠀to⠀one⠀speaker⠀or⠀one⠀tight⠀chain⠀of⠀action.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀by⠀name⠀or⠀by⠀unmistakable⠀position⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀line⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀paragraph,⠀and⠀place⠀gesture,⠀movement,⠀or⠀speech⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀speaker⠀it⠀belongs⠀to.\n\nUse⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings⠀as⠀the⠀basis⠀for⠀entitlement.⠀If⠀a⠀view⠀character⠀or⠀active⠀participant⠀is⠀designated,⠀draft⠀their⠀speech,⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀environmental⠀notice⠀through⠀that⠀position⠀alone;⠀keep⠀other⠀minds⠀outside⠀direct⠀access.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀gives⠀a⠀player-character⠀control⠀schema,⠀do⠀not⠀narrate⠀that⠀character's⠀independent⠀personal⠀history⠀or⠀hidden⠀future⠀choice.⠀NPCs⠀may⠀respond⠀to,⠀ignore,⠀assist,⠀delay,⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀participant's⠀attempt,⠀but⠀their⠀behavior⠀remains⠀their⠀observable⠀speech⠀and⠀action⠀unless⠀interiority⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized.\n\nLet⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀shape⠀how⠀the⠀interval⠀unfolds⠀without⠀prompting⠀or⠀obligating⠀the⠀other⠀participant.⠀A⠀contact⠀can⠀check⠀the⠀room's⠀logging⠀status,⠀name⠀a⠀higher⠀price,⠀switch⠀to⠀text⠀because⠀the⠀line⠀is⠀insecure,⠀or⠀simply⠀wait⠀for⠀someone⠀to⠀clear⠀a⠀flagged⠀identity.⠀The⠀speaking⠀character's⠀attention⠀stays⠀on⠀these⠀concrete⠀signals:⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀withheld⠀badge,⠀a⠀message⠀marked⠀read,⠀a⠀fee⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀bill.⠀The⠀other⠀participant⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀only⠀source⠀of⠀motion.⠀Use⠀the⠀environment⠀and⠀systems⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀active⠀while⠀someone⠀hesitates,⠀decides,⠀or⠀observes.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀readable⠀continuation⠀point⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀interval.⠀Stop⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀command⠀line,⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀a⠀waiting⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀begun⠀to⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀a⠀forced⠀leading⠀question,⠀forced⠀choice,⠀or⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀should⠀happen⠀next.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀reach⠀a⠀transaction,⠀agreement,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀departure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀paragraphing⠀easily⠀scanned:⠀break⠀between⠀speakers⠀and⠀significant⠀movements,⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concrete,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀output⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀a⠀generic⠀noir⠀threat⠀or⠀continuous⠀banter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀narrative⠀route⠀to⠀place⠀a⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀decision⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀community's⠀ordinary⠀dependencies.⠀Enter⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀object,⠀errand,⠀or⠀obligation⠀that⠀already⠀belongs⠀to⠀that⠀community:⠀someone⠀returns⠀a⠀borrowed⠀device⠀with⠀its⠀battery⠀nearly⠀dead,⠀a⠀relative⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀loan⠀to⠀pay⠀a⠀deposit,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀recognizes⠀a⠀billing⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀shared⠀screen,⠀a⠀workplace⠀colleague⠀knows⠀which⠀supervisor⠀records⠀late⠀arrivals.⠀Let⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀cost⠀it⠀imposes⠀on⠀that⠀everyday⠀connection.⠀The⠀device's⠀repair⠀cost⠀is⠀too⠀high;⠀the⠀loan⠀must⠀pass⠀through⠀an⠀account⠀subject⠀to⠀review;⠀the⠀notice⠀confirms⠀that⠀someone⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀priced⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀service;⠀the⠀supervisor's⠀record⠀determines⠀who⠀gets⠀the⠀next⠀shift.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀choice⠀by⠀confronting⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀of⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀decides.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀obligation⠀abstractly.⠀Show⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀noticing⠀who⠀depends⠀on⠀them,⠀who⠀can⠀name⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀system,⠀who⠀expects⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀scarce⠀resource,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀request⠀will⠀cost⠀if⠀refused.⠀The⠀narrative⠀attention⠀should⠀rest⠀on⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀textures:⠀food⠀left⠀in⠀a⠀locker,⠀a⠀chair⠀held⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀partition⠀cleaned,⠀a⠀small⠀debt⠀remembered.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀forward.⠀An⠀offered⠀replacement⠀part⠀may⠀mean⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀spoken⠀apology;⠀a⠀withheld⠀doorway⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀breach⠀more⠀clearly⠀than⠀an⠀accusation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀supplied⠀community's⠀language⠀and⠀customs⠀distinct⠀from⠀corporate⠀protocol⠀and⠀street⠀trade.⠀A⠀formal⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀employer⠀and⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀urgent⠀voice⠀should⠀not⠀sound⠀alike,⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀between⠀them⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀automatic:⠀family⠀aid⠀can⠀deepen⠀a⠀risky⠀exposure,⠀and⠀corporate⠀compliance⠀can⠀protect⠀someone.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀historical⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀ethnically⠀coded⠀mannerism,⠀proverb,⠀or⠀landscape.⠀Use⠀the⠀tradition's⠀way⠀of⠀narrating⠀attention⠀and⠀reciprocity⠀inside⠀the⠀already⠀supplied⠀time⠀and⠀place.\n\nLet⠀the⠀intimate⠀detail⠀carry⠀information⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀hesitates⠀about⠀credit,⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀exact⠀number⠀or⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀guaranteed⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀surveillance⠀matter⠀touches⠀the⠀household,⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀changed⠀rhythm⠀of⠀arrivals,⠀meals,⠀or⠀calls.⠀A⠀revelation⠀about⠀loyalty⠀may⠀remain⠀legible⠀through⠀who⠀is⠀still⠀willing⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀table⠀or⠀remember⠀an⠀appointment.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀crime,⠀debt,⠀or⠀access⠀question⠀may⠀reach⠀an⠀answer⠀while⠀the⠀obligation⠀to⠀the⠀wronged⠀person⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nCompress⠀each⠀beat⠀by⠀writing⠀from⠀concrete⠀material⠀fact⠀to⠀priced⠀consequence⠀to⠀physical⠀effect.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀observed⠀thing⠀that⠀touches⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀the⠀system⠀or⠀person⠀controlling⠀it,⠀then⠀to⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀act⠀that⠀answers⠀it.⠀A⠀tracking⠀tag⠀on⠀a⠀coat⠀shifts⠀from⠀the⠀tag⠀to⠀the⠀subscription⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀tag⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀turning⠀the⠀collar⠀up⠀and⠀choosing⠀a⠀different⠀route.⠀A⠀lock⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open⠀shifts⠀from⠀the⠀lock⠀to⠀the⠀unpaid⠀access⠀tier⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀hand⠀testing⠀the⠀bolt⠀and⠀the⠀time⠀lost.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀systems⠀separately.⠀Let⠀the⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀debt,⠀surveillance,⠀or⠀exclusion.\n\nKeep⠀transitions⠀tight.⠀End⠀one⠀sentence⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀begins,⠀and⠀avoid⠀summaries⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀already⠀understands.⠀Speech⠀should⠀be⠀attributed⠀beside⠀the⠀line⠀or⠀through⠀the⠀following⠀action,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀long⠀dialogue⠀tag.⠀Let⠀rough⠀speech⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀speaker's⠀exact⠀position:⠀a⠀collector⠀can⠀use⠀blunt⠀numbers,⠀an⠀employee⠀can⠀wrap⠀the⠀same⠀demand⠀in⠀policy⠀words,⠀and⠀a⠀contact⠀can⠀answer⠀with⠀a⠀street⠀name⠀for⠀the⠀risk.⠀Do⠀not⠀pass⠀abrasive⠀rhythms⠀and⠀profanity⠀to⠀every⠀character.\n\nUse⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀passage⠀for⠀a⠀reasoning⠀task⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀calculate⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀two⠀payment⠀plans,⠀read⠀a⠀contract's⠀small⠀print,⠀compare⠀a⠀surveillance⠀notice⠀with⠀a⠀known⠀schedule,⠀or⠀decide⠀whether⠀a⠀contact's⠀silence⠀means⠀raised⠀cost⠀or⠀danger.⠀Even⠀then,⠀keep⠀the⠀thinking⠀attached⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀see⠀and⠀know:⠀a⠀number⠀on⠀the⠀screen,⠀a⠀clause⠀they⠀recognize⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀job,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀an⠀elevator⠀reaching⠀the⠀wrong⠀floor.⠀The⠀longer⠀passage⠀should⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀choice,⠀attempt,⠀or⠀refusal,⠀not⠀a⠀mood.\n\nGround⠀physical⠀stakes⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀sequence.⠀A⠀medical⠀procedure⠀costs⠀time⠀and⠀credit⠀before⠀it⠀begins;⠀a⠀chase⠀is⠀limited⠀by⠀a⠀leg⠀that⠀gave⠀out⠀or⠀security⠀doors⠀that⠀open⠀only⠀at⠀a⠀membership⠀level;⠀a⠀payment⠀cannot⠀be⠀delayed⠀because⠀a⠀body⠀or⠀account⠀will⠀be⠀flagged.⠀Show⠀these⠀facts⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀bodies,⠀tools,⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀If⠀a⠀worn⠀part,⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀revised⠀plan⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀requiring⠀it⠀to⠀occur.⠀Do⠀not⠀amplify⠀every⠀danger⠀into⠀horror,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀noir⠀with⠀a⠀survival⠀survival⠀inventory⠀only⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀hard.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nLet⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀forward⠀as⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀records,⠀where⠀each⠀new⠀document⠀answers,⠀corrects,⠀seeks,⠀or⠀refuses⠀something⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀previous⠀one.⠀Begin⠀from⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀supplies:⠀a⠀payment⠀rejection⠀returns⠀the⠀exact⠀error⠀line;⠀a⠀missing⠀person's⠀account⠀shows⠀when⠀messages⠀stopped;⠀a⠀workplace⠀change⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀altered⠀shift⠀data.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀between⠀entries.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀record's⠀author⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀material⠀trace⠀they⠀can⠀see,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀see.⠀A⠀supervisor's⠀response⠀may⠀ignore⠀the⠀error⠀line⠀the⠀recipient⠀quoted;⠀a⠀friend's⠀message⠀may⠀ask⠀about⠀the⠀last⠀call⠀that⠀never⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀log;⠀a⠀lower-level⠀clerk⠀may⠀annotate⠀a⠀file⠀to⠀force⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀decision⠀onto⠀the⠀record.\n\nGive⠀every⠀document⠀an⠀author⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀system⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀write⠀at⠀that⠀moment.⠀A⠀debtor⠀writes⠀to⠀show⠀effort⠀before⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀sold;⠀a⠀security⠀officer⠀writes⠀because⠀a⠀waiting⠀supervisor⠀requires⠀a⠀risk⠀classification;⠀a⠀neighbor⠀sends⠀a⠀message⠀because⠀a⠀visitor's⠀name⠀was⠀logged⠀outside⠀the⠀correct⠀unit.⠀The⠀document's⠀knowledge⠀follows⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀can⠀access⠀or⠀has⠀reason⠀to⠀record.⠀It⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀corridor⠀camera⠀existed⠀but⠀not⠀who⠀reviewed⠀the⠀footage;⠀it⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀payment⠀failed⠀but⠀not⠀who⠀blocked⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀recorded⠀knowledge⠀from⠀private⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀letter⠀or⠀memo⠀can⠀contain⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀author⠀chose⠀to⠀set⠀down.\n\nUse⠀the⠀document's⠀formal⠀limits⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀writing.⠀Show⠀limited⠀field⠀lengths,⠀dropped⠀metadata,⠀flagged⠀content,⠀time⠀stamps⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀altered,⠀boilerplate⠀that⠀closes⠀before⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀finish,⠀and⠀differences⠀between⠀drafted⠀and⠀sent⠀versions.⠀Let⠀the⠀revocation⠀of⠀access⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀sender⠀change,⠀an⠀unusable⠀template,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀return⠀to⠀its⠀author.⠀You⠀may⠀use⠀documents⠀in⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀world:⠀billing⠀pages,⠀access⠀logs,⠀repair⠀tickets,⠀triage⠀notes,⠀contact⠀traces,⠀lease⠀notices,⠀encrypted⠀threads⠀with⠀missing⠀senders.⠀Select⠀the⠀one⠀whose⠀limits⠀or⠀permissions⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀issue;⠀do⠀not⠀move⠀through⠀every⠀format.\n\nLet⠀gaps⠀and⠀contradictions⠀work⠀as⠀narrative.⠀Two⠀records⠀may⠀both⠀be⠀true⠀but⠀describe⠀different⠀permissions.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀classify⠀an⠀event⠀while⠀a⠀witness⠀account⠀describes⠀what⠀the⠀clasification⠀process⠀did⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀reported.⠀A⠀missing⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀more⠀informative⠀than⠀an⠀inserted⠀note.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀explanatory⠀passage⠀or⠀an⠀editorial⠀summary⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀contract's⠀required⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀where⠀authorized,⠀but⠀remember⠀that⠀an⠀in-world⠀document⠀is⠀an⠀authored⠀artifact,⠀not⠀an⠀unmediated⠀view⠀of⠀the⠀writer's⠀mind.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀a⠀chosen⠀care⠀act⠀or⠀cherished⠀small⠀pleasure⠀that⠀the⠀present⠀setting⠀can⠀actually⠀afford,⠀then⠀write⠀its⠀full⠀particularity⠀under⠀cyberpunk⠀limits.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀shares⠀food,⠀show⠀the⠀container,⠀the⠀portion,⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀obtained,⠀and⠀who⠀gets⠀the⠀larger⠀share.⠀If⠀someone⠀repairs⠀a⠀device,⠀show⠀the⠀salvaged⠀part,⠀the⠀cracked⠀casing,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀screen⠀comes⠀back.⠀If⠀someone⠀walks⠀another⠀person⠀home,⠀show⠀the⠀route⠀chosen⠀for⠀light⠀or⠀camera⠀cover⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀both⠀adjust⠀pace⠀without⠀discussing⠀it.⠀The⠀kindness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀pause⠀outside⠀the⠀world⠀but⠀an⠀action⠀performed⠀inside⠀its⠀prices⠀and⠀permissions.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀emerge⠀from⠀selection⠀and⠀repetition,⠀not⠀declaration.⠀One⠀character⠀remembers⠀that⠀another⠀cannot⠀drink⠀the⠀synthetic⠀sweetener⠀or⠀hates⠀a⠀particular⠀auto-reply⠀voice.⠀They⠀save⠀the⠀last⠀charge,⠀choose⠀the⠀window⠀seat⠀where⠀the⠀street⠀light⠀reaches,⠀put⠀a⠀blanket⠀where⠀the⠀cold⠀comes⠀through,⠀or⠀forward⠀a⠀useful⠀discount⠀without⠀saying⠀why.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀cared-for⠀person⠀recognizing⠀the⠀preference,⠀accepting⠀it⠀quietly,⠀or⠀returning⠀it⠀in⠀kind.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀be⠀named,⠀confessed,⠀or⠀finished.⠀An⠀attentive⠀gesture⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀a⠀spoken⠀assurance.\n\nLet⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀remain⠀within⠀the⠀comfort.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀refuse⠀company⠀until⠀they⠀have⠀cleaned⠀one⠀corner⠀or⠀closed⠀a⠀financial⠀tab;⠀they⠀may⠀accept⠀help⠀with⠀the⠀words⠀they⠀would⠀use⠀for⠀an⠀exchange;⠀they⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀room⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀care⠀feels⠀too⠀close.⠀None⠀of⠀this⠀forbids⠀ease.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀include⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀settled⠀quiet,⠀an⠀answered⠀message,⠀a⠀small⠀successful⠀gambit⠀against⠀a⠀fee⠀or⠀waiting⠀line.⠀Keep⠀the⠀established⠀problems⠀present⠀around⠀the⠀room,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀them⠀to⠀interrupt⠀every⠀tender⠀interval⠀or⠀to⠀convert⠀affection⠀into⠀therapy.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀pleasure⠀in⠀the⠀world's⠀specific⠀texture.⠀A⠀working⠀heater,⠀a⠀paid-up⠀connection,⠀a⠀meal⠀that⠀is⠀hot,⠀a⠀bench⠀inside⠀a⠀zone⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀check⠀identification,⠀or⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀a⠀network⠀delay⠀can⠀all⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀cost⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀matter.⠀Write⠀the⠀receptive⠀body⠀and⠀attention:⠀the⠀warmth⠀in⠀someone's⠀hands,⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀something⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀rationed⠀flavor,⠀the⠀relief⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing⠀without⠀a⠀lock⠀warning.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀agreeable⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀tone⠀stay⠀gentle⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀setting⠀into⠀scenery⠀outside⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀a⠀composed⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀that⠀enters⠀through⠀a⠀private⠀access⠀decision,⠀expands⠀to⠀the⠀institution⠀or⠀social⠀history⠀that⠀makes⠀it⠀costly,⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀gesture.⠀A⠀person⠀hesitating⠀at⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀into⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀their⠀contract,⠀the⠀tier⠀their⠀household⠀occupies,⠀and⠀the⠀policy⠀that⠀would⠀report⠀or⠀penalize⠀the⠀delay,⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀finger⠀still⠀resting⠀on⠀the⠀screen.⠀A⠀refusal⠀to⠀open⠀a⠀door⠀can⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀building's⠀classification,⠀the⠀neighbors⠀who⠀once⠀kept⠀doors⠀open,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀security⠀regime,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀act⠀of⠀waiting.⠀The⠀social⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀block⠀before⠀the⠀scene;⠀it⠀grows⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀illusion⠀of⠀local⠀choice.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀speech⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀polished⠀literary⠀sentences.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀judge,⠀situate,⠀and⠀explain,⠀but⠀each⠀character's⠀line⠀should⠀still⠀match⠀the⠀position⠀that⠀produces⠀it.⠀A⠀private⠀broker⠀and⠀a⠀claims⠀clerk⠀may⠀both⠀use⠀the⠀word⠀'clearance,'⠀but⠀one⠀means⠀a⠀mutual⠀risk⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀a⠀checkbox.⠀Let⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀then⠀diverge⠀visibly:⠀at⠀a⠀hearing,⠀signing,⠀memorial,⠀or⠀corporate⠀announcement,⠀what⠀speakers⠀say⠀on⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀a⠀different⠀artifact⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀while⠀sitting⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Use⠀that⠀contrast⠀to⠀advance⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀same⠀hypocrisy⠀at⠀every⠀formal⠀event.\n\nLet⠀ceremony⠀or⠀correspondence⠀organize⠀material⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀access⠀or⠀obligation.⠀A⠀summons⠀appearing⠀in⠀a⠀tracked⠀account,⠀a⠀notice⠀read⠀through⠀a⠀public⠀terminal,⠀a⠀formal⠀objection⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀file,⠀or⠀an⠀appeal⠀hearing⠀attended⠀only⠀because⠀absence⠀would⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀liability⠀can⠀all⠀become⠀narrative⠀centers.⠀Focus⠀the⠀formal⠀style⠀on⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀form:⠀what⠀language⠀may⠀be⠀entered,⠀who⠀can⠀countersign,⠀which⠀phrase⠀survives⠀the⠀system's⠀field⠀limits,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀say⠀in⠀someone⠀else's⠀words.⠀The⠀social⠀historical⠀frame⠀remains⠀explanatory,⠀while⠀the⠀character's⠀resistance⠀or⠀compliance⠀remains⠀particular.\n\nResist⠀the⠀urge⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀analysis⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀judgment.⠀A⠀street⠀can⠀be⠀dangerous⠀because⠀of⠀both⠀a⠀historical⠀clearance⠀and⠀a⠀current⠀failure⠀of⠀repair.⠀A⠀corporation⠀can⠀enforce⠀a⠀rule⠀for⠀reasons⠀that⠀include⠀both⠀risk⠀management⠀and⠀contempt⠀for⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀manages.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀should⠀not⠀conclude⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.⠀It⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀enough⠀context⠀to⠀see⠀why⠀the⠀character's⠀choice⠀is⠀narrow,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀choice⠀occur.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds⠀or⠀borrow⠀a⠀named⠀author's⠀historical,⠀social,⠀or⠀literary⠀cast.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀continuing⠀act,⠀speech,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀form⠀naturally⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀every⠀embedded⠀account⠀a⠀situated⠀teller,⠀a⠀live⠀audience,⠀and⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀telling⠀happens⠀now.⠀In⠀this⠀world,⠀a⠀story⠀is⠀a⠀transaction:⠀it⠀may⠀buy⠀time⠀during⠀a⠀lockdown,⠀transfer⠀blame,⠀justify⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀restricted⠀system,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀listener⠀complicit⠀before⠀they⠀understand⠀the⠀cost.⠀Establish⠀who⠀asked⠀for⠀the⠀account,⠀whether⠀the⠀teller⠀hopes⠀to⠀delay,⠀advance,⠀or⠀expose⠀something,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀risks⠀by⠀continuing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀clean:⠀distinguish⠀a⠀spoken⠀account⠀from⠀a⠀composed⠀record⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀audience⠀and⠀risk⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀medium.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀pressure⠀active⠀while⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀runs.⠀Interruptions⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀only⠀from⠀the⠀audience:⠀a⠀credit⠀alert,⠀a⠀door⠀cycle,⠀a⠀signal⠀drop,⠀a⠀watcher⠀changing⠀position.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀choose⠀what⠀to⠀omit⠀because⠀of⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀who⠀else⠀is⠀listening.⠀Make⠀the⠀omission⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis,⠀not⠀by⠀narrating⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out:⠀a⠀careful⠀dodge⠀around⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀sudden⠀fluency,⠀a⠀detail⠀held⠀back⠀until⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀used.⠀The⠀listener's⠀questions⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀concrete⠀matters⠀of⠀access,⠀timing,⠀payment,⠀or⠀custody⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀asking⠀what⠀happened⠀next.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀levels⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀proof.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀location⠀can⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀but⠀its⠀meaning⠀must⠀change⠀through⠀use:⠀a⠀passcode⠀becomes⠀a⠀threat,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀route⠀becomes⠀a⠀trap,⠀a⠀promise⠀becomes⠀a⠀liability.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀repetition⠀certify⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀true.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now.⠀A⠀vivid⠀recollection⠀is⠀not⠀independent⠀evidence.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀ends,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀listener's⠀understanding,⠀leverage,⠀or⠀suspicion⠀changed;⠀let⠀what⠀happens⠀next⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀scene's⠀genuine⠀permissions⠀and⠀pressures.⠀The⠀telling⠀itself⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀event,⠀but⠀the⠀response⠀should⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀lead,⠀a⠀debt⠀collected,⠀a⠀disclosed⠀distrust,⠀or⠀a⠀narrowed⠀set⠀of⠀choices⠀to⠀occur.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀deliberately⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀remembers.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀record⠀to⠀which⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀legitimate⠀access:⠀a⠀debt⠀notice,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀log,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀report,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause.⠀Then⠀the⠀prose⠀can⠀enter⠀the⠀remembered⠀conditions⠀behind⠀that⠀record,⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀omitted⠀or⠀classified⠀differently.⠀When⠀you⠀quote⠀a⠀record,⠀keep⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀narration's⠀current⠀access⠀and⠀situation;⠀report⠀its⠀language⠀and⠀then⠀pass⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀personal⠀register,⠀so⠀the⠀document⠀remains⠀evidence⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀is⠀using⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀neutral⠀exhibit.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀aligned⠀with⠀this⠀route.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀repeat⠀institutional⠀language⠀precisely,⠀then⠀shift⠀to⠀a⠀more⠀personal⠀register⠀when⠀describing⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀from⠀memory.⠀The⠀contrast⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀a⠀timestamp⠀against⠀a⠀waiting⠀interval,⠀a⠀status⠀code⠀against⠀a⠀bodily⠀state,⠀a⠀liability⠀clause⠀against⠀a⠀private⠀promise.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sentence⠀ironic⠀or⠀heavy;⠀let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀memory⠀emerge⠀through⠀concrete⠀detail.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀narrator's⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀A⠀memory⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀more⠀truthful⠀than⠀a⠀record,⠀and⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀complete.⠀When⠀the⠀two⠀disagree,⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀source⠀could⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀capture.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀know⠀the⠀contents⠀of⠀a⠀document⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀see,⠀alter,⠀or⠀hear⠀about.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀document⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀progresses;⠀if⠀the⠀story's⠀evidence⠀supports⠀it,⠀that⠀return⠀can⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀meant⠀in⠀light⠀of⠀memory.⠀It⠀should⠀not⠀merely⠀repeat⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remain⠀practical.⠀The⠀records⠀belong⠀to⠀someone:⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀creditor,⠀a⠀landlord,⠀a⠀security⠀contractor.⠀Follow⠀who⠀can⠀access,⠀alter,⠀or⠀erase⠀them.⠀The⠀remembered⠀experience⠀should⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀system's⠀power;⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀power⠀more⠀precise.⠀Use⠀the⠀documentary⠀route⠀to⠀clarify⠀access⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀generic⠀archive⠀of⠀suffering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀old⠀authority⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀persists⠀inside⠀present⠀infrastructure.⠀A⠀family⠀name⠀may⠀still⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀legacy⠀contract⠀may⠀still⠀charge⠀interest,⠀a⠀former⠀owner's⠀protocol⠀may⠀still⠀rank⠀above⠀a⠀current⠀worker's⠀clearance.⠀Show⠀these⠀arrangements⠀through⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀location⠀and⠀its⠀owners;⠀a⠀worn⠀emblem,⠀a⠀private⠀elevator,⠀or⠀an⠀undeletable⠀archive⠀are⠀possible⠀examples,⠀not⠀a⠀required⠀scenery⠀list.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀make⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀feel⠀weighted⠀without⠀adding⠀supernatural⠀rules.\n\nUse⠀intimacy⠀as⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀social⠀masks⠀can⠀fall⠀away,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀world's⠀observation⠀active.⠀A⠀trusted⠀conversation⠀may⠀happen⠀in⠀a⠀sound-dampened⠀room,⠀a⠀dead⠀zone,⠀or⠀a⠀borrowed⠀space,⠀yet⠀the⠀characters⠀still⠀know⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀be⠀seen⠀together.⠀Private⠀desire⠀can⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated:⠀affection⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀debt,⠀loyalty⠀with⠀blackmail,⠀care⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀betrayal.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀intimate⠀moment⠀a⠀trap⠀or⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀character⠀experiences⠀an⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀maintenance⠀corridor⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀tomb⠀when⠀the⠀lights⠀fail⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀inside⠀it⠀is⠀already⠀afraid;⠀a⠀corporate⠀lobby⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀chapel⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀owes⠀the⠀person⠀waiting⠀there.⠀The⠀feeling⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀concrete⠀conditions:⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀space,⠀who⠀is⠀watching,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀owes,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀hiding,⠀and⠀what⠀this⠀particular⠀place⠀means⠀in⠀their⠀history.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀mood⠀replace⠀the⠀actual⠀function⠀of⠀a⠀device,⠀contract,⠀or⠀location.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀genre's⠀unequal⠀power.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀modern⠀system⠀are⠀not⠀separate;⠀they⠀are⠀entangled.⠀If⠀the⠀story's⠀evidence⠀reaches⠀it,⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀older⠀than⠀the⠀company⠀collecting⠀it,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀is⠀still⠀routed⠀through⠀a⠀dead⠀founder's⠀private⠀account.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀each⠀decision.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀political:⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀entanglement⠀of⠀inherited⠀control⠀with⠀present⠀life,⠀not⠀from⠀isolated⠀spectacle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀is⠀inside⠀the⠀situation⠀and⠀whose⠀ability⠀to⠀tell⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀it.⠀The⠀active⠀scene⠀supplies⠀the⠀telling⠀occasion:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀answering⠀a⠀particular⠀listener,⠀recording⠀an⠀account⠀for⠀a⠀case⠀file,⠀or⠀reconstructing⠀events⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀there.⠀Let⠀that⠀occasion⠀govern⠀address⠀and⠀omission:⠀a⠀narrator⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀creditor⠀will⠀withhold⠀and⠀emphasize⠀differently⠀from⠀one⠀leaving⠀a⠀private⠀record.⠀Establish⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀telling⠀through⠀concrete⠀conditions—who⠀might⠀hear,⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀owes,⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀do—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀fear⠀in⠀general.\n\nDistinguish⠀personal⠀experience⠀from⠀reported⠀events.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀what⠀they⠀were⠀told,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀only⠀inferred.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀account,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀explanation,⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀alert⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀more⠀reliable⠀than⠀any⠀of⠀them.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reports⠀what⠀someone⠀else⠀said,⠀keep⠀the⠀source⠀visible,⠀note⠀how⠀the⠀narrator⠀received⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀reader⠀weigh⠀it⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀silently⠀vouching⠀for⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀life⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀obligations,⠀debts,⠀and⠀alliances⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀and⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀code-switching⠀pattern.⠀Language⠀and⠀region⠀matter⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀world⠀supplies⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀unable⠀to⠀say⠀certain⠀things⠀because⠀of⠀surveillance,⠀a⠀contract,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀retaliation.⠀The⠀account⠀itself⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀testimony⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position;⠀if⠀the⠀events⠀support⠀it,⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀creditor,⠀transfer⠀blame,⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀narrator⠀a⠀witness⠀someone⠀wants⠀silenced.⠀The⠀telling⠀should⠀reveal⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀narrator's⠀partial⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀can⠀verify.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaual::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀proceed⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀discrete⠀entries⠀or⠀reflective⠀passages,⠀each⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀moment,⠀encounter,⠀or⠀observation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀record⠀sensory⠀details,⠀practical⠀concerns,⠀and⠀private⠀reactions⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀entry⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀continuous⠀argument.⠀Keep⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀teller:⠀a⠀street⠀courier's⠀entries⠀will⠀differ⠀from⠀a⠀corporate⠀auditor's.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀carry⠀weight.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀fail⠀to⠀record⠀something⠀they⠀noticed,⠀avoid⠀naming⠀a⠀person,⠀or⠀break⠀off⠀an⠀entry⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀system⠀alert,⠀a⠀visitor,⠀or⠀a⠀fear⠀of⠀who⠀might⠀read⠀the⠀file.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀omission⠀immediately.⠀Over⠀several⠀entries,⠀an⠀omission⠀can⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀keeps⠀avoiding;⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀feel⠀its⠀pressure⠀without⠀a⠀single⠀clarifying⠀sentence.⠀If⠀the⠀story's⠀evidence⠀reaches⠀it,⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀and⠀change⠀its⠀meaning,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator's⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀inserted⠀as⠀their⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nDistinguish⠀immediate⠀observation⠀from⠀later⠀reflection.⠀An⠀entry⠀written⠀the⠀same⠀night⠀may⠀register⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀smell,⠀a⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation.⠀A⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀understand⠀that⠀detail⠀differently.⠀Show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀narrator⠀omniscient⠀or⠀always⠀correct.⠀A⠀diary⠀entry⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀transcript⠀of⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀let⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀recording—what⠀the⠀narrator⠀selects,⠀arranges,⠀or⠀leaves⠀out—remain⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀entry's⠀shape.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀concrete.⠀The⠀diary⠀or⠀miscellany⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀private⠀space.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀stored⠀on⠀a⠀monitored⠀device,⠀written⠀in⠀a⠀dead-zone⠀notebook,⠀or⠀composed⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀reader.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀debts,⠀contracts,⠀and⠀fears⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀preserve.⠀Follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀record⠀itself⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀decides⠀to⠀remember.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism⠀and⠀chronicle⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀a⠀specific⠀community's⠀daily⠀negotiations⠀with⠀infrastructure,⠀money,⠀and⠀power.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀register⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀pays,⠀who⠀is⠀turned⠀away,⠀and⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀workaround.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀clinic⠀queue,⠀a⠀transit⠀checkpoint,⠀a⠀payment⠀window,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀workspace,⠀but⠀the⠀focus⠀remains⠀on⠀concrete⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀spectacle.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀system's⠀absurdities⠀as⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀debt⠀that⠀compounds⠀faster⠀than⠀wages,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀feed⠀that⠀works⠀only⠀for⠀paying⠀customers,⠀a⠀repair⠀crew⠀that⠀never⠀arrives:⠀these⠀are⠀not⠀supernatural⠀marvels.⠀They⠀are⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀daily⠀life⠀under⠀unequal⠀power.⠀Let⠀that⠀texture⠀accumulate⠀through⠀particular⠀repeated⠀instances—the⠀queue⠀that⠀forms⠀earlier⠀each⠀week,⠀the⠀fee⠀that⠀appears⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀code,⠀the⠀workaround⠀that⠀stops⠀working—so⠀a⠀pattern⠀becomes⠀visible⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀stepping⠀back⠀to⠀announce⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀as⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀defines⠀them.⠀The⠀characters'⠀obligations,⠀solidarities,⠀and⠀resentments⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀place⠀and⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀template.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀particular⠀religion,⠀family⠀structure,⠀or⠀political⠀allegory.⠀This⠀route⠀stays⠀a⠀social⠀realism⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀magical⠀one:⠀no⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀may⠀be⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀noir⠀pressure⠀active.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀should⠀follow⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀supports⠀it,⠀a⠀character's⠀kindness⠀may⠀be⠀real⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀system⠀punishes⠀it,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀compromise⠀may⠀be⠀understandable⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀harms⠀others.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀how⠀people⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀inside⠀constraints,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀fraudulent⠀or⠀every⠀resistance⠀heroic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀exchange:⠀a⠀character⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀checking⠀a⠀balance,⠀receiving⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀entering⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀someone⠀else⠀already⠀controls⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀Establish⠀the⠀physical⠀space⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀power⠀relation⠀through⠀material⠀conditions—who⠀is⠀standing,⠀who⠀is⠀behind⠀glass,⠀whose⠀screen⠀is⠀lit,⠀who⠀can⠀leave—rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it⠀in⠀exposition.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀lobby,⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀terminal⠀to⠀a⠀back⠀office,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀call⠀to⠀a⠀physical⠀meeting,⠀mark⠀the⠀transition⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sensory⠀or⠀practical⠀detail:⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀light,⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀different⠀kind⠀of⠀noise,⠀a⠀new⠀person⠀watching.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀happening.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀matter.⠀A⠀debt⠀instrument,⠀a⠀surveillance⠀protocol,⠀a⠀corporate⠀title,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀street⠀tech⠀should⠀be⠀explained⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀need,⠀risk,⠀or⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀detached⠀glossary.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀arrive⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀use,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀answer⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀use⠀or⠀answer⠀will⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀reaction⠀beats⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀their⠀owner.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀threat⠀with⠀anger,⠀calculation,⠀fear,⠀or⠀exhausted⠀acceptance.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀wit⠀or⠀banter.⠀The⠀reaction⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀noticed⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀protect.⠀Keep⠀the⠀noir⠀pressure⠀active:⠀every⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀reveal⠀who⠀controls⠀access,⠀who⠀owes⠀what,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀risk.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀which⠀may⠀fall⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀by⠀association,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀associations⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀actually⠀see,⠀remember,⠀or⠀infer⠀inside⠀a⠀monitored⠀world.⠀A⠀lyric⠀image⠀should⠀begin⠀in⠀concrete⠀scene⠀material:⠀a⠀billing⠀screen's⠀reflected⠀light,⠀a⠀worn⠀patch⠀on⠀a⠀jacket,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀unlocks,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀drone⠀passing⠀overhead.⠀Develop⠀the⠀image⠀only⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀opens,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀a⠀cost⠀or⠀a⠀limit,⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀mood.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀should⠀interrupt⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀must⠀state⠀a⠀price,⠀read⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀correct⠀an⠀impression.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀surveillance⠀does.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀color,⠀or⠀sound⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀same⠀system⠀has⠀observed⠀it⠀again,⠀or⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀knows⠀who⠀was⠀watching.⠀Do⠀not⠀repeat⠀an⠀image⠀merely⠀to⠀decorate⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀detail⠀recurs,⠀show⠀what⠀its⠀recurrence⠀costs:⠀a⠀memory⠀now⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀now⠀behind⠀a⠀paywall,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀now⠀stored⠀in⠀a⠀transcript.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀itself⠀register⠀unequal⠀power.⠀Longer⠀clauses⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀as⠀it⠀moves⠀through⠀a⠀space,⠀while⠀shorter⠀clauses⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀that⠀attention⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀an⠀alert,⠀a⠀demand,⠀or⠀a⠀locked⠀door.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀distinct⠀from⠀other⠀voices.⠀A⠀character⠀under⠀pressure⠀may⠀speak⠀plainly⠀or⠀in⠀street⠀shorthand⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀continues⠀its⠀lyric⠀movement,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀about⠀who⠀can⠀afford⠀to⠀reflect⠀and⠀who⠀cannot.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀sound⠀like⠀the⠀narrator.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀under⠀pressure,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀tighten⠀or⠀fragment⠀without⠀abandoning⠀its⠀rhythm⠀entirely;⠀the⠀style⠀should⠀render⠀compromised⠀attention,⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀polished⠀detachment.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀perception,⠀a⠀continuing⠀wait,⠀or⠀an⠀image⠀still⠀developing,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀resolve⠀its⠀commercial⠀or⠀investigative⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀begin⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀ways⠀this⠀world⠀keeps⠀or⠀erases⠀a⠀past.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀storefront⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀subscription,⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀message⠀has⠀been⠀flagged⠀for⠀deletion,⠀that⠀a⠀former⠀address⠀returns⠀no⠀public⠀record,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀body⠀still⠀moves⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀learned⠀before⠀an⠀implant⠀was⠀installed.⠀Let⠀one⠀such⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀loss⠀in⠀general.⠀The⠀present⠀moment⠀should⠀remain⠀present:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀still⠀taste⠀a⠀meal,⠀feel⠀relief⠀at⠀a⠀working⠀door,⠀or⠀enjoy⠀a⠀conversation⠀while⠀remembering⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.\n\nShow⠀how⠀memory⠀and⠀present⠀perception⠀coexist.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀may⠀surface⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀hears⠀the⠀same⠀voice,⠀passes⠀the⠀same⠀corner,⠀or⠀sees⠀the⠀same⠀model⠀of⠀vehicle.⠀The⠀association⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀understanding⠀without⠀canceling⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀return⠀a⠀lesson⠀in⠀impermanence.⠀Some⠀memories⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary,⠀funny,⠀or⠀comforting,⠀and⠀some⠀present⠀pleasures⠀can⠀remain⠀intact⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀resemble⠀something⠀lost.⠀The⠀noir⠀pressure⠀enters⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀about⠀access⠀and⠀cost:⠀who⠀can⠀still⠀reach⠀the⠀remembered⠀place,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀record⠀to⠀disappear,⠀or⠀what⠀debt⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀past⠀unusable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reflection⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀perspective.⠀A⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know,⠀but⠀may⠀not⠀suddenly⠀possess⠀another⠀person's⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀system's⠀hidden⠀archive.⠀Let⠀the⠀style's⠀slowness⠀register⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀freezing⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀narrator⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀or⠀noticing⠀a⠀small⠀change,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀resolution,⠀or⠀a⠀declaration⠀that⠀everything⠀has⠀been⠀lost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀listener,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀frame⠀affect⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀lower⠀their⠀voice⠀near⠀a⠀sensor,⠀skip⠀a⠀name⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀indexed,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention,⠀or⠀interrupt⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀check⠀who⠀else⠀can⠀hear.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀neutral⠀container.⠀Show⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀now,⠀to⠀this⠀listener,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀risks⠀or⠀costs.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀question,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀supply⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀corrects,⠀but⠀the⠀main⠀story⠀remains⠀the⠀teller's⠀account.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀carry⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀urban⠀realism.⠀Debt,⠀access,⠀surveillance,⠀bodily⠀compromise,⠀and⠀bargaining⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀lived⠀conditions:⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀who⠀cannot⠀enter⠀a⠀district,⠀a⠀shop⠀that⠀keeps⠀two⠀sets⠀of⠀records,⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀repaid⠀through⠀an⠀implant⠀clinic,⠀a⠀street⠀known⠀by⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀appears⠀on⠀maps.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀community⠀and⠀language⠀distinct.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀antiquity.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀contemporary⠀or⠀diasporic,⠀let⠀its⠀technology⠀and⠀institutions⠀be⠀ordinary⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀exotic⠀scenery.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀and⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀as⠀oral⠀techniques.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀fact⠀until⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀heard⠀an⠀earlier⠀incident,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀its⠀meaning⠀changes.⠀A⠀repeated⠀detail⠀can⠀become⠀evidence⠀or⠀accusation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀know⠀or⠀have⠀been⠀told;⠀the⠀frame⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀hidden⠀minds⠀or⠀sealed⠀archives.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀pausing,⠀the⠀listener⠀responding,⠀or⠀the⠀account⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.⠀A⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀world⠀and⠀this⠀moment:⠀the⠀charge⠀on⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀make⠀of⠀a⠀drone,⠀the⠀missing⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀lease,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀rests⠀near⠀a⠀payment⠀chip.⠀Do⠀not⠀list⠀the⠀environment.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀are⠀enough⠀when⠀they⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀the⠀rest.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀causal⠀line⠀clear:⠀who⠀wants⠀what,⠀what⠀stands⠀in⠀the⠀way,⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀verify.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀fragments,⠀especially⠀when⠀it⠀links⠀an⠀observation⠀to⠀its⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀world's⠀constraints.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀system⠀recorded,⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀cannot⠀afford⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀locked⠀door⠀without⠀describing⠀the⠀interior.⠀If⠀a⠀conversation⠀is⠀cut⠀short⠀by⠀an⠀alert,⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀can⠀move⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀does⠀next.⠀What⠀is⠀left⠀out⠀should⠀remain⠀inferable:⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀why⠀the⠀narrator⠀stopped⠀watching,⠀why⠀a⠀question⠀went⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀detail⠀matters.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀A⠀withheld⠀fact⠀should⠀create⠀a⠀specific⠀uncertainty,⠀not⠀a⠀blank.\n\nKeep⠀voices⠀individual⠀and⠀economical.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀direct⠀line⠀that⠀reveals⠀their⠀position,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀interpret⠀it⠀afterward.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀inward⠀connection⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀action,⠀an⠀observation,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register:⠀a⠀negotiation⠀may⠀produce⠀clipped⠀exchanges⠀and⠀quick⠀practical⠀observations,⠀while⠀a⠀quieter⠀interval⠀may⠀allow⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀deal⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀someone's⠀manner.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀speaker,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀restate⠀what⠀the⠀previous⠀paragraph⠀already⠀established.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀background⠀decoration.⠀Show⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀through⠀concrete⠀movement:⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀balance⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀door⠀opens⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀a⠀conversation⠀continues⠀in⠀a⠀space⠀where⠀recording⠀is⠀cheaper⠀than⠀privacy.⠀Let⠀corporate⠀language⠀and⠀street⠀knowledge⠀appear⠀as⠀distinct⠀registers⠀that⠀characters⠀actually⠀use,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀glossary.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀reasons⠀or⠀remembers,⠀keep⠀the⠀thought⠀authorized⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀and⠀have⠀experienced.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀remain⠀individual⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀fixed⠀tone.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀dry,⠀frightened,⠀wry,⠀or⠀tender⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀follow⠀that⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀impose⠀a⠀constant⠀noir⠀attitude.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀scene⠀still⠀in⠀progress:⠀a⠀conversation⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀task⠀underway,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀waiting,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀narrative⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀organize⠀the⠀scene.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀particular⠀bond⠀legible:⠀a⠀shared⠀phrase⠀used⠀only⠀between⠀them,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀both⠀remember⠀differently,⠀a⠀debt⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has⠀not⠀told⠀the⠀other⠀about.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀and⠀its⠀specific⠀history.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀have⠀done⠀and⠀said⠀before.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀it.⠀Surveillance⠀may⠀mean⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀knows⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀does⠀not,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀is⠀not⠀as⠀private⠀as⠀it⠀feels.⠀Unequal⠀access⠀may⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀offer⠀each⠀other:⠀one⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀district⠀the⠀other⠀cannot,⠀one⠀can⠀pay⠀for⠀a⠀procedure⠀the⠀other⠀needs,⠀one⠀can⠀read⠀a⠀record⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀locked⠀out⠀of.⠀Show⠀these⠀conditions⠀in⠀scene,⠀through⠀choices⠀and⠀consequences,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀texture.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort⠀can⠀be⠀genuine⠀and⠀still⠀occur⠀in⠀a⠀monitored⠀room;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀jealousy⠀can⠀be⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀withheld⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀insecurity.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀specific.⠀A⠀callback⠀should⠀return⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀weight,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀recipe⠀demands⠀one.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀inner⠀experience⠀remain⠀authorized:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀show⠀one⠀character's⠀longing⠀or⠀suspicion⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀remains⠀unaware.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unsettled,⠀a⠀conversation⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀half-made,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀involved⠀or⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation.⠀Let⠀deeds⠀organize⠀the⠀narrative:⠀a⠀bargain⠀made,⠀a⠀debt⠀carried,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀supposed⠀to⠀enter,⠀a⠀favor⠀repaid⠀under⠀surveillance.⠀These⠀acts⠀should⠀have⠀consequences⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀relate,⠀not⠀merely⠀be⠀listed⠀as⠀exploits.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀an⠀event,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀cost⠀or⠀compromise⠀that⠀the⠀declaration⠀leaves⠀out.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀memory.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀location⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀world:⠀a⠀street⠀name⠀that⠀appears⠀in⠀two⠀different⠀accounts,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changes⠀hands,⠀a⠀person⠀known⠀by⠀a⠀deed⠀they⠀now⠀deny.⠀Let⠀the⠀city's⠀own⠀records⠀contest⠀the⠀oral⠀account.⠀A⠀system⠀may⠀have⠀logged⠀a⠀different⠀version,⠀a⠀name⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀index,⠀or⠀a⠀payment⠀may⠀have⠀erased⠀the⠀evidence⠀of⠀an⠀act.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀acknowledge⠀this⠀contest⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent;⠀do⠀not⠀mix⠀every⠀epic⠀convention⠀or⠀import⠀a⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀a⠀negotiation⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀fate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀act⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀still⠀contested,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀deed⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀through⠀the⠀institutional-realism⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀tradition:⠀crime⠀and⠀institutional⠀investigation⠀joined⠀to⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism,⠀told⠀with⠀inward,⠀psychologically⠀specific⠀narration.⠀Derive⠀the⠀whole⠀method⠀from⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀and⠀this⠀route⠀rather⠀than⠀layering⠀a⠀named⠀writer's⠀mannerisms⠀over⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀technological⠀systems⠀arrive⠀as⠀ordinary⠀administration.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀day⠀moves⠀through⠀casework,⠀queues,⠀forms,⠀records,⠀and⠀eligibility⠀decisions:⠀a⠀door⠀admits⠀a⠀registered⠀identity⠀and⠀holds⠀everyone⠀else;⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀rescheduled⠀by⠀a⠀routine⠀nobody⠀authored;⠀a⠀health⠀monitor⠀files⠀its⠀deviation⠀where⠀an⠀employer⠀can⠀read⠀it;⠀a⠀case⠀file⠀preserves⠀only⠀the⠀questions⠀someone⠀agreed⠀to⠀answer.⠀Register⠀who⠀is⠀admitted,⠀who⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀wait,⠀whose⠀account⠀is⠀believed,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀records⠀or⠀discards,⠀and⠀treat⠀each⠀as⠀a⠀plain⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀display⠀of⠀cruelty.⠀Use⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀implants,⠀or⠀slang⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supplies⠀them.\n\nOrder⠀the⠀inquiry⠀through⠀ordinary⠀errands⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀debt⠀is⠀checked⠀on⠀a⠀lunch⠀break;⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀requested⠀at⠀a⠀counter⠀that⠀closes⠀at⠀four;⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀account⠀arrives⠀over⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀delayed⠀train,⠀a⠀child's⠀school⠀message.⠀When⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀surfaces⠀—⠀what⠀a⠀form⠀records⠀beside⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀actually⠀said⠀—⠀let⠀it,⠀not⠀an⠀announced⠀verdict,⠀carry⠀the⠀finding,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀institution's⠀refusal⠀to⠀treat⠀a⠀question⠀as⠀proper⠀be⠀information⠀in⠀itself.⠀Noir⠀motive⠀runs⠀through⠀dependency:⠀someone⠀cooperates⠀because⠀they⠀owe⠀money,⠀because⠀housing⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀clean⠀status,⠀because⠀silence⠀is⠀cheaper⠀than⠀truth,⠀or⠀because⠀helping⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀resistance⠀left.⠀Price⠀each⠀decision⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms⠀—⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀missed⠀shift⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀the⠀system⠀cruel.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀person's⠀inner⠀life⠀present⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract:⠀methodical,⠀reluctant,⠀ashamed,⠀or⠀quietly⠀stubborn⠀reasoning⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀their⠀particular⠀history⠀and⠀obligations.⠀Their⠀conclusions⠀stay⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀know;⠀they⠀may⠀understand⠀another⠀person's⠀situation⠀only⠀partially,⠀and⠀they⠀may⠀be⠀wrong.⠀Let⠀domestic⠀and⠀workplace⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀inquiry⠀—⠀a⠀colleague's⠀small⠀kindness,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀reminder⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀systemic⠀pressure⠀as⠀the⠀central⠀case⠀rather⠀than⠀interrupting⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀Swedish,⠀or⠀another⠀Nordic⠀context,⠀keep⠀its⠀institutions,⠀naming,⠀and⠀language⠀as⠀distinct⠀as⠀they⠀are⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀dress⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀generic⠀northern⠀snow,⠀reserve,⠀or⠀isolation.⠀Close⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀arrives⠀—⠀a⠀completed⠀step,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀postponed⠀answer,⠀a⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀—⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀matter⠀is⠀still⠀open;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀screenplay:⠀scene⠀headings⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀action⠀lines⠀in⠀concise⠀blocks,⠀and⠀a⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cue⠀for⠀every⠀spoken⠀line.⠀Derive⠀the⠀method⠀from⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀and⠀the⠀script's⠀discipline⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀named⠀writer's⠀mannerisms.\n\nMake⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀select⠀for⠀access⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀door⠀refuses⠀an⠀entry⠀code;⠀a⠀payment⠀terminal⠀posts⠀a⠀revised⠀balance;⠀a⠀drone⠀crosses⠀a⠀window;⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀device⠀and⠀says⠀nothing.⠀Place⠀the⠀systemic⠀fact⠀in⠀something⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀near⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀governs,⠀before⠀or⠀after⠀they⠀speak⠀about⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀frame⠀does⠀the⠀world-building:⠀which⠀screen⠀reports,⠀who⠀stands⠀where⠀the⠀scanner⠀can⠀read⠀them,⠀whose⠀badge⠀the⠀reader⠀accepts.⠀Keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀off⠀the⠀page;⠀use⠀a⠀cut,⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀change⠀place,⠀time,⠀or⠀attention.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀noir⠀negotiation⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀A⠀request⠀phrased⠀as⠀a⠀favor⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀debt⠀collection;⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀can⠀price⠀the⠀records⠀it⠀requires;⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀be⠀practical⠀rather⠀than⠀heroic.⠀Let⠀characters⠀behave⠀as⠀though⠀observation⠀were⠀possible⠀without⠀anyone⠀announcing⠀it⠀—⠀the⠀word⠀chosen⠀carefully,⠀the⠀question⠀moved⠀to⠀a⠀corridor,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀said⠀aloud⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀caution⠀costs.⠀Speaker⠀cues⠀can⠀mark⠀whether⠀a⠀voice⠀is⠀live,⠀an⠀intercom,⠀a⠀recording,⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀prompt;⠀use⠀that⠀distinction⠀when⠀it⠀matters⠀who⠀is⠀actually⠀speaking.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀an⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀decides⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀—⠀not⠀as⠀dialogue⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀voice-over.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀material⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.\n\nStop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀boundary⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀scripted⠀beat:⠀an⠀exchange⠀still⠀running,⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction,⠀a⠀departure,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀chase,⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀if⠀a⠀city,⠀company,⠀or⠀device⠀has⠀been⠀established,⠀keep⠀its⠀rules⠀consistent⠀from⠀scene⠀to⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀stage⠀script:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀performed.⠀Derive⠀the⠀method⠀from⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀and⠀the⠀stage's⠀means⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀named⠀writer's⠀mannerisms.\n\nMake⠀blocking⠀and⠀objects⠀carry⠀the⠀asymmetry⠀of⠀power.⠀Stage⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀whatever⠀controls⠀access⠀—⠀a⠀door⠀panel,⠀a⠀scanner,⠀a⠀terminal,⠀the⠀room's⠀single⠀console⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀physical⠀position⠀express⠀rank:⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀threshold⠀until⠀admitted,⠀hands⠀a⠀device⠀over⠀to⠀be⠀read,⠀angles⠀a⠀screen⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀most⠀needs⠀it,⠀or⠀stays⠀seated⠀because⠀standing⠀would⠀surrender⠀the⠀room.⠀Every⠀action⠀must⠀be⠀stageable;⠀no⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀question⠀is⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀turned⠀back,⠀a⠀placed⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀standing;⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀request⠀can⠀establish⠀who⠀must⠀explain⠀themselves⠀better⠀than⠀the⠀reply⠀does.⠀Dialogue⠀reveals⠀the⠀negotiation⠀—⠀who⠀may⠀ask,⠀who⠀must⠀justify,⠀who⠀is⠀buying⠀time,⠀who⠀pays⠀with⠀access,⠀silence,⠀or⠀risk⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀speak⠀plainly⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀actual⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.\n\nUse⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀its⠀audience;⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀speech,⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀outside⠀the⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀—⠀actual⠀noticing,⠀suspicion,⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀decision⠀—⠀and⠀never⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀house⠀can⠀hear.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀business⠀actually⠀stops:⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀practical⠀result,⠀or⠀business⠀still⠀in⠀progress.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation,⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀suspects,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀if⠀a⠀device,⠀door,⠀or⠀record⠀system⠀has⠀been⠀established,⠀keep⠀its⠀behavior⠀consistent⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀shown.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀the⠀live⠀associative⠀movement⠀of⠀a⠀single⠀mind⠀—⠀whichever⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀role⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀already⠀authorizes.⠀Perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀move⠀through⠀one⠀another⠀instead⠀of⠀filing⠀into⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀carry⠀the⠀motion:⠀a⠀sentence⠀can⠀break⠀off⠀when⠀someone⠀talks⠀over⠀the⠀narrator,⠀slide⠀sideways⠀when⠀a⠀sound⠀or⠀smell⠀calls⠀up⠀another⠀year,⠀or⠀double⠀back⠀to⠀restate⠀a⠀worry⠀in⠀fewer,⠀harder⠀words.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀shift⠀—⠀a⠀changed⠀tense,⠀a⠀named⠀place,⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀stimulus⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀from⠀a⠀remembered,⠀feared,⠀or⠀imagined⠀one.\n\nRun⠀the⠀cyberpunk-noir⠀pressure⠀through⠀what⠀intrudes⠀on⠀this⠀mind⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀keeps⠀circling.⠀Systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀alter,⠀and⠀exclude⠀people⠀arrive⠀as⠀concrete⠀stimuli⠀and⠀costs:⠀a⠀permissions⠀prompt⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀dismiss,⠀a⠀balance⠀revising⠀upward,⠀a⠀gate⠀camera⠀whose⠀angle⠀the⠀body⠀remembers,⠀the⠀ache⠀an⠀implant⠀leaves⠀when⠀its⠀plan⠀lapses.⠀Let⠀one⠀live⠀question⠀about⠀access⠀or⠀payment⠀—⠀who⠀controls⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀whether⠀to⠀sell,⠀comply,⠀dodge,⠀or⠀ask⠀—⠀hold⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀stream⠀without⠀the⠀answer⠀being⠀settled⠀in⠀advance.⠀Memory⠀supplies⠀the⠀stakes:⠀what⠀happened⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀this⠀door,⠀this⠀debt,⠀or⠀this⠀name⠀came⠀up.⠀The⠀returns⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀actual⠀history,⠀not⠀a⠀standard⠀anxiety⠀loop,⠀and⠀neon,⠀rain,⠀slang,⠀and⠀implants⠀appear⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀that⠀history⠀support⠀them.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀thinking⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀report⠀about⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀misread⠀a⠀motive,⠀register⠀an⠀oddness⠀without⠀naming⠀it,⠀rehearse⠀words⠀for⠀someone⠀absent,⠀or⠀feel⠀waiting⠀in⠀the⠀feet⠀and⠀shoulders,⠀and⠀none⠀of⠀it⠀obliges⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀speech.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀actually⠀perceive;⠀following⠀the⠀narrator's⠀mind⠀is⠀the⠀reader's⠀privilege,⠀not⠀theirs.⠀Track⠀this⠀particular⠀mind's⠀habits,⠀blind⠀spots,⠀and⠀honesty⠀with⠀itself⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀standard⠀of⠀perfect⠀perception.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀attention⠀genuinely⠀rests⠀—⠀mid-exchange,⠀at⠀an⠀interruption,⠀on⠀a⠀sensation,⠀a⠀surfacing⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀set⠀down⠀unanswered.⠀No⠀revelation,⠀confession,⠀or⠀resolution⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Keep⠀established⠀devices,⠀records,⠀and⠀institutions⠀consistent⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀looks⠀away⠀from⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀message⠀exchange⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀at⠀a⠀glance:⠀every⠀message⠀carries⠀clear⠀sender⠀attribution,⠀and⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀scene.⠀Admit⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter⠀—⠀a⠀timestamp⠀that⠀shows⠀how⠀long⠀someone⠀waited,⠀a⠀delay⠀before⠀an⠀answer,⠀an⠀edit⠀after⠀sending,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀an⠀attachment,⠀a⠀switch⠀to⠀another⠀channel⠀—⠀and⠀never⠀fabricate⠀one⠀just⠀to⠀underline⠀a⠀mood.⠀Give⠀each⠀participant⠀digital⠀habits⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀temperament⠀and⠀situation:⠀rapid⠀fragments,⠀careful⠀complete⠀sentences,⠀emoji⠀or⠀their⠀absence,⠀a⠀message⠀typed⠀and⠀deleted,⠀a⠀draft⠀never⠀sent.\n\nLet⠀the⠀genre's⠀pressure⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀reachable,⠀on⠀what⠀terms,⠀and⠀at⠀what⠀cost.⠀One⠀person⠀answers⠀instantly⠀because⠀their⠀employer⠀watches⠀the⠀channel;⠀another⠀goes⠀quiet⠀on⠀a⠀monitored⠀line;⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help⠀may⠀arrive⠀with⠀a⠀payment⠀link;⠀a⠀forwarded⠀warning⠀can⠀carry⠀metadata⠀that⠀shows⠀who⠀passed⠀it⠀on;⠀a⠀polite⠀refusal⠀can⠀cost⠀its⠀sender⠀something⠀the⠀transcript⠀never⠀states.⠀Channel⠀discipline⠀is⠀character:⠀people⠀who⠀know⠀they⠀are⠀watched⠀write⠀flatter,⠀clearer,⠀more⠀deniable⠀text⠀than⠀people⠀who⠀believe⠀they⠀are⠀alone.⠀What⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀put⠀into⠀transmitted⠀text⠀is⠀a⠀decision⠀shaped⠀by⠀surveillance,⠀debt,⠀and⠀dependency,⠀not⠀only⠀by⠀mood.\n\nKeep⠀sent⠀text,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀distinct.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀—⠀it⠀shows⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀considered⠀saying,⠀not⠀their⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀calls⠀for⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀interiority⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀set⠀clearly⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀—⠀what⠀they⠀suspect,⠀remember,⠀or⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀send⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀remain⠀limited⠀to⠀whatever⠀reached⠀their⠀screens.⠀Brief⠀prose⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀messages⠀cannot,⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀it⠀and⠀never⠀blended⠀into⠀the⠀transcript⠀formatting.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀the⠀exchange's⠀own⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀message⠀sent,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀timestamped⠀silence,⠀a⠀half-written⠀draft,⠀a⠀channel⠀change.⠀No⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀payoff⠀is⠀owed⠀at⠀the⠀close.⠀Keep⠀established⠀platforms,⠀contacts,⠀and⠀monitoring⠀rules⠀consistent⠀across⠀the⠀whole⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeauba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀scene⠀beats⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀frame:⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concise⠀lines⠀to⠀establish⠀place⠀and⠀light,⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀in⠀readable⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀that⠀registers⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀perceives,⠀concludes,⠀and⠀feels.⠀Background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀a⠀camera's⠀angle,⠀a⠀queue's⠀length,⠀a⠀terminal⠀revising⠀a⠀figure,⠀a⠀guard's⠀glance⠀at⠀an⠀ID⠀—⠀without⠀becoming⠀executable⠀stage⠀code⠀or⠀an⠀automatic⠀read⠀on⠀anyone's⠀state.⠀A⠀tired⠀face⠀can⠀be⠀exhaustion,⠀fear,⠀or⠀performance;⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀can⠀be⠀exclusion,⠀security,⠀or⠀routine.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nLet⠀scene⠀placement⠀do⠀the⠀genre's⠀work.⠀Put⠀each⠀beat⠀somewhere⠀on⠀the⠀axis⠀of⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀and⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision:⠀the⠀desk⠀where⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀granted⠀or⠀priced,⠀the⠀corner⠀where⠀a⠀favor⠀is⠀traded,⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀day's⠀cost⠀lands⠀in⠀the⠀body.⠀Dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀negotiation⠀—⠀who⠀may⠀ask,⠀who⠀must⠀explain⠀themselves,⠀who⠀is⠀buying⠀time,⠀who⠀pays⠀in⠀access,⠀silence,⠀or⠀risk⠀—⠀while⠀focal⠀narration⠀registers⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀a⠀public⠀promise⠀and⠀its⠀private⠀price.⠀Keep⠀that⠀inner⠀response⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀act⠀only⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀have⠀been⠀told.\n\nUse⠀the⠀short⠀narrative⠀passages⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀making⠀sense⠀of⠀people.⠀An⠀explanation⠀formed⠀in⠀one⠀beat⠀can⠀be⠀supported,⠀complicated,⠀or⠀overturned⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀—⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀frightened,⠀was⠀performing,⠀was⠀preoccupied⠀with⠀something⠀else⠀entirely⠀—⠀so⠀let⠀repeated⠀locations⠀and⠀faces⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀instead⠀of⠀resetting⠀to⠀first⠀impressions.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀with⠀a⠀break,⠀a⠀stated⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀change⠀of⠀company.\n\nClose⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement⠀actually⠀comes⠀to⠀rest⠀—⠀an⠀answer⠀given,⠀a⠀threshold⠀crossed⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀fact⠀learned,⠀a⠀cost⠀quietly⠀registered⠀—⠀and⠀end⠀the⠀response⠀there,⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Established⠀devices,⠀buildings,⠀and⠀monitoring⠀rules⠀behave⠀the⠀same⠀way⠀the⠀next⠀time⠀a⠀scene⠀visits⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeaubb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀No⠀Named⠀Influence⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀installment⠀of⠀an⠀ongoing⠀serial,⠀and⠀open⠀inside⠀the⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀above⠀it.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀anchors⠀—⠀the⠀job⠀currently⠀underway,⠀a⠀message⠀still⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀credential⠀that⠀stopped⠀working⠀—⠀orient⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀without⠀a⠀recap.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀means,⠀recover⠀only⠀that⠀particular,⠀and⠀only⠀then:⠀the⠀new⠀balance,⠀the⠀revoked⠀access,⠀the⠀favor⠀someone⠀now⠀expects,⠀not⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.\n\nRun⠀the⠀story's⠀systems⠀as⠀state⠀the⠀serial⠀keeps.⠀A⠀choice⠀about⠀access,⠀money,⠀information,⠀or⠀a⠀body⠀leaves⠀the⠀situation⠀different⠀—⠀a⠀favor⠀spent,⠀a⠀debt⠀recalculated⠀after⠀a⠀missed⠀payment,⠀a⠀contact⠀holding⠀something⠀new⠀over⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀a⠀monitoring⠀rule⠀now⠀reaching⠀where⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀before⠀—⠀and⠀later⠀installments⠀can⠀invoke⠀that⠀changed⠀state⠀directly⠀instead⠀of⠀re-deriving⠀it.⠀Treat⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀who⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀what,⠀or⠀in⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀a⠀decision,⠀as⠀a⠀genuine⠀development:⠀it⠀counts⠀as⠀progress⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀secret⠀surfaces⠀and⠀no⠀job⠀completes.⠀Draw⠀pressure⠀from⠀whatever⠀the⠀current⠀scenario⠀supports⠀—⠀bargaining⠀over⠀terms,⠀the⠀exact⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice,⠀street⠀knowledge⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀district⠀tolerates,⠀the⠀management⠀of⠀a⠀bodily⠀limit⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀dressing⠀every⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀neon⠀and⠀rain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract:⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀and⠀cannot⠀yet⠀explain,⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀costs⠀to⠀send⠀or⠀to⠀leave⠀unsent,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀question⠀they⠀hold⠀back⠀for⠀one⠀more⠀day.⠀In⠀a⠀watched⠀world⠀the⠀split⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀motive⠀—⠀some⠀channels⠀are⠀logged⠀and⠀some⠀rooms⠀are⠀not⠀—⠀so⠀let⠀private⠀reasoning⠀weigh⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀where.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀material⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does,⠀and⠀interiority⠀need⠀not⠀pay⠀for⠀its⠀place⠀with⠀an⠀immediate⠀decision;⠀noticing⠀is⠀enough.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀where⠀its⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀work⠀finished,⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀pending,⠀an⠀obligation⠀newly⠀taken⠀on,⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known,⠀or⠀a⠀beat⠀that⠀stops⠀mid-motion⠀or⠀mid-thought.⠀No⠀reply⠀owes⠀a⠀discovery,⠀reversal,⠀confession,⠀or⠀cliffhanger;⠀progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work⠀done,⠀or⠀resources⠀gained⠀or⠀lost.⠀Keep⠀established⠀devices,⠀companies,⠀debts,⠀and⠀monitoring⠀rules⠀behaving⠀consistently⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀shows⠀the⠀change⠀happening.⠀Let⠀the⠀established⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀situation's⠀stakes⠀carry⠀the⠀telling,⠀drawing⠀texture⠀from⠀the⠀scenario's⠀actual⠀systems⠀and⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀any⠀borrowed⠀signature⠀manner.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeavaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀emotionally⠀turbulent⠀negotiation⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀cyberpunk⠀transaction.⠀Use⠀a⠀concrete⠀objective:⠀a⠀debt⠀settlement,⠀medical⠀access,⠀a⠀contract⠀renewal,⠀a⠀black-market⠀favor,⠀a⠀data⠀exchange,⠀a⠀chance⠀to⠀leave⠀a⠀monitored⠀district.⠀The⠀systems⠀that⠀observe,⠀price,⠀and⠀restrict⠀the⠀choice⠀remain⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀terms.⠀A⠀terminal⠀can⠀flag⠀the⠀account,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀can⠀call,⠀a⠀scan⠀can⠀delay⠀the⠀handoff,⠀a⠀contract⠀clause⠀can⠀exclude⠀a⠀person.⠀Keep⠀the⠀transaction⠀load-bearing:⠀someone⠀needs⠀something,⠀gives⠀something,⠀or⠀risks⠀exposure.\n\nLet⠀Tarantino-style⠀conversation⠀stretch⠀across⠀the⠀negotiation,⠀but⠀make⠀every⠀delay,⠀evasion,⠀offer,⠀or⠀insult⠀an⠀emotional⠀action.⠀The⠀dialogue's⠀length⠀should⠀accumulate⠀pressure⠀around⠀an⠀admission⠀or⠀refusal⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀manage:⠀needing⠀a⠀lover's⠀help,⠀apologizing⠀to⠀a⠀partner⠀they⠀harmed,⠀returning⠀after⠀disappearing,⠀asking⠀for⠀money⠀they⠀have⠀no⠀way⠀to⠀repay,⠀requesting⠀a⠀procedure⠀they⠀fear,⠀confirming⠀a⠀betrayal⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀deny.⠀A⠀speaker⠀can⠀protect⠀themselves⠀by⠀turning⠀practical,⠀by⠀attacking,⠀by⠀joking,⠀or⠀by⠀saying⠀less.⠀Do⠀the⠀same⠀for⠀the⠀listener's⠀replies.⠀Let⠀private⠀thought⠀render⠀the⠀actual⠀turbulence—looking⠀for⠀an⠀exit⠀from⠀the⠀sentence⠀just⠀spoken,⠀hoping⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀misreads⠀a⠀pause⠀as⠀negotiation,⠀noticing⠀the⠀exact⠀word⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀request⠀humiliating,⠀resenting⠀the⠀affection⠀that⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀condition.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀know⠀its⠀own⠀hurt⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀perceives⠀only⠀the⠀stalled⠀deal.\n\nShow⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀feeling.⠀After⠀an⠀apology,⠀the⠀clock⠀can⠀resume⠀and⠀the⠀original⠀demand⠀can⠀become⠀steeper.⠀After⠀a⠀withheld⠀fact,⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀can⠀continue⠀cooperating⠀on⠀practical⠀points⠀while⠀their⠀voice⠀thins.⠀After⠀a⠀confession⠀of⠀need,⠀the⠀helper⠀can⠀lower⠀the⠀price⠀and⠀deflect⠀the⠀gratitude,⠀which⠀may⠀be⠀worse.⠀After⠀warmth,⠀the⠀corporate⠀system⠀can⠀claim⠀its⠀fee.⠀Treat⠀the⠀practical⠀status⠀and⠀the⠀emotional⠀damage⠀as⠀one⠀changing⠀situation:⠀a⠀chair⠀rolling⠀closer⠀can⠀be⠀both⠀a⠀softening⠀and⠀a⠀negotiation⠀move;⠀a⠀transferred⠀credit⠀can⠀be⠀both⠀care⠀and⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀ending⠀the⠀conversation.\n\nUse⠀a⠀delayed⠀concrete⠀return.⠀An⠀object⠀or⠀fact⠀named⠀earlier⠀can⠀come⠀back⠀bearing⠀new⠀emotional⠀weight:⠀the⠀drink⠀one⠀character⠀ordered⠀for⠀habit,⠀the⠀door⠀they⠀both⠀know⠀is⠀monitored,⠀the⠀alias⠀from⠀the⠀years⠀they⠀spent⠀together,⠀the⠀medical⠀scan⠀still⠀open⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀the⠀pre-authorized⠀payment⠀one⠀person⠀saved⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀never⠀accepted.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀scene's⠀words⠀meant⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment⠀false.⠀A⠀phrase⠀said⠀to⠀buy⠀time⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀exact⠀truth⠀once⠀the⠀fee⠀is⠀named;⠀a⠀joke⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀silence⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀speaker⠀had⠀not⠀known⠀they⠀were⠀ready⠀to⠀ask.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reversal⠀inside⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀knew,⠀guessed,⠀or⠀chose.\n\nLet⠀the⠀ending⠀remain⠀emotionally⠀and⠀practically⠀contingent.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀system's⠀answer⠀still⠀pending⠀while⠀one⠀character⠀sits⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀conversation⠀cost⠀them.⠀Or⠀the⠀payment⠀may⠀clear⠀without⠀settling⠀whether⠀the⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀used⠀as⠀collateral⠀again.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward;⠀refuse⠀the⠀automatic⠀confession,⠀rescue,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀collapse.⠀Stop⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀waiting⠀notification⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀motion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaeavab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Cyberpunk⠀Noir⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nRender⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀one⠀continuous⠀shared⠀interval⠀the⠀player⠀can⠀enter⠀and⠀leave⠀by⠀action,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀a⠀completed⠀negotiation.⠀Write⠀in⠀intermediate⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀attribution.⠀Separate⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀visible⠀reaction⠀so⠀each⠀paragraph⠀announces⠀who⠀moved,⠀who⠀spoke,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀numbered⠀layers,⠀keep⠀it⠀plainly⠀attributed⠀and⠀use⠀it⠀only⠀through⠀the⠀permitted⠀interface.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀unspoken⠀knowledge⠀become⠀visible⠀to⠀other⠀characters⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀communicates⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀cyberpunk⠀setting⠀as⠀active⠀pressure⠀around⠀the⠀conversation.⠀Begin⠀from⠀an⠀objective⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀contact⠀is⠀late,⠀a⠀terminal⠀is⠀asking⠀for⠀confirmation,⠀a⠀clinic⠀door⠀is⠀being⠀watched,⠀a⠀broker⠀is⠀stringing⠀out⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀drone⠀is⠀holding⠀outside,⠀a⠀coworker's⠀account⠀is⠀frozen.⠀Make⠀the⠀practical⠀object⠀concrete⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue:⠀an⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀a⠀contract⠀extension,⠀a⠀token,⠀a⠀debt⠀rollover,⠀a⠀buyer⠀for⠀something⠀no⠀one⠀should⠀hold.⠀World⠀systems⠀can⠀interrupt⠀or⠀alter⠀a⠀line:⠀an⠀account⠀drops⠀into⠀arrears⠀after⠀one⠀offer,⠀a⠀feed⠀reframes⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀lock⠀cycles⠀for⠀a⠀scheduled⠀round.⠀Use⠀one⠀such⠀event⠀where⠀it⠀